</node>
<node id="&quot;VENUE OF THE PRE-TENDER MEETING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The venue of the pre-tender meeting is not explicitly stated but will be provided by the organizers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
