  <data key="d2">chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 357}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1059}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE BY FAX AND POST AT THE FAX NUMBER AND ADDRESS STATED IN THE REPLY SLIP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Engineer/Surveyor/Supervising Officer is a designated official who will receive the tenderers' completed Reply Slips via fax or postal mail, which could be relevant to Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited as it may need to interact with this individual in their construction projects."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Engineer/Surveyor/Supervising Officer is a designated official who will receive the tenderers' completed Reply Slips via fax or postal mail."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 353}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1049}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WBTC NO. 4/92&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This likely refers to a specific document or regulation related to construction or engineering projects, possibly within the building and civil works industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"WBTC No. 4/92 likely refers to a specific document or regulation related to construction or engineering projects, possibly within the building and civil works industry."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
