  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a role within a company or government entity responsible for providing clarifications on tender documents. The specific post title and contact details should be provided by the appropriate Government officer/company."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6f1c507a5f83ea7cc30c5ceefa06210</data>
