<node id="&quot;TENDER PRICE DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tender Price Documents include copies of the Bills of Quantities and Schedule of Proportions, which may need to be submitted or copied by tenderers as specified in clause (c)."</data>
