<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Government is a broader organization that includes public officers and sets policies, including those in Cap. 57 RTF."&lt;SEP&gt;"Government is a competent authority whose rules and regulations must be followed by The Contractor, particularly in relation to notices required for public benefit or employee welfare."&lt;SEP&gt;"Government is an organization that has the authority to review tenderer's qualified status and make decisions regarding their eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government is mentioned in relation to regulations that may be required to be observed, indicating its role in setting standards and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Government is an organization mentioned in the text, referring to entities capable of civil claims and debt recovery through various methods including wage attachment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Government is an organization to which this Ordinance applies according to its provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Government is subject to this Ordinance with certain provisions and obligations outlined."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government has legal responsibilities that may be affected by certain actions of public officers, as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government here likely refers to the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region (HKSAR) Government, which also has a role in regulating employment agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government is an organization mentioned in relation to the application of this Ordinance, specifically referring to entities under both the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region and the Central People's Government."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government is mentioned in relation to fees and notices, indicating its role in administrative processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government is mentioned in the context that it is bound by this Ordinance, indicating its role within the legal framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government may have liabilities that are not affected by the personal non-liability of public officers under certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government refers to a body that maintains hospitals and has legal authority over employment matters as described."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Government refers to the administrative body responsible for managing public affairs and ensuring compliance with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3717bfa1a0a429ae82cff6583f9ffc97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-949aa5f14dfe77c1d4658936c3d545de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a63521ff775998da1314db4dd547a7d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf739f28af13fb255489857524eaf50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a1fa46128d33dc86ff9326b722ce67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e25506f50e901e7cebe325e56cdc3f67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4113afe7255cfeb2800c08deeeac90a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4144bf8068bf5c4282e2d5caa7067c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbe588d5c34575494b1af01bf122cae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b8b40b208f0fb021cf679f8d096916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f19199388ebb0416790d9140af888a4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1901c04f5d127d84848a2cd1cbc4a1bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2051734d4010ecf353d49c7190a3cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 322}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1010}]</data>
</node>
