<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Government of Hong Kong is a governing body that oversees and enforces laws, including those related to contracts for building works."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 263}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 950}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE SURVEYOR'S REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Maintenance Surveyor’s Representative is a person designated by the Maintenance Surveyor to perform specific duties under Clause 2(2) of the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"A representative of the Maintenance Surveyor who may provide instructions or decisions related to work execution and claim handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is an authorized individual who maintains Site Diaries, records daily activities, and ensures proper documentation as per the Maintenance Surveyor’s instructions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is an individual authorized to watch, inspect works, test materials, examine workmanship, and carry out other delegated duties from the Maintenance Surveyor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintenance Surveyor's Representative maintains site diaries for specific Works and records daily information related to labor, plant, materials, utilities, work carried out, and instructions issued to the Contractor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is a person authorized by the Maintenance Surveyor to give directions and instructions, acting on behalf of the Maintenance Surveyor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is a person authorized to act on behalf of the Maintenance Surveyor in overseeing the quality of workmanship and materials as required by the Contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is a role authorized by the Maintenance Surveyor, having similar powers of inspection and approval as the main Maintenance Surveyor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is an individual who prescribes forms for labor returns and provides orders regarding the disposal of discovered articles."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is someone delegated by the Maintenance Surveyor to perform certain duties, whose actions within specified terms are binding on the Contractor and Employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative signs the Complaint Chit to acceptably carry out work within 12 working days of issue."&lt;SEP&gt;"The representative is responsible for approving quotations and signing lists and statements submitted by the Contractor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The representative of a Maintenance Surveyor has similar duties and powers in managing the maintenance survey for building works under contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5353a0b04268f3f2bf8419dceec4f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b303be3f296ee1a255a0d6e39708e058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-949aa5f14dfe77c1d4658936c3d545de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77cf568578b8488d566bb45f92f61c0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0c5e3d59d6713fc43836ebeb09b59a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abfa4c447132cda1acca49de3797a9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e48c641bb7544fa8f59eeacc0c3c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8ac9b93ec382ad9a1bb20e1b7960a03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6fcfdf9559a5ecd190189bd2dc1bf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49aef112fabf90ecd0181146a7452f1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32963fd7d32ec116c9715aae3cbcb4c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 263}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 950}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event where one party transfers their rights or obligations to another, as detailed in Clause 3 of the General Conditions of Contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBLETTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of a contractor subleasing part of the contracted work to others, regulated by Clauses 4 and 5 of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contract Documents encompass all mutually explanatory documents forming part of the Contract and include General Conditions, Special Conditions, Drawings, Specifications, etc., providing comprehensive guidelines for project execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contract Documents include all information provided for contracts such as Drawings or other documents required by Clause 7, which must be in English according to Clause 9."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contract documents include drawings, other Contract materials provided by both parties for executing work under the contract. They are used to ensure compliance with contractual terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents that are mutually explanatory and provide necessary information for executing building works as outlined in Clause 6 onwards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0764b1a02432b62a0ad22895f699b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb1308c02d44b7ab0dcb7b386e3c410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599efa27c5ee543ca385bb3d944e13fe</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 277}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 955}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DRAWINGS PROVIDED BY THE CONTRACTOR FOR THE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Technical drawings prepared by contractors to guide construction work, mentioned in Clause 7 of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 277}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 955}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACTOR'S EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employees working under a contractor who are responsible for executing building works as per Clause 19."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 265}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMERGENCY STAFF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Emergency staff refers to workmen and plant available for immediate use in case of emergencies related to the execution of works."&lt;SEP&gt;"Staff members designated to handle emergencies, mentioned in Clause 20 of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49aef112fabf90ecd0181146a7452f1a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 265}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SETTING-OUT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Setting-out involves the precise positioning of construction elements based on reference points provided by the Maintenance Surveyor, ensuring correct dimensions and alignment throughout the project."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of marking out or laying down a construction site as per Clause 21 of the General Conditions of Contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c2ce37d3bd5b0e583c4fe6bb69ef68b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 360}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAFETY AND SECURITY OF THE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ensuring safety measures are in place to protect both persons and property during construction, discussed under Clause 22."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 360}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAMAGE TO PERSONS AND PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Potential incidents that could occur on-site leading to harm or loss of assets, addressed in Clause 24."&lt;SEP&gt;"The indemnity clause covering damage to persons and property other than surface or crop damage on-site."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5236112da700e89f157c80fd002a7fb7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 359}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DESIGN RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The obligation for the design aspects of construction projects as per Clause 25 of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERFERENCE WITH TRAFFIC AND ADJOINING PROPERTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Issues that may arise due to disruptions in local traffic or adjacent property rights, detailed under Clause 26."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REMEDY ON FAILURE TO INSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Actions taken when insurance requirements are not met as per the contract terms, discussed in Clause 27."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 261}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCIDENT OR INJURY TO WORKMEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Accident or injury to workmen refers to incidents that may occur during the course of employment, requiring notice from contractors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incidents involving harm to workers during construction activities, addressed under Clause 28 of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 261}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACTOR TO GIVE NOTICE OF INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The duty of a contractor to report any injuries that occur on-site as per Clause 29."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 261}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PATENT RIGHTS AND ROYALTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal aspects related to intellectual property, mentioned in Clause 30 of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Patent rights and royalties pertain to intellectual property protections and financial benefits associated with inventions or innovations in the industry."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
