  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 351}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1045}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SITE DIARY AND LABOUR RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Records of daily activities on-site and labor reports, discussed under Clause 34 of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Site diary and labour returns are documents used for recording daily activities, labor hours, and other relevant information on a construction site."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOSSILS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fossils refer to geological or archaeological findings that may be encountered during the course of work and require special handling or documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The presence or discovery of fossils during construction work as per Clause 35."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACILITIES FOR OTHER CONTRACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Services and resources provided to support multiple contractors working on the same site, mentioned in Clause 36."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLEARANCE OF THE SITE ON COMPLETION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clearance of the Site on completion is an event where all temporary structures, materials, and other items are removed after project completion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of finalizing a construction project by clearing the site as per Clause 37 of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is an event where the Contractor must clear and clean the site after completing their contractual obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fef86c4247fdecc339b1414a3fdd5966&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLICATION OF PHOTOGRAPHS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of publishing photographic records related to the construction work, discussed in Clause 38."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLICATION OF PHOTOGRAPHS OF THE SITE OR THE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event involves restrictions placed upon the Contractor regarding publishing photos related to the project without Employer's permission."&lt;SEP&gt;"The publication of photographs involves documenting the site or works for various purposes such as records, marketing, or compliance with agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fef86c4247fdecc339b1414a3fdd5966&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENGAGEMENT OF LABOUR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Engagement of labour refers to hiring and managing workforce on a construction project."&lt;SEP&gt;"This event pertains to the Contractor’s responsibility in engaging labor for project execution and ensuring fair wages according to local practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fef86c4247fdecc339b1414a3fdd5966&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 261}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAIR WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fair wages are related to labor laws and practices ensuring workers receive appropriate compensation for their work."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 261}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUALITY OF MATERIALS AND WORKMANSHIP AND TESTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The quality of materials and workmanship involves the standards and testing procedures used in construction projects to ensure durability and safety."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 351}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1043}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCESS TO THE SITE AND PLACES OF MANUFACTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Access refers to permissions granted for entry into specific areas, including manufacturing sites, necessary for material supply or inspection purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 351}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1043}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNCOVERING AND MAKING OPENINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Uncovering and making openings are actions taken during construction where parts of the structure need to be exposed for work or inspections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RATE OF PROGRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rate of Progress refers to the speed at which work is being completed, monitored by the Maintenance Surveyor and can lead to instructions for expedited progress if deemed too slow."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate of progress measures how quickly a project is advancing, often used in performance evaluations and contract compliance checks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-671cf14fabde451a853f4cb49e6a812f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIQUIDATED DAMAGES FOR DELAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liquidated Damages for Delay is an event where penalties are imposed on the Contractor for failing to complete a Works Order within the prescribed time, leading to financial consequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liquidated damages are pre-determined financial penalties imposed when work does not meet the agreed-upon timeline."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liquidated damages for delay refers to a predetermined amount that must be paid by the Contractor if they fail to complete a Works Order within the prescribed time frame."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-671cf14fabde451a853f4cb49e6a812f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87f722c8522f822c2e90eb078db141b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 262}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 949}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUSPENSION OF THE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Suspension refers to a temporary halt in construction activities, often due to unforeseen circumstances or contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE AND DEFECTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maintenance and defects cover ongoing care for structures as well as identifying and addressing issues that arise during use or operation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTION OF WORK OF REPAIR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The execution of work of repair involves carrying out necessary maintenance tasks to fix any damages or deficiencies in the construction project."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 351}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1045}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VESTING OF CONSTRUCTIONAL PLANT AND TEMPORARY BUILDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vesting refers to transferring ownership or control over equipment, structures, and materials used on a site from one party to another."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 351}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1045}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOMINATED SUBCONTRACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Nominated subcontractors are selected by the employer for specific tasks within the project scope."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 351}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1046}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTIONAL PLANT, TEMPORARY BUILDINGS AND MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to various equipment, structures, and supplies used in construction projects that may be subject to ownership or removal clauses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 351}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1046}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIRED AND HIRE-PURCHASE CONSTRUCTIONAL PLANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hired and hire-purchase plant involves leasing or purchasing machinery for use on the site, often with specific terms outlined in contracts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE SURVEYOR OR HIS REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Maintenance Surveyor or his representative is a role that issues certifications, specifically Certificates of Completion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d04fd928cd5cdad2902f95e470d14ad3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 262}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 947}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTIONAL PLANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Constructional Plant includes appliances or things required for executing works but excludes materials forming part of permanent work or vehicles transporting personnel or Constructional Plant to/from the site."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant includes equipment and materials intended to be supplied, used, or constructed as part of executing works according to the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant includes machinery or equipment used in the execution of works, needing proper care during the Maintenance Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant includes machinery, equipment, and other tools necessary for completing works under the contract, which becomes property of the Employer upon certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant refers to all appliances used in construction, which are part of the materials and equipment involved in completing Works Orders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant refers to equipment and materials brought onto the site by the Contractor for construction purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant refers to machinery and equipment used for construction activities that might be a factor in determining whether an extension of time is warranted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant refers to machinery and equipment used in construction projects that may be owned by the Contractor but can also involve third-party ownership requiring Maintenance Surveyor's consent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant refers to machinery or equipment used in the construction process that may be hired or purchased under specific conditions set by the Employer and Contractor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constructional Plant refers to machinery, equipment, or tools required for construction works and may be subject to patent rights."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d288eda39d01e6178bcf7c5f4500b57f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d562d8afcd917deebad02c95fa56d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb73081d4183e7d829a503c9bb63a946&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3df24d7cf0a0114d43ffbcf5d5c71fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abfa4c447132cda1acca49de3797a9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e4b58ef0946f56f64c8c36cf13b78f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04fd928cd5cdad2902f95e470d14ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b3528cf552045555b1e6ac732dd25a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7514d2843f8174e8fae404cc75760a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f6be589350c8e73f0a57d60397f9eb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 259}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 939}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKS ORDER WITH AN ESTIMATED VALUE NOT EXCEEDING THE AMOUNT STATED IN THE APPENDIX TO THE FORM OF TENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This product is specifically referred to as a Complaint Chit if its value does not exceed the limit mentioned, indicating it's a smaller order within the larger scope of Works Orders."</data>
