</node>
<node id="&quot;DISAGREEMENTS IN WRITING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disagreements in writing are instances where The Contractor’s Authorized Agent or Representative notes discrepancies with recorded information directly within Site Diaries to ensure transparency and accuracy of documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-949aa5f14dfe77c1d4658936c3d545de</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDUSTRIES INVOLVED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The industries involved include construction, maintenance, and possibly public works, as these activities are subject to detailed regulatory compliance and record-keeping requirements outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-949aa5f14dfe77c1d4658936c3d545de</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 263}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 953}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATORY COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compliance with regulations related to occupational health and safety is emphasized throughout the passage, reflecting industry practices aimed at protecting workers from harmful exposures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory Compliance involves the adherence to laws and regulations governing workplace practices, which is a key aspect of social science research on labor relations and occupational health and safety."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory Compliance refers to adherence by The Contractor to all relevant laws, regulations, by-laws, and rules during the course of the Works for proper project execution and oversight."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory compliance refers to adherence by employment agencies to legal requirements regarding record-keeping, reporting, and other obligations as stipulated by relevant authorities such as the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory compliance refers to the adherence by individuals or entities to laws, regulations, and administrative procedures related to construction activities, including those concerning noise control measures and permits."&lt;SEP&gt;"This concept involves ensuring that all actions taken under this ordinance comply with relevant laws and regulations to maintain order and fairness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-949aa5f14dfe77c1d4658936c3d545de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a1139425d270c7317d6d6a1dd6e020&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92398049cd93d8f432b90b9d7cf63d15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 323}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employer owns all fossils, coins, and other valuable items found on-site and requires the Contractor to report such discoveries and comply with Maintenance Surveyor's instructions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employer refers to the organization that has paid a long service payment to Person A and is entitled to receive repayment from Person B for employer-funded ORS or MPFS benefits received by Person B after the death of Person A."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d634411e44f3153b1f3217349599619c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e48c641bb7544fa8f59eeacc0c3c2e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 263}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 951}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOSSILS, COINS, ARTICLES OF VALUE OR ANTIQUITY, STRUCTURES, AND GEOLOGICAL OR ARCHAEOLOGICAL REMAINS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These items discovered on the Site belong to the Employer and must be reported and preserved according to Maintenance Surveyor's instructions."</data>
