  <data key="d2">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Occupational Safety and Health Ordinance, along with the Shipping and Port Control Ordinance, both contribute to overall site safety and environmental regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"This ordinance provides definitions for maritime-related roles such as 'ship' and 'vessel', crucial for understanding the scope of legal terms in this context."</data>
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 304}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1001}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOISE CONTROL ORDINANCE (CAP. 400)&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-b6d5c1db270105c42831679d46cdf6fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606c291ea5ee675ad86390a5e98aaec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd34572cc7a7c12a47fc15cbaf1c545c</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Noise Control Ordinance (Cap. 400) is a legal document that outlines regulations and penalties for noise-related offenses in Hong Kong, including the procedures for instituting proceedings against bodies corporate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Noise Control Ordinance (Cap. 400) is a legal document that regulates noise-related offenses and provides the framework for issuing notifications to individuals or entities involved in such violations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Noise Control Ordinance is a legal document that outlines regulations for controlling noise, including provisions for taking action against violations by bodies corporate or individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Occupational Safety and Health Ordinance, along with the Noise Control Ordinance, both contribute to ensuring a safe working environment."</data>
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 378}]</data>
</node>
