<node id="&quot;INSOLVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Insolvent refers to a person who has stopped repaying debts or cannot repay them upon debt maturity, regardless of whether they have been declared bankrupt."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1e575d442f08ac69ffbe5033c6d10569</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 215}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 767}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELIVERABLE STATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY, INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deliverable state is the condition in which goods are ready for delivery according to contract terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"可交付状态 describes the condition of goods that are ready for delivery under contract terms, which can be understood from industrial standards or technological readiness perspectives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e575d442f08ac69ffbe5033c6d10569</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 210}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MERCHANTABLE QUALITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Merchantable quality is the standard that goods must meet, being of average fitness and acceptable for trade without any defects known at the time of sale."&lt;SEP&gt;"Merchantable quality means that the sold goods are fit for ordinary use, as expected by a typical buyer under normal circumstances and without any specific knowledge of their intended purpose."&lt;SEP&gt;"Merchantable quality refers to a product that meets reasonable expectations regarding its suitability, appearance, final finish, absence of defects (including minor ones), safety, and durability based on the description provided with the goods, their price if applicable, and other relevant circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Merchantable quality refers to the standard that goods must meet when sold in a business context, unless defects are specifically drawn to the buyer’s attention before the contract is made or if such information was reasonably known to the buyer."&lt;SEP&gt;"可商售品质 refers to a standard level of product quality expected in commercial transactions; it involves both industry-specific criteria and mathematical assessments of durability, safety, etc."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd61364920843014789da67b81b39a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5228b6166ae5f3bb9be72928713eb4f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50fde94b2a9530049fb2ca036b2e0622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e575d442f08ac69ffbe5033c6d10569</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 215}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 765}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;通常業務運作中已停止償還債項&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a situation where an entity has ceased repayment of debts during normal business operations or cannot repay upon debt maturity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1e575d442f08ac69ffbe5033c6d10569</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 215}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 767}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACTION (訴訟)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Action includes suit, counterclaim, and set-off in a business context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
