</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS (業務)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business operations, such as employment agencies or those involving licences, are described with their specific purposes according to the context provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business refers to professions and activities of public bodies or authorities appointed by the Chief Executive or Government."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 382}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUYER (買方)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Buyer means a person who buys or agrees to buy goods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT OF SALE (售賣合約)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contract of sale includes an agreement to sell as well as a sale, indicating the legal transaction involved in selling goods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELIVERY (交、交付)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delivery refers to the voluntary transfer of possession from one person to another, but does not belong to any specific technology."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENT OF TITLE TO GOODS (貨品的所有權文件)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Document of title includes various documents used in business as proof of ownership or control over goods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAULT (錯失)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fault refers to wrongful acts or defaults, which are social and legal concepts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 307}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUTURE GOODS (期貨)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Future goods refer to goods that will be manufactured or acquired by the seller after the contract is made."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOODS (貨、貨品)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Goods include all chattels personal other than things in action and money, encompassing a wide range of products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLAINTIFF (原告人)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Plaintiff includes a defendant counterclaiming, indicating the legal roles involved in disputes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 307}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY (產權)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Property refers to general property in goods and is a social science concept related to ownership rights."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUALITY OF GOODS (貨品品質)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Quality includes the state or condition of goods, which can be quantified but does not belong specifically to mathematics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALE (售賣)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sale refers to a legal transaction involving the transfer of ownership of goods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 307}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLAINTIFF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Plaintiff is a party initiating legal actions or claims before a court, presenting their case and seeking relief from another party who may be named as a Defendant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plaintiff refers to the party applying for remedies such as specific performance or compensation from the court."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Plaintiff is an individual bringing legal actions, either independently of this Ordinance or through it, seeking compensation for injuries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The plaintiff is an individual or entity who applies to the court for remedies such as specific performance or compensation for breaches of contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"原告人 refers to a party in legal proceedings who initiates the lawsuit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed27e8241086925853de29390c3f116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ab3758cb9962eb7aad59c32353f872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e61f5794135dfe2a1a6e5ae434940c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 429}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIFIC GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific Goods are items sold under a contract that can be appropriated to the contract by the seller with certain conditions attached regarding ownership and disposal rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"特定货品 refers to goods identified and agreed upon at the time of contract formation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08fbcc9c2ce9e3d4f773cc495db19495</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 210}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WARRANTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A warranty is a guarantee regarding the quality or condition of the sold goods, and its breach results in claims for damages rather than repudiation of the contract unless specified otherwise."&lt;SEP&gt;"Warranty refers to a legal guarantee provided by the seller that ensures certain conditions of quality, performance, etc., are met for a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"保证条款 is a term that describes agreements related to the quality of sold goods but does not directly refer to any specific technology or scientific field."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69fc897b8b9dfae677db802b05a78337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6898f338d8c873d727625cb55234a222</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 206}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 753}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUALITY OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES, MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"货品品质 includes aspects such as state and condition which can be analyzed from both social science perspectives (e.g., consumer behavior) and mathematical standards (e.g., quality metrics)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 215}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 765}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Sale is defined as the transfer of ownership in goods from the seller to the buyer once certain conditions or future times have been met."&lt;SEP&gt;"售卖 refers to the act of selling goods or services; it is an event in a commercial context but also describes a type of transaction involving products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93975688247d3b9e7a757c9ac99d011</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 210}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOOD FAITH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Good faith refers to an ethical principle guiding the application of laws, ensuring honesty and fairness in legal practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"出於真誠 means acting honestly and can be analyzed from both ethical (social science) and legal perspectives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3694b9973d0eb7e4719ad33e81b8744f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 210}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSOLVENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Insolvency refers to a situation where a buyer becomes unable to pay their debts, which can trigger the seller's right to retain possession of the goods."&lt;SEP&gt;"无力偿债 refers to a state where an entity cannot pay its debts as they become due; it is both a financial event and a legal concept."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0e4c0453b8451785120b5b76a2526cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83a8d937e2b926da0d7047a5288d8ae8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 216}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 768}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOODS OF ANY KIND ARE OF MERCHANTABLE QUALITY WITHIN THE MEANING OF THIS ORDINANCE IF THEY ARE—&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MERCHANTABLE QUALITY GOODS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"product"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1f612e80bc33b548b5b253bf3e3dac0</data>
</node>
