<node id="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"District Court is a higher-level judicial body where claims exceeding the Small Claims Tribunal's jurisdiction can be brought and resolved."&lt;SEP&gt;"District Court is a specific type of court mentioned as determining matters arising out of certain claims, regardless of the amount involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is a court mentioned in the text where appeals can be made, dealing with decisions or assessments from other bodies such as Commissioner, Ordinary Assessment Board, and Special Assessment Board."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is a court with the power to determine claims for compensation and has jurisdiction similar to that of other civil actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is a higher court in Hong Kong that handles more significant civil cases, potentially including claims for medical expenses exceeding the jurisdiction of the Small Claims Tribunal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is a judicial body responsible for assessing compensation in certain legal proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is a judicial body responsible for determining matters arising out of claims, including calling upon persons to give evidence based on their expert knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is an organization that has jurisdiction over certain matters, including compensation claims, as outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is mentioned as a court where employees may file actions for recovery of damages in addition to the Court of First Instance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is mentioned as having jurisdiction over claims under this Part."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is mentioned as one of the possible venues for certain legal proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court is the court where applications under certain provisions of the Employment Ordinance are heard and decided, such as those involving sureties and bonds for employers who have not paid debts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99200b663e8bce393d63651cd3a038bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-038d93706fae2839f459e5e67e58e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f5fe723dc66b1a35b256f0fbcfd9642&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edaba831bd1e0154426defdca143f061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e72191ab4edd091f82585ac0b7be851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e61f5794135dfe2a1a6e5ae434940c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb14dc46e73a0904990632336b013f69</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 142}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 625}]</data>
