</node>
<node id="&quot;HONG KONG GOVERNMENT EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON,ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employees of the Hong Kong Government are subject to the Ordinance in terms and extent as if their employer were a private person, except for specific exclusions mentioned."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f01a3b960a2dbd284b449cf8b37e63c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 303}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 997}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HER MAJESTY'S GOVERNMENT IN HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the government entity governing Hong Kong, with specific regulations regarding employee benefits and pensions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 128}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION,ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any public body as defined by this Ordinance includes entities exercising powers and performing duties deemed their trade or business for compensation purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"公共机构是具合法裁判權的主管當局之一，在行使法定权限时可以批准或决定某些合同条款。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDINANCE 50 OF 1954&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to an ordinance that has been amended multiple times over the years, providing details on employee benefits and pensions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 303}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 997}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDINANCE 76 OF 1982&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Another ordinance mentioned for its role in regulating employee benefits and pension provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
