</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDINANCE 52 OF 2000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This ordinance is part of the legal framework governing employee rights and benefits as per this text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compensation for Injury refers to the legal responsibility of employers towards employees who suffer injuries at work and its conditions under relevant laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event or situation where an injury occurs in the course of duty leading to compensation claims under certain ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-607a2fda7757f874bbb128bc111c8ee6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 128}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1964 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1964 s. 4 is a provision added in 1964, which outlines certain conditions for compensation payment by employers to injured workers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607a2fda7757f874bbb128bc111c8ee6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 188}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;E.R. 1 OF 2018&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"E.R. 1 of 2018 indicates an edition or revision record, which details changes made to the compensation laws for occupational diseases in 2018."&lt;SEP&gt;"E.R. 1 of 2018 indicates the format changes made in 2018 regarding the provision on injury compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"E.R. 1 of 2018 refers to an editorial revision record that updates the format for distributing compensation among eligible family members, as detailed in Cap 282 RTF (14-05-2026)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607a2fda7757f874bbb128bc111c8ee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e00fdf9b02a058deef2e0c53efa1c4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6942b65bc123e327e9f90372813c148</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 188}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORK INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Work Injury is an incident where a worker sustains bodily harm during their employment, entitling them to receive medical and possibly other forms of compensation from the employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Work Injury is defined here as injuries sustained by employees during their work, which can lead to death or loss of work ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Work injuries refer to situations where employees lose their ability to work or die due to incidents related to occupational diseases, which are considered as separate accidents if they cannot be linked to a single identifiable event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Work injury is mentioned as a situation where employees are injured during their employment and may require prosthesis or surgical appliances, according to legal provisions discussed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdcb847cbe822aecbab442ce9430887f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f5fe723dc66b1a35b256f0fbcfd9642&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-427b651b5a2a0a36734fd93776b2efbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-607a2fda7757f874bbb128bc111c8ee6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 741}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal Responsibility refers to the obligations and duties imposed on employers under relevant laws for compensating injured workers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal responsibility refers to obligations and liabilities that parties must adhere to under law, which can be affected by various clauses in contracts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0aa5c7bec2bb945d36bb333255416d51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-607a2fda7757f874bbb128bc111c8ee6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 741}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employer's premises refer to the workplace or any area nearby where employees are performing their duties and may be involved in incidents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The premises owned by the employer include places such as workplaces, facilities, and any other locations where an employee works for their employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 914}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIRST AID, RESCUE TRAINING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Training for first aid, rescue operations, or related competitions is an activity that can occur during work hours without affecting the employee's status as being on duty."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 914}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER CONSENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consent from the employer regarding participation in training activities such as first aid and rescue operations reflects a social science aspect of workplace safety policies and practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 915}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCIDENT LOCATION OUTSIDE EMPLOYER PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any location other than the employer's premises where an incident occurs, but with consent from the employer for emergency response work, is considered part of the work environment in terms of legal definitions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 915}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER-ORDERED TRANSPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Transport services ordered by or on behalf of the employer that are not public transport and used for commuting between home and workplace qualify as means of transportation during working hours according to certain regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 915}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱主或僱主的代表&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"僱主或僱主的代表是指执行交通工具运作的人，可能是雇主本人或是其代理。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;他人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"他人指的是依据与雇主作出安排提供或安排交通工具的人，可能不是直接的雇主。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;居所&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"居所是指员工居住的地方。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;工作地點&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"工作地点是指雇主明确规定的或者默示许可的工作场所，在香港境内或境外。"&lt;SEP&gt;"工作地點是员工工作的地点。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;公共交通服務&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"公共交通服务是指由公共机构提供的运输服务，与本段讨论的私人安排的交通工具不同。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 494}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;烈風警告或暴雨警告&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"烈风警告或暴雨警告是气象部门发出的通知恶劣天气状况的警报。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;極端情況&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"极特殊情况是指由政府机构宣布的存在极端环境条件的情况，可能包括但不限于极端气候事件。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 494}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;烈風警告&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"烈風警告是指表示香港或其附近出现热带气旋的警告，通常通过发布8号西北、8号西南、8号东北、8号东南、9号或10号热带气旋警告信号来作出。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;暴雨警告&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"暴雨警告是指表示香港或其附近有暴雨的警告，通常通过发布红色或黑色暴雨警告信号来作出。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;極端情況公布&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"極端情況公布是由政务司司长发布的公告，说明由超强台风或其他大规模自然灾害引起的极端情况，在该公告所指明期间（包括延展期间）存在。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;超強颱風&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"超強颱風是指中心附近最高持续风速达到每小时185公里或以上的台风。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;其居所&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"其居所指的是雇员的居住地，根据具体情况而定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;香港天文台&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"香港天文台是负责发布气象警告和公告的组织，包括烈风警告、暴雨警告等。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;超強颱風 (SUPER TYPHOON)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"超強颱風是指中心附近最高持续风速达到每小时185公里或以上的台风，这里更多指的是这种天气现象的技术描述和分类。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY FOR COMPENSATION FOR DEATH OR INCAPACITY RESULTING FROM ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to a legal situation where employers are liable for compensating employees who suffer injuries, incapacity, or death due to accidents related to their work."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd9ca81af9ebd6573085bdfa4ff00a3d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURED BY ACCIDENT ARISING OUT OF AND IN THE COURSE OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An employee who suffers personal injury as a result of an accident that occurs during their employment is involved in this event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd9ca81af9ebd6573085bdfa4ff00a3d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY TO PAY COMPENSATION ACCORDING TO ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The organization or employer has legal obligations under the ordinance to pay compensation for injuries sustained by employees during work-related accidents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd9ca81af9ebd6573085bdfa4ff00a3d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee's injury is an event where an employee sustains harm during their work, potentially affecting their ability to claim compensation based on certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 182}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S TRADE OR BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employer's trade or business is an industry context where activities such as first aid, ambulance work, and rescue operations are performed within the scope of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 180}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 720}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1169}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIRST AID, AMBULANCE OR RESCUE WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"First aid, ambulance, or rescue work refers to specific types of emergency response services that employees may be engaged in during their employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 182}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREMISES OTHER THAN HIS EMPLOYER'S&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Premises other than the employer's refer to any location outside the primary workplace where an employee might engage in first aid, ambulance or rescue work with the consent of the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 182}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLACE OF WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Place of Work refers to the physical location where an employee performs their job duties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEANS OF TRANSPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Means of Transport includes any vehicle used by employees for travel, such as cars or public transportation, and is crucial in determining workplace accident conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC TRANSPORT SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public Transport Service refers to organized transportation services provided by the government or private companies that are not directly arranged by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An extreme conditions announcement is an official statement made by the Chief Secretary for Administration declaring the existence of severe weather or natural disasters affecting Hong Kong during a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Extreme Conditions Announcement is a public notice issued during severe weather, affecting travel and workplace safety policies for employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 324}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1014}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GALE WARNING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A gale warning is a weather alert issued by the Director of the Hong Kong Observatory indicating the presence of a tropical cyclone near or affecting Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gale Warning is a specific type of extreme condition announcement related to strong winds that can impact employee travel and work conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 324}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1015}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RAINSTORM WARNING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rainstorm warning is a weather alert for heavy rainfall, issued by the Director of the Hong Kong Observatory using specific signal codes to indicate severe conditions in and around Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rainstorm Warning is another form of an extreme weather alert, indicating potential risks during travel or at the workplace due to heavy rainfall."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 324}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1015}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GALE WARNING (AMENDED 24 OF 2000 S. 2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gale Warning (Amended) refers to a specific type of extreme weather alert that has been updated in legislation, affecting travel and workplace safety policies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 324}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1015}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee Accident is an incident occurring during the course or as a result of employment activities, including travel between home and work."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRAVELING TO OR FROM HIS PLACE OF WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Traveling to or from Place of Work refers to the movement of employees between their residence and workplace for performing job duties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECT ROUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Direct Route is a specific path taken by an employee while traveling, which can be crucial in determining whether an accident occurs within the course or scope of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKING HOURS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Working Hours are defined periods during which employees perform their job duties and are subject to workplace safety policies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT (AMENDED 24 OF 2000 S. 2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Extreme Conditions Announcement (Amended) refers to a specific type of public notice that has been updated in legislation, affecting workplace safety policies during severe weather."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 324}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1015}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE TRAVEL BETWEEN HIS PLACE OF RESIDENCE AND HIS PLACE OF WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee Travel is the movement of employees from their home to their workplace or vice versa for performing job duties, which can be subject to specific legal conditions regarding accidents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;4 HOURS BEFORE THE TIME OF COMMENCEMENT OF HIS WORKING HOURS FOR THAT DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Time Period (4 Hours) is a defined duration used in legislation to determine when an accident during travel may be considered within the course or scope of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;4 HOURS AFTER THE TIME OF CESSATION OF HIS WORKING HOURS FOR THAT DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Time Period (4 Hours) refers to another specific duration used in legislation, defining when accidents occurring after work might still be covered under workplace safety policies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPER TYPHOON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A super typhoon refers to a tropical cyclone with maximum sustained wind speeds of 185 km/h or more, indicating an extremely dangerous and powerful storm."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 324}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1015}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HONG KONG OBSERVATORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Hong Kong Observatory is the official weather service agency responsible for issuing various types of warnings including tropical cyclones and heavy rainstorms in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 324}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1015}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chief Secretary for Administration is a public officer responsible for inquiries and ensuring the termination of contraventions involving noise as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Secretary for Administration determines who will receive notifications on behalf of the government."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Secretary for Administration is a high-ranking government official who can issue extreme conditions announcements during severe natural disasters affecting Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Secretary for Administration is a person who has the authority to determine questions related to the composition of the Advisory Council on the Environment through a certificate under his hand."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Secretary for Administration, referred as '處長' in the text, needs to be informed of proposed premium increases and can compare them with current rates if required by regulation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ede1afd089da6234965403cda2d41666&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a63521ff775998da1314db4dd547a7d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ae14afda9d52be1864e9090474b79d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 324}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1014}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPER TYPHOON (超強颱風)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A super typhoon refers to a tropical cyclone with maximum sustained wind speeds of 185 km/h or more, indicating an extremely dangerous and powerful storm."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1142}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Family Member refers to individuals who may receive a portion of the allocated funds in certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family member is a relative who receives compensation in case an employee dies due to injury during employment-related travel."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family members are individuals on whose behalf an employer might make direct payments, particularly in cases where the employee's claim is pending settlement or determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family members are individuals who share the same dwelling with the proprietor and may be exempt from certain regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1d19ac100c430c329d42230a7654f3c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786c67dfb1439b58fce397c3168c9e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f08187ad728064351e188904ac02ad6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 598}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Injury refers to an incident causing physical harm, which can lead to permanent partial incapacity and subsequent compensation claims."&lt;SEP&gt;"Injury refers to incidents that may lead to the death of employees, triggering the need for compensation according to specific conditions and age criteria."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f08187ad728064351e188904ac02ad6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062631c2ee8edb363f6cc234fa986a1a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 178}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 716}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;附表6&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"附表6是指一个表格或清单，其中包含具体的金额或其他数值信息。它被用来确定补偿的数额。"&lt;SEP&gt;"附表6是文本中提及的一个表格，用于指明某些款项的具体数额。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83add8e03db8051ceb4cb4d7104d7a5c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第6(2)條之處指明的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"指的是在附表6中第二栏所指定的具体款项额度。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第6(5)條之處指明的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"指的是在附表6中第五栏所指定的具体款项额度，用于支付已故雇员合理的殡葬费和医疗费用。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法律公告&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"法律公告是指香港特别行政区颁布的重要文件类型，用于修订和发布法律法规。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法律公告是由政府发布的正式文件或公告，用来修订或制定法律法规。文中多次提到的1983年第79号、1985年第321号等都是具体的法律公告编号。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法律公告是香港特别行政区颁布的重要文件类型，用于修订和发布法律法规。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 493}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;已故僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"已故僱員指的是已经去世的雇员，在文中涉及到其合理的殡葬费和医疗费用由雇主承担的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 493}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"损伤指的是导致员工收入能力永久性损失的身体或工作方面的问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"损伤指的是导致员工收入能力永久性损失的身体或工作方面的问题，可能包括多种具体类型的伤害。"&lt;SEP&gt;"损伤指的是身体上的伤害，在文中涉及到因损伤导致死亡的赔偿问题。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 493}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;殯殮費和合理的醫護費&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"殡葬费和合理的医疗费用是指具体的补偿项目，用于支付已故雇员的相关费用。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第7或9條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第7或9条指的是其他条款，在文中提到这些条款可能已经支付了赔偿金，需要在新的赔偿中扣除。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2000年第52號第5條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"2000年第52号第五条规定已被废除，表明该规定不再有效或适用。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;修正和修订条款&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"修正和修订条款指的是法律公告中对原有规定的修改内容，确保法律法规的适应性和时效性。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6(1)(a) is an event in the legal context, specifying a condition for compensation calculation based on age and earnings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6(1)(a) is part of the Sixth Schedule that specifies compensation amounts in terms of monetary values or percentages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-11e05d44f5461a2b7dca424d8058b93d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-463028737c14d4a1b81570efedfe747c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 285}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 960}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6A&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6A is a clause related to the allocation of compensation payments for employee family members based on certain determinations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6A is an event in the legal context, indicating that it modifies or affects other sections but specific details are not provided here."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6A is an event or condition under which certain actions or payments may be made, though it's not explicitly described in the given text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-11e05d44f5461a2b7dca424d8058b93d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a6dfc79f4a9de7dba162e137dcffd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 198}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 735}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIXTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Sixth Schedule is a document that contains specific details regarding the amount specified for different accidents as per Section 36C."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule is a document that lists amounts for different types of attention, which are used to calculate compensation in cases of permanent incapacity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule is a reference document containing specific monetary values and percentages for surcharges in case of non-payment by employers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule is a reference document that provides detailed information about the amounts specified in different scenarios of permanent total incapacity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule is a reference document that specifies details such as the amount of reimbursement payable under section 6(5)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule refers to a document containing detailed information used for calculating compensation amounts based on earnings and age."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule refers to a document containing specific percentages or details related to surcharges in certain contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule refers to a document that specifies an amount in its second column corresponding to accidents mentioned in the first column."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule refers to a document that specifies details such as the amount of reimbursement, surcharges for non-payment, and other financial terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule refers to a legal or regulatory document that specifies surcharge amounts and percentages for unpaid interim payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule refers to a specific legal document or regulation that outlines the specified amount of compensation for certain situations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule refers to a specific part of an ordinance or regulation that has been amended, indicating changes in legal provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule refers to a specific section in the text that provides details on monthly earnings determination, though it's not explicitly described here."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b9a6dfc79f4a9de7dba162e137dcffd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8de87b8402a32b88814909eb8b04f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bdac67e9c03ff3905f24c9ae12c304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c974ea5d752dd73a9522c1e2701db94a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f817e1f2a5b13a0586c36573c6eea5b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e2e52d53aa59764f7b51002074a7ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e09c4bccf616e923c3efce314be187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-463028737c14d4a1b81570efedfe747c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11e05d44f5461a2b7dca424d8058b93d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03bb282f99bcf0993cd32ec58e1edb6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 279}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 958}]</data>
</node>
