</node>
<node id="&quot;处长&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 处长 is an official who can make determinations regarding compensation claims in fatal cases according to the given text."&lt;SEP&gt;"处长 is a person responsible for receiving notifications and making decisions regarding workplace safety measures."&lt;SEP&gt;"处长指明格式向雇员、雇主及处长发出证明书，涉及维持原评估或更改评估的详情。"&lt;SEP&gt;"处长是一个具有指定和授予职衔及职务权限的人物，负责管理与职业安全相关的事务。"&lt;SEP&gt;"处长是指有权审批发牌或牌照续期的官员。"&lt;SEP&gt;"处长是指有权延长申请书送达期限的官员。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3c3394a6b72977677a8a437b4151b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a3ec4e0b16148270927aaef6bc6cb14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f30bd1959d14cc825d9dc1909b7819e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 498}]</data>
</node>
