  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a document signed by the employer that allows the 处长 to make determinations on compensation claims, as mentioned in section 6B(1)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE OF WITHDRAWAL OF CONSENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A written notification from the employer withdrawing their previous consent for a determination is described as an instance where the 处长 cannot continue with the compensation claim, according to section 6B(2)(b) of the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAMILY RELATIONSHIP DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
