  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to an official document signed by the employer that allows the 处长 to proceed with making determinations regarding a family member’s claim for compensation, as per section 6B(1)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
