</node>
<node id="&quot;FATAL INCIDENT INVOLVING AN EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to incidents leading to the death of an employee which may result in family members making compensation claims and require determinations by the 处长, as described throughout sections 5 and 6B."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMISSIONER'S DETERMINATION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Commissioner has the authority to make determinations regarding compensation amounts for family members of deceased employees based on their application and the employer’s consent, according to section 6(1) of the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
