<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM PROCESS FOR FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the overall procedure through which family members can apply and receive compensation after a fatal incident involving an employee, including determinations by the Commissioner or 处长 as per sections 5 and 6B."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S WRITTEN CONSENT FOR CLAIM DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a document that must be signed by the employer to allow the Commissioner or 处长 to make determinations on compensation claims, according to section 6(1) of the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT CERTIFICATE ISSUANCE PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process involves issuing certificates based on assessments and determinations made regarding fatal cases and their associated compensation claims as per sections 5 and 6B."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER'S APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the act of a family member applying for compensation after an employee’s death, which may require approval from the employer before determinations can be made by the Commissioner or 处长 as per sections 5 and 6B."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S WRITTEN NOTICE OF WITHDRAWAL OF CONSENT FOR CLAIM DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a document that must be signed by the employer to withdraw their previous agreement, which can prevent determinations from being made regarding compensation claims as per section 6(2)(b) of the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISPUTE OVER FAMILY RELATIONSHIP IN FATAL CASE CONTEXT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to disagreements or disputes between parties concerning familial relationships that may arise during the process of making determinations on compensation claims for a deceased employee, as per section 6(2)(c) of the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM DETERMINATION TIMELINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the time frame within which certain actions must be completed after an incident leading to a fatal case involving an employee. The exact dates depend on whether it is based on the date of death or the incident, as per sections 5 and 6B."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS FOR FAMILY MEMBERS IN FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the detailed procedure through which determinations are made regarding compensation claims by family members after a fatal case involving an employee. It includes steps such as application, assessment, and issuance of certificates based on these assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM DETERMINATION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Commissioner or 处长 have the authority to make determinations regarding compensation claims for family members after a fatal case involving an employee. This includes determining total amounts and individual shares, as per sections 5 and 6B."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;">
