  <data key="d1">"根据第(7)款被取消的除外的致命个案补偿评估证明书或致命个案补偿评估审核证明书是指那些在特定条件下仍然有效的相关文件。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;裁判官席前或任何法庭出示时,即须接納为证据而无须进一步证明&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"在裁判官席前或任何法庭出示时，即须接纳为证据而无需进一步证明是指这些文件在法律程序中具有直接的法律效力。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;相反证明成立之前,须推定为如此发出和签署的&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"在相反证明成立之前，必须假定为如此发出和签署的是指在没有其他证据反驳的情况下，这些文件被视为真实有效的。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A concept defining a specific timeframe within which payment must be made after the issuance of certain certificates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment Period is a term defined under Rule 11C, which involves calculations and definitions related to remuneration periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment Period refers to the specific time frame during which employees are employed and entitled to receive their end-of-year payment according to contractual agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment period is a defined time frame within which financial compensation or other payments are made according to contractual agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment period refers to the specific timeframe during which an employer must pay compensation as per Section 13(3)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The payment period refers to a specific timeframe within which payments are expected to be made for expenses related to funeral and medical attendance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1b0eee63da6475bd592efac352092a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1bb383ea19375cfe6d50e66dce88dd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43b4560ca9a773332d0b2bf256551f4c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 399}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1091}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The date on which a certificate is issued, used as a reference point for calculating payment periods and determining compensation amounts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 198}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 736}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6B(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6B(1)(a) is a specific clause that pertains to determinations made by the Commissioner in fatal incident cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6B(1)(a) outlines the conditions under which compensation must be paid, including timeframes and exceptions related to interim payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6B(1)(a) refers to an event where the Commissioner may issue a notice requiring the provision of particulars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6B(1)(a) refers to an event where the Court may issue certain certificates or determinations regarding fatal cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f817e1f2a5b13a0586c36573c6eea5b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 284}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SURCHARGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A surcharge is an additional charge imposed on top of a principal amount, often based on delays or other conditions as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Surcharge is a financial penalty imposed on employers who fail to comply with subsection (9) within the specified payment period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Surcharges are additional penalties imposed on employers who fail to make timely payments as per legal requirements, calculated based on specific schedules or percentages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f817e1f2a5b13a0586c36573c6eea5b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 377}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;3 MONTHS AFTER THE EXPIRY OF THE PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This timeframe is used for calculating further surcharges if initial deadlines are not met, reflecting a structured approach to enforcing compliance with compensation obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f817e1f2a5b13a0586c36573c6eea5b6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ECAFB (EMPLOYEES COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE FUND BOARD)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The ECAFB, Employees Compensation Assistance Fund Board, is a body involved in the application process and may also be an objector or recipient of certificates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a66ccff5f4b1f0435e3a62cb416f252b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 198}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 736}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6B(1)(A) DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A determination under section 6B(1)(a), which involves employer applications for compensation assessment, can lead to objections and reviews by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a66ccff5f4b1f0435e3a62cb416f252b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 198}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 736}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEES COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 365)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employees Compensation Assistance Ordinance is an ordinance that provides the framework for employee compensation and includes provisions related to applications and assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employees Compensation Assistance Ordinance, Cap. 365, provides the legal framework for applications by family members of deceased employees to make objections or reviews."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is the name of an ordinance that provides guidelines or regulations related to employee compensation matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d232c4c17f319179e61e9fe9f748ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a66ccff5f4b1f0435e3a62cb416f252b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 612}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ECAFB&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"ECAFB (Employee Compensation and Appeals Board) is a body involved in making applications to the Court for certain certificates to be made an order of the Court."&lt;SEP&gt;"ECAFB (Employers' Compensation and Accident Fund Board) is mentioned as a party that may receive certificates related to compensation assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"ECAFB (Employers' Compensation and Accident Fund Board) is mentioned as one of the parties that can apply to the Court for an order concerning the Certificate."&lt;SEP&gt;"ECAFB is an organization, possibly the Employment Compensation Appeal Board involved in appeals related to injury compensation cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"ECAFB likely refers to a specific organization, possibly an acronym for Employees Compensation Assistance Fund Board, involved in handling applications and determinations regarding reimbursement."&lt;SEP&gt;"ECAFB, or Employees' Compensation Assistant Force Bureau, can make objections to assessed compensation amounts within certain timeframes as outlined by regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c5bdac67e9c03ff3905f24c9ae12c304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b7183db745ed54dff547be6105981a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12b83ce1e2c205caa4f85bb97a5c7967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eba7d646d2449192a3db7213315460a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 818}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1187}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical Attendance Expenses include costs associated with medical care provided to an employee, which can also be claimed under this section."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical Attendance Expenses refer to expenses for medical treatment and convalescence provided by others before an employee’s death, which can be claimed under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8b99b710a13a074eee4b0551f5e725be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSECTION (17)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Subsection (17) is a provision that may override or modify the general rules outlined in other sections of the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8b99b710a13a074eee4b0551f5e725be</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNERAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funeral is an event where the Commissioner determines and reimburses expenses related to it if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c974ea5d752dd73a9522c1e2701db94a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1145}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical attendance refers to healthcare services provided during an employee's illness or injury, which may be claimed for reimbursement by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c974ea5d752dd73a9522c1e2701db94a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1145}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal Personal Representative is a person appointed to manage and distribute the estate of a deceased individual, in this context, they have no right to receive compensation after certain conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal Personal Representative is an individual who substitutes a deceased person in pursuing claims related to funeral and medical attendance expenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d87e36b5ad46db41c716cf2910faa95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 131}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE ON THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to medical services provided during the time of an employee's illness or injury, potentially related to their death."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 131}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This term describes the expenses related to funeral services and medical care that may be reimbursed under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 612}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REIMBURSEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reimbursement refers to the process of recovering costs or expenses, particularly in relation to funeral and medical attendance expenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICATION FOR COURT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An application made to the Court by the employer, individuals mentioned in the Certificate, or ECAFB requesting a specific order regarding payment under the Certificate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLE EXCUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Reasonable Excuse is a justification for failing to pay compensation or its proportionate part within the stipulated period without committing an offense."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Reasonable excuse is a justification that can be used by medical practitioners who fail to comply with notification requirements without facing criminal charges."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reasonable excuse is defined as something that justifies an employer's failure to comply with subsections (8) and (9), which could be used in legal defenses or explanations for non-compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reasonable Excuse refers to a valid reason that would exempt someone from attending an inquiry as a witness or producing documents or other key pieces of evidence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5074da09c4f82109b976a4c8a7a052fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05288c51fb6c9855d3f031e51b7e2be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70e316f848fd5f9f0f6efb5f28f0e45b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 311}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXPENSES FOR MEDICAL ATTENDANCE (醫護費)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical attendance expenses are social science-related costs incurred by individuals other than the deceased employee for hospitalization or medical treatment before their death, which can be claimed under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 282}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD (付款期)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment period (付款期) is a term defined in subsection (11), referring to the appropriate time frame for making payments as specified under section 16A."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Payment Period is a defined time frame during which payments related to funeral and medical attendance expenses should be made according to the terms specified in subsection (8)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 282}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;30-DAY PERIOD (三十天期限)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 30-day period is mentioned, during which an application for determination or continuation of claims must be submitted after certain events such as fire burial or cremation dates, or receipt of consent from the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 282}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS (索赔决定过程)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Claim Determination Process involves various steps and conditions that must be met for claims related to funeral expenses and medical attendance expenses. This process is regulated by specific sections of the text, detailing who can make determinations and under what circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONVALESCENCE (康复)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Convalescence, as part of medical attendance expenses, refers to recovery periods during hospitalization that are covered under specific claim criteria."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 199}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEVEL 6 FINE (六级罚款)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Level 6 fine is a specific monetary penalty that can be imposed on an employer who fails to comply with the requirements of subsections 8 and 9, without any valid reason."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 311}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNERAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES DETERMINATION PROCESS (丧葬费用决定过程)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process for determining funeral attendance expenses involves multiple steps including application submission, consent from the employer, and other procedural requirements that must be met before a determination can be made."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇员的殡葬费和医疗费用&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇员的殡葬费和医疗费用是指因员工去世而产生的相关费用，包括殡葬服务费用及医疗费用。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 496}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第42天至第49天内的付款期限&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第42天至第49天内的付款期限是指雇主在收到证明文件后的特定时间内需支付相应款项的事件。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 496}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;附加费&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"附加费是在雇主未能按时或全额支付相关费用时，需要额外支付的一笔费用。它分为两个阶段：一是当期到期时应支付的金额；二是付款期限届满后三个月内需支付的进一步附加费。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;附表6第2栏和第3栏中的百分率计算方法&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"附表6第2栏和第3栏中的百分率计算方法是用于确定额外费用的具体计算方式，其中第二栏给出的是固定金额，第三栏则是基于未支付余额的百分比进行计算。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;合理辩解&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"合理辩解是指雇主在未能按时或全额支付相关费用时可以提供的正当理由，以减轻其责任。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第6E(9)(A)条和第6E(9)(B)条的条款内容&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第6E(9)(a)条和第6E(9)(b)条是法律文本中的具体条款，分别规定了不同阶段需支付的不同附加费。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;付款期限届满时与三个月后的时间节点&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"付款期限届满时与三个月后的时间节点是指在特定时间点上雇主需要完成额外费用的支付义务。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;未付还余额计算方法&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"未付还余额计算方法是基于附表6中给出的具体百分率来确定应支付金额的方法，确保了对欠款进行精确计算和追讨的过程。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;殡葬费和医疗费用证明书或审核证明书的发放方&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"殡葬费和医疗费用证明书或审核证明书是由相关机构出具的文件，用于确认员工去世后产生的具体费用。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇员死亡事件&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇员死亡事件是指导致产生上述所有费用的具体情况，即某位雇员不幸离世。"&lt;SEP&gt;"雇员死亡事件是指雇员因任何原因去世的情况，触发长期服务金的支付。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a3ec4e0b16148270927aaef6bc6cb14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;附表6中的固定金额和百分比计算方法&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"附表6中的固定金额和百分比计算方法是用于确定附加费具体数额的规则，包括直接给出的固定金额以及基于未支付余额按比例计算的方法。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇员家属或受益人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇员家属或受益人在这一情境中是指因员工去世而有权获得相关费用补偿的人群。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇主的付款义务&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇主的付款义务是法律和合同规定的责任，要求在特定时间内支付相应的殡葬费、医疗费用及相关附加费。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;未付还金额计算方法的具体应用&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"未付还金额计算方法的具体应用是指如何根据附表6中的规定来准确计算出雇主应额外支付的款项，确保所有相关方的利益得到保障。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法律文本条款解释与执行过程&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"法律文本条款解释与执行过程涉及对具体条文的理解和实际操作中如何落实这些规则的过程，包括计算附加费、追讨欠款等环节。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇主的合理辩解机制&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇主的合理辩解机制是指在未能按时或全额支付相关费用时可以提供的正当理由和解释方式，以减轻其责任并可能影响最终的附加费计算结果。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇员去世后的后续处理流程&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇员去世后的后续处理流程包括从证明文件的出具、付款期限的规定到额外费用的支付等一系列步骤和程序。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;未付还金额的具体计算方法&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"未付还金额的具体计算方法是基于附表6中给出的比例来确定雇主应支付的附加费，确保所有相关方的利益得到准确评估与补偿。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇员去世后的法律和财务处理&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇员去世后的法律和财务处理涉及从员工死亡到费用计算、付款等一系列复杂的过程，需要遵循特定的法律规定并进行精确的操作以确保公平性和透明性。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇主的责任与义务&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇主的责任与义务是指在雇员去世后必须承担的相关法律责任和财务责任，包括支付相关费用及可能产生的附加费等。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;未付还金额的计算依据&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"未付还金额的计算依据是附表6中规定的百分率方法，用于确定雇主应额外支付的具体数额以弥补欠款。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇员去世后的补偿机制&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇员去世后的补偿机制是指在员工离世后为家属或受益人提供的经济支持和法律保障措施，包括相关费用的计算与支付等环节。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇主的付款期限规定&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇主的付款期限规定是要求雇主必须在特定时间内完成对雇员去世产生的相关费用及附加费的支付义务，否则将面临额外罚款或其他法律后果。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;未付还金额的具体计算方式&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"未付还金额的具体计算方式是指根据附表6中给出的比例来确定雇主应支付的额外费用，确保所有相关方的利益得到准确评估与补偿。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇员去世后的法律程序和财务处理流程&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇员去世后的法律程序和财务处理流程涉及从员工死亡到费用计算、付款等一系列复杂的过程，需要遵循特定的法律规定并进行精确的操作以确保公平性和透明性。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇主的责任与义务的具体内容&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇主的责任与义务的具体内容是指在雇员去世后必须承担的相关法律责任和财务责任，包括支付相关费用及可能产生的附加费等具体操作步骤。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNERAL AND MEDICAL EXPENSES AUDIT CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funeral and Medical Expenses Audit Certificate is a document used for auditing funeral and medical expenses, which can be accepted as evidence in court under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fa74d0f00f96c28e36e2d2dc5c9e2eda</data>
