</node>
<node id="&quot;CHIEF OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A high-ranking official who authorizes inspectors for specific purposes, as mentioned in the text but not explicitly named."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Officer refers to the person who issues and signs the Funeral and Medical Expenses Audit Certificate or its review certificate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The official to whom doctors must report their findings or suspicions regarding potential occupational illnesses among employees or former employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d781ae6a3974dcd155b4f5b736d6161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa74d0f00f96c28e36e2d2dc5c9e2eda</data>
