</node>
<node id="&quot;PROVINCIAL GOVERNMENT DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provincial Government Department is responsible for making determinations on claims related to funeral and medical expenses, as well as reviewing such certificates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fa74d0f00f96c28e36e2d2dc5c9e2eda</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 556}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6C(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6C(1)(a) and (11), Section 6D(6)(b), and Section 6E(1)(a) or (12) are specific clauses that pertain to determinations made by the Commissioner in various fatal incident cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6C(1)(a) is another event related to issuing certificates for fatal cases, possibly involving medical expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6C(1)(a) is another event where the Commissioner can require the provision of particulars from employers or sub-contractors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
