</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6D(6)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6D(6)(b) involves an event requiring the submission of copies of documents as directed by the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6D(6)(b) is a clause related to determinations involving fatal incidents and compensation distribution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6D(6)(b) refers to a specific event or provision within the legal framework governing fatal cases and compensation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
