</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6E(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6E(1)(a) is an event related to determinations under section 6E, possibly involving mid-term payments for fatal cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6E(1)(a) is yet another event where particulars may be required from relevant parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6E(1)(a) or (12) are clauses that pertain to specific determinations made by the Commissioner in fatal incident cases, affecting compensation recovery and distribution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
