</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES AND MEDICAL TREATMENT FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are specific products or services (funeral expenses and medical treatment fees) that may need to be compensated according to legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical Attendance Fees refer to expenses related to medical care for an employee before their death and need to be factored into the total compensation calculation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 181}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION UNDER SECTION 6(5)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compensation under Section 6(5) is a key factor in determining the maximum liability of employers and insurers, especially concerning funeral expenses and medical attendance fees for deceased employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 181}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10 COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 10 Compensation refers to any compensation paid by an employee before their death according to Section 10, which is not included in the total liability calculation under Section 6(5)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 181}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SURCHARGE UNDER SECTIONS 6C(8), 6D(3), AND 6E(9)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These surcharges are additional fees that do not affect the total compensation amount calculated according to Section 6."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 181}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCESS AMOUNT PAID UNDER SECTIONS 7 AND 9&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An excess amount paid by an employer under Sections 7 and 9 before an employee's death, which cannot be recovered from the employee or their insurer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 181}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 7 AND 9&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sections 7 and 9 are provisions where an employer may pay more than the statutory amount before the employee's death, potentially affecting recovery rights."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 566}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical Payments are funds allocated for medical expenses related to an employee's care before their death, potentially included in legal determinations regarding fatal cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 284}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPELLATE COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appellate court is mentioned as an entity that hears appeals from lower courts and has the authority to grant leave for certain appeals. It is synonymous with 'Court of Appeal' in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appellate Court is a location where applications related to arbitration costs or expenses can be submitted for review."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appellate Court is the organization that hears appeals against determinations made by the Commissioner under section 6B(1)(a), 6C(1)(a) or (11), 6D(6)(b) or 6E(1)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9f62200ffc7f6236194042490c461241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e105b81cb8e7429af8bdd848fcb41de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 237}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 883}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;42 DAYS PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 42 days period is a specific timeframe within which an appeal can be filed, after which it may no longer be possible to challenge the determination unless extended by the Court."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 284}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST DETERMINATION OF COMMISSIONER IN FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to the legal process where parties can contest determinations made by the Commissioner regarding fatal cases and compensation amounts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 284}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DETERMINATION UNDER SECTION 6B(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A determination under section 6B(1)(a) is a specific event or decision related to issuing certificates for fatal cases, possibly involving funeral expenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 284}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DETERMINATION UNDER SECTION 6C(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Similarly, this refers to determinations made under section 6C(1)(a), which may involve medical payments and other compensation matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 284}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MID-TERM PAYMENT CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A mid-term payment certificate is a document that authorizes or records the distribution of funds for interim payments related to fatal cases, such as funeral expenses and medical costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 598}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINAL DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The final determination refers to the conclusive decision made by the Court after considering all relevant factors in an appeal against Commissioner's determinations regarding fatal cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compensation for fatal cases is a social science concept that deals with financial and legal arrangements designed to support individuals or families affected by the death of an employee due to work-related incidents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK GOVERNING FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Legal Framework Governing Fatal Cases refers to the set of laws, regulations, and procedures established to handle compensation matters related to fatal cases in a systematic manner."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 598}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES ALLOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funeral Expenses Allocation is a process or system used by organizations to distribute funds for funeral expenses among affected parties based on legal determinations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 598}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL PAYMENTS DISTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical Payments Distribution refers to the allocation and management of medical expense payments related to fatal cases, ensuring proper distribution according to legal guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 598}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income is used as a variable in calculating the compensation for employees who have permanently lost their work capacity, with different multiples applied depending on the employee's age at the time of injury."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 120}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;40 YEARS OLD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The age 40 is a critical point in determining the compensation amount based on the employee's income and the potential loss due to permanent total work incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;56 YEARS OLD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The age 56 marks another significant point for calculating compensation, with different multiples applied compared to younger employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;7(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7(1)(a) is an event or condition that triggers a specific calculation method for employee compensation based on their income and age at the time of injury."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 120}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;7(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7(2) is another event or condition, ensuring that the minimum compensation amount cannot be less than what is specified in Schedule 6 Column 2 corresponding to the provisions mentioned in Section 1 of the same schedule."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 120}]</data>
</node>
