  <data key="d2">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;7. COMPENSATION IN CASE OF PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a title for compensation related to permanent total incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;(1) WHERE PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY RESULTS FROM THE INJURY, THE AMOUNT OF COMPENSATION SHALL BE— (A) IN THE CASE OF AN EMPLOYEE UNDER 40 YEARS OF AGE AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT,&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This clause specifies that for employees under 40 years old who suffer a work-related injury leading to permanent total incapacity, they are entitled to a specific compensation amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;96&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
