</node>
<node id="&quot;附表1所指明的損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appendix 1 specifies certain types of injuries, which are recognized or categorized for specific purposes within this document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appendix 1 specifies injuries that are recognized, indicating a list or database of specific injuries."&lt;SEP&gt;"附表1所指明的損傷是指在特定情况下需要赔偿的具体损伤类型。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
</node>
