  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are organizations involved in evaluating and determining compensation amounts for injuries."&lt;SEP&gt;"These organizations are involved in assessing the degree of incapacity and determining compensation amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"These organizations play a role in the assessment and determination process related to compensation for work-related injuries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;多項損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
