<node id="&quot;INJURED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An injured employee is mentioned as part of the agreement with the employer, indicating their role in receiving compensation based on specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An injured employee refers to individuals who have been harmed at work and are entitled to receive medical supplies and services under the provisions of section 36B, 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Injured employee refers to a person who has suffered an accident and may be entitled to receive prostheses or surgical appliances as per section 36B."&lt;SEP&gt;"The injured employee is the individual who has received notice from the Commissioner, an Ordinary Assessment Board or a Special Assessment Board and must comply with attendance requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0777124042c66cc9558d8401a55e7156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab861803e98b52f9a42ed6d058e8b49</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 557}]</data>
</node>
