</node>
<node id="&quot;CARE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Care expenses are the costs associated with providing care, which may be paid by employers or calculated as whole amounts based on possible duration and cost of care."</data>
