</node>
<node id="&quot;僱用合約或學徒訓練合約&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to employment contracts or apprenticeship agreements that define terms and conditions for payment, but they do not belong in any of the specified categories except as a general concept related to labor laws."</data>
