<node id="&quot;1個月&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1個月表示一个月的期限，用于界定合同性质和续期条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The maximum interval of one month is mentioned in relation to the frequency of periodic payments, which is a numerical constraint on payment schedules."</data>
