</node>
<node id="&quot;24個月&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A period of 24 months is mentioned in relation to the duration for receiving periodic payments before losing eligibility. This is a numerical constraint on payment periods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法院按個別情況所容許另加不多於12個月的較長期間&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Courts can allow longer periods, up to 36 months in total, for receiving periodic payments based on individual circumstances. This is a legal provision that affects payment duration."</data>
