</node>
<node id="&quot;停止喪失工作能力&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The cessation of loss of work capacity before the next scheduled payment date still requires payment for that period, calculated proportionally based on the duration of incapacity. This describes an event or condition affecting payment schedules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT COMPENSATION SCHEME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
