  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Small Claims Tribunal Ordinance (Cap. 338) is legislation that establishes the framework for the Small Claims Tribunal, including its jurisdiction and procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Small Claims Tribunal Ordinance is a legal document that establishes the framework for resolving small civil debts, including medical expenses claims in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1f5fe723dc66b1a35b256f0fbcfd9642&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
