  <data key="d2">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Technology includes the certification from registered doctors, registered Chinese medicine practitioners, or registered dentists regarding the necessity of further treatment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FREE MEDICAL TREATMENT OFFERED BY EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Service refers to free medical treatments provided by employers as per legal provisions and agreements with employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;雇員&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"雇員是受僱工作的个体，在工作期间遭遇意外身体受伤的人。"&lt;SEP&gt;"雇員是指受僱于僱主的人，在特定条件下有权享受年假，并可以选择将未使用的年假延期至下一年。"&lt;SEP&gt;"雇員是指受僱於原僱主或替代僱主的人，在此文本中涉及他们的权利和工作连续性。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b1de7cbb89da3f1adf715fabc5ea88cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 473}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;免費醫治&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"免費醫治是指由註冊醫生、中醫等專業人士提供的無償治療服務，涵蓋多種類別如物理治療和職業治療。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法律責任&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"法律責任指的是僱主根據相關法規需承擔的義務，包括支付醫療費用或提供免費醫治。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2006年第16號修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"2006年第16號修訂是指對現有法律條文進行修改和增補的一次事件，涉及僱主對於因工受傷雇員的醫療責任。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;註冊醫生&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Registered doctor refers to medical practitioners who are licensed to practice medicine in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registration Doctors are medical practitioners who have been registered and can provide medical services."&lt;SEP&gt;"註冊醫生是指獲得合法執照從事醫療工作的醫學专业人士。"&lt;SEP&gt;"註冊醫生是指經認可的醫療專業人員，能夠提供治療意見並簽發證明書。"&lt;SEP&gt;"註冊醫生是經過專業培訓並獲得執業資格的醫學专业人士，提供包括診斷、治療等服務。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 81}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;註冊中醫&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioner (as referred) is a traditional healthcare provider authorized by the government of Hong Kong to practice Chinese medicine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioners (TCM) are healthcare professionals specializing in traditional Chinese medicine practices, including diagnosis and treatment methods based on TCM theories."&lt;SEP&gt;"註冊中醫是指具有中医学专业背景并获得执业资格的专业人士，提供中医相关的治疗服务。"&lt;SEP&gt;"註冊中醫是指另一類經認可的医疗专业人员，能够提供特定类型的治疗意见和证明书。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 456}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1126}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;物理治療師&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROFESSION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"物理治療師是专门从事物理治疗方法的医疗专业人士，负责通过各种手段改善患者的生理功能和生活质量。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;職業治療師&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"職業治療師是指提供职业治疗服务的专业人士，帮助患者恢复或提高其参与日常生活和社会活动的能力。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;脊醫&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROFESSION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"脊醫是专门从事脊椎相关疾病的诊断和治疗的医疗专业人士，通常采用非药物疗法如按摩、牵引等进行治疗。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;物理治療&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"THERAPY"</data>
