  <data key="d2">chunk-1e7838850b120bb3976756876786fd0f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;《中醫藥條例》(第549章)附表1或2指明的中藥材 (CHINESE HERBAL MEDICINES LISTED IN SCHEDULE 1 OR 2 OF THE CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE, CHAPTER 549)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些药材是根据香港地区法规明确列出，可以用于中药处方中的特定草药。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1e7838850b120bb3976756876786fd0f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;華人慣常作藥用的其他源於植物、動物或礦物的物料 (OTHER PLANT, ANIMAL OR MINERAL MATERIALS CUSTOMARILY USED AS MEDICINAL IN CHINESE CULTURE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
