</node>
<node id="&quot;CHINESE HERBAL MEDICINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chinese Herbal Medicine refers to medicinal materials specified in Annex 1 or 2 of The Chinese Medicinal Materials Ordinance, and other plant, animal, or mineral substances commonly used as medicine by the Chinese community."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chinese herbal medicine refers to medicinal substances derived from plants, used in traditional Chinese medicine practices as per the regulation Cap. 549 sub. leg. F."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 67}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PHARMACY AND POISONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 138)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Pharmacy and Poisons Ordinance governs the registration of substances or products related to pharmacy and poisons, which includes Chinese herbal medicines registered under this ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Pharmacy and Poisons Ordinance is a legal framework governing pharmaceutical products in Hong Kong, including registration requirements for certain medicines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 67}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Chinese Medicine Ordinance (Cap. 549) is a legal document that defines terms such as 'Chinese herbal medicine' and 'proprietary Chinese medicine', regulating the prescription and sale of medicines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chinese Medicine Ordinance is a legal document that regulates the sale and use of Chinese herbal medicines in Hong Kong, including licensing requirements for retailers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chinese Medicine Ordinance provides the regulatory framework for traditional Chinese medicine practitioners and their practice in Hong Kong, including provisions related to the registration of proprietary Chinese medicines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 565}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RETAILER LICENCE ISSUED UNDER SECTION [SECTION NUMBER] OF THE CHINESE MEDICINAL MATERIALS ORDINANCE (CAP. 549 SUB. LEG. F)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LICENSE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Retailer Licence issued by relevant authorities is required for selling certain medicinal materials, including Chinese herbal medicines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 67}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RETAILER LICENCE ISSUED UNDER SECTION 114 OF THE CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LICENSE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A retailer licence is required for selling Chinese herbal medicine according to the Chinese Medicine Ordinance, ensuring that only licensed individuals can sell such medicines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 565}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 118(1) OF THE CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 118(1) of the ordinance provides conditions under which a person may be deemed to have been granted a retailer licence, allowing for flexibility in licensing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 565}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Registered medical practitioners or dentists can issue prescriptions for medicines according to professional standards and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPRIETARY CHINESE MEDICINE REGISTERED UNDER SECTION 121 OF, OR DEEMED TO HAVE BEEN REGISTERED UNDER SECTION &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proprietary Chinese medicines are regulated products that may be registered according to specific sections of the ordinance and can include both those explicitly registered and those deemed to be registered."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHINESE HERBAL MEDICINE&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chinese herbal medicine refers to materials used for medicinal purposes, including those specified in Schedule 1 or 2 of the Chinese Medicine Ordinance (Cap. 549) and other customarily used herbs, animals, or minerals."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPRIETARY CHINESE MEDICINE&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proprietary Chinese medicine is a registered product under section 121 or deemed to be registered under section 128 of the Chinese Medicine Ordinance (Cap. 549), and can also include exempted products as per section 158(6) of the same ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRESCRIPTION&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT,PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prescription is a document that must be produced by a registered Chinese medicine practitioner showing details such as patient name, prescribed medicines' names and quantities, and date given."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECEIPT&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Receipt is a document for the payment of cost of medicines sold, showing seller's name and address, sale date, and detailed information about the prescribed medicines including their names, quantities, and prices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;处长&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 处长 refers to an official who makes decisions regarding medical expenses as per the regulations outlined in sections 10B(1) of a relevant ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;医疗费&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS,INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical fee is calculated and determined by the 处长 based on applications from employees or employers, involving legal responsibilities for medical treatments outside Hong Kong as per section 10A of the Chinese Medicine Ordinance (Cap. 549)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;香港&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hong Kong is a location where medical treatments and expenses are regulated by the Chinese Medicine Ordinance (Cap. 549) and related legal frameworks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;裁決&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event of determining legal responsibility for medical expenses paid outside Hong Kong is described as a key point in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50672759d0eedd36be50c0f02eae5b67</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 474}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;申請&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Application refers to requests made by employees or employers for determinations of legal responsibility and medical expense amounts, which is a formal process described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"申請是指根據原本命令有關僱員須獲再次聘用的最後日期或之前提出的申請，或者在法院或勞資審裁處准许的延展期间内提出申请。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50672759d0eedd36be50c0f02eae5b67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4a36a8d591bd2dfc15340f652a220e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 474}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;證明書&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certificate is a document issued by healthcare professionals, such as doctors or dentists, certifying certain medical conditions or treatments received by patients."&lt;SEP&gt;"The certificate mentioned is used to formally document decisions regarding medical expenses, serving as evidence in court proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50672759d0eedd36be50c0f02eae5b67</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 474}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法庭&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Court is where disputes over medical expense determinations can be resolved through legal means, ensuring the finality and enforceability of the certificates issued by the '处长'."&lt;SEP&gt;"法庭 means court, which is where legal procedures are conducted and decisions on damages are made."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a5734a3528df7505e20e5f0156116bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50672759d0eedd36be50c0f02eae5b67</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10A&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 10A refers to the legal section that outlines liability and amounts related to medical expenses, both inside and outside Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d76ba7381f3e95da332b4d2d5206d84</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 429}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT REVIEW PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Court review process is an event where determinations made by the Commissioner can be confirmed, varied, reversed, or substituted with a new determination regarding medical expense liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cbcb1ef289ad456f0c48fcfc25edb43d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT INCOME CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event refers to the process of calculating employment income based on certain criteria, such as previous earnings and comparable employees' salaries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ca5cfeffecbed01cff551f97c830898</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEMPORARY LOSS OF WORK CAPACITY AFTER ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Condition where an employee temporarily loses work capacity after an accident for more than 12 months from the date of the incident."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ca5cfeffecbed01cff551f97c830898</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIMILAR EARNINGS CALCULATION METHOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A method to calculate earnings based on similar employees' income in comparable positions, considering hypothetical scenarios without the occurrence of an accident."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ca5cfeffecbed01cff551f97c830898</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMPTION PRICE INDEX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Consumption Price Index is a measure used to adjust income calculations in the context of work incapacity compensation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e7d114925114937b88b0d806fd1a7519</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORK INCAPACITY COMPENSATION CALCULATION METHODOLOGY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the process outlined for calculating compensation when an employee temporarily loses their ability to work, including methods based on similar employees' incomes and adjustments using the consumption price index."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e7d114925114937b88b0d806fd1a7519</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (CPI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Consumer Price Index is a measure of the average change over time in the prices paid by consumers for a market basket of consumer goods and services, used here to adjust income calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-36d3f58cc1b0180627d982d9257e5465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;附表6第2欄中相對於該附表第1欄所指明的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a mathematical calculation used in determining the income of an employee for compensation purposes, based on specific amounts listed in Schedule 6 Column 2 corresponding to certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-613a87c26df0303e04bf8a71b1462496</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第11(5)條之處指明的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is another reference to a mathematical calculation used as a benchmark or standard amount of income for an employee, specifically mentioned under Section 11(5)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-613a87c26df0303e04bf8a71b1462496</data>
</node>
