</node>
<node id="&quot;第3級罰款&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A fine at level 3 is a monetary penalty associated with certain offenses under the legal provisions mentioned, specifically regarding interest on late payments of wages."&lt;SEP&gt;"第3級罰款是指因违反法律规定而可能面临的罚款等级，具体金额未明确给出。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
