<node id="&quot;家庭成員&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Family members are categorized into different groups for specific distribution rules based on eligibility criteria, reflecting legal and social science considerations in compensation allocation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family members are defined as individuals related by blood, marriage, or adoption within a family unit, potentially eligible for certain benefits under the law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family members are mentioned as recipients in the distribution of certain funds related to compensation and benefits."</data>
