</node>
<node id="&quot;MEMBERS OF HIS FAMILY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FAMILY MEMBERS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Family members are individuals such as spouses, children, or other relatives who may be eligible for compensation if their deceased relative was an employee under the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d87e36b5ad46db41c716cf2910faa95c</data>
