<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURY COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee Injury Compensation refers to the compensation paid due to an injury sustained by an employee, which may be subject to certain exclusions as specified in section 6B(1)(a), 6C(1)(a) or (11), 6D(6)(b) or 6E(1)(a) or (12)."</data>
