<node id="&quot;REGULATION 14. 關於意外通知和補償申請的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This regulation outlines specific rules and procedures related to accident notifications and compensation applications according to the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1d19ac100c430c329d42230a7654f3c9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 303}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 992}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKPLACE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Workplace accident or dangerous incident occurs at a work location and can be investigated by the Commissioner to determine its cause and circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"A workplace accident is an incident that occurs while the employee was working for the employer, leading to injury or death of the employee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Workplace accidents are incidents that result in bodily harm to employees at their work location."&lt;SEP&gt;"Workplace accidents refer to incidents occurring at work locations, which may lead to appeals against related notifications or decisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05288c51fb6c9855d3f031e51b7e2be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc8d52a1038b5b838fbe9231f59cfc74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b74f875ef514e4d7940f5dbe0d7910e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 47}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 396}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compensation application is the process by which seafarers apply for financial compensation due to accidents at sea."&lt;SEP&gt;"The compensation application refers to a legal claim made by the employee according to Section 18A(2) of relevant laws within specific time limits after the accident occurs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49920e3fc93948bee580896f50d6da6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 47}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 394}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLACE OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Place of Employment refers to any location where employees are hired and can be inspected under the authority granted to certain officials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Place of Employment is the location at which employees are typically paid their wages directly in legal tender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Place of employment is the physical location where an employee works and receives notifications or notices regarding changes in company policies, such as those concerning annual leave calculation methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"This term describes any location where an employee works for their employer, including but not limited to the workplace or areas under the control of the employer and its employees during work hours."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af3fa69740e6c0d13188b3cd0b0d9a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-919e8934f076d1a9c5aea1486aa3f1c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f51952a48de0746c8700f0d84b90238&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 294}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 983}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEATH LOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This term refers to the place where a deceased employee died after being injured in a workplace accident or at the time of death if they were still near the location of the incident."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 47}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 396}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S KNOWLEDGE OF ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The employer's knowledge of an accident, which can be obtained through various means such as direct notification from employees or discovery during legal proceedings related to claims."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 47}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 396}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal Proceedings refer to the legal actions initiated by insurance companies for claims of compensation or damages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal procedures refer to the processes and actions taken in court regarding workplace accidents and compensation applications by employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal proceedings are formal processes conducted within a court or arbitral tribunal setting to resolve disputes according to established laws and procedures, including those involving arbitration as detailed by Article 27 of the UNCITRAL Model Law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal proceedings are mentioned as a context for discussing employer-employee relationships and compliance with regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal proceedings are systematic processes used within the legal system to initiate, conduct, and conclude cases related to offenses; they involve formal steps such as filing complaints or laying information according to specific provisions of an ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal proceedings arise under this Ordinance when disputes involve the results of an analysis. A certificate from a Public Analyst is admissible in these proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal proceedings include court actions and other dispute resolution mechanisms where information can be disclosed under certain legal requirements, such as for enforcement purposes or seeking professional advice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal proceedings refer to any legal actions or processes where a Mainland award may be relied upon as evidence, defense, set-off, etc., in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal proceedings refer to the process of a lawsuit, which may be stayed or proceed based on certain conditions as directed by the court."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204ae6c021e3fe4bd76744d9bd61144e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff7a7ad14c10761bcb15431ef57d8f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce083c97323a19a9162d045f2002c1d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3977494e2da78f664ddb0fbbd085bf83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d0bd5cc3392e5c0de523f5bb0536a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcca397988541ca9ac3822ff7a363627</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 912}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;管工或其他職員&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"管工或其他职员是指负责监督雇员工作的管理人员或工作人员。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;總承判商&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"總承判商是在建筑行业中总承包项目的公司或实体。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法院&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Courts are referred to in the text, particularly in relation to enforcing and refusing enforcement of Convention awards."&lt;SEP&gt;"法院是处理补偿索赔案件的重要机构，在决定是否考虑处长作出的查询结果时具有裁决权。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法院是指在法律程序中作出裁决的司法机构，负责审理案件并做出判决。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法院是指处理工伤赔偿申请的司法机构，负责受理和裁决相关案件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法院是提出補償申索的地點，在某些情況下可以與其他申索一起提交。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-637d9e3dd1440e4117d86911ea5a7841&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42e445b0642be8d3a51c65d52cad0740&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b4dba8dcefb2d368c753859f749fd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 492}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;通知&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"通知是指女性员工向雇主通报怀孕情况和产假计划的行为。"&lt;SEP&gt;"通知是用于报告意外事故的重要信息传递方式，可以通过书面或口头形式发出。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eb1fa32929a7020d65f293e8c9d7dd58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;補償申請&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"補償申請是指因工伤而向雇主或其他相关方提出的赔偿请求。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 456}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1126}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1982年第76號第12及37條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1982年第76号第12和37条是法律修订的条款编号，用于说明通知的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第24條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第24条规定了在特定情况下次承判商需要向总承判商发出的通知要求。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;常用語言&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"常用语言是指用于描述受伤原因和意外发生地点的语言，确保信息的准确传达。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;合理因由&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"合理因由指的是导致未及时通知或不符合规定的原因，如错误、人员不在香港等情形。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE OF ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notice of Accident is a form required by the Commissioner for reporting accidents causing injury but not resulting in death within 7 days."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notice of Accident refers to an event where the employer must be informed about an incident involving injury, which triggers further actions such as compensation applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6087ed3d45150a001bf9f66572bde4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 132}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Application for Compensation is a formal request made by employees under specific conditions and timeframes, aimed at receiving financial support due to workplace injuries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6087ed3d45150a001bf9f66572bde4b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 818}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1187}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER OR ANY PERSON EMPLOYED BY HIM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The employer and anyone working for the employer are entities responsible for reporting accidents involving employees according to workplace safety regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92743ab978843e283d6914a0d34ee3ea</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1142}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREMISES OR PLACE WHERE THE ACCIDENT OCCURRED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This location is where accidents take place and are relevant for reporting purposes according to workplace safety regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92743ab978843e283d6914a0d34ee3ea</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 254}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 923}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;支付補償的法律責任&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"支付补偿的法律责任涉及因事故导致员工伤亡时，雇主需承担的相关法律规定和责任。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eae344452d3fef20d9a84a14e26b325a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 456}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1126}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;意外通知&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"意外通知是指雇主在得知或通过其他途径获知事故发生后，根据主管指明的格式发出的通知。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-56d9a950f8e72e839cb27b535da95ff4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 72}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 466}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;死亡通知&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"死亡通知是雇主在得知或通过其他途径获知员工去世后，根据规定格式向主管发出的通知。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-56d9a950f8e72e839cb27b535da95ff4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE DEATH NOTIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event where an employee's death is notified by the employer, which can trigger compensation claims or other actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86b556980892b37b85caf641b152672a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Compensation Claim is mentioned as arising due to injuries covered under this regulation, involving legal proceedings within specified time limits."&lt;SEP&gt;"A claim for compensation may arise in respect of the death or incapacity of an employee and can be made by the Commissioner after receiving a notice under specified subsections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A claim for compensation that may arise from an employee's death and could be investigated by the Secretary."&lt;SEP&gt;"Compensation Claim is an event where individuals or entities seek financial reparation from the court, which may involve legal procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Compensation Claim is the process where employees can seek payment from either the total contractor or the subcontractor for their work."&lt;SEP&gt;"Compensation claims refer to claims for financial reparation due to an injury or incident, which are subject to legal procedures and time constraints."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d68cfffcc2e250c3bcedc1cbea93ab48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5264a8fa197e6ad59c59c71f8b3763e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ad747843ea1e53c58713c22b928c5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86b556980892b37b85caf641b152672a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f922ec3eb4453fd0e3ed3576f92a000e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd413c3e0e2d3c065b140491b75c8888</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 824}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Family members are individuals related to a deceased employee who might receive notifications about the cause of death if applicable."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86b556980892b37b85caf641b152672a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 824}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱主的處所&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"僱主的處所是指雇员死亡发生的地点，根据法律规定，雇主在此处应被视为对雇员之死有所知悉。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42e445b0642be8d3a51c65d52cad0740</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 72}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 466}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEATH NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Death Notice is a report given to the Commissioner about an employee's death, which must be provided no later than 7 days after the event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 132}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;64 OF 1992 S. 3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 3 of Act 64 from 1992 amends provisions related to notice requirements for accidents and deaths in employment contexts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;67 OF 1996 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 4 of Act 67 from 1996 adds or modifies specific clauses regarding accident reporting timelines, including extensions beyond initial incapacity periods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;76 OF 1982 S. 13&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 13 of Act 76 from 1982 amends provisions for the Commissioner to require employers to notify specific incidents within a prescribed period, not less than 7 days."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The text refers to legal and regulatory frameworks governing workplace accidents, employee incapacity, and death notifications, which fall under social science studies of labor laws and occupational health policies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 132}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE TO EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The notice to the employer is an event where details about an employee's death or incapacity must be reported within 7 days as per specified regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f922ec3eb4453fd0e3ed3576f92a000e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE DEATH NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event where the death of an employee is reported to the employer, which then needs to be communicated to the Commissioner within 7 days."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f922ec3eb4453fd0e3ed3576f92a000e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS NOTIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Commissioner may inform family members if any, about the reported cause and circumstances of the employee's death and advise them of their right to compensation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f922ec3eb4453fd0e3ed3576f92a000e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 824}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCIDENT NOTIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An accident notification is the formal communication from an employee to their employer about an incident that may have caused injury or illness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 115}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PHYSICIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A physician, including registered doctors, traditional Chinese medicine practitioners, and dentists, are medical professionals who conduct health checks on employees as required by law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Physicians, including registered doctors or acupuncturists, may issue medical certificates relevant to the text's context of pregnant employees' work conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c53400793123be7f8846d77b56748e48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 115}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROFESSION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Traditional Chinese Medicine Practitioner is a healthcare professional specializing in traditional Chinese medicinal practices that may be involved in employee health check-ups under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 115}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A dentist, as part of the medical professionals mentioned, can conduct specific types of health checks on employees if required by their treatment status."&lt;SEP&gt;"A professional dental healthcare provider authorized by law in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dentist is mentioned as one of the types of practitioners involved in medical examinations but does not fit into an organizational context directly; it refers to a professional who can provide dental care and advice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registered Dentists are members of the Ordinary Assessment Boards who assess injuries related to dental conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-be12459eb42b5303144e2a38dc8cf0c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 115}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;註冊牙醫&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dentists who have been registered to provide dental services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registered Dentist refers to dental practitioners who are licensed to provide oral health services in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"註冊牙醫是第三種經認可的醫療專業人員，能夠提供相關治療意見並簽發證明書。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 456}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1126}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;身體檢查&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Physical examinations conducted by medical professionals such as doctors, dentists, and TCM practitioners to assess the health status of employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 455}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Medical Examination Report is mentioned in the text which needs to be provided by employers under certain conditions or upon employee's request."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1faa1664ffe65d577dff74396c2e0ae</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1142}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRIVATE REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Private Registered Doctor is a healthcare professional who can conduct medical examinations for employees under certain conditions according to labor laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1faa1664ffe65d577dff74396c2e0ae</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to medical professionals who are authorized to treat employees under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-41bbb00ceaa0cfa991f173d4f0741862</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 555}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION AND TREATMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event involves a requirement for an employee to undergo a medical examination after giving notice of an accident."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to a process where an employee may be examined and treated by authorized medical practitioners after reporting an accident."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-60357a5d0f946dc1e998d1bea10860b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bbb00ceaa0cfa991f173d4f0741862</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 590}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM FOR EMPLOYEE'S DEATH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A compensation claim can be made in the case of an employee's death, provided certain conditions are met regarding their treatment or examination as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-41bbb00ceaa0cfa991f173d4f0741862</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 555}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2006年第16號第16條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is another amendment or revision from 2006 that further defined the process of requiring periodic medical examinations for certain employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-60357a5d0f946dc1e998d1bea10860b6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 590}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A practitioner refers to a person who can provide medical advice and conduct examinations. This includes registered medical practitioners, registered Chinese medicine practitioners, or registered dentists."&lt;SEP&gt;"Practitioner is an individual who operates or plans to operate a vocational placement office, subject to licensing conditions and potential disqualification criteria."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-be12459eb42b5303144e2a38dc8cf0c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 611}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A medical examination is an event where a registered practitioner assesses the health condition of an employee as required by law or employer's request."&lt;SEP&gt;"A medical examination is an event where the employer arranges for an employee to be assessed by a registered practitioner to determine their fitness for specific work activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"A medical examination is required by an employer before employing an employee in certain trades, industries or processes. The cost of the examination is borne by the employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical examination is a procedure conducted by healthcare professionals to assess an employee's health status related to pregnancy or other medical conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical examination refers to a health check-up conducted by a registered medical practitioner or Chinese medicine practitioner at the employer's expense, aimed at determining an employee's fitness for work."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical examination refers to a physical check-up conducted before employment, which can be requested by the employer and paid for by them."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical examination refers to an event where employees are required to undergo health checks as per regulations or employer requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical examinations are required for further assessment when an employer requests it from a pregnant employee. The cost is borne by the employer and must be conducted within 14 days after receiving the request."&lt;SEP&gt;"medical examination是一种医学检查技术，用于确定员工是否永久不适合特定类型的工作。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc7d719876b6f50011d4a77def5a2428&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be12459eb42b5303144e2a38dc8cf0c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6b2c9739d4904eac9e0c6be6072cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53400793123be7f8846d77b56748e48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9abcb1aa4ccb5d467cb0175ca3011bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e7d6d62033f777323f252b1d52645d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-338f6b52974bc08baebc662da42c4477</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 112}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 568}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPORT ON THE EXAMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The report on the examination is a document prepared after conducting a medical check-up, detailing findings related to the injury of the employee. It must be sent to the employer at their expense."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-be12459eb42b5303144e2a38dc8cf0c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 112}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 568}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These professionals provide the necessary out-patient medical services as part of a recognized scheme of medical treatment for employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"These refer to healthcare professionals that can provide treatment and are mentioned in the text but not as an organization with a specific name."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4af496fc2b1c26e3d6bca76a4b99c25f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 179}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 718}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TREATMENT BY REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Treatment provided by healthcare professionals is a product of their services in the context of this text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 179}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 718}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INJURY AND RESULTING INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
