<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S DEATH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee's death refers to a tragic event where an employee passes away due to circumstances related to their failure to undergo necessary medical examinations or treatment as required by law, leading to no compensation being payable in such cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event of an employee's death triggers certain financial transactions and entitlements related to employer-funded benefits and long service payments."</data>
