<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A certificate is a document that can be issued in ignorance of the true nature or extent of injury, which may lead to applications for orders from the Court."&lt;SEP&gt;"Certificate is a document that can be issued by or on behalf of registrars and contains specific facts related to tribunal awards or court decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The certificate is an official document issued under specific subsections, used for recording and proving matters related to compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The certificate is an official document that needs to be presented in court, containing details about payments related to judgments or legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bdac67e9c03ff3905f24c9ae12c304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2792d26b948960fecf0ee999232dc4</data>
