</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 16A(10)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 16A(10)(a) is a legal provision that specifies the surcharge percentage and amount for non-compliance within the initial payment period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 16A(10)(a) is part of the Sixth Schedule that specifies additional compensation amounts in terms of monetary values or percentages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-463028737c14d4a1b81570efedfe747c</data>
