<node id="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Application refers to a formal request made by an employee and supported by a tripartite agreement, which must be submitted within specific timeframes or during permissible extensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Application refers to the process of requesting decisions on legal questions or challenging arbitration awards based on misconduct."&lt;SEP&gt;"An application refers to a formal request made within 6 months after the date of issue of the certificate, seeking an order as deemed just by the circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-76cb33f1b7685e188783adaf8e60f8f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2792d26b948960fecf0ee999232dc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9b2c9282e23c05c84bef3cbc6edb690</data>
