<node id="&quot;SECTION 16CA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 16CA is part of the legal framework under which agreements are made, possibly related to employment compensation schemes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-691e0bbfff602acd26ed9f7e9579a105</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
