</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYERS' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) COMMITTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employers' Compensation (Special Assessment) Committee is a committee formed for specific compensation evaluations, consisting of appointed members including an occupational health advisor doctor, senior labor affairs officer, and a labor affairs officer as per the Commissioner's decision."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 623}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH ADVISOR DOCTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Occupational Health Advisor Doctor is a member of the Employers' Compensation (Special Assessment) Committee, providing expert advice on health-related matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 623}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SENIOR LABOR AFFAIRS OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Senior Labor Affairs Officer is a member of both Ordinary and Special Assessment Committees responsible for labor affairs management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 623}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LABOR AFFAIRS OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Labor Affairs Officer, appointed according to the provisions in 16D(2), serves as a member of the Special Assessment Committee alongside other designated members."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 623}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHAIRMAN OF THE SPECIAL ASSESSMENT COMMITTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Chairman is an appointed member who leads meetings and decision-making processes within the Special Assessment Committee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 619}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These boards are responsible for assessing claims related to permanent loss of earning capacity due to injury, following the appointment by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 620}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH CONSULTANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This role refers to a member of the Special Assessment Board, possibly providing expert advice on health matters related to work injuries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 620}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SENIOR OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A senior officer in occupational health who can be part of the Special Assessment Board, contributing expertise and oversight."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Senior Occupational Health Officer is a role within the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board, responsible for occupational health aspects related to prosthetics and surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 742}]</data>
