<node id="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Occupational Health Officer is a role involved in the health and safety of employees, though not directly mentioned in this text, it's implied as part of labor-related roles."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Occupational Health Officer supports the board in assessing the health impacts of prosthetic devices or surgical appliances on workers."&lt;SEP&gt;"An officer involved in occupational health matters that could contribute to decision-making within a Special Assessment Board."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
