</node>
<node id="&quot;SENIOR LABOUR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Senior Labour Officer is a higher-level position within labour management or administration, overseeing other officers like Labour Officers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A senior official from the labour department who is part of the Special Assessment Board, providing necessary expertise and oversight."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 620}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Claim for Compensation is a formal request by an employee seeking financial compensation due to injury or loss of earning capacity."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Claim for Compensation refers to requests or applications made by individuals seeking financial compensation according to legal provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Claim for Compensation refers to the application made by an employee to the court for compensation after suffering injury or death related to work."&lt;SEP&gt;"Claim for compensation refers to the formal request made by the employee or his family to recover compensation from liable employers based on an occupational disease."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 197}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 733}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSESSMENT PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Assessment Procedure includes specific steps and methods for evaluating claims as determined by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 619}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;[FROM &quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;]">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The role of Secretary (Commissioner) is to oversee assessment boards and handle appeals according to relevant sections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Certificate of Assessment, issued in a specified form by the appropriate board, details the results of an evaluation process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 619}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1156}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REVIEW OF ASSESSMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event involves reviewing assessments made by assessment boards under sections 16D(5), 16E(8) or (9)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
