<node id="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dispute Resolution Process encompasses all steps involved in resolving conflicts through arbitration, including the application for preliminary or interim measures as part of managing disputes before final decisions are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dispute Resolution Process is the overall mechanism through which disputes are handled from initial applications for emergency relief to final arbitration decisions by tribunals following established rules and procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dispute Resolution Process is a broader term encompassing all methods and procedures used to resolve disputes between parties, including but not limited to arbitration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The overall process described involves dispute resolution mechanisms between employers and employees regarding assessments of claims for compensation."</data>
