<node id="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Fine at Level 5 is a monetary penalty defined by legal standards, with specifics not provided in this text but typically associated with moderate offenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fine at level 5 is a monetary penalty for an employer's second or subsequent conviction, as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fine at level 5 is a type of penalty that may be imposed on individuals who violate conditions or limitations set forth in an order."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fine at level 5 is mentioned as one of the punishments for certain offences, indicating a specific monetary penalty scale within the legal framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fine at Level 5 is another tier of financial penalties, higher than Level 3, indicating more severe violations in the context of employment law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fine at level 5 is a legal penalty imposed on employers who violate regulations regarding employee attendance and leave of absence without reasonable excuse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fine at level 5 is another tier of financial penalties for providing false or misleading information, indicating varying degrees of compliance and enforcement within the regulatory framework."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-82a3bfa1b02f074277b3b1a27f3afcb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a153c57e6b577c1b46cd329273673a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d94d21b562915559fff6272dbbdb3b70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab861803e98b52f9a42ed6d058e8b49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
