  <data key="d1">"Another reference to the same amendment that sets out conditions for when and how Court reviews regarding periodical payments after an accident are conducted based on changes in employee work capacity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORK CAPACITY OF EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES, MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Work Capacity of an Employee is a key factor considered by the Court during reviews to determine whether their periodical payment should be continued, increased, diminished, converted into a lump sum, or ended. It involves assessing how accidents have affected their ability to work."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 140}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 624}]</data>
</node>
