</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT,PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compensation Claims are events or situations where individuals seek financial recompense for damages or losses, which can be heard by the District Court according to the described legal framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Compensation claims involve the recovery of sums for damages or losses as determined by the District Court based on civil actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-99200b663e8bce393d63651cd3a038bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 142}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 625}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 336)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The District Court Ordinance is a piece of legislation that grants powers and jurisdictions to the District Court, as referenced in the text for handling compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-99200b663e8bce393d63651cd3a038bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 142}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 625}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OF APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Court of Appeal has the authority to decide questions of law submitted by the District Court or hear appeals from its decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Court of Appeal is an appellate court that hears appeals from lower courts and has the authority to grant leave for certain appeals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Court of Appeal is an institution where cases are referred by the Appeal Board, particularly for questions of law that need determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Court of Appeal is mentioned as requiring leave for any appeal from its decision under this section."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Court of Appeal is mentioned as requiring leave for appeals, indicating its role in the legal process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-698354d68541c6722cada50bb05de978&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f62200ffc7f6236194042490c461241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9174a61c7bf0b325fa1fb34e7b741c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60c17dd78d73fb0b81ce0ba9e3153396</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 237}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 883}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 336)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a reference to the District Court Ordinance, which provides qualifications for appointment as a District Judge."&lt;SEP&gt;"This ordinance provides rules and practices for civil actions in the District Court and specifies how judgments and orders are enforced."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to a legal document or ordinance that qualifies persons for appointment as District Judges in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65da5be1610c7210df4b6d277a43ffa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
