<node id="&quot;INTEREST ORDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Orders for interest can be made in compensation cases to cover the period between an accident and a court order, at rates deemed appropriate by the court."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 142}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 626}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPEALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The text mentions that appeals against any command of the District Court may be brought before the Court of Appeal unless specifically prohibited or restricted."</data>
