</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSECTION (1) PROCEEDINGS FOR DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proceedings for damages under subsection (1) are legal actions initiated by employees against employers or third parties to recover compensation for injuries or losses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f8e345be219d3fc366dc62469796daf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;">
