</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 36D&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36D outlines the procedures and requirements for making claims under Section 36B, including written requests from the Director to employers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 36D outlines the process and requirements for making a claim for the cost of supplying and fitting any prosthesis or surgical appliance, including serving a request in writing to the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-786468d759a9a7b3ea39a79ba530682c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e2e52d53aa59764f7b51002074a7ec</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 370}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1064}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 36E&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36E details the actions an employer must take upon receiving a payment request under section 36D, including paying within one month unless disputing the claim or depositing and notifying of disputes as per specific procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-786468d759a9a7b3ea39a79ba530682c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
