<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY TO PAY FOR MAINTENANCE AND REPLACEMENT COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the legal obligation of an employer to pay for maintenance and replacement costs related to prosthetic devices or surgical equipment, which can extend up to 10 years after initial fitting."</data>
