<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY TO PAY FOR REPAIR AND RENEWAL COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the legal responsibility of an employer under section 36I, which includes paying for the probable cost of normal repair and renewal of prostheses or surgical appliances during a period of 10 years after their original fitting."</data>
