<node id="&quot;LEGAL CLAIMS MANAGEMENT PROCESS UNDER SECTION 36K&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process described under section 36K for managing claims related to prosthetic/surgical appliance replacements involves multiple steps, indicating a technological or procedural system in legal claim handling."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 36D, SECTION 36E, SECTION 36F, SECTION 36G, SECTION 36H&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections are legal provisions that apply to claims related to the maintenance and repair of prostheses or surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 202}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 36I&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36I is a legal provision for claims regarding the normal repair and replacement of prostheses or surgical appliances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 36I is a legal provision that applies in certain cases, requiring the assessment of repair and renewal costs for prosthesis or surgical appliance over a period of 10 years."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 202}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 36L&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36L outlines financial provisions related to costs associated with prosthesis or surgical appliance supply, fitting, maintenance, and renewal under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT GENERAL REVENUE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Government general revenue refers to the overall government budget from which funds can be allocated for expenses as described in section 36L."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HONG KONG GOVERNMENT GENERAL REVENUE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hong Kong government general revenue is the specific budget of Hong Kong's government from which funds can be allocated for expenses related to prosthesis and surgical appliance costs under certain conditions, as described in sections 36L and 36F."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 36E(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36E(1) is a legal provision that specifies how funds are paid to the Commissioner of Labour for expenses related to prosthesis or surgical appliance supply, fitting, maintenance, and renewal under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 36F(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36F(2) is a legal provision that outlines how funds are recovered by the Commissioner of Labour for expenses related to prosthesis or surgical appliance supply, fitting, maintenance, and renewal under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 36G&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36G is a legal provision that further details the recovery process for costs associated with prosthesis or surgical appliance supply, fitting, maintenance, and renewal as per section 36F(2)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMISSIONER OF LABOUR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Commissioner of Labour is an individual responsible for overseeing the financial aspects related to prosthesis or surgical appliance costs under certain legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hospital Authority refers to a government organization that may be involved in providing and fitting prostheses or surgical appliances as per section 36B, though it is not explicitly mentioned by name."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Hospital Authority manages public hospitals in Hong Kong, providing healthcare services to the population."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a31b81a1625e550531d4c12b4182702</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GENERAL REVENUE OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"General Revenue of Hong Kong is a fund managed by the government, used to cover costs such as those associated with prosthesis or surgical appliance repairs for injured employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e69f47e10b2e6f7fc8c8517ea228736e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 827}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURANCE COMPANY/INSURER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Insurance Company/Insurer refers to the financial institution responsible for insurance claims and payments related to accidents involving employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e69f47e10b2e6f7fc8c8517ea228736e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 40}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 368}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IV部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IV部 refers to a specific part or section within the legal framework governing insurance and employment in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"IV部指的是条例的一个部分，但没有具体说明其地理位置或物理位置。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e69f47e10b2e6f7fc8c8517ea228736e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTOR (1993年第66號第6條增補) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Director, as mentioned under 1993 amendments, is responsible for initiating legal proceedings against insurers when certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e69f47e10b2e6f7fc8c8517ea228736e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER (1993年第66號第6條增補) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Employer, in the context of 1993 amendments, may be unable to be located or insolvent, leading to legal actions by the Director against insurers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e69f47e10b2e6f7fc8c8517ea228736e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An insurer is a legal entity that issues policies of insurance and may be required by the Chief Executive in Council to provide advance notices of any proposed increase in premiums."&lt;SEP&gt;"An insurer provides insurance coverage for liabilities of employers and others as mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insurer is a person or organization required by regulation to notify authorities before increasing premiums on policies issued under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insurer is an entity responsible for paying out claims under insurance policies, especially those related to work-related injuries as per legal obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insurer is an organization that provides insurance coverage, involved in paying out compensation under policies and potentially being added as a party to legal proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insurer refers to an entity that provides insurance policies and may disclaim liability under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insurer refers to an organization that provides insurance and may be required to pay claims according to specific circumstances mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insurer refers to the company that provides the insurance policies, but no specific organization name is mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insurer refers to the entity that issues insurance policies, specifically related to employment and liability coverage for employers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Insurer refers to an organization that issues insurance policies and is responsible for paying out claims under those policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity responsible for paying out claims under the policy of insurance, as mentioned in the text but not explicitly named."&lt;SEP&gt;"The insurer is a company or entity that issues insurance policies as per legislative mandates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The insurer is responsible for paying sums due under an insurance policy, including interest and costs, when certain conditions are met regarding the payment of compensation or damages to employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ede1afd089da6234965403cda2d41666&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df740cc032fb332ff71c24c0e55c9c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8565a0dde3a6e724288267c5d06fe0dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa06844e99812b2f5f3eb2b64f82eb38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab8247f4347839df18b680f569571c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740adc792b975b3e69e6b1a7c25c776a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a384314fa98b789ae4d76d79c9eae831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f50ffa55ee49cc2d1e6b1641b82f27dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca74ec0b128bebdd8deb74d88fe33613</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 113}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 574}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;36LA. DIRECTOR MAY PROCEED AGAINST INSURER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to an action that can be taken by the Director directly against the insurer under specific conditions outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8df740cc032fb332ff71c24c0e55c9c5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;36M. 義製人體器官及外科器具委員會&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The committee is a formal organization established by the Secretary, consisting of registered doctors or dentists and an occupational health doctor as described in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8df740cc032fb332ff71c24c0e55c9c5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSTHETIC ORGAN OR SURGICAL DEVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prosthetic organ or surgical device refers to artificial body parts or medical instruments that may be fitted due to injury, requiring assessment of costs for supply, fitting, and normal repair/replacement over a 10-year period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eea091e3d60115d9c86a868057c8f1d6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 371}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1070}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSTHESES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prostheses refer to artificial body parts that replace missing organs, such as limbs or other body structures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 742}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Surgical Appliances are medical devices used during surgical procedures and may include tools, instruments, or implants."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INJURED EMPLOYEE(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Injured Employees are individuals who may require prostheses or surgical appliances and whose injuries are assessed by the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 202}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSTHESIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A prosthesis is a medical device required for an injured employee, which can be fitted to replace missing body parts or assist in recovery."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 743}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Occupational Health Officer or any other related personnel are part of the board responsible for assessing prostheses and surgical appliances needed for injured employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 202}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A registered medical practitioner is a member of the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board who can provide professional opinions on necessary prostheses or surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 743}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A registered Chinese medicine practitioner is another type of healthcare provider involved in assessing the necessity of medical devices for injured employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 743}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A registered dentist can also be a member of the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board to provide professional opinions on necessary prostheses or surgical appliances related to dental care."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 742}]</data>
</node>
