</node>
<node id="&quot;DURABILITY OF THE PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Durability refers to the longevity and reliability of a prosthetic device over time, which is an important factor in its evaluation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
