  <data key="d0">"TIME PERIOD"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase specifies the duration for assessing replacement needs and costs of prosthesis or surgical appliances from the initial fitting date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
