</node>
<node id="&quot;36M条的施行而出席&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase indicates a specific event or action of employees attending for the implementation of section 36M, which involves receiving notifications to attend for assessment or inquiry."</data>
