<node id="&quot;委員會&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Commission refers to a governing body that has adopted this definition of 'Arbitration Agreement' at its 2006 thirty-ninth session."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commission refers to a governing body that has the authority to adopt legal definitions and agreements. It highlights the formal process through which these important legal documents are established."&lt;SEP&gt;"The committee refers to an organizational body that can issue notices and conduct assessments as per legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
