  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;24 OR 31条&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to specific sections in a legal document that have different provisions regarding claims related to the supply of prosthetic devices and their maintenance under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 24&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 24 is another reference to an event, likely related to authorizing certain actions or functions that Section 25 builds upon."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 24 is part of the legal framework governing employee rights, specifically concerning the entitlements of injured employees as mentioned in section 36O."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 24 specifies the time period within which a Claimant may initiate other Adjudication Proceedings after withdrawing from existing ones."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e43310bb8a059a1a014c1ba9a611877f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 224}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 804}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1185}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 31&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31 also plays a role in defining the scope and application of claims related to prosthetic devices under different conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 31 refers to a specific provision within legislation, detailing certain requirements or prohibitions for employers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cbf72b50ae34f7ab9f1b18ab52fd7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 407}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1107}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;24条员工权利&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rights mentioned in section 24 pertain to employee entitlements, particularly those of injured employees, which are relevant when considering claims for medical supplies and services as stated in sections 36B and 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;36B条文适用范围&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36B defines the scope of application for providing prosthetic devices to injured employees, which is crucial in understanding how claims are processed and managed as per sections 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;36I条文适用范围&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36I outlines the provisions for normal repair and replacement of prosthetic devices, which are integral to understanding the maintenance procedures as required by sections 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第24或31条的适用范围&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These clauses specify how different provisions apply in various scenarios, particularly concerning claims for medical supplies and services as detailed under sections 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第24条员工权利适用范围&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The scope of application mentioned in section 24 regarding employee rights, especially for injured employees, is significant when considering the claims and entitlements as outlined under sections 36B, 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第36N条文适用范围&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36N defines the steps that must be taken by the Director to ensure the supply and maintenance of prosthetic devices, which are critical in understanding how these provisions interact with sections 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第36O条文适用范围&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 36O specifies the application of certain clauses, particularly in relation to claims for medical supplies and services as detailed under sections 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第36B条文适用范围和第36N条文适用范围的结合&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The combined application of section 36B and section 36N highlights the comprehensive framework for managing claims related to medical supplies, maintenance, and services as outlined under sections 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第24条和31条的结合适用范围&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The combined application of section 24 and section 31 provides a broader context for understanding the overall framework governing employee rights, particularly in relation to claims as detailed under sections 16I(2), (3), (4), (5) &amp; (6)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;署长采取的步骤&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The steps taken by the Director are described as necessary measures for ensuring the supply and maintenance of prosthetic devices, which is a technological aspect in managing medical supplies and services."</data>
