  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A company has the meaning given by section 2(1) of the Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622)."&lt;SEP&gt;"A company is a legal entity that can have related persons such as directors, managers, secretaries, or other similar officers according to section 3 of 2018 s. 3."&lt;SEP&gt;"Company refers to a business entity as defined by the Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), which is central in determining employment relationships and associated companies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Company refers to an entity established under The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622) in Hong Kong."</data>
