<node id="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Domestic Premises refer to premises occupied as private residence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic Premises refers to residential areas where activities such as playing music or operating loudspeakers can cause annoyance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic premises are defined as any premises used exclusively for residential purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic premises are private residences, which are excluded from certain noise-related regulations under this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic premises are private residential properties where construction work can be performed without a permit under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic premises refer to private dwellings occupied as residences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic premises refer to private residences or dwellings where search warrants can only be issued by a magistrate based on reasonable grounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic premises refer to private residences where the authorized officer may enter with a warrant issued by a magistrate if there is reason to believe that an offense has been committed or evidence exists."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic premises refer to private residential areas where noise regulations are applicable."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domestic premises refers to private residences and is excluded from the scope of inspections as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are private residences where noise regulations apply."&lt;SEP&gt;"住用处所是指用于住宅用途或主要为住宅用途的任何场所。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2a533c6d1827b9ef6feae269cab454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7d7ad99b2b6121e30cb678dc647a4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce50382ff024b176dc7ebf19fb5b68d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7249fad978915b4915d01ecac03019f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 293}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 980}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A holding company that insures its subsidiaries and may be liable for employee compensation if certain conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"A holding company that insures its subsidiaries under a policy according to section 40(1C), and bears legal responsibility for compensation in certain cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Holding company has the meaning given by section 13 of the Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), specifically for that Ordinance's purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2fbd733817e8b83d49f91e4a4cbe908&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
