</node>
<node id="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE ISSUED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A policy of insurance is a product issued to insure or purport to insure an employer against his liability, as defined in section 8 of the Insurance Ordinance (Cap. 41)."&lt;SEP&gt;"This product is a type of insurance document designed specifically under certain regulations or parts, limiting the insurer's liability within its coverage amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10132a194a7ccd2dae34efb474098db1</data>
