<node id="&quot;STATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A State refers to an entity that may adopt or adapt the conditions set forth by the UNCITRAL Model Law, potentially with fewer circumstances under which enforcement may be refused."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the jurisdiction within which a competent court operates and provides assistance in taking evidence."&lt;SEP&gt;"The State is an organization mentioned in the text where certain employments are exempted from specific parts of a regulation or policy."</data>
