<node id="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A governing body responsible for making regulations under certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chief Executive in Council refers to a person who has the authority to exempt employment from certain regulations through gazette notices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Executive in Council is an organization responsible for making regulations regarding various procedures related to employment agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Executive in Council is an organization that can make regulations requiring insurers to give notice for premium increases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Executive in Council is an organization that can publish orders to exempt areas, places, premises or activities from the provisions of a certain ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Executive in Council refers to the body that can make regulations regarding insurance premium increases, as mentioned in section 45D(1)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ede1afd089da6234965403cda2d41666&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f93037749b5c82c21a4dffe24495861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa06844e99812b2f5f3eb2b64f82eb38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32c74af47d4bd7932dd3de0fb1f8ae1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a153c57e6b577c1b46cd329273673a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b820d3fdcb65775124275159131a823e</data>
