<node id="&quot;COMPANY GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Company Group includes multiple companies within an organization, all of which may be covered by a single insurance policy to ensure compliance with legal requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A company group refers to a corporate entity consisting of multiple companies, corporations, or entities that can collectively take out an insurance policy covering their respective legal liabilities as per regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Company group is an organization consisting of multiple companies, including parent and subsidiary firms that operate under common ownership or control."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdcb847cbe822aecbab442ce9430887f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740adc792b975b3e69e6b1a7c25c776a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6157228e3518a3c9dd66f98867aa8a6e</data>
