  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Employer's Crime occurs when the employer fails to comply with regulations regarding employee liability insurance, leading to criminal charges and penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employers who fail to pay on time according to court orders are considered criminals under certain conditions."</data>
