<node id="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A policy of insurance is a document issued by an employer, which needs to be produced for inspection as per the notice from the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Policy of insurance is a product issued by insurers for employers, principal contractors, and groups of companies to cover their respective liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Policy of insurance is an insurance contract issued by insurers for employers, covering certain risks and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Policy of insurance is an insurance document that provides coverage to the insured party under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-740adc792b975b3e69e6b1a7c25c776a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfb4e2ef783a3573d88736c7ce485115</data>
