  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Accidents as defined here include both single incidents and series of accidents arising from one event, impacting how liability is assessed under insurance policies according to the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Accidents or series of accidents arising out of one event are defined as incidents covered by insurance policies according to the text."</data>
