<node id="&quot;PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Premises include any conveyances and public places, including parts thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refer to any place where an intruder alarm system may be installed, including buildings, structures, or areas under control."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refer to any property or place where an occupational safety officer may be required to enter for inspection purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refer to any property or place where occupational safety officers may conduct their duties according to the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refer to specific physical locations that may or may not be under the control of the employee’s employer, requiring safety and health measures according to regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refer to the physical location of a workplace and are subject to inspection by the Commissioner for safety risks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refer to the physical locations where employees work and notices need to be displayed, but no specific location is mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refer to the physical locations where workplaces are situated, which can be subject to inspections and enforcement actions by authorities such as the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refer to the places where work is conducted or where potential workplace contraventions may occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refers to any physical space where work activities take place, which can be under the control of either an employer or another entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Premises refers to any vehicle or public place including parts of specific premises such as Hong Kong's territorial sea or airspace."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the place at which a notice is left, as mentioned in section 43L(2), indicating the location of service."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46d0d7db59a8dee1e09d7d4424293375&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bca658a6c295daa0f1b015fffbbdfb79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c1ae5b0a8aff1b3116e95deba9e3ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5cb02beaa944fb9a1df344fab4d2a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d2094275e74c7538edf07aca95a54a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a215b7541a9d5eb966c5aa9ffed5374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92398049cd93d8f432b90b9d7cf63d15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3282c20ec28d4bb14aec7fe4e4eafbe8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbb962605c6a7e5085bf69519da702fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93a1fe97f228ec755ced3c31d6506c86</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 143}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 628}]</data>
