  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fifth-level fine similarly denotes another tier of financial penalties in the legal context described, with a higher level than third-level fines as indicated by its designation."&lt;SEP&gt;"第5级罚款 refers to a specific level of fine prescribed by law for certain offenses, indicating the severity of punishment."&lt;SEP&gt;"第5级罚款是指根据相关法律规定的，雇主要承担的最高级别的罚款额度。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47f5ddfc5b519fcf524c4d9bd233c4e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a3ec4e0b16148270927aaef6bc6cb14</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 649}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHINESE LANGUAGES&quot;">
