</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEES INSURED UNDER THE POLICY AT THE TIME OF ISSUE THEREOF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase refers to individuals who are covered by an insurance policy when it is issued, indicating their employment status as of that date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMOUNT OF THE LIABILITY INSURED UNDER THE POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amount of liability represents a numerical value associated with the coverage provided by an insurance policy for specific risks or liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOMESTIC SERVANTS EMPLOYED IN, OR IN CONNECTION WITH, THE PRIVATE HOUSEHOLD OF THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes employees who work within or related to the personal residence of their employer, often subject to special insurance policies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE REFERRED TO IN SECTION 30B WHOSE WORK IS PERFORMED OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to workers performing tasks beyond the geographical boundaries of Hong Kong and are covered under specific sections or regulations related to employment and insurance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 429}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAWFUL RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lawful responsibility refers to obligations under law, particularly in relation to insurance policies issued by insurers for employers' liability towards their employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
