</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURANCE SINGLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Insurance single is a document that provides coverage details and terms of an insurance policy, specifically related to employment and legal responsibilities."</data>
