<node id="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A fine at level 3 is a monetary penalty for an employer's first conviction, as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fine at level 3 is a monetary penalty specified within the regulations as part of the punishment for certain offences under this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fine at level 3 is a monetary penalty specified within the regulations as part of the punishment for certain offences."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fine at level 3 is another monetary penalty associated with certain offenses under the legal provisions mentioned, specifically regarding interest on late payments of wages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fine at Level 3 is a monetary penalty imposed by the court for an offence as defined in the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fine at Level 3 refers to a monetary penalty of a specific amount as determined by legal standards and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fine at level 3 refers to a monetary penalty imposed on employers who fail to comply with insurance regulations as specified in legal provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the penalty imposed, which is a fine set at level 3 according to local law enforcement guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a3bfa1b02f074277b3b1a27f3afcb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d94d21b562915559fff6272dbbdb3b70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 165}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 685}]</data>
</node>
