  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第30B条所指雇员&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employees referred to in section 30B perform work outside Hong Kong and are covered under specific sections or regulations related to employment and insurance policies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
