  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase indicates that insurers have legal obligations regarding the amount of liability they must cover for employers in certain legal procedures as defined by specific sections or regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;不合理的借口&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unreasonable excuse is a concept used to determine whether an employer's failure to comply with insurance regulations constitutes a valid reason, indicating the importance of adherence and accuracy in reporting information related to employment and insurance policies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;提供任何虚假或误导性信息的雇主&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employers who provide false or misleading information are organizations that fail to accurately report details required by law for insurance purposes, subjecting them to legal penalties as outlined in specific sections of the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot; (REPEATED)">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fine at level 5 is another tier of financial penalties for providing false or misleading information, indicating varying degrees of compliance and enforcement within the regulatory framework."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法律程序中保险人就雇主的法律责任所涉款额不得超过为施行本部而发出的保险单可得承保金额&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase indicates that insurers' liability for an employer's legal responsibilities cannot exceed the coverage limits specified in insurance policies issued to implement specific parts of the law, ensuring a clear and defined scope of responsibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURER'S LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The concept refers to an obligation of insurers in legal proceedings related to employers' liabilities, constrained by the coverage limits specified in relevant policies."</data>
