  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections are legal provisions that trigger the application of insurers' liabilities in specific circumstances related to employers' responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10132a194a7ccd2dae34efb474098db1</data>
