<node id="&quot;COURT OR TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Court or Tribunal is a place where legal procedures for claims of compensation or damages are initiated, and insurance companies can join as parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Court or tribunal is a legal body that can make determinations regarding compensation and damages in disputes related to insurance policies and workplace injuries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Court or tribunal refers to judicial authorities where further communication may be made for legal proceedings related to arbitration awards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ff7a7ad14c10761bcb15431ef57d8f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a384314fa98b789ae4d76d79c9eae831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4158bcd358cce62e9937de8896e1ba0b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 113}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 573}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURANCE COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Insurance Company refers to the entity that issues policies and may be involved in legal proceedings related to compensation or damages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insurance company is a type of organization mentioned as one of the parties with whom data can be disclosed for reasonable commercial purposes, such as seeking legal advice or enforcing decisions related to adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ff7a7ad14c10761bcb15431ef57d8f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 113}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 573}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT/TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION,EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A court or tribunal can determine or adjudge compensation or damages payable to an employee in cases where such payments need to be made according to legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3ab8247f4347839df18b680f569571c3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 113}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 574}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON INSURED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION/PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Person Insured refers to either an organization or individual that is covered by an insurance policy and may be liable for claims made by employees or others."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f50ffa55ee49cc2d1e6b1641b82f27dc</data>
