<node id="&quot;LEVEL 6 FINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Level 6 fine indicates a monetary penalty for employers who contravene certain provisions related to employee termination and incapacity under the Ordinance, with 'level' likely referring to a scale of fines."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Level 6 fine refers to a specific monetary penalty that can be imposed as part of the legal consequences for non-compliance with noise abatement notices or related offenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Level 6 Fine is a legal penalty described in the text for certain offenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Level 6 fine refers to a specific monetary penalty level as defined by the regulatory framework, corresponding to first-time offenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to a specific monetary penalty level set by legal authority for first-time offenses related to non-compliance with product standards during warranty periods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7788fe09e12252d0bb714e4f775b4322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77530b0513e9222b2220609d22541c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 294}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 984}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legislative Council是指一个立法机构，可以审议和通过决议修改技术备忘录。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is a body that can pass resolutions to amend Technical Memoranda regarding noise regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is a body that must approve regulations made by the Chief Executive before they can take effect, according to section 1 of the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is an entity that can revise compensation amounts and other specified items through resolutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is an organization responsible for passing resolutions and publishing them in the Gazette. It plays a key role in amending technical memoranda."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is an organization that can amend references to monetary amounts in specific sections through resolutions published in the Gazette."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is an organization that has the authority to revise compensation amounts or other aspects of the Ordinance through resolutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is an organization that has the power to amend certain provisions of law through resolutions published in the Gazette, particularly concerning severance payments and long service payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is an organization with the power to amend schedules and control exemption clauses according to the provided text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is mentioned as needing to approve certain regulations, indicating its role in legislative processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council is responsible for approving regulations made by the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council refers to the body responsible for certain legislative functions in an administrative region, such as approving technical memoranda after a decision-making process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-553752aa230afc1ddedc93862b70955f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7788fe09e12252d0bb714e4f775b4322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66c75321ad1bdf83283c50d27bc8b7e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379c4ce8ea1b640a4bc34adf7620d112&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cd54f63250a5891c0ad271003ffd081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b75037d48822c36000fbac9c3ce438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ab9313c7b307d3d1ed4c3e3eadfe7ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bc7b3a739542b0651749e63bbf9e5d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e7556ee34515464c79e90674823db90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa88f4f6c68bdcdf602f197a3d1b3c60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 298}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 985}]</data>
</node>
