<node id="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This Ordinance is a legal document that defines the terms and conditions for contracts or agreements, particularly in relation to their validity and interpretation."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Ordinance is a legal document that outlines the principles and provisions for arbitration in disputes, emphasizing fairness and speed without unnecessary expense."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Ordinance refers to a legal document or set of rules governing certain aspects of arbitration procedures in specific circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Ordinance refers to a legal document that outlines provisions and regulations for certain actions or contraventions."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Ordinance refers to a legal document with specific provisions regarding the applicability under certain conditions in construction contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Ordinance refers to the current legal document being discussed, which makes changes to how arbitrations are conducted after its enactment."&lt;SEP&gt;"This term is used throughout the text to refer back to a specific legal document, likely containing provisions for regulations, offenses, punishments, court procedures, and appeals related to certain actions or contraventions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c8bbf5a007054d5e9238f9704d8e1b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cc8e230a5d660ff292c1740f8b1b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0e013fee151f1254a38965f636a0159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3867158c784daaa4eb73ead4db9ca6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 346}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1040}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATIONS MADE THEREUNDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulations made under this Ordinance are rules or guidelines derived from the main ordinance, providing detailed instructions on how its provisions should be implemented."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 346}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1040}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR A TERM OF 3 MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Imprisonment for a term of 3 months refers to a legal consequence where an individual may be detained in prison for three months, which is one form of punishment specified under the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 346}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1040}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINE OF $200 FOR EVERY DAY DURING WHICH THE DEFAULT CONTINUES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A fine of $200 per day indicates that if a contravention continues beyond its initial period, an additional daily penalty will be imposed until compliance is achieved under this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fine of $200 per day indicates that if a contravention continues beyond its initial period, an additional daily penalty will be imposed until compliance is achieved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 346}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1040}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Court Proceedings are mentioned as exceptions where the provisions of The Legal Practitioners Ordinance apply in relation to arbitral procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Court Proceedings refer to legal actions or processes conducted in court as regulated by the Ordinance and any associated rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Court Proceedings refer to legal actions taken in a court of law, which can be an alternative method for resolving payment disputes if not settled through other means."&lt;SEP&gt;"Court Proceedings refer to legal actions that may be initiated in conjunction with or as a result of arbitral proceedings, where disputes are resolved by judicial means if necessary."&lt;SEP&gt;"Court proceedings are legal actions taken in a court of law to resolve disputes or enforce decisions, as mentioned in relation to payment disputes arising from construction contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Court proceedings refer to administrative functions and legal actions, including applications for interim measures or orders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71987cb00c98805ab9ed06eb948af233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ab3758cb9962eb7aad59c32353f872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85b8cad9edd61a2498008aaa9412835f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6d15568c3f749767f8090588c63f24</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 250}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 916}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPEALS TO THE COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appeals to the Court are instances where parties seek a higher judicial review of decisions made at lower levels, governed by specific regulations under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 234}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 863}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RULES OF COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rules of Court are formal guidelines or procedures established for managing legal proceedings and appeals within courts as per the provisions outlined in the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rules of court are procedural guidelines established by courts to ensure fair and efficient administration of justice."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6d15568c3f749767f8090588c63f24</data>
