<node id="&quot;APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An appeal is a legal process where decisions can be challenged and reconsidered by higher authorities such as the Court of Appeal."&lt;SEP&gt;"An appeal is not allowed regarding decisions made about recusal within the specified periods as per the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appeal is an event where a decision of the arbitral tribunal can be challenged in the Court based on questions of law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appeal refers to a legal process of challenging or reviewing the decision made by a court, which may be subject to certain conditions as stated in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appeals are legal proceedings where parties seek a higher judicial review of decisions made at lower levels, as regulated by the provisions outlined in the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e17ae2e1dd0c38e2c8a34618b769e578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3906bbf7ee03793cf876d19cdfab509&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3977494e2da78f664ddb0fbbd085bf83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60c17dd78d73fb0b81ce0ba9e3153396</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 234}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 863}]</data>
</node>
