<node id="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amendments refer to changes made to existing laws, impacting how statutory holidays are observed or defined."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amendments refer to changes or modifications made to existing laws or regulations as outlined in various sections of the text, indicating ongoing updates and adjustments to the legal framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"These refer to changes made in the legislation over different years as indicated by L.N. 98 of 2003, L.N. 25 of 2018, and L.N. 209 of 2025."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
