<node id="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 'Workmen's Compensation Ordinance' is a legal document or regulation related to workers' compensation laws and its translations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Workmen's Compensation Ordinance is a legal document that provides provisions for claims, rights, obligations or liabilities related to work-related accidents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Workmen's Compensation Ordinance is the base legislation that was amended by various ordinances over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Workmen's Compensation Ordinance refers to a primary legislation providing compensation for work-related injuries or illnesses before any amendments were made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Workmen's Compensation Ordinance refers to an ordinance that provides financial assistance and medical benefits for injured workers, which is the original English name of the mentioned legal documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d1ddc182c8f11077e959dbc0ab877a19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-361bcf47bf6b781fdf79ee1bc93fdfaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52f2dcf46c7d731442f86d90c2b5ddd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1f50784d6cf63dc01f3a41116ed7b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-832a99374a792105c8856a7a8ed4e220</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 388}]</data>
</node>
