  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION,PERSON,LOCATION,EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Workmen's Compensation (Amendment) Ordinance 1980 is a legal document that amends the original Workmen's Compensation Ordinance, introducing changes and new sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Workmen's Compensation (Amendment) Ordinance 1980 is an amendment that came into effect on November 1, 1980 for sections 4, 5, 8 and 12."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Workmen's Compensation (Amendment) Ordinance 1980 is another piece of legislation with specific sections that have different commencement dates affecting claims for compensation and other rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to an amendment in the labor compensation ordinance that took effect on November 1, 1980."</data>
