<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1982&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employees' Compensation (Amendment) Ordinance 1982 refers to a specific amendment made in 1982, which is part of the broader employees' compensation ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employees' Compensation (Amendment) Ordinance 1982 is a legislative amendment that changes the application of compensation claims for pre-commencement accidents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employees' Compensation (Amendment) Ordinance 1982 is an amendment that came into effect on July 1, 1983 for the entire ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employees' Compensation (Amendment) Ordinance 1982 is another legal document that further amends the original Workmen's Compensation Ordinance, introducing additional changes and sections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d1ddc182c8f11077e959dbc0ab877a19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-361bcf47bf6b781fdf79ee1bc93fdfaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52f2dcf46c7d731442f86d90c2b5ddd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1f50784d6cf63dc01f3a41116ed7b1</data>
