  <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Interpretation and General Clauses Ordinance is a legal document that defines the meaning of terms used in other laws and provides general rules for their application, including provisions related to subsidiary legislation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interpretation and General Clauses Ordinance is a legal document that provides general rules of interpretation for other ordinances, ensuring consistent application across different laws."</data>
