<node id="&quot;INJURIES RESULTING IN BEING PERMANENTLY BEDRIDDEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These injuries lead to a state where an individual is unable to leave their bed due to permanent disability."&lt;SEP&gt;"This event involves injuries that result in permanent bedridden state and has no specific percentage but implies it should be less than total paralysis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
