<node id="&quot;PARAPLEGIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Paraplegia involves the loss of movement and sensation in the lower half of the body, typically affecting the legs and trunk."&lt;SEP&gt;"Paraplegia is a condition involving partial or complete loss of movement and sensation below the waist, with its compensation rate not specified."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
