  <data key="d2">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOSS OF ARM AT SHOULDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loss of an arm at the shoulder has a compensation rate of 75% or 80%, with 80% being preferred for the dominant hand."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loss of an arm from the shoulder joint is a severe injury resulting in permanent disability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
</node>
