<node id="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Occupational Health Regulations encompass laws and guidelines designed to protect workers from health risks in the workplace, which are enforced through mechanisms like improvement notices issued by authorities such as the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"These refer to the legal and regulatory frameworks governing occupational safety and health in relation to injuries caused by physical factors like electromagnetic radiation or ionizing particles."</data>
