</node>
<node id="&quot;农务、园艺或林务工作,或起卸或处理储存中的上述干草或其他蔬菜产品的工作,或处理蔗渣的工作&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These activities are associated with exposure risks due to moldy hay or other vegetable products stored in a workplace."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c2ba02a120b5445fb0fcfab455eea53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;布鲁氏菌属生物传播疾病&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Infection by Brucella bacteria is an occupational disease that can be contracted through contact with infected animals, their carcasses, or unprocessed products from them."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c2ba02a120b5445fb0fcfab455eea53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;结核病患者治疗或护理工作,或提供该项治疗或护理方面的附带服务;照料因身体或精神虚弱而致令需要照料的结核病患者;以研究工作者身份进行与结核病有关的研究工作;以实验室工作人员、病理学家或验&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These activities are associated with close and frequent contact with tuberculosis patients, making them susceptible to the disease."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c2ba02a120b5445fb0fcfab455eea53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;结核病源地&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Locations where there is a concentration of tuberculosis sources pose risks for occupational exposure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c2ba02a120b5445fb0fcfab455eea53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;結核病患者&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are individuals suffering from tuberculosis who may require medical care and nursing services."&lt;SEP&gt;"与结核病患者的治疗护理相关的人员可能面临职业暴露风险，需要采取防护措施以避免感染。"&lt;SEP&gt;"結核病患者是指需要接受治療或護理的個體，可能涉及研究、醫療工作及相關附帶服務。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e298de9a3d303228555899208700c934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-448a3a690b34d790fafbe2c72700661b</data>
</node>
