  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">"Acute Respiratory Syndrome is a term associated with specific occupational risks and protective measures, particularly for healthcare workers and laboratory personnel dealing with the source of this syndrome."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;甲型禽流感&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d1">"Avian Influenza A (H5N1) is an infectious disease that poses significant occupational health risks to those handling infected poultry or related materials, requiring specific protective measures and monitoring."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;严重急性呼吸系统综合症病源&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">TECHNOLOGY</data>
  <data key="d1">"Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome (SARS) pathogens are the sources of infection for healthcare workers and laboratory personnel involved in research or patient care activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;甲型禽流感病源&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"Avian Influenza A (H5N1) pathogens refer to infectious materials from infected poultry, which pose significant risks to those handling them without proper protection and protocols."&lt;SEP&gt;"甲型禽流感病源涉及处理家禽或雀鸟、未煮熟的已死家禽或雀鸟及其部分或残留物的工作，以及相关的实验室研究。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;研究工作者&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">"Research workers are individuals engaged in SARS-related research activities or providing support services for such work."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;實驗室工作人員&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">"Laboratory staff handle materials related to the source of severe acute respiratory syndrome, requiring specific protective measures and protocols."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;病理學家&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pathologists are medical professionals involved in diagnosing diseases through laboratory analysis, including handling SARS-related samples under strict safety guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;驗屍工作人員&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">"Autopsy staff perform post-mortem examinations on individuals suspected or confirmed to have died from severe acute respiratory syndrome, requiring specialized protective equipment and procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;殯殮服務工作人員&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funeral service personnel handle the remains of deceased individuals who may have had SARS, necessitating strict safety protocols during handling and disposal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;照料因身體或精神虛弱而致令需要照料的嚴重急性呼吸系統綜合症患者&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">ROLE</data>
  <data key="d1">"This role involves caring for severely ill patients with acute respiratory syndrome who are physically or mentally weak, requiring specialized care and support services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;從事處理屬甲型禽流感病源的家禦或雀鳥、未經烹煮的已死家禦或雀鳥或其部分或其殘留物、或未經處理的家禦或雀鳥產品的工作人員&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">INDUSTRY</data>
  <data key="d1">"This industry involves handling and processing infected poultry or birds, their dead bodies, parts, residues, or unprocessed products related to avian influenza A (H5N1), requiring strict health and safety measures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2004年第213號法律公告&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">"This legal announcement from 2004 provides specific regulations for handling the sources of SARS, including occupational risks and protective measures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2005年第13號法律公告&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">"This legal announcement from 2005 updates and revises the guidelines related to SARS management, particularly in healthcare settings and laboratories."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
