  <data key="d0">INDUSTRY</data>
  <data key="d1">"This occupational category involves close and frequent contact with the sources of severe acute respiratory syndrome, requiring specialized protective measures in healthcare settings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;從事處理屬甲型禽流感病源的工作人員&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">"These workers handle materials related to avian influenza A (H5N1), including infected poultry or birds and their products, necessitating strict health protocols during handling and processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;監督或監察嚴重急性呼吸系統綜合症患者&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">ROLE</data>
  <data key="d1">"This role involves supervising or monitoring patients with severe acute respiratory syndrome to ensure they receive appropriate care and follow safety guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;從事與甲型禽流感有關連的研究工作的研究工作者&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"Research workers engaged in avian influenza A (H5N1) research activities require specialized knowledge, skills, and protective measures during their work."&lt;SEP&gt;"這些人是從事甲型禽流感相關研究的科研人員。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;隔離、扣留、監督或監察嚴重急性呼吸系統綜合症患者&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d1">"These actions involve isolating or monitoring patients with severe acute respiratory syndrome to prevent the spread of infection and ensure proper care."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;從事處理屬甲型禽流感病源的家禦或雀鳥的工作人員&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">"This occupational group involves handling infected poultry, requiring strict health protocols during processing and disposal to minimize risk of transmission."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2005年第13號法律公告修訂&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">SOCIAL SCIENCES</data>
  <data key="d1">"Revisions made in 2005 to the legal announcements related to SARS management reflect updated guidelines for occupational health, safety measures, and public health protocols."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;由2004年第213號法律公告增補&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">MATHEMATICS</data>
  <data key="d1">"This addition from a 2004 legal announcement provides supplementary information on handling the sources of avian influenza A (H5N1), including specific risk factors and protective measures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d51180df5c2a5d4bf6cf07439637d0d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;緊密並經常接觸一處或多於一處甲型禽流感病源的職業&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">INDUSTRY</data>
