</node>
<node id="&quot;鉛或鉛化合物中毒&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lead or lead compound poisoning involves any occupation involving the use or processing of lead, its compounds, or substances containing lead, as well as exposure to their smoke, dust, or vapors. The penalty is 2 years; if kidney inflammation occurs, it's 4 years."&lt;SEP&gt;"This describes the event of lead poisoning or exposure to lead compounds in occupational settings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e298de9a3d303228555899208700c934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ac5b599c206250c4e25463f6b6527b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;錳或錳化合物中毒&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Manganese or manganese compound poisoning involves any occupation involving the use or processing of manganese, its compounds, or substances containing manganese, as well as exposure to their smoke, dust, or vapors. The penalty is 2 years."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06ac5b599c206250c4e25463f6b6527b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;磷或磷無機化合物中毒,或因磷有機化合物的抗膽素酯酶作用或假抗膽素酯酶作用而中毒&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Phosphorus or inorganic phosphorus compound poisoning involves any occupation involving the use of phosphorus, its compounds, or substances containing phosphorus, as well as exposure to their smoke, dust, or vapors. The penalty is 3 years."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06ac5b599c206250c4e25463f6b6527b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;砷或砷化合物中毒&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arsenic or arsenic compound poisoning involves any occupation involving the use of arsenic, its compounds, or substances containing arsenic, as well as exposure to their smoke, dust, or vapors. The penalty is 1 year."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arsenic or arsenic compound poisoning involves any occupation involving the use or handling of arsenic, arsenic compounds, or arsenic-containing substances, or exposure to such substances in smoke, dust, or vapor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0ecd9f44b5bcdd46ef57df26ba77a9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ac5b599c206250c4e25463f6b6527b</data>
</node>
