  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mercury or mercury compound poisoning involves any occupation involving the use of mercury, its compounds, or substances containing mercury, as well as exposure to their smoke, dust, or vapors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mercury or mercury compound poisoning involves any occupation involving the use or handling of mercury, mercury compounds, or mercury-containing substances, or exposure to such substances in smoke, dust, or vapor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0ecd9f44b5bcdd46ef57df26ba77a9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ac5b599c206250c4e25463f6b6527b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;腎炎&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
