  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal provisions for compensation distribution are the set of rules that govern how financial awards or payments should be allocated among eligible family members, as detailed in documents such as Cap 282 RTF (14-05-2026) and E.R. 1 of 2018."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6942b65bc123e327e9f90372813c148</data>
