  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal documents like Cap 282 RTF (14-05-2026) provide the framework for distributing financial awards among eligible family members, detailing specific rules and clauses governing different scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6942b65bc123e327e9f90372813c148</data>
