  <data key="d2">chunk-56e97ce586530c13a293f392668859be</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 299}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 991}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;蒸氣或液壓&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"蒸汽或液压用于传输能量，以产生机械动作的主要作用的机器或装置。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 222}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 799}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANNOYANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"烦扰指的是一个合理的人不会容忍的烦恼。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 293}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 980}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Construction Noise Permit is a document issued by the Authority allowing certain activities related to construction noises within specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Construction Noise Permit is a document issued by the Authority that allows for certain levels of noise during construction activities. It can be subject to conditions and may be renewed or amended under specified circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Construction Noise Permit is a document required for construction activities that may involve noise disturbances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction Noise Permit is a document required for carrying out construction work, especially during restricted hours or in designated areas, to ensure compliance with noise control laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction Noise Permits are permits issued for construction activities that involve noise, with conditions set by Technical Memoranda."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction noise permit is a document issued by the Authority that regulates noise levels during construction activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction noise permit is a regulatory tool used to control the noise levels during construction activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction noise permit is an authorization for carrying out percussive piling between 7 a.m. and 7 p.m., not on general holidays, to control noise during construction activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"建築噪音許可證是指根据第8(1)条颁发的建筑噪音许可。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c46d2bc84b41a7759d92a2cdbd5b2891&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bda701f7b69fa34380775a0f86642cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72a00cd6e89601305d8b400d5eef9c21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c80a5edef13387c70f1ddbc0ac7e4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 290}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 971}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1213}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A construction site is a place where building work is taking place, often subject to specific regulations regarding noise levels during operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A location where construction activities take place, subject to noise regulations based on issued Technical Memoranda."&lt;SEP&gt;"A location where construction work is carried out as per the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction Site is the place where construction work is carried out or needs to be carried out according to a building contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction site is a place where construction work related to payment disputes takes place, subject to inspections by the adjudicator."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction site is a specific area where building activities are taking place, subject to regulations like the construction noise permit."&lt;SEP&gt;"建築地盤指的是进行建筑工程的地方。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d879d95be32b955d798da85e699506e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622e9afcf96894f3c8695345444428d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71a89fc961d4c4ccbebf98c5fc224109</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 290}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 967}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1210}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXTRACTION FROM THE EARTH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"从地下提取任何物质。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
</node>
