  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Registered owner refers to the official record holder of a vehicle according to the Road Traffic Ordinance, Cap. 374."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECRETARY (局長)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Secretary or '局長' is an administrative position within government departments, specifically in this context referring to the Secretary for Environment and Ecology."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VEHICLE (車輛)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vehicle refers to any motor vehicle as defined by the Road Traffic Ordinance, Cap. 374, which includes various types of road vehicles used on public roads."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECRETARY FOR ENVIRONMENT AND ECOLOGY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Secretary for Environment and Ecology is a public office position responsible for the environment and ecology in a certain administrative region."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ce50382ff024b176dc7ebf19fb5b68d4</data>
