<node id="&quot;ROAD TRAFFIC ORDINANCE (CAP. 374)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LAW/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Road Traffic Ordinance (Cap. 374) is a legal document defining rules related to road traffic management and vehicle regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Road Traffic Ordinance (Cap. 374) is referenced for vehicle registration and noise emission control, indicating its relevance in traffic management and environmental protection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ce50382ff024b176dc7ebf19fb5b68d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3645bfc30781435fa7015192a9be351c</data>
