  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are individuals responsible for a domestic premise who may be held accountable if noise regulations are violated during specified hours or on holidays."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 165}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 685}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO MAKES NOISE DUE TO ACTIVITIES SUCH AS PLAYING OR OPERATING MUSICAL INSTRUMENTS, USING AMPLIFICATION DEVICES, ETC.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are individuals engaging in specific noisy activities that can be considered an offense if they cause annoyance to others at any time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 165}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 685}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MUSICAL INSTRUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Musical Instrument is an item that can be played or operated in domestic premises causing potential annoyance if not managed properly."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 293}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 981}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOUD-SPEAKER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loud-speaker is a device used for magnifying sound, which could cause disturbance when improperly utilized in public places."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 293}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 981}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADE OR BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Carrying on a trade or business involves commercial activities that can generate noise and disturb the peace if not conducted responsibly."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 293}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 981}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GAME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Engaging in games is mentioned as an activity that could be performed in domestic premises, potentially causing annoyance to others."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 293}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 981}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PASTIME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
