  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Kowloon-Canton Railway Corporation is an organization that defines the scope and operation of the North-west Railway within its ordinances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kowloon-Canton Railway Corporation is another organization specified in section 37, which has limited applicability based on practicality and legal functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Kowloon-Canton Railway Corporation manages railway services, connecting Hong Kong with mainland China."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-471ea86899263b19957a8682c15503f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a31b81a1625e550531d4c12b4182702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-309604fa3106e70bedbe6af0b9f1e7a3</data>
