</node>
<node id="&quot;輸入、製造或供應,或為供應而要約或展示&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"活动包括输入、制造、供应以及为供应目的的要约或展示产品。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;生意或業務&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"生意或业务指的是商业活动中涉及的各种行为和操作，如生产和销售等。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第27(1)條訂立的規例&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"该条例是指根据第27条第1款制定的规定，可能涉及到免除某些罪行的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;輸入或製造為施行本部而訂明的產品之後,但在供應或為供應而要約或展示該產品之前&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这一事件描述了产品从制造到供应的时间段，期间内可能不构成犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第(3)(B)(I)或(II)款的規定,或沒有按此二者的規定作出安裝或配備&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些规定指的是安装和配备产品的具体要求，违反这些规定可能导致犯罪行为不被免除。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第一次定罪&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"首次定罪是指一个人因某项罪行被判刑的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANUFACTURE, ETC. OF PRODUCTS NOT IN COMPLIANCE WITH NOISE STANDARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to an event where someone manufactures or supplies non-compliant products regarding noise emission standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5285a98388a7108ff07a189d749db20c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 433}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 14(3) NOT YET IN OPERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 14(3) is a regulation that has not yet come into effect, related to the compliance of imported and manufactured products with noise standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5285a98388a7108ff07a189d749db20c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 433}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATIONS MADE UNDER SECTION 27(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are regulations requiring certain devices or markings on products for noise emission control."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5285a98388a7108ff07a189d749db20c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 433}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Regulation is mentioned as part of the Ordinance that can be imposed on 2 or more different persons, with provisions for full compliance by any one person."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation is mentioned in relation to declaring offences and imposing sentences, indicating its role in legal frameworks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation means a regulation made under this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation means a regulation under this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulations are documents that can be made by the Chief Executive to implement or amend laws as per section 1 of the text. They may contain provisions related to savings and transitional nature."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulations are legal documents that specify how employment agencies can operate, including permitted commissions and inspection procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The regulation refers to rules and provisions set under section 27(1) that govern the fitting or equipping of products with prescribed devices or plates, as well as penalties for non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bca658a6c295daa0f1b015fffbbdfb79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-990bd24369be2bc2f9bdd440773f2e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126e18663d810ba6b83365ff30027a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fd592d376d0854e1e9f902478b9ced3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa88f4f6c68bdcdf602f197a3d1b3c60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 405}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1102}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOISE EMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Noise emission is a concept related to the measurement and regulation of sound levels from various sources, particularly in relation to environmental protection laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 405}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1103}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRODUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Product is an item that can be imported, manufactured, supplied, offered or exposed for supply and may require measurement, inspection or test as per the notice served by the Authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"Products are items that may be required by the Authority for measurement, inspection, or test as per prescribed forms and notifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The product here refers to any item that may be imported, manufactured, or supplied, which must comply with noise emission regulations as specified by prescribed plates, labels, or other markings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0c6e4486519ef84f7ca9a05c6e39c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 290}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 967}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1212}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPORTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Importing is an activity where products are brought into a jurisdiction and must adhere to the noise emission regulations set forth in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 405}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1101}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANUFACTURING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Manufacturing involves producing goods that need to comply with specific noise emission standards as outlined by prescribed markings or devices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 405}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1103}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPPLYING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Supplying refers to offering products for sale, which must also meet the requirements set out in terms of noise emissions and related labels or plates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 405}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1101}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Fine is a monetary penalty imposed for non-compliance with safety and health regulations in premises."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fine refers to monetary penalties imposed on individuals or organizations for violating regulations, such as those related to wage payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fines are monetary penalties imposed for committing offences related to non-compliance with noise emission regulations. The fines vary based on conviction and duration of the offence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a215b7541a9d5eb966c5aa9ffed5374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f949d11fd1c1d8a909fd36ccac57d6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 405}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1103}]</data>
</node>
