  <data key="d2">chunk-ed8223cf90d5d4646feb10ec51169ca9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANUFACTURE, ETC. OF PRODUCTS NOT COMPLYING WITH NOISE STANDARDS WITHIN WARRANTY PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to an event where a person commits an offense by manufacturing or supplying non-compliant products during the warranty period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECOND OR SUBSEQUENT CONVICTION FINE $200,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"For offenses committed after the first conviction, the penalty includes a fine of $200,000."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to an increased financial penalty for repeat offenses beyond the first conviction, emphasizing stricter enforcement of compliance standards over time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTINUED OFFENSE DAILY FINE $20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"In cases where the offense continues, an additional fine is imposed at a rate of $20,000 per day during the period of continued crime."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPORTATION, MANUFACTURE OR SUPPLY, OFFER OR EXPOSE FOR SUPPLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These activities refer to actions such as importing, manufacturing, supplying, offering, and exposing products for sale which are subject to legal scrutiny in terms of noise compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WARRANTY PERIOD (保證期)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The warranty period is a defined term used within the context of product guarantees, indicating the duration during which non-compliance with standards may be considered under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOISE EMISSION COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the social and regulatory aspect concerning noise emissions from products, ensuring they meet specified standards as part of quality control measures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WEAR AND TEAR BEYOND NORMAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes an event where a product has undergone more wear than usual, potentially affecting its compliance status during testing or warranty periods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MODIFICATION INCREASING NOISE EMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Modifications that increase the noise emission of products are considered in determining whether they comply with prescribed standards after certain events have occurred."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTENDED USE OF PRODUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The intended use of a product is crucial for legal and compliance purposes, as it affects how its usage impacts its classification under regulations concerning noise emissions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADE OR BUSINESS ACTIVITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to commercial operations involving the importation, manufacture, supply, offering, or exposing products for sale within a defined industry context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRESCRIBED STANDARDS FOR NOISE EMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Standards prescribed by authorities govern the permissible levels of noise emissions from products, ensuring they meet regulatory requirements and quality benchmarks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY FINE $20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A daily fine is imposed as part of the punishment structure for continued offenses beyond initial convictions, ensuring ongoing compliance and deterrence against repeated violations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFFENSE UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to an offense defined in section 15(1) which involves importing, manufacturing, supplying, offering or exposing for supply of non-compliant products during the warranty period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRESCRIBED PRODUCT FOR PART PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Products specifically designated under a part's provisions are subject to detailed regulations and compliance checks regarding noise emissions within specified periods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MODIFICATION, WEAR AND TEAR, OR MISUSE DEFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These factors can serve as legal defenses in cases where products do not meet prescribed standards due to modifications, excessive wear, or improper use after initial supply or importation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTINUED CRIME FINE STRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The structured fines for continued offenses provide a clear framework for penalties based on the duration and nature of non-compliance with product noise emission standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPORT, MANUFACTURE, SUPPLY ACTIVITIES WITHIN WARRANTY PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to specific commercial activities that are subject to legal scrutiny during the warranty period in relation to compliance with prescribed noise emission standards for products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOISE STANDARD REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulations concerning noise emissions from products ensure they meet specified levels, protecting public health and maintaining environmental quality standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIRST CONVICTION FINE AT LEVEL 6 (AMENDED E.R. 2 OF 2021)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The first-time offender's penalty has been amended to a specific monetary value as detailed in the legal document, reflecting changes in regulatory frameworks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY FINE DURING CONTINUED OFFENSE PERIOD (LEVEL 6)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A daily fine is imposed at a rate equivalent to Level 6 as part of ongoing penalties for non-compliance with noise emission regulations after initial convictions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRESUMPTION OF PRODUCT USE IN HONG KONG&quot;">
