</node>
<node id="&quot;監督可規定交出產品以作測試&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to an authority's directive for handing over products for testing, indicating regulatory oversight in quality assurance or compliance checks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-767fcab98a545fabc81b28e3a6ad1ac3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;具訂明格式的通知書&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specified format of notification document used by authorities to request product submission for inspection and testing purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-767fcab98a545fabc81b28e3a6ad1ac3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;交出或備妥通知書上指明的產品,供監督量度、檢查或測試&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes the act of providing or preparing products as requested in a notice for measurement, inspection, or testing by supervisory authorities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-767fcab98a545fabc81b28e3a6ad1ac3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;指明交出或備妥產品的地點&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This specifies the location where products should be handed over or prepared for supervision to conduct necessary tests and inspections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-767fcab98a545fabc81b28e3a6ad1ac3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEASUREMENT, INSPECTION OR TEST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Measurements, Inspections, and Tests are activities conducted by authorized officers to determine if an offense has been committed, involving various technical procedures for evidence collection."&lt;SEP&gt;"These refer to technical procedures conducted on products to ensure compliance with regulations, which can include physical examinations or evaluations of product attributes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8024a8a38a1cf4faa9e3a31112f97d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0c6e4486519ef84f7ca9a05c6e39c</data>
