</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE IN THE PRESCRIBED FORM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notices are formal communications from the Authority requiring actions such as producing or making available products for testing. These notices must be served according to specific formats and procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30c0c6e4486519ef84f7ca9a05c6e39c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 290}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 967}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1212}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person refers to any individual who owns, uses, imports, manufactures, supplies, offers or exposes for supply of a product prescribed under this Part."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person refers to an individual who has the right to challenge the award, as mentioned in section 26 or 81, and other provisions of this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-caff1791e8e9f461d58d69581c8df6cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 294}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 983}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY THE AUTHORITY IN WRITING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public officers are individuals authorized by the Authority to conduct measurements, inspections or tests on products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 294}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 982}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 25(1)(E)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 25(1)(e) is a reference within the text that likely involves affixing labels to products for identification purposes."</data>
