<node id="&quot;FINE OF $200,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A fine of $200,000 is specified for second or subsequent convictions related to non-compliance with notices served under this regulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"This specifies the maximum fine for repeated offenses in monetary terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 294}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 982}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY PRODUCT UNDER SECTION 25(1)(E)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to any product falling under the provisions of Section 25, Clause 1(e), which commits an offense if it does not comply with certain regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 160}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 673}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (5)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to any individual or entity that violates the provisions outlined in subsection 25(1)(e), which can result in fines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 398}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1088}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;$200,000 FINE ON SECOND OR SUBSEQUENT CONVICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This specifies the amount of the fine for repeat offenses, set at $200,000 according to amendments made in 1994 s. 9."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 398}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1088}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;任何人使用或促使使用為施行本部而訂明的任何產品&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to any person who uses or causes the use of a product as defined by this section, which can result in criminal charges if it does not meet noise standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;不符合噪音標準的產品的使用&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The misuse of products that do not comply with noise regulations is an event that triggers legal proceedings under this text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;任何人如身為為施行本部而訂明的任何產品的擁有人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to any person who owns a product as defined by the section and knowingly allows or permits its use, which can result in criminal charges if it does not meet noise standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;任何人管有的產品&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to any owned products that are subject to testing for compliance with noise regulations under this text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;推定該產品在緊接測試當日之前的30日內任何時間,均不符合該等規定&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is an event where the product's non-compliance status is presumed until proven otherwise within 30 days prior to testing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;任何人犯第(1)或(2)款所訂的罪行&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any person who commits a crime as defined in clauses (1) or (2), which involves the misuse of products not meeting noise standards, can face legal consequences."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;經第一次定罪,可處第6級罰款&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"First-time conviction for offenses under clause 5(a) results in a fine at level 6 as per amendment E.R. 2 of 2021."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;經第二次&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Second or subsequent convictions result in fines of $200,000 according to amendments made in 1994 s. 9."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;USE OF PRODUCTS NOT IN COMPLIANCE WITH NOISE STANDARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the use of products that do not meet specific noise emission requirements, indicating a technical violation."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the event where someone uses a product that does not meet noise emission requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO USES, OR CAUSES TO BE USED, ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART WHICH DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMISSION PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS SUBSECTION COMMITS AN OFFENCE.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a specific event where someone violates the law by using non-compliant products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO BEING THE OWNER OF ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART WHICH DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMISSION PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (1) KNOWINGLY PERMITS OR SUFFERS SUCH PRODUCT TO BE USED COMMITS AN OFFENCE.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes another event where a product's owner violates the law by allowing non-compliant products to be used."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to individuals owning non-compliant products and allowing their use, indicating potential legal liability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOR THE PURPOSES OF ANY PROCEEDINGS UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OR (2), ANY PRODUCT WHICH WHEN TESTED UNDER CONDITIONS PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS SUBSECTION DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMISSION PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (1), SHALL, UNTIL THE CONTRARY IS PROVED, BE PRESUMED TO BE A PRODUCT WHICH DID NOT COMPLY THEREWITH AT ANY TIME DURING THE PERIOD OF 30 DAYS IMMEDIATELY PRIOR TO THE DATE OF THE TEST.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event presumes that non-compliant products were used in the last 30 days before testing if no contrary proof is provided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO HAS IN HIS POSSESSION ANY PRODUCT WHICH WHEN TESTED UNDER CONDITIONS PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (3) DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMISSION PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (1) SHALL, UNTIL THE CONTRARY IS PROVED, BE PRESUMED TO HAVE USED THAT PRODUCT AT ANY TIME DURING THE PERIOD OF 30 DAYS IMMEDIATELY PRIOR TO THE DATE OF THE TEST.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event presumes possession implies use within a 30-day window before testing if no proof otherwise."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OR (2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to anyone violating the law by using or owning non-compliant products and facing legal consequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to individuals committing offenses related to the misuse of non-compliant products."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to individuals who violate regulations regarding product usage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 398}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1086}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUNISHMENT DAILY $20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to a daily fine calculation method based on crime duration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 398}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1086}]</data>
</node>
