  <data key="d1">"Directions issued in writing by the authority regarding proper usage methods for products that could reduce noise emissions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REDUCE EXCESSIVE NOISE EMISSION DURING USAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The goal of issuing directions is to minimize noise pollution when using certain products, ensuring compliance with regulations and reducing environmental impact."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTIONS OR GUIDELINES ISSUED BY THE PRODUCT MANUFACTURER&quot;">
