  <data key="d1">"Instructions provided by manufacturers for correct use of their products to comply with regulatory requirements and reduce noise emissions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;USE THE PRODUCT IN A MANNER AS DIRECTED BY THE AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to adhering to instructions given by the authority, which can prevent violations and ensure compliance with regulations regarding product usage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRODUCT MANUFACTURER'S INSTRUCTIONS FOR USE OF THEIR PRODUCTS&quot;">
