  <data key="d1">"Regulatory actions taken to control noise emissions, including issuing directions and fines for non-compliance with product use regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATIONS ON THE USE OF PRESCRIBED PRODUCTS IN REDUCING NOISE POLLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These regulations are part of broader social science efforts aimed at environmental protection through proper product usage practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
</node>
