  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advisory Council on the Environment is an organization whose membership may be determined by legal procedures and requires certification from the Chief Secretary for Administration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advisory Council on the Environment provides advice to The Secretary regarding regulations, indicating its role in environmental matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3645bfc30781435fa7015192a9be351c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
