  <data key="d2">chunk-379c4ce8ea1b640a4bc34adf7620d112</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 298}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 985}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCLOSURE OF CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION OBTAINED OFFICIALLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to the legal situation where disclosing business-related confidential information under official duties may or may not be considered a crime depending on circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-379c4ce8ea1b640a4bc34adf7620d112</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 298}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 987}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADE, BUSINESS OR PROFESSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These terms refer to industries or sectors of activity that are protected by confidentiality laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-379c4ce8ea1b640a4bc34adf7620d112</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 298}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 987}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;A PERSON WHO DISCLOSES OR GIVES TO ANOTHER PERSON ANY INFORMATION THAT CONCERNS A TRADE, BUSINESS OR PROFESSION, IS CONFIDENTIAL AND HAS COME TO HIS KNOWLEDGE OR INTO HIS POSSESSION IN THE COURSE OF THE DISCHARGE OF HIS FUNCTIONS UNDER THIS ORDINANCE COMMITS AN OFFENCE.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This entity refers to individuals who may commit an offense by disclosing confidential information obtained officially unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aae626926134b8ac6b7cded959f0e21a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 4 AND TO IMPRISONMENT FOR 6 MONTHS.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes a penalty structure where an individual is liable to a fine up to level 4 and/or imprisonment for six months for committing certain offenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aae626926134b8ac6b7cded959f0e21a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY IN-CORPORATE PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OF THE OFFENCE TO DISCLOSE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION OBTAINED OFFICIALLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This entity refers to any individual, including directors or high-level personnel, who may commit an offense by disclosing confidential official information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aae626926134b8ac6b7cded959f0e21a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1074}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTOR OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Director of the Body Corporate is a person who manages or delegates management authority for an organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Director of the Body Corporate is an individual acting with immediate authority over a body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1074}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An officer can request information from individuals, particularly those they believe are responsible for workplaces or have relevant information."&lt;SEP&gt;"An officer refers to someone with authority under the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59), who can exercise various powers such as entering premises and requiring declarations from individuals or employers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Officer refers to individuals managing or acting under immediate direction from directors within an organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Officers have the power to exercise certain duties related to industrial undertakings as defined by the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5cb675ac0cac90a784b227b042225f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b297641c5fc96a9b02649fb896184fdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-106089b31da6304da0bc926c63d44161</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 146}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 639}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Building Management Ordinance (Cap. 344) defines common parts of a building, which are relevant to the exclusion criteria in certain contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Building Management Ordinance (Cap. 344) is a Hong Kong legislation related to the registration of certain corporations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Building Management Ordinance (Cap. 344) is a piece of legislation that does not include corporations registered under it, as mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Building Management Ordinance (Cap. 344) is referenced as providing the meaning of 'common parts' within this ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Building Management Ordinance defines existing residential units and common parts of a building, impacting the applicability of the Ordinance in specific scenarios."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Building Management Ordinance is a legal document that provides regulations and definitions for construction contracts, sites, work, etc., in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f191206611c2d612e34771fce129216e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4113afe7255cfeb2800c08deeeac90a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06e739d62dd19f34a46b38a2c7902502</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 435}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLE PRECAUTIONS AND EXERCISED DUE DILIGENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reasonable Precautions and Due Diligence are concepts indicating actions taken to prevent offenses by a body corporate through establishing proper systems and ensuring their effective operation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPER SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proper System refers to the established mechanisms designed to prevent the commission of offenses, as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EFFECTIVE OPERATION OF THE SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Effective Operation of the System is a concept indicating that the systems put in place are functioning correctly and efficiently to prevent offenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCEEDINGS HAVE BEEN INSTITUTED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proceedings Have Been Instituted refers to legal actions taken, such as complaints or accusations being made against a body corporate for certain crimes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proceedings have been instituted means legal procedures have been initiated in relation to an offense under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8555cdc45377153d4e3dfbeaa45b31ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 297}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPENDIX (附表)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appendix is mentioned in the text but its specific content and details are not provided. It likely contains formats of notifications related to proceedings instituted under this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIFIED OFFENSE(S) WITH RESPECT TO A SPECIFIED PLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specified Offense(s) With Respect To A Specified Place refers to crimes that occur in or relate to a specific location as mentioned in the text, which must be part of legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 297}]</data>
</node>
