  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notification Sent To The Specified Person is an event where notifications are sent according to a format specified by the ordinance, and it triggers certain legal actions or defenses under this section."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CIRCULATION OF NOTICE IN THE GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Circulation Of Notice In The Gazette refers to the process of publishing notices related to the ordinance's application through official gazette publications as mentioned in the text."</data>
