<node id="&quot;COMPLAINTS OR INFORMATIONS LAYING TIME LIMIT AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These amendments in legislation set out specific timelines within which complaints or informations regarding offenses under this Ordinance must be made, providing legal clarity and structure to these procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 319}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1009}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENT CONSULTATION COMMITTEE COMPOSITION DETERMINATION AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These amendments provide further details on how the Chief Secretary for Administration determines who constitutes the Environment Consultation Committee, ensuring clarity and consistency in this process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 319}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1009}]</data>
