<node id="&quot;COMPLAINTS OR INFORMATIONS LAYING TIME LIMIT AMENDMENT EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are events where specific timelines for complaints or informations regarding offenses under this Ordinance have been amended, providing updated procedures and guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 319}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1008}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAGISTRATES ORDINANCE (CAP. 227)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Magistrates Ordinance, Chapter 227, provides legal framework for magistracy in Hong Kong, which is referenced regarding the time limit for complaints or informations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Magistrates Ordinance, Chapter 227, refers to a legal document that authorizes public officers to institute and conduct proceedings for offences as mentioned in this text."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a reference to the Magistrates Ordinance, which provides rules and procedures related to judicial matters in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-20f049d1d30f5c16c93c8bc30a7dab75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 316}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1004}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECRETARY FOR JUSTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Secretary for Justice holds an official position with responsibilities including prosecution functions as mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary for Justice holds the authority to propose criminal charges, independent of the provisions regarding section 43P and the Commissioner's consent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary for Justice is a government official responsible for legal affairs and justice-related matters within Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary for Justice is a person who retains powers in respect of the prosecution of criminal offences, according to the text provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary for Justice is an individual or entity responsible for monitoring and reviewing certain operations, appointing authorized bodies, and exercising specific powers under relevant sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary for Justice is an individual responsible for appointing institutions and organizations to oversee certain legal matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary for Justice is an individual who holds the position of overseeing prosecution matters according to the laws and regulations specified in the Ordinance, with powers not diminished by section 32(1) of the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary for Justice is mentioned as a person who consults with the advisory body to make rules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5247edeafb01587bde32ae379e5261dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de69b2333ff7d9bb2dd79e072a634503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ad58eafa2f8aa3ad189d3ab135c444&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3450bee90618bb17df6c3522ce7aa42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f7eb0e6c37c2ef17e35db1071f66982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20f049d1d30f5c16c93c8bc30a7dab75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb3c1a7d6211fc1cac75a7aeaaff11f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 316}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1005}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;4TH CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 4 refers to a specific provision within an ordinance or legal document that outlines certain conditions for initiating legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;5TH CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 5 is another specific provision detailing the initiation and conduct of legal procedures related to offenses against this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;6TH CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 6 provides further details on initiating legal proceedings for certain offenses as mentioned in the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;7TH CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 7 is part of a series of clauses that outline conditions under which legal procedures can be initiated and conducted without full responsibility, often involving public safety or property protection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;13TH CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 13 specifies the appointment of public officers who may initiate proceedings in certain circumstances as outlined by this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;17TH CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 17 is part of a series that provides conditions under which legal procedures can be initiated and conducted, often involving specific defenses or exemptions from full responsibility for actions taken to prevent harm or protect property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WHENEVER IS THE EARLIER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase refers to the principle in law where multiple time periods are specified; the shorter of these periods applies as per legal interpretation, often used in statutes and ordinances to set deadlines for actions such as filing complaints or initiating proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSECUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prosecution refers to legal proceedings initiated against individuals or entities accused of committing offenses under specific sections as mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The prosecution provides relevant and reliable financial information to the court for assessing the scale of operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'prosecution' here refers to a process within the legal system where an authority initiates criminal charges against someone accused of committing an offense, often involving formal procedures and documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb3c1a7d6211fc1cac75a7aeaaff11f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fabbc3eeb929a4a143a6817fd7b457aa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 316}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1006}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLAINT OR INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Complaints or information are documents or reports that initiate legal proceedings by bringing attention to offenses committed under this Ordinance; they serve as the initial step in prosecution processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
