  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These clauses refer to specific provisions within an ordinance that outline conditions under which legal procedures can be initiated and conducted without full responsibility for actions taken."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
