</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCEEDINGS FOR OFFENCES AGAINST THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proceedings for offenses refer to the formal process initiated by an authority or public officer to bring a case before a court, involving documentation and procedures as outlined in specific clauses of the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
