</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSECUTION OF OFFENCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event refers to legal proceedings for offenses against an ordinance or conspiracy to commit such offenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The prosecution of offences refers to the process by which an authority initiates criminal charges against someone accused of committing an offense, often involving formal procedures and documentation as outlined in specific clauses of this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-20f049d1d30f5c16c93c8bc30a7dab75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
