</node>
<node id="&quot;4TH CLAUSE (OF THE ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 4 is a provision within this legal document that sets out conditions for initiating certain types of legal proceedings related to offenses against it."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 316}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1004}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;5TH CLAUSE (OF THE ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 5 provides further details on how and when legal procedures can be initiated according to specific provisions outlined in the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 316}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1004}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;6TH CLAUSE (OF THE ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 6 specifies conditions under which certain types of legal proceedings related to offenses against this Ordinance may be initiated, often involving public safety or property protection as a defense."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 316}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1004}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;7TH CLAUSE (OF THE ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 7 outlines further conditions for initiating and conducting legal procedures in relation to specific offenses under this ordinance, providing defenses based on actions taken to prevent harm or protect property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 316}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1004}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;13TH CLAUSE (OF THE ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 13 sets out provisions related to the appointment of public officers who may initiate legal proceedings in certain circumstances as outlined by this ordinance, often involving formal procedures and documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 316}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1004}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;17TH CLAUSE (OF THE ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 17 provides conditions under which legal procedures can be initiated and conducted without full responsibility for actions taken to prevent harm or protect property according to specific provisions of this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
