  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions are the individual clauses that make up a legal document such as an Ordinance, each setting out conditions and procedures related to offenses against it; they often involve formal steps for initiating or conducting proceedings in court."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL DEFENSE&quot;">
