</node>
<node id="&quot;CIRCUMSTANCES PLACING THE PROPERTY IN DANGER OF BEING DAMAGED COULD NOT REASONABLY HAVE BEEN FORESEEN BY THE PERSON CHARGED WITH THE OFFENCE&quot;">
