  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Occupational Safety and Health Ordinance is an ordinance aimed at ensuring the safety and health of persons when they are at work, providing related matters, and amending other relevant ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eb7fcd5200d5f794a363f07e5ee2dc70</data>
