  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance is a product that will be amended by the Occupational Safety and Health Ordinance to improve safety measures in workplaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59) is a legal document governing the operation of factories and industrial undertakings in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ead21a291080deb8a3da710d2fd2a7fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb7fcd5200d5f794a363f07e5ee2dc70</data>
