<node id="&quot;SHORT TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT,ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 1 of the Ordinance defines its short title as 'Arbitration Ordinance'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Short title is a concise name given to the Occupational Safety and Health Ordinance for easy reference."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f6f1173170ce4ac811fedab280f3b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb7fcd5200d5f794a363f07e5ee2dc70</data>
