</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S WORKPLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An employee’s specific work location on the premises that may not be under their employer's control but requires safety measures as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKPLACE SAFETY AND HEALTH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ensuring a safe working environment for employees, including both physical conditions and actions taken by employers or occupiers of premises."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONVICTION ON INDICTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal legal process involving a jury and potentially resulting in higher fines or imprisonment for more serious offenses."</data>
