  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY/LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal documents outlining the responsibilities of employers and occupiers to ensure a safe working environment, including potential penalties for non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINES AND IMPRISONMENT FOR NON-COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT/PENALTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Penalties imposed on individuals or organizations that fail to comply with safety regulations at workplaces, ranging from fines to imprisonment based on the severity of the offense."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKPLACE SAFETY MEASURES COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY/LEGAL REQUIREMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ensuring all workplace elements are safe and without health risks as per legal requirements, including premises, access routes, plant, and substances kept on-site."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S RESPONSIBILITY FOR OTHERS' SAFETY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employees must take reasonable steps to ensure the safety of their colleagues in the workplace, considering both their own actions and those that might affect others."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COOPERATION WITH EMPLOYERS ON SAFETY MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The obligation for employees to cooperate with their employers in ensuring compliance with safety regulations at workplaces, including communication and collaboration efforts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAFETY AND HEALTH PROVISIONS UNDER THE LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal provisions that mandate both employers and occupiers of premises to ensure a safe working environment, detailing penalties for non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPIER'S RESPONSIBILITY FOR SAFETY MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION/PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The duty of an occupier to maintain the safety and health of persons employed at their premises, including ensuring that all elements are safe as per legal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ROLE IN WORKPLACE SAFETY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON/ROLE"</data>
