  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLANT SAFETY AT WORKPLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The safety standards applied to equipment or materials stored on-site, ensuring they do not pose a risk to employee health in the workplace."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKPLACE SAFETY AND HEALTH REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal documents that outline specific measures employers and occupiers must take to ensure a safe working environment for employees, including potential penalties for non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S DUTY OF CARE TOWARDS COLLEAGUES'">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal obligation of an employee to look after the safety and health of their coworkers in the workplace, considering both proactive actions and reactive responses to incidents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPIER'S ROLE IN ENSURING PREMISES ARE SAFE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION/PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The responsibility of an occupier to ensure that all aspects of a premise are safe for employees, including compliance with legal safety standards and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE-EMPLOYER COLLABORATION ON WORKPLACE SAFETY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Collaborative efforts between employers and employees in ensuring the implementation of workplace safety measures, involving both proactive actions and reactive responses to incidents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKPLACE SAFETY COMPLIANCE PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY/LEGAL REQUIREMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specific steps taken by employers and occupiers to ensure that all elements of a workplace are safe and without health risks as per legal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ROLE IN REPORTING HAZARDS OR UNSAFE CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employees have the responsibility to report any potential safety hazards or unsafe working conditions, contributing to overall workplace safety compliance efforts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPIER'S DUTY OF CARE TOWARDS EMPLOYEES'">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION/PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal obligation of an occupier to ensure that all aspects of a premise are safe for employees, including compliance with legal safety standards and regulations, and the potential consequences of non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE-EMPLOYER COMMUNICATION ON WORKPLACE SAFETY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Effective communication between employers and employees in ensuring the implementation of workplace safety measures, involving both proactive actions and reactive responses to incidents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEES AT WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employees are individuals working in a workplace and must take care of their own safety, the safety of others present, and cooperate with employers to comply with health and safety regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0a0ae0d06f82179e57847e5fde58901</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 561}]</data>
</node>
