</node>
<node id="&quot;AN EXPLOSION OR FIRE THAT—(A) CAUSES DAMAGE TO THE STRUCTURE OF ANY WORKPLACE, OR TO ANY PLANT OR SUBSTANCE AT A WORKPLACE; AND (B) PREVENTS THE CONTINUATION OF ORDINARY WORK AT THE WORKPLACE.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event describes an explosion or fire causing structural damage and disrupting normal operations in a workplace."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03b36ba11357053a39ca2249116c43d5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AN ELECTRICAL SHORT CIRCUIT OR ELECTRICAL FAILURE OF ELECTRICAL PLANT THAT—(A) IS FOLLOWED BY, OR ASSOCIATED WITH, AN EXPLOSION OR FIRE; OR (B) CAUSES STRUCTURAL DAMAGE TO THE PLANT,&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
