<node id="&quot;ELECTRICAL SHORT CIRCUIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Electrical Short Circuit refers to a situation in which the electric current flows through an unintended path, often causing damage or leading to other events like explosions or fires."</data>
