</node>
<node id="&quot;PLANT EQUIPMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Plant Equipment includes various machinery and structures used in a workplace, which may be affected by electrical failures, short circuits, explosions, or fires."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e36c4f965a7c0c6d77ad1711ac700f1</data>
