<node id="&quot;BULLDOZER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Bulldozer is a type of mobile machine used in stone quarrying, which can be involved in overturning or collisions that pose safety risks to the workplace."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e36c4f965a7c0c6d77ad1711ac700f1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DUMPER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Dumper is a type of mobile machine used for handling materials in stone quarries and poses potential safety hazards when it collides with objects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e36c4f965a7c0c6d77ad1711ac700f1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCAVATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Excavator is a type of mobile machine used in stone quarrying, which can be involved in overturning or collisions that pose safety risks to the workplace."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e36c4f965a7c0c6d77ad1711ac700f1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GRADER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Grader is a type of mobile machine used for leveling and preparing ground surfaces in stone quarries and poses potential safety hazards when it collides with objects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e36c4f965a7c0c6d77ad1711ac700f1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LORRY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lorry, also known as a truck or hauler, is a vehicle used to transport materials within the workplace and can be involved in collisions that pose safety risks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e36c4f965a7c0c6d77ad1711ac700f1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SHOVEL LOADER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Shovel Loader is a type of mobile machine used for moving earth and other substances in stone quarries and poses potential safety hazards when it collides with objects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e36c4f965a7c0c6d77ad1711ac700f1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIFTING APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lifting Appliances include cranes, hoists, and related machinery that are used to lift heavy loads within the workplace and can pose safety risks if involved in accidents or malfunctions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e36c4f965a7c0c6d77ad1711ac700f1</data>
