  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERTURNING OF OBJECT BY MACHINERY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes an event involving the overturning of objects due to collisions with various types of machinery used in quarries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIFTING APPLIANCE (起重機械)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lifting appliances include cranes, derricks, winches and hoists, which are mechanical devices used for lifting or moving heavy loads."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CRANE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A crane is a type of lifting appliance commonly used in quarries to lift and move heavy objects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DERRICK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Derrick is another type of lifting appliance, often used for hoisting materials vertically or horizontally in construction sites including quarries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WINCH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A winch is a mechanical device that winds and unwinds wire rope to lift or move heavy loads; it can be part of the machinery used in quarry operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hoists are lifting appliances designed for raising and lowering materials, often seen in industrial settings like quarries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CRANE, DERRICK, WINCH AND HOIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are specific types of lifting appliances used in quarry operations to handle heavy loads safely and efficiently."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTROMAGNETIC RADIATION OR IONIZING PARTICLES CAUSING SKIN OR SUBCUTANEOUS TISSUE INFLAMMATION, ULCERS, OR MALIGNANT DISEASES, OR BLOOD DISORDERS, OR INTERNAL CATARACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes a potential occupational disease caused by exposure to electromagnetic radiation (excluding thermal radiation) or ionizing particles."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BAROTRAUMA, INCLUDING DECOMPRESSION SICKNESS, BAR INJURIES AND BONE NECROSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Barotrauma refers to a group of conditions caused by changes in air pressure; it includes decompression sickness, bar injuries, and bone necrosis experienced by workers operating under compressed or rarefied air environments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPETITIVE MOTION-INDUCED HAND OR FOREARM CRAMPS (AMENDED—2018 NO. 2 AMENDMENT RECORD)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes an occupational disease caused by long-term repetitive actions involving the hands, such as writing or typing, which can lead to muscle spasms in the hands and forearms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HAND SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS (HAND ULCER)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hand subcutaneous cellulitis is a type of occupational disease that occurs due to severe or long-term friction or pressure on the hand from physical labor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KNEE OR SURROUNDING PART SUBJECTED TO SEVERE OR PROLONGED EXTERNAL RUBBING OR PRESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes an occupational condition where knee and surrounding areas are exposed to significant friction or pressure, often seen in physically demanding jobs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;手指、手或臂作重複動作的職業&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OCCUPATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This occupation involves repetitive finger, hand or arm movements and is associated with the risk of developing occupational injuries such as hand cellulitis (hand ulcer)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50b429f7441b76e64978fbbde04359c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;手皮下蜂窩織炎(手瘍)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hand cellulitis (hand ulcer) occurs due to severe or prolonged friction or pressure on the hands from physical labor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50b429f7441b76e64978fbbde04359c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;膝或周圍部分受嚴重或長期的外來磨擦或壓力而引起膝或周圍部分患粘液囊炎或皮下蜂窩織炎(膝瘍)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This condition, known as knee bursitis or knee ulcer (knee ulcer), is caused by severe or prolonged external friction or pressure on the knees and surrounding areas due to physical labor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50b429f7441b76e64978fbbde04359c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;因手肘或周圍部分受嚴重或長期的外來磨擦或壓力而引起手肘或周圍部分患粘液囊炎或皮下蜂窩織炎(肘瘍)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This condition, known as elbow bursitis or elbow ulcer (elbow ulcer), is caused by severe or prolonged external friction or pressure on the elbows and surrounding areas due to physical labor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50b429f7441b76e64978fbbde04359c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;炭疽&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charcoal disease occurs due to contact with infected animals or handling animal products or residues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50b429f7441b76e64978fbbde04359c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;馬鼻疽&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This condition, known as equine anthrax, is associated with the occupation involving contact with horse species or their carcasses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50b429f7441b76e64978fbbde04359c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;受鈎端螺旋體感染&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INFECTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Infections caused by hook-end spirochetes are linked to occupations where individuals work in areas disturbed by rats, mice, or other small mammals, or handle dogs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50b429f7441b76e64978fbbde04359c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;馬科動物&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"马科动物涉及接触其活体或尸体的职业。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;屠體&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"屠體是与处理和加工动物有关的活动中的产品。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;老鼠、田鼠或野鼠,或其他小哺乳類動物&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些地点涉及职业暴露，可能受到啮齿类和其他小型哺乳动物侵扰的工作环境。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;牛科動物或牛肉產品,或豬隻或豬肉產品&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些产品涉及接触动物及其制品的职业活动，如屠宰、加工等。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;農務、園藝或林務&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"农业、园艺和林业是与农作物种植、植物养护及森林管理相关的行业。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;起卸或處理貯存中的上述乾草或其他蔬菜產品;或&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些活动涉及处理储存的干草和其他蔬菜产品的工作事件，可能引起职业病。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;蔗渣&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"蔗渣是与农业和加工相关的产物，在特定工作环境中可能导致健康问题。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;布魯氏菌感染的動物;或&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"涉及接触这些动物的职业人员可能受到布鲁氏菌感染，需要特别注意防护措施。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;該等動物的屠體或該等動物部分;或&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些产品是与处理和加工受布鲁氏菌感染的动物有关的产品。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;從該等屠體或部分取得的任何未經處理的產品;或 &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"未经处理从上述动物尸体或部位获得的产品可能携带病原体，需要特别注意卫生安全。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;布魯氏菌的實驗樣本或疫苗,或含有布魯氏菌的實驗樣本或疫苗&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
