  <data key="d2">chunk-e2414cbe93dee7ecbcf55ede3d6fbe19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;煙霧&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"煙霧是指含有有害化学物质的气体悬浮颗粒，通常在职业环境中产生。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e2414cbe93dee7ecbcf55ede3d6fbe19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;蒸汽&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"蒸汽指的是含有所述化学品的气态形式，在职业环境中可能对人体造成危害。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e2414cbe93dee7ecbcf55ede3d6fbe19</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;二噁烷&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"二噁烷是一种有机化学物质，常用于工业溶剂和某些化学品中。在职业环境中可能产生蒸汽，对人体健康构成潜在风险。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf294443fd5e460668594e0ece4b6129</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASBESTOS&quot;(&lt;A&gt;, &lt;B&gt;)">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Asbestos refers to substances used or processed in certain occupations that can lead to skin cancer. It includes arsenic, tar, resin, asphalt, mineral oil (including paraffin), soot, and their compounds, products, or residues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-69c5878537fbe10530d6dfd19a7cfc82</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHROMATES&quot;(&lt;A&gt;, &lt;B&gt;)">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chromates include substances such as chromic acid or its salts of ammonium, potassium, sodium, or zinc that are used in certain occupations leading to chromic ulceration. It also includes formulations containing these substances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-69c5878537fbe10530d6dfd19a7cfc82</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;Α-NAPHTHYLAMINE&quot;(&lt;A&gt;, &lt;B&gt;)">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"α-Naphthylamine and β-naphthylamine, as well as o-dianisidine, are chemicals used in certain occupations that can lead to primary epithelial tumors of the urinary system. They include substances with at least one nitro or primary amine group or at least one nitro or primary amine group (o-toluidine), and diphenyls."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-69c5878537fbe10530d6dfd19a7cfc82</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HEXANE&quot;(&lt;A&gt;)">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hexane, in its natural state or as a component of certain formulations, is associated with the development of multiple peripheral neuropathies when used or processed in specific occupations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-69c5878537fbe10530d6dfd19a7cfc82</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;金胺&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"金胺是一种染料，与职业病的发生有关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3b4c60593ba0e33bbbbcde7cf5d76534</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;品紅&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"品红也是染料的一种，涉及某些职业环境中的健康风险。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3b4c60593ba0e33bbbbcde7cf5d76534</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;對苯二酚&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"对苯二酚是另一种化学物质，在特定的职业环境中可能引起健康问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"對苯二酚是一种化学物质，可能与职业健康相关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b4c60593ba0e33bbbbcde7cf5d76534</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;一苯甲基對苯二酚&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"一苯甲基对苯二酚是一种化学物质，涉及某些职业环境中的健康风险。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3b4c60593ba0e33bbbbcde7cf5d76534</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;塵埃、液體或蒸汽引致皮膚發炎或潰瘍(包括氯痤瘡但不包括鉻潰瘍)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"此事件描述了因暴露于特定物质引起的皮肤炎症或溃疡，可能与职业健康相关。"&lt;SEP&gt;"这种描述涉及一种职业性皮肤病，与特定的职业暴露有关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b4c60593ba0e33bbbbcde7cf5d76534</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;一苯甲基對苯二酚或對苯二酚一丁基醚&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些是对苯二酚的衍生物，可能与职业健康相关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;塵埃、液體或蒸汽引致上呼吸道或口腔的粘膜發炎或潰瘍&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"此事件描述了因暴露于特定物质引起的上呼吸道或口腔黏膜炎症或溃烂，可能与职业健康相关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;鼻腔或相關氣竇的癌症(鼻癌)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"此事件描述了一种由特定职业活动引发的职业性癌症——鼻癌。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;製造或修理木製成品的職業&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OCCUPATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这种职业涉及制造或修理木质产品，可能与鼻腔或相关气窦的癌症有关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;製造或修補全部或部分以皮革或纖維板製成的鞋類或鞋配件的職業&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OCCUPATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这种职业涉及制造或修补由皮革或纤维板制成的鞋子及其配件，可能与鼻腔或相关气窦的癌症有关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;原棉屑沉著病&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"此事件描述了一种因暴露于原棉屑引起的职业性疾病——原棉屑沉着病。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;異氰酸鹽、鉑化合物、因製造、運送或使用以鄰苯二甲酸酐、偏苯三酸酐或三乙烯四胺為主要成分的硬化劑(例如環氧樹脂硬化劑)所引起的煙霧或塵埃、因使用松脂作為助焊劑所引起的煙霧、甲醛、蛋白酶、作研究或教育用途或在實驗室使用的動物或昆蟲&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT, TECHNOLOGY, ENVIRONMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些是可能引起职业性哮喘病的物质和环境因素。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;職業性哮喘病&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"此事件描述了一种由特定化学物质引起的呼吸系统疾病——职业性哮喘病。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b3db50c2224305e179dfe2d56a0ba2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;环氧树脂硬化剂烟雾或尘埃&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the fumes or dust caused by epoxy resin hardener, a chemical product used in various industries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;松脂作为助焊剂引起的烟雾&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes smoke generated from rosin-based soldering agents, commonly used in electronics manufacturing processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;甲醛&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Formaldehyde is a chemical product that can cause respiratory issues and other health problems when inhaled."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;蛋白酶&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Protease refers to an enzyme or technology involving enzymes, which may be used for various applications including research and industrial processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;动物或昆虫用于研究或教育用途或在实验室使用&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes the use of animals or insects in educational or research settings within laboratory environments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;谷物粉尘(大麦、燕麦、黑麦、小麦或玉米的播撒、栽植、收割、干燥、处理、研磨、运输或储存，以及由这些谷物制成的面粉或粉末的运输和储存引起的尘埃)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to dust generated from the handling, processing, and storage of various grains like barley, oats, rye, wheat, or corn, as well as their derived products such as flour."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;吸入性过敏原(任何其他在工作期间吸入的物质)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes any substance that can cause allergic reactions when inhaled during work hours, highlighting the need for workplace safety measures to protect employees from respiratory irritants and allergens."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;矽肺病(SILICOSIS) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Silicosis is a lung disease caused by inhaling silica dust, which can occur in any occupation involving exposure to such particles."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;与石棉有关的疾病(如石棉沉着症及间皮瘤)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are diseases related to asbestos exposure, including asbestosis and mesothelioma, affecting workers who handle or work with asbestos-containing materials."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;职业性失聪(ACCOUSTIC NEUROMA) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to hearing loss resulting from occupational noise exposure in any profession where such exposure is common."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;腕管综合症(CARPAL TUNNEL SYNDROME) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Carpal tunnel syndrome occurs due to repetitive use of vibrating hand-held power tools, affecting workers who operate these types of equipment for extended periods without manual-only tasks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;退伍军人病(VETERAN'S DISEASE) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This term likely refers to diseases contracted by veterans during their service, specifically those involving the repair, maintenance, or cleaning of water-cooling systems using fresh water or hot water treatment systems."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;严重急性呼吸系统综合症(SARS) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome (SARS) is a viral respiratory illness that can be contracted by individuals working in close and frequent contact with sources of the virus, often found in healthcare settings or other high-risk environments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;退伍军人病(VETERAN'S DISEASE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This term refers to diseases such as SARS contracted due to work involving the repair, maintenance, or cleaning of water-cooling systems using fresh water or hot water treatment systems by veterans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;甲型禽流感&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"甲型禽流感是一种由病毒引起的疾病，主要通过家禽或鸟类传播给人类。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-397a21e488bbd089378ec2e94d69e1bf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;處理屬甲型禽流感病源的物料的實驗室工作人員&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這些人是從事與甲型禽流感相關的研究和處理工作的實驗室工作者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INFLAMMATION, ULCERATION OR MALIGNANT DISEASE OF THE SKIN OR SUBCUTANEOUS TISSUES OR OF THE BONES, OR BLOOD DYSCRASIA, OR CATARACT, DUE TO ELECTRO-MAGNETIC RADIATIONS (OTHER THAN RADIANT HEAT), OR TO IONISING PARTICLES&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這是一種由電磁輻射（除熱輻射外）或放射性粒子引起的可報告職業病。涉及長期暴露於這些因素的工作人員。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HEAT CATARACT&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這是一種由於頻繁或長時間接觸熔融或紅熱材料的輻射而導致的可報告職業病。涉及相關工作的職員。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DYSBARISM, INCLUDING DECOMPRESSION SICKNESS, BAROTRAUMA AND OSTEONECROSIS&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這是一種由於暴露於壓縮或稀薄空氣或其他氣體及其混合物而導致的可報告職業病，涉及相關工作的職員。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CRAMP OF THE HAND OR FOREARM DUE TO REPETITIVE MOVEMENTS&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這是一種由手部或前臂因重複運動引起的抽筋所引發的可報告職業病，涉及長期進行書寫、打字或其他手指、手腕或手臂重複動作的工作人員。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這是一種由於手部因嚴重或長時間摩擦或壓力而引起的皮下蜂窝組織炎，涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BURSITIS OR SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS ARISING AT OR ABOUT THE KNEE DUE TO SEVERE OR PROLONGED EXTERNAL FRICTION OR PRESSURE AT OR ABOUT THE KNEE (BEAT KNEE)&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這是一種由於膝部因嚴重或長時間外部摩擦或壓力而引起的滑膜炎或皮下蜂窩組織炎，涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BURSITIS OR SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS ARISING AT OR ABOUT THE ELBOW DUE TO SEVERE OR PROLONGED EXTERNAL FRICTION OR PRESSURE AT OR ABOUT THE ELBOW&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這是一種由於肘部因嚴重或長時間外部摩擦或壓力而引起的滑膜炎或皮下蜂窩組織炎，涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;電磁輻射（除熱輻射外）或放射性粒子&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這些因素導致的可報告職業病包括皮膚、皮下組織或骨骼炎症、潰瘍或惡性腫瘤，涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RAYS FROM MOLTEN OR RED-HOT MATERIAL&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這種輻射導致的可報告職業病是熱性白內障，涉及頻繁或長期接觸熔融或紅熱材料的工作人員。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPRESSED OR RAREFIED AIR OR OTHER GASES OR GASEOUS MIXTURES&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這種空氣或混合物導致的可報告職業病是壓縮性癥候群，包括減壓症、壓力損傷和骨髓壞死，涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HANDWRITING, TYPING OR OTHER REPETITIVE MOVEMENTS OF THE FINGERS, HAND OR ARM&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這種重複動作導致的可報告職業病是手部或前臂因重複運動引起的抽筋，涉及長期進行書寫、打字或其他手指、手腕或手臂重複動作的工作人員。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANUAL LABOUR CAUSING SEVERE OR PROLONGED FRICTION OR PRESSURE ON THE HAND&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這種勞動導致的可報告職業病是手部因嚴重或長時間摩擦或壓力而引起的皮下蜂窩組織炎，涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANUAL LABOUR CAUSING SEVERE OR PROLONGED EXTERNAL FRICTION OR PRESSURE AT OR ABOUT THE KNEE&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這種勞動導致的可報告職業病是膝部因嚴重或長時間外部摩擦或壓力而引起的滑膜炎或皮下蜂窩組織炎，涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANUAL LABOUR CAUSING SEVERE OR PROLONGED EXTERNAL FRICTION OR PRESSURE AT OR ABOUT THE ELBOW&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這種勞動導致的可報告職業病是肘部因嚴重或長時間外部摩擦或壓力而引起的滑膜炎或皮下蜂窩組織炎，涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTIFIABLE OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"|</data>
  <data key="d1">"這些疾病包括由特定工作環境和因素引發的可報告職業病，如電磁輻射、熱性白內障、壓縮性癥候群等。涉及相關工作的勞動者。"|</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
</node>
