  <data key="d1">"This is a type of cancer that can occur due to certain occupational exposures, specifically mentioned in relation to woodworking and footwear manufacturing activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5847f90776d59664cd156a77705302e6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANIMALS OR INSECTS FOR RESEARCH, EDUCATION OR LABORATORIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to live animals or insects used in scientific settings that can be a source of respiratory irritation without specifying a named entity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5847f90776d59664cd156a77705302e6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BARLEY, OATS, RYE, WHEAT OR MAIZE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are agricultural products mentioned as potential sources of occupational asthma due to dust exposure but not detailed further within the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5847f90776d59664cd156a77705302e6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEAL OR FLOUR MADE FROM BARLEY, OATS, RYE, WHEAT OR MAIZE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a processed form of the aforementioned grains and listed among other agents that can cause respiratory irritation without specifying a named entity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5847f90776d59664cd156a77705302e6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SILICOSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific type of lung disease caused by exposure to silica dust but not detailed further within the text provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"Silicosis is an occupational disease caused by inhaling silica dust and affects workers in various occupations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5847f90776d59664cd156a77705302e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASBESTOS-RELATED DISEASES (SUCH AS ASBESTOSIS AND MESOTHELIOMA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are diseases linked to asbestos exposure, affecting any occupation involving it."&lt;SEP&gt;"This describes a range of health issues related to asbestos exposure, specifically mentioned in relation to various occupations without specifying named entities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5847f90776d59664cd156a77705302e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DEAFNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of hearing loss caused by prolonged noise exposure but not detailed further within the text provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a hearing loss condition resulting from occupational noise exposure in various occupations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5847f90776d59664cd156a77705302e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BARLEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Barley is one of the grains mentioned for its use in meal or flour production."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OATS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Oats is another grain listed, used similarly to barley and wheat in meal or flour production."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RYE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rye is a grain involved in the handling, milling, transport, or storage of meal or flour made from it."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WHEAT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Wheat is one of the grains discussed for its role in meal or flour production."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAIZE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maize (corn) is a grain used in meal or flour production, similar to other listed grains."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEAL OR FLOUR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Meal or flour made from the mentioned grains are central products discussed for their handling and transport."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY OTHER SENSITISING AGENT INHALED AT WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to any additional allergen that can cause sensitisation when inhaled during work, added by L.N. 147 of 1999."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGIONNAIRES' DISEASE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a severe respiratory infection associated with cooling systems and hot water service systems maintenance or service work, added by L.N. 147 of 1999."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEVERE ACUTE RESPIRATORY SYNDROME (SARS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"SARS affects workers in close contact with infected individuals due to their occupation, including medical treatment and research roles, added by L.N. 214 of 2004."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVIAN INFLUENZA A&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Avian influenza A is a type of virus that can cause severe acute respiratory syndrome infection and has been associated with occupational risks in certain industries such as poultry handling or research."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a respiratory infection linked to the handling or exposure to poultry or birds in various occupations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7306865e35ebfb2e70b787c62738f5ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-882d1f4bbed926b547f7b5a8eba55c50</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HANDLING OF POULTRY OR BIRDS OR THEIR UNCOOKED REMAINS OR RESIDUES, OR THEIR UNTREATED PRODUCTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This activity involves close contact with animals potentially infected by avian influenza A, posing a risk to workers engaged in this occupation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-882d1f4bbed926b547f7b5a8eba55c50</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESEARCH WORKER ENGAGED IN RESEARCH IN CONNECTION WITH AVIAN INFLUENZA A&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person involved in scientific studies related to the virus, carrying out activities that may expose them to infection risks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-882d1f4bbed926b547f7b5a8eba55c50</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LABORATORY WORKER ENGAGED IN HANDLING MATERIALS THAT ARE A SOURCE OF AVIAN INFLUENZA A INFECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This role involves direct contact with samples or substances known to be infected by avian influenza A, requiring specific safety protocols and precautions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-882d1f4bbed926b547f7b5a8eba55c50</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAVINGS AND TRANSITIONAL PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Savings and Transitional Provisions refer to the legal provisions ensuring continuity in laws or regulations during changes, particularly relevant for ordinances like those mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"These provisions outline the administrative procedures for implementing new regulations while ensuring continuity of existing laws and practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a4ff4d9a4c70f60d81fee6914d6220ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-882d1f4bbed926b547f7b5a8eba55c50</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE FACTORY AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 59)">
  <data key="d0">"LAW/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Factory and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance is a legal document that regulates factory operations and industrial activities in Hong Kong. It includes provisions for inquiries as mentioned in section 11A and 11B, which have been repealed but ongoing inquiries can continue."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aa88f4f6c68bdcdf602f197a3d1b3c60</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INQUIRY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An inquiry refers to an official investigation or examination into matters related to the operation of factories and industrial undertakings under the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"An inquiry refers to an official investigation or examination of facts related to a specific issue under the Factory and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance. Sections 11A and 11B were previously used for this purpose, but they have been repealed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ead21a291080deb8a3da710d2fd2a7fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa88f4f6c68bdcdf602f197a3d1b3c60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 291}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 974}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TIPS AND SERVICE CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tips and service charges refer to payments received by employees during their employment, either directly or indirectly, from sources other than the employer, which are acknowledged as part of employee wages under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0cbd71f092df4f0f0a3f86b5141618df</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 330}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINOR EMPLOYMENT CLAIMS ADJUDICATION BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board is an organization where claims related to minor employment issues can be submitted according to Part 4 of the Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board Ordinance (Cap. 453)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board is another organizational body responsible for resolving minor employment disputes, including small salary claims."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board is an institution established according to the Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Ordinance (Chapter 453), responsible for handling small-scale wage disputes between employees and employers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board is an organization established under the Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Ordinance (Chapter 453 of the Laws of Hong Kong)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board is another legal body referenced, also involved in settling minor employment claims through awards."&lt;SEP&gt;"This board adjudicates minor claims related to employment, as mentioned in section 43N(1)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f6302661df10aad972a6e63a05f0aa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d4bd265e2aa3d3a8af55fbca1b13963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4803dc099d05bf6f05b27d07f8429783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafe272a6fc4c9f42a82af975bc57303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cbd71f092df4f0f0a3f86b5141618df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93a1fe97f228ec755ced3c31d6506c86</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 330}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SMALL SALARY CLAIMING ARBITRATION OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Small Salary Claiming Arbitration Office is another name for Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board mentioned earlier. It refers to an organization established under the Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Ordinance (Chapter 453 of the Laws of Hong Kong)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aafe272a6fc4c9f42a82af975bc57303</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 138}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 604}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;交通津貼&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"交通津貼是指因工作性质而支付给员工的实际开支，包括非经常出现的性质和特定工作的实际开销。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5ac9460414e7dd9f37d9cef5c1c9b1a5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 195}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;年終酬金&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"年終酬金指的是根据第IIA部付给的年终奖金或其部分。"&lt;SEP&gt;"年終酬金是指根據第IIA部須支付的年度獎勵或補償。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ac9460414e7dd9f37d9cef5c1c9b1a5</data>
