  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Labour Tribunal Ordinance is a legal document that established the Labour Tribunal as defined in section 3."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b1423caf4f652f620d2ab84148c99789</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LABOUR TRIBUNAL (勞資審裁處)&quot;">
