  <data key="d2">chunk-b1423caf4f652f620d2ab84148c99789</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOCK-OUT (閉廠)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lock-out, an event defined by the Trade Unions Ordinance under section 2, refers to the act of closing down operations by employers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b1423caf4f652f620d2ab84148c99789</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANDATORY PROVIDENT FUND SCHEMES ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Mandatory Provident Fund Schemes Ordinance is a legal document that allows for the registration of provident fund schemes as mandatory plans under Cap. 485."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mandatory Provident Fund Schemes Ordinance is a legal document that registers provident fund schemes, Cap. 485."</data>
