</node>
<node id="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT (長期服務金)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Long service payment, a product defined in section 31R and 31RA, is an amount payable by employers to employees for long-term service."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b1423caf4f652f620d2ab84148c99789</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE (產假)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maternity leave refers to an absence from work by a female employee due to pregnancy or confinement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maternity leave, an event related to female employees' absence from work due to pregnancy or confinement as per Part III provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-765d51e319fa417bcf02401654532054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1423caf4f652f620d2ab84148c99789</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINOR EMPLOYMENT CLAIMS ADJUDICATION BOARD ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board Ordinance establishes the Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board, Cap. 453."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board Ordinance is related to the adjudication of minor employment claims and was added in 1994."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-765d51e319fa417bcf02401654532054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5e77a632eea87bc5c9d8f63b609eb9c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MISCARRIAGE (流產)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Miscarriage refers to the expulsion of non-viable products of conception before 24 weeks of pregnancy."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-765d51e319fa417bcf02401654532054</data>
</node>
