<node id="&quot;CONTINUOUS CONTRACT (連續性合約)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Continuous contract is defined as an employment contract under which the employee is deemed to be in continuous employment due to specific provisions outlined in Schedule 1 of relevant regulations."</data>
