<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT (CONTINUOUS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A continuous employment contract is a type of agreement that automatically renews monthly unless otherwise specified in writing and lasts for at least one month according to the text provided."</data>
