  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The interpretation of legal compliance in the context of employment agreements is discussed throughout the text, emphasizing the importance of clear documentation and adherence to Ordinance provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e804bc54b158b7b2826228aa81b5372e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT DURATION REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mathematical calculations for determining monthly wages based on longer-term contracts are described as part of the broader regulations governing contract duration according to section 5(4)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e804bc54b158b7b2826228aa81b5372e</data>
</node>
