</node>
<node id="&quot;WORK DAY EQUIVALENCE CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The calculation method to determine work days equivalent to or more than six months is described, ensuring that such agreements still follow the monthly renewal default according to section 5(3)."</data>
