</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL CONDITIONS AND PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conditions under which employment contracts can be renewed on a monthly basis are outlined in sections 5(1) through (4), providing clarity for both employers and employees."</data>
