  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 10 of this ordinance specifies conditions under which compensation may be payable due to temporary incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40165e3c59ec939d934c64dcd17fd402</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSECTION (1) OF SECTION 10 OF THE EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This subsection refers to periods where wages are paid for days when an employee is absent from work due to temporary incapacity, which may be disregarded under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40165e3c59ec939d934c64dcd17fd402</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B) OF SECTION 10 OF THE EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This subsection provides a method for calculating daily wages when an employee's earnings on a specific day are only a fraction of their normal working day."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40165e3c59ec939d934c64dcd17fd402</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSECTION (1C) OF SECTION 10 OF THE EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This subsection clarifies that if it is impracticable to calculate daily or monthly averages, wages can be calculated by reference to a person employed in similar conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40165e3c59ec939d934c64dcd17fd402</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSECTION (1D) OF SECTION 10 OF THE EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This subsection provides an alternative method for calculating daily or monthly averages if no suitable employee can be found, using a person in similar trade or occupation within the same district."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40165e3c59ec939d934c64dcd17fd402</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6 OF THE EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
