<node id="&quot;OVERTIME PAY OF A CONSTANT CHARACTER OR THE MONTHLY AVERAGE OF WHICH OVER A PERIOD OF 12 MONTHS (OR IF NOT APPLICABLE, SUCH SHORTER PERIOD OF EMPLOYMENT) IMMEDIATELY PRECEDING THE DATE ON WHICH THE TERMINATION TAKES EFFECT IS EQUIVALENT TO OR EXCEEDS 20% OF HIS MONTHLY AVERAGE WAGES DURING THE SAME PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
