<node id="&quot;代通知金&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the compensation given in lieu of notice, which is an alternative form of severance pay when immediate termination is required without prior notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"代通知金是一种补偿机制，用于替代僱主在特定情况下终止与雇员的雇佣关系时支付给原僱主的一种费用。"&lt;SEP&gt;"代通知金是在沒有給予妥當通知而解僱的情況下，根據第II部須支付的一種款項。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e220e0c7587651abe976f081881efeb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24</data>
