</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event of contract termination by either party or according to specific sections and subsections outlined in the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d88cda6d2e850ba77bbd055819688849</data>
