</node>
<node id="&quot;END OF YEAR PAYMENT CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a process defined for calculating payments due at the end of employment based on specified proportions and service periods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d88cda6d2e850ba77bbd055819688849</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 286}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S PERIOD OF SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ATTRIBUTE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The attribute of an employee's period of service is used in determining their proportionate share of the end-of-year payment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d88cda6d2e850ba77bbd055819688849</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 286}]</data>
