  <data key="d1">"A pregnant employee is a female worker whose pregnancy has been confirmed by a medical certificate, entitled to maternity leave as per the regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pregnant female employee is mentioned in relation to maternity leave policies and decision-making processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pregnant employees are mentioned in the text and their work allocation is discussed."</data>
