</node>
<node id="&quot;14-WEEK CONTINUOUS PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 14-week continuous period is a specific timeframe starting from a confirmed date for calculating maternity leave duration."</data>
