  <data key="d1">"Part III refers to the section of laws or regulations related to maternity protection, specifically addressing definitions and rights concerning pregnant employees in employment contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part is another section reference, part of the legal framework defining entitlements but not representing an independent entity in this context."</data>
