<node id="&quot;醫生證明書&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to medical documentation provided by doctors regarding an employee's health and suitability for work, a product of healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"医生证明书是一种医疗文件，用于确认某日为病假日。"&lt;SEP&gt;"医生证明书是指用于证实怀孕或疾病状况的一种医疗文件，女性员工需要在放产假前向雇主出示。"&lt;SEP&gt;"醫生證明書是一种证明文件，用于证实某人是否怀孕或分娩日期等信息。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fb31bef1e8dd24810a075920d4fb5602&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61c622614f8a7b3173a59e39171f674c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb1fa32929a7020d65f293e8c9d7dd58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcef1d93167679643a824fa74e4d13d1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 83}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 485}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;连续性合约&quot;">
