<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The location where the employee will be employed is a factor considered when discussing renewal or new contracts, but it does not affect the severance pay clause directly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The place where employment takes place, related to the production process or industry."</data>
