<node id="&quot;$22,500&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"$22,500 is a monetary value used as a reference point in calculating severance payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"$22,500 is the reference amount used in calculations to determine severance pay and monthly or daily average wages."&lt;SEP&gt;"$22,500 是文中提及的一个具体金额，在不同情况下被用作比较基准。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The figure $22,500 serves as a threshold or cap in the calculation of severance payments for both types of employees mentioned."</data>
