  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employer-funded (specified) ORS Benefits are specific types of benefits funded by the employer and related to employment services, potentially subject to reduction due to severance payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employer-funded specified ORS benefits refer to specific types of employer-provided benefits that may be related to the employee's service and are subject to reduction from the long service payment in certain circumstances."</data>
