  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employer-funded (voluntary) MPFS Benefits are voluntary financial benefits provided by employers in mandatory provident fund schemes, which may be affected by severance payments under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Voluntary MPFS benefits are voluntary contributions or funds held by an employer for employees, often linked to provident fund schemes, which may be reduced when calculating a long service payment upon the employee's death."</data>
