<node id="&quot;SECTION 31J&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31J outlines the conditions and effects of changes in business ownership, including termination of employment contracts by previous owners and potential re-employment or contract renewal by new owners."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b8cb52dd4a9b2981de387c70ee06f029</data>
