<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.2(1A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6.2(1A) is a specific clause that has an effect even if the years of service for severance payments exceed those attributable to gratuities or benefits, though it's not directly detailed in this text."</data>
