<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment Contract Renewal refers to the process of offering continued or new contracts to employees when there are changes in business ownership."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6eb34df6176f74b437e7db047dc2d759</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 707}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS OWNERSHIP CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A business ownership change refers to any alteration in the ownership structure, such as through sale or other property disposition, which can lead to legal and financial implications for employees and their beneficiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Ownership Change is a situation where ownership of a business or part of it changes hands, affecting employment contracts and offers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Ownership Change is a situation where the ownership of a company or part of it has been transferred, affecting employment contract renewals and replacements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business ownership change is an event involving the transfer of business or part of it, which can affect employment contracts as per sections mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2193ccb19ec3e792d874a92951eae0f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ddecf99bc0bca06387d96224afeaf4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb0098fa2f01839bce9b10d85c36181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eb34df6176f74b437e7db047dc2d759</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 707}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE OF OWNERSHIP OF BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Change of ownership of business refers to a situation where the ownership of a business or part of it changes due to sale, disposition, or operation of law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event refers to a change in the ownership of a business for which an employee is employed, or part of such a business."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event refers to a change in the ownership of a business, which can occur through sale or other disposition, or by operation of law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-781090deea1d567c616cff8f0c0ae1ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be5c7596bb8e4301da4cc603ef1a2b55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 708}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREVIOUS OWNER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A former owner or employer whose conditions and actions are referenced in relation to a current situation involving a change in ownership."&lt;SEP&gt;"Previous Owner is the original holder of a business before it was transferred to a new owner, and their role in contract renewals is compared with that of the new owner as per section 31C(2)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Previous owner is an individual who owned the business before it was transferred to another party."&lt;SEP&gt;"Previous owner is the person who immediately before the change occurs owns the business or a part of it and terminates the employee's contract according to section 6 or 7."&lt;SEP&gt;"The previous owner is an individual who employed someone before the change in business ownership and terminated their contract according to section 6 or 7."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-781090deea1d567c616cff8f0c0ae1ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92eb9fce002800330c9f680d468f081b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bab69b3c78835240d5782d563ec35c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be5c7596bb8e4301da4cc603ef1a2b55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 708}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW OWNER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New Owner refers to a person who takes over ownership of a business from another individual or entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"New owner is an organization or individual that acquires the ownership of a business after it has been transferred, affecting employment contracts as per legal provisions mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"New owner refers to a person or entity that acquires ownership of the business after a change in ownership has occurred."&lt;SEP&gt;"New owner refers to the entity that becomes the owner of the business or its part after the change, as agreed by both parties in an employment agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The New Owner is Rongxin or its successor after taking over the business, responsible for making employment contract renewal offers and handling related legal matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"The current owner who is making offers regarding the contract of employment, replacing the previous owner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The new owner refers to a person or entity that acquires control of the business after a change in ownership, possibly through agreement with an employee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-781090deea1d567c616cff8f0c0ae1ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb0098fa2f01839bce9b10d85c36181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92eb9fce002800330c9f680d468f081b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ddecf99bc0bca06387d96224afeaf4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bab69b3c78835240d5782d563ec35c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be5c7596bb8e4301da4cc603ef1a2b55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 706}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6 OR 7&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6 or 7 are provisions in the legal document that deal with terminating an employee's contract, but their specific content is not provided here."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6 or 7 refers to specific sections in a legal framework that deal with termination of employment contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sections 6 and 7 refer to specific clauses that detail how an employee’s contract can be terminated by the previous owner in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-781090deea1d567c616cff8f0c0ae1ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be5c7596bb8e4301da4cc603ef1a2b55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 708}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 31C(2) OR (3)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31C(2) or (3) are provisions that deal with situations where an employee refuses to renew their contract of employment after a change in ownership, but their specific content is not provided here."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-be5c7596bb8e4301da4cc603ef1a2b55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1142}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1965 C. 62 S. 13 U.K.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
