<node id="&quot;PART VB&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Part VB is a part within an organization's or jurisdiction's legal framework, specifically related to long service payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part VB is an industry-specific section within labor laws or regulations, focusing on long service payments for employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part VB refers to a specific section in a larger document, possibly an organization's bylaws or regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part refers to a section within the legal document that defines long service payment, part of the entitlements framework."</data>
