</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTINUOUS EMPLOYMENT YEAR NUMBER (5 YEARS) FOR DEATH ENTITLEMENT CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"For employees who die with at least 5 continuous employment years, this number is used as a basis for calculating long service payments according to specific legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc7d719876b6f50011d4a77def5a2428</data>
