</node>
<node id="&quot;LONG-TERM SERVICE BENEFIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Long-term Service Benefit is a financial benefit paid by the employer to an employee's dependents or legal representative upon the death of the employee, calculated based on years of continuous service."&lt;SEP&gt;"Long-term service benefit refers to a financial compensation provided by employers for years of dedicated service, often linked with the employee's retirement age."&lt;SEP&gt;"Long-term service benefits are discussed in detail, including conditions for their payment and deductions related to certain payments or benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-da3daa00f8a571e7a58b273ea6df48ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b3d407961e6ed952b04345f5d32a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24fa2abbabb20643bcca00d03c443b72</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 45}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 393}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S SPOUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee's Spouse is a person who may receive long-term service benefit if the employee has no surviving children or parents at the time of death."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a0b3d407961e6ed952b04345f5d32a45</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 45}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 393}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S CHILDREN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee's Children are referred to as successors and can potentially receive long-term service benefits in absence of spouse or parent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a0b3d407961e6ed952b04345f5d32a45</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 45}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 393}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S PARENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee's Parents may be entitled to long-term service benefit if the employee has no surviving spouse, children, or other legal representatives at the time of death."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a0b3d407961e6ed952b04345f5d32a45</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 45}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 393}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Legal Representative is someone who can claim long-term service benefits on behalf of an employee in absence of a spouse, children, or parents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal Representatives are individuals who act on behalf of clients in legal matters, including arbitration or mediation procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a0b3d407961e6ed952b04345f5d32a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6afb8943a99ee7bf996b0ce17c18a04b</data>
