</node>
<node id="&quot;SECRETARY GENERAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Secretary General refers to the individual responsible for approving and processing applications for long-term service benefits according to specific formats and procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a0b3d407961e6ed952b04345f5d32a45</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICATION FORM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Application Form is a document used by legal representatives or beneficiaries to apply for long-term service benefits, required in accordance with specified guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a0b3d407961e6ed952b04345f5d32a45</data>
