  <data key="d2">chunk-d45ab396b6bdde518be28a76d42d6670</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE RIGHTS AND PROTECTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee rights and protections refer to laws and provisions designed to safeguard employees from unfair termination, such as those outlined in Sections 31T, 9, 10 of 1992 s. 62, and the exceptions provided by Section 31R and 31RA of 1988 s. 52."</data>
