  <data key="d1">"31YA clause is a legal provision that specifies the deduction of gratuity or benefit when an employee dies, including both pre-transition and post-transition portions."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to another legal provision, 31YA, which outlines circumstances under which long-service payments are reduced due to various financial benefits received by an individual during their employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1e5131fef8ae89d5a0f48b17c1599d19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54addea578982eb79d7f3048cf09c6a2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 175}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RETIREMENT PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Retirement plan is a technology or system that provides long-term financial security through various types of savings and investment schemes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-54addea578982eb79d7f3048cf09c6a2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 680}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GRATUITIES BASED ON LENGTH OF SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gratuities are payments made to employees for their long-term services, and these can affect the severance payment calculation according to specific conditions mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gratuities based on length of service are financial benefits provided by employers as compensation for years of service, often in cases involving an employee's death."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gratuities based on length of service are payments made to employees as a reward for long-term service, often considered in calculating reductions to long service payment upon death."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gratuities based on length of service are payments made to employees upon termination as a form of compensation for their years of dedicated work."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are financial benefits paid out as a result of an employee's years of service, becoming payable upon their death and benefiting Person B under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b6ca736f121ac163d07969e939b811f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16880dc0f6b710adfcdbea0c6c5c09ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0b522ee3e92b516e9befd9d3479f215&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f087949a68abbda398ef78592fe5cb12</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 166}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 693}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;31RA SECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31RA is part of the legal framework that defines conditions under which a person becomes entitled to a long service payment after an employee's death."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0b522ee3e92b516e9befd9d3479f215</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 680}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE 11 SECTION 5&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The fifth section of Schedule 11 likely contains detailed rules or guidelines that are relevant to interpreting or applying the provisions related to long service payments, especially concerning deductions based on gratuities and benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0b522ee3e92b516e9befd9d3479f215</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 682}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GRATUITY OR BENEFIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gratuity or benefit includes payments based on service length and other interests from retirement plans, which may be reduced by the amount of long-service payment upon an employee's death."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gratuity or benefit refers to financial compensation or rights related to an employee's death, which can be affected by legal provisions and years of service."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gratuity or benefit refers to the long service payment made in cases of employee's death, including both pre-transition and post-transition portions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gratuity or benefit refers to various forms of compensation that may relate to an employee's years of service and could potentially affect the long service payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gratuity or benefit refers to various forms of compensation, including gratuities and benefits related to an employee's years of service."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-233de206d4d440690ca3d19bf8ddb77c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e5131fef8ae89d5a0f48b17c1599d19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b785a6d2d7fe1aa9d111846965f88378&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dabef41d299eda51d77087c2ca170398&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b66ec28db0dbcb16e24e4d4df0ef35a2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 684}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 31YB&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31YB is a legal section that outlines the reduction of gratuities or benefits for an employee's death and related conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 683}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 31RA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31RA refers to a provision where long service payment is made under certain circumstances, but specific details are not provided in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 680}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GRATUITIES AND BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gratuities and benefits refer to various forms of compensation or rewards provided to employees upon death, potentially subject to reduction as per the legal section described."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 683}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 31YC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31YC is another legal section that outlines similar conditions for payment reductions in relation to an employee's death and related benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 683}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;甲方&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"甲方是因雇员死亡而从雇主那里收到长期服务金的人。"&lt;SEP&gt;"甲方是文本中提到的某个实体，在此上下文中指代一方当事人。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7fb9bafd0cba5b9cfa67282f7c70bf83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f522c2b4fb2af18c29efee69dde9f663</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 55}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 427}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1122}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;乙方&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"乙方也是文本中提到的另一个实体，在此上下文中指代另一方当事人。"&lt;SEP&gt;"乙方是在雇佣合同中由于雇员死亡有权获得酬金、职业退休计划利益或强积金计划权益的另一人。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7fb9bafd0cba5b9cfa67282f7c70bf83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f522c2b4fb2af18c29efee69dde9f663</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 55}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 427}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1122}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱員死亡&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"僱員死亡是指雇员去世的情况，触发长期服务金和其他相关利益或权益的支付条件。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f522c2b4fb2af18c29efee69dde9f663</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 55}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 426}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱主供款(指明)職業退休計劃利益&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"僱主供款(指明)职业退休计划利益是一种特定类型的长期福利。"&lt;SEP&gt;"僱主供款(指明)職業退休計劃利益是指根据雇佣合同规定，雇主向职业养老金计划中支付的特定金额或权益。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf0d42aa8ddf0d9c1bf8ce8c4d98678b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f522c2b4fb2af18c29efee69dde9f663</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱主供款(自願性)強積金計劃權益&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"僱主供款(自願性)強積金計劃權益指雇主要求根据自愿性公积金计划向受托人支付的相应权益。"&lt;SEP&gt;"僱主供款(自願性)强积金计划权益是员工自愿参与的强制性或自愿性的储蓄和保障产品。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf0d42aa8ddf0d9c1bf8ce8c4d98678b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f522c2b4fb2af18c29efee69dde9f663</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT (SECTION 31RA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Long Service Payment is a product or benefit that the employer must pay due to the death of an employee under section 31RA."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 175}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON A&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Person A is an employee who has received a long service payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person A refers to the individual who receives long service payments from the employer due to the death of a specified employee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person A refers to the individual who receives the long service payment from the employer as per their contract of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d634411e44f3153b1f3217349599619c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f087949a68abbda398ef78592fe5cb12</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 166}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 693}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON B&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Person B is another individual who may become entitled to certain financial benefits due to the death of a specified employee, based on their contractual rights and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person B is another person entitled to certain benefits or gratuities due to the death of an employee, based on specific conditions outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person B is the beneficiary of employer-funded ORS or MPFS benefits after the death of Person A, and may be required to repay these benefits under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d634411e44f3153b1f3217349599619c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f087949a68abbda398ef78592fe5cb12</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 165}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 687}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORS BENEFITS (EMPLOYER-FUNDED SPECIFIED)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"ORS Benefits refer to employer-funded specified ORS (Occupational Retirement Scheme) benefits that may be payable to Person B due to the employee's death, based on their contract of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 175}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MPFS BENEFITS (EMPLOYER-FUNDED VOLUNTARY)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MPFS Benefits are voluntary employer-funded MPFS (Mandatory Provident Fund Schemes) benefits that could become payable to Person B as a result of the employee's death, based on their contract of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 175}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANAGEMENT OR TRUSTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the organization responsible for managing retirement plans and distributing gratuities or benefits upon an employee's death."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 175}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPENDIX 11 SECTION 5&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appendix 11 Section 5 refers to additional legal provisions or guidelines related to the distribution of benefits upon an employee's death, which are referenced but not detailed in this text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 174}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATOR OF AN OCCUPATIONAL RETIREMENT SCHEME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An administrator of an occupational retirement scheme is responsible for managing the distribution of funds from such schemes, particularly in cases involving deceased employees or their beneficiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"This role manages the distribution of employer-funded ORS benefits, which can be paid to Person B upon the employee's (Person A) death."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2193ccb19ec3e792d874a92951eae0f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d634411e44f3153b1f3217349599619c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 165}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 687}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPROVED TRUSTEE OF A MANDATORY PROVIDENT FUND SCHEME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The approved trustee of a mandatory provident fund scheme manages the disbursement of benefits under these schemes and may be involved in financial transactions related to employee deaths or long service payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"This role is responsible for managing and distributing employer-funded MPFS benefits that may be paid to Person B after the employee's (Person A) death."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2193ccb19ec3e792d874a92951eae0f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d634411e44f3153b1f3217349599619c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 165}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 689}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON A, PERSON B&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Person A is an employee who has received a long service payment; Person B is entitled to receive certain gratuities or benefits if specific conditions are met after the death of Person A."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2193ccb19ec3e792d874a92951eae0f7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 707}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;31Z. CHANGE OF OWNERSHIP OF BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31Z outlines the effects on an employee’s contract when there's a change in the ownership of their employing business, including potential re-engagement or renewal by the new owner without treating it as termination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-781090deea1d567c616cff8f0c0ae1ed</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;31ZA. 相聯公司&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 31ZA pertains to situations where the employer is a company, and it introduces additional considerations or definitions related to associated companies within the context of employment law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-781090deea1d567c616cff8f0c0ae1ed</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;附屬公司 (SUBSIDIARY)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"附屬公司在法律上指的是由另一家母公司拥有控制权的公司，根据《公司条例》(第622章)第15条定义。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc7050cecd4e7d8b17b6622358415e8f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第三間公司的附屬公司&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"指两家或更多家公司共同隶属于同一母公司的状况，其中一家是另一家的附属公司。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc7050cecd4e7d8b17b6622358415e8f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱主 (EMPLOYER)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"僱主 is a person who employs others under a contract of service or apprenticeship, with responsibilities to ensure fair treatment and compliance with employment protection laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"僱主可以是个体或组织，在此文本中通常指的是一个公司。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc7050cecd4e7d8b17b6622358415e8f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 53}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱員 (EMPLOYEE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employees are individuals who can benefit from the recognized scheme of medical treatment, choosing to be examined by registered professionals or having a reasonable excuse for not attending examinations under the scheme."&lt;SEP&gt;"僱員 refers to an individual working for another under a contract of service or apprenticeship, with rights protected by employment protection laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"僱員是指被雇佣的人，文中提到的员工可能指个人或一组人。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc7050cecd4e7d8b17b6622358415e8f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 53}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;《公司條例》(第622章) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY, LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"《公司条例》是一部香港法律条文，规定了公司的注册、运作和管理等事宜。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc7050cecd4e7d8b17b6622358415e8f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPANIES ORDINANCE (第622章)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622) provides legal definitions and regulations for companies operating in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2351949864b29078618f803ef4d2c6cb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 336}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1026}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPLIED OR CONSTRUCTIVE TERMINATION OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Implied or constructive termination of a contract occurs when an employee's employment is terminated due to actions by the employer, without explicit notice, as defined under section 31ZB."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2351949864b29078618f803ef4d2c6cb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 335}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT TERMINATION DUE TO EMPLOYER'S ACT/EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any act on the part of the employer or any event affecting the employer (including death) can operate so as to terminate a contract under which an employee is employed by him, and such termination shall be treated as a termination by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-96ecd392e516343d8ffd40e3611e0e8f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 170}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 705}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLE DEFENSE FOR NON-COMPLIANCE WITH PAYMENT REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-compliance with regulations regarding long service payment may result in criminal charges if there is no reasonable defense provided by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-96ecd392e516343d8ffd40e3611e0e8f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 680}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAKING OF LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event refers to the process of making a long service payment, which is governed by specific regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3aa1d2d981153f366e07b9a78ba0c7ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 680}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL TENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal tender refers to the official currency that must be accepted for the discharge of debts, indicating its importance in financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3aa1d2d981153f366e07b9a78ba0c7ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 680}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER COMMITS AN OFFENCE AND IS LIABLE TO A FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event describes the legal consequence for employers who fail to comply with long service payment regulations without reasonable excuse."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3aa1d2d981153f366e07b9a78ba0c7ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 679}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LONG-TERM SERVICE DETAILS STATEMENT (31ZE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Long-term service details statement is an official document required by law when making a long-service payment, detailing how the amount of such payments are calculated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3aa1d2d981153f366e07b9a78ba0c7ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 167}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FALSE INFORMATION IN WRITTEN STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event refers to the legal consequences for employers who provide false or misleading information in the long-term service details statement, which can result in fines up to level 5."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3aa1d2d981153f366e07b9a78ba0c7ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 167}]</data>
</node>
