  <data key="d1">"Part VIA is an addition to the existing regulations, effective as per 75 of 1997 s. 4 and format changes documented in E.R. 3 of 2017."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part VIA refers to specific sections within employment protection laws that deal with certain aspects or conditions of employment such as termination procedures, notice periods, etc."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part VIA是僱傭保障的一部分，由1997年第75號第4條增補並進行了格式變更。"</data>
