<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment Protection is a concept related to the legal framework ensuring job security and rights for employees in certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment Protection refers to a set of legal provisions designed to protect employees from unfair termination under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment Protection是指雇员享有就业保护的权利。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment protection refers to laws and regulations designed to safeguard employees' rights during various employment-related events such as termination, layoff, or changes in employer status due to death."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77a43e929231eee2f87662db94ca7692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c826449cd8715ca847fb4ea3433d8bf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06d9351b59c3c08e06761abd48f7ff73</data>
