</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32D&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32D refers to a specific provision within a legal document that deals with associated companies and their operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d06ee4edd39803f9b252b767c726ef91</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VARIATION OF CONTRACT TERMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Variation of Contract Terms is the modification or change in the conditions of an employment agreement by the employer, effective on a specific date as defined in section 32F."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d06ee4edd39803f9b252b767c726ef91</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 103}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 535}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Death of Employer or Employee refers to the legal implications and provisions related to the death of either party within the context of their professional relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event refers to the death of either an employer or employee, which has legal implications regarding employment and payments according to the text's conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d06ee4edd39803f9b252b767c726ef91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8bb2bf50613f2cddc9c821004e6e7d</data>
