</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIM FOR REMEDIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL CLAIM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal claim for remedies refers to an employee's right to seek compensation or other forms of redress, subject to certain conditions as outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 242}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;3 MONTHS PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TIME FRAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 3-month period starting from the relevant date within which an employee must make their claim or it will be invalid unless extended by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 242}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;6 MONTHS EXTENSION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TIME FRAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An additional 6-months extension can be granted by the Commissioner, making a total of 9 months for employees to file claims after the relevant date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 242}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;9 MONTHS PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TIME FRAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 9-month period starting from the relevant date within which questions regarding an employee's right to remedies must be addressed through legal means or it will lapse, as per the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 242}]</data>
</node>
