<node id="&quot;《勞資審裁處條例》(第25章)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Labour Relations Ordinance (Cap. 25) is a key piece of legislation in Hong Kong dealing with labor disputes, employment conditions, and other matters affecting workers' rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Labour Tribunal Ordinance (Cap. 25) is a legal statute governing labor disputes and tribunals in Hong Kong, as referenced for claim submissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the Labour Relations Ordinance in Hong Kong, which governs labor disputes and other employment-related matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-da53ed52a17c537de0b1301ebe9c9aa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 343}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;司法常務主任&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Justice Officer refers to the official position within the Labour Tribunal responsible for handling filings and cases submitted under Part 4 of Cap. 25 according to the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUSTICE OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Justice Officer is a person who handles claims and disputes at the Labour Tribunal, as mentioned in relation to claim submissions under Part 4 of the Labour Tribunal Ordinance (Cap. 25)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 343}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAWS OF HONG KONG: THE LABOUR TRIBUNAL ORDINANCE (CAP. 25)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Labour Tribunal Ordinance (Cap. 25) is a piece of legislation that establishes and governs the operations of the Labour Tribunal, including its jurisdiction over labor disputes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a68f0496b4d3967e4dee08ee2a743063</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 833}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUSTICE PRESIDENT OF THE LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Justice President of the Labour Tribunal refers to an individual with judicial authority within the Labour Tribunal for hearing and deciding cases as per Part 4 of the Labour Tribunal Ordinance (Cap. 25)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a68f0496b4d3967e4dee08ee2a743063</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 343}]</data>
