<node id="&quot;THE REDUNDANCY CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Redundancy Clause refers to situations where an employee is dismissed due to redundancy or genuine operational requirements of the business, which can be a valid reason for dismissal under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6297aac0b94f77cc5b93128ce6315ec</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL CONTRAVENTION CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Legal Contravention Clause states that if continuing employment would result in legal contraventions by either party, it could also serve as a valid reason for dismissal or contract variation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6297aac0b94f77cc5b93128ce6315ec</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32K COMPLIANCE ABSENCE NOT REASONABLE CAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event describes the situation where an employee's absence due to compliance with Cap. 599 requirements does not constitute a reasonable cause for their dismissal or contract modification, as per section 32KA."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6297aac0b94f77cc5b93128ce6315ec</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32K&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32K is a legal provision related to valid reasons for dismissal or variation of employment contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 32K refers to a specific section in an ordinance or regulation that defines valid reasons for dismissal or changes in employment terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc2894a439737cb35869b760804ff684</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 709}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32L&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32L pertains to the determination of claims in labor disputes, outlining considerations for courts and tribunals."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc2894a439737cb35869b760804ff684</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 709}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32M&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32M is another event within the same legal framework, dealing with remedies available when employee rights are threatened by dismissals or contract variations without just cause."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 833}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32N&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32N refers to a procedural aspect of remedial actions that can be taken in cases where an employer fails to prove the legitimacy of their actions, such as dismissing employees unjustly."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32O&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32O pertains to another form of remedy available through legal proceedings when employee rights are compromised by unfair dismissals or contract variations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;15(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reference to a specific clause (15(1)) in an ordinance, likely related to employment conditions and protections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACTORIES AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 59 OF LAWS OF HONG KONG)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a reference to an industrial regulation that may be relevant in cases involving factory operations or labor practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The court or Labour Tribunal is a judicial body that makes findings in relation to employment claims, requests reports from the Commissioner, and issues orders for reinstatement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or Labour Tribunal is an organization responsible for determining applications related to employment disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or Labour Tribunal is an organization that can make awards for terminal payments in certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or Labour Tribunal is an organization that can make awards of compensation to employees under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or Labour Tribunal is an organization that makes decisions on employee dismissals and related matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or Labour Tribunal is an organization that may make awards of compensation to employees under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"These refer to judicial bodies that have the authority to make awards of terminal payments according to specific provisions in employment law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1958590510250b6ab53b0fe3e4cc53e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4254cc0d21afce88f6eb9b8c9366f7cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236ae534fe116485f7714d0a24fe4030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc0e662ccd81354d4e411a146aa85d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 551}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32A(1)(C)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32A(1)(c) refers to a specific circumstance under which the employer's dismissal of an employee may be challenged in court or Labour Tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2cc0e662ccd81354d4e411a146aa85d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 550}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 15(1), 21B(2)(B), 33(4B) OR 72B(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections refer to specific conditions under which an employer's dismissal of an employee could be considered unjustified and result in a compensation award."&lt;SEP&gt;"These sections refer to specific legal provisions that the employer must not contravene, indicating compliance requirements in employment matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc0e662ccd81354d4e411a146aa85d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 551}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6 OF THE FACTORIES AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 59)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6 of this ordinance pertains to industrial undertakings, suggesting regulations related to factory operations or industrial settings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2cc0e662ccd81354d4e411a146aa85d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 550}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 48 OF THE EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This section deals with employee compensation in case of injury or illness, indicating social science principles applied in labor law and policy."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2cc0e662ccd81354d4e411a146aa85d0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 550}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法院或勞資審裁處&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"法院或劳资审裁处是一个司法机构，负责作出针对雇主的命令，并可应申请而发出更改原本命令的指令。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法院或勞資審裁處可作出按其認為在有關情況下屬公正和恰當的終止僱傭金判給，涉及司法或仲裁機構。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法院或勞資審裁處是负责审理与决定更改命令申请及相关法律后效的机构。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法院或勞資審裁處负责考虑是否作出复职或再次聘用的命令，并向当事人解释和询问其意见。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4a36a8d591bd2dfc15340f652a220e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485a8e98861158f8d237502e6fe9bcc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 475}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第32A(1)(C)條所述的任何情況&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这是指特定情况下员工被解雇的情形，即使只有该僱員表示同意，法院或勞資審裁處仍需作出复职或再次聘用的命令。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6485a8e98861158f8d237502e6fe9bcc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 475}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第3B款&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这指的是在某些合理可行的情况下，即使只有一方同意，法院或勞資審裁處也需要作出复職或重新雇佣的决定的技术性规定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6485a8e98861158f8d237502e6fe9bcc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 475}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The court or Labour and Industrial Relations Tribunal are entities where reports can be submitted or informed about disputes regarding employment termination."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or Labour and Industrial Relations Tribunal is an organization that makes decisions on reinstatement or re-employment orders, ensuring both employer and employee have the opportunity to present their arguments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-994a5726bf785617e7fce7f56d8f7b24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd3f77c02277cf44f86e0e290dbd76e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1142}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LABOUR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Labour and Industrial Relations Tribunal is a specific organization within the court system that handles labor-related cases involving reinstatement or re-employment orders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-994a5726bf785617e7fce7f56d8f7b24</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONCILIATION OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON/ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conciliation Officer, though not explicitly named, refers to an individual who may be required by courts or tribunals to provide reports on labor disputes as per the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-994a5726bf785617e7fce7f56d8f7b24</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employer or employee refers to the parties involved in an employment dispute, who may agree with a report's content or disagree and inform the court or Labour and Industrial Relations Tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5cd3f77c02277cf44f86e0e290dbd76e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Reinstatement Order is a legal action that may be made to return an employee to their job after dismissal."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reinstatement order is a legal document issued by the court or Labour Tribunal that mandates an employer to treat an employee as if not dismissed and restores their rights and privileges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reinstatement Order is an event where the court or Labour Tribunal mandates the employer to reinstate the employee under specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reinstatement order is a command issued by the court or Labour and Industrial Relations Tribunal that requires the employer to treat an employee as never having been terminated under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reinstatement order is a type of decision that can be part of the certificate, related to returning someone to their previous position or status."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reinstatement order refers to an event where a dismissed employee is ordered by the court or Labour Tribunal to be returned to their previous position."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reinstatement order refers to an order that could prevent the making of an award of compensation if it's made instead of a compensation award under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd3f77c02277cf44f86e0e290dbd76e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236ae534fe116485f7714d0a24fe4030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2200d76e6cc5397e7868136950dfb19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f17d41b36a40e80f45f0f635b4ad7eb7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1029}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;就业条例&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"就业条例指的是规范雇佣关系的相关法律或规定，文本中讨论了其对雇员权利的影响。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3451e297aa0bd05f84186c235d841d44</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 497}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;劳资审裁处命令&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"劳资审裁处命令是指由劳动争议仲裁机构作出的关于再次聘用员工的决定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3451e297aa0bd05f84186c235d841d44</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 496}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDER FOR REINSTATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Order for Reinstatement is a legal directive issued by a court or Labour Tribunal, aimed at restoring an employee's position in their job after termination."&lt;SEP&gt;"An order for reinstatement is mentioned as per Section 32N and includes changes made according to Section 32PC."&lt;SEP&gt;"order for reinstatement is a legal term defined in the text and refers to an order made under section 32N that can be varied under section 32PC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee588c56ed96e2cbc4dc5b9474b0fa9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 342}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDER FOR REENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Order for Reengagement is another type of legal directive from a court or Labour Tribunal that involves re-employing an individual who was previously terminated under different circumstances than typical reinstatement cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee588c56ed96e2cbc4dc5b9474b0fa9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 833}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Re-engagement Order refers to the possibility of re-employing an ex-employee under different terms or conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Re-engagement Order is a legal term that specifies conditions for re-employment, including remuneration and rights restoration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Re-engagement order is another type of decision included in certificates, relating to reassigning an individual to work after a tribunal award."&lt;SEP&gt;"Re-engagement order is another type of decision made by the court or Labour Tribunal, involving the re-employment of a former employee who has been dismissed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Re-engagement order is mentioned in relation to section 32N and can affect whether an award of compensation is made."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2200d76e6cc5397e7868136950dfb19</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1028}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-ENGAGEMENT OF EMPLOYEE BY EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event involves an employer's action in either reinstating or re-employing a former employee, which is subject to the court or Labour Tribunal’s decision."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2200d76e6cc5397e7868136950dfb19</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 833}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment claims are disputes related to employment conditions and rights that may be heard by courts or Labour Tribunals for resolution through orders of reinstatement or re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a2200d76e6cc5397e7868136950dfb19</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONCILIATION HELD UNDER THE LABOUR TRIBUNAL ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conciliation events are formal meetings facilitated by the Labour Tribunal to resolve employment disputes before they go to court or Labour Tribunal hearings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-236ae534fe116485f7714d0a24fe4030</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 343}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDER FOR RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Order for Re-Engagement is an event where the court or Labour Tribunal requires the employer to re-engage the employee in comparable employment with restored rights and privileges."&lt;SEP&gt;"order for re-engagement is a legal term defined in the text and refers to an order made under section 32N that can be varied under sections 32PA or 32PC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f17d41b36a40e80f45f0f635b4ad7eb7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 342}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ABSENCE FROM WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee's Absence from Work is a period during which an employee is not working due to reasons specified in the text, affecting entitlements under employment contracts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1027}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REMUNERATION FOR EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Remuneration for Employment refers to payment or compensation provided by employers to employees as part of their contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1027}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SENIORITY AND PENSION RIGHTS RESTORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Seniority and Pension Rights Restoration involves the reinstatement of employee benefits such as seniority status and pension rights after a period of absence due to employment termination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1028}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT DATE SPECIFIED IN ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Re-engagement Date Specified in Order is a specific date set by an order for when an employee must be re-engaged, impacting their entitlements under the contract and ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1028}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARREARS OF PAY AND STATUTORY ENTITLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arrears of Pay and Statutory Entitlements refer to unpaid wages or benefits that employees might have been entitled to but did not receive due to dismissal or changes in employment terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1028}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATUTORY ENTITLEMENTS RESTORED BY EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Statutory Entitlements Restored by Employee involves the process where an employee must return certain statutory entitlements paid erroneously upon re-engagement, as determined by legal authorities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1028}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to the amendment or addition of sections in an ordinance, specifically related to statutory entitlements and re-engagement terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32NA(1) is a legal reference related to sums that must be paid as per an order of variation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 32NA(1) is a provision detailing specific payments required by employers under certain conditions, indicating legal technology or procedural guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32N(4)(D)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to the enforcement of terms related to employment re-engagement as per section 32N(4)(d)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32N(6)(G)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to another clause under Section 32N that may be enforced or applied in the context of employee entitlements and re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32O&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32O is a provision related to termination compensation, indicating legal technology or procedural guidelines for employment matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 32O is referenced as providing details on terminal payments in case neither reinstatement nor re-engagement orders are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 32O is related to awards of terminal payments, which may affect whether the court or Labour Tribunal makes a separate award of compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section refers to a specific legal provision for terminal payments, which are considered entitlements under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32P&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32P deals with compensation in cases of wrongful dismissal, providing specific calculation methods and terms, which are part of the legal framework governing employee rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 32P provides information on the compensation that would be awarded if an employee has been dismissed under certain circumstances mentioned in Section 32A(1)(c)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section refers to a specific provision for compensation, which can be considered an event or condition under which certain entitlements are awarded."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32PB&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to a section that may have implications for re-engagement or reinstatement conditions as per Section 32PB."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32PC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to another section with potential variations in the terms of re-engagement, indicating procedural changes or updates related to employment rights and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32N&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32N is a legal provision that outlines the calculation and payment of certain sums to employees, including terminal payments and compensation for dismissal under specific circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1029}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32NA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32NA specifies the sums payable by employers to employees, including terminal payments and lesser of two amounts based on average monthly wages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32NB&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32NB outlines the method for calculating an employee's average monthly wage as required under Section 32NA(1)(b)(ii)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1029}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERMINAL PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Terminal payments are financial compensation awarded by courts or Labour Tribunals under certain conditions, such as when an employee's contract is terminated without reinstatement or re-engagement orders being made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Terminal payments are financial compensation awarded by the court or Labour Tribunal for certain employment terminations, calculated based on the length of service."&lt;SEP&gt;"Terminal payments are financial compensation awarded in cases where neither reinstatement nor re-engagement orders are made, as specified by Section 32O."&lt;SEP&gt;"Terminal payments are sums awarded under specific conditions related to employment termination and can be considered as events leading to certain entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1958590510250b6ab53b0fe3e4cc53e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR DISMISSAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compensation for dismissal is the monetary award given to an employee who has been dismissed under specific circumstances mentioned in Section 32A(1)(c), as detailed in Section 32P."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32NA条&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"32NA条 refers to an unspecified event or regulation that needs to be implemented according to the text context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;每月平均工資计算&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The calculation of monthly average wages is a process described in detail, involving various conditions and periods for wage inclusion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱員放取產假、侍產假、休息日、病假日、假日或年假的日子&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are specific days when employees take leave such as maternity leave, paternity leave, rest days, sick leaves, holidays or annual leave, which do not count towards the calculation of monthly average wages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱員在僱主同意下放取假期的日子&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are specific days when employees take approved leave from their employer, also excluded in wage calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;不獲僱主提供工作的正常工作日&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are days when employees do not receive work from their employers on regular working days, highlighting the distinction between paid and unpaid leaves."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are normal working days where the employee is not provided work by the employer but still considered for other purposes such as wage calculation under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-de9d7bf328eb68da98c29ac72b529085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 80}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 476}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1131}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;因暫時喪失工作能力而缺勤的日子,根据《僱員補償條例》(第282章)第10條,僱員是會就此獲付補償的。&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are days when an employee is absent due to temporary loss of work capacity and would be compensated according to the Employment Compensation Ordinance (Cap. 282), Section 10."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;緊接僱傭合約終止的日期之前的12個月內,僱員所賺取的每月平均工資&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the average monthly wages earned by an employee in the last twelve months before their employment contract ends."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;豁除期間&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This term refers to periods excluded from wage calculations due to specific reasons such as leave or absence without work provision by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32NA(1)(B)(II)條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"32NA(1)(b)(ii)條 is a clause that needs implementation, related to calculating an employee's monthly average wage for certain purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱傭合約終止的日期&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The termination date of the employment contract is a specific point in time used to calculate wages over a period leading up to this date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;平均工資&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"平均工資是指计算员工过去一段时间内工资水平的方法，用于衡量和比较不同时间段或不同员工之间的薪资情况。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 80}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 478}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;產假、侍產假、休息日、病假日、假日或年假&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are types of leave or holidays that employees can take under labor laws and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"这些假期包括产假、侍产假等，涉及社会学和劳动法的相关规定。"&lt;SEP&gt;"這些事件是指特定情况下员工可以休假而不被扣除全部工資的日子，如产假、侍產假等。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7243d6ae166cfdb764a13e61a193cccf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c12a66b5fa9d29ed0b0dc7f747de3d29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 80}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 478}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;同一僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"同一僱主指的是同一个雇主或公司，他们在雇佣关系中具有相同的管理结构和工作环境。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 456}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1126}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;同樣工作&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"同樣工作是指在相同的工作环境中执行相似任务的职位或角色。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 456}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1126}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;同一地區的同一行業或職業&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"同一地區的同一行業或職業指的是在同一地理区域从事相同行业或职业的人群，他们的工资水平可以作为参考来计算平均工資。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 455}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Average monthly wages refer to the calculated earnings over a period of 12 months or a shorter period before the termination of employment, excluding certain days as specified."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 404}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1098}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY OR ANNUAL LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are specific events where wages may not be earned but still need to be considered in calculating average monthly wages."&lt;SEP&gt;"These events refer to specific types of leaves that may affect the calculation of wages and sickness allowance as per the Employees' Compensation Ordinance (Cap. 282)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5e29cfe8eddddf302f5a14076a67a7d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 404}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1098}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE WITH THE AGREEMENT OF THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a situation where an employee takes leave that is agreed upon, which also affects wage calculation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 404}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1098}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NORMAL WORKING DAY ON WHICH THE EMPLOYEE IS NOT PROVIDED WITH WORK BY THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A normal working day without any work provided by the employer is considered in calculating average monthly wages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 404}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1098}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEAVE WITH EMPLOYER AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to any leave taken by the employee with the agreement of the employer, which can lead to reduced payment for the employee during this time."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to any leave that is agreed upon by the employer and can impact wage calculations for the same 12-month period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd469871354ff220088ed4c17affde45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY COMPENSATION UNDER EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a compensation scheme that provides payments to employees due to temporary incapacity, as mentioned in section 10 of Cap. 282."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd469871354ff220088ed4c17affde45</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGES CALCULATION METHOD A&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNIQUE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Method A for calculating average monthly wages involves using the wages earned by an employee during a period immediately before their contract termination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd469871354ff220088ed4c17affde45</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGES CALCULATION METHOD B&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNIQUE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Method B for calculating average monthly wages is to use the wages of another person employed in similar work, trade or occupation within the same district over the 12 months prior to the employee's contract termination if no such employee exists."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd469871354ff220088ed4c17affde45</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERMINATION OF EMPLOYMENT ENTITLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The termination of employment may result in entitlement to wages or benefits being affected based on the circumstances and agreements between employer and employee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd469871354ff220088ed4c17affde45</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;工資及其他款項&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"工資及其他款項是指根據僱員的僱傭合約應付予僱員的任何收入和其他補償。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 172}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 710}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;產假薪酬或款項&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"產假薪酬或款項是指根據第III部須支付的與生育相關的經濟補助。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 455}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;遣散費或長期服務金&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"遣散費或長期服務金是指根據第VA部和VB部須支付的與終止僱傭關係相關的補償。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 455}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;疾病津貼或款項&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"疾病津貼或款項是根据第VII部须支付的一种款项，与医疗补助相关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 455}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;年假薪酬&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Annual Leave Pay is a form of compensation provided during annual leave according to specific regulations or agreements between employers and employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"年假薪酬 is a term related to annual leave pay, which is part of the compensation package in employment contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"年假薪酬是根据第VIIIA部须支付的一种款项，与带薪休假相关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf34bf4406f6219987d03f2fb1fb1f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 80}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 479}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1133}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;終止僱傭金&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"終止僱傭金是指僱員在僱傭合約終止時有權享有而未獲支付的法定權利。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 475}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;最短可享利益服務年資&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"最短可享利益服務年資是衡量僱員工作年限的一個數學概念，用於確定其是否有權享受某些法定權益。"&lt;SEP&gt;"最短可享利益服務年資是衡量僱員根據本條例就有關享有權而規定的最低工作年限。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 77}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第II部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第II部涉及未給予妥當通知解僱時須支付代通知金。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第IIA部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第IIA部涉及年終酬金的規定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第III部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第III部涉及產假薪酬或款項的規定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第VA部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第VA部是一个条例的一部分，涉及与已故僱主去世相关的员工权益和续订合約或再次聘用的规定。"&lt;SEP&gt;"第VA部涉及遣散費支付的規定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第VB部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第VB部涉及長期服務金支付的規定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第VII部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第VII部涉及疾病津貼或款項的規定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第VIII部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第VIII部涉及假日薪酬的規定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第VIIIA部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第VIIIA部涉及年假薪酬的規定。"&lt;SEP&gt;"第VIIIA部涉及年假薪酬的規定，與帶薪休假相關。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2014年第21號第7條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"2014年第21號第7條增補了侍產假薪酬的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;本條例&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"本条例可能指的是劳动法或相关法规的一部分，规定了雇佣关系和再次聘用的具体条款。"&lt;SEP&gt;"本条例指的是具体的法律法规文本，用以规范和指导雇用行为。"&lt;SEP&gt;"本條例可能指的是某个法律或条例的名称，在此文本中作为背景信息出现。"&lt;SEP&gt;"本條例指香港的相关法律条例，用于规范和解释特定情况下的合同条款合理性问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"本條例是指與僱傭關係相關的法律或規定，涵蓋終止僱傭金和其他法定權利。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d24225c9fe2991b4b3b7b5c007e031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 77}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;本條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"本條是指具體規定終止僱傭金的法律或條款。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第(4)款&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第(4)款是對終止僱傭金支付條件的一項補充說明，涉及未達致某些法定權益的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;合理地預期有權享有本條例下的法定權利&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"合理地預期有權享有是指在特定情況下僱員對終止僱傭金等法定權利的合法期望。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第(3)款&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第(3)款列明了終止僱傭金包括多種補償項目，涵蓋工資、代通知金、年終酬金等。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第II部至VIII部&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第II部至VIII部是不同法律或規定的部分，分別規定了終止僱傭金的不同組成部分和支付細則。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;司法或仲裁機構&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"司法或仲裁機構是指法院或勞資審裁處等處理僱傭關係爭議的組織。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;休假日&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"休假日是指根據法律或僱傭合同規定的休息日，僱員在此期間享有休假權利。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 83}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 483}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AWARD OF TERMINAL PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event refers to a legal process where courts or Labour Tribunals can award terminal payments under certain conditions, such as when reinstatement or re-engagement orders are not made."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1958590510250b6ab53b0fe3e4cc53e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 551}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to potential legal actions where employees can be ordered back into their jobs by courts or Labour Tribunals, which are not applicable in the context of terminal payments as per section 32M and subsequent sections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1958590510250b6ab53b0fe3e4cc53e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reinstatement is a specific event where an employee can be returned to their job, potentially leading to entitlements as defined in other sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reinstatement refers to the act or order by which an employee's position in their original job may be restored after termination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a47dd87b7de189aa048a8aef9b8e4899&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 833}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISMISSAL WITHOUT DUE NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dismissal without due notice refers to an event where an employee's contract may be terminated without providing adequate notice as required by law or agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a47dd87b7de189aa048a8aef9b8e4899</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 818}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1187}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reinstatement or re-engagement are events where an employee is returned to their job or given a new position within the same organization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 303}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 992}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREASONABLE VARIATION OF THE TERMS OF THE CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unreasonable variation of the terms of the contract of employment refers to changes in the employment agreement that are not fair or reasonable, potentially leading to an unreasonable dismissal by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREASONABLE DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unreasonable dismissal by the employer is a situation where the employer terminates the employee's contract without just cause, which can lead to awards for terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATUTORY ENTITLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Statutory entitlements refer to legal rights and benefits that employees are entitled to under specific laws or ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTIONS 31I AND 31IA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sections 31I and 31IA refer to specific legal provisions that apply to severance payments made under this section."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTIONS 31Y, 31YAA AND 31YA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sections 31Y, 31YAA and 31YA are additional legal provisions that apply to long service payments made under this section."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第32M條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 第32M條 is a clause in the Ordinance that may have specific conditions or exceptions for making awards for terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第32N條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 第32N條 refers to another legal provision related to the circumstances under which an employee can be reinstated or re-engaged, potentially affecting the award of terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第15(1)、21B(2)(B)、33(4B)或72B(1)條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These clauses in other ordinances refer to specific conditions under which an employee can be unreasonably dismissed, potentially triggering the award of terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;《工廠及工業經營條例》(第59章)第6條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This clause from another ordinance refers to factory and industrial operation regulations that may affect employment conditions and terminations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;《僱員補償條例》(第282章)第48條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This clause from the Employment Compensation Ordinance (Chapter 282) refers to specific provisions related to employee compensation, which may be relevant in calculating terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32O条&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 32O条 is a legal section that provides for the termination of employment and potentially includes conditions or procedures for making awards for terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;312号法律&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 1998年第312號法律 refers to specific legislation that amends provisions related to severance payments, providing additional context on legal changes affecting employment terminations and compensation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第32P條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 第32P條 is a clause in the Ordinance that provides for compensation awards under specific circumstances of unreasonable dismissal or variation of contract terms, detailing conditions and procedures for making such awards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32M, SECTION 32O&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sections 32M and 32O are legal provisions that may affect the award of compensation or terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4254cc0d21afce88f6eb9b8c9366f7cc</data>
