</node>
<node id="&quot;CROWN GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Crown gazette refers to an official publication where announcements and regulations are made, including potential revisions to compensation award amounts by the Labour Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Crown Gazette refers to a government publication where notices and amendments are officially announced, often used for legal documents and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4254cc0d21afce88f6eb9b8c9366f7cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-178a551bcbbb140ed32885ff11a760d2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1073}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32M&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32M refers to a condition where the court or Labour Tribunal does not have to consider making an award of terminal payments before considering an award of compensation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 551}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dismissal by the employer refers to a situation where an employee may be awarded compensation if it's found that the dismissal was unjustified or illegal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 551}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AN AMOUNT OF $150,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a monetary limit for an award, indicating the maximum financial threshold."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d67392f2bc79e19540a56f3041a4e5eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;三方協議&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"三方协议是一种书面文件，涉及原雇主、雇员和替代雇主三方面，在此情境中用于规定在替代雇主聘用该雇员时视为遵从原本命令的再次聘用的具体条款。"&lt;SEP&gt;"三方協議是一种书面协议，涉及原雇主、员工和替代雇主三方面，规定了在替代雇主聘用该雇员时视为遵从原本命令的再次聘用的具体条款。"&lt;SEP&gt;"三方協議是一种文本形式的规定，用于替代雇主按特定条款重新聘用员工。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd4a36a8d591bd2dfc15340f652a220e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 474}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;原僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON/ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"原僱主是指最初雇佣某位员工的企业或个人，在此情境中涉及与三方协议和继任者的关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"原僱主是被替代的雇主，其雇佣关系可能因各种情况而改变或终止。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 473}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;替代僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"替代僱主是可能聘用该雇员的公司，需按照特定条款执行以符合原本命令的要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"替代僱主是指根据某些条款需要代替原僱主聘用有关雇员的实体。"&lt;SEP&gt;"替代雇主是可能聘用该雇员的公司，需按照特定条款执行以符合原本命令的要求。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 473}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;有關僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"有关员工是指在原雇主和替代雇主之间进行再次聘用协议的人。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;原僱主的繼承人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON/ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"原僱主的继承人在特定情况下可以被要求履行替代雇主聘用有关员工的责任，以符合原本命令的要求。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;勞資審裁處&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"劳资审裁处是一个仲裁机构，在解决劳动争议方面具有权威性，负责解释和执行相关法规。"&lt;SEP&gt;"劳资审裁处是一个仲裁机构，负责解释和执行相关法规，并作出针对雇主（原雇主）的命令，在此情境中涉及员工再雇佣的问题。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱傭期&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS/SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"僱傭期是指员工受雇于雇主的时间段，可能会影响其根据雇佣合同享有的权利及特权的计算方式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"僱傭期是指雇员受雇于雇主的时间段，可能会影响其根据雇佣合同享有的权利及特权的计算方式，在此情境中涉及原雇主和替代雇主之间的责任划分。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;年資&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"年资是衡量员工在公司工作年限的一个概念，在计算某些福利如退休金时具有重要意义。"&lt;SEP&gt;"年资是衡量员工在公司工作年限的一个概念，在计算某些福利如退休金时具有重要意义，可能需要考虑其受雇于原雇主和替代雇主的时间段。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;退休金權利&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"退休金权利是指员工根据雇佣合同享有的退休后获得养老金的权利，可能需要考虑其受雇于原雇主和替代雇主的时间段。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;再次聘用的命令(原本命令)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"再次聘用的命令是法院或劳资审裁处作出的一种指令，要求在特定条件下重新雇佣某位员工以符合先前协议的要求。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;原僱主的繼承人或相聯公司(替代僱主)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"原雇主的继承人或相关联公司（替代雇主）是指可能需要履行原雇主职责的一方，确保员工再次聘用符合原本命令的要求。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;書面協議&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"书面协议是一种正式文件，用于记录各方同意的具体条款和条件，在此情境中涉及三方之间的约定以确保雇员的再雇佣过程合规。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;命令(原本命令)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"命令（原本命令）是法院或劳资审裁处作出的一种正式指令，在特定条件下要求原雇主继续雇佣某位员工以符合先前协议的要求。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱傭合約的權利及特權&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"僱傭合同的权利和特权是指雇员根据其与雇主签订的工作合同享有的各种福利，包括但不限于年资、退休金等，在再次聘用过程中需得到保障。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORIGINAL EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Original Employer is an organization that has the responsibility to engage employees and pay sums as specified in section 32NA(1)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Original Employer refers to the initial organization that employed an employee before they were re-engaged by an alternative employer, as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Original Employer is a company or organization from which an employee was originally hired and later engaged by another employer, referred to in legal terms related to re-engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Original Employer is the initial employer of an employee whose employment period needs to be considered when calculating rights such as seniority and retirement benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"The original employer is an organization that initially employed the employee and complies with a principal order for re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9b2c9282e23c05c84bef3cbc6edb690</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1143}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPLACEMENT EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Replacement Employer, or alternative employer, refers to the entity that may hire the employee if not re-engaged by the original employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Replacement Employer is a new employer that takes over the employment relationship, where the continuity of the employee's service term must be maintained according to certain terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9b2c9282e23c05c84bef3cbc6edb690</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1143}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRIPARTITE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Tripartite Agreement is a document agreed upon by all parties involved that includes terms for the employee's service continuity when moving from one employer to another."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b9b2c9282e23c05c84bef3cbc6edb690</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 180}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 724}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;更改命令&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"更改命令是一种法律文件，用于改变原雇主重新聘用员工的方式和条件，并规定替代雇主按三方协议指明的条款重新聘用有关雇员的具体要求及后果。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd4a36a8d591bd2dfc15340f652a220e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 474}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Order of Variation is a legal document that changes the terms and conditions, including re-engagement dates for employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Order of Variation refers to a specific type of order made under Section 32PA, which changes how the employment relationship is perceived between the Original Employer and Employee through engagement by an Alternative Employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"An order that varies or amends an existing principal order, allowing for re-engagement by an alternative employer under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1017}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;32PA. AMENDMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"32PA refers to an amendment order which modifies employment arrangements as per certain provisions in labor law or regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1017}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPLACEMENT EMPLOYER'S ENGAGEMENT TERMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The replacement employer must engage the employee by a specified date, and these terms are legally binding according to 32PA(7)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Re-engagement Date is a specific deadline for when an employee must be re-engaged or treated as such under the order of variation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第32PA(7)(A)條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"第32PA(7)(a)條是一个具体的条款编号，用于指明替代僱主聘用雇员的具体条件。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 77}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Alternative Employer is mentioned as engaging the same employee after their original employment ended, which affects the entitlements and obligations under the principal order according to the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Alternative Employer is the new entity that has taken on the role of engaging the original employee as if it were a continuation of their employment with the Original Employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The alternative employer is another organization that engages the employee as per an order of variation, treating it as re-engagement by the original employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1143}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32PA is a legal provision that outlines circumstances where engagement of an employee by an alternative employer can be treated as re-engagement by the original employer in compliance with certain orders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 32PA is part of the legal framework defining conditions and terms related to employer changes and employee engagements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1016}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A principal order that mandates certain actions regarding employee engagement, serving as a basis for re-engagement compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal Order refers to the command or directive issued under Section 32N of the Ordinance that governs the engagement and entitlements of employees after a re-engagement by an alternative employer, as described in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 594}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of re-engaging an employee by either the original or alternative employer as per specific orders and agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1017}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL ORDER(32N)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32N of a principal order that specifies amounts payable to employees, relevant in terms of financial obligations under different employment scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1017}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECONCILIATION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A period during which the continuity and duration of an employee's service are recalculated for entitlement purposes after re-engagement by either employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1016}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT IN LIEU OF NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal concept where employers provide payment instead of granting employees their usual notice period, affecting employment breaks and continuities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1016}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REENGAGEMENT COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process ensuring that re-engagements by alternative employers comply with the terms set out in principal orders for employee rights and entitlements continuity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1017}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S EXISTING AND FUTURE ENTITLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rights and benefits an employee is entitled to under their contract with the employer, which are considered continuous despite changes in employers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1017}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANCE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific point in time used as a reference for determining employment breaks or continuities when re-engaging employees between different employers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1016}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ABSENCE FROM WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A situation where an employee is not present at the workplace due to various reasons such as illness or leave, which may result in wage deduction if it exceeds a reasonable limit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Periods during which an employee is not present at their workplace, potentially affecting the calculation of continuous service and entitlements under various employer scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-918c0eabaec10917e5775ff91d8fc75a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1017}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Duties and liabilities related to payments due to employees as per contractual agreements or legal requirements, including those specified in principal orders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1016}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL TERMS AND CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal concepts and stipulations that define the rights, responsibilities, and obligations of employers and employees under different employment scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REENGAGEMENT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal arrangement or document outlining the specifics of re-engaging an employee by either their original or alternative employer as per legal orders and agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 325}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1017}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR RELATIONS BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Court or Labour Relations Board is mentioned as having the authority to issue commands under Section 32N for reinstatement or re-employment of an employee according to certain conditions, as detailed in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or Labour Relations Board is an organization that can hear and decide on applications for relief in employment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4769919f14cc0f877d3fa0c4e17e775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 594}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICATION FOR RELIEF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Application for relief refers to a formal request made by an employee seeking reconsideration of their employment status after it was changed due to specific reasons."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4769919f14cc0f877d3fa0c4e17e775</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 121}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORIGINAL ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Original order is the initial decision or command issued by the court or Labour Relations Board regarding the re-employment or reinstatement of an employee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4769919f14cc0f877d3fa0c4e17e775</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 121}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 32NA(1)(b) is a legal provision related to relief from paying a sum mentioned in section 32NA, which deals with the conditions and procedures for reinstatement or re-engagement of employees dismissed under certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 32NA(1)(b) is part of a legal document that specifies conditions related to employment disputes and relief from liability for the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f25bacc107a2662a1a2b75591817ea36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER AND EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employer and employee refer to the parties involved in an application before the court or Labour Tribunal, where each has a case to present."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 551}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEX DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 480)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Sex Discrimination Ordinance (Cap. 480) is a piece of legislation that defines acts of sex discrimination which are excluded under certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sex Discrimination Ordinance is a legal framework that defines acts of sex discrimination, which are excluded from the scope of this particular part."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889aa8c79dffab2f7d3682d1fe6bfb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISABILITY DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 487)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Disability Discrimination Ordinance (Cap. 487) is another piece of legislation defining acts based on disability that are also excluded from the application scope."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Disability Discrimination Ordinance is another legal framework defining acts of disability discrimination, also excluded from the specific part mentioned."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889aa8c79dffab2f7d3682d1fe6bfb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAMILY JOB DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 527)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Family Job Discrimination Ordinance (Cap. 527) defines discrimination related to family status and is one of the exclusions mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RACE DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 602)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Race Discrimination Ordinance (Cap. 602) deals with acts based on race or a person's close relatives' race and is another exclusion from this part of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Race Discrimination Ordinance covers acts of race-based discrimination, which are also outside the context of this particular part."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889aa8c79dffab2f7d3682d1fe6bfb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT DISPUTES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment disputes are events that may be brought before the court or Labour Tribunal for determination, involving claims related to employer-employee relations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 551}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEX DISCRIMINATION WITHIN THE MEANING OF THE SEX DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 480)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sex discrimination as defined by the Sex Discrimination Ordinance (Cap. 480) is an exclusion from this part, referring to acts that are not covered under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCRIMINATION AGAINST PERSONS ON THE GROUND OF THEIR OR THEIR ASSOCIATES' DISABILITY WITHIN THE MEANING OF THE DISABILITY DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 487)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disability discrimination as defined by the Disability Discrimination Ordinance (Cap. 487) is another exclusion, referring to acts based on a person's or associate's disability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCRIMINATION AGAINST PERSONS ON THE GROUND OF FAMILY STATUS WITHIN THE MEANING OF THE FAMILY JOB DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 527)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Family job discrimination as defined by the Family Job Discrimination Ordinance (Cap. 527) is an exclusion, referring to acts based on a person's family status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCRIMINATION AGAINST PERSONS ON THE GROUND OF RACE OR THEIR CLOSE RELATIVES' RACE WITHIN THE MEANING OF THE RACE DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 602)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Race discrimination as defined by the Race Discrimination Ordinance (Cap. 602) is an exclusion, referring to acts based on a person's race or that of their close relatives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAMILY STATUS DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 527)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This ordinance defines acts of family status discrimination and is excluded from the scope discussed in this text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889aa8c79dffab2f7d3682d1fe6bfb39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;膳食成本&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"膳食成本包括为应员工要求提供的饮食所需的成本，涉及加工和服务费用。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5dff2dac44cda710c0a41dfe3af3e572</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 455}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;處長書面批准&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"處長書面批准是指主管书面同意的情况下才能进行某些扣除操作。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5dff2dac44cda710c0a41dfe3af3e572</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 455}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAMAGE TO OR LOSS OF GOODS, EQUIPMENT OR PROPERTY BELONGING TO OR IN THE POSSESSION OR CONTROL OF THE EMPLOYER OR EXPRESSLY ENTRUSTED TO AN EMPLOYEE FOR CUSTODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Incidents where employees are responsible for damage or loss of company assets under their care, leading to potential deductions from wages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-918c0eabaec10917e5775ff91d8fc75a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOSS OF MONEY FOR WHICH AN EMPLOYEE IS REQUIRED TO ACCOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Situations where employees fail to account for lost funds they were entrusted with, potentially resulting in wage deductions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-918c0eabaec10917e5775ff91d8fc75a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARDIANSHIP OF MINORS ORDINANCE (CAP. 13)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This ordinance pertains to attachment orders that can affect wage deductions for absence from work."&lt;SEP&gt;"This ordinance pertains to specific sections that deal with wage deductions and attachments related to minors' guardianship matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4260c7d330eaf337c4690f784c02608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdc4a39840a667a7878ee99d632412a5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEPARATION AND MAINTENANCE ORDERS ORDINANCE (CAP. 16)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This ordinance is referenced for its section on wage deductions, specifically regarding separation and maintenance orders."&lt;SEP&gt;"This ordinance relates to section 9A(1) which may impact wage deductions through specific conditions or orders."</data>
