<node id="&quot;認可醫療計劃&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Recognized Medical Scheme (as referred to) is a healthcare plan approved by the government of Hong Kong, which may cover certain treatments and services."&lt;SEP&gt;"認可醫療計劃是經政府或其他監管機構批准的医疗保障方案，涵蓋特定治療服務。"&lt;SEP&gt;"认可医疗计划是雇员在疾病或损伤期间接受治疗的机制，通常由雇主提供并受到相关规定约束。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
