  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 1983 is a legal amendment that changed the rules for sickness allowance in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"The product is the amendment to the Employment Ordinance made in 1983, which has been revised multiple times over the years."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6ca8ea4c3347749e50a0bfdf049de28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94369d11b6a74581ea67e2ddddb841fc</data>
