  <data key="d2">chunk-e6ca8ea4c3347749e50a0bfdf049de28</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISEASE津貼&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disease津貼 refers to a type of allowance provided by employers to employees who are sick and meet specific criteria, such as continuous employment for at least one month prior to the sickness day."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6ca8ea4c3347749e50a0bfdf049de28</data>
