</node>
<node id="&quot;BAA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"BAA is an organization that has specific regulations regarding employment contracts and termination procedures, particularly concerning sickness days."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 503}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NORMAL WORKING DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A normal working day is a standard measure used in calculating wages and sickness allowance, representing the typical workday for an employee."&lt;SEP&gt;"A normal working day refers to any regular workday when an employee would typically be provided with work by their employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Normal working day is a regular workday where the employee performs their usual duties, but on which no work was provided, still considered in wage calculations under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5e29cfe8eddddf302f5a14076a67a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 404}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1100}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Temporary incapacity for compensation refers to days when an employee cannot perform their job due to temporary health issues and is eligible for compensation as per the Employees' Compensation Ordinance (Cap. 282)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 503}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISMISSAL OF EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dismissal of employment contract occurs when an employer terminates a contract, subject to specific conditions outlined in BAA regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 503}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Daily Average Wages are calculated by dividing an employee’s total earnings over a specified 12-month period by the number of working days in that period, used to determine sickness allowance rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily average wages is calculated based on the employee's earnings over a specified period, used for determining compensation under certain circumstances as per BAA regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dea1924fb64e67aeda866266fbf06fab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 100}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 522}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY, ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are types of leave taken by an employee which may affect the calculation of wages during a 12-month period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY, COMPENSATION UNDER EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT, TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Temporary incapacity due to which compensation may be payable affects wage calculation during a leave of absence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE CALCULATION METHOD FOR WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is the method used to calculate daily average wages when it's not impracticable. It involves using data from similar employees or trades in the same district over 12 months before termination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SICKNESS DAY WITH PAYABLE SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT, TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A sickness day where allowance is payable under this section affects wage calculations for continuous contract of employment termination purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AN EMPLOYER WHO TERMINATES THE CONTINUOUS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT OF AN EMPLOYEE ON ANY SICKNESS DAY TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF WHICH SICKNESS ALLOWANCE IS PAYABLE UNDER THIS SECTION SHALL BE TAKEN FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (4B)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This entity refers to a legal or organizational context where employers are subject to specific rules regarding termination and payment during sick leave."</data>
