<node id="&quot;MEDICAL PROFESSIONAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical professionals are individuals who issue attendance certificates for pre-natal checks and paid sick leave days as per regulations, playing a crucial role in employee health management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical professionals include registered doctors, registered Chinese medicine practitioners, and midwives as defined by relevant regulations. They play a crucial role in issuing certificates for sick leave based on the employee's condition.")&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical professionals include registered doctors, registered Chinese medicine practitioners, and midwives or nurses who are officially, specially, or temporarily registered according to relevant regulations."</data>
