</node>
<node id="&quot;PAID MATERNITY CHECK-UP ATTENDANCE CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Paid maternity check-up attendance certificates are documents issued by healthcare professionals to female employees who undergo pre-natal checks, entitling them to paid leave days."</data>
