  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 33(2A) is a legal provision related to the accumulation of paid sickness days under certain conditions, part of social science and law framework governing employment rights and benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 33(2A) is referenced for accumulation rules under category 1."</data>
