  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 33(2) outlines the monthly accrual of paid sick leave, also a component within the legal and social science context related to employee welfare and labor laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 33(2) provides the basis for monthly accumulations in category 1."</data>
