  <data key="d1">"Part VIII refers to a section in legislation that deals with holidays with pay, detailing rules and regulations for employers and employees regarding paid leave days."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part refers to a section within the legal document that defines annual leave pay, part of the entitlements framework."</data>
