</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE OF THE WAGES EARNED BY AN EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The daily average is calculated based on the wages earned over a period, typically 12 months, to determine fair payment for employees during leave or holidays."</data>
