  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 41F(3) refers to a clause in legislation that provides conditions for annual leave entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed2004c9e59e7e54ef6756f3c59d039a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSE DOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Close down is an event where a business or its parts are temporarily shut, leading to changes in employee work status and potentially affecting their leave rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"Close down is an event where operations cease, often relevant to the calculation of employee benefits such as annual leave pay."&lt;SEP&gt;"Close down refers to the proposed closure of a business as mentioned in section 41F."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c46e076b844c67b6ef12faaaccec1c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed2004c9e59e7e54ef6756f3c59d039a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13c30dec17d1cd754d99b0830f49589c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 129}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 578}]</data>
</node>
