</node>
<node id="&quot;PAID LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Paid Leave is the paid time off provided to employees as part of their employment package after meeting certain conditions such as a minimum period of continuous service."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 501}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;12 MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"12 months is a specific period of time that defines the minimum requirement for an employee to be eligible for annual leave benefits according to the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 501}]</data>
</node>
