  <data key="d2">chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE PAY CALCULATION METHODOLOGY (AMENDED)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The method for calculating the daily average of wages earned by an employee during their annual leave was amended and replaced as per section 13 of Amended 21 of 2014 s. 13."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169</data>
