  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The method for calculating the daily average of wages earned by an employee during their annual leave was replaced as per section 14 of Replaced 7 of 2007 s. 14."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169</data>
