<node id="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE PAY CALCULATION METHODOLOGY (ORIGINAL)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The original method for calculating the daily average of wages earned by an employee during their annual leave, before any amendments or replacements as per section 13 of Amended 21 of 2014 s. 13 and Replaced 7 of 2007 s. 14."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 101}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 526}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CESSER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cesser of employment is the termination or end of an employee's employment, triggering payment obligations related to unused annual leave."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4b74bf264f43f2a8be1c1c6d9a90273b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 129}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 580}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE PAY ON CESSATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Annual Leave Pay on Cesser of Employment is the payment made to an employee upon ceasing their job, for any annual leave that has accrued but not taken."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 114}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9 TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9 Termination refers to the legal provision for terminating employment under certain conditions as specified in section 9 of relevant legislation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 114}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIGNATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Resignation is a social science concept referring to an employee's voluntary decision to leave their job, which can affect entitlements such as annual leave pay upon cessation of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 114}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT IN LIEU OF UNUSED ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment in Lieu of Unused Annual Leave refers to the compensation provided by employers for any unutilized annual leave when an employee ceases their job, calculated based on the accrued but untaken leave days."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1142}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;41AA(8)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"41AA(8)(a) is a legal provision that restricts the payment of compensation in lieu of unused annual leave under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;41D CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"41D Clause refers to another legal provision related to the calculation and payment of annual leave pay upon cessation of employment, which may have specific requirements or exceptions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;41E. COMPENSATION IN LIEU OF UNUSED HOLIDAY DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compensation in Lieu of Unused Holiday Days is a legal requirement that restricts employers from substituting paid holidays with monetary compensation unless certain conditions are met, as specified under section 41E."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 502}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOLIDAY YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Holiday Year refers to the period used for calculating an employee's entitlement to annual leave and any associated payments upon cessation of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 502}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;數&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"數 refers to a concept or number in the context of wage calculation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 80}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 479}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1132}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;41E. RESTRICTION ON PAY IN LIEU OF LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"41E. Restriction on pay in lieu of leave refers to an event or regulation that restricts employers from paying remuneration instead of granting annual leave, and specifies the conditions under which employees can work in place of taking their leave."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 80}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 479}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1133}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;41EA. 禁止將某些條文列入僱傭合約的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"41EA. Inclusion of certain provisions in contracts of employment prohibited refers to an event or regulation that prohibits the inclusion of specific terms in employment contracts, which could affect the application of section 41E(2)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 172}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 710}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCLUSION OF CERTAIN PROVISIONS IN CONTRACTS OF EMPLOYMENT PROHIBITED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a legal event where the inclusion of specific terms or conditions affecting section 41E(2) in employment contracts is prohibited."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 41E(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 41E(2) refers to a provision within a legal document, which becomes void if violated by an inclusion of certain terms or conditions affecting it in employment contracts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;YEAR假歇業&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Year leave closure is an event where employers plan to close their business or cease part of the operations for granting employees annual leave. It involves notifying and displaying notices at prominent locations, as well as calculating entitlements based on specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;停業通告&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closure notice is a document displayed prominently at the workplace informing employees about business closures or partial shutdowns for granting annual leave. It includes details of affected employees' names or other identifying information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 71}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 455}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1990年第53號第4條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to an amendment made in 1990, which revised the provisions related to employee rights during business closures and annual leave entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE SHUTDOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Annual Leave Shutdown refers to a business closure for granting annual leave, which requires one month's notice and public announcement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc3b1c37f3356b594664179bc904382f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSURE NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closure notice refers to the announcement made by the employer in a conspicuous place at the workplace regarding the closure and affected employees, as required before the commencement of the period of closure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c46e076b844c67b6ef12faaaccec1c4b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 552}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORMULA FOR ANNUAL LEAVE CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The formula A×B/365, where A is the number of days in the period before closure and B is the annual leave an employee would be entitled to under normal circumstances, calculates the amount of annual leave employees are due during a business closure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c46e076b844c67b6ef12faaaccec1c4b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 129}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 578}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Relevant day refers to the starting point for calculating the entitlement to annual leave in case of a business or part thereof being closed down."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c46e076b844c67b6ef12faaaccec1c4b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 129}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 578}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT CLOSURE DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Relevant closure days are specific days that determine the amount of annual leave an employee can take, as defined in the context provided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e9e62e9c51234e7e58e65ee8d9b2c47e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 501}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE PAY RECORD KEEPING REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The requirement for employers to keep records of employee annual leave pay and related information is a legal obligation as stated in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-341592011806c965a734bf17f63882db</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 560}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SICKNESS ALLOWANCE, PAID HOLIDAYS, ANNUAL LEAVE WITH PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are types of benefits or payments that employees may be entitled to according to labor laws mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-341592011806c965a734bf17f63882db</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 589}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1142}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
