<node id="&quot;COMPANIES (WINDING UP AND MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 32)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Companies (Winding Up and Miscellaneous Provisions) Ordinance (Cap. 32) is a legal document that includes provisions related to the winding up of companies, which affects how certain wages are treated during bankruptcy proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 341}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 265&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 265 is another clause within The Companies (Winding Up and Miscellaneous Provisions) Ordinance that defines similar provisions regarding wage payments during the relevant period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 341}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 79&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 79 of The Companies (Winding Up and Miscellaneous Provisions) Ordinance provides additional context for the payment of wages in specific circumstances related to company winding up."</data>
