</node>
<node id="&quot;判令 (AWARD)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A term used for decisions or determinations made by a tribunal, specifically referring to awards given by Labour and Welfare Tribunal or Small Claims Tribunal depending on the case."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c14c658fc7f9efe67addd18c3054ce6d</data>
</node>
