</node>
<node id="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entitlement refers to various types of payments or sums, including wages, end-of-year payments, leave pay, severance payment, long service payment, sickness allowance, holiday pay, annual leave pay, and terminal payments under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 107}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 548}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 23, 24 OR 25&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section references are part of the legal framework defining entitlements but do not represent a distinct entity in this context."</data>
