</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32M(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section is another reference within the legal document that defines awarding of terminal payments as part of the entitlement framework but does not represent an independent entity here."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
