  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section is another reference within the legal document that defines reinstatement or re-engagement orders, part of the broader framework defining entitlements but not an independent entity here."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(A)(I)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section refers to a specific clause under which certain sums are awarded as entitlements and does not represent an independent entity in this context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 107}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 549}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reinstatement or re-engagement is a legal event where employees can be reinstated or re-employed, potentially leading to the award of certain sums as entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 107}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 548}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32PA OR 32PC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sections are references within the legal document that modify provisions for reinstatement and re-engagement but do not represent independent entities here."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUM MENTIONED IN SECTION 32NA(1)(A)(I)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sum is a reference within the legal document that defines a specific amount potentially awarded as entitlements but does not represent an independent entity here."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 107}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 549}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32O, 32M(2), AND 32P&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections collectively define various events or conditions under which certain sums are considered entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 107}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 548}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREASONABLE VARIATION OF THE TERMS OF THAT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unreasonable variation refers to a condition where changes in employment contracts may lead to specific entitlements as defined by legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 107}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 548}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERMINATION OF THE EMPLOYEE'S CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Termination is an event where an employment relationship ends, potentially leading to certain sums being awarded as entitlements under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 107}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 548}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GRANT TO AN EMPLOYEE BUT FAILS TO GRANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Grant refers to a legal obligation for employers to provide certain benefits or payments to employees, which may lead to the award of entitlements if not provided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REST DAYS, MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, HOLIDAY OR ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are types of leaves and rest periods that can be considered social science concepts related to employee rights and benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reinstatement orders are legal documents leading to reinstatement events and can result in certain sums being awarded as entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Re-engagement orders are another type of order that may lead to re-employment, potentially resulting in the awarding of specific entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(A)(I) SUM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section refers to a specific clause defining an amount awarded as entitlements but does not represent an independent entity here."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREASONABLE VARIATION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unreasonable variation is a condition that can lead to certain sums being considered as entitlements under the legal framework."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
</node>
