  <data key="d2">chunk-93f4d21b8a3685a0451d126a19e9d5b4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;監禁3年/IMPRISONMENT FOR THREE YEARS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A form of punishment involving imprisonment for up to three years as specified in the legal context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-93f4d21b8a3685a0451d126a19e9d5b4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;$350,000/FINE OF $350,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This represents a monetary fine amounting to 350,000 Hong Kong dollars as stated in the legal text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-93f4d21b8a3685a0451d126a19e9d5b4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PENALTY FOR NON-PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event refers to the criminal act of not paying within 14 days after a payment date as stipulated, which can result in fines and imprisonment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 113}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 576}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT ORDER PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the payment required by a court order, which can be partial or installment-based as per legal stipulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The concept of employment rights is mentioned in relation to claims and specific entitlements that may arise from certain judgments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-EMPLOYMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This term refers to an order for reinstating or re-employing an employee, which can be subject to conditions as per legal amendments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 113}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 576}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The compensation date is a specific time mentioned in the text where payment must occur if certain conditions are not met by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRIBUNAL AWARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A tribunal award refers to a legal document that outlines the terms of payment for an employee's entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b797e4b1aa3d7cb527163dd9230cfd06</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER COMMITMENT OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event is defined as the employer failing to pay specified sums under a tribunal award within the stipulated time frame, leading to criminal charges and penalties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b797e4b1aa3d7cb527163dd9230cfd06</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;$350,000 FINE AND 3 YEARS IMPRISONMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PENALTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes the legal consequences for an employer who commits the offense of not paying as per the tribunal award."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b797e4b1aa3d7cb527163dd9230cfd06</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSTALMENT OR PART OF INSTALMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to a method of payment where the total sum is divided into installments, with each installment being either in full or partial amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b797e4b1aa3d7cb527163dd9230cfd06</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 32N, SECTION 32PA, AND SECTION 32PC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections are part of a legal framework that can vary the terms of an order for reinstatement or re-engagement. They were added in 2018 under section 10."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13ee9a92c0574802dd2767b6923aabc1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 43P&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to a section in legislation defining offenses related to corporate governance and management responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 43P is a provision defining offenses related to corporate misconduct, and its violations can lead to legal responsibilities for directors, managers, secretaries, or similar individuals of the corporation. It was added in 2018 under section 10."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ee9a92c0574802dd2767b6923aabc1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 379}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;43P条所订罪行&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The offense defined by Section 43P, which involves corporate misconduct and can lead to legal responsibilities for directors, managers, secretaries, or similar individuals of the corporation. It was added in 2018 under section 10."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13ee9a92c0574802dd2767b6923aabc1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;董事、合夥人等的法律责任&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal responsibility of directors, partners, and other similar personnel who are involved with offenses committed by an organization or partnership, including their consent,纵容或疏忽。 It was added in 2018 under section 10."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13ee9a92c0574802dd2767b6923aabc1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;商号的管理人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The person managing a business entity such as a partnership. They can be held responsible for offenses committed by the partnership with their consent,纵容或疏忽。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13ee9a92c0574802dd2767b6923aabc1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;商號&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"商號指的是一个商业实体，涉及其合伙人或管理者的同意或纵容下的行为。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aa12a0d33858fa1c978c751c1c56644d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;董事、經理、秘書或其他類似的人員&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"這些人員是指法團中的關鍵管理者角色，在特定情況下可能被視為犯了罪行的主體。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aa12a0d33858fa1c978c751c1c56644d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第43P條所訂罪行&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"這是一種法律上的行為或事件，涉及商號或其管理者的違規行為。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aa12a0d33858fa1c978c751c1c56644d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANAGER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Manager is another individual who manages a body corporate and may also be held liable for offenses committed with their consent, connivance, or due to neglect."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manager is another type of officer that may be liable for offenses committed by the body corporate due to their consent, connivance, or negligence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1075}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER SIMILAR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Other Similar Officer is a person who has responsibilities akin to directors, managers, or secretaries and may also be held liable for offenses under section 43P based on their role in managing the body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1074}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person who has a partnership role within a firm, potentially involved in managing it and thus subject to similar presumptions as officers of a body corporate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Partner in a Firm refers to individuals involved in running a business entity where an offense can be presumed to have been committed with their consent, connivance, or due to neglect by other partners or those managing the firm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Partner in a Firm refers to individuals involved in the management and operation of a business entity. They may be liable for offenses committed by the firm due to their consent, connivance, or negligence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1075}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER PARTNER IN THE FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Other Partner in the Firm is another individual who runs a business alongside others and may also be held liable for offenses under section 43P based on their role in management or consent/connivance to an offense."&lt;SEP&gt;"Other Partner is another individual who can be held guilty if an offense was committed with his/her consent or because of his/her neglect within a business entity managed by multiple partners."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1075}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 43P&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event where a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of a body corporate is presumed to have committed an offence if they were concerned in the management and knew or should have known about an award made against the body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 379}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTOR, MANAGER, SECRETARY OR OTHER SIMILAR OFFICER—OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to individuals holding management positions within an organization who may be presumed to have committed offenses under section 43P if they were involved in managing and knew about certain awards against the company."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 379}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRESUMPTION UNDER SUBSECTION (3) OR (4)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal presumption that can be rebutted, involving management roles within a firm and knowledge of tribunal awards affecting the firm."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENT (首述文件)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to a document that is presumed to be genuine and true if it appears to have been certified by an official or their representative as a copy of another document, used in legal proceedings under Section 43R."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 380}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1080}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUSTICE OFFICER (司法常務官)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An official who may be involved in certifying documents, as mentioned under Section 43R for legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 380}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1080}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTOR OF TRIBUNAL (審裁處的主任)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The head or director responsible for a tribunal that makes awards which can lead to presumptions being made about individuals involved with the organization's management and operations, as mentioned under Section 43R."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 379}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPRESENTATIVE OF OFFICIAL (代表) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A role held by someone representing an official or authority figure in legal proceedings, such as certifying documents for use in court cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT PROCEEDING UNDER SECTION 43P AND 43R&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal events involving the application of Sections 43P and 43R, dealing with presumptions about offenses committed by corporate officers or partners based on their management roles and knowledge."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 379}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BODY CORPORATE (首述文件)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal entity that can be a party to an offense under Section 43P if its officers are presumed to have committed the offense due to their management role and awareness of certain awards against it."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AWARD OF TRIBUNAL IN RESPECT OF WHICH THE OFFENCE WAS COMMITTED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A decision or award made by a tribunal that can lead to presumptions being made about individuals involved with the organization's management, as mentioned under Sections 43P and 43R."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 380}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1079}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEGLECT ON PART OF PARTNER IN FIRM (其他合伙人或任何其他管理该公司的人员)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A concept related to a legal presumption that can be rebutted if it is proven that the offense was not attributable to neglect by any partners or other persons involved in managing the firm."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1075}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUFFICIENT EVIDENCE (足夠的證據) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the level of proof required under Section 43R, where a person charged with an offense must provide sufficient evidence that it was committed without their consent or connivance and not attributable to their neglect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSECUTION (檢控方) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal body responsible for bringing charges under Section 43P, which can be rebutted by providing sufficient evidence that the offense was committed without consent or connivance and not attributable to negligence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OF LAW (法院)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A location where legal proceedings are conducted for cases involving offenses under Section 43P, as well as proof of documents under Section 43R."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 380}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1080}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL DOCUMENT CERTIFICATION PROCESS (文件核證程序) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process by which official documents or copies thereof are certified and accepted in legal proceedings, involving the roles of justice officers and representatives mentioned in Sections 43P and 43R."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTNERSHIP FIRM (合伙公司)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A business entity where partners share management responsibilities and can be subject to similar presumptions as corporate officers under Section 43P, involving knowledge of tribunal awards affecting the firm."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANAGEMENT RESPONSIBILITY (管理責任) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The role or duty held by individuals in managing a company's operations that can lead to legal presumptions being made about their involvement with offenses under Section 43P, as well as knowledge of tribunal awards affecting the firm."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CORPORATE GOVERNANCE (公司治理) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The system and processes by which a company is directed, managed, and controlled that can lead to legal presumptions being made about offenses committed under Section 43P based on management roles and knowledge of tribunal awards affecting the firm."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL PRESUMPTION (法律推定) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal concept where certain facts are presumed unless proven otherwise, as mentioned in Sections 43P and 43R for offenses committed by corporate officers or partners based on their management roles and knowledge of tribunal awards affecting the firm."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL OFFICER (法律官员) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to officials such as justice officers who may be involved in certifying documents, making decisions, or conducting legal proceedings under Sections 43P and 43R."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE (初审法院)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The court where the initial trial is held for cases involving offenses under Section 43P, as well as proof of documents under Section 43R."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 379}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPEALS COURT (上诉法院) &quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A higher-level court that may hear appeals from decisions made in lower courts regarding cases involving offenses under Section 43P and the certification of legal documents under Section 43R."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRESIDING OFFICER OF THE TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Presiding officer of the tribunal refers to the person who oversees the proceedings and whose signature or certification on documents may be required for their acceptance as evidence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0bf4100b4fcbad386ad1781e51770f26</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 818}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1188}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDICIAL COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Judicial commissioner is a person mentioned in relation to certifying documents, similar to the presiding officer's role but possibly with different responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0bf4100b4fcbad386ad1781e51770f26</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 818}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1188}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIFIED DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specified document refers to documents filed with tribunals, awards made by them, or other relevant documents related to proceedings before tribunals or courts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specified document refers to specific types of files or records that are submitted to or generated by tribunals and courts as evidence in legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0bf4100b4fcbad386ad1781e51770f26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 826}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRESIDENT OF THE TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The president of the tribunal refers to an individual or their representative who issues certificates, with specific details about payments related to judgments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 818}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1190}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDING FOR REVOCATION OR REVIEW OF TRIBUNAL ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal proceedings are mentioned as those seeking the cancellation or review of a tribunal's judgment, with detailed information required if such cases are pending or have been decided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 112}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 570}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICATION UNDER SECTIONS 32PA AND 32PC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Applications under Sections 32PA and 32PC refer to requests made for the implementation of reinstatement or re-employment orders, with details required about whether such applications have been decided or are pending."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER OR RE-EMPLOYMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are specific types of legal judgments that may be subject to further review and application under Sections 32PA and 32PC for their implementation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;司法常務官&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Justice Registrar refers to a judicial officer in the High Court or终审法院, responsible for certain administrative and procedural functions within the court system."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdbfe84655d9fdb85d6dbec5df3b3bf3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;再次聘用的命令&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Order for re-engagement is an order made under Section 32N that reinstates someone to their previous position after a termination of employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdbfe84655d9fdb85d6dbec5df3b3bf3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;复职的命令&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Order for reinstatement is an order made under Section 32N that restores someone's job and benefits after they have been dismissed, with possible amendments under Section 32PC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdbfe84655d9fdb85d6dbec5df3b3bf3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORDER FOR RETENTION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The term 'order for retention' refers to a command under Section 32PA or 32PC, which may include modifications as per Section 32PC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 43P PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proceedings under Section 43P are discussed, involving the admissibility of certain documents and certificates in court proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 43P proceedings refer to the legal process for offenses under section 43P, where certificates are produced and used as evidence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
