</node>
<node id="&quot;FIRST-MENTIONED DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The first-mentioned document is a copy certified by or on behalf of the registrar of a tribunal or court, used as evidence without further proof unless contradicted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 826}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE ISSUED BY REGISTRAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certificates issued by the registrar of a tribunal or court are mentioned as evidence in certain cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 342}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTRAR OF A TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Registrar of a tribunal refers to an official who issues certificates and manages records related to tribunals."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTRAR OF A COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Registrar of a court is mentioned as another official whose certificate can be admissible in evidence without further proof."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registrar of a court, which includes the Registrar of the High Court or the Registrar of the Court of Final Appeal, is a legal position mentioned in the text responsible for certain judicial functions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AWARD OF THE TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Award of the tribunal is a decision document issued by the tribunal that may require payment and can be set aside or reviewed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 355}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIMANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Claimants are individuals who have filed claims with tribunals, potentially receiving awards from them."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 355}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SET-ASIDE PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Set-aside proceedings refer to legal actions taken to challenge or overturn an award made by a tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 340}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1029}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIGH COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"High Court is a location where proceedings may take place as indicated by its role within the definition of 'registrar of a court' and other sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The High Court is a judicial body with authority over certain legal matters, as mentioned in the context of rules for interim measures or orders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The High Court is a specific type of court mentioned for evaluating costs under the rules specified by its regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6af742025bbb451d461d7aaec24f38e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6d15568c3f749767f8090588c63f24</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OF FINAL APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Court of Final Appeal is another legal location mentioned in the text, alongside High Court, involved in certain judicial functions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSECUTION OF AN OFFENSE UNDER SECTION 43P&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event involves initiating a prosecution for offenses defined under section 43P without written consent from a superior authority as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER (处长)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chief Executive Officer, or '处处长' in Chinese, is the individual whose written agreement must be obtained before proceeding with certain legal actions such as prosecution under section 43P."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 342}]</data>
