</node>
<node id="&quot;LICENCE (牌照)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A licence is a document issued under section 52 and comes with corresponding licensee rights and responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Licence refers to a document issued according to Section 52, granting permission for certain activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0fbb70bb06a25c64d5b60d4ef9c96b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 383}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LICENSEE (持牌人)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Licensee is the individual or entity holding and operating under a licence as per Section 52."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0fbb70bb06a25c64d5b60d4ef9c96b1e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 300}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION (豁免证明书)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A certificate of exemption issued according to Section 54, providing an exception from certain regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0fbb70bb06a25c64d5b60d4ef9c96b1e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY (职业介绍所)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An employment agency is a business entity that facilitates the matching of job seekers with employers or supplies labor to employers for hire."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0fbb70bb06a25c64d5b60d4ef9c96b1e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Licensee refers to an individual or organization that has been granted permission to operate as an employment agency, subject to specific regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A licensee is an entity that has been granted permission to operate as an employment agency and must comply with certain regulations regarding record-keeping and reporting."&lt;SEP&gt;"A licensee refers to an individual or entity that holds a license and may have it refused, renewed, or revoked according to certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Licensee is an entity that holds a license or permit from the Commissioner and is subject to record-keeping and reporting requirements related to employment agency operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Licensee refers to the holder of a license as explained under Section 52, and is responsible for operations according to this interpretation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The licensee refers to individuals holding a license or certificate of exemption for employment agency services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf1cb5b59a9e111ec611acd3b69ca0ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1783e936e85cdc622ad6f3d15623b397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ed1612036892adf32beecde8586556</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 145}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A certificate of exemption is a document that allows certain entities, such as companies and individuals, to operate without specific restrictions, mentioned in the text regarding display requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A certificate of exemption is an official document issued by The Commissioner to employment agencies that have been granted temporary permission under section 54."&lt;SEP&gt;"A certificate of exemption issued by the Commissioner specifies the place of business and conditions under which an employment agency can operate without a license."&lt;SEP&gt;"A document issued under section 5(a) of a related ordinance regarding building works. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Certificate of Exemption refers to a document issued under Section 54 exempting certain entities from regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1783e936e85cdc622ad6f3d15623b397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 645}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1162}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Employment Agency is a business entity regulated by certain provisions regarding commissions and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Employment Agency is a business entity that facilitates job placements and may be subject to regulations regarding commissions and inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Employment Agency is a business entity that operates to facilitate the employment of individuals. It must be licensed or have an exemption certificate and can only operate at specified locations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Employment Agency is a business entity that operates under a license issued by the Director, providing job placement services."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Employment Agency is a business entity that operates within Hong Kong, facilitating job placements and related services."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Employment Agency is a business entity that provides job placement services. It must adhere to certain regulations as described in the text regarding licensing criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employment agency is a business entity that provides services related to job placement, often requiring a licence for operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employment agency is a business that helps job seekers find work and employers hire workers."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employment agency is a type of organization that can apply for and receive exemptions based on certain criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employment agency is an organization subject to regulations concerning licensing, management changes, service charges, fees, and the issuance of codes of practice for better operation and control as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employment agency is an organization that operates under specific licensing requirements and may be subject to name restrictions and use conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employment agency is an organization that registers job applicants, places them in employment, and maintains records of their details and transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employment agency is described as potentially non-profit making and subject to licensing exemptions based on public interest considerations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An organization regulated by this ordinance, providing services such as job placement or recruitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment Agency, as defined in the text, is an entity that conducts business for the purpose of either placing people or supplying laborers to employers without necessarily receiving financial benefits from them."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment agency is an organization that operates to facilitate job placements between employers and individuals seeking employment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment agency is an organization that provides job placement services and may be subject to licensing regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment agency refers to a business that helps job seekers find work, often regulated by specific requirements regarding record-keeping and reporting."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf1cb5b59a9e111ec611acd3b69ca0ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409891bfe2bfb21a0731ddceffe7a7d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1783e936e85cdc622ad6f3d15623b397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602c441cf667030bb7c11323e7c28f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b820d3fdcb65775124275159131a823e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db7c4caf2703152da21b6fa8c5646ce3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa5fcead28ed6dc73acdd53533256cb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b8b40b208f0fb021cf679f8d096916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff957c4b25c4b72be5b7c3c1525b4deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ed1612036892adf32beecde8586556</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 647}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1166}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CENTRAL PEOPLE'S GOVERNMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Central People's Government refers to a governmental body that sets up offices or institutions within the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region as per the application of this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Central People's Government is an entity that operates or subsidizes certain employment agencies as exempted under Section 54(3)(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Central People's Government refers to the government of China, which may subvent certain employment agencies as per the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1783e936e85cdc622ad6f3d15623b397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b8b40b208f0fb021cf679f8d096916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2051734d4010ecf353d49c7190a3cf</data>
