</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICATION FOR LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Application for License is a process where an entity applies to be recognized as operating a Vocational Introduction Office or Employment Agency with legal authorization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fa5fcead28ed6dc73acdd53533256cb4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 334}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1021}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment Agency License is a document issued by the Director to allow an entity to operate as an employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-db7c4caf2703152da21b6fa8c5646ce3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 370}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1067}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LICENCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Licences are documents issued by the Commissioner that allow individuals or companies to operate as employment agencies, valid for 12 months from issuance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Licences are official permits required for operating employment agencies, subject to specific conditions regarding names and purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-602c441cf667030bb7c11323e7c28f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff957c4b25c4b72be5b7c3c1525b4deb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 613}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 53&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 53 is a reference to another part of legislation that may provide additional rules regarding licences beyond those mentioned in this text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 53 is referenced at the end but no specific content related to it is provided in this text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff957c4b25c4b72be5b7c3c1525b4deb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 613}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agency refers to the organizations or entities mentioned in the text, which are subject to separate licensing requirements for different names."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LICENSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Licence is a term used for permission granted by an agency, valid for 12 months and renewable upon application as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VOCATIONAL PLACEMENT OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vocational Placement Office refers to a business name that must be unique, not similar enough to mislead the public, and cannot be used for illegal purposes as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRACTICAL GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Practical Guidelines are the rules and procedures that must be followed by practitioners as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 611}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;职业介绍所&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"职业介绍所 (Job placement agency) is an organization that may apply for exemption from obtaining a license according to certain conditions specified by the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"职业介绍所是文中提到的一种实体，涉及持牌人的相关背景和资质审核。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;实务守则&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"实务守则是根据第62A(1)条发出的规定，涉及到持牌人或其关联人士的行为准则。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第62条订立的任何规例&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这是指根据第62条规定制定的相关条例，涉及行为规范和法律责任。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 498}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第8号第5条修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这指的是对相关条款进行修订的时间点或事件。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;持牌人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON,ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"持牌人可以是个人也可以是一家公司，或者一个合伙中的合伙人，涉及发牌和牌照续期的相关申请与行为规范。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;有关连人士&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"有关连人士指的是与持牌人有直接关联的实体或个人，在某些情况下会影响其资质审核。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;申请人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"申请人是指提出发牌或牌照续期申请的人，涉及相关背景和行为规范。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 498}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;撤销牌照&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"撤销牌照是处长根据相关规定可以采取的一种处罚措施。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;拒绝发牌或拒绝将牌照续期&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这是指处长在审核申请后可能做出的决定，涉及相关理由和通知程序。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第62A(1)条&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这指的是具体条款编号，涉及到实务守则的相关内容。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;个人受雇于持牌人或拟作为持牌人的人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这是指与持牌人有雇佣关系的个人，在某些情况下会影响其资质审核和行为规范。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NAME OF ANOTHER EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the names used by other employment agencies, which must not be identical or closely resemble each other to avoid deception."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-602c441cf667030bb7c11323e7c28f43</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 647}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1166}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDISCHARGED BANKRUPT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Undischarged bankrupt is a social science term referring to an individual who has not completed their bankruptcy process and may face restrictions in certain professional activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-602c441cf667030bb7c11323e7c28f43</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 645}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1162}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY LICENSEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Employment Agency Licensee is a company or individual seeking to operate an employment agency and must meet certain criteria as outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 646}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRIAD SOCIETY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Triad Society refers to an illegal organization involved in criminal activities, which can be grounds for disqualification of employment agency licensees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FALSE OR MISLEADING INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"False or misleading information is a concept that involves providing inaccurate data during the application process for licensing, which could lead to refusal of the license."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 646}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATED PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Related Person is defined as an individual associated with the licensee, such as a company officer or partner, who may have committed offenses or failed to comply with regulations that could affect the licensing status of the employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDIVIDUAL EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Individual Employee refers to any person working for the licensee in an employment agency. Their compliance with regulations is also a factor in determining whether a license should be issued or renewed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFFENSE AGAINST PERSON OF CHILD, YOUNG PERSON OR WOMAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event describes criminal offenses committed against minors or women that can disqualify individuals from operating an employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FRAUD, DISHONESTY OR EXTORTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These social issues refer to illegal activities such as fraud and extortion which are grounds for disqualification of employment agency licensees based on their involvement by related persons or employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATION MADE UNDER SECTION 62&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Regulation Made Under Section 62 refers to specific rules set forth in the legal framework governing employment agencies, which must be adhered to for licensing purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 62A(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 62A(1) is a reference to a specific part of the legislation that outlines codes of practice required by employment agency licensees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1120}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIT AND PROPER PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The concept of 'fit and proper person' refers to an individual or entity's suitability for operating an employment agency based on their past actions, convictions, and compliance with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 646}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNLAWFUL OR IMMORAL PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event describes the use of an employment agency in activities that are illegal or unethical, which can lead to refusal of a license."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE APPEALS BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Administrative Appeals Board is a body to which any person aggrieved by the Commissioner's decision can appeal within 28 days after notification."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Appeals Board is an organization where body corporates can appeal against decisions made by the Secretary regarding their registrations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-89bbff8bbf3f0985059cdccf2a6fe747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 372}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LICENSING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The licensing authority is implied in the text as the body responsible for issuing licenses and making decisions regarding their renewal or revocation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 372}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE APPEALS BOARD'S DISMISSAL OF THE APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a specific event where an appeal made to the Administrative Appeals Board is dismissed, potentially affecting the licensee’s actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 145}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICANT FOR LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An applicant for license refers to individuals or entities seeking a license from the licensing authority."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 372}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;54. COMMISSIONER'S POWER OF EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Event 54 outlines the powers and procedures for the Commissioner to exempt certain organizations from licensing requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPEALED 28 OF 1992 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The repeal of section 4 in 1992 indicates a change or removal of previous legislation related to employment agencies and their licenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;55. REVOCATION OF EXEMPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Event 55 describes the conditions under which the Commissioner can revoke previously granted exemptions for employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 54 EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 54 exemption refers to the temporary permission granted by The Commissioner under section 54, which can be withdrawn at any time if conditions are not met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 645}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1162}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 53(1) REFUSAL GROUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 53(1) refusal grounds include reasons for denying a license or renewal of a license based on non-profit status and other criteria."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 645}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1163}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY (HOLDER)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment agency holder refers to the organization or entity holding a certificate of exemption and subject to regulations regarding its operations and compliance with public interest standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 645}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1163}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JOB APPLICANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Job applicants are individuals seeking employment through an employment agency, whose personal details must be recorded according to regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 643}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HONG KONG IDENTITY CARD NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hong Kong Identity Card number is a unique identifier used for identification purposes in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 643}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PASSPORT NUMBER AND CITIZENSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Passport number and citizenship are details required from non-residents to identify their identity and origin, often necessary for employment registration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 643}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEE AND COMMISSION RECEIVED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fee and commission received refer to the charges collected by an employment agency for services provided, which must be recorded as part of the documentation requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 648}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER'S NAME OR ADDRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The employer's name or address is information required in records related to job placements, indicating where jobs are being offered and helping track employment outcomes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 445}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCOUNTING PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Accounting period refers to a specific time frame used for financial reporting purposes, often one year, during which records must be maintained according to regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 644}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERS, RECORDS, AND RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Registers, records, and returns are formal documents required by law for employment agencies to maintain and submit to the Commissioner as part of compliance with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 647}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1166}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JOB PLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Job placement refers to the act of placing a job applicant in an employment position through an agency's services, which is subject to record-keeping requirements under regulatory frameworks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1992年第28號第5條&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The amendment from '56. 訂明的紀錄及申報表的保存及提交處長的規定' and '(3) 持牌人須將第(1)款所提述的紀錄,在職業介紹所每一個會計年度完結後保留一段不少於12個月的期間。' indicates changes in regulations regarding record-keeping and reporting requirements for employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT REGISTRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment registration is the process through which job seekers are recorded by an employment agency, including details such as personal information, fees paid, and placement outcomes, all of which must be documented according to legal standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCOUNTING YEAR END&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Accounting year end refers to the conclusion of a financial period used for record-keeping purposes, during which records related to employment placements must be maintained and potentially submitted as part of annual reporting requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECORD-KEEPING REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Record-keeping requirement is a specific obligation imposed on employment agencies to maintain detailed records of various aspects related to job placements, including personal information, fees, and placement outcomes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 648}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPORTING REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reporting requirement refers to the duty of employment agencies to submit certain documents or reports to regulatory bodies like the Commissioner at specified intervals or upon request, ensuring transparency in operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 445}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY OPERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment agency operation encompasses all activities and processes related to helping job seekers find work through an intermediary service provider, including record-keeping, placement services, and compliance with regulatory standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 323}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-RESIDENT APPLICANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-resident applicants are individuals seeking employment in Hong Kong who do not hold a permanent residency status within the region but may be eligible for work through an employment agency's services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 644}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulatory framework refers to the set of laws, rules, and guidelines that govern the operations of employment agencies in Hong Kong, including record-keeping, reporting, and other compliance measures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 145}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial period is a specific time frame used for accounting purposes, often one year, during which financial transactions are recorded and reported according to regulatory requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JOB SEEKER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Job seekers are individuals looking for employment opportunities through the services of an employment agency, whose personal details must be documented as part of compliance with legal standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMISSIONING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Commissioning authority refers to the entity or individual responsible for granting exemptions and overseeing the operations of employment agencies according to regulatory frameworks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 643}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECORD-KEEPING OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Record-keeping obligation is a legal requirement imposed on organizations like employment agencies to maintain detailed records of various aspects related to job placements, including personal information, fees, and placement outcomes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPORTING PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reporting period refers to the specific time frame during which certain documents or reports must be submitted by an organization like an employment agency to regulatory bodies as part of compliance with legal standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 648}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT PLACEMENT SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment placement service is a product offered by employment agencies that helps job seekers find work, often involving record-keeping and reporting requirements according to regulatory frameworks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATORY BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulatory bodies are entities that oversee and enforce compliance with laws and regulations in specific industries or sectors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory body is an organizational entity mentioned in the text that might receive communications under certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory body refers to the entity responsible for overseeing compliance with legal standards in various industries, including employment agencies, ensuring transparency and accountability through record-keeping and reporting obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a252d91181bacec6fcd6f1d54297b19a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4158bcd358cce62e9937de8896e1ba0b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 445}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCOUNTING YEAR OF THE EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An accounting year refers to a specific period used for financial recording, typically 12 months, during which records are retained by the licensee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63ed1612036892adf32beecde8586556</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 145}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSOCIATE OF A LICENSEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Associate of a Licensee is someone associated with the licensee in the context of operating an employment agency and must adhere to certain restrictions regarding commissions and agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf1cb5b59a9e111ec611acd3b69ca0ea</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 145}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRESCRIBED COMMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prescribed Commission is a type of fee that an Employment Agency can charge according to regulations set forth in relevant rules and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf1cb5b59a9e111ec611acd3b69ca0ea</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 145}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECORD OR DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Records and Documents are any written materials related to employment agencies that can be requested for inspection during a regulatory check."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1975 ACT S. 2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2 of the 1975 Act amended certain provisions, likely including those about commissions and permissions for Employment Agencies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1992 ACT S. 6&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6 of the 1992 Act made amendments to existing regulations regarding employment agencies' operations and inspections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2018 AMENDMENT S. 6&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 2018 Amendment introduced new sections, such as those related to prescribed commissions for Employment Agencies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECORD OR DOCUMENT RELATING TO AN EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Records and Documents relating to an Employment Agency are any written materials, such as contracts or logs, related to the agency's operations that can be inspected during a regulatory check."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 405}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1102}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON OPERATING, MANAGING, OR ASSISTING IN MANAGEMENT OF AN EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Person operating, managing, or assisting in management refers to individuals who are involved in running an employment agency and may be required to provide information for inspection purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTRODUCTION OF NEW SECTIONS 2018 AMENDMENT S. 6&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The introduction of new sections in the 2018 Amendment, such as those related to prescribed commissions, marked significant changes in how employment agencies are regulated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORK FOR EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Regulatory Framework is a set of rules and guidelines that governs the operations of employment agencies, including their financial practices and inspection procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY HIM IN THAT BEHALF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public officers authorized by the Commissioner have similar powers as the Commissioner regarding searches and seizures without a warrant at reasonable times."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public officers authorized by the Commissioner have the right to enter and inspect the place of business of an employment agency at any reasonable time, as well as require information or particulars from persons operating such agencies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409891bfe2bfb21a0731ddceffe7a7d6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY HIM IN THAT BEHALF OR ANY POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public officers and police personnel with a certain level of authority are granted permission to enter premises suspected of containing evidence related to offences without a warrant, as detailed in section 59(1) of the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-409891bfe2bfb21a0731ddceffe7a7d6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Police officers with ranks not below an inspector can enter premises to search for evidence or require production, seize, detain, and remove articles, records, or other documents under suspicion of offenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE, RECORD OR OTHER DOCUMENT WHICH MAY BE EVIDENCE OF AN OFFENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are items that could potentially serve as evidence in offenses under this Part and can be seized during searches conducted without a warrant at reasonable times."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAGISTRATE'S WARRANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A magistrate's warrant is a legal document issued by a judge authorizing the Commissioner, public officers authorized by him, or police inspectors to enter domestic premises for search purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;51(2)条的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The violation of 51(2) regulation constitutes an offense and is punishable with a fine at level 3."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 608}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1144}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;53(5) OR 55(4)条的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Violations of 53(5) or 55(4) regulations are also considered offenses, subject to the same penalties as violations of other specified provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 146}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 639}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;52(2A), (2B), OR (2C)条的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Violations of these specific clauses in regulation 52 result in criminal charges and a fine at level 3."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;56(1), (2), OR (3)条的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Violations of the specified sections in regulation 56 are also considered offenses, subject to fines at level 3."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;提供明知或理應知道在要项上属虚假或误导的信息&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to actions that involve providing false or misleading information regarding applications made under specific regulations, which can be criminalized and result in penalties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 52(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 52(1) is an event in the context of this text where someone applies for permission from the Secretary according to certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 180}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 723}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 54(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 54(1) is another event mentioned, related to applications made by individuals as per specific provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 180}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 723}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 58&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 58 refers to an event of inquiries or inspections conducted according to certain regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 180}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 723}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDICIAL OFFICER ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 227)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The organization or legal framework that provides the basis for certain provisions and procedures in this text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 26&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 26 of the Judicial Officer Ordinance is referenced, providing a time limit for filing complaints related to specific offenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
