  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions from a later amendment, effective as of 2018, which replace or supplement earlier articles with new regulations and penalties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;罪行發生的日期後12個月內作出或提出。&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the time limit within which complaints or accusations can be made, specifically 12 months after the incident occurs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;第5級罰款。&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a reference to a fine level in the legal system, indicating a specific penalty amount but does not belong to any other predefined types."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 51(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 51(2) refers to an event or condition under which someone can be guilty of an offense and liable for a fine at level 3."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 53(5)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 53(5) is another reference to an event where violation leads to criminal liability, with the same penalty as section 51(2)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 55(4)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 55(4) also refers to a specific offense and its associated penalties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 52(2A), (2B) OR (2C)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections refer to additional offenses related to the operation of an employment agency, each carrying similar penalties as other sections mentioned."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 56(1), (2) OR (3)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 56 outlines further specific offenses with corresponding fines at level 3."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FURNISHES ANY INFORMATION WHICH HE KNOWS OR REASONABLY OUGHT TO KNOW TO BE FALSE OR MISLEADING IN ANY MATERIAL PARTICULAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
