  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAILS WITHOUT REASONABLE EXCUSE TO PRODUCE ANY RECORD OR OTHER DOCUMENT RELATING TO THE EMPLOYMENT AGENCY WHEN REQUIRED BY THE COMMISSIONER OR ANY PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED IN THAT BEHALF BY THE COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase describes a technical aspect of failing to provide documents, but does not belong to other predefined types."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FURNISHES TO THE COMMISSIONER OR ANY SUCH PUBLIC OFFICER ANY INFORMATION WHICH HE KNOWS OR REASONABLY OUGHT TO KNOW TO BE FALSE OR MISLEADING IN ANY MATERIAL PARTICULAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase is another description of providing inaccurate information and falls under similar technical aspects as mentioned before, but does not belong to other predefined types."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fine at level 5 refers to a specific monetary penalty for certain offenses described in the text, but it is more of a procedural detail rather than an entity type that fits into any other category."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMENDED 24 OF 1988 S. 2;&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to amendments made to specific sections on certain dates and does not belong in the predefined types except as a reference event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPEALED 24 OF 1988 S. 2.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This indicates that section 2 was repealed, which is an event or change in legal text but doesn't fit into other categories."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 51(1) OFFENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
