  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Imprisonment for 3 years is a form of punishment related to criminal offenses as described in the text, particularly those involving wage-related violations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Imprisonment for three years is another form of punishment specified in the text, signifying a fixed term imprisonment as a consequence of contravening certain sections."</data>
