<node id="&quot;ANY LEAVE AS REQUIRED OR ALLOWED UNDER SECTION 41AA OR 41F(3)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any leave given to an employee according to the provisions of sections 41AA and 41F(3) is considered a legal event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY REST DAY OR HOLIDAY AS REQUIRED UNDER SECTION 41AA(6)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any rest day or holiday given to an employee based on the requirements of section 41AA(6) is considered a legal event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALARY FOR LEAVE AS REQUIRED OR ALLOWED UNDER SECTION 41AA OR 41F(3)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The salary paid for any leave given to an employee according to the provisions of sections 41AA and 41F(3) is a product of legal obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION AS REQUIRED UNDER SECTION 41D&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compensation or payment made based on the requirements of section 41D is considered a legal event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VIOLATION OF SECTIONS 40A(1) OR 41B&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Violating the provisions of sections 40A(1) and 41B constitutes a criminal act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-COMPLIANCE WITH REQUIREMENTS BY PUBLIC OFFICERS UNDER SECTION 72 (EXCLUDING CLAUSES (1)(A), (B) AND (C))&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Failure to comply with the requests of public officers according to sections 72, excluding clauses (1)(a), (b) and (c), is considered a criminal act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROVIDING FALSE OR INCOMPLETE INFORMATION IN MATTERS REQUIRING DATA UNDER SECTION 72 (EXCLUDING CLAUSE (1)(B) AND (C))&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Providing false or incomplete information intentionally or negligently in matters that require the provision of data according to sections 72, excluding clauses (1)(b) and (c), is considered a criminal act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-COMPLIANCE WITH CONDITIONS IMPOSED WHEN GRANTING EXEMPTION UNDER SECTION 73(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Failure to comply with any conditions imposed at the time of granting an exemption according to section 73(2) constitutes a criminal act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VIOLATION OF SECTION 41E(1)&quot;">
