<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO— (A) FAILS TO COMPLY WITH A REQUIREMENT MADE BY ANY OFFICER UNDER ANY OF THE PROVISIONS OF SECTION 72 OTHER THAN SUBSECTION (1)(A), (B) AND (C) OF THAT SECTION; (AMENDED 31 OF 1992 S. 2)&quot;">
