<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO— (B) WILFULLY OR RECKLESSLY GIVES INFORMATION WHICH IS FALSE IN A MATERIAL PARTICULAR OR WITHHOLDS INFORMATION AS TO ANY OF THE MATTERS IN RESPECT OF WHICH INFORMATION IS REQUIRED TO BE GIVEN UNDER ANY OF THE PROVISIONS OF SECTION 72 OTHER THAN SUBSECTION (1)(B) AND (C) OF THAT SECTION; OR (AMENDED 31 OF 1992 S. 2)&quot;">
