</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO— (D) FAILS TO COMPLY WITH ANY CONDITION IMPOSED ON THE GRANTING OF ANY EXEMPTION UNDER SECTION 73(2), SHALL BE GUILTY OF AN OFFENCE. (ADDED 55 OF 1979 S. 2)&quot;">
