</node>
<node id="&quot;REGIONAL COURT JUDGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A regional court judge can issue warrants based on applications for apprehension of absconding employers as per the provisions outlined."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Regional Court Judge has the authority to order imprisonment of employers who do not comply with court orders and can revoke guarantees under certain conditions."</data>
