  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A duty defined by law that relates to the safety and protection of persons at work, often enforced through regulations and legal proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Statutory Duty refers to legal obligations related to workplace safety, which may be breached by employers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5742863cc938d9f9470985855601b925&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e37def8625e820a47ed5130364eb70d4</data>
