</node>
<node id="&quot;SAFETY OF PERSONS AT WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Safety of Persons at Work refers to the social science concept related to ensuring employee well-being during their working hours, which is a key focus of workplace safety regulations."</data>
