  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment (Amendment) (No. 2) Ordinance 2018 is a legal document that amends the Employment Ordinance, with sections and provisions related to employee dismissals and contract variations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment (Amendment) (No. 2) Ordinance 2018 is a legal document that introduced changes to existing employment laws, specifically affecting the material dates for claims under Part VIA."</data>
