  <data key="d1">"Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2020 is another legal document that further amends the Employment Ordinance, with transitional provisions for certain sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2020 is a legal document that introduces transitional provisions for existing employment contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2020 is a legislative act that amends the existing employment laws in a specific year and applies to certain events such as childbirth."</data>
