  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a legal document that introduces amendments to the employment regulations, affecting work hour calculations and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1225ad39721dd1127eb47430e36b62e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2A&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2A refers to an event or condition in which employee working hours are calculated under specific rules introduced by the amendment ordinance."</data>
