</node>
<node id="&quot;THE EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 599)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employment Ordinance (Cap. 599) is a legal document that provides regulations and definitions related to employment, including terms like 'lock-out' and 'strike'."</data>
