  <data key="d1">"必要期间是法律术语，指在特定情况下需要考虑的时间段，用于判断受雇状态和相关权益问题。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e941c75e00a3faa0f2daf5fb450b75f7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Personal Representative of the Deceased Employer is a person authorized or required by law to act on behalf of the deceased in business and legal matters, particularly concerning employment contracts after death."&lt;SEP&gt;"A personal representative of the deceased employer refers to someone authorized by law to act on behalf of the deceased in managing business affairs or handling legal matters related to the estate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Personal representative of the deceased employer is an individual or group authorized to act on behalf of a deceased person, particularly concerning financial matters such as paying severance payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Personal representative refers to a person who manages or represents an employer after their death, particularly in matters related to employment and long service payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Personal representative refers to an entity that manages or represents the interests of a deceased employer, often in legal and employment contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Personal representative refers to an individual who takes over responsibilities from a deceased person in legal and contractual matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e17f3710da650d1e14713613a2dff129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a79efc9c7d5b3c5051c209e7d8238e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5d2b28a0cc543e1f646cbc0388c9eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2419e9b08cdfdf99b66599d9de26ba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbef4b639390d1d66289078a98204ee1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 170}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 704}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deceased employer is an individual whose business or role has ended due to death, but responsibilities may continue through personal representatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deceased employer is the individual whose death triggers certain conditions for employment renewal or re-engagement, as outlined by the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deceased employer refers to the original owner or manager of an organization or business entity that no longer exists in its previous form due to the owner's passing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The deceased employer is an individual who has passed away, and their death triggers certain legal actions or obligations regarding the employee's contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e17f3710da650d1e14713613a2dff129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a79efc9c7d5b3c5051c209e7d8238e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2419e9b08cdfdf99b66599d9de26ba7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 170}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 704}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUITABLE EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
