  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION, LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Pneumoconiosis and Mesothelioma (Compensation) Ordinance provides compensation for workers who suffer from pneumoconiosis or mesothelioma as a result of their employment."</data>
