  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"死亡的雇主或雇員 is an event where either the employer or employee has passed away, which can have significant implications for ongoing contracts and legal claims."&lt;SEP&gt;"死亡的雇主或雇員 refers to the event where either the employer or employee has passed away, which can have significant implications for ongoing contracts and legal claims within Employment Protection frameworks."</data>
