<node id="&quot;遺產代理人 (ESTATE ADMINISTRATOR / EXECUTOR)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"遗产管理人是法律上被任命来管理和分配已故雇主财产的人，通常涉及与就业保护法相关的法律程序。"&lt;SEP&gt;"遺產代理人 is a person appointed by law to manage and distribute the estate of someone who has died, often involved in legal proceedings related to Employment Protection laws."</data>
