  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"續訂合約 refers to the process or technology used for extending employment contracts, which can be influenced by changes in labor laws and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"续订合同是指延长劳动合同的过程或技术，这可能受到劳动法律法规和规定的影响。"</data>
