<node id="&quot;再次聘用 (RE-EMPLOYMENT)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"再次聘用 is an event where a previous employee may return to work under new conditions, often subject to legal protections and provisions within Employment Protection frameworks."&lt;SEP&gt;"重新雇佣是前雇员在新条件下返回工作的情况，通常受就业保护法中的法律保护和规定影响。"</data>
