<node id="&quot;訴訟權 (RIGHT TO SUE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"訴訟權 refers to the right of individuals or entities to bring legal action in court, a fundamental aspect of employment protection laws that ensure fair treatment and redress for employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"诉讼权是指个人或实体有权向法院提起诉讼的权利，这是就业保护法中确保员工公平待遇和救济的一个基本方面。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;申索 (CLAIM)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"申索 is an event where one party seeks compensation or other relief from another through formal legal proceedings, often related to Employment Protection claims."&lt;SEP&gt;"索赔是涉及一方寻求从另一方获得赔偿或其他救济的正式法律程序事件，通常与就业保护索赔有关。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8</data>
</node>
