<node id="&quot;POST-TRANSITION EMPLOYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Post-transition employment period is the period of an employee's employment after the transition date under their continuous contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"Post-transition employment period refers to the time after a specific transition point where an employee continues working and is eligible for further long service payment calculations under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term refers to the period after the transition date for a specified employee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0dd3aa2554b81fa47ed2eec0f056d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c7aef455ebf5c49827835bcb4e365e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fc0a2ceb4811e0cf7dd2fae3da572f2</data>
