<node id="&quot;PRE-TRANSITION EMPLOYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pre-transition employment period is defined as the duration of employment before a specified transition point, which affects how long service payments are calculated according to different criteria based on whether it covers at least one month or not."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pre-transition employment period is the period of an employee's employment before the transition date under their continuous contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0dd3aa2554b81fa47ed2eec0f056d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c7aef455ebf5c49827835bcb4e365e9</data>
