  <data key="d1">"Applicable Ceiling refers to the maximum allowable amount for a severance payment based on specified periods in the Seventh Schedule of Table A."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-baf74cd15c802dc378f719fad8fcf7e9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 163}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 678}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRE-TRANSITION PORTION OF THE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pre-Transition Portion of Payment is defined as part of the severance calculation that needs adjustment if it exceeds the applicable ceiling before considering post-transition adjustments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pre-transition portion refers to a part of the long service payment that is calculated before certain changes or transitions, with potential adjustments based on ceiling limits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-baf74cd15c802dc378f719fad8fcf7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ea74deaae12a605f5ea78eff9b6bb9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POST-TRANSITION PORTION OF THE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Post-Transition Portion of Payment refers to another component in the severance calculation, which may be reduced or set to zero based on pre-transition calculations and applicable ceilings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Post-transition portion refers to another part of the long service payment calculated after specific changes or transitions, which may be reduced if pre-transition calculations exceed applicable ceilings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-baf74cd15c802dc378f719fad8fcf7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ea74deaae12a605f5ea78eff9b6bb9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGES DURING THE SPECIFIED PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee's Average Monthly Wages During Specified Period is a concept used for calculating severance payments, averaging employee earnings over a specific time frame."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employee's average monthly wages is a calculation method used in determining parts of the long service payment based on an averaging process over a specific time frame."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-baf74cd15c802dc378f719fad8fcf7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ea74deaae12a605f5ea78eff9b6bb9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 163}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 678}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S AVERAGE DAILY WAGES DURING THE SPECIFIED PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee's Average Daily Wages During Specified Period is another key factor in severance payment calculations, representing an averaged wage per day within a given timeframe."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employee's average daily wages is another calculation method for part of the long service payment, derived by dividing total wages by the number of days in the specified period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-baf74cd15c802dc378f719fad8fcf7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ea74deaae12a605f5ea78eff9b6bb9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 163}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 678}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIFIED PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specified Period refers to the time frame in which submissions, responses, or replies must be made to an adjudicator without being disregarded."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specified period is a defined time frame used in wage calculations and can vary based on employment duration before transition dates or specific events such as elections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified period refers to a defined time frame used for calculating various aspects such as average daily wage or employment duration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified period refers to a defined time frame used in calculations related to severance pay adjustments. It varies based on the employee's pre-privatization employment duration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-515212436640c28d5f467b8b10ac11d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bba63535f02791b0eaca5f64d5b8ed57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-985ae67540622887dd136da808df6b3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8af6b4dc2fe01fb4922af5ea08198c20</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 169}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 700}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;12 MONTHS IMMEDIATELY PRECEDING THE TRANSITION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to a 12-month period right before a specified transition date, crucial for calculating wages under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-515212436640c28d5f467b8b10ac11d7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1990 (41 OF 1990)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 1990 is an organization or legal document that amends employment laws, specifically affecting wage calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-515212436640c28d5f467b8b10ac11d7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JANUARY 1980&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"January 1980 marks a significant date in the context of this text where it affects the inclusion of certain periods in pre-transition employment for wage calculation purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-515212436640c28d5f467b8b10ac11d7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;遣散費的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"遣散費的款額 refers to severance pay amounts, calculated based on specific conditions and formulas provided within the legal framework described."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-515212436640c28d5f467b8b10ac11d7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;指明僱員有權獲得的遣散費款額&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event describes the entitlement of a specified employee to receive severance pay according to certain calculations as outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-515212436640c28d5f467b8b10ac11d7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;A. 該僱員的轉制前僱傭期不少於一個月&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to a situation where the employee's pre-privatization employment period is at least one month, and they receive two-thirds of the final full-month salary or $22,500, whichever is smaller."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a330a959a6c15ba83519889d549f1e3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;B. 該僱員的轉制前僱傭期不足一個月&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to a situation where the employee's pre-privatization employment period is less than one month, and they receive two-thirds of their first full-month salary or $22,500, whichever is smaller."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a330a959a6c15ba83519889d549f1e3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;A. 該僱員的轉制前僱傭期不少於30個正常工作日&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to a situation where the employee's pre-privatization employment period includes at least 30 regular working days, and they receive two-thirds of their selected 18-day salary or $22,500, whichever is smaller."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a330a959a6c15ba83519889d549f1e3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;B. 該僱員的轉制前僱傭期不足30個正常工作日&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to a situation where the employee's pre-privatization employment period includes less than 30 regular working days, and they receive two-thirds of their selected 18-day salary or $22,500, whichever is smaller."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a330a959a6c15ba83519889d549f1e3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;僱員的轉制後僱傭期年數(不足一年的部分按比例計算)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the calculation method for years of post-privatization employment, with fractional parts calculated proportionally."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a330a959a6c15ba83519889d549f1e3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;屬該僱員的整段僱傭期的最後一個月全月工資的三分之二,或$22,500的三分之二,以款額較小者為準&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes the calculation method for determining severance pay based on two-thirds of the final full-month salary or $22,500, whichever is smaller."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a330a959a6c15ba83519889d549f1e3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;由該僱員選取的18日(須從在整段僱傭期內該僱員最後工作的30個正常工作日中選取任何18日)為依據的18日工資&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes the calculation method for determining severance pay based on 18 days' salary, selected from any of the last 30 regular working days within the entire employment period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a330a959a6c15ba83519889d549f1e3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;由該僱員選取的18日(須從在整段僱傭期內該僱員最先工作的30個正常工作日中選取任何18日)為依據的18日工資&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This describes the calculation method for determining severance pay based on 18 days' salary, selected from any of the first 30 regular working days within the entire employment period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a330a959a6c15ba83519889d549f1e3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;18日工資&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"18日工资是指从员工最后工作的30个正常工作日内选取任意18天的工资，用于计算遣散费。"</data>
