<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1990&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 'Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 1990' is a legal document that has provisions affecting employment terms and conditions, particularly regarding severance pay."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 1990 is a legal document that modifies certain sections to affect the calculation of wages and benefits for employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 1990 is a legal document that outlines the rules and regulations for long service payments in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the '1990年僱傭(修訂)條例', which is a legal amendment affecting wage calculations and long service payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c5336f48f2648be18accb456b032c71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8af6b4dc2fe01fb4922af5ea08198c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-772d5b97625d81ec1623236fca58771c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c7aef455ebf5c49827835bcb4e365e9</data>
