</node>
<node id="&quot;ORS BENEFITS (EMPLOYER-FUNDED ORS BENEFITS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BENEFIT TYPE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"ORS benefits are part of the employment contract that provide retirement plan interests funded by the employer. They may be either mandatory or voluntary, and can include both basic and specified portions."&lt;SEP&gt;"ORS benefits refer to employer-funded occupational retirement scheme benefits that may impact the reduction of severance payments under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b6ca736f121ac163d07969e939b811f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38034baf57d26ec704e02e12e81cdf6a</data>
