<node id="&quot;MONTHLY PAID EMPLOYEE&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">SOCIAL SCIENCES</data>
  <data key="d1">"Monthly paid employee describes an individual whose salary is calculated on a monthly basis, which affects how their pre-privatization service years are converted into the long-service money amount."</data>
