</node>
<node id="&quot;30 REGULAR WORKING DAYS&quot;|">
  <data key="d0">MATHEMATICS</data>
  <data key="d1">"30 regular working days refers to a standard period used in calculating long-term service fund amounts for employees with less than one month of pre-privatization employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9661724896688b8cd0643c1a0b2fa146</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;附表7表A第1栏所指明的期间内&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"附表7表A第1栏所指明的期间是一个特定的时间段，在此时间段内长期服务金款额不能超过该表格在相应位置列出的上限。"</data>
