  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are sections of a document that have been modified to include specific conditions for the deduction of remuneration and benefits from long-service bonuses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3950c75e15e51a9aa6482b52fbd5f985</data>
