<node id="&quot;僱主供款職業退休計劃利益&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employer-funded occupational pension benefits are part of ORS benefits, which can affect long service payments according to the conditions outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"僱主供款職業退休計劃利益是指因雇员死亡而乙方根据雇佣合同有权获得的职业退休计划的利益。"</data>
