</node>
<node id="&quot;強積金計劃權益&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contributory rights within a mandatory provident fund scheme refer to individual employee's financial interests that may be impacted by certain legal or contractual provisions related to long service payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"強積金計劃權益指的是雇員在強制性公积金制度下的权益，可能涉及多個僱主供款的計劃。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-233de206d4d440690ca3d19bf8ddb77c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c0794da631cfd39500d26a03a02ecf</data>
