  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employer-funded ORS (Occupational Retirement Scheme) benefits refer to retirement-related financial support offered by the employer based on employment contracts and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employer-funded ORS benefits are financial benefits funded by the employer and may be subject to reduction if attributable to the same years of service as a long service payment."</data>
