  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employer-funded MPFS (Multi-Storey Premises Fire Safety) benefits are related to fire safety measures provided as part of an employee's contract or benefits package."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employer-funded MPFS benefits refer to specific types of financial benefits provided by employers, potentially related to mandatory provident fund schemes."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are specific types of benefits funded by employers, including those related to employment contracts and occupational pension plans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27ca5e1e28067ca3c2334e15e6221974&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c87228f0b6f2f82336ca7700cb45e5d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f087949a68abbda398ef78592fe5cb12</data>
