<node id="&quot;PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Party' refers to a party involved in an arbitration agreement or proceeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Party refers to an individual or entity involved in arbitration proceedings and is required not to unreasonably delay the pursuit of their claim."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Party refers to entities participating in adjudication proceedings, which can be organizations or individuals, and their roles include initiating or participating in such processes for various reasons."&lt;SEP&gt;"A party in the context of adjudication can refer to any entity or individual involved, such as a company, organization, or person participating in disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A party may be liable to pay an adjudicated amount according to the determination of an adjudicator."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties are entities involved in arbitration proceedings that have the right to request decisions on challenges to arbitrators or termination of mandates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties are individuals or organizations involved in disputes that can be resolved through arbitration. They include both claimants and respondents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Party here refers to individuals or entities involved in a dispute, who may be notified of arbitrations or have their cases arbitrated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59f65136a37f2183ac96641ebb7819e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b49150680872ebc6da3ccdee23b5d249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d869f809c494e89028b24de4ba24f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aba64861ea22070188d9b7dd4c0fd47a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f6f1173170ce4ac811fedab280f3b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-854d00c33e69aed0258675abc1e2d264</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 245}]</data>
</node>
