<node id="&quot;MAINLAND AWARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Mainland award is a legal decision from the mainland that can be enforced in Hong Kong under specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Mainland award is defined as a decision made in accordance with the People's Republic of China Arbitration Law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mainland award is a term used here for clarity but does not specify which legal context it pertains to; it could refer to awards from mainland China or another specific region under similar legal frameworks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mainland award is an arbitration decision made according to the 'People's Republic of China Arbitration Law'."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4f6f1173170ce4ac811fedab280f3b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08d5d6b1196500a57db7811d96c91750&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcca397988541ca9ac3822ff7a363627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3136488efa6b0856e563bdafbaaa1633</data>
