<node id="&quot;THE ARBITRAL AUTHORITY OR THE ARBITRAL PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The arbitral authority refers to the body that conducts arbitration proceedings, while the arbitral procedure includes rules and methods for conducting such hearings. These are crucial elements in ensuring fair dispute resolution processes."</data>
