<node id="&quot;THE NEW YORK CONVENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The New York Convention, also known as the United Nations Commission on International Trade Law (UNCITRAL) Model Law on International Commercial Arbitration, refers to an international treaty that governs the recognition and enforcement of arbitral awards in signatory countries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-603a9b33a6e3900af70fd439592326ba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 429}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CROWN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Crown is a term used in Hong Kong's legal system to refer to the government or executive authority. In this context, it likely involves decisions made by administrative bodies like the Chief Executive and the Executive Council."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-603a9b33a6e3900af70fd439592326ba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 155}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 663}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONVENTION ON THE RECOGNITION AND ENFORCEMENT OF FOREIGN ARBITRAL AWARDS (NEW YORK CONVENTION)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event refers to an international treaty that sets out rules for recognizing and enforcing arbitral awards made in one signatory state by a tribunal constituted in another, provided certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-603a9b33a6e3900af70fd439592326ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CANTONESE TRANSLATION OF 'THE NEW YORK CONVENTION'&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document or legal text translated into Cantonese to facilitate understanding among the local population regarding international arbitration agreements and their enforcement procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-603a9b33a6e3900af70fd439592326ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CANTONAL GOVERNMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the government body responsible for implementing policies related to international law, including conventions like The New York Convention."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-603a9b33a6e3900af70fd439592326ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW ON INTERNATIONAL COMMERCIAL ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The UNCITRAL Model Law on International Commercial Arbitration is a legal framework adopted by the United Nations Commission on International Trade Law, providing guidelines for international commercial arbitration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UNCITRAL model law provides guidelines for the recognition and enforcement of international arbitral awards, aiming to harmonize arbitration laws across different jurisdictions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603a9b33a6e3900af70fd439592326ba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 70}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CANTONESE TRANSLATION OF 'INTERNATIONAL COMMERCIAL ARBITRATION'&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document or legal text translated into Cantonese explaining the principles and procedures of International Commercial Arbitration for local understanding."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-603a9b33a6e3900af70fd439592326ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CANTONAL GOVERNMENT'S LEGAL DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
