<node id="&quot;THE CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Chief Executive in Council is an organization responsible for making orders under the New York Convention regarding party states or territories."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed6ba602b145c3cd359dd6dda74e3b40</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 819}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATE OR TERRITORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A State or territory is any geographical area declared as a party to the New York Convention through an order made by The Chief Executive in Council."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed6ba602b145c3cd359dd6dda74e3b40</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 230}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 819}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINLAND AWARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mainland Awards are legal documents related to arbitration awards from mainland regions that can be enforced under specific conditions within Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mainland awards are decisions or rulings from mainland regions that may need enforcement according to certain conditions and timeframes mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mainland awards are legal decisions or agreements that may be enforced under specific conditions, as outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mainland awards refer to arbitration decisions made in mainland regions, which may face restrictions on enforcement under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7002524f6a8a76d0aa6007df37e1ac1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47762eabb07bb9265d79611ab6fc55f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6ba602b145c3cd359dd6dda74e3b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fdd2bff76f50fe6b943f4fd79b5f894</data>
