</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 84&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 84 refers to a specific section in the applicable laws that governs how certain awards are enforced and applies similarly to Mainland awards for enforcement purposes."</data>
