<node id="&quot;ARBITRAL PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arbitral procedure is a set of rules or methods used in arbitration for resolving disputes between parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arbitral procedure refers to the process of resolving disputes through arbitration, which is governed by specific legal agreements and laws."</data>
