<node id="&quot;HONG KONG LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hong Kong Law refers to the legal framework within which disputes are resolved, particularly in relation to arbitration and public policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hong Kong law is implied in the text as a reference for legal procedures, particularly regarding arbitration and enforcement policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The law of Hong Kong is mentioned in the context of determining if a matter is capable of settlement by arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47762eabb07bb9265d79611ab6fc55f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75abbf9735ce9959e08a7259663fa08d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53aea00b88989df2a0f5c9c8eaf66aa</data>
