  <data key="d2">chunk-47762eabb07bb9265d79611ab6fc55f6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;92-95 PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions 92 through 95 are mentioned as part of the legal framework governing Mainland awards enforcement but do not apply to certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47762eabb07bb9265d79611ab6fc55f6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REJECTION OF ARBITRATION AWARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rejection of an arbitration award is a specific event where such decisions may be denied enforcement based on public policy or other grounds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47762eabb07bb9265d79611ab6fc55f6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEPARATION OF ARBITRAL AND UNRELATED DECISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the process in which only parts of an award that pertain to submitted matters can be enforced, while non-submitted (unrelated) decisions cannot."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47762eabb07bb9265d79611ab6fc55f6</data>
</node>
