  <data key="d1">"The Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2000 (2 of 2000) is a legal document that amends the existing arbitration laws, providing rules for enforcing awards in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2000 is a legal document that amended the existing laws related to arbitration, including provisions for enforcement."</data>
