</node>
<node id="&quot;仲裁 (ARBITRATION)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT, PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arbitration is a legal process where parties agree to have an impartial third party make decisions on disputes between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'arbitration' refers to the process of resolving disputes through binding decisions by arbitrators, which is a key topic discussed throughout the text regarding enforcement and conditions for certain awards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7002524f6a8a76d0aa6007df37e1ac1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0dd7c47ebdb02fb1d905b0c712a8bd</data>
</node>
