</node>
<node id="&quot;ENFORCEMENT PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Enforcement Proceedings refer to legal actions taken to enforce a Macao Award, either in Macao or other places except Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enforcement proceedings involve actions taken to enforce rights conferred under the Patents Ordinance, particularly in relation to short-term patents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ec95a82e50ec8c3adae1748b384fca48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8322a8472d188ae5550ad46529f8b37b</data>
