  <data key="d2">chunk-bf0dd7c47ebdb02fb1d905b0c712a8bd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;仲裁的一方 (PARTY TO AN ARBITRATION)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION, ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A party to an arbitration is one of the entities involved in resolving disputes through this legal process as defined by relevant laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf0dd7c47ebdb02fb1d905b0c712a8bd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;香港以外的司法管轄區 (JURISDICTION OUTSIDE HONG KONG) (OF THE LEGAL PRACTITIONERS ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION, JURISDICTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jurisdictions other than Hong Kong refer to areas governed by different laws and regulations from those in Hong Kong as recognized under specific sections of relevant legislation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf0dd7c47ebdb02fb1d905b0c712a8bd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIVISION 4—CODE OF PRACTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Division 4 is a section that introduces the Code of Practice, which sets out guidelines and standards expected from third-party funders in arbitration-related activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-087a07092efc881959ad458909cb8527</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1120}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THIRD PARTY FUNDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Third Party Funders are entities involved in funding arbitration proceedings, required to follow specific practices and standards as outlined by a code of practice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Third party funders are entities or individuals that provide financial support for arbitration proceedings, as described by the code of practice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Third party funders are entities that provide arbitration funding and must adhere to specific procedures and capital requirements as outlined in the code of practice."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a96252983055863ad83c00cacd5a42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-087a07092efc881959ad458909cb8527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24bcba17e89155ad11eeca80dd981ea9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1119}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSULTANCY FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consultancy Firm is a professional service provider whose details are to be provided by the Third Party Funder to the funded party for independent legal advice before entering into an agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-319ab10afb64c747e7339427a06f0a41</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 411}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1116}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARBITRATION SUPPORT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arbitration Support Agreement is a document outlining the terms of financial assistance for an arbitration process, including control rights, liability clauses, termination conditions, and conflict resolution mechanisms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-319ab10afb64c747e7339427a06f0a41</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 411}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1118}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONFLICT OF INTEREST MANAGEMENT PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conflict of Interest Management Procedures are effective processes established by the Third Party Funder to handle potential conflicts of interest that may arise during the funding period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-319ab10afb64c747e7339427a06f0a41</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 411}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1118}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLAINT HANDLING MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Complaint Handling Mechanism is a procedure set up by the Third Party Funder for funded parties to lodge and enforce meaningful remedies against any complaints raised, ensuring transparency and accountability in dispute resolution processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-319ab10afb64c747e7339427a06f0a41</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 411}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1118}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSULTANCY INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Consultancy Institution is an organization that receives reports from third party funders regarding their activities and compliance with the code of practice."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a96252983055863ad83c00cacd5a42b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1119}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROMOTIONAL MATERIAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Promotional Material refers to marketing content related to third-party funding of arbitration, required to be clear and not misleading according to the code of practice."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a96252983055863ad83c00cacd5a42b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1119}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVERSE COSTS, INSURANCE PREMIUMS, SECURITY FOR COSTS, OTHER FINANCIAL LIABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are financial liabilities that third party funders or associated persons may be liable for under funding agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a96252983055863ad83c00cacd5a42b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1119}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERMINATION OF FUNDING AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event where parties to a funding agreement can terminate the agreement based on specific conditions, and third party funders might withhold arbitration funding under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a96252983055863ad83c00cacd5a42b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1119}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEPENDENT LEGAL ADVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Independent Legal Advice is recommended for funded parties before entering into funding agreements to ensure they understand their rights and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a96252983055863ad83c00cacd5a42b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1119}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNDED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funded parties refer to individuals or organizations receiving funds from third party funders for legal representation, required to obtain independent legal advice before entering into agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24bcba17e89155ad11eeca80dd981ea9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1121}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REALMS BEYOND STARS AND STRIPES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is an abstract concept referring metaphorically to the unknown or distant regions from which funding agreements may originate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24bcba17e89155ad11eeca80dd981ea9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC CONSULTATION PROCESS FOR ISSUING PRACTICAL GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The public consultation process involves seeking input on proposed guidelines before their official release, ensuring transparency and stakeholder engagement in the development of legal frameworks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24bcba17e89155ad11eeca80dd981ea9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1121}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTHORISED INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Authorised Institution is an entity responsible for drafting and publishing codes of practice or practical guidelines after consulting with relevant experts and stakeholders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24bcba17e89155ad11eeca80dd981ea9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1121}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC CONSULTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public Consultation refers to the process where the public can provide feedback on proposed codes of practice before they are finalized and published."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c30afb3b53c21887cbdb5f0083639960</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 50}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 413}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1120}]</data>
</node>
