  <data key="d1">"This division refers to additional measures or safeguards within the legal framework, which may include various procedural or compliance requirements for different industries or sectors."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to a section in an unspecified document or legislation that deals with additional measures and safeguards, but has yet to be applied."</data>
