<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Government bodies are public organizations responsible for managing various aspects of governance, often mentioned as recipients or subjects of information disclosure under certain regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Government body refers to any governmental organization that may receive communicated information, as per legal obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a252d91181bacec6fcd6f1d54297b19a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4158bcd358cce62e9937de8896e1ba0b</data>
