</node>
<node id="&quot;营业地点最密切的营业地&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The most closely related business location, as defined in Article 1(4)(a), is used when a party has multiple business locations for determining jurisdictional aspects of disputes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;本条第(3)款&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 1(3) defines the conditions under which an arbitration can be considered international, including parties having their business locations in different countries or other specified circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;与争议事项关系最密切的地点&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The place most closely related to the dispute, as defined in Article 1(3)(b), is used for determining jurisdictional aspects of disputes when a party does not have an established business location."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;本条第(4)款&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 1(4) defines how to determine the most closely related business location, especially in cases where a party has multiple locations or no fixed place of business."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;商事关系的大部分义务履行地&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The main performance site of commercial relations, as defined in Article 1(3)(b)(ii), is used for determining jurisdictional aspects when it is not the most closely related location to the dispute."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;一个以上的国家有关&quot; (第1条4款C项)">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 1(3)(c) defines that an arbitration can be considered international if all parties agree that the subject matter of the agreement involves more than one country."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;本法之规定,除第8、9、17H、17I、17J、35及36条外&quot; (第1条2款)">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"According to Article 1(2), the provisions of this law apply only when the place of arbitration is within the country's territory, except for Articles 8, 9, 17H, 17I, 17J, 35 and 36."</data>
