<node id="&quot;CONTRACTUAL OBLIGATION (合同義務)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Contractual Obligation refers to duties and responsibilities outlined in a contract that parties must adhere to, including payment obligations under a construction agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Contractual Obligation refers to the duties and responsibilities of parties as outlined in a contract, which may include arbitration agreements for resolving disputes related to that contractual relationship."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 234}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 866}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIM STATEMENT AND DEFENSE STATEMENT (索賠聲明和抗辯聲明)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Claim Statement and Defense Statement are documents where one party makes claims against another and the other responds with a defense, potentially forming part of an arbitration agreement if both parties acknowledge its existence."</data>
