<node id="&quot;WRITTEN FORM (書面形式)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Written Form refers to any form of documentation that records agreements or provisions in a tangible manner for future reference and enforcement, including electronic communications as defined above."</data>
