<node id="&quot;COURT REFERRAL PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The court referral procedure refers to the process where a party requests that the dispute be referred to arbitration after initiating litigation in matters subject to an arbitration agreement, unless the court determines the agreement is invalid, unenforceable, or incapable of being performed."</data>
