</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OR OTHER INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Courts or other institutions have the authority to decide on whether to terminate an arbitrator’s mandate in cases where there is controversy regarding the reasons for termination."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or other institution is responsible for designating arbitrators when parties fail to agree on the process, ensuring that arbitration can proceed without delay."</data>
