  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arbitration with three arbitrators is a method of resolving disputes where each party selects one arbitrator and the third is selected by mutual agreement or court appointment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4487876b424618c4533648d46889bd3</data>
