<node id="&quot;PROCEDURE FOR APPLYING FOR RECUSAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Procedure for Applying for Recusal is a process defined either by mutual agreement between parties or specified in this text, through which one party can challenge another's appointment as an arbitrator if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-963f917b5a00c96d5b43bd1832480a19</data>
