</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 17D&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 17D outlines provisions for modifying, suspending, or terminating interim measures and preliminary orders in specific circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a8aef97985d67c64a247cd4ac0838cb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 341}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTY REQUESTING AN INTERIM MEASURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON/ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a party that applies for or requests the grant of an interim measure from the arbitral tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 899}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTY APPLYING FOR A PRELIMINARY ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person or entity that applies to the arbitral tribunal for a preliminary order, required to disclose relevant circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to a party that seeks the issuance of a preliminary order, which may be required to provide security as per the arbitral tribunal's discretion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
