</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 17D. MODIFICATION, SUSPENSION, TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This article outlines events related to modifying, suspending, or terminating interim measures and preliminary orders granted by the arbitral tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 899}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 17E. PROVISION OF SECURITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This article describes an event where the arbitral tribunal may require parties requesting interim measures to provide appropriate security."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 896}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 17F. DISCLOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This article details events related to disclosure obligations, requiring parties to disclose material changes in circumstances relevant to interim and preliminary orders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 899}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The arbitral tribunal is an organization responsible for making decisions on disputes and issuing interim measures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 896}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERIM MEASURE OR PRELIMINARY ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to temporary actions or orders issued by the arbitral tribunal during an arbitration proceeding."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 896}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COSTS AND DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS,SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to financial losses incurred as a result of interim measures or orders, which may be claimed for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 896}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 41, SECTION 42&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION,EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections are part of the legal framework governing arbitration and provide specific rules related to costs, damages, and interim measures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THIRD PARTY RIGHTS PROTECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The protection of third party rights refers to measures taken to safeguard the interests and legal claims of parties not directly involved in the arbitration proceedings, ensuring a fair balance during interim enforcement procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-610c6dec3dfd2d606eea19c4dfbadfa7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 897}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1207}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 17H&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 17H is an event or provision within international arbitration law that outlines the recognition and enforcement process for interim measures issued by arbitral tribunals."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-610c6dec3dfd2d606eea19c4dfbadfa7</data>
</node>
