  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This section discusses the procedural mechanism for court-issued interim measures in relation to arbitration, similar to those in regular court proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06afdeae20298d16d6b6fe33975e54ea</data>
