  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This chapter outlines the procedural conduct for arbitral proceedings, ensuring equal treatment among parties and providing them with opportunities to present their cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06afdeae20298d16d6b6fe33975e54ea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 46(2) AND (3)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sections 46(2) and (3) are noted to replace Section 18 from a previous version, indicating changes or updates in the legal framework."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06afdeae20298d16d6b6fe33975e54ea</data>
