</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 46&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 46 is a legal provision that must be followed by the Arbitral Tribunal; failure to comply with this section can lead to challenges in arbitral awards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 46 is referenced as containing provisions that override certain parts of the示范法, highlighting modifications or replacements within the legal document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06afdeae20298d16d6b6fe33975e54ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e</data>
