  <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 2015 Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance is a piece of legislation enacted in 2015, which amends the original arbitration rules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 331}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;生效日期 (COMMENCEMENT DATE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The commencement date refers to July 17, 2015, when the 2015 Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance came into effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 331}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;相關程序 (ALL RELATED PROCEEDINGS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All related proceedings include arbitration procedures and any subsequent actions or decisions made in relation to an arbitration case."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 331}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;原本條例 (PRE-AMENDED ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The pre-amended Ordinance refers to the original version of the Arbitration Rules before the 2015 amendment took effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 27}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 331}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;仲裁程序及相關程序的進行 (CONDUCT OF ARBITRAL AND RELATED PROCEEDINGS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This section outlines how arbitration procedures should be conducted, especially in relation to cases that started before a certain date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2015年7月17日 (JULY 17, 2015)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specific date when the new legislation came into effect and how it affects ongoing arbitration procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARBITRATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2015 (11 OF 2015)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2015 is a legal document that amended the existing arbitration laws, coming into effect on July 17, 2015."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 431}]</data>
