  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2017 is a legal document that further amended the arbitration laws, as indicated by its addition in section 7 of the 2017 legislation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAVINGS AND TRANSITIONAL PROVISIONS RELATING TO ARBITRATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2017&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These provisions are part of a legal document that outlines how existing arbitration cases will be handled after amendments, specifically addressing the transition period post-2015."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 431}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JULY 17, 2015&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This date marks the commencement of the Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2015, which had a significant impact on existing arbitration procedures and related proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PART 3 ADDED BY S. 7 OF 2017&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This part is an addition to the legislation made in 2017, specifically addressing savings and transitional provisions for arbitration matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 431}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE PRE-AMENDED ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The pre-amended Ordinance refers to the version of this ordinance that was in effect before January 1, 2018, and continues to apply unless otherwise agreed by parties involved in an arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 236}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 881}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1198}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SETTING ASIDE OF THE AWARD IN THE ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Setting aside of the award in the arbitration is an event that can lead to related proceedings being resumed or continued after a decision has been made and potentially challenged."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 236}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 881}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1198}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMENCEMENT DATE: 1 JANUARY 2018.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The commencement date marks when specific provisions, such as Part 11A, come into effect, affecting how arbitration and related proceedings are conducted from that point onward."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 236}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 881}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1198}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY SECURITY OF PAYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Construction Industry Security of Payment Ordinance is a legal document that provides definitions and regulations for payment security in the construction industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Construction Industry Security of Payment Ordinance is an ordinance designed to facilitate the recovery of payments under construction contracts and provide mechanisms for resolving payment disputes quickly through adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3af7bc872d7fc7932c078771ff368e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f191206611c2d612e34771fce129216e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 435}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUILDING INDUSTRY (SECURITY OF PAYMENTS) ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to a legal framework, not specifically an organization but related to regulations governing the building industry in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3af7bc872d7fc7932c078771ff368e80</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 435}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjudication Proceedings are formal processes conducted by an adjudicator to resolve disputes, subject to specific powers and duties as defined in relevant sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings are formal processes for resolving Payment Disputes as per the terms specified in the Construction Contract, involving selected Nominating Bodies or bodies nominated by Claimants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings are legal processes where disputes, particularly in construction contracts, are resolved through a third-party determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings are ongoing legal processes that claiming party must not include in payment claim as per regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings are the formal process through which payment disputes are resolved by an adjudicator."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings are the processes conducted by an adjudicator to resolve payment disputes and related matters, following specific guidelines and powers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings is a mechanism for resolving payment disputes under certain construction contracts quickly and efficiently."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings refer to a process where disputes are resolved by an appointed adjudicator, involving fees, expenses, and costs that need to be paid according to specific rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings refer to formal dispute resolution processes initiated by claimants against respondents through written notices and selected arbitrators."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Proceedings refer to legal processes where an adjudicator makes determinations on disputes, and considerations for costs are based on various factors such as success in proceedings and reasonableness of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication proceedings are legal processes where disputes or claims are resolved by an impartial third party, leading to a determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication proceedings refer to formal processes where decisions or judgments are made based on evidence and arguments presented, often involving a fee for services related to these procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication proceedings refer to formal processes where disputes are resolved through an adjudicator's determination of payment issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication proceedings refer to the process where a neutral third party makes a binding decision on a payment dispute submitted by parties involved in a construction contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proceedings during which an adjudicator determines a payment dispute based on documents, evidence, and information available to them when certain failures occur, as described by the legislation provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of adjudicating payment disputes related to or arising from a construction contract, which is not affected by submission in court or other dispute resolution procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ea4a40e2dfeb073559acd2aab072a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3af7bc872d7fc7932c078771ff368e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b7d543744ae8aafbe46746751935e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e060ad7c0dcaf66b5c6e6d5a4b6243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f87d18cc47acf07db6f5458960b21f19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-304365a41d317ba2bf7cdd71b9dcffa2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d30ea89e5165c3d71c14d8648bf53596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80fae333d21f2886ed576bdc768e41f7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 224}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 804}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1185}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Development Authority refers to the Development Bureau and its officials involved in construction-related matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-622e9afcf96894f3c8695345444428d3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 373}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1073}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPATION PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document issued in relation to a building that contains a residential unit allowing its occupation. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupation Permit is a document issued according to the Buildings Ordinance (Cap. 123) or by the House Authorities, certifying that a building has been completed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-622e9afcf96894f3c8695345444428d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 218}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 780}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUILDING WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Building Work refers to the activities of constructing buildings as defined in Article 3, including both labor and supply of related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-622e9afcf96894f3c8695345444428d3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 290}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 967}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1210}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any building that is specifically designated as such according to the law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any building, structure or works specified in Schedule 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specified Structure refers to any building, construction, or engineering facilities listed in Appendix 2."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 222}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 800}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Goods and services directly related to construction work under a contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Goods and Services are defined as per Article 6 of the relevant document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Goods and Services include items or services that are integral to the construction work but may also be supplied separately in some cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Goods and Services include materials, components, machinery, equipment, transportation services, manpower resources, and other services directly supporting construction work."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related goods and services include materials, supplies, and other items necessary for the completion of a construction project, which may also have conditions that affect applicability under this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d64bf6870cd28991e3919d0bb4b5dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed725f04c7bcd4c7d2f5a1a4787af6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 222}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 797}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Nominating Body is an entity that can be selected to appoint an adjudicator in case of a payment dispute, either specified or chosen from potential bodies."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Nominating Body is an organization designated to nominate and appoint adjudicators in the context of construction contract disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Nominating Body is an organization responsible for establishing and maintaining a panel of individuals, nominating adjudicators, regulating adjudication proceedings, making codes of conduct, providing training, and performing other functions as specified by the Ordinance or Secretary."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Nominating Body is an organization that approaches individuals for possible appointment as adjudicators in relation to payment disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Nominating Body is mentioned but no specific details are provided about its role or characteristics."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Nominating Body is specified within the construction contract and plays a crucial role in selecting an arbitrator for dispute resolution; it must be named or nominated according to section 27(2)."&lt;SEP&gt;"A group selected by either respondents under section 27(3)(a) or claimants under section 27(4)(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nominating body is a group or entity whose function includes being registered, having its registration suspended or canceled, and providing documents or information related to its operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nominating body is an entity responsible for providing training and managing adjudicators as per the Ordinance, including charging fees related to services provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nominating body refers to an entity specified or selected for resolving payment disputes under a construction contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nominating body refers to an organization responsible for appointing adjudicators and setting rules for their conduct during proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nominating Body is a role or status that a body corporate may be registered for, involving functions such as nominating and appointing adjudicators."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nominating Body refers to a legal entity listed in the register established and maintained according to Section 62(1)(b)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nominating Body refers to an organization or group whose consent and methods for service are specified by law, particularly concerning adjudication notices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Nominating Body is responsible for appointing the adjudicator and charging related fees and expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nominating body is responsible for nominating and appointing an adjudicator under specific sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nominating body is responsible for proposing and appointing an adjudicator if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-705ea4a40e2dfeb073559acd2aab072a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89bbff8bbf3f0985059cdccf2a6fe747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1611b0ccefada6387970ed4d17809f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4537b3223942fe128431f147e0b27414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ace38a89f19c657876dcff9d5f230c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71987cb00c98805ab9ed06eb948af233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-169c5c3921ad759a4d5a8b8e69511b19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d296364c6fb1e176227c199c33f148d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b53857aed1787aca531dea0f456e8ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1901c04f5d127d84848a2cd1cbc4a1bd</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 221}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 795}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A progress payment is a type of payment made according to the construction contract with specific deadlines for both admission and fulfillment by the paying party."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of payment for construction work or related services under a contract, including one-off, interim, and final payments triggered by events or dates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Progress Payment is a type of payment made during the course of a project based on completed work or milestones, often subject to specific timelines and claims procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Progress Payment refers to interim payments made during construction work based on completed milestones or phases of the project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Progress Payment refers to partial payments made during construction work, subject to certain conditions regarding defects or non-conformance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Progress Payment refers to payments made for work carried out or goods and services supplied in accordance with a construction contract, including one-time payments, interim payments, final installments, and amounts due on the occurrence of an event or by a specified date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Progress Payments refer to interim payments made during the course of a construction project for work completed up until that point."&lt;SEP&gt;"Progress payment here refers to interim payments made during construction projects based on completed work phases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Progress payment is an amount payable under a construction contract at intervals during the course of work as progress is made towards completion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ad2f770d3edd7fc8b6985f3040077779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0af4d7e54b59f5f639294394f679c069&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3978c9d363a5060a5f5dafe37f64fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dc61c3e9d0b909249e0a6492fb80f00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd1eddc6f0faa7cf197a030cc7a29b94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c90a7be5c9755cdde83e35c88dd2f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 218}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 776}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUDICATED AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT/MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjudicated Amount is the amount determined according to Article 42."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudicated Amount is the amount determined through the adjudication process, which must be paid according to legal obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Adjudicated Amount refers to a specific amount determined by an adjudication process, which must be paid in full before certain conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Adjudicated Amount refers to the amount determined by an adjudicator that the respondent must pay to the claimant under a construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-143b0fa3beba6c5913ea9659f090c4b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6edcec90a44956192e9747946f6d5481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d229505b95cc3e576d9ad034318c66d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 219}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 785}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMITTED AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Admitted Amount is the amount that the paying party agrees or proposes to pay for the claimed services or goods, based on their assessment of the claim."&lt;SEP&gt;"Admitted Amount refers to the amount admitted as per Section 19(2)(c)(i) of the relevant document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Admitted Amount is a portion or full acknowledgment of debt by the respondent towards the claimant as part of a payment dispute, also required details in an adjudication notice."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98b9cc96db8e2ffdc374754939531431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 223}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PANEL OF ADJUDICATORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A panel of adjudicators consists of a group of trained individuals selected by the nominating body to make decisions or judgments based on evidence presented during proceedings, often involving fees for their inclusion in such panels."&lt;SEP&gt;"An organization established and maintained by a nominating body to adjudicate disputes under section 64(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Panel of Adjudicators refers to the list established and maintained by a nominating body as per Section 64(a)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 217}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 770}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1180}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUDICATION RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjudication Rules are guidelines or procedures that Nominating Bodies must follow when appointing an Adjudicator."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjudication Rules refer to the regulations set up by a nominating body for conducting adjudication procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1611b0ccefada6387970ed4d17809f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 221}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 795}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;審裁員&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"審裁員是指裁定付款爭議的個人。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;提名團體&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"提名團體指根據第64(a)條設立和維持名單的組織，以及被挑選進行相關程序的組織。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;審裁規則&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"審裁規則是指某提名團體就如何進行審裁程序而訂立的規則。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;審裁通知&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"審裁通知是根據第25(1)條發出的通知，涉及付款爭議的信息。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;審裁程序&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"審裁程序是指按照第3部審裁某付款爭議的過程。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;擁有人&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"擁有人指符合特定條件的人，包括與另一人訂立建造合約並進行相關工作的個人或供應商。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;獲選團體&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"獲選團體是指答辯人根據第27(3)(a)條挑選的提名團體或是申索人根據第27(4)(a)條挑選的提名團體。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;總私人承包合約&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"總私人承包合約是指根據特定法例訂立的主要私營合同，涉及建築工程等內容。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;現有住宅單位&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"現有住宅單位指符合特定條件的住宅單位，包括在某建築物進行相關建築工程並獲豁免證明書的單位。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;现有住宅单位&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"现有住宅单位指的是某个建筑内的居住单元，涉及建筑工程豁免证明书等相关规定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;地政总署署长&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"地政总署署长负责发出通知或合格证书以确认土地的使用情况。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;《建筑物条例(新界适用)条例》(第121章)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY, REGULATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"该条例涉及建筑工程豁免证明书的相关规定，影响住宅单位占用许可。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;地政总署&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"地政总署负责发出通知或合格证书以确认土地的使用情况。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;《审裁规则》&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY, REGULATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"《审裁规则》是关于审裁程序的规定，由相关机构制定并执行。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;审裁员&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"审裁员是指根据Part 3被任命来决定支付争议的个人。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;申索方&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"申索方 is an individual or organization that makes a claim for payment according to section 18(1) of the regulation, initiating the dispute process."&lt;SEP&gt;"申索方是发起仲裁程序的一方，可以是个体或组织。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16c32b6c243652a8ef2eb45cb49c1e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;经审裁款额 (ADJUDICATED AMOUNT)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS, CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"经审裁款额是指根据第42条确定的金额。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;审裁通知 (ADJUDICATION NOTICE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY, REGULATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"审裁通知是关于支付争议仲裁程序的规定，见第25(1)条。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;审裁程序 (ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT, PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"审裁程序是指根据Part 3发起的支付争议仲裁过程。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;《审裁规则》 (ADJUDICATION RULES)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY, REGULATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"《审裁规则》是相关机构为进行仲裁程序制定的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;建造合約 (CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT, TECHNOLOGY, INDUSTRY"</data>
