  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Buildings Ordinance (Cap. 123) is a legal document mentioned regarding approvals for commencement of specific construction works."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Buildings Ordinance is another legal document related to buildings in Hong Kong, providing the basis for issuing occupation permits or temporary occupation permits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06e739d62dd19f34a46b38a2c7902502&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
