<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 57)">
  <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employment Ordinance (Cap. 57) is referenced for defining an employee's status as per Hong Kong law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06e739d62dd19f34a46b38a2c7902502</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VALUE OF THE CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Value of the construction work refers to the monetary assessment used in calculating payments under a construction contract."</data>
