</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSIDERATION PAYABLE FOR CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consideration payable for construction work is related to how payment for building services or goods should be calculated, potentially exempting from this ordinance based on specific provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 222}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 797}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;A CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT TO THE EXTENT THAT IT CONTAINS PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific event in a construction contract where certain clauses or agreements are made regarding payment methods and work scope potentially exempting from the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 228}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROVISIONS UNDER WHICH THE CONSIDERATION PAYABLE FOR CONSTRUCTION WORK IS TO BE CALCULATED OTHERWISE THAN BY REFERENCE TO THE VALUE OF THE CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions that specify alternative calculation methods for payments, not based on the direct valuation of the construction work itself, potentially exempting from this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 228}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;A CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT TO THE EXTENT THAT IT IS FOR WORK CARRIED OUT OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A condition where a construction contract involves work being done in locations other than Hong Kong, which may be excluded under certain provisions of the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL PRIVATE WORKS CONTRACT (OR ITS SUBCONTRACT)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Total private works contract refers to an overarching agreement for building projects that may include subcontracts, and conditions related to specific types of construction sites can affect applicability under this ordinance."</data>
