</node>
<node id="&quot;THE CONSTRUCTION ORDINANCE (AS IMPLIED BY CONTEXT)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Construction Ordinance is a set of rules or guidelines that govern the construction industry within Hong Kong, which may have specific conditions for applicability under this ordinance based on certain types of work and their location."&lt;SEP&gt;"This implies a set of rules or guidelines for the construction industry within Hong Kong that may have specific conditions affecting applicability based on certain types of work and their location."</data>
