<node id="&quot;COURT OR OTHER DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Court or other dispute resolution proceedings are mechanisms for resolving disputes, including legal actions in court or alternative methods of conflict resolution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
