<node id="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY OF ADJUDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Confidentiality of adjudication refers to the principle that information related to an adjudication, such as procedures and decisions, should be kept private unless specific conditions are met for disclosure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event refers to the confidentiality rules surrounding adjudication proceedings and determinations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
