</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCLOSURE OR PROVISION OF DATA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disclosure or provision of data pertains to sharing information under certain circumstances outlined in legal provisions, including public knowledge, mutual agreement, implementation requirements, necessary actions for enforcement, and other specified procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 219}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 787}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANKING INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Banking institution refers to financial entities like banks that may have access to confidential data in specific circumstances outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PROVIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan provider refers to financial institutions that may have access to confidential information under specific conditions outlined in the text, including enforcement of judgments and other relevant procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 219}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 787}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL OPINION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal opinion is a professional advice or interpretation provided by legal experts which can be shared for reasonable commercial purposes as per the guidelines mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
</node>
