<node id="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Confidentiality requirement is a legal or ethical principle that mandates keeping certain information private unless disclosed for specific purposes outlined in the text, such as enforcement of judgments or seeking professional advice."</data>
