<node id="&quot;THE CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY DEVELOPMENT BOARD (CIDB)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The CIDB is a regulatory body involved in the construction industry, which may have relevance to data disclosure and confidentiality requirements under specific conditions outlined in the text."</data>
