</node>
<node id="&quot;MONEY LENDERS ORDINANCE (CAP. 163)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Money Lenders Ordinance authorizes licensed money lenders to disclose certain financial information for legitimate business reasons."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Money Lenders Ordinance is another legal document regulating the licensing of money lenders for specific purposes."</data>
