<node id="&quot;ADJUDICATING (審裁)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjudicating refers to a process where an adjudicator accepts appointments, considers, and determines payment disputes in adjudication procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPORTIONS OF COSTS DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event involves the determination of cost proportions by the adjudicator based on various factors such as relative success and unreasonable actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATIVE SUCCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Relative success is a factor considered in determining costs, reflecting how successful each party was in the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREASONABLE ACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unreasonable actions are factors that may affect cost determinations, including behavior before and during the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COSTS OF ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The costs associated with adjudication procedures include various expenses related to these processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPORTION DETERMINATION FACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Factors such as relative success, improper purposes, vexatious participation, and unreasonable actions are considered in determining the proportion of costs each party must pay."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COST PROPORTIONS PAYABLE BY A PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
