  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLENESS OF ACTIONS LEADING UP TO PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Actions taken before the proceedings, if unreasonable, can affect the determination of costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCEEDINGS PARTICIPATION FOR AN IMPROPER PURPOSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Participation in adjudication proceedings with improper purposes is considered and may impact cost determinations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VEXATIOUS OR FRIVOLOUS PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Engaging in vexatiously or frivolously initiated proceedings can affect the determination of costs based on unreasonable actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLENESS DURING PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
