  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPORTION DETERMINATION BY ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process of determining the proportion of costs each party must pay, based on various considerations and calculations made by the adjudicator."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Costs associated with adjudication proceedings include expenses related to these processes, which are determined through a proportional distribution among parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATIVE SUCCESS IN ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The relative success of each party in the proceedings is an important factor considered when determining cost proportions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREASONABLE ACTIONS DURING AND BEFORE PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Actions taken by parties during or before adjudication proceedings, if deemed unreasonable, can affect the determination of costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPROPER PURPOSE PARTICIPATION IN ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Participation in adjudication proceedings with improper purposes is considered and may impact cost determinations based on relative success and other factors."</data>
