</node>
<node id="&quot;VEXATIOUS OR FRIVOLOUS PARTICIPATION IN ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Engaging in vexatiously or frivolously initiated adjudication proceedings can affect the determination of costs, as indicated by various considerations such as unreasonable actions and relative success."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLENESS LEADING UP TO ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The reasonableness of a party's behavior leading up to the adjudication proceedings is considered in determining cost proportions based on factors like relative success and other relevant matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COST PROPORTIONS DETERMINATION BY ADJUDICATOR (裁定審裁程序費用的比例)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process of determining how costs are proportionally distributed among parties involved, considering various factors such as relative success and unreasonable actions during the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS COSTS CONSIDERATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Factors considered in determining cost proportions for adjudication proceedings include relative success, improper purposes, vexatious participation, and other relevant matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COST PROPORTIONS DETERMINATION FACTORS (裁定審裁程序費用的比例時須考慮的事宜)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The factors that must be considered when determining the proportion of costs in adjudication proceedings include relative success, improper purposes, vexatious participation, and other relevant matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION (審裁員在裁定某方須按何比例支付審裁程序費用時)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The adjudicator is responsible for determining the proportion of costs each party must pay in adjudication proceedings, considering various factors such as relative success and unreasonable actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS COSTS DETERMINATION (確定審裁程序費用的比例)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Determining how costs are distributed among parties involved in adjudication proceedings based on their relative success and other relevant matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPORTION OF ADJUDICATION PROCEEDS COSTS PAYABLE BY A PARTY (某方須按何比例支付審裁程序費用時)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The proportion of costs payable by each party involved in adjudication proceedings is determined based on their relative success and other relevant factors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCEEDINGS TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proceedings Termination is the event where an adjudication process ends due to specific grounds as outlined by law, affecting the entitlement of the adjudicator to receive fees or expenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 226}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 41(E), (F) AND (G)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections refer to legal provisions that specify conditions under which an adjudication process may be terminated, impacting the adjudicator's right to payment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 245}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 48&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 48 pertains to court actions that can invalidate determinations made by adjudicators, but does not affect their right to receive fees and expenses for the adjudication process they conducted in good faith."&lt;SEP&gt;"This section is mentioned as a basis for setting aside determinations, implying events where adjudicators may still be entitled to fees and expenses despite such set-asides."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
