</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 54(5)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 54(5) is a reference in the text that defines certain aspects of payment disputes relevant to adjudicators, particularly concerning their conduct during proceedings involving genuine efforts to resolve such disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"This section defines 'adjudicating' which is relevant in determining if the adjudicator acted in good faith as per subsection (3) of a certain regulation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 220}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 790}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUE REPRESENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"True Representation refers to the principle that an adjudicator must act with integrity and good faith when dealing with payment disputes, ensuring fair and just outcomes in accordance with legal standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 220}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 790}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 41(E), (F) OR (G)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections are mentioned as grounds for terminating proceedings, indicating events where adjudicators may not be entitled to fees and expenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 220}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 788}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TIME-RELATED DISPUTE FOR MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACTS AND SUBCONTRACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This phrase refers to a specific type of dispute concerning extensions of time in main private contracts or subcontracts, which is disapplicable according to section 57 as per the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 220}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 788}]</data>
</node>
