  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The organization has jurisdiction over disputes related to work periods.")</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;局長&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Secretary is a person who can appoint the expiration date of certain provisions by notice published in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;公眾假期&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public holidays are days on which jurisdiction does not apply according to the text.")</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;黑色暴雨警告日或烈風警告日&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Black rainstorm warning day or typhoon warning day is an event that does not fall under public holidays and thus affects work period calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;工作日&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Working days are defined as non-holiday dates, excluding public holidays and specific weather warnings.")</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;延遲 (DELAY)&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delay refers to the suspension or reduction of progress in construction work or supply of related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;意向通知 (NOTICE OF INTENTION)&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notice of intention is a product that informs about delays in carrying out building works or supplying relevant goods and services.")</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;擬開始日 (INTENDED STARTING DATE)&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Intended starting date refers to the planned commencement date for delayed construction work or supply of related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delay means to suspend or reduce the rate of progress in construction work or supply related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 218}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 778}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTENDED STARTING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Intended starting date is the date on which the person serving a notice of intention intends to start delaying the carrying out of construction work, or the supply of related goods and services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Intended Starting Date is the planned commencement of construction work or supply of related goods and services, determined based on notice served by the claimant."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d229505b95cc3e576d9ad034318c66d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 218}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 778}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Notice of Intention is a written notice served by the claimant on the respondent and owner, indicating their intention to delay carrying out construction work or supplying related goods and services if certain conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Notice of Intention is an official notice served by the claiming party to inform the paying party about their intention to delay work or supply, which must meet specific requirements as set out in subsection (3) of section 59."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notice of Intention refers to a formal notification to delay the execution of construction works or the provision of relevant products and services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89690e148d95bff497042548ed9e3555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d229505b95cc3e576d9ad034318c66d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 218}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 775}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKING DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A working day is defined as any day that is not a general holiday or a black rainstorm warning day or gale warning day according to section 71(2) of the Interpretation and General Clauses Ordinance (Cap. 1)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 222}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 798}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIMANT'S RIGHT TO DELAY WORK OR SUPPLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The claimant has the right to delay construction work execution, or delaying supply related goods and services under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event refers to a situation where a claimant can delay work or supply under certain conditions, as outlined in subsection (2)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6edcec90a44956192e9747946f6d5481</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 219}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 785}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESPONSE TO PAYMENT CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The response to a payment claim, as per clause 19, indicates that the payer will pay the claimed amount but fails to do so by the due date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 219}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 785}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE PERIOD BEFORE INTENDED STARTING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Before the intended starting date, at least five working days prior, the claimant must deliver a notice of intention and inform the owner about their intent to delay construction work or supply related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 218}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 778}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT DUE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment Due Date refers to a specific date after which payment should be made, serving as a reference point for other actions in the contract process."</data>
