<node id="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT OR MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT FOR PURPOSES OF SECTION 7(1)(A)(II) OR 8(1)(A)(II)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These contracts are related to construction work or supply of goods/services with specific value thresholds as defined by the legislation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a75fc2e86bd1bd49cadcd97f8d2f0419</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;$5,000,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The value $5,000,000 is a monetary threshold applicable to public contracts or main private contracts for construction work."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a monetary threshold for public contracts involving construction work, indicating the minimum contract value in Hong Kong dollars."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a75fc2e86bd1bd49cadcd97f8d2f0419&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d64bf6870cd28991e3919d0bb4b5dfa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;$500,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The value $500,000 is a monetary threshold applicable to public contracts or main private contracts for the supply of related goods and services only."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is another monetary threshold for public contracts solely related to supply of goods/services, also denoted in Hong Kong dollars and representing a lower value limit compared to construction work contracts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a75fc2e86bd1bd49cadcd97f8d2f0419&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d64bf6870cd28991e3919d0bb4b5dfa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACTS OR MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public Contracts or Main Private Contracts are contracts for construction work or the supply of related goods and services, with specified values determined by their nature."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d64bf6870cd28991e3919d0bb4b5dfa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 7(1)(A)(II) OR 8(1)(A)(II)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections are used in determining contract values, specifically $500,000 or $5,000,000 depending on the nature of the contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d64bf6870cd28991e3919d0bb4b5dfa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTROL OF EXEMPTION CLAUSES ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Control of Exemption Clauses Ordinance is a legal document that restricts the extent to which civil liability can be avoided by contract terms and other methods, and limits the enforceability of arbitration agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6f1b0342117fba0657cd9deb544e402</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 138}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 603}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1990年第38號法律公告&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1990年第38號法律公告 is a legal notice published on 1 December 1990, which made changes to the Control of Exemption Clauses Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6f1b0342117fba0657cd9deb544e402</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 138}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 603}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;《售賣貨品條例》(第26章)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"《售賣貨品條例》(第26章) is a legal document that defines the meaning of 'goods' in relation to civil liability and contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6f1b0342117fba0657cd9deb544e402</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 138}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 603}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONNEL INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Personnel injury refers to any physical or mental damage, including diseases, as defined under the Control of Exemption Clauses Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6f1b0342117fba0657cd9deb544e402</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 749}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEGLIGENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Negligence refers to failing to meet —— (a) contractual express or implied terms obligations, which require reasonable care in performing such contracts; (b) common law duties of care requiring reasonable skill and diligence but not more stringent responsibilities; (c) general duty of care imposed by the Occupiers' Liability Ordinance (Cap. 314)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Negligence refers to the failure to fulfill legal obligations arising from explicit or implied contractual terms, which requires a reasonable level of care during contract performance, according to the Control of Exemption Clauses Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6f1b0342117fba0657cd9deb544e402&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405702086caa260fb0fa6bf8fac677c3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 749}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPIERS' LIABILITY ORDINANCE (CAP. 314)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Occupiers' Liability Ordinance (Cap. 314) imposes general duty of care on property occupiers, relevant to legal obligations not fulfilled due to the unsafe condition of properties used for business purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-405702086caa260fb0fa6bf8fac677c3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 749}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Sale of Goods Ordinance (Cap. 26) defines goods in a commercial context, setting standards and responsibilities related to their sale and delivery."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sale of Goods Ordinance (Cap. 26) is a legal document that outlines the obligations and rights between sellers and buyers in transactions involving goods, including implied warranties regarding title, conformity with description or sample, quality, and fitness for purpose."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sale of Goods Ordinance defines 'goods,' which has implications for various commercial activities involving tangible items or products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-872dd343c6e35c900d1e080217da3c6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac6eb040e98e92757cf6e4d3f0473e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405702086caa260fb0fa6bf8fac677c3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 214}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 761}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPIERS LIABILITY ORDINANCE (CAP. 314)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Occupiers Liability Ordinance is a legal document that imposes common duties of care, relevant in the context of business operations and property management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac6eb040e98e92757cf6e4d3f0473e64</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 744}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEGLIGENCE (疏忽)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Negligence is a concept in law that involves breaching obligations through failure to take reasonable care, either under contract terms, common law duties, or specific statutory requirements such as the Occupiers Liability Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac6eb040e98e92757cf6e4d3f0473e64</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 744}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL INJURY (人身傷害)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Personal Injury includes any disease and impairment of physical or mental condition, relevant in legal contexts involving harm to individuals."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac6eb040e98e92757cf6e4d3f0473e64</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 744}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Liability refers to the legal obligations or duties arising from actions taken in a business context, whether one's own or another's."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3af7b8f9d9569fddb32c031c5ec0dbc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 30}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREMISES USED FOR BUSINESS PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Premises Used for Business Purposes are locations occupied by individuals engaged in commercial activities, subjecting them to specific liabilities related to their occupation and use of the premises."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3af7b8f9d9569fddb32c031c5ec0dbc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 30}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Purposes refer to the activities and objectives pursued by an individual in relation to commercial operations, which can determine liability under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3af7b8f9d9569fddb32c031c5ec0dbc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 30}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACTUAL OBLIGATIONS OR DUTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contractual Obligations or Duties are legal responsibilities arising from agreements between parties, particularly relevant for business contexts as defined here."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3af7b8f9d9569fddb32c031c5ec0dbc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 30}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tort is a civil wrong committed by one person against another, involving the breach of a duty not to engage in conduct that causes harm, which can be related to business operations and premises usage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3af7b8f9d9569fddb32c031c5ec0dbc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 30}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLE STANDARD VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reasonable Standard Verification involves judicial or arbitral determination on contract clauses' fairness and reasonableness under specific circumstances as outlined by legal statutes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3af7b8f9d9569fddb32c031c5ec0dbc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 231}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 837}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OR ARBITRATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Court or arbitrator refers to judicial bodies responsible for determining the reasonableness of contract terms and disclaimers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or arbitrator is an organization responsible for determining reasonableness in contract terms and notices, as per legal ordinances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or arbitrator refers to judicial bodies that will consider whether certain terms satisfy reasonableness requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51792815fbdf7d62aebbf3740d5c33b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53896ec29a47d41511a83256e25be1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f2388558428d5c25b0420a73f3129c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 68}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT TERM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contract Term refers to specific clauses within contracts that need to satisfy the reasonableness test and remain effective despite breaches or terminations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contract term is a legal provision in an agreement that may limit liability, which needs to be assessed for its reasonableness according to specific standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contract terms refer to clauses within agreements that may attempt to limit liability for loss or damage, but are overridden by legal guarantees as described."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contract terms refer to the specific clauses within a contract that define the obligations and responsibilities of parties involved in a transaction, particularly regarding the sale of goods."&lt;SEP&gt;"contract term指的是合同中的具体条款，这些条款在特定条件下被视为合理标准的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2333b3d2deec0b227d514b0090b44838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-872dd343c6e35c900d1e080217da3c6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-723308f570a274e7e8ac1a555c11b81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f2388558428d5c25b0420a73f3129c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 447}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCLAIMER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disclaimer refers to clauses that appear to remove or limit related legal liabilities but are not contract terms and need assessment under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34f2388558428d5c25b0420a73f3129c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 68}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MISREPRESENTATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 284)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Misrepresentation Ordinance (Cap. 284) is a product of legislation that defines the requirements for reasonable contract terms and notices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Misrepresentation Ordinance is a piece of legislation used in conjunction with the Reasonableness test for assessing the validity of contractual clauses or disclaimers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51792815fbdf7d62aebbf3740d5c33b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f2388558428d5c25b0420a73f3129c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 68}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESOURCE ALLOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Resource allocation refers to the consideration of available resources that an individual can commit towards potential legal liabilities, which is part of the reasonableness assessment process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34f2388558428d5c25b0420a73f3129c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 68}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON AS AGAINST WHOM ANOTHER PERSON SEEKS TO RELY UPON THE TERM OR NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This entity type represents an individual who might be affected by a contractual term or notice and whose understanding of the language used could impact reasonableness determinations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51792815fbdf7d62aebbf3740d5c33b8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 68}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACTUAL EFFECT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contractual effect refers to situations where terms have legal binding force, distinguishing them from mere notices without such effects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51792815fbdf7d62aebbf3740d5c33b8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 68}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSECTION (2) OR (4)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Subsection (2) or (4) likely refer to specific sections of a legal document, which are part of the social sciences in this context as they pertain to law and regulation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53896ec29a47d41511a83256e25be1c7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 68}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON CLAIMING THAT A CONTRACT TERM SATISFIES REASONABLENESS REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person who asserts that a contractual term or notice meets the standard of reasonableness for liability limitation purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53896ec29a47d41511a83256e25be1c7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESOURCES AVAILABLE FOR MEETING LIABILITY SHOULD IT ARISE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Resources refer to financial and other means available to cover potential liabilities, which can be considered as technology in terms of risk management tools and strategies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53896ec29a47d41511a83256e25be1c7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURANCE COVERAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Insurance is a product that can help cover risks, thus providing protection against financial loss."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53896ec29a47d41511a83256e25be1c7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER TRANSACTION&quot; (AS PER SECTION 4(1))">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer transactions occur when one party engages in commerce without being involved in business activities and the other party operates within their business context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53896ec29a47d41511a83256e25be1c7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business processes refer to commercial operations conducted by entities for profit or service provision, distinguishing them from individual consumer actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-53896ec29a47d41511a83256e25be1c7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEALING AS CONSUMER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dealing as consumer is a legal term defined in relation to parties involved in contracts, particularly distinguishing between those who are and are not engaged in business activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0aa5c7bec2bb945d36bb333255416d51</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTY TO A CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Party to a contract refers to individuals or entities participating in contractual agreements, with specific conditions under which they may be considered as dealing as consumers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0aa5c7bec2bb945d36bb333255416d51</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer rights pertain to the protection of individuals who purchase goods or services for personal use against unfair practices by businesses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0aa5c7bec2bb945d36bb333255416d51</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXEMPTION CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Exemption Clause refers to clauses in contracts or agreements that attempt to limit the legal liability of one party. The text discusses how such clauses cannot be used to avoid certain types of liabilities like negligence and breach of contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exemption clause is a legal term referring to provisions within agreements that attempt to limit or remove certain responsibilities or rights of the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aa5c7bec2bb945d36bb333255416d51</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 298}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 986}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAWFUL LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lawful liability refers to obligations and duties imposed by law, which can be modified or limited through various clauses in contracts but are subject to legal constraints."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0aa5c7bec2bb945d36bb333255416d51</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEGLIGENCE, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are events or circumstances where legal liabilities arise due to failure in duty of care (negligence) or violation of contractual obligations (breach of contract). The text states that such events cannot be exempted by using exemption clauses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITY FOR NEGLECT, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the legal responsibility one may have due to negligence or breach of a contract. According to the text, these liabilities cannot be excluded or limited through certain types of agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 298}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 986}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEGLIGENCE LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Negligence liability refers to the legal responsibility for death or personal injury resulting from negligence. It cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms, notices given generally, or particular persons except in reasonable standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f58b4ec9af40aa0f4ba64be9471ec8f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS AND NOTICES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contract terms and notices are used to exclude or restrict liability but their validity depends on reasonableness as stated in the law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f58b4ec9af40aa0f4ba64be9471ec8f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITY FOR BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liability for breach of contract refers to legal responsibility when one party breaches a contract, which cannot be excluded by another party according to the law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f58b4ec9af40aa0f4ba64be9471ec8f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer transactions are defined as those where one party trades under consumer status or follows specific business terms set by the other party. This affects how liability is handled in disputes between parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f58b4ec9af40aa0f4ba64be9471ec8f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACTING PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contracting parties refer to the entities involved in a contract where one party deals as a consumer or on the other's written standard terms of business."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9caec393d81747f82a0bc36401fbbd53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Breach of contract refers to the violation or non-fulfillment of contractual obligations by one party."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9caec393d81747f82a0bc36401fbbd53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liability in this context is a legal responsibility that cannot be excluded or restricted when oneself is in breach of contract, as per the contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9caec393d81747f82a0bc36401fbbd53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLE STANDARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reasonable standard refers to the criteria used to determine if certain contractual terms are fair and justifiable under law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9caec393d81747f82a0bc36401fbbd53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER IDENTITY TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer identity transaction describes a situation where an individual enters into a contract as a consumer, potentially subjecting them to specific legal protections or limitations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9caec393d81747f82a0bc36401fbbd53</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 745}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAMAGES FOR NEGLIGENCE OR BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Damages for negligence or breach of contract refer to the financial compensation that may be claimed due to another party's failure to fulfill their contractual obligations or negligent actions, but such claims are limited under certain conditions as per legal standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9caec393d81747f82a0bc36401fbbd53</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 745}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNJUST ENRICHMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unjust enrichment refers to a situation where one party benefits at the expense of another without justification, which is not covered by contract terms that do not meet reasonable standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9caec393d81747f82a0bc36401fbbd53</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREASONABLE INDEMNITY CLAUSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unreasonable indemnity clauses refer to contract terms that cannot make a consumer deal as a party liable for another's negligence or breach of contract unless the term is reasonable."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dfdaa9554cda347b9858ba470c1dfeab</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITY ARISING FROM SALE OR SUPPLY OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liability arising from sale or supply of goods refers to legal responsibility due to selling or supplying products, specifically mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dfdaa9554cda347b9858ba470c1dfeab</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER GUARANTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer guarantee is a protection for consumers against defects and negligence related to the sold or supplied goods, ensuring that such losses cannot be limited by contract terms unless reasonable."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dfdaa9554cda347b9858ba470c1dfeab</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTEE&quot;(">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This text discusses legal provisions related to guarantees for consumer goods, specifically addressing liability and warranty terms in relation to defective products and their usage.")</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2333b3d2deec0b227d514b0090b44838</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOSS OR DAMAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loss or damage refers to the consequences of a product being found defective during use or due to negligence in its manufacture or distribution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2333b3d2deec0b227d514b0090b44838</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 138}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 606}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER USE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer use describes the intended private usage of goods as opposed to their business application, and affects how warranties apply."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2333b3d2deec0b227d514b0090b44838</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 215}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 764}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Sale of Goods Ordinance is a legal document that outlines warranties and guarantees related to goods sold, defining various implied terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 14 OF THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 14 of the Sale of Goods Ordinance defines seller's implied undertakings as to title, which cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 102}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 15 OF THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 15 of the Sale of Goods Ordinance deals with warranties regarding goods being in accordance with descriptions and fitness for a particular purpose, which also cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms when dealing as a consumer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 102}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 16 OF THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 16 of the Sale of Goods Ordinance covers warranties regarding quality and fitness for purpose, which cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms when dealing as a consumer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 102}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 17 OF THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 17 of the Sale of Goods Ordinance deals with warranties regarding fitness for purpose, which cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms when dealing as a consumer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 102}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS EXCLUDING OR RESTRICTING LIABILITY FOR BREACH OF OBLIGATION ARISING BY IMPLICATION OF LAW FROM THE NATURE OF THE CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These terms are used in contracts not governed by the law of sale of goods, allowing courts or arbitrators to decide on their effect regarding exclusion or limitation of liability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0093428c9e5c24b975d1827e057247c3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 204}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITY FOR BREACH OF OBLIGATION ARISING BY IMPLICATION OF LAW FROM THE NATURE OF THE CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to legal responsibilities that arise due to the nature of a contract, such as correspondence with description or sample and quality or fitness for purpose."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0093428c9e5c24b975d1827e057247c3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 204}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-CONSUMER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Someone not dealing as a consumer can have the legal responsibility of liability excluded or restricted by contract terms, but only if these terms are reasonable."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0093428c9e5c24b975d1827e057247c3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 204}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRANSFER OWNERSHIP OF GOODS OR GIVE POSSESSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the right to transfer ownership of goods or give possession, which cannot be excluded or restricted except insofar as it satisfies a requirement of reasonableness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0093428c9e5c24b975d1827e057247c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUIET POSSESSION ASSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is an assurance that allows someone taking goods under contract to have quiet possession without interference, and this liability also cannot be excluded or restricted except by reasonable terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0093428c9e5c24b975d1827e057247c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAW OF SALE OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The law governing the sale of goods, which provides specific protections for consumers regarding correspondence with description or sample and quality or fitness for purpose."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0093428c9e5c24b975d1827e057247c3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLENESS TEST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reasonableness Test is a concept in contract law that certain terms must meet, even after a breach or repudiation of the contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-723308f570a274e7e8ac1a555c11b81b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 447}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITY EXCLUSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liability Exclusion is an event where terms in a contract related to transferring ownership, giving possession, or ensuring quiet enjoyment cannot be excluded except if reasonable."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-723308f570a274e7e8ac1a555c11b81b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 447}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVASION BY MEANS OF SECONDARY CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Evasion by means of a secondary contract is an action taken to avoid legal responsibility through another agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a2e2728ed9206072fd11eab3f6ceb87</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 748}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arbitration agreements refer to the method or process where disputes are resolved through arbitration, as described in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a2e2728ed9206072fd11eab3f6ceb87</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 748}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN CONSENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Written consent refers to an agreement or permission given in writing, often required for specific actions as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a2e2728ed9206072fd11eab3f6ceb87</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 748}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTROL DOES NOT APPLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to specific circumstances under which legal controls do not apply, such as in exempt supply contracts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca4a2a9fbbaee42187b60b84f640f8f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 231}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 845}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPPLY CONTRACT EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A supply contract exemption is a situation where the terms of a contract can remove or limit legal liability. It does not apply to the legal responsibilities arising from an exempted supply contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca4a2a9fbbaee42187b60b84f640f8f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 231}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 845}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT (IN CHINESE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An arbitration agreement in Chinese context, which cannot be enforced without written consent after disputes have arisen or if a party has previously used arbitration for any other disputes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca4a2a9fbbaee42187b60b84f640f8f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 231}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 845}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPPLY CONTRACT EXEMPTION (IN CHINESE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A supply contract exemption in the legal context of Hong Kong, where terms can remove or limit legal liability. It does not apply to responsibilities arising from such contracts under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca4a2a9fbbaee42187b60b84f640f8f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 231}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 845}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CIRCUMSTANCES WHERE CONTROL DOES NOT APPLY (IN CHINESE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to situations under which the control provisions of a law do not apply, specifically in exempt supply contracts involving international transactions or services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca4a2a9fbbaee42187b60b84f640f8f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 231}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 845}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXEMPT SUPPLY CONTRACT (IN CHINESE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Exempt supply contracts are agreements that allow for the removal or limitation of legal liability. They exclude certain responsibilities under specific conditions related to international trade and service provision."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca4a2a9fbbaee42187b60b84f640f8f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 231}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 845}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT TERM EXCLUSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The concept refers to exclusion or restriction of liability by contract terms, which may be subject to limitations under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8271f6bc492f9ae5ef71b7e98a92bd06</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 448}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXEMPTED SUPPLY CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An exempted supply contract is a specific type of business agreement that falls outside the scope of certain legal requirements and restrictions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8271f6bc492f9ae5ef71b7e98a92bd06</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 448}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT OF SALE OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A contract of sale of goods refers to transactions involving the transfer of ownership or possession of physical items, which can be part of an exempted supply contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8271f6bc492f9ae5ef71b7e98a92bd06</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 448}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPPLY CONTRACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Supply contracts are business agreements related to the provision and exchange of goods between parties based in different countries or territories."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8271f6bc492f9ae5ef71b7e98a92bd06</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 448}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFFER AND ACCEPTANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The events constituting offer and acceptance are described in different scenarios involving multiple countries or territories."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-057148e20c6e00b2ee6dee748e6c75ff</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 234}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 866}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;7 TO 12 CLAUSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clauses 7 to 12 refer to specific provisions that may not apply due to the choice of law governing a contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-057148e20c6e00b2ee6dee748e6c75ff</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAW APPLICABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The discussion revolves around the applicable laws in different jurisdictions and their impact on contracts, involving legal and mathematical reasoning."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-057148e20c6e00b2ee6dee748e6c75ff</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 234}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 866}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHOICE OF LAW CLAUSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Choice of law clauses refer to provisions in contracts that select the applicable laws, particularly when such choice differs from default jurisdictional rules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70bc29e417a48ee998a460c753e36328</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 430}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;18. 其他有關法例的保留條文&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is a provision stating exceptions to the main rule regarding contract terms and their legal effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70bc29e417a48ee998a460c753e36328</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 430}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;具合法裁判權的主管當局&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION,ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"具合法裁判權的主管當局指的是法庭、仲裁人或公共機構。在合同条款中，这些实体在其法定权限范围内作出决定时所包含或批准的内容被视为合理标准的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 301}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;成文法則 (ENACTMENT)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"成文法則指任何條例或法律文件，以及通过条例生效的文书。在合同条款中，这些实体授予的权利和职能是判断合同合理性的重要依据。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 301}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;法定 (STATUTORY)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS,SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"法定指的是由成文法則所授予的权利、职能等，在合同条款中用来界定某些行为或决定的合法性与有效性。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 301}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1977 C. 50 S. 29 U.K.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION,EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1977 c. 50 s. 29 U.K. 是英国相关法律条文的引用，用于对比和参考香港的相关规定。"&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to a specific section of the United Kingdom's legislation from 1977, which is cited as a reference for definitions."&lt;SEP&gt;"这是对英国相关法律条文的引用，用于对比参考香港的相关规定。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-938a5862de0ab4ab87d0bfde97f7d287&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTHING IN THIS ORDINANCE REMOVES OR RESTRICTS THE EFFECT OF, OR PREVENTS RELIANCE UPON, ANY CONTRACTUAL PROVISION WHICH—&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这部分内容描述了条例中关于合同条款合理性的规定，指出任何由成文法則授权或要求的合同条款不会被排除在外。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;A) IS AUTHORIZED OR REQUIRED BY THE EXPRESS TERMS OR NECESSARY IMPLICATION OF AN ENACTMENT;&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这是指那些根据成文法則明确授权或必要推论而存在的合同条款，它们在条例中被视为合理标准的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;B) BEING MADE WITH A VIEW TO COMPLIANCE WITH AN INTERNATIONAL AGREEMENT WHICH APPLIES TO HONG KONG, DOES NOT OPERATE MORE RESTRICTIVELY THAN IS CONTEMPLATED BY THE AGREEMENT.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这部分内容描述了与香港适用的国际协议相关的合同条款，指出这些条款不应比该协议所设想的更为严格。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;A CONTRACT TERM IS TO BE TAKEN FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS ORDINANCE AS SATISFYING THE REQUIREMENT OF REASONABLENESS IF IT IS INCORPORATED OR APPROVED BY, OR INCORPORATED PURSUANT TO A DECISION OR RULING OF, A COMPETENT AUTHORITY ACTING IN THE EXERCISE OF ANY STATUTORY JURISDICTION OR FUNCTION AND IS NOT A TERM IN A CONTRACT TO WHICH THE COMPETENT AUTHORITY IS ITSELF A PARTY.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这是条例中关于合同条款合理性的具体规定，指出由具合法裁判權的主管當局在其法定权限内批准或决定的合同条款被视为满足合理性要求。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IN THIS SECTION—COMPETENT AUTHORITY (具合法裁判權的主管當局) MEANS ANY COURT, ARBITRATOR OR PUBLIC BODY;&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这部分定义了具合法裁判權的主管當局，包括法院、仲裁人和公共机构。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 301}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENACTMENT (成文法則) MEANS ANY ORDINANCE AND ANY INSTRUMENT HAVING EFFECT BY VIRTUE OF ANY ORDINANCE;&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这是对成文法則的定义，指任何条例或通过条例生效的文书，在合同条款中这些实体授予的权利和职能是判断合理性的依据。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATUTORY (法定) MEANS CONFERRED BY AN ENACTMENT.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS,SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"法定指的是由成文法則所授予的权利、职能等，用于界定某些行为或决定的合法性与有效性。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAVING FOR OTHER RELEVANT LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这部分内容表明该条例保留了其他相关立法的影响和适用范围。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;適用範圍 (SCOPE OF APPLICATION)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT,ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"适用范围指的是该条例的应用领域和条件，在合同条款中用来界定其有效性与约束力。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;本條例的任何條文 (ANY PROVISION IN THIS ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY,INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"这是指香港相关法律条文中关于合同条款合理性的具体规定，用于解释条例的应用范围和条件。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
</node>
