<node id="&quot;INSURANCE CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Insurance Contract is a type of agreement that includes life annuity contracts, involving financial protection and risk management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAND RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Land Rights refer to the generation, transfer, or termination (by cancellation, merger, waiver, confiscation, etc.) of land interests in any contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Intellectual Property Rights include rights and interests generated or transferred in patents, trademarks, copyrights, registered designs, technology, business information, or other forms of intellectual property, as well as the termination of such rights."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPANY ESTABLISHMENT OR DISSOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The establishment or dissolution of a company involves its formation or liquidation and affects the legal obligations of corporate members or organizational members."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Securities refer to financial instruments such as stocks, bonds, and other investment products that are generated or transferred in any contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLEARING HOUSE PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Clearing House Participant is an individual specified in the Securities and Futures Ordinance (Cap. 571) Schedule 1 Part I Article 1 who engages in business activities as a participant of a clearing house."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALVAGE CONTRACT OR TUGBOAT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Salvage Contract or Tugboat Contract is an agreement related to maritime rescue operations, towing services, and includes specific types of contracts involving ships or air cushion vessels."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SHIP OR AIR CUSHION VESSEL LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Ship or Air Cushion Vessel Lease Agreement involves the rental contract for a ship or air cushion vessel."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CARGO TRANSPORTATION CONTRACT INVOLVING SHIPS OR AIR CUSHION VESSELS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This type of agreement specifies contracts where goods are transported by ships or air cushion vessels, focusing on logistics and transportation services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY CONTRACT OF INSURANCE (INCLUDING A CONTRACT TO PAY AN ANNUITY ON HUMAN LIFE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to contracts related to insurance including those paying annuities for human lives. These are excluded from the scope of Sections 7, 8 and 9."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY CONTRACT RELATING TO LAND INTERESTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to any agreements concerning the creation or transfer of an interest in land, which is not covered by Sections 7, 8 and 9 unless it benefits consumers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANY INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS (PATENT, TRADE MARK, COPYRIGHT, REGISTERED DESIGN)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This includes patents, trademarks, copyrights, and designs. Contracts related to these are excluded from the scope of Sections 7, 8 and 9 unless they benefit consumers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTIONS 7, 8, AND 9&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These sections refer to specific clauses in a contract that do not apply under certain conditions as outlined. They include provisions related to insurance contracts, land interests, intellectual property rights, etc., unless they are beneficial for consumers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment contracts are excluded from the application of Sections 7(1) and (2), except when it benefits employees. This indicates a specific type of contract within an organization context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 7(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7(1) applies to certain types of contracts, including marine salvage or towage, charterparty of a ship or hovercraft, and carriage of goods by ship or hovercraft."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 7(1) refers to conditions that do not apply to contracts of employment, except for employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff7ccd88e0bf1fa24f736784b46e37</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARINE SALVAGE OR TOWAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Marine salvage or towage refers to the recovery of property from the sea or towing services related to maritime operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARTERPARTY OF A SHIP OR HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charterparty of a ship or hovercraft is a contract for renting out ships or hovercrafts, often used in commercial and transportation contexts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CARRIAGE OF GOODS BY SHIP OR HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Carriage of goods by ship or hovercraft involves the transport of cargo via maritime means, subject to specific legal considerations as outlined in Section 7(1)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 20 (AMENDED 68 OF 1992 S. 20)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 20 amends certain provisions related to contracts and securities, including the formation or dissolution of companies and rights in securities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITIES AND FUTURES ORDINANCE (CAP. 571)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Securities and Futures Ordinance (Cap. 571) is a legal framework governing financial instruments and markets in Hong Kong, particularly concerning clearing participants as defined within its Schedule 1."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 8 is part of the legal framework mentioned but does not specify its exact application in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 8 of the relevant legislation deals with specific applications or exclusions not covered by Section 7(2) and (3), but applies to consumers dealing with certain contracts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff7ccd88e0bf1fa24f736784b46e37</data>
