</node>
<node id="&quot;REASONABLE STANDARDS VALIDATION CRITERIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The reasonable standards validation criteria are outlined to help courts or arbitrators consider specific issues when applying certain sections, particularly focusing on negotiation power and customer awareness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5ff7ccd88e0bf1fa24f736784b46e37</data>
