<node id="&quot;GUIDELINES FOR APPLICATION OF REASONABLENESS TEST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These guidelines are a set of rules or procedures used in legal reasoning to determine the reasonableness of contractual terms, particularly focusing on factors such as bargaining power and knowledge of the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0d95ad1d2c3e1a79bcbb97aba7400ea9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCH. 2 U.K.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Schedule 2 of the United Kingdom legislation, though its specific content is omitted due to expiration and subsequent edits."</data>
