<node id="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">The Ordinance is a formal law or regulation passed by legislative bodies in various contexts, often with regulatory power and official standing. These ordinances typically outline rules and procedures governing specific areas such as employment practices, worker safety, evidence provision, permits, notices, enforcement mechanisms, and compensation claims. They may also define the powers, functions, or duties of public officers and set out requirements for compliance with Chief Executive's directions.

In particular, these Ordinances can cover a wide range of topics including:
- Employment policies: rules regarding annual leave calculation, maternity leave provisions, suspension and termination procedures.
- Safety regulations: guidelines for occupational safety and health practices.
- Permit processes: procedures for obtaining permits or notices along with their enforcement mechanisms.
- Arbitration frameworks: legal documents that provide the framework for arbitral proceedings in Hong Kong, including recognition of awards.
- Construction contracts: specific requirements applicable to construction agreements under certain conditions.
- Compensation claims: provisions related to employee compensation and insurance liability issues.

These Ordinances often include exemption clauses, detailed procedural steps, and definitions of terms relevant to their scope. They may also address the rights and obligations of parties involved in various types of agreements, such as employment contracts or sales transactions. Additionally, some ordinances focus on public officer responsibilities, including issuing certificates and exercising duties related to occupational safety.

In summary, an Ordinance is a comprehensive legal document with regulatory power that governs specific matters within its jurisdiction, ensuring compliance through detailed rules and procedures across various sectors like employment, maritime affairs, construction, sales, and more.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7788fe09e12252d0bb714e4f775b4322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9e62e9c51234e7e58e65ee8d9b2c47e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786c67dfb1439b58fce397c3168c9e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e17f3710da650d1e14713613a2dff129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89690e148d95bff497042548ed9e3555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9112f21c7d8a89e9880b92acfce9ecd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e37def8625e820a47ed5130364eb70d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a0cf86f8afb0c798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e804bc54b158b7b2826228aa81b5372e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4113afe7255cfeb2800c08deeeac90a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a9118870da5f24590e5c8c51628539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f1ee15f14896a24f23432269f049b12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-097842d27813c438fcbfa56e8eef5ca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691e0bbfff602acd26ed9f7e9579a105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea69c357721dd337ab1f2ad1b4f0333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e80ca1cb58b86bd99a385c76452eb8d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f02d6ddba7929fb360049bae6cab88e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d1a5d83703c47f3bc06048ecc6e08a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f01a3b960a2dbd284b449cf8b37e63c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe986d49a20cfdf5d43e02699374c050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd505e56ed8f7c2a002ed11a0086e732&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2783fda0cba2d6f90774b999de29ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2792d26b948960fecf0ee999232dc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fd592d376d0854e1e9f902478b9ced3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2051734d4010ecf353d49c7190a3cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19092b2cdc4468b2128aef41dc2b2b67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08d5ac982d50689641df03f0066401a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c1ed02e78cf2ee9e321f22dbe3ba84b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd3149c252f1ac5ec61e07c2fc936cbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8308cea0d5fc5589bf46df7d1755b30d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f5c32e3a6975f5012a9f880a409dd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c59e0c04b442ca3e395d9315796d6817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83a8d937e2b926da0d7047a5288d8ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed2ef74a32a03501189b4ee2f1d7da9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab3acc9003eaebb164d56867334dedad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e976980f19e9ab89febaf65027fa503e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cbfdf286322347be702ca6a2680df3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d19ac100c430c329d42230a7654f3c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d6404c4c99adb77c93c911f532c75ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1003d931ca48aae0de2635d9e61e0891&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7d7ad99b2b6121e30cb678dc647a4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a0ae0d06f82179e57847e5fde58901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e220e0c7587651abe976f081881efeb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f5c7774940469ec261850f6dbd6b83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d229505b95cc3e576d9ad034318c66d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ae14afda9d52be1864e9090474b79d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6087ed3d45150a001bf9f66572bde4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-098ca6bfb60006d76569bead63917ebd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aa33b76129ff2291e92c06beb87f12a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e61f5794135dfe2a1a6e5ae434940c</data>
