<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The Employees' Compensation Ordinance (Cap. 282) is a comprehensive legal document that serves as a regulatory framework providing guidelines and compensation terms for employees affected by temporary incapacity due to work-related injuries or illnesses, including maternity leave, paternity leave, rest days, sickness days, holidays, annual leaves, and other conditions. This ordinance replaced certain parts of the Workmen's Compensation Ordinance and Regulations, offering updated rules for workers' compensation. It outlines the framework for compensation payable to employees who suffer from work-related injuries or illnesses and ensures that they receive appropriate benefits in case of temporary incapacity. Additionally, it includes provisions for making compensation awards if an employer’s dismissal of an employee is in contravention of specific sections or ordinances. The ordinance also provides guidelines for reporting accidents in the workplace and offers additional grounds for compensation in certain cases, such as employee deaths, alongside long service payments. Overall, this legal document plays a crucial role in safeguarding employees' rights and ensuring they receive fair treatment and adequate support when facing temporary incapacity due to work-related issues.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5b551a4a483944d6cf3179909e4812f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d410c88421aeae56a47aedb79d008e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5e29cfe8eddddf302f5a14076a67a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61c50955c5e42baad9d032d0022c3d46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbbad1d728178af8a023898a237d258a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-832a99374a792105c8856a7a8ed4e220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50e245666877c34f0ac196d032b544a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-390c9cace3f2a3a2e290c01be307700f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4646eb80519916bd0464a8b522d48735&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbffac9fe29b467d2e151a6c12685697&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd469871354ff220088ed4c17affde45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d14b62c50b2a0a92ac73c8ef0642fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06d23d2b54047f6e0d92f6798bcab7c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40165e3c59ec939d934c64dcd17fd402&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea1924fb64e67aeda866266fbf06fab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cf406b3b427b0e2efe01c3ec1bb9db4</data>
