<node id="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">An Arbitration Agreement is a legal document or arrangement where parties agree to resolve disputes through arbitration rather than litigation. This agreement can be included in contracts, as an independent clause within the main agreement, or as a separate document altogether. It typically stipulates that any existing or future disputes arising from their relationship will be resolved by one or more arbitrators according to specific terms and conditions outlined in the agreement.

The Arbitration Agreement is considered an independent contract under applicable laws; its invalidity does not necessarily invalidate the entire arbitration clause, but it can affect enforceability under certain circumstances. The agreement may include provisions for initiating arbitral proceedings, cost sharing, and other relevant details that define the jurisdiction and scope of arbitral tribunals.

While some descriptions mention that an Arbitration Agreement can be subject to specific conditions or incapacities based on applicable laws, others highlight its importance as a defined legal relationship in resolving disputes through arbitration. The agreement may also include provisions for mediation before arbitration and can affect the application of cost assessment rules and payment orders by tribunals.

The term "Arbitration Agreement" is consistently used across various contexts to refer to an arrangement between parties agreeing to resolve their disputes through arbitration, which can be part of primary contracts or subcontracts. It often includes definitions and forms as described in legal texts and regulations, such as the UNCITRAL Model Law, ensuring that decisions made by arbitrators are enforceable under certain conditions.

In summary, an Arbitration Agreement is a legally binding contract between parties to resolve disputes through arbitration rather than litigation, with specific terms defining how these disputes will be handled. It can take various forms and may include provisions for mediation or other dispute resolution methods, subject to the laws governing its validity and enforceability.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-637d9e3dd1440e4117d86911ea5a7841&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e496ab5c7a454a1b436e9279c911d987&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42e0db1f27b3313444cf12ec497ffd57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6af742025bbb451d461d7aaec24f38e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e027acdec4c66c21703cf2589ec26926&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93da520a07c3f45a47c10cf01594d640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49949a92adb17e5dadd770d704b72f8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63fa361a4bbae312d93826ee30bf2182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b29a301d74270bec02c5b77671a3c5a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6c644c4a7067336b920f4ea718d504d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a820d49f72ef3eeb5be9d057a9cb248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea69c357721dd337ab1f2ad1b4f0333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af79dae94b8a0756fefbbf0f811ebd51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d9d91db74534ffd661699611c1087da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-818682a0f1950aff44c4e7f18a331608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb384a29e745420d0a68b05f9a55801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f35bbfd9ee83b0701ea2384c506063d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a64f61df4c2295abb6d73eef9a781326&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5ed4af08fa3d54713649e0adf6d0ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b688d6d5d4487cad0a2e8714c6369fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca57b579105e713a9a47fbe85dd981f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605f21b5a2eb897deb796a8915dad75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99f980ad8d8f30c8e25f6f9fa3f01746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01af5189922031b9258e77aa6012d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfadf35d2f372b32609102a0deae476e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0a5fd141643101c1f971cefdaf4f9ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca4a2a9fbbaee42187b60b84f640f8f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da3d7a01706de39cd849092deef8b9b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b4dba8dcefb2d368c753859f749fd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fdd2bff76f50fe6b943f4fd79b5f894&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-524caefeb3520a83b6c8130676f95c53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61ef9a8b87aa1cf04b46aaf871b5f39a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aa5c7bec2bb945d36bb333255416d51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ab3758cb9962eb7aad59c32353f872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a71d73fb76a414dd08c07b249777f35d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15c5427da69a34465f87e7a3287bd026&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3dc78b87bb7d880e40b21eadb5c8441&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-211e080c19540ebafb0dc80d25b20e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd6cc93acdd87603565c28f0e5d9386&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2047b71041716475b6c4ce04dcb74ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b414ae197269a985e13f48ee92be6bda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74a8e51496cea628136989290d2eaf6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3136488efa6b0856e563bdafbaaa1633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-665407cfb1dd4211e1d5ff880154e6bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad741dbed5c956a0e2be863adf9b077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08d5d6b1196500a57db7811d96c91750&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb631b96138ab7e64e00f4b6081fb346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026f8c614649cf19151a207c9397cdd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db0dce37722025939d7bba875b1ed10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d79d6d4cb98ab3f89dde1c3946204317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-368fa7e2763a0614258f01172b9c741f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f6f1173170ce4ac811fedab280f3b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd6c63034b5446fb90d89932614a5d4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d6872db724ae32c205d96d7e3c902f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3977494e2da78f664ddb0fbbd085bf83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cc9146e12fcb8f714add3a3f7c0771b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-854d00c33e69aed0258675abc1e2d264&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9669f3137e35798edd3b5969882589dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-655dbcc67746c1c9fceca1a4e089796b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
