<node id="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">A Registered Medical Practitioner is a healthcare professional authorized by law to practice medicine and provide healthcare services, specifically recognized according to the Medical Registration Ordinance (Cap. 161) in Hong Kong. These professionals are licensed doctors who can issue medical certificates for various purposes such as supporting claims related to employee incapacity, certifying periods of absence due to sickness or injury, conducting mandatory medical examinations for employees, and providing necessary documents like doctor's certificates.

Registered Medical Practitioners play a crucial role in evaluating prosthetic needs through their involvement with the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board. They can supervise or provide treatment under certain conditions and are qualified to issue appropriate medical certificates for sickness days as per specified conditions. Additionally, they conduct mandatory medical examinations for employees according to regulations.

These practitioners also have the authority to certify periods of absence from duty necessary for total temporary incapacity and can provide opinions regarding an employee's fitness to undertake specific work. They may be involved in free medical treatment agreements and are responsible for issuing certificates related to physical fitness for work as per relevant laws and regulations.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a67530e0a9df975682238097b18b864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bad177b227e380cc066abb25e6c2cf7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6b2c9739d4904eac9e0c6be6072cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e7d6d62033f777323f252b1d52645d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b48e83da24f4750fe34f6e53c34ac0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11184ac38e9ff98017a8ef0f47064dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f31efedbeed7b67b60bd6e147d2e1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a3738f6ebf19e3d7fa78e01d28be6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d908f80036493cf02a5dd6da247a2a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c1ed02e78cf2ee9e321f22dbe3ba84b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc7d719876b6f50011d4a77def5a2428&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60357a5d0f946dc1e998d1bea10860b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bab24c47d69b1c9fe7a8b2d862514c83</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 564}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1136}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">A Commissioner, in this context, is a high-ranking government official or organization within the Labour Department who has extensive authority over various aspects of employment practices and workplace safety. The Commissioner's roles include overseeing disputes related to employee rights and compensation, amending schedules and issuing regulations through gazette publications, determining claims for long service payments after medical expert reviews, approving agreements regarding employee compensation, and handling interim payment certificates.

The Commissioner is responsible for appointing members to assessment boards, extending deadlines for filing claims, granting exemptions from certain requirements, specifying classes of employers with record-keeping responsibilities, entering residential premises under specific conditions, investigating suspected offenses related to occupational safety and health, receiving notifications on workplace accidents or deaths, issuing licenses and making decisions regarding their revocation, reviewing determinations, sending certificates, handling objections, and publishing notices for codes of practice.

The Commissioner also has the authority to make regulations ensuring employee safety standards, issue improvement notices to employers or occupiers, approve certain deductions related to advances or over-payments, assign designations and ranks to officers, determine compensation claims under specific sections (such as fatal cases), cancel agreements based on conditions, arrange inquiries into workplace accidents, and provide consent for prosecution in employment-related matters. The Commissioner is a key figure responsible for enforcing labor laws and ensuring compliance with regulations related to employee rights, safety, and health across various sectors in Hong Kong.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0409e534977d79adcbe523886e26b9cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ef0e8f1f38a0c8885d599e4ee4a20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1833f1af069fda07edd900b2ad5d51e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a66ccff5f4b1f0435e3a62cb416f252b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057cc616cb8b855799f3fcacf937e222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbb962605c6a7e5085bf69519da702fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23a60b107acb436d1472e4d6fcca723b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7550fdff3623ae221e2d156f6ce5cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bb18157fba38057f130a7b17e656fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fd592d376d0854e1e9f902478b9ced3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236ae534fe116485f7714d0a24fe4030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff957c4b25c4b72be5b7c3c1525b4deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92398049cd93d8f432b90b9d7cf63d15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2200d76e6cc5397e7868136950dfb19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af832cb4743d5ddf0c8ea32cb2fd5d71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f281684938925901a68a287ea35fbc44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d19ac100c430c329d42230a7654f3c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aa6a1ecbb96f241ec693e9b7796d393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f5c7774940469ec261850f6dbd6b83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdc4a39840a667a7878ee99d632412a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4260c7d330eaf337c4690f784c02608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc560479538470069d89f317f702e111&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7788fe09e12252d0bb714e4f775b4322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21097621f6720ea0958fecf07d8dcf43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04fef0fb53d56f3928c358832b44a6a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a