<node id="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">僱主, or employer in English, refers to an individual or entity responsible for hiring employees and providing them with work and compensation. The term encompasses a wide range of responsibilities including setting terms of employment such as leave policies and compensation, managing employee benefits like annual leave, ensuring compliance with legal obligations regarding wages and notices, handling medical certificates and related matters, and maintaining records of their employment, especially concerning sickness days.

僱主 can be an individual person or an organization depending on the context. They are typically involved in labor relationships as they set terms of employment, manage work contracts, and ensure that employees' rights and benefits are protected according to relevant laws and regulations. In cases where there is a dispute over compensation or if employers terminate employees without adhering to specific provisions outlined by law, legal actions may be taken against them.

僱主 also plays a crucial role in managing the employment of young people or children within industrial operations as regulated by certain ordinances. They are responsible for providing work and paying wages but can have periods where they do not provide full wages due to reasons such as leave. In some situations, 僱主 may be required to pay compensation or damages according to regulations.

僱主 is the party that may need to assign tasks, ensure compliance with labor laws and regulations, and manage work relationships in a way that respects employee rights and benefits. They are also responsible for providing medical treatment plans and related benefits as well as handling claims related to workplace injuries. Overall, 僱主 holds significant responsibilities in ensuring fair employment practices and maintaining positive working conditions for their employees.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44e57b1615ed5c8b1f49eb6a6ecd4472&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92d63fd21b0cce3b9e5c075238ab83af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad03aa80581d9d78c4971adade589820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a5734a3528df7505e20e5f0156116bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c031adb2191e2fdd70a1cfb2171a003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06d9351b59c3c08e06761abd48f7ff73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dff2dac44cda710c0a41dfe3af3e572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9d7bf328eb68da98c29ac72b529085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7243d6ae166cfdb764a13e61a193cccf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed2004c9e59e7e54ef6756f3c59d039a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6957d2ae600df45cdcfeef087031ad45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d109565430987af7bbb5aad3681f0e0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ef1890ed05a41bc045fd740d85a179&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae344452d3fef20d9a84a14e26b325a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56bc001544d5c8018d61bd84bcb83283&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c777bc9929cfa20260878316c3ec4ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56d9a950f8e72e839cb27b535da95ff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7411d1f85f0eff7988eea8a8452a906d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7430d09345738519e0c07e81b09c47d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd5d9d61caba55ae3f9dfd2940ae47cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c12a66b5fa9d29ed0b0dc7f747de3d29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb1fa32929a7020d65f293e8c9d7dd58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a95471afd1aaf3812ba594d6c8b0d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1de7cbb89da3f1adf715fabc5ea88cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffd253a6ffc2d98305e581075ce59a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-688810e0abd091776de88edcaaba1bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be5f720af1dc189f9088eb832b2b0cfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af77be8b003511c35b7551f4285bb427&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9615e656723ee75837b02f754231cbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcef1d93167679643a824fa74e4d13d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b95a210c7fca53b1bea2e9c19744745&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7afd3d77979ccf6bd91ad9b535aba7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9abcb1aa4ccb5d467cb0175ca3011bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d24225c9fe2991b4b3b7b5c007e031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14526d01cdd531d1142f16c1d5e43367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca8eaf190829e68d29722b559c43b7e</data>
