<node id="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">A Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioner (RCMP) is a licensed professional registered under the Chinese Medicine Ordinance (Cap. 549) in Hong Kong, specializing in traditional Chinese medicine techniques and treatments. They are authorized to provide healthcare services that include issuing various medical certificates related to health conditions, permanent unfitness for certain types of work, sick leave, attendance at medical examinations, and periods of absence from duty as necessary for total temporary incapacity. The RCMP can also conduct medical examinations when required by the employer or under specific circumstances. Additionally, they are permitted to sell and administer Chinese herbal medicines according to regulations outlined in the ordinance.

The RCMP plays a significant role within the healthcare framework, covering both traditional and modern practices, and their services may be included in schemes that cover free medical treatment as defined by relevant texts. They can also serve on boards such as the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board, further emphasizing their importance in Hong Kong's healthcare system.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a67530e0a9df975682238097b18b864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bad177b227e380cc066abb25e6c2cf7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6b2c9739d4904eac9e0c6be6072cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b48e83da24f4750fe34f6e53c34ac0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f31efedbeed7b67b60bd6e147d2e1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a3738f6ebf19e3d7fa78e01d28be6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f158408c588106f3a0fd30a322902be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d908f80036493cf02a5dd6da247a2a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c1ed02e78cf2ee9e321f22dbe3ba84b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1faa1664ffe65d577dff74396c2e0ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a9f135881cefdec226e999451dec41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc7d719876b6f50011d4a77def5a2428&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60357a5d0f946dc1e998d1bea10860b6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 563}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1135}]</data>
