<node id="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">An Arbitral Tribunal is a body or group of individuals appointed by parties involved in disputes to resolve conflicts according to rules agreed upon in an arbitration agreement. This tribunal can consist of one arbitrator or multiple members and operates under legal frameworks such as the UNCITRAL Model Law, which provide specific procedures for conducting arbitration proceedings.

The primary function of an Arbitral Tribunal is to hear and decide on disputes between parties through arbitration processes. These tribunals are responsible for making decisions based on evidence and arguments presented by the disputing parties. They have authority over issuing preliminary orders, interim measures, and security for costs as well as granting or modifying such measures when necessary.

In addition to resolving disputes, an Arbitral Tribunal can also make awards in cases involving intellectual property rights (IPR) and other types of claims. The tribunal may be authorized to charge reasonable fees and expenses, award interest on certain payments, and assess the costs associated with arbitration proceedings. It has the power to interpret and correct awards within specified timeframes and rule on its own jurisdiction, including determining if it has proper composition and matters submitted for arbitration.

The Arbitral Tribunal plays a crucial role in international dispute resolution processes by ensuring that decisions are made based on agreed-upon rules and trade usages while maintaining compliance with specific sections and procedures as per legal requirements.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42e0db1f27b3313444cf12ec497ffd57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42e43618531219d229d97ed5116bec20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3ad57851ab0dc6b7960a3df34491d78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6af742025bbb451d461d7aaec24f38e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204ae6c021e3fe4bd76744d9bd61144e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-793ad550c41441bec21087b3f776d5d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a8aef97985d67c64a247cd4ac0838cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b29a301d74270bec02c5b77671a3c5a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cb33f1b7685e188783adaf8e60f8f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8edbd1c4d3b35d7faddb32b978e73e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7d382b60c68c418d8128c80396b687&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6eef98cdb7cf96d52a56e0103910d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af79dae94b8a0756fefbbf0f811ebd51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5195e3e252b673b130b3aa632c54f19f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44743bbc15d45a8109ce653b3d495eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39b02ac25884a8c6102243f2b93f0c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-375bde2b853ea690587e97e345bd3671&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34872d5563389492bd86e96a7e9d819c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5490186775273077486362a56a5b981f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4667827d445ebb505094eb4b58494cea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-341dbfe6e21afa768ee74c7e3db0be67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03bb9907c4707aee4e32c05a81efe12a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ad58eafa2f8aa3ad189d3ab135c444&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5ed4af08fa3d54713649e0adf6d0ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d869f809c494e89028b24de4ba24f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99f980ad8d8f30c8e25f6f9fa3f01746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da7991e9473f6c5aadfd4a87f21c511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6127a28d22b5d9d9145842f6c4caba9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6100d8c7e7c5fa3f9af262a8c8cb68f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ca78018d1b3e2ef66e8091b3209bc2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98a7cf7df4d78e9604020dd5f5323409&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-610c6dec3dfd2d606eea19c4dfbadfa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c4488b1327869fe2b0410a202e25b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26d3619691b8c4b07bbc74f1edf654f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0829311bda6ca8e30706b5b4b72bc86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e17ae2e1dd0c38e2c8a34618b769e578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31879101d38b1d4251cc0b47a342f1d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8d309a2e724a8764d515c5d8417d815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ab3758cb9962eb7aad59c32353f872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3dc78b87bb7d880e40b21eadb5c8441&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bbcea8f9e587ebf99b65f0299e0286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8630302d71316afe5c4d5a0aacb23fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9174a61c7bf0b325fa1fb34e7b741c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39620e4541eb49ae7a7ea14a2cf664bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae42208132627b8d5ff98d4e7966f28e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08d5d6b1196500a57db7811d96c91750&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e802264259e33579dca823a3e718f95b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7edd9fa2d61911f5177713c81f63dd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db0dce37722025939d7bba875b1ed10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff1392eccc9ea622ef0b3868092fcd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b2fac04904854d200ea9c9161cb98c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4511c8f186e004155d32a4e03ae34f4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9669f3137e35798edd3b5969882589dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76c7e2b40934f289064a0e67067836b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8214b3161676dee8df8d19240ebf6752</data>
