<node id="&quot;因塵埃、液體或蒸汽引致皮膚發炎或潰瘍(包括氯痤瘡但不包括鉻潰瘍)&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-3b4c60593ba0e33bbbbcde7cf5d76534</data>
  <data key="d1">"这些物质与疾病直接相关，因为暴露于它们可能会导致皮肤炎症和溃烂。"</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;矽肺病(SILICOSIS)&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
  <data key="d1">"两者都是职业性呼吸系统疾病的类型，都涉及长期暴露于特定类型的粉尘中。虽然它们的具体病因不同（前者由硅尘引起；后者主要由石棉纤维引起），但都在讨论工作环境中吸入有害物质对健康的潜在影响。”</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;职业性失聪(ACCOUSTIC NEUROMA)&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
  <data key="d1">"两者都是与长期暴露于特定环境因素有关的职业性疾病。虽然它们的具体病因不同（前者由吸入有害粉尘引起；后者主要由于长时间接触高噪音），但都在讨论工作环境中存在的健康风险。”</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;腕管综合症(CARPAL TUNNEL SYNDROME)&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
  <data key="d1">"两者都是职业性疾病，尽管它们的具体病因不同（前者由吸入有害粉尘引起；后者主要由于长时间重复使用手部进行震动操作），但都在讨论工作环境中存在的健康风险。”</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;严重急性呼吸系统综合症(SARS)&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d2b63799f840424c5fa1ea4ac492eea</data>
  <data key="d1">"两者都是职业性疾病，尽管它们的具体病因不同（前者由吸入有害粉尘引起；后者主要由于感染特定病毒），但都在讨论工作环境中存在的健康风险。”</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTIFIABLE OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d1">"The laboratory staff handling avian influenza pathogens are considered as Notifiable Occupational Diseases under the relevant regulations."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INFLAMMATION, ULCERATION OR MALIGNANT DISEASE OF THE SKIN OR SUBCUTANEOUS TISSUES OR OF THE BONES, OR BLOOD DYSCRASIA, OR CATARACT, DUE TO ELECTRO-MAGNETIC RADIATIONS (OTHER THAN RADIANT HEAT), OR TO IONISING PARTICLES&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d1">"This disease is listed as a Notifiable Occupational Disease due to exposure to electromagnetic radiations."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BURSITIS OR SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS ARISING AT OR ABOUT THE ELBOW DUE TO SEVERE OR PROLONGED EXTERNAL FRICTION OR PRESSURE AT OR ABOUT THE ELBOW&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d1">"Manual labor causing severe or prolonged external friction on the elbow is recognized as a Notifiable Occupational Disease."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;電磁輻射（除熱輻射外）或放射性粒子&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d1">"Electromagnetic radiations other than radiant heat or ionising particles are the cause of this disease."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
