<edge source="&quot;HARBOURFRONT DATA INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED&quot;" target="&quot;APEX BUILDERS (HK) LIMITED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Apex Builders (HK) Limited is contracted by Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited for the data centre fit-out and MEP upgrade works."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both companies are involved in construction projects and have entered into an agreement for the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both entities are parties involved in the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project, with Harbourfront as the main contractor for fit-out and MEP upgrade works, while Apex Builders is responsible for overseeing subcontractors like Vanguard MEP Engineering."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
