<edge source="&quot;MAIN CONTRACT AGREEMENT FOR DATA CENTRE FIT-OUT &amp; MEP UPGRADE WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;HDIL-2026-MC-01&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Main Contract Agreement is a document that outlines terms and conditions between Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited and Apex Builders (HK) Limited for the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
