  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUBCONTRACT WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subcontractors like Nominated Sub-contractors are organizations or individuals working under Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited to execute parts of the works on the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project, subject to Maintenance Surveyor's authority for access and work inspections."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TOTAL CONTRACTOR has legal responsibilities towards EMPLOYEES who are employed by the SUBCONTRACTOR, as per the terms of their agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TOTAL CONTRACTOR is legally responsible for paying the EMPLOYEE's wages if the SUBCONTRACTOR fails to do so, as per contractual agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total contractor is responsible for insuring the subcontractors against their liabilities as per certain regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ad747843ea1e53c58713c22b928c5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6157228e3518a3c9dd66f98867aa8a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7e01a5307e145a0563e90666073bf5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUBCONTRACTORS are responsible for employing and paying EMPLOYEES who work on projects they have contracted to complete under agreements with the TOTAL CONTRACTOR."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SUBCONTRACTOR employs EMPLOYEES to work on tasks assigned by the TOTAL CONTRACTOR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ad747843ea1e53c58713c22b928c5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7e01a5307e145a0563e90666073bf5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SUBCONTRACTOR can be held LEGAL LIABILITY if there are issues with the work they perform on behalf of TOTAL CONTRACTOR and its employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ad747843ea1e53c58713c22b928c5ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
