<edge source="&quot;FACTORIES AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 59)&quot;" target="&quot;COURT'S ORDER FOR FINANCIAL DATA SUBMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FACTORIES AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (Cap. 59) is mentioned in the context of a specific court order, indicating potential overlap or related legal frameworks."</data>
