  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are part of the legal framework governing industrial activities, with one addressing non-duplication of prosecution and the other specific requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85bf5f4c0ed4aaf7faca3a4817c0b647</data>
