  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese translation of SUBSECTION (6) is part of the legal framework that has been replaced by a specific section, indicating its historical context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb527550097d8ae04c63a6dbcf448664</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT REPUDIATION&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If the BUYER's neglect or refusal to take delivery amounts to a repudiation of the contract, the SELLER retains their rights under this condition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019dad10da4fa0e0f55e19465cb7641c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT REPUDIATION&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BUYER's actions in neglecting or refusing to accept the GOODS can be considered as CONTRACT REPUDIATION which affects the legal obligations between parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019dad10da4fa0e0f55e19465cb7641c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An unpaid seller is a type of seller who has not been fully paid for the goods sold."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c25cd0589b8a4d3c22c97ec5d8feb564</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The rights of an unpaid seller against a buyer include retention of goods sold when payment is not made or tendered fully."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c25cd0589b8a4d3c22c97ec5d8feb564</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;INSOLVENT BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller has the right to stop goods in transitu when the buyer becomes insolvent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3460a8b3f83d1862f966932908fad7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;CARRIER OR OTHER BAILEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller can exercise their right of stoppage in transitu by giving notice to the carrier or other bailee who is in possession of the goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019d766805b0f1dd881f70eeb98bba2c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BILL OF EXCHANGE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSIGNOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A consignor may be responsible for paying or arranging payment through instruments like bills of exchange when selling goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c25cd0589b8a4d3c22c97ec5d8feb564</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An agent can act as a seller, especially if they have endorsed the bill of lading and are involved in the sale process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c25cd0589b8a4d3c22c97ec5d8feb564</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN allows the seller to retain possession even if they are in possession as an agent for the buyer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a8d937e2b926da0d7047a5288d8ae8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal Representative and Agent are both involved in actions related to arbitration or mediation procedures, indicating a relationship through their roles."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6afb8943a99ee7bf996b0ce17c18a04b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Agent can be an Employee who performs actions under the authority of another person, indicating a direct employment relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Employee can act as an Agent, establishing a direct relationship between them based on the text context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6afb8943a99ee7bf996b0ce17c18a04b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN&quot;" target="&quot;STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller's lien and the stoppage in transitu are similar rights that a seller can exercise when not paid for goods, both allowing the seller to retain possession of the goods until payment is made."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30dda660ca1f229dc1755fad3c1ac13</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN is governed by the provisions of the ORDINANCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a8d937e2b926da0d7047a5288d8ae8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN applies to situations where goods are sold on credit, but the term of credit has expired."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a8d937e2b926da0d7047a5288d8ae8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN&quot;" target="&quot;CARRIER OR BAILEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The carrier or bailee does not affect the seller's ability to exercise their UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN, as long as they are acting on behalf of the buyer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a8d937e2b926da0d7047a5288d8ae8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;TERMINATION OF LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both concepts are related to rights over goods in transit, but they pertain to different stages of the transaction lifecycle."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-64fb15ad53f00752c5f21028f6ffe501</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;途中停運權&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Stoppage in transitu and 途中的停運權都是指在貨物運送過程中賣方對貨物的權利。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-64fb15ad53f00752c5f21028f6ffe501</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;AGREEMENT TO WAIVE LIEN OR RETENTION RIGHT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part delivery of goods can be seen as an exception to exercising UNPAID SELLER'S LIEN if there's evidence of waiving this right."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a8d937e2b926da0d7047a5288d8ae8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TERMINATION OF LIEN&quot;" target="&quot;LAND TRANSPORT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of lien termination is related to the period during which goods are in land transport, as it involves the seller's rights over the goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-64fb15ad53f00752c5f21028f6ffe501</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;途中停運&quot;" target="&quot;途中停運權&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"途中的停運權是對途中貨物的權利，而途中停運則描述了這種狀態。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-64fb15ad53f00752c5f21028f6ffe501</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSOLVENT BUYER&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER'S AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The buyer's agent can act on behalf of the insolvent buyer in receiving and managing the delivery of goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3460a8b3f83d1862f966932908fad7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELLER'S RIGHT OF STOPPING GOODS&quot;" target="&quot;LAND CARRIER/SEA CARRIER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller can stop goods in transitu even if they are with a carrier until payment or tender of the price is made by the insolvent buyer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3460a8b3f83d1862f966932908fad7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAND CARRIER/SEA CARRIER&quot;" target="&quot;DELIVERY LOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The carrier retains control over the goods until they are delivered to the specified location by the buyer or their agent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3460a8b3f83d1862f966932908fad7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER'S AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;PRINCIPAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal must be notified effectively for the agent's actions regarding the goods, especially when dealing with stoppage in transitu rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019d766805b0f1dd881f70eeb98bba2c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER'S AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;RE-SALE BY BUYER OR SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Buyer's agents may be involved in re-sales, which can impact the original sale agreement between buyer and seller."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019d766805b0f1dd881f70eeb98bba2c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELIVERY LOCATION&quot;" target="&quot;TRANSPORTATION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delivery location marks the end of the transportation period, where goods are considered to have reached their final destination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3460a8b3f83d1862f966932908fad7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DURATION OF TRANSIT&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Buyer's acceptance or rejection affects the end of the duration of transit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DURATION OF TRANSIT&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Seller's actions, such as refusal to receive goods back, do not necessarily end the duration of transit if they are unaccepted by the buyer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DURATION OF TRANSIT&quot;" target="&quot;SHIP CHARTERED BY THE BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ship chartered by the buyer can be involved in determining the duration of transit based on possession and control over goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DURATION OF TRANSIT&quot;" target="&quot;MASTER AS A CARRIER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The master as a carrier may hold or continue to possess goods, affecting the end of the duration of transit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DURATION OF TRANSIT&quot;" target="&quot;AGENT OF THE BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Agent's actions in accepting delivery can affect when the duration of transit ends."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP CHARTERED BY THE BUYER&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller's relationship with the buyer who charters a ship can affect possession and control over goods during transit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MASTER AS A CARRIER&quot;" target="&quot;AGENT OF THE BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles may have overlapping responsibilities in controlling or delivering goods, but their actions are independent regarding duration of transit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MASTER AS A CARRIER&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Master as a carrier may hold goods on behalf of the buyer, affecting when transit ends."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CARRIER OR OTHER BAILEE&quot;" target="&quot;PRINCIPAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The carrier or other bailee must act according to the principal’s instructions regarding the goods and handle re-deliveries as directed by the seller."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019d766805b0f1dd881f70eeb98bba2c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER'S AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal must ensure that their agent acts within the bounds of the rights granted by the unpaid seller regarding stoppage in transitu."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019d766805b0f1dd881f70eeb98bba2c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELLER'S AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;RE-SALE BY BUYER OR SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Seller's agents may engage in re-sales by buyers or sellers, which can affect the seller's right of stoppage in transitu."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019d766805b0f1dd881f70eeb98bba2c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-SALE BY BUYER OR SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER OR SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Re-sale activities are directly related to the buyer or seller's actions regarding the goods they possess or have sold previously."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1e7e0254dd707b1e5c7c10449fc028e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S RIGHT OF LIEN OR RETENTION OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER OR SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The rights of an unpaid seller are related to the actions and dispositions made by a buyer or seller regarding goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1e7e0254dd707b1e5c7c10449fc028e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S RIGHT OF LIEN OR RETENTION OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;CARRIER OR OTHER BAILEE IN POSSESSION OF THE GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller's rights can be affected by the carrier or bailee in possession of goods when notice is given for stoppage in transitu."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1e7e0254dd707b1e5c7c10449fc028e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S RIGHT OF LIEN OR RETENTION OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENT OF TITLE TO GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The document of title to goods can influence the exercise of an unpaid seller's right, especially if it is transferred under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1e7e0254dd707b1e5c7c10449fc028e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S RIGHT OF LIEN OR RETENTION OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;SALE CONTRACT NOT RESCINDED DUE TO PERISHABLE NATURE OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller's right of lien or retention or stoppage in transitu does not generally rescind the sale contract if the goods are perishable, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S RIGHT OF LIEN OR RETENTION OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;SALE CONTRACT NOT RESCINDED DUE TO LIEN EXERCISE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller's right of lien or retention or stoppage in transitu does not generally rescind the sale contract if exercised, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S RIGHT OF LIEN OR RETENTION OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;SALE REVOCATION DUE TO LIEN EXERCISE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller's right of lien or retention or stoppage in transitu can be exercised to revoke the sale contract, but only subject to certain conditions and rights of transferees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S RIGHT OF LIEN OR RETENTION OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;RESALE AFTER LIEN EXERCISE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller can resell the goods after exercising their right of lien or retention or stoppage in transitu, subject to certain conditions and rights of transferees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER'S RIGHT OF LIEN OR RETENTION OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;SALE NOT RESCINDED DUE TO PERISHABLE NATURE OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unpaid seller's right of lien or retention or stoppage in transitu does not generally rescind the sale contract if the goods are perishable, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER OR SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENT OF TITLE TO GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The document of title can be transferred by a buyer or seller, affecting the unpaid seller's rights over the goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1e7e0254dd707b1e5c7c10449fc028e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER OR SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;CARRIER OR OTHER BAILEE IN POSSESSION OF THE GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Buyers or sellers may instruct carriers or bailees to re-deliver goods as part of the transaction process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1e7e0254dd707b1e5c7c10449fc028e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER'S GOOD FAITH AND VALUABLE CONSIDERATION TRANSFER&quot;" target="&quot;SALE CONTRACT NOT RESCINDED DUE TO PERISHABLE NATURE OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The buyer's good faith and valuable consideration transfer does not generally rescind the sale contract if the goods are perishable, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER'S GOOD FAITH AND VALUABLE CONSIDERATION TRANSFER&quot;" target="&quot;SALE CONTRACT NOT RESCINDED DUE TO LIEN EXERCISE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The buyer's good faith and valuable consideration transfer does not generally rescind the sale contract if exercised, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER'S GOOD FAITH AND VALUABLE CONSIDERATION TRANSFER&quot;" target="&quot;SALE REVOCATION DUE TO LIEN EXERCISE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The buyer's good faith and valuable consideration transfer does not generally allow the sale contract to be revoked if exercised, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLEDGE OR OTHER DISPOSITION FOR VALUE TRANSFER&quot;" target="&quot;SALE REVOCATION DUE TO LIEN EXERCISE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pledge or other disposition for value transfer does not generally allow the sale contract to be revoked if exercised, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLEDGE OR OTHER DISPOSITION FOR VALUE TRANSFER&quot;" target="&quot;SALE CONTRACT NOT RESCINDED DUE TO LIEN EXERCISE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pledge or other disposition for value transfer does not generally rescind the sale contract if exercised, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLEDGE OR OTHER DISPOSITION FOR VALUE TRANSFER&quot;" target="&quot;SALE CONTRACT NOT RESCINDED DUE TO PERISHABLE NATURE OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pledge or other disposition for value transfer does not generally rescind the sale contract if the goods are perishable, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE REVOCATION DUE TO LIEN EXERCISE&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER'S RESERVATION OF RIGHT TO RESALE FOR SECURITY PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller's reservation of right to resale for security purposes can be exercised to revoke the sale contract, but only subject to certain conditions and rights of transferees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESALE AFTER LIEN EXERCISE&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER'S RESERVATION OF RIGHT TO RESALE FOR SECURITY PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller can resell after exercising their right to resale for security purposes, subject to certain conditions and rights of transferees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE CONTRACT NOT RESCINDED DUE TO PERISHABLE NATURE OF GOODS&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER'S RESERVATION OF RIGHT TO RESALE FOR SECURITY PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller's reservation of right to resale for security purposes does not generally rescind the sale contract if the goods are perishable, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELLER'S RESERVATION OF RIGHT TO RESALE FOR SECURITY PURPOSES&quot;" target="&quot;SALE CONTRACT NOT RESCINDED DUE TO LIEN EXERCISE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller's reservation of right to resale for security purposes does not generally rescind the sale contract if exercised, unless certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-200bd4845769007ce451fb6541f74f39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE NOT GENERALLY RESCINDED BY LIEN OR STOPPAGE IN TRANSITU&quot;" target="&quot;UNPAID SELLER GIVES NOTICE TO THE BUYER OF HIS INTENTION TO RE-SELL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of sale not being rescinded is related to the unpaid seller's notice intention, as both pertain to the rights and actions of an unpaid seller regarding goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER ACQUIRES A GOOD TITLE THERETO AS AGAINST THE ORIGINAL BUYER&quot;" target="&quot;RE-SELL THE GOODS AND RECOVER FROM THE ORIGINAL BUYER DAMAGES FOR ANY LOSS OCCASIONED BY HIS BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Acquiring a good title and recovering damages are related as both result from the act of reselling goods by an unpaid seller."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recovering damages and acquiring a good title are related as both result from the act of reselling goods by an unpaid seller."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUYER ACQUIRES A GOOD TITLE THERETO AS AGAINST THE ORIGINAL BUYER&quot;" target="&quot;UNPAID SELLER GIVES NOTICE TO THE BUYER OF HIS INTENTION TO RE-SELL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Acquiring a good title is related to the notice of intention to re-sell, as both are outcomes for the buyer after an unpaid seller's actions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-SELL THE GOODS AND RECOVER FROM THE ORIGINAL BUYER DAMAGES FOR ANY LOSS OCCASIONED BY HIS BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;UNPAID SELLER GIVES NOTICE TO THE BUYER OF HIS INTENTION TO RE-SELL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notifying intention to re-sell is related to the act of reselling and recovering damages, as both are actions taken by an unpaid seller after giving notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-SELL THE GOODS AND RECOVER FROM THE ORIGINAL BUYER DAMAGES FOR ANY LOSS OCCASIONED BY HIS BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;WHERE THE SELLER EXPRESSLY RESERVES A RIGHT OF RE-SALE IN CASE THE BUYER SHOULD MAKE DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reserving a right of re-sale and recovering damages are related as both result from the seller's action in case of buyer default."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WHERE THE GOODS ARE OF A PERISHABLE NATURE&quot;" target="&quot;UNPAID SELLER GIVES NOTICE TO THE BUYER OF HIS INTENTION TO RE-SELL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notifying intention to re-sell is related to perishable nature, as the notice might be given due to the risk of goods perishing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Perishable nature is related to the notice of intention to re-sell, as perishability might prompt such a notice sooner than non-perishable goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER GIVES NOTICE TO THE BUYER OF HIS INTENTION TO RE-SELL&quot;" target="&quot;WHERE THE BUYER DOES NOT WITHIN A REASONABLE TIME PAY OR TENDER THE PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notifying intention to re-sell and buyer's payment are related as both actions can lead to legal consequences for the unpaid seller."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notifying intention to re-sell is related to buyer's payment, as the notice can lead to legal actions if price is not paid within a reasonable time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNPAID SELLER GIVES NOTICE TO THE BUYER OF HIS INTENTION TO RE-SELL&quot;" target="&quot;WHERE THE SELLER EXPRESSLY RESERVES A RIGHT OF RE-SALE IN CASE THE BUYER SHOULD MAKE DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notifying intention to re-sell is related to the seller's reserved right, as both are actions taken by an unpaid seller in case of buyer default."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACTIONS FOR BREACH OF THE CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;REMEDIES OF SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Remedies and actions for breach of contract are related as remedies include legal actions taken by a seller in case of a buyer's default or breach of contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REMEDIES OF SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;PROPERTY HAS PASSED TO THE BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Remedies of a seller include actions taken when property has passed to the buyer, such as recovery of payment or damages in case of default."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROPERTY HAS PASSED TO THE BUYER&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER WRONGFULLY NEGLECTS OR REFUSES TO PAY FOR THE GOODS ACCORDING TO CONTRACT TERMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Property passing to the buyer is related to the buyer's wrongful neglect, as both pertain to the status of goods and payment under a contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae57bca98959e6dd3d2fc2d9ac1ea95e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACTION FOR PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller can maintain an action against the buyer for payment under a contract of sale where property has passed to the buyer and they neglect or refuse to pay."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c8e3424a8a5275e58cb410e4ea0f205</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACTION FOR PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The buyer's wrongful neglect or refusal to pay for goods according to the terms of the contract allows the seller to sue for payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c8e3424a8a5275e58cb410e4ea0f205</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES FOR NON-ACCEPTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller can maintain an action against the buyer for damages where they wrongfully neglect or refuse to accept and pay for goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c8e3424a8a5275e58cb410e4ea0f205</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES FOR NON-ACCEPTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The buyer's wrongful neglect or refusal to accept and pay for goods allows the seller to sue for damages due to non-acceptance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The seller can sue the buyer for damages due to non-acceptance, indicating a legal remedy available against the buyer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c93fa5b9277d567b2558365e758a282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8e3424a8a5275e58cb410e4ea0f205</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES FOR NON-ACCEPTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;MARKET PRICE/TIMES PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Market price/times price is used as a basis for calculating damages when there is an available market for the goods in question, especially if no specific time of acceptance has been agreed upon."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c8e3424a8a5275e58cb410e4ea0f205</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REMEDIES OF BUYER&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This section directly discusses remedies that apply specifically to the buyer in various contractual scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c93fa5b9277d567b2558365e758a282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES FOR NON-DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The buyer can sue the seller for damages due to non-delivery, indicating a legal remedy available against the seller."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c93fa5b9277d567b2558365e758a282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Market price is used as a reference point in calculating damages when there's an available market."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c93fa5b9277d567b2558365e758a282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Market price is also relevant for the seller, especially in determining damages related to non-delivery or non-acceptance scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c93fa5b9277d567b2558365e758a282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIC PERFORMANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT has the authority to order specific performance of a contract when appropriate, without giving the defendant an option to retain goods on payment of damages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fed27e8241086925853de29390c3f116</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIC PERFORMANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Specific performance requires the SELLER to fulfill their contractual obligations, even when monetary compensation might be more convenient."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fed27e8241086925853de29390c3f116</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIC PERFORMANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BUYER has the right to seek specific performance if the SELLER violates a guarantee clause, even though they might also be entitled to damages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fed27e8241086925853de29390c3f116</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT determines the measure of damages as the difference between the contract price and market or current prices if there is an available market for the goods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fed27e8241086925853de29390c3f116</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES&quot;" target="&quot;BREACH OF WARRANTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The breach of warranty can lead to damages which are the estimated loss directly and naturally resulting from such a breach."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed869807b046c3698e2d9492883a3d9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES&quot;" target="&quot;1991年第54號第47條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision in 1991 (No. 54, Article 47) provides the basis for defining 'damages'. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES&quot;" target="&quot;2025年第33號第190條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision in 2025 (No. 33, Article 190) provides the basis for defining 'damages'. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL considers whether harm not adequately reparable by an award of DAMAGES is likely to result if the measure is not ordered. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8630302d71316afe5c4d5a0aacb23fcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTEE CLAUSE VIOLATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT JUDGMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT JUDGMENT can address violations of guarantee clauses and may direct specific performance or award damages accordingly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fed27e8241086925853de29390c3f116</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BUYER may seek reduction or exemption of PRICE due to BREACH OF WARRANTY by SELLER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-69fc897b8b9dfae677db802b05a78337</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BREACH OF WARRANTY&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLEMENTARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Supplementary provisions are mentioned in relation to breaches of warranty, indicating they provide additional context and rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed869807b046c3698e2d9492883a3d9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BREACH OF WARRANTY&quot;" target="&quot;《管制免責條款條例》(第71章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The regulation (条例) provides a framework for dealing with breaches of warranty, possibly limiting or defining certain aspects of such breaches."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed869807b046c3698e2d9492883a3d9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interest and special damages can be recoverable separately as mentioned in the text, indicating they are distinct but related forms of compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed869807b046c3698e2d9492883a3d9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can influence the payment of interest in arbitration proceedings, particularly under section 79."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8edbd1c4d3b35d7faddb32b978e73e29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL has the authority to award interest on certain payments as per section 79."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL has the power to award interest on money and costs awarded or ordered."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8edbd1c4d3b35d7faddb32b978e73e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7d382b60c68c418d8128c80396b687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PARTIES' liability for payment of fees and expenses includes any interest awarded by the ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL, affecting their financial responsibility in arbitration proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8edbd1c4d3b35d7faddb32b978e73e29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE BUYER&quot;" target="&quot;THE SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The buyer has the right to maintain an action against the seller for breach of warranty or other damages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed869807b046c3698e2d9492883a3d9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTROL OF EXEMPTION CLAUSES ORDINANCE (CAP. 71)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 15 of the Control of Exemption Clauses Ordinance affects arbitration agreements by providing specific conditions under which they are enforceable."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7564251214dafe0ef47139543601d3f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BIDDER&quot;" target="&quot;BID RETRACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A bidder can retract their bid before the hammer falls during an auction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32292d53bc2adbfdb992bdf0fe946e4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESERVE PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The seller may reserve a right to set a minimum price (reserve or upset price) for items being sold at auction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32292d53bc2adbfdb992bdf0fe946e4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMON LAW&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 7 TERMINATION CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The common law provides grounds for terminating an employment contract without notice or payment in lieu of notice, which is referenced by the clause."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2554ffe0d55bbe29aef6808731a595f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMON LAW&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 23 WAGES PAYMENT CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Common law rights are considered when determining if wages can be deemed due under Section 23."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2554ffe0d55bbe29aef6808731a595f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977&quot;" target="&quot;BANKRUPTCY RULES RELATING TO CONTRACTS OF SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Bankruptcy rules relating to contracts of sale continue to apply, even if there are contradictions with the Sale of Goods (Amendment) Ordinance 1977."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9ff930ec7eb83b579d28ddffeafb904</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977&quot;" target="&quot;COMMON LAW INCLUDING THE LAW MERCHANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Common law, including the law merchant, continues to apply except where inconsistent with specific provisions of the Sale of Goods (Amendment) Ordinance 1977."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9ff930ec7eb83b579d28ddffeafb904</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977&quot;" target="&quot;RULES RELATING TO THE LAW OF PRINCIPAL AND AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rules relating to the law of principal and agent continue to apply, except where inconsistent with specific provisions of the Sale of Goods (Amendment) Ordinance 1977."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9ff930ec7eb83b579d28ddffeafb904</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977&quot;" target="&quot;FRAUD, MISREPRESENTATION, DURESS OR COERCION, MISTAKE, OR OTHER INVALIDATING CAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rules regarding fraud, misrepresentation, duress or coercion, mistake, or other invalidating cause continue to apply, except where inconsistent with specific provisions of the Sale of Goods (Amendment) Ordinance 1977."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9ff930ec7eb83b579d28ddffeafb904</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977&quot;" target="&quot;BILLS OF SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Enactments relating to bills of sale are not affected by the Sale of Goods (Amendment) Ordinance 1977."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9ff930ec7eb83b579d28ddffeafb904</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACTS FOR THE SALE OF GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contracts for the sale of goods continue to be governed by specific provisions of the Sale of Goods (Amendment) Ordinance 1977, except where otherwise specified."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9ff930ec7eb83b579d28ddffeafb904</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BILLS OF SALE&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ORDINANCE does not affect enactments relating to bills of sale, indicating a separate legal framework for these documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd505e56ed8f7c2a002ed11a0086e732</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BILLS OF SALE&quot;" target="&quot;SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977 (58 OF 1977)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment does not apply to bills of sale, suggesting they are governed by different legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd505e56ed8f7c2a002ed11a0086e732</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977 (58 OF 1977)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SALE OF GOODS (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1977 is an amendment to the main ORDINANCE, affecting its provisions and application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd505e56ed8f7c2a002ed11a0086e732</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;CAP. 282&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employees' Compensation Ordinance is referred to as Cap. 282 in the document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1183805b5e096e72ad7ed819d31ac70a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;PRELIMINARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employees' Compensation Ordinance includes a preliminary section in the document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1183805b5e096e72ad7ed819d31ac70a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1980&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are part of a broader framework of compensation-related laws, though they address different entities: workmen and employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a52f2dcf46c7d731442f86d90c2b5ddd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances form parts of a broader framework of compensation laws for workmen and employees respectively."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a52f2dcf46c7d731442f86d90c2b5ddd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;TRANSITION PROVISIONS OF 1995 EMPLOYEE COMPENSATION AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The transition provisions apply to both workmen's and employees' compensation ordinances, indicating a unified approach."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a52f2dcf46c7d731442f86d90c2b5ddd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE: JULY 1, 1996&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The effective date of the ordinance aligns with specific amendments to compensation ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a52f2dcf46c7d731442f86d90c2b5ddd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1953年A160號政府公告&quot;" target="&quot;[1 DECEMBER 1953]&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The announcement G.N.A. 160 of 1953 is dated on December 1, 1953."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1183805b5e096e72ad7ed819d31ac70a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRELIMINARY&quot;" target="&quot;SHORT TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Preliminary section provides information on how the ordinance may be cited as a short title."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb7fcd5200d5f794a363f07e5ee2dc70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRELIMINARY&quot;" target="&quot;PURPOSE OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Preliminary section outlines the purpose of the Occupational Safety and Health Ordinance, which is to ensure workplace safety and health for employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb7fcd5200d5f794a363f07e5ee2dc70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRELIMINARY&quot;" target="&quot;2011年第38號法律公告&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PRELIMINARY section refers to the announcement L.N. 38 of 2011."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c4f6f1173170ce4ac811fedab280f3b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORK INJURY COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee can make a work injury compensation claim if they are hurt during their employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89c4e47ed400d96906517cf8d97057f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER OF EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The family member of an employee is mentioned in the context where it includes legal representatives or refers to the injured employee's relatives."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89c4e47ed400d96906517cf8d97057f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員"與"雇主"之間存在合同關係，僱員在受雇期間因工遭遇意外。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f5c32e3a6975f5012a9f880a409dd60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;送交&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇主负责将文件提交给相关方。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adab7939e3cd66e530eb16d94f47de64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;雇员的殡葬费和医疗费用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇主负责支付员工去世后的殡葬费和医疗费用。同时，如果未按期付款还会产生附加费。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;普通评委会或特别评委会&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(3)款规定,普通评估委员会也需向雇主发出维持或更改的评估详情的证明书。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;处长&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长指示格式要求普通评委会或特别评委会向雇主发证明书。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;雇员&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"就业条例规定了雇员和雇主之间的权利与义务关系，包括工作性质、报酬等。劳资审裁处命令则进一步明确了在特定情况下雇主必须再次聘用或支付相应款项给雇员的条款。"&lt;SEP&gt;"普通或特别评委会需向雇员和雇主发出证明书以说明评估结果。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3451e297aa0bd05f84186c235d841d44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;女性僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"女性僱員需要通知雇主其懷孕狀態及分娩計劃，以獲得產假。&lt;br/&gt;"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb31bef1e8dd24810a075920d4fb5602</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;休息日&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇主通常无须为员工不工作的休息日支付工资。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9cbd74be84a690a6e54b01cd6e7752ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;病假日&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在雇员因病请假期间，雇主无需为其支付工资。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9cbd74be84a690a6e54b01cd6e7752ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;年假&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"正常工作日内不放年假亦不会工作的日子通常无须支付工资。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9cbd74be84a690a6e54b01cd6e7752ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主&quot;" target="&quot;劳资审裁处命令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"劳资审裁处命令赋予了在特定情况下对雇主的约束力，要求其必须再次聘用或支付相应款项给雇员。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3451e297aa0bd05f84186c235d841d44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外&quot;" target="&quot;受僱工作期間因工遭遇的意外&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在沒有相反證據的情況下,僱員在受僱工作期間遭遇的意外被視為是因工遭遇的意外。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f5b6c7d25f6395f43d3ccf96762b01c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外&quot;" target="&quot;急救、救護或救援工作的訓練&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在僱員同意下,正在接受急救、救護或救援工作的訓練的情況下,意外被視為是受僱工作期間因工遭遇的意外。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f5b6c7d25f6395f43d3ccf96762b01c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外&quot;" target="&quot;並非僱主處所的任何處所&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在某些情況下，意外發生地點可能不在僱主處所內，但仍然可以被視為是在受僱工作期間因工遭遇的意外。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f5b6c7d25f6395f43d3ccf96762b01c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外&quot;" target="&quot;公共交通服務&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在烈風警告或暴雨警告期間,使用公共交通服務也可能導致意外發生。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外&quot;" target="&quot;極端情況&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"於極端情況下遭遇的意外被視為受僱工作期間因工遭遇的意外。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外&quot;" target="&quot;暴雨警告&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"暴雨可能导致工作或居所的意外情况发生，从而影响员工的安全和健康状态。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外&quot;" target="&quot;損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"意外導致了損傷，進而可能引發補償問題。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8d6f58db2bf906e62e1287ce399d4434</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"意外導致僱員傷亡或喪失工作能力，影響其健康和安全。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eae344452d3fef20d9a84a14e26b325a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;保險單&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員"的意外可能會觸發有效的保險單進行賠償。"&lt;SEP&gt;"有關的保險單有效適用的僱員的人數以及按照附表4的規定而確定款額,並可包括根據該保險單獲彌償的利息、訟費及開支。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f5c32e3a6975f5012a9f880a409dd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-269d623b6606eba8ac3002fec6213eae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;保險單&quot;" target="&quot;地點&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"涉及多個地點發生事故的情況下,與總承判商所承擔的建造工作在多少個地點進行無關,但可能影響到保險單的有效適用範圍和款額。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-269d623b6606eba8ac3002fec6213eae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;合同&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員"通過與"雇主"簽訂合約來建立工作關係。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f5c32e3a6975f5012a9f880a409dd60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot; (僱員)" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT may deal with matters related to the recovery of compensation for injured employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8a5d1112f976dfc9d2cfe7182bd06d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OUTWORKER&quot;" target="&quot;COHABITEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both OUTWORKER and COHABITEE are defined terms in the context of employment and insurance policies but they do not have a direct relationship with each other as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both terms are related to employment and insurance but no direct relationship is established between OUTWORKER and COHABITEE based on the provided information."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OUTWORKER&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition of an OUTWORKER does not directly relate to INSURANCE POLICIES, hence no clear relationship can be established based on the provided information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text does not directly establish any relationship between OUTWORKERS and INSURANCE POLICIES but both are related to employment in a broader sense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OUTWORKER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms relate to the concept of employment, though their specific roles and definitions differ as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The EMPLOYEE's status can be compared with that of an OUTWORKER in terms of their roles but no direct relationship is explicitly stated for insurance policies or other specific conditions mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text does not directly establish any specific relationship between the roles of EMPLOYEE and OUTWORKER in terms of insurance policies, though both are related to employment conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OUTWORKER&quot;" target="&quot;EARNINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The OUTWORKER receives items for processing but their earnings are not directly mentioned in relation to the text's definition of EARNINGS as wages or other forms of remuneration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OUTWORKER&quot;" target="&quot;31B條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Clause 31B does not apply to outworkers as specified in excluded classes of employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b8e2655c247e96affa05132d650c897b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OUTWORKER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL OR RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Outworkers are excluded from the employment contract renewal or re-engagement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-590222e3ba7f541e965c6d035076bb63</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OUTWORKER&quot;" target="&quot;31U. EXCLUDED CLASSES OF EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Outworkers are explicitly listed as one of the excluded classes in 31U, meaning they do not fall under certain employment provisions such as those for renewal or re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-590222e3ba7f541e965c6d035076bb63</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OUTWORKER&quot;" target="&quot;DOMESTIC SERVANT IN A PRIVATE HOUSEHOLD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both domestic servants in private households and outworkers fall outside certain provisions like those for renewal or re-engagement due to their specific employment statuses, as defined by 31U."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-590222e3ba7f541e965c6d035076bb63</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COHABITEE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A COHABITEE is defined as someone living with an employee but there's no direct mention of their relation to employment status or insurance policies in this text, only that they are considered employees for certain purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A COHABITEE is defined as someone living with an employee, which can affect the status of insurance policies and other conditions for employees but no direct relationship is explicitly stated in this text."&lt;SEP&gt;"A cohabitee, in relation to an employee, refers to someone living with the employee and could potentially impact their status or rights under certain sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COHABITEE&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A COHABITEE's status as a person living with an employee can affect their inclusion under certain conditions for insurance coverage but no direct relationship is explicitly stated for OUTWORKERS or EMPLOYER."&lt;SEP&gt;"Similar to OUTWORKER and INSURANCE POLICY, the relationship between COHABITEE and INSURANCE POLICIES is not directly established in this text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COHABITEE's status can affect insurance policies under certain conditions but no direct relationship is explicitly stated for OUTWORKER or EMPLOYEE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COHABITEE&quot;" target="&quot;EARNINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A COHABITEE is defined based on living arrangements and does not have a direct relationship with earnings in the context provided by this text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COHABITEE&quot;" target="&quot;SPOUSE (配偶)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'spouse' does not include a cohabitee, distinguishing between the two terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06b0b35c8989b71abf93d8af04dd8d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE's earnings, as defined by the text, include wages paid in cash or other forms of remuneration which can be valued monetarily."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE PREMIUM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance premiums can be deducted from earnings as per the ordinance, making it an offense if done improperly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee, including a COHABITEE in specific circumstances, may be covered by an insurance policy as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employees are beneficiaries under an insurance policy that covers them for injuries arising out of their employment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of EMPLOYEE includes conditions under which they are covered by insurance policies but no direct relationship with OUTWORKER or COHABITEE is mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text mentions that where personal injury occurs during employment and involves a COHABITEE who would be an employee under specific conditions, the insurance policy applies as if they were an actual employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-700cb0251acd9df09975828a3d0f4f1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab8247f4347839df18b680f569571c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW LIABILITY INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance policies are related to Employment Law Liability Insurance as the latter mandates that employers must have insurance covering their legal liabilities towards employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f93037749b5c82c21a4dffe24495861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment contracts and insurance policies are interrelated since an employment contract may require coverage under an insurance policy for legal liabilities towards employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f93037749b5c82c21a4dffe24495861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROLLING COMPANY OR SUBSIDIARY COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Controlling companies or subsidiary companies may be covered under insurance policies that include them in the scope of coverage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6157228e3518a3c9dd66f98867aa8a6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Company groups may be covered under a single insurance policy that includes all members of the group in its scope of coverage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6157228e3518a3c9dd66f98867aa8a6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S CRIME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance policies can cover employers against certain crimes, such as those related to employee injuries or other liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6157228e3518a3c9dd66f98867aa8a6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule specifies the applicable amounts for insurance policies required by law in relation to employer's liability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6157228e3518a3c9dd66f98867aa8a6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amount that may be taken out under SUBSECTION (1B) is irrespective of the number of employees and sites involved in construction work by a principal contractor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37d1a5d83703c47f3bc06048ecc6e08a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amount required by SUBSECTION (1C) may include interest, costs, expenses indemnified under the policy for all companies insured within the group of companies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37d1a5d83703c47f3bc06048ecc6e08a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The insurance policy is governed by the Ordinance, defining the amount and conditions for coverage based on subsections 1, 1B, and 1C."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37d1a5d83703c47f3bc06048ecc6e08a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;40A. 載於保險單內的強制性資料&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The mandatory information as specified in Section 40A must be included in the insurance policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8565a0dde3a6e724288267c5d06fe0dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;LAWFUL RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The insurance policy covers lawful responsibility of employers according to legal procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;法律程序中保险人就雇主的法律责任所涉款额负有法律责任,但该款项不得超过可得的保险单承保金额&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The insurance policy's coverage limits the insurer's liability in legal proceedings involving employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;INSURER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">33.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The insurance policy defines the insurer's liability and rights in case of excess payment beyond the covered amount."&lt;SEP&gt;"The insurance policy is deemed to provide that any claimant can directly recover from the insurer, subject to certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The insurer is responsible for paying claims under the insurance policy, as per legal obligations and terms of the policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The insurer is responsible for paying sums due under an insurance policy, subject to certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a384314fa98b789ae4d76d79c9eae831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f50ffa55ee49cc2d1e6b1641b82f27dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca74ec0b128bebdd8deb74d88fe33613&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab8247f4347839df18b680f569571c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts or tribunals can make determinations regarding compensation claims that insurers must honor under insurance policies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a384314fa98b789ae4d76d79c9eae831</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance Policy is relevant to Legal Proceedings, as it may influence whether an insurance company can join such proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ff7a7ad14c10761bcb15431ef57d8f8f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subsidiary takes out insurance policies to cover potential liabilities and risks associated with employees' injuries during their employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2fbd733817e8b83d49f91e4a4cbe908</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER'S NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's notices can relate to insurance policies that are required for inspection or production by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5ead5337f34ae6c6d3adbc5b06e2bc74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;同居者&quot;" target="&quot;收入&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"同居者的存在可能影响收入，特别是当涉及到因意外失去由雇主提供的食物、燃料或宿舍的价值时。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033e8a760f87ee7c1653db65ace61bb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;收入&quot;" target="&quot;完全喪失工作能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"完全丧失工作能力会导致收入减少或中断，因为无法继续从事有报酬的工作。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033e8a760f87ee7c1653db65ace61bb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;次承判商&quot;" target="&quot;完全喪失工作能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"虽然文本没有直接提到次承判商与完全丧失工作能力之间的关系,但可以推断在某些情况下，次承判商的工作可能会影响雇员的健康状况或安全，从而导致完全丧失工作能力。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033e8a760f87ee7c1653db65ace61bb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;次承判商&quot;" target="&quot;完全喪失工作能力 (TOTAL INCAPACITY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"完全喪失工作能力涉及因意外導致的職業狀態,與次承判商的工作相關。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb7e4af89a52e25a6a1e9f29341b95ad</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;次承判商&quot;" target="&quot;总承判商&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"总承判商与次承判商之间存在合同关系，涉及工资支付责任。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14a9a0d371299e9e23af47ea1aef8145</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;次承判商&quot;" target="&quot;指定次承判商&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"指定次承判商和次承判商之间的合同关系同样涉及到工资支付问题。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14a9a0d371299e9e23af47ea1aef8145</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;次承判商&quot;" target="&quot;次承判商僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"次承判商雇佣员工从事相关工作，并涉及工资支付问题。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14a9a0d371299e9e23af47ea1aef8145</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院 (COURT)&quot;" target="&quot;區域法院 (REGIONAL COURT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"區域法院是特定情況下由法院進行裁決的地方。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb7e4af89a52e25a6a1e9f29341b95ad</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院 (COURT)&quot;" target="&quot;方、一方 (PARTY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在审裁程序中，当事人（party）可以是原讼法庭或区域法院（court）。"&lt;SEP&gt;"在规定的工作日内进行相关法律行为或提交文件等，这影响了当事人的行动和时间安排以及与法院的互动。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院 (COURT)&quot;" target="&quot;裁定 (DETERMINATION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院作出的裁决是审裁员根据相关法律规定和事实情况做出的最终决定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院 (COURT)&quot;" target="&quot;審裁陳詞 (ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"审裁陈词提交给法院作为支持审裁决定的依据之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"审裁陈词提交给法院，作为支持或反对某一决定的重要依据。"&lt;SEP&gt;"审裁陈词提交给法院，作为支持或反对某一决定的重要依据。这影响了最终裁定的形成过程。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院 (COURT)&quot;" target="&quot;審裁答覆 (REPLY TO AN ADJUDICATION RESPONSE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院可能涉及审裁回应的处理过程，确保程序公正进行。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;保險公司 (INSURANCE COMPANY)&quot;" target="&quot;保險人 (INSURER)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"保險公司在意外保險業務中提供保障,而保險人則是具體承保的實體。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb7e4af89a52e25a6a1e9f29341b95ad</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE AUTHORITY OF HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;SOCIETY OF LLOYD'S&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both entities are related to insurance and risk management, with the Hong Kong Insurance Authority regulating insurers including Lloyd's organizations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0394a6f179167fe6215a7bbf41cc871e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">36.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Review Certificate cancels the original Certificate if it is not continued to be determined due to specified reasons."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are related as they both pertain to the assessment of compensation in fatal cases, with one being a review mechanism for the other."&lt;SEP&gt;"Review Certificates of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case can be used to re-evaluate or challenge the original Certificate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE is an alternative or additional document that may be used in the same context as the CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Review Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case is based on the original Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0394a6f179167fe6215a7bbf41cc871e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f817e1f2a5b13a0586c36573c6eea5b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12b83ce1e2c205caa4f85bb97a5c7967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a0053e7177c68e160847406a3692d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner also has a role in reviewing the Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case, as indicated by the review mechanism."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a0053e7177c68e160847406a3692d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6(1) is relevant as it defines eligibility criteria which may be reviewed in the context of a review certificate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a0053e7177c68e160847406a3692d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 4(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 4(1) is relevant as it defines conditions under which interim payments are made, potentially affecting the review process of the Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a0053e7177c68e160847406a3692d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar to the previous certificate, review certificates also determine the payment period based on their issuance date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The issuance date also applies to review certificates, defining the timeline for payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The review of the compensation assessment certificate may lead to a payment order being issued."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d87e36b5ad46db41c716cf2910faa95c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Review Certificates of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case are another method to determine specific types of compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 8 AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Review Certificates can be used to challenge agreements made under Section 8, indicating an overlap in the determination process for fatal cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 8 Agreements can be reviewed through a Review Certificate, indicating an overlap in determination methods for fatal cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16CA AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Review Certificates can be used to challenge agreements made under Section 8, which is related to the newer Section 16CA for fatal cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to confirm, vary or cancel a Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case after review."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner is responsible for determining and issuing the Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b83ce1e2c205caa4f85bb97a5c7967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a0053e7177c68e160847406a3692d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 3 provides general provisions that could influence how compensation amounts are determined and apportioned according to the Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a0053e7177c68e160847406a3692d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Claim Determination Process leads to the issuance of a Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case if the Commissioner determines the claim, or by Court determination in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eff0ca72356f89bbfc64201ec755179c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation for an employee's fatal case is assessed through this certificate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case is issued in relation to an Employee's claim, providing details on the compensation determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eff0ca72356f89bbfc64201ec755179c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d87e36b5ad46db41c716cf2910faa95c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation, except for interim payments, should be paid within the specified payment period after the date of issue of a certificate of compensation assessment for fatal case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date of issue is crucial in determining when compensation should be paid based on this certificate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;ECAFB (EMPLOYEES COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE FUND BOARD)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ECAFB can make objections based on the Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case, which is issued after a determination under Section 6B(1)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a66ccff5f4b1f0435e3a62cb416f252b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6B(1)(A) DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case is issued based on determinations made under Section 6B(1)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a66ccff5f4b1f0435e3a62cb416f252b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case are a method by which certain claims for compensation can be determined."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both certificates deal with compensation assessments but serve different purposes and may be used in conjunction or separately depending on the specific case circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER (MEMBER OF THE FAMILY)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members are eligible to receive compensation from the Special Assessment Board in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0394a6f179167fe6215a7bbf41cc871e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Commissioner and Ordinary Assessment Board are involved in making decisions or assessments that can be appealed to the District Court."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner forwards a copy of certain objections to the Ordinary Assessment Board for review under section 16G(2). "&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner is involved in notifying and issuing certificates by the Ordinary Assessment Board. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ordinary Assessment Board is also appointed according to the regulations set by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f281684938925901a68a287ea35fbc44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da37f195f3ad2a893b50923a13911e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d232c4c17f319179e61e9fe9f748ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinary Assessment Board also handles compensation issues according to the regulations mentioned."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f281684938925901a68a287ea35fbc44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIAL INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While not explicitly mentioned, partial incapacity could also fall under the purview of the Ordinary Assessment Board depending on the context and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f281684938925901a68a287ea35fbc44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">57.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Ordinary Assessment Board can refer claims to a Special Assessment Board for further evaluation, indicating an interdependent relationship in the assessment process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both ORDINARY and SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARDS handle assessments but under different circumstances as outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both Ordinary Assessment Board and Special Assessment Board make decisions or assessments that can be appealed to the District Court."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are assessment boards used for determining compensation, with Special Assessment Board possibly having a more specific role compared to Ordinary Assessment Board."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are types of assessment boards mentioned in the text, with different names but similar functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are types of assessment boards, with 'Ordinary' and 'Special' as their descriptors but both having similar roles in issuing certificates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both boards are involved in assessments but operate under different sections of law, with the Special Assessment Board handling cases referred from the Ordinary Assessment Board."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both boards can refer claims to the Special Assessment Board as per Section 16E(8) or (9). "&lt;SEP&gt;"Both boards may be involved in the assessment process, but are not obliged to give weight to post-accident earnings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ordinary Assessment Board may refer a claim to the Special Assessment Board if it involves section 9(1A). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21097621f6720ea0958fecf07d8dcf43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aa6a1ecbb96f241ec693e9b7796d393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779a6ebdcf1cc3fbd67a4dc22862c59e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0545d506978169e320db3a0cda4273&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da37f195f3ad2a893b50923a13911e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-514e0a6ffa9d391d835f484bdbaa5724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court can substitute for or involve an Ordinary Assessment Board in decision-making processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb0545d506978169e320db3a0cda4273</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An assessment from the Ordinary Assessment Board affects wages calculation for temporary incapacity periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bad177b227e380cc066abb25e6c2cf7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ordinary Assessment Board members can be appointed as Labour Officers for these Special Assessment Boards, linking their operations and roles."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;LABOUR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Labour Officers are explicitly mentioned as members of the Ordinary Assessment Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinary Assessment Board issues a certificate of assessment to the employee, employer, and Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;16D(5) ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ordinary Assessment Board handles assessments under section 16D(5), some of which can be referred to the Special Assessment Board for further review."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21097621f6720ea0958fecf07d8dcf43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16F&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinary Assessment Board's certificate issued under section 16F can be cancelled upon the issue by the Special Assessment Board of a certificate under section 16F in respect of a claim referred to it under subsection (5). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1eeedbfd93d66d01580f5f057b6a2dfb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16D(5)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinary Assessment Board may review assessments made under this section. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16E(8) OR (9)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinary Assessment Board can refer claims to these sections for further evaluation. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16G(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinary Assessment Board takes into account objections under section 16G(1). "&lt;SEP&gt;"This section pertains to objections that the Ordinary Assessment Board must consider during reviews. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da37f195f3ad2a893b50923a13911e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16GA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16GA is relevant to the Ordinary Assessment Board's review process. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da37f195f3ad2a893b50923a13911e53</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Ordinary Assessment Board issues certificates to employees regarding compensation matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ordinary Assessment Board reviews assessments related to employees and issues certificates accordingly. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da37f195f3ad2a893b50923a13911e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7788fe09e12252d0bb714e4f775b4322</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court can hear appeals against decisions or assessments made by an Ordinary Assessment Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Particular incapacity is a condition that may be assessed by the Special Assessment Board as part of their duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f281684938925901a68a287ea35fbc44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;WORK CAPACITY OF EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Partial incapacity affects an employee's work capacity and can influence decisions on periodical payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FUNERAL EXPENSES" are included in the compensation as per the text provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funeral expenses are apportioned from the total compensation as per the distribution rules described in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f42f51d2c6e983618042024d83fb403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Not explicitly mentioned but both are part of the compensation context provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED OCCUPATIONAL THERAPIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Not explicitly mentioned but both are part of the compensation context provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE ON THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both expenses are part of a broader set of benefits provided under the legislation related to compensation for deceased employees. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER can determine claims for FUNERAL EXPENSES based on applications from relevant parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b99b710a13a074eee4b0551f5e725be</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal Personal Representatives can claim Funeral Expenses on behalf of deceased individuals who have paid these expenses but died before receiving reimbursement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Review Certificates can include or modify Funeral Expenses claims, providing a more accurate reimbursement amount if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are types of expenses covered under the same certificates and claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both FUNERAL EXPENSES and MEDICAL ATTENDANCE FEES are expenses that the employer must consider in their total liability under Section 6(5). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION UNDER SECTION 6(5)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compensation limit under Section 6(5) includes funeral expenses. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6(1) deals with the compensation for funeral expenses, directly linking these two entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6E(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6E(1)(a) involves funeral expenses, which are also covered under Section 42D for compensation purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST DETERMINATION OF COMMISSIONER IN FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Funeral expenses are part of compensation for which appeals can be made against Commissioner's determinations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURY COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee injury compensation includes provisions for funeral expenses as part of its distribution rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f42f51d2c6e983618042024d83fb403</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL FEES&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MEDICAL FEES" are included in the compensation as per the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
