  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioner" can be involved in providing medical fees, though not directly stated, it is related to medical services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL FEES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHIROPRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chiropractor" is a medical professional and may involve in providing "medical fees"."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGES OR SALARIES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED PHYSIOTHERAPIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"WAGES OR SALARIES" can be related to registered physiotherapists' payment as per general understanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"WAGES OR SALARIES" refer to salaries or wages, which can be part of a registered physiotherapist's payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ADDITIONAL FEES OR INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Temporary Payment" may include additional fees or interest as per the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bd0b12255f92625b40e8341bf78636d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A period of absence certified by a Registered Dentist also impacts wages in similar ways as other practitioners."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bad177b227e380cc066abb25e6c2cf7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;PHYSIOTHERAPY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Registered Dentists and Physiotherapists are mentioned as providing medical treatment, though not directly related in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Dentists can provide treatments that might be subject to payment under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certificate from a REGISTERED DENTIST is needed to support an application related to changes in the employee's dental health conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A registered dentist can provide a certificate regarding an employee's condition that may affect their work capacity and thus influence decisions on periodical payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employee can get dental treatment supervised by a registered dentist."&lt;SEP&gt;"The EMPLOYEE has the right to undergo medical examinations with a REGISTERED DENTIST, but they are responsible for the costs. If necessary, the employer can require treatment from such dentist without cost to the employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c1ed02e78cf2ee9e321f22dbe3ba84b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1faa1664ffe65d577dff74396c2e0ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A registered dentist's certificate can support an employer's application to end or diminish a periodical payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;PERMANENT INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A registered dentist can provide a certificate regarding permanent incapacity which may affect decisions on periodical payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The board includes members who are registered dentists as part of its composition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER-FUNDED (VOLUNTARY) MPFS BENEFIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Dentists may be beneficiaries or recipients of employer-funded voluntary medical benefits provided by employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a67530e0a9df975682238097b18b864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;RECOGNIZED SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, a recognized scheme of medical treatment might include dental care provided by a registered dentist."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d908f80036493cf02a5dd6da247a2a7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE HEALTH CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The REGISTERED DENTIST can issue an EMPLOYEE HEALTH CERTIFICATE in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd5f66bf87b244d8c901c733042ddc26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;DIAGNOSIS AND TREATMENT RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A REGISTERED DENTIST's diagnosis and treatment can be documented in a DIAGNOSIS AND TREATMENT RECORD, which is relevant to employee health certificates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd5f66bf87b244d8c901c733042ddc26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employees' Compensation Ordinance covers injuries or occupational diseases that may require advice from a registered dentist."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A medical certificate can be issued by a registered dentist for employee fitness and sickness days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered dentists may attend employees in the hospital for advice and treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, a registered dentist has the authority to provide an appropriate medical certificate for sickness allowance claims when relevant."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certificate from a registered dentist is necessary for dental-related medical treatments that are not covered by the scheme."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42671f6db02a812e702214c1753dfc91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2025&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance specifies that incapability in excess of 48 hours must be supported by a registered dentist."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b48e83da24f4750fe34f6e53c34ac0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED CHIROPRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;THE CHIROPRACTIC REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 428)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chiropractic Registration Ordinance (Chapter 428) defines the term 'registered chiropractor'. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of 'registered chiropractor' is given by the The Chiropractic Registration Ordinance (Chapter 428). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED CHIROPRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;2006年第16號第12條增補&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment in 2006 (No. 16, Article 12) provides the basis for defining 'registered chiropractor'. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED CHIROPRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee might receive chiropractic treatment from a registered chiropractor under supervision."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED OCCUPATIONAL THERAPIST&quot;" target="&quot;THE SPECIALIST MEDICAL PROFESSION ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 359)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Specialist Medical Profession Ordinance (Chapter 359) defines the term 'registered occupational therapist'. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of 'registered occupational therapist' is given by the The Specialist Medical Profession Ordinance (Chapter 359). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED OCCUPATIONAL THERAPIST&quot;" target="&quot;2006年第16號第12條增補&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment in 2006 (No. 16, Article 12) provides the basis for defining 'registered occupational therapist'. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT INSURANCE BUSINESS&quot;" target="&quot;1969年第55號第3條增補&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment in 1969 (No. 55, Article 3) provides the basis for defining 'accident insurance business'. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT INSURANCE BUSINESS&quot;" target="&quot;2025年第33號第190條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision in 2025 (No. 33, Article 190) provides the basis for defining 'accident insurance business'. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT INSURANCE BUSINESS&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 41)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accident insurance business is one of the classes of insurance specified in the Insurance Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MEDICAL REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CAP.161)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Medical Registration Ordinance (Cap. 161) defines the term 'registered medical practitioner'. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of 'registered medical practitioner' is given by the The Medical Registration Ordinance (Cap. 161). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 29(A) OF THE MEDICAL REGISTRATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 29(a) of The Medical Registration Ordinance is part of the definition for 'registered medical practitioner'. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of 'registered medical practitioner' includes those registered under Article 29(a) of the The Medical Registration Ordinance. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2006年第16號第12條增補&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment in 2006 (No. 16, Article 12) provides the basis for defining 'registered medical practitioner'. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7266eb6e2df511d14420717ab492d463</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ECAFB (EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE FUND BOARD)&quot;" target="&quot;INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ECAF Board is involved in the process of interim payments, which are related to compensation matters under their jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033087b2f1fb0d32b2faddaa41f6e432</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ECAFB (EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE FUND BOARD)&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ECAF Board issues certificates for interim payments as part of the compensation process they manage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033087b2f1fb0d32b2faddaa41f6e432</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT OF APPRENTICESHIP&quot;" target="&quot;IMPROVERSHIP OR LEARNERSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A contract of apprenticeship includes contracts of improvership or learnership, indicating a relationship in terms of training agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A principal contractor may be involved in issuing or receiving interim payments related to project work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033087b2f1fb0d32b2faddaa41f6e432</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal contractor is likely involved in the review process of certificates for interim payments, as they manage such projects."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033087b2f1fb0d32b2faddaa41f6e432</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A principal contractor may issue or be responsible for certifying interim payments related to their project work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033087b2f1fb0d32b2faddaa41f6e432</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR is liable to pay COMPENSATION to EMPLOYEES working for SUB-CONTRACTORS as if they were directly employed by the PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd3149c252f1ac5ec61e07c2fc936cbc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ORDINANCE defines the liability of PRINCIPAL CONTRACTORS towards EMPLOYEES working for SUB-CONTRACTORS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd3149c252f1ac5ec61e07c2fc936cbc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR is responsible for paying WAGES to an EMPLOYEE under section 43C and can recover these wages from a SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR."&lt;SEP&gt;"The employee is required to serve notice on the principal contractor before making any claim, which involves providing personal details and accident particulars."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2852e178b14d2f1e89cf137922f29e35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bfdf4a9968aec09594f73a07cdf18d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule specifies the applicable amount in relation to the liability of principal contractors and their sub-contractors."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">26.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR contracts to perform BUILDING WORKS, which includes various construction activities and installations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The principal contractor is directly responsible for carrying out the building works as per agreements with property owners or occupiers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The principal contractor is responsible for carrying out the building works and may subcontract parts of it to a nominated sub-contractor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1766fce0308d4fb774b3b29e83cb45eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cb98b63e05e5bcca889147b0b338ac8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;ARCHITECT, SURVEYOR, CIVIL ENGINEER, URBAN PLANNER, STRUCTURAL ENGINEER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal contractor may enter into agreements with architects, surveyors, civil engineers, urban planners, or structural engineers for the building works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0cb98b63e05e5bcca889147b0b338ac8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;OWNER OR OCCUPIER OF PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal contractor enters into a contract directly with an owner or occupier of property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;AGENT OR AUTHORIZED ARCHITECT, SURVEYOR OR CIVIL, MUNICIPAL OR STRUCTURAL ENGINEER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal contractor may enter into a contract with an agent or authorized architect, surveyor or civil, municipal or structural engineer of the owner or occupier."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR (次承判商)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A sub-contractor enters into a contract with the principal contractor to perform work for an owner or occupier."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal contractor and superior sub-contractors are jointly liable for paying the wages of employees under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c648be5705790613057129f42ce74462</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal contractor is responsible for paying the wages of employees employed by a sub-contractor if such wages are not paid within the specified period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c648be5705790613057129f42ce74462</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE UNDER SECTION 43D&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The notice under section 43D triggers the payment obligation for the principal contractor regarding employee wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c648be5705790613057129f42ce74462</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Principal Contractor may face legal consequences if they do not comply with the regulations set by the Commissioner regarding notices and payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1082e0d73690e2409d13d0dfdf0e64c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE OF A SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Principal Contractor can avoid wage payment responsibility if the Employee serves notice within 14 days as required by law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af77be8b003511c35b7551f4285bb427</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;CONVICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Principal Contractor can be convicted if they fail to comply with legal wage payment requirements without reasonable excuse."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af77be8b003511c35b7551f4285bb427</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR may deduct wages paid to an EMPLOYEE from the SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR as a set-off, based on work sub-contracted by the SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bfdf4a9968aec09594f73a07cdf18d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SET-OFF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR can use SET-OFF to recover WAGES paid to an EMPLOYEE from a SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR based on work sub-contracted by the latter."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bfdf4a9968aec09594f73a07cdf18d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are entities that can receive notices or requests under the service provisions mentioned in section 43L."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-93a1fe97f228ec755ced3c31d6506c86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interim payment certificates are reviewed and confirmed by the relevant authority, often involving a principal contractor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033087b2f1fb0d32b2faddaa41f6e432</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates of interim payments document the interim payments made during project work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-033087b2f1fb0d32b2faddaa41f6e432</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;52 OF 2000 S. 3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interim payments are added in 2000, indicating a change or addition to the legal framework for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms refer to certificates issued under different provisions of the same regulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Review Certificate of Interim Payment may replace or continue from the original Certificate of Interim Payment if the initial one is cancelled."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9a6dfc79f4a9de7dba162e137dcffd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550180dac5a100738db953050f3d47b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment period is also applicable for review certificates of interim payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, the date of issue applies to review certificates as well."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SPOUSE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Certificate of Interim Payment will be issued to the spouse after a determination has been made by the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The spouse will receive the Certificate of Interim Payment from the Commissioner detailing the interim payment determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55bb18157fba38057f130a7b17e656fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD EXPIRY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Certificate of Interim Payment triggers actions upon the expiry of the payment period, including surcharge calculation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d03bb282f99bcf0993cd32ec58e1edb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;OBJECTION TO DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person may object to a determination under subsection (1)(a) by sending an objection in writing signed by him to the Commissioner within 14 days from the date of issue of the Certificate of Interim Payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d03bb282f99bcf0993cd32ec58e1edb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REVIEW INITIATION BY COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may initiate a review on his own initiative if he considers that a determination under subsection (1)(a) was made in ignorance or based on false information."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d03bb282f99bcf0993cd32ec58e1edb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment period is defined to start from the date of issue of a certificate of interim payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to vary or determine claims related to interim payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date of issue refers to when a certificate of interim payment was issued."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf9822f57c8a8c75b294d17dfa49f864</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Review Certificate is a type of document that can be issued in relation to the original certificate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both Certificates are used to state reimbursement amounts, with the Review Certificate potentially providing more detailed or corrected information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Review Certificates are used to re-evaluate or challenge the original Certificate of Funeral and Medical Attendance Expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Review Certificates for Funeral and Medical Attendance Expenses can be used to re-evaluate or challenge the original Certificate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Similar naming convention, both are related to expenses review certificates for funeral and medical attendance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550180dac5a100738db953050f3d47b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE ON THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Likewise, Review Certificates may also include or modify Medical Attendance on the Employee claims for accurate reimbursement amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Review Certificates for Funeral and Medical Attendance Expenses are a way to re-evaluate specific types of compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Review Certificates and Section 16A Certificates both deal with specific types of expenses, but the former is a newer method that may have different application conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16CA AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Review Certificates and Section 16CA Agreements both deal with specific types of expenses, but the latter is a newer form that may have additional requirements or conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates for Funeral and Medical Attendance Expenses can also be used to settle certain compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE FOR FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 8 AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates for Funeral and Medical Attendance Expenses can also be determined through agreements under Section 8, indicating an overlap in determination methods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational diseases can lead to medical treatments as part of the healthcare process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-550180dac5a100738db953050f3d47b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational diseases specified in Schedule 2 are to be reported by medical practitioners to the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule 2 lists specific conditions that qualify as occupational diseases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05288c51fb6c9855d3f031e51b7e2be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550180dac5a100738db953050f3d47b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation is provided for occupational diseases as if they were caused by an accident in employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55b9afafd03eeeed71ede32974cead3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claim for compensation arises from an occupational disease that may have been contracted in any of the employers' employment during the prescribed period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER FROM WHOM THE COMPENSATION IS RECOVERABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This entity is responsible for compensating due to an occupational disease contracted in their employment, as per legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER EMPLOYERS WHO EMPLOYED HIM IN SUCH EMPLOYMENT DURING SUCH PERIOD AS HE OR THEY MAY POSSESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These employers may be held liable for compensation if it is proven that the disease was contracted during their employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE INJURY OR ILLNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational diseases can lead to workplace injuries or illnesses, affecting employees' work capacity and potentially leading to compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-28e7d6d62033f777323f252b1d52645d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;INDUSTRY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational diseases are related to specific industries as mentioned in the Second Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-082f06bd634567bd06a50adf127eb9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;TRADE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational diseases are linked with specific trades as mentioned in the Second Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-082f06bd634567bd06a50adf127eb9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;DOCTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Doctors must report any discovered or suspected OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES that are listed in Schedule 2 and believed to be caused by exposures mentioned in Schedule 3."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3d781ae6a3974dcd155b4f5b736d6161</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CHIEF OFFICER receives reports of OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES from doctors as part of their duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3d781ae6a3974dcd155b4f5b736d6161</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;COLUMN 3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Diseases potentially attributable to occupations listed in Column 3 of Schedule 2 must be reported by medical practitioners to the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05288c51fb6c9855d3f031e51b7e2be3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certificate issued by a registered medical practitioner is required for certain types of medical treatments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42671f6db02a812e702214c1753dfc91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certificate issued by a registered Chinese medicine practitioner is needed if the scheme does not cover specific treatments provided by them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42671f6db02a812e702214c1753dfc91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 102 OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 102 of the Ordinance limits or modifies the applicability of provisions in Schedule 2."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ad741dbed5c956a0e2be863adf9b077</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Provisions from Schedule 2 apply to arbitration agreements as specified by Section 100."&lt;SEP&gt;"The arbitration agreement can specify the applicability of Schedule 2, which affects Sections 100 and 101."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ad741dbed5c956a0e2be863adf9b077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY COUNCIL ORDINANCE (CAP. 587)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule 2 is referenced in the context of Sections 100 and 101 not applying under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 100 AND 101&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule 2 is referenced in relation to Sections 100 and 101 not applying under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;" target="&quot;WALKWAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Walkways are included as part of the structures listed in Schedule 2 under section 70. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-236f00f9bfd67b3814958a8c6ddf9450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR ARBITRATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT OR ARBITRATOR considers matters specified in SCHEDULE 2 when determining the reasonableness of a term or notice, as per section 3(2)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51792815fbdf7d62aebbf3740d5c33b8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 7(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7(2), which relates to hovercraft, has implications for the validation criteria outlined in Schedule 2."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5ff7ccd88e0bf1fa24f736784b46e37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2&quot;" target="&quot;REASONABLE STANDARDS VALIDATION CRITERIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The reasonable standards validation criteria are detailed in Schedule 2 and apply specifically to certain contractual terms involving hovercraft, as per Section 7(2)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5ff7ccd88e0bf1fa24f736784b46e37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;PRIVATE MEDICAL INSTITUTIONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 633)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hospitals are defined under the Private Medical Institutions Ordinance (Cap. 633), which provides their licensing criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Private Medical Institutions Ordinance defines hospitals, which are not considered residential units under Section 2(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-178a551bcbbb140ed32885ff11a760d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88128975194421da26a5cd7caa858a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY条例(CAP. 113)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public hospitals fall under the Hospital Authority, as per the Hospital Authority Ordinance (Cap. 113). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88128975194421da26a5cd7caa858a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 655)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Hong Kong Chinese Medicine Hospital is mentioned under both ordinances, indicating a connection between hospitals and traditional medicine."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88128975194421da26a5cd7caa858a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD (普通評估委員會)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The board can assess claims related to medical treatment in hospitals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51d776901078e225f9c3c73c7879b5ff</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical expenses are payable by the employer for treatment in a hospital, with rates specified."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ba7e2407b8844aba128e42ffefa2f5d5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fourth schedule provides details on the implementation of certain clauses related to insurance coverage and rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ba7e2407b8844aba128e42ffefa2f5d5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;HOSPITAL (GOVERNMENT-OPERATED)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'Hospital' includes government-operated hospitals as defined in the Hospital Authority Ordinance (Cap. 113) and specialized clinics."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-34eee1f014b609a8808be1cb2bff9b39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC HOSPITAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'Hospital' encompasses public hospitals operated by the Government under the Hospital Authority Ordinance (Cap. 113). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-34eee1f014b609a8808be1cb2bff9b39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG CHINESE MEDICINE HOSPITAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"According to the definition in the Traditional Chinese Medical Services Ordinance (Cap. 655), 'Hospital' includes Hong Kong Chinese Medicine Hospitals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-34eee1f014b609a8808be1cb2bff9b39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;PRIVATE MEDICAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'Hospital' also covers private hospitals that have been licensed under the Private Medical Institutions Ordinance (Cap. 633). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-34eee1f014b609a8808be1cb2bff9b39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;DIAGNOSIS AND TREATMENT RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A DIAGNOSIS AND TREATMENT RECORD issued by a doctor within the HOSPITAL is relevant to employee health certificates when an employee is hospitalized."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd5f66bf87b244d8c901c733042ddc26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered doctors can issue certificates for employees examined at the hospital under certain conditions as stated in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registered doctors can issue certificates of attendance when conducting examinations in hospitals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registered doctors can provide diagnoses and treatments at hospitals, which are crucial for generating DIAGNOSIS AND TREATMENT RECORDS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd5f66bf87b244d8c901c733042ddc26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f158408c588106f3a0fd30a322902be</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;OUT-PATIENT SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Out-patient service is provided in the hospital where employees receive treatment from practitioners."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;IN-PATIENT SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In-patient service is provided in the hospital where employees receive treatment from practitioners."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered medical practitioners may attend employees in the hospital for advice and treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chinese medicine practitioners are also mentioned to be involved in issuing certificates when working within a healthcare setting such as a hospital."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registered Chinese medicine practitioners can also issue certificates of attendance for in-patient examinations conducted at the hospital."&lt;SEP&gt;"Registered Chinese medicine practitioners may attend employees in the hospital for advice and treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b89f7731524d41ce9b762132c808abd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f158408c588106f3a0fd30a322902be</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;THE CHINESE MEDICINE HOSPITAL OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese Medicine Hospital of Hong Kong is considered as one type of hospital within the context of sickness allowance and related regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;PRIVATE HEALTHCARE FACILITIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 633)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Private healthcare facilities are recognized under the definition of 'hospital' in this ordinance, which is relevant to sickness allowance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of Hospital does not include those as defined in the Private Healthcare Facilities Ordinance (Cap. 633). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236f00f9bfd67b3814958a8c6ddf9450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY ORDINANCE (CAP. 113)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public hospitals maintained by the Hospital Authority Ordinance are included within the context of hospital definitions for sickness allowance purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;33A CLAUSE OF EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2022&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The HOSPITAL plays a role in the issuance of certificates under the 33A clause, specifically when the check-up is conducted on-site."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60efa76430de6c8c3995f39eeee4cc13</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL PROFESSIONAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical professionals such as registered doctors and registered Chinese medicine practitioners are involved in issuing certificates for employees who need to be examined at the hospital."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f158408c588106f3a0fd30a322902be</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;MIDWIFE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Midwives, registered under specific legislation, may be involved as medical professionals conducting examinations within a hospital setting."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;NURSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Nurses are part of the healthcare team that can assist in or conduct certain types of medical examinations at hospitals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;2024年第24號第91條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment applies to hospitals and their roles within the context of medical examinations related to pregnancy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTORS, REGISTERED DENTISTS, REGISTERED CHIROPRACTORS, REGISTERED PHYSIOTHERAPISTS OR OCCUPATIONAL THERAPISTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical expenses include charges from registered medical professionals such as doctors and dentists."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88128975194421da26a5cd7caa858a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SURGICAL FEES AND THERAPY FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Surgeries and therapies are part of the medical expenses incurred during treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88128975194421da26a5cd7caa858a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;NURSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Nursing costs are a component of overall medical expenses for patient care."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88128975194421da26a5cd7caa858a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;IN-PATIENT AT HOSPITALS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In-patient stays at hospitals generate significant medical expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88128975194421da26a5cd7caa858a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICINES, TREATMENT ITEMS, AND MEDICINAL DRESSINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medicines and treatment items are part of the total medical expenses incurred during hospitalization or treatments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88128975194421da26a5cd7caa858a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 10A&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical expenses payable under section 10A fall under the broader category of compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 7 AND 9&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 7 and 9 deal with medical expenses that may be paid by the employer in excess of regular compensation, impacting medical costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6E(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6E(1)(a) involves medical expenses which are also covered under Section 42D for compensation purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;WORK INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MEDICAL EXPENSES are incurred due to WORK INJURY suffered by an EMPLOYEE during employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f5fe723dc66b1a35b256f0fbcfd9642</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Medical Practitioners are involved in providing certified treatments that may incur expenses if not covered by free medical treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioners can provide treatments that might be subject to payment under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers have liability for paying medical expenses as per the laws and ordinances mentioned."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c507c410ec255631812c63bb0a5d8bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may receive medical treatment that incurs expenses, which are subject to employer's payment obligations under Hong Kong law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c507c410ec255631812c63bb0a5d8bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;RETAILER LICENCE ISSUED UNDER SECTION [SECTION NUMBER] OF THE CHINESE MEDICINAL MATERIALS ORDINANCE (CAP. 549 SUB. LEG. F)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Retailers with a licence are involved in the sale of medicines that may be covered by medical expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;PHARMACY AND POISONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 138)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This ordinance affects what costs can be included under medical expenses for Chinese herbal medicine."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The registration of proprietary Chinese medicines impacts the definition and coverage of medical expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court can review and confirm, vary or reverse the determination regarding medical expenses issued by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cbcb1ef289ad456f0c48fcfc25edb43d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may incur or be entitled to receive medical expenses as a result of an incident."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cbcb1ef289ad456f0c48fcfc25edb43d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;職業治療師的收費&quot;" target="&quot;外科收費或療法收費&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"職業治療师的收费和外科或疗法费用都是医疗相关费用，但它们之间没有直接关系。文本中未明确指出两者之间的联系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;職業治療師的收費&quot;" target="&quot;護理費用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"職業治療师可能提供护理服务，因此这两者可能存在间接关联。但是具体收费项目并未在文本中明确说明存在直接关系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;職業治療師的收費&quot;" target="&quot;住院病人身分入住醫院的費用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"住院费用通常包括职业治疗师的服务费，但两者之间没有直接描述联系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;職業治療師的收費&quot;" target="&quot;藥物、治療物品及藥用敷料的費用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"药物和治疗用品可能在患者接受治疗过程中使用，因此可能存在间接关联。但是具体收费项目并未在文本中明确说明存在直接关系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;職業治療師的收費&quot;" target="&quot;由2006年第16號第12條代替&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"职业治疗师收费条款被其他条款取代或修改，因此存在间接关系。但具体细节未在文本中明确说明。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;職業治療師的收費&quot;" target="&quot;由1980年第44號第15條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"职业治疗师收费条款被其他条款取代或修改，因此存在间接关系。但具体细节未在文本中明确说明。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;住院病人身分入住醫院的費用&quot;" target="&quot;由2006年第16號第12條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"住院费用条款被其他条款取代或修改，因此存在间接关系。但具体细节未在文本中明确说明。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;藥物、治療物品及藥用敷料的費用&quot;" target="&quot;由2006年第16號第12條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"药物和治疗用品费用条款被其他条款取代或修改，因此存在间接关系。但具体细节未在文本中明确说明。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第10B(1)(B)條&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长根据第10B(1)(b)条发出书面证明来裁定医疗费用，两者之间有直接联系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;家庭成員 (MEMBER OF THE FAMILY)&quot;" target="&quot;領養令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"领养令定义了哪些人可以被视为家庭成员的一部分，因此这两者存在明确的法律关系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;家庭成員 (MEMBER OF THE FAMILY)&quot;" target="&quot;《領養條例》(第290章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"《领养条例》规定了成为家庭成员的具体条件和程序，两者之间有直接联系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;家庭成員 (MEMBER OF THE FAMILY)&quot;" target="&quot;由2000年第52號第3條增補&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"文本中提到该家庭成员定义在2000年进行了补充说明，两者之间有直接联系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;領養令&quot;" target="&quot;由2004年第28號第35條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"领养令条款被其他条款修订，两者之间有直接联系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《領養條例》(第290章)&quot;" target="&quot;1973年1月1日前按照中國法律及習俗在香港作出的領养&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
