<edge source="&quot;由1995年第1號第2條代替。&lt;BR&gt;編輯修訂——2018年第1號編輯修訂紀錄&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长的职责和权力可能受到其他条款的影响或修订，但具体细节未在文本中明确说明。因此只能推测存在间接联系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d685de840aec3e84c6ab3d5c85a2c77</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LLOYD'S&quot;" target="&quot;领养条例(第290章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LLOYD'S"与《领养条例》中的定义和条款有关,尽管文本中没有直接提及LLOYD'S的具体关系,但作为译名,LLOYD'S可能涉及相关法律文件的翻译或解释工作。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-457d9503e754bcc19c6e39039a25bb6f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT (法院)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court can refer to the District Court for certain proceedings related to compensation recovery as per section 36."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">22.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court can hear appeals against decisions or assessments made by the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court can refer cases involving compensation recovery to the Commissioner for determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court sends a notice to the Commissioner upon receiving a claim where death results from injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038d93706fae2839f459e5e67e58e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"For claims exceeding SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL's jurisdiction, they can be brought in the DISTRICT COURT as a civil debt."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f5fe723dc66b1a35b256f0fbcfd9642</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court can hear appeals against decisions or assessments made by a Special Assessment Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A, 16D, 16E, 16G, 16GA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court hears appeals related to sections 16A, 16D, 16E, 16G or 16GA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 8, SECTION 16A, 16F, 16G, 16GA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court hears appeals related to sections 8 and 16A, 16F, 16G or 16GA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 76 OF 1982 S. 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court hears appeals related to section 76 of the 1982 Act and its subsequent amendments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31 OF 1985, SECTION 59 OF 1988&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court hears appeals related to sections 31 of 1985 and section 59 of 1988."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;AGREEMENT UNDER SECTION 8&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court can make determinations regarding agreements under section 8, which may be related to appeals heard by the court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038abcb26f772c8f77b5ead3c3b7177c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court is responsible for determining matters arising out of proceedings related to compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court is responsible for determining matters arising out of claims for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION DOCTOR, TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"For claims based on changes in the employee's condition, the court may require evidence from a registered doctor, traditional Chinese medicine practitioner or dentist."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court has jurisdiction over compensation claims, as if it were empowered by The District Court Ordinance (Cap. 336) to determine all such claims regardless of the amount involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Court has the authority to determine all claims for compensation under the District Court Ordinance, Cap. 336."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-99200b663e8bce393d63651cd3a038bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;THE DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 336)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court's powers and jurisdictions are derived from The District Court Ordinance (Cap. 336), which grants it authority to hear and determine compensation claims as if it were empowered by the ordinance itself."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-99200b663e8bce393d63651cd3a038bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court has the power to submit questions of law for determination by the Court of Appeal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;CIVIL ACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court handles civil actions, and its jurisdiction extends over compensation claims as per the District Court Ordinance (Cap. 336)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST ORDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court can order interest on sums recovered in civil actions involving compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court has jurisdiction to assess compensation as per certain provisions in the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71e61f5794135dfe2a1a6e5ae434940c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;APPELLATE TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In cases where an appeal is made, the Appellate Tribunal can review and potentially alter decisions made by the District Court regarding compensation assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71e61f5794135dfe2a1a6e5ae434940c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;21 OF 2018 S. 3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court has jurisdiction over claims added by section 3 of Act 21 of 2018."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb14dc46e73a0904990632336b013f69</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;2022年第5號第4條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision to the law in 2022, No. 5 Article 4, affects the jurisdiction and interpretation related to District Court decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb14dc46e73a0904990632336b013f69</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY FOR A BOND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Surety for a bond can apply to District Court to be discharged from their obligation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edaba831bd1e0154426defdca143f061</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES (損害賠償)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Damages are recoverable by an employee independently of this Ordinance, indicating a relationship between damages and employees in legal contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES (損害賠償)&quot;" target="&quot;EARNINGS (收入)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both damages and earnings are related to financial compensation in employment disputes, with earnings specifically defining what is included within such compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038d93706fae2839f459e5e67e58e664</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES (損害賠償)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER (僱主)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Damages can be recovered from the employer if an employee suffers personal injury during their employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038d93706fae2839f459e5e67e58e664</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES (損害賠償)&quot;" target="&quot;ECAFB (管理局)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ECAFB may be involved in the administration or distribution of damages related to employee compensation cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038d93706fae2839f459e5e67e58e664</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARNINGS (收入)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER (僱主)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers are responsible for paying earnings to employees, which is a key aspect of employment relationships."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038d93706fae2839f459e5e67e58e664</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ECAFB (管理局)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER (僱主)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers are subject to regulations and oversight by the ECAFB regarding employee compensation matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-038d93706fae2839f459e5e67e58e664</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER (僱主)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE (雇員)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers and employees have relationships governed by employment regulations and licensing requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIVATE HEALTHCARE FACILITIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 633)&quot;" target="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY ORDINANCE (CAP. 113)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances define hospitals in a way that includes various types of healthcare facilities, thus they are interrelated in the context of sickness allowance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both ordinances relate to healthcare facilities but serve different purposes, with the latter focusing on hospitals maintained by the Government."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIVATE HEALTHCARE FACILITIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 633)&quot;" target="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE HOSPITAL OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese Medicine Hospital of Hong Kong is a type of healthcare facility defined under the Private Healthcare Facilities Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIVATE HEALTHCARE FACILITIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 633)&quot;" target="&quot;THE CHINESE MEDICINE HOSPITAL OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese Medicine Hospital of Hong Kong is also considered a type of hospital under the definition provided by this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIVATE HEALTHCARE FACILITIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 633)&quot;" target="&quot;HOTEL AND GUESTHOUSE ACCOMMODATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 349)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are separate legal frameworks with distinct definitions, and they do not directly relate to each other in the given context. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-236f00f9bfd67b3814958a8c6ddf9450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY ORDINANCE (CAP. 113)&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 41)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are related to health-related services, with Hospital Authority managing hospitals and Insurance Ordinance regulating insurance companies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY ORDINANCE (CAP. 113)&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Hospital Authority is distinct from the Insurance Authority but both are part of broader health-related services in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY ORDINANCE (CAP. 113)&quot;" target="&quot;THE CHINESE MEDICINE HOSPITAL OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese Medicine Hospital of Hong Kong is recognized under the definition provided by the Hospital Authority Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE HOSPITAL OF HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 41)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese Medicine Hospital is not directly related to the Insurance Ordinance, but both are part of healthcare services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE HOSPITAL OF HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"No direct relationship between these entities as per provided text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 41)&quot;" target="&quot;ASSOCIATION OF UNDERWRITERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Association of Underwriters is an entity that can be authorized under the Insurance Ordinance to carry on certain insurance businesses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 41)&quot;" target="&quot;NOT DIRECTLY MENTIONED BUT RELATED TO POLICIES AND INSURANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While not explicitly referenced, it's implied as a broader legal framework for insurance matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 41)&quot;" target="&quot;DISCLOSURE RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Insurance Ordinance provides an exception for disclosure of certain information to authorized insurers under reasonable commercial purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;SOCIETY OF UNDERWRITERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Insurance Authority regulates the Society of Underwriters, ensuring compliance with insurance regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The INSURANCE AUTHORITY has approval authority for some underwriters before a specific date, as detailed in the ORDINANCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;LLOYD'S SOCIETY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The INSURANCE AUTHORITY has regulatory oversight over LLOYD'S SOCIETY, as it is an association under the ORDINANCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSOCIATION OF UNDERWRITERS&quot;" target="&quot;CLASS 13 OF CLASSES OF INSURANCE BUSINESS SPECIFIED IN PART 3 OF SCHEDULE 1 TO THAT ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Association of Underwriters can be authorized to carry on class 13 insurance business under the Insurance Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSOCIATION OF UNDERWRITERS&quot;" target="&quot;SOCIETY OF UNDERWRITERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are associations related to underwriting but operate differently as per provided text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fe38763521cd6ea4535e1c682771715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNOR IN COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The GOVERNOR IN COUNCIL has approval power over certain associations as specified in the ORDINANCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LLOYD'S SOCIETY&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LLOYD'S SOCIETY is recognized by the ORDINANCE as an association of underwriters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERIM PAYMENT (臨時付款)&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL EXPENSES (醫療費)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"INTERIM PAYMENT can include expenses related to MEDICAL EXPENSES, particularly medical treatment in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL TREATMENT (醫治)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Medical Practitioners provide services under the definition of MEDICAL TREATMENT for employees injured at work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL TREATMENT (醫治)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioners also contribute to the definition of MEDICAL TREATMENT provided in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11b6fd8c9717bd35576cd1770b92c47c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED DENTIST, REGISTERED CHIROPRACTOR, REGISTERED PHYSIOTHERAPIST OR REGISTERED OCCUPATIONAL THERAPIST&quot;" target="&quot;OUTWORKER (外發工)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These practitioners can provide medical treatment to outworkers outside Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51d776901078e225f9c3c73c7879b5ff</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER (家庭成員)&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE (職業病)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members may care for an employee suffering from an occupational disease."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51d776901078e225f9c3c73c7879b5ff</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE (職業病)&quot;" target="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational diseases are covered under the policy of insurance, especially when related to accidents or sudden and identifiable events."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE (職業病)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 44B&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 44B defines the conditions under which occupational diseases are considered accidents or series of accidents for policy purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIAL INCAPACITY(&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'partial incapacity' is defined in relation to employees and their earning capacity, which falls under the purview of an Employees' Compensation Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d00e5d24fe5e70cf9bff7cadb2617bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;(" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER(&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioner is defined under the Chinese Medicine Ordinance, indicating a legal framework for practitioners."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d00e5d24fe5e70cf9bff7cadb2617bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;(" target="&quot;香港&quot;(">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549) applies in the context of Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIROPRACTORS REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 428)&quot;(" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHIROPRACTOR(&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registered Chiropractor is defined under the Chiropractors Registration Ordinance, showing a specific legal framework for this profession."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d00e5d24fe5e70cf9bff7cadb2617bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DENTISTS REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 156)&quot;(" target="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST(&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registered Dentist is defined by section 2(1) of the Dentists Registration Ordinance, establishing a legal framework for this profession."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d00e5d24fe5e70cf9bff7cadb2617bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 161)&quot;(" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER(&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registered Medical Practitioner is defined under the Medical Registration Ordinance and includes both registered practitioners and those deemed to be such, indicating a comprehensive legal framework for medical professionals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d00e5d24fe5e70cf9bff7cadb2617bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ALLIED HEALTH PROFESSIONS ORDINANCE&quot;(" target="&quot;REGISTERED OCCUPATIONAL THERAPIST(&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registered Occupational Therapist is defined under the Allied Health Professions Ordinance, showing its role within this broader legal and regulatory framework for health professionals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d00e5d24fe5e70cf9bff7cadb2617bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 161)&quot;" target="&quot;ALLIED HEALTH PROFESSIONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 359)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Medical Registration Ordinance and the Allied Health Professions Ordinance both deal with registration of health professionals, but under different scopes; CAP. 161 focuses on medical practitioners while CAP. 359 covers allied health professions such as occupational therapists and physiotherapists."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-87c13a5036ab1fa84c38d60a51990cd9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE PEOPLE'S LIBERATION ARMY&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG GOVERNMENT EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese People's Liberation Army is excluded from the application scope defined for Hong Kong government employees under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f01a3b960a2dbd284b449cf8b37e63c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE PEOPLE'S LIBERATION ARMY&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance specifically excludes members of the Chinese People's Liberation Army from its applicability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f01a3b960a2dbd284b449cf8b37e63c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE PEOPLE'S LIBERATION ARMY&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE 50 OF 1954&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance does not apply to members of the Chinese People's Liberation Army."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE PEOPLE'S LIBERATION ARMY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese People's Liberation Army is not covered by the provisions for compensation as per the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HER MAJESTY'S GOVERNMENT IN HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE 76 OF 1982&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ordinance 76 of 1982 specifically excludes employees in Her Majesty’s Government of Hong Kong from its application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE 52 OF 2000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The exercise and performance of the powers and duties of any public body are deemed to be their trade or business according to Ordinance 52 of 2000."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE 76 OF 1982&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation for injury is governed by specific provisions in Ordinance 76 of 1982, which outlines the conditions under which compensation can be paid."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae17a545bdd85603b1810f4143f67b98</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may receive compensation from employers if they suffer injuries during their employment due to workplace accidents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607a2fda7757f874bbb128bc111c8ee6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1964 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;E.R. 1 OF 2018&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment of E.R. 1 of 2018 is based on the addition made by section 4 in 1964."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607a2fda7757f874bbb128bc111c8ee6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;E.R. 1 OF 2018&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"E.R. 1 of 2018 is a format change document that provides rules for compensation related to occupational diseases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e00fdf9b02a058deef2e0c53efa1c4d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;E.R. 1 OF 2018&quot;" target="&quot;APPORTIONMENT OF COMPENSATION PAYABLE TO ELIGIBLE MEMBERS OF THE FAMILY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The format changes documented by E.R. 1 of 2018 include rules for apportioning compensation to eligible family members as detailed in Apportionment of Compensation Payable to Eligible Members of the Family."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f6942b65bc123e327e9f90372813c148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORK INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal responsibility is defined for compensating work-related injuries, specifying conditions under which such compensation must be provided or not."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607a2fda7757f874bbb128bc111c8ee6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORK INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS (義製人體器官)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Prostheses are provided to employees who suffer work injuries, replacing parts of their bodies that have been removed or amputated due to the injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-427b651b5a2a0a36734fd93776b2efbd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORK INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE (外科器具)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Surgical appliances are also provided to employees who suffer work injuries, supporting impaired body parts resulting from the injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-427b651b5a2a0a36734fd93776b2efbd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORK INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accidents are considered as work injuries when they occur due to an accident or a series of accidents, including occupational diseases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdcb847cbe822aecbab442ce9430887f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL RESPONSIBILITY&quot;" target="&quot;EXEMPTION CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Exemption clauses can limit legal responsibilities, but they are subject to certain restrictions in the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0aa5c7bec2bb945d36bb333255416d51</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST AID, RESCUE TRAINING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"First aid and rescue training can occur within the employer's premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings can involve disputes over incidents that occur on the employer's premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST AID, RESCUE TRAINING&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE RESPONSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Training in first aid and rescue equips employees to respond appropriately during emergencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER CONSENT&quot;" target="&quot;INCIDENT LOCATION OUTSIDE EMPLOYER PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer consent is required for incidents occurring outside their premises, including first aid or rescue activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER CONSENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE RESPONSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee responses during incidents require consent from the employer, especially in off-premises situations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCIDENT LOCATION OUTSIDE EMPLOYER PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER-ORDERED TRANSPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Incidents outside the employer's premises can involve employer-ordered transport for emergency response."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-633a54ae013ddfc9a89c4e2cd4f26da7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱主或僱主的代表&quot;" target="&quot;他人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主或其代表與他人之間存在協議,安排交通工具供僱員使用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;居所&quot;" target="&quot;工作地點&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員在從居所前往工作地點或相反途程中可能遭遇意外,這些都被視為受僱工作期間因工遭遇的意外。"&lt;SEP&gt;"僱員從居所前往工作地點途中遭遇意外時被視為受僱工作期間因工遭遇的意外。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdb83d21468796679ea45d3ca07b4e55</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作地點&quot;" target="&quot;香港天文台&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"香港天文台发布天气警告，影响员工前往其居所或工作地点的决策和行动路径。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作地點&quot;" target="&quot;其居所&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"员工可能需要在工作地点和居住地之间移动以响应天气警告或紧急情况的通知。因此两者之间的关系较为紧密。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;烈風警告&quot;" target="&quot;超強颱風 (SUPER TYPHOON)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"烈風警告是描述热带气旋的一种方式，而超强台风是一种特定类型的热带气旋。因此两者之间存在相关性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;烈風警告&quot;" target="&quot;香港天文台&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"香港天文台负责发出热带气旋警告信号，如烈风警告等。因此两者之间存在直接关联性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;暴雨警告&quot;" target="&quot;香港天文台&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"香港天文台发布暴雨警告以提醒公众注意相关天气情况和潜在风险。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;香港天文台&quot;" target="&quot;極端情況公布 (EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"香港天文台与政府合作，共同发布极端情况公告来应对超强台风等自然灾害带来的影响。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;超強颱風 (SUPER TYPHOON)&quot;" target="&quot;極端情況公布 (EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"极端情况公告是针对由超强台风等大规模自然灾害引起的情况发布的声明。因此两者之间存在直接关联性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-686d30ddd39f8474a0c88cb4aa604f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY FOR COMPENSATION FOR DEATH OR INCAPACITY RESULTING FROM ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURED BY ACCIDENT ARISING OUT OF AND IN THE COURSE OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is liable to pay compensation according to the Ordinance when an employee gets injured in the course of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd9ca81af9ebd6573085bdfa4ff00a3d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURED BY ACCIDENT ARISING OUT OF AND IN THE COURSE OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY TO PAY COMPENSATION ACCORDING TO ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer's liability to pay compensation is defined by the Ordinance in case of an employee injury during employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd9ca81af9ebd6573085bdfa4ff00a3d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance defines conditions under which an injury by accident arising out of and in the course of employment can be compensated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST AID, AMBULANCE OR RESCUE WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An injury by accident arising out of employment can be related to first aid, ambulance or rescue work as per the conditions outlined in the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"An injury by accident arising out of employment can be related to first aid, ambulance or rescue work performed with consent from their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;PREMISES OTHER THAN HIS EMPLOYER'S&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An injury by accident arising out of employment can occur in, at or about any premises other than his employer's as per certain conditions outlined in the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation is awarded based on the nature and circumstances of an employee's injury as defined by the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S TRADE OR BUSINESS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation is determined based on whether an employee's actions are done for the purposes of and in connection with their employer's trade or business, according to the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST AID, AMBULANCE OR RESCUE WORK&quot;" target="&quot;PREMISES OTHER THAN HIS EMPLOYER'S&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"First aid, ambulance or rescue work can be performed on premises other than an employee's employer's premises with the consent of their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bec8c023e7d401bc65410e4d6428ec7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF WORK&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accidents at or during travel to and from the place of work are deemed part of an employee's duties and thus within their employment context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEANS OF TRANSPORT&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC TRANSPORT SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public transport services are a subset of means of transport used by employees while traveling to or from their place of work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUPER TYPHOON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT" is made by the Chief Secretary for Administration in response to extreme conditions caused by a super typhoon or other natural disasters of substantial scale."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION makes EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENTS in response to severe weather conditions, including super typhoons."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GALE WARNING&quot;" target="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT (AMENDED 24 OF 2000 S. 2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An extreme conditions announcement may include a gale warning, indicating related scenarios under which accidents are considered in the course of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GALE WARNING&quot;" target="&quot;SUPER TYPHOON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"GALE WARNING is a type of warning issued by the Hong Kong Observatory for tropical cyclones that may lead to conditions similar to those described under SUPER TYPHOON."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RAINSTORM WARNING&quot;" target="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT (AMENDED 24 OF 2000 S. 2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An extreme conditions announcement may include a rainstorm warning, indicating related scenarios under which accidents are considered in the course of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RAINSTORM WARNING&quot;" target="&quot;SUPER TYPHOON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RAINSTORM WARNING is related to heavy rainstorms, which can be part of the broader weather system associated with a SUPER TYPHOON."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GALE WARNING (AMENDED 24 OF 2000 S. 2)&quot;" target="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS ANNOUNCEMENT (AMENDED 24 OF 2000 S. 2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An extreme conditions announcement may include a gale warning, indicating related scenarios under which accidents are considered in the course of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE TRAVEL BETWEEN HIS PLACE OF RESIDENCE AND HIS PLACE OF WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An accident to an employee is considered in the course of employment if it occurs while traveling between his place of residence and work, as part of a direct route."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;TRAVELING TO OR FROM HIS PLACE OF WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accidents during travel to or from the workplace are deemed in the course of employment for an employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;WORKING HOURS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accidents during working hours are specifically mentioned as part of an employee's duties and thus within their employment context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79cc5ddf4e6de2a7921e786b0c812fc5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPER TYPHOON&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG OBSERVATORY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"HONG KONG OBSERVATORY issues tropical cyclone warning signals that include warnings for SUPER TYPHOONS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While not directly mentioned, the Commissioner's role and powers suggest a relationship with the Chief Secretary for Administration who may be involved in administrative oversight."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ede1afd089da6234965403cda2d41666</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;INSURER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurers are required to notify the Chief Secretary for Administration about premium increases, as per section 45D(1A)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ede1afd089da6234965403cda2d41666</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Secretary for Administration determines who constitutes the Advisory Council on the Environment when there are questions about its composition, which is an event related to this role."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;ENVIRONMENT CONSULTATION COMMITTEE COMPOSITION DETERMINATION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Secretary for Administration determines who constitutes the Environment Consultation Committee when there are questions about its composition, which is an event related to this role."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Secretary for Administration is responsible for ensuring that contraventions reported by the Authority regarding noise made by public officers are addressed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ae14afda9d52be1864e9090474b79d7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Secretary for Administration receives reports from the Authority about potential contraventions related to noise made by public officers in their duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ae14afda9d52be1864e9090474b79d7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DEPARTMENT is responsible to a public officer as determined by the CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a63521ff775998da1314db4dd547a7d9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPER TYPHOON (超強颱風)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The presence of a SUPER TYPHOON can affect the safety and travel arrangements of EMPLOYEES, potentially impacting their work conditions or requiring them to take precautions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-751eea5a9359446ee65e5dee8d66e6a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER&quot;" target="&quot;CHILD OF ADOPTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A child who is adopted becomes a family member to the adopter but not to any other parent or guardian."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-786e383c94a3c844d81a1afb79da985c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">20.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A FAMILY MEMBER can be the recipient of payments made by the EMPLOYER on account of claims pending settlement or determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"An EMPLOYEE's FAMILY MEMBER can receive payments related to claims or compensation under the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family members receive compensation in the event of an employee's death due to injury during work-related travel."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d19ac100c430c329d42230a7654f3c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f08187ad728064351e188904ac02ad6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER&quot;" target="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES ALLOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members are recipients of FUNERAL EXPENSES ALLOCATION as per legal framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation is determined based on the type and severity of injuries, particularly those specified in the First Schedule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Compensation is provided to employees who suffer injuries while traveling for employment purposes, as per legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f08187ad728064351e188904ac02ad6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062631c2ee8edb363f6cc234fa986a1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Permanent total incapacity is determined based on injuries as per the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-430e5976cb2d37cf2cc19b50c8f851c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;1985 S. 3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Injury is a key term that leads to the amendment of 1985 S. 3 as per the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-430e5976cb2d37cf2cc19b50c8f851c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;4條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision of 4条涉及到损伤的定义或处理方式，表明二者存在相关性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-430e5976cb2d37cf2cc19b50c8f851c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
