  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can make regulations for Sixth Schedule matters through Gazette orders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sixth Schedule provides details on how expenses should be apportioned and specifies surcharge amounts for non-payment by employers."</data>
