  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 6(5) is repealed, which indirectly affects the calculation method for compensation in fatal cases as referenced by SECTION 6(1)(C). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11e05d44f5461a2b7dca424d8058b93d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L.N. 566 OF 1995&quot;" target="&quot;L.N. 463 OF 1993&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are legislative notices from the same year (1993 and 1995) but not directly related in content based on provided text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L.N. 566 OF 1995&quot;" target="&quot;52 OF 2000 S. 5&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The latter replaces the former, indicating a legislative change over time but not directly related in content as per given context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L.N. 566 OF 1995&quot;" target="&quot;处长或法院&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legislative notices do not directly influence the authority or court's actions as per given context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;L.N. 79 OF 1983; L.N. 321 OF 1985; L.N. 390 OF 1987; L.N. 386 OF 1989; L.N. 435 OF 1991; L.N. 463 OF 1993; L.N. 566 OF 1995; 36 OF 1996 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
