  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;E.R. 2 OF 2018&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule is part of E.R. 2 OF 2018, which may have amendments or omissions as noted in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a63521ff775998da1314db4dd547a7d9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6(2)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 7; SECTION 9&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6(2) specifies conditions for compensation, while Sections 7 and 9 specify related provisions that may affect the calculation or applicability of subsection (1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6(2)&quot;" target="&quot;REIMBURSEMENT OF REASONABLE FUNERAL EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6(2) specifies conditions and amounts for reimbursement, which is directly linked to funeral expenses. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6(5)&quot;" target="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES; MEDICAL ATTENDANCE ON THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6(5) specifies reimbursement for funeral expenses and medical attendance, which are related to the deceased employee. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6(5)&quot;" target="&quot;REASONABLE MEDICAL ATTENDANCE ON THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are specified under Section 6(5), detailing the reasonable costs that should be reimbursed for medical attendance and funeral expenses. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6(5)&quot;" target="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE ON THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6(5) directly specifies the reimbursement for both funeral expenses and medical attendance. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6(5)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COMMISSIONER is involved in the application process for SECTION 6(5), where the COURT may vary an order based on family circumstances or other sufficient causes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a0cf86f8afb0c798</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 4; SECTION 44 OF 1980&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE; L.N. 386 OF 1989; L.N. 435 OF 1991; L.N. 463 OF 1993; L.N. 566 OF 1995; 36 OF 1996 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These sections and legislative notifications are related to the compensation schedule, as they provide context for the amounts specified in the Schedule. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;52 OF 2000 S. 5&quot;" target="&quot;44 OF 1980 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The latter replaces the former according to the context, indicating a legislative change over time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;52 OF 2000 S. 5&quot;" target="&quot;处长或法院&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legislative notices do not directly influence the authority or court's actions as per given context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6(2) SPECIFIED IN THE FIRST COLUMN OF THAT SCHEDULE; SECTION 7 OR 9; SECTION 6(5)&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE; L.N. 386 OF 1989; L.N. 435 OF 1991; L.N. 463 OF 1993; L.N. 566 OF 1995; 36 OF 1996 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Schedule and related legislative notifications specify the conditions, amounts, and provisions for compensation under Sections 6(2), 7 or 9, and 6(5). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3fbc4f46edd3e4f207893d46b3cad06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L.N. 463 OF 1993&quot;" target="&quot;44 OF 1980 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are legislative notices but from different years (1993 vs 1980), no direct relationship based on provided text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L.N. 463 OF 1993&quot;" target="&quot;致命个案补偿评估证明书或致命个案补偿评估审核证明书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"No direct relationship based on provided text, legislative notice and compensation certificates serve different purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;44 OF 1980 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;致命个案补偿评估证明书或致命个案补偿审核证明书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"No direct relationship based on provided text, legislative notice and compensation certificates serve different purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;44 OF 1980 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 5&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"44 OF 1980 S. 4 amends SECTION 5, indicating another legislative relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-430e5976cb2d37cf2cc19b50c8f851c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;6(1)条规定的补偿&quot;" target="&quot;第6B(1)(A)、6D(6)、6H(4)或18A(1)条作出的裁定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compensation is determined based on the rulings of specific clauses, indicating a dependency relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长或法院&quot;" target="&quot;致命个案补偿评估证明书或致命个案补偿评估审核证明书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The authority or court makes determinations that lead to the issuance of these certificates, showing a direct influence and responsibility relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-556079fee31cc52ebb6a4bc34cf0d17b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER AND THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS NAMED IN THE CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner and the Court may round down compensation amounts for family members named in the Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case or Review Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER AND THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM DETERMINATION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner and the Court have authority to determine compensation claims, including rounding down amounts as necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS NAMED IN THE CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION AMOUNT DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members named in the Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case or Review Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case are part of the process to determine compensation amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS NAMED IN THE CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;SIX-MONTH PERIOD FROM DATE OF DEATH OR ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The six-month period from the date of death or accident is relevant to the compensation claims for family members named in the Certificate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS NAMED IN THE CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS FOR FAMILY MEMBERS IN FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members named in the Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case or Review Certificate of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case are involved in the compensation claim determination process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;" target="&quot;普通评委会或特别评委会&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长指明格式要求普通评委会或特别评委会发出证明书。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;" target="&quot;雇员&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长指示格式要求普通评委会或特别评委会向雇员发证明书。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;" target="&quot;雇主要求出示文件等&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据45C条的规定，雇主必须在指定的时间和地点向处长展示特定类型的文件或记录。这表明了双方之间的关系：一方有义务执行通知中的要求，而另一方有权进行检查。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e45334df7830d020e82770c4df4a7b7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;" target="&quot;督察&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Inspector can be assigned designations by the Commissioner, making them an Occupational Safety Officer. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3c3394a6b72977677a8a437b4151b9d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;" target="&quot;衞生主任&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Health Officers are designated as Occupational Safety Officers by the Commissioner through their role and authority. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3c3394a6b72977677a8a437b4151b9d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;" target="&quot;职业安全主任&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner designates individuals, including Health Officers, as Occupational Safety Officers. "&lt;SEP&gt;"处长和职业安全主任之间存在监管与被监管的关系，处长可以对职业安全主任的决定提出上诉。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3c3394a6b72977677a8a437b4151b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f30bd1959d14cc825d9dc1909b7819e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;" target="&quot;长期服务金分配&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长有权延长申请书送达期限，这与长期服务金的分配程序相关。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a3ec4e0b16148270927aaef6bc6cb14</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;" target="&quot;申请人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长负责处理申请人的发牌或牌照续期的申请，并有权作出拒绝、撤销等决定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S WRITTEN CONSENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S WRITTEN AGREEMENT FOR COMPENSATION DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer's written consent is required for both compensation determination and agreement on the process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE OF WITHDRAWAL OF CONSENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S WRITTEN NOTICE OF DISAGREEMENT WITH CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A notice of withdrawal of consent can lead to a disagreement with the claim, affecting compensation determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY RELATIONSHIP DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM DETERMINATION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A dispute over family relationships can affect the authority to determine compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY RELATIONSHIP DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;DISPUTE OVER FAMILY RELATIONSHIP IN FATAL CASE CONTEXT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Disputes over family relationships in fatal case contexts directly impact claim determination processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE CLAIMING COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS FOR FAMILY MEMBERS IN FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members of deceased employees claiming compensation are part of the process to determine claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION AMOUNT DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS FOR FAMILY MEMBERS IN FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The process for determining compensation claims involves the amount of compensation to be determined."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-def49c83275f7a43c7888fbfe05b6999</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;FUNERAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both processes are related as they pertain to the determination and payment of funeral-related expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;CONVALESCENCE (康复)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The process involves determining expenses related to convalescence as part of funeral and medical attendance expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPOUSE OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can make temporary payment decisions for the Spouse of Deceased Employee based on their application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04fef0fb53d56f3928c358832b44a6a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPOUSE OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER(S) OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family Members and the Spouse share a relationship as both are involved in compensation claims for the deceased employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04fef0fb53d56f3928c358832b44a6a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER(S) OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner sends a certificate to Family Members of the deceased employee, whether or not compensation is payable."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04fef0fb53d56f3928c358832b44a6a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPOUSE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can determine interim payments for the spouse of the deceased employee upon application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55bb18157fba38057f130a7b17e656fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7&quot;" target="&quot;FREE MEDICAL TREATMENT AS AN IN-PATIENT IN A HOSPITAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Free medical treatment as an in-patient in a hospital affects the compensation under section 7 of this Act."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-caf4b3f0aa7e762095c32496aac13d2b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7&quot;" target="&quot;DEPENDANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DEPENDANTS may benefit from SECTION 7, which deals with specific types of compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a0cf86f8afb0c798</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Termination in accordance with SECTION 7 involves the payment obligations upon termination as specified."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04cd6ed43a9db3f3a7e91d2bf134ecfa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31R(1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment in lieu according to SECTION 7 affects the employee's right to a long service payment by reason of dismissal. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e3a3f0edfa08a61dbd46b52c9f94d56a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both SECTION 6 and SECTION 7 deal with termination conditions but under different scenarios: section 6 for notice period, section 7 for payment in lieu."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9ddecf99bc0bca06387d96224afeaf4c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Without prejudice to sections, proper notice given under SECTION 9 affects the calculation of sums and payments due on contract termination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04cd6ed43a9db3f3a7e91d2bf134ecfa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 9 is a provision within the Ordinance that allows for termination of contract of employment by the employer for disciplinary reasons or other valid grounds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-098ca6bfb60006d76569bead63917ebd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;LAY-OFF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 9 does not directly relate to lay-off provisions but both deal with the termination or modification of employment contracts under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-098ca6bfb60006d76569bead63917ebd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Termination according to SECTION 9 applies under subsection (b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88cda6d2e850ba77bbd055819688849</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER WHO TERMINATES CONTINUOUS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT OF A PREGNANT EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer must prove that the termination was in accordance with Section 9, otherwise it is considered a contravention of Subsection (1)(a) or (b)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5d10f3a9af779ebd8f5d93a83026e213</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;AN EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SECTION 9 outlines a condition under which an AN EMPLOYEE may not be entitled to severance payment if dismissed without notice or payment in lieu by the EMPLOYER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d536cf1eacc47eb2d3812dd2faa34e3c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;51 OF 2000 S. 3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 9 is amended by 51 of 2000 s. 3, which provides a condition for the dismissal without entitlement to severance payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d536cf1eacc47eb2d3812dd2faa34e3c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 75 OF 1997 S. 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 9 is also amended by 75 of 1997 s. 2, which affects the construction of references to the RELEVANT DATE if it falls on a REST DAY or HOLIDAY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d536cf1eacc47eb2d3812dd2faa34e3c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31R(1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Termination without notice or payment in lieu according to SECTION 9 affects entitlement under section 31R(1)(b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e3a3f0edfa08a61dbd46b52c9f94d56a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 51 OF 2000 S. 5&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amended by SECTION 51 OF 2000 S. 5, which changes the conditions for termination without notice or payment in lieu under section 9."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e3a3f0edfa08a61dbd46b52c9f94d56a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;REST DAY OR HOLIDAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 9 provides rules for termination of employment, which may affect REST DAY OR HOLIDAY scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-44e57b1615ed5c8b1f49eb6a6ecd4472</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 8&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 8 and 9 are part of a larger set of sections that apply in specific contexts but do not apply to certain contracts except for consumers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9&quot;" target="&quot;HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar to SECTION 8, sections related to hovercraft do not apply unless in favor of a person dealing as a consumer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5ff7ccd88e0bf1fa24f736784b46e37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 13(3)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD (付款期)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment period is defined for the purposes of section 13(3). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 13(3)&quot;" target="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE (發出日期)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date of issue is relevant to section 13(3), likely as part of documentation or evidence. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;INITIAL PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The initial payment is made based on the Certificate of Interim Payment or Review Certificate of Interim Payment, not later than 21 days after its issue."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-330946d46297f253a2618e1b8da8fb4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Monthly payments are made based on the corresponding date to the initial payment or the last day of that month if no such date exists, as per the Certificate of Interim Payment or Review Certificate of Interim Payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-330946d46297f253a2618e1b8da8fb4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE (發出日期)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'date of issue' refers to a specific date found on certain certificates mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06b0b35c8989b71abf93d8af04dd8d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INITIAL PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SPOUSE NAMED IN THE CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The spouse named in the certificate is entitled to receive initial payments made by the employer based on the certificate's terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-330946d46297f253a2618e1b8da8fb4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INITIAL PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SIXTH SCHEDULE SHOWN OPPOSITE SECTION 6C(8)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The surcharge amount for failing to make initial payments is determined by the Sixth Schedule shown opposite section 6C(8)(a), as per subsection (8)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-330946d46297f253a2618e1b8da8fb4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INITIAL PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can order cessation of initial payments if there are grounds for dissatisfaction with a previous determination, as per subsection (6)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-330946d46297f253a2618e1b8da8fb4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SIXTH SCHEDULE SHOWN OPPOSITE SECTION 6C(8)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The surcharge amount for failing to make monthly payments is determined by the Sixth Schedule shown opposite section 6C(8)(a), as per subsection (8)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-330946d46297f253a2618e1b8da8fb4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can order cessation of monthly payments if there are grounds for dissatisfaction with a previous determination, as per subsection (6)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-330946d46297f253a2618e1b8da8fb4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPOUSE NAMED IN THE CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF INTERIM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SIXTH SCHEDULE SHOWN OPPOSITE SECTION 6C(8)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The spouse is entitled to receive surcharges if the employer fails without reasonable excuse to make interim payments, based on the Sixth Schedule shown opposite section 6C(8)(a), as per subsection (8)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-330946d46297f253a2618e1b8da8fb4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD EXPIRY&quot;" target="&quot;SURCHARGE CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Surcharge Calculation is directly related to the Expiry of the Payment Period as it determines additional charges based on this event."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d03bb282f99bcf0993cd32ec58e1edb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD EXPIRY&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subsection addresses scenarios where an employment contract is terminated at or after the payment period expires."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b944c917df94b8aea60532ac3450cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAGISTRATE OR COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's certificate is admitted in evidence without further proof before any Magistrate or court, and it can be made an order of the Court by application from the employer or spouse."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af832cb4743d5ddf0c8ea32cb2fd5d71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPOUSE OF THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The certificate issued by the Commissioner is sent to both the employer and the spouse, affecting their rights regarding pension benefits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af832cb4743d5ddf0c8ea32cb2fd5d71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPOUSE OF THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT TO WHICH HE IS ENTITLED—WHERE THE PERSON SO ENTITLED IS A SPOUSE, NOT LATER THAN 7 DAYS AFTER THE RECEIPT OF THE APPLICATION; OR WHERE THE PERSON SO ENTITLED IS AN ISSUE OR PARENT, WITHIN SUCH TIME AS MAY BE AGREED UPON BY THE EMPLOYER AND THE APPLICANT.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The spouse is the primary recipient of long service payment if applicable."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a881a0688f9274757e29bce4fcc07e0d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PENSIONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 89)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Pensions Ordinance governs the rights of employees under the Commissioner's certificates related to pensions and gratuities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af832cb4743d5ddf0c8ea32cb2fd5d71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PENSION BENEFITS ORDINANCE (CAP. 99)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Pension Benefits Ordinance is relevant to the Commissioner's certificates concerning pension benefits for employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af832cb4743d5ddf0c8ea32cb2fd5d71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PENSION BENEFITS ORDINANCE (CAP. 99)&quot;" target="&quot;AUXILIARY FORCES PAY AND ALLOWANCES ORDINANCE (CAP. 254)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are mentioned in the context of receiving pension or gratuities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06b0b35c8989b71abf93d8af04dd8d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PENSION BENEFITS ORDINANCE (CAP. 99)&quot;" target="&quot;PENSION BENEFITS (JUDICIAL OFFICERS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 401)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Pension Benefits (Judicial Officers) Ordinance is another ordinance related to pension benefits, similar to the Pension Benefits Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06b0b35c8989b71abf93d8af04dd8d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PENSION BENEFITS (JUDICIAL OFFICERS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 401)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Pension Benefits (Judicial Officers) Ordinance is related to the Commissioner's certificates concerning pension benefits for judicial officers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af832cb4743d5ddf0c8ea32cb2fd5d71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUXILIARY FORCES PAY AND ALLOWANCES ORDINANCE (CAP. 254)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Auxiliary Forces Pay and Allowances Ordinance is relevant to the Commissioner's certificates concerning pay and allowances for auxiliary forces."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af832cb4743d5ddf0c8ea32cb2fd5d71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE (發出日期)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date of issue specified in the certificate by the Commissioner is a critical detail that affects legal proceedings and compliance obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af832cb4743d5ddf0c8ea32cb2fd5d71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE (發出日期)&quot;" target="&quot;EXPENSES FOR MEDICAL ATTENDANCE (醫護費)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date of issue is relevant for determining medical attendance expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY PAYMENT CERTIFICATE OR TEMPORARY REVIEW CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director has the authority to determine when a claim must be resolved by court based on these certificates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-54b3bbd8ad212745f60d65d18d1915a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第6級罰款&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第6級罰款涉及處长在处理雇员服务政府时的裁定权。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffb9dffd6c5cc9c95fa591e60b3b6694</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第6級罰款&quot;" target="&quot;付款期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"未遵守关于付款期的规定将面临最高第6级罚款的处罚。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-29b68787277a8733a0f0172e8e08317c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第6級罰款&quot;" target="&quot;發出日期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"发出了评估证明书后，如果雇主未能遵守相关规定，则可能面临第6级罚款的法律后果。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-29b68787277a8733a0f0172e8e08317c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第6級罰款&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主違反相關規定時，將面臨第6級罰款的處罰。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-688810e0abd091776de88edcaaba1bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第6級罰款&quot;" target="&quot;第4B款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"違反第(4B)款即屬犯罪,一經定罪,可處第6級罰款。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61c622614f8a7b3173a59e39171f674c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;臨時付款證明書&quot;" target="&quot;臨時付款審核證明書&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"臨時付款審核證明書一旦發出,相關的臨時付款證明書即告取消。這表明兩者之間存在直接關係和影響力。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-140ad6aa8f9e18c2087a074a7e55b9b6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;臨時付款證明書&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員可能根据临时付款证明书获得临时付款，这与处长的裁定有关联。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffb9dffd6c5cc9c95fa591e60b3b6694</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;臨時付款證明書&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主可能需要根据临时付款证明书支付临时款项，这与处长的裁定有关联。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffb9dffd6c5cc9c95fa591e60b3b6694</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;臨時付款審核證明書&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱员可能根据临时付款审核证明书获得临时付款，这与处长的裁定有关联。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffb9dffd6c5cc9c95fa591e60b3b6694</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;臨時付款審核證明書&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主可能需要根据临时付款审核证明书支付临时款项，这与处长的裁定有关联。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffb9dffd6c5cc9c95fa591e60b3b6694</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;致命個案補償評估證明書&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">23.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"處長根據該證書作出裁定,但若程序終止則須由法院進行裁定。"&lt;SEP&gt;"處长负责根据致命个案补偿评估证明书支付赔偿金。"&lt;SEP&gt;"處长负责根据致命个案补偿评估证明书更改其先前的裁定或决定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffb9dffd6c5cc9c95fa591e60b3b6694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de67114856d774592b4fb886fb31e9f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;致命個案補償評估審核證明書&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"處长负责根据致命个案补偿评估审核证明书支付赔偿金。"&lt;SEP&gt;"處长负责根据致命个案补偿评估审核证明书更改其先前的裁定或决定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffb9dffd6c5cc9c95fa591e60b3b6694</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;ADDITIONAL FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compensation certificate may trigger or be associated with an additional fee based on certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-089f9cdfce12f678cda7d05b231183ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDITIONAL FEE&quot;" target="&quot;TABLE 6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Table 6 specifies the amounts and percentages related to additional fees, providing a detailed calculation basis."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-089f9cdfce12f678cda7d05b231183ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(4)款提交的反対書&quot;" target="&quot;其他根据第6B(1)条提出申请的人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"反对书需要送交其他申请人，影响他们的权益。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(4)款提交的反対書&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"如果反对者不是雇主，则还需要将反对书送交给雇主。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(4)款提交的反対書&quot;" target="&quot;管理局&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"如果反对者不是管理机构，也需要将其通知给管理机构。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;其他根据第6B(1)条提出申请的人&quot;" target="&quot;僱主、每名家庭成员及管理局&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"申请人可能需要收到相关证明书以了解裁定详情或进一步行动。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;管理局&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">28.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In some cases, the authority (管理局) can challenge or review decisions made by the director regarding compensation assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"在適用情況下,處長亦需要向管理局發出相關的證明書。"&lt;SEP&gt;"根據第(12)(a)款和(13)，處長需向管理局發出證明書或取消相關證明書。"&lt;SEP&gt;"管理局在某些情況下可向處長提交反對書,由處長進行審核和決定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c031adb2191e2fdd70a1cfb2171a003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c689b8d0795a9c81d181c39f442bd05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0ab6c8718eab2752969763d7d57fe2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92d63fd21b0cce3b9e5c075238ab83af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;管理局&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The authority (管理局) can intervene or review decisions made by the director regarding compensation assessments, which may affect employers' responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"僱主可以提出反對書,並須將副本送交管理局或僱員。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c031adb2191e2fdd70a1cfb2171a003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92d63fd21b0cce3b9e5c075238ab83af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;管理局&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員可以提出反對書,並須將副本送交管理局或僱主。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-92d63fd21b0cce3b9e5c075238ab83af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;管理局&quot;" target="&quot;僱主及僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在某些情況下,證明書需要同時發給僱主、僱員和管理局。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ab6c8718eab2752969763d7d57fe2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱主、每名家庭成员及管理局&quot;" target="&quot;維持原来的裁定,並列明有关详情&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据审核结果，这些实体可能会收到维持原裁定的通知，并附有详细信息。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱主、每名家庭成员及管理局&quot;" target="&quot;經更改後的裁定的详情&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"如果裁定被修改，则需要通知这些实体并提供新的细节。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;維持原来的裁定,並列明有关详情&quot;" target="&quot;根据第6B(2)条列出的理由,处长须停止对该项申索作出裁定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"维持原裁定和更改后的裁定之间存在对比，可能涉及不同理由或情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;致命个案补偿评估审核证明书&quot;" target="&quot;致死案件补偿评估证明书(已根据第(7)款取消的除外)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"审核证明书发出后，相关原证明书将被取消。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;裁判官席前或任何法庭出示时,即须接納为证据而无须进一步证明&quot;" target="&quot;致命个案补偿评估证明书(已根据第(7)款取消的除外)&quot;或&quot;致命个案补偿评估审核证明书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这些证明文件在法庭上被视为有效证据，无需额外验证。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;裁判官席前或任何法庭出示时,即须接納为证据而无须进一步证明&quot;" target="&quot;相反证明成立之前,須推定为如此发出和签署的&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在有反证出现之前，这些文件被视为真实有效的。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53e6b79fd1548d0000152ed3e82c3ba0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's determinations are based on the payment period of reimbursements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Expenses are reimbursed within a specified payment period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failure to comply with the payment period constitutes an offence. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;END OF YEAR PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The end of year payment becomes due on the last day of the payment period if no specific date is mentioned in the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'payment period' is defined to give meaning to when and over what duration 'end of year payment' may occur."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb1b0eee63da6475bd592efac352092a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43b4560ca9a773332d0b2bf256551f4c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;SAME EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment period is defined by the same employer's employment of an employee throughout its duration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1bb383ea19375cfe6d50e66dce88dd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both concepts are related as they pertain to the duration of an employee's continuous service under one employer, which is critical for determining end-of-year payment eligibility and timing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The payment period and employment contract are interlinked, with the former defined by the latter's duration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1bb383ea19375cfe6d50e66dce88dd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment period is defined by the contract of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-43b4560ca9a773332d0b2bf256551f4c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6B(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may require details from the claimant and employer under section 6B(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6B(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 42D(6)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These sections are related as they both pertain to decisions made by the Commissioner that can be appealed to the court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6B(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6C(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both sections deal with decisions by the Commissioner that can be appealed to the court, indicating a parallel legal process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6B(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;DETERMINATION UNDER SECTION 6B(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Determination under this section is subject to appeal to the COURT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURCHARGE&quot;" target="&quot;REIMBURSEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reimbursements may be subject to surcharges based on unpaid amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURCHARGE&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (9)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (9)'s non-compliance leads to a surcharge being imposed. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURCHARGE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A(10)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16A(10)(A) specifies conditions for a surcharge upon expiry of the payment period. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURCHARGE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A(10)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16A(10)(B) further details another condition leading to an additional surcharge after three months. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ECAFB (EMPLOYEES COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE FUND BOARD)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ECAFB is another party that can make objections to determinations under Section 6B(1)(a), and the Commissioner may review such determinations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a66ccff5f4b1f0435e3a62cb416f252b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6B(1)(A) DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner reviews and confirms or varies determinations made under Section 6B(1)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a66ccff5f4b1f0435e3a62cb416f252b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 365)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has authority over determinations under this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 365)&quot;" target="&quot;FUNERAL AND MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This ordinance covers the reimbursement for funeral and medical attendance expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ECAFB&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's actions and decisions affect ECAFB as they are mentioned in relation to certificate issuance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b83ce1e2c205caa4f85bb97a5c7967</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ECAFB&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ECAFB can apply to the Court for an order regarding a Certificate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ECAFB&quot;" target="&quot;16B. CANCELLATION OF INJURIES CLAIM CERTIFICATE BY THE COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ECAFB is an entity that can apply for the cancellation of a certificate issued under Section 16A(2) or (5)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eba7d646d2449192a3db7213315460a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER can also determine claims for MEDICAL ATTENDANCE EXPENSES in similar circumstances as mentioned above."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b99b710a13a074eee4b0551f5e725be</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner determines claims for funeral expenses as part of their role in handling such applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c974ea5d752dd73a9522c1e2701db94a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both funeral and medical attendance expenses fall under the same regulatory framework managed by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c974ea5d752dd73a9522c1e2701db94a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar to funerals, the Commissioner also handles determinations related to medical attendance expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c974ea5d752dd73a9522c1e2701db94a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a person who has paid funeral or medical attendance expenses dies before receiving reimbursement, their Legal Personal Representative can pursue the claim on their behalf."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE ON THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, Legal Personal Representatives can also claim Medical Attendance on the Employee for a deceased individual in such cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aaf035b8724e14296be4849afc0b0d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;MEMBERS OF HIS FAMILY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal personal representative has no right to compensation if a member of the family dies before certain documents or court orders are issued."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d87e36b5ad46db41c716cf2910faa95c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REIMBURSEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can review and determine reimbursement amounts, including surcharges."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bfc04b1f8f2bd8327f1a17852a14638</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLE EXCUSE&quot;" target="&quot;LEVEL 6 FINE (六级罚款)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A reasonable excuse can affect the imposition or avoidance of a Level 6 fine for non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLE EXCUSE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 7 OR 9&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7 or 9 of the ordinance provides conditions under which employers can avoid paying compensation without a reasonable excuse."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70e316f848fd5f9f0f6efb5f28f0e45b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLE EXCUSE&quot;" target="&quot;PERMANENT INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of reasonable excuse is relevant to whether an employee can avoid being deemed permanently incapacitated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70e316f848fd5f9f0f6efb5f28f0e45b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLE EXCUSE&quot;" target="&quot;PROVINCIAL COMMISSIONER OR DEPUTY PROVINCIAL COMMISSIONER OF LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The commissioner or deputy commissioner can accept any evidence they deem relevant, including those with reasonable excuse."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5074da09c4f82109b976a4c8a7a052fb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLE EXCUSE&quot;" target="&quot;CIVIL LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reasonable excuse may be accepted in civil legal proceedings, but it does not absolve one from providing truthful information."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5074da09c4f82109b976a4c8a7a052fb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD (付款期)&quot;" target="&quot;APPROPRIATE PERIOD OF PAYMENT REFERRED TO IN SUBSECTION (4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment period is defined as an appropriate period related to payments discussed in section 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06b0b35c8989b71abf93d8af04dd8d7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD (付款期)&quot;" target="&quot;30-DAY PERIOD (三十天期限)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms refer to the time frame within which payments must be made, with a 30-day period being a specific case of payment periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a2e37a06f23a289862428e2457ce5863</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD (付款期)&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court can cancel a damage claim certificate if certain conditions are met, involving the payment period. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员的殡葬费和医疗费用&quot;" target="&quot;第42天至第49天内的付款期限&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"规定了雇主在收到证明书后的支付时间范围为第42天到第49天之间。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附加费&quot;" target="&quot;未付还余额计算方法的具体应用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附加费是基于未付款项的百分比进行计算，具体取决于不同的条款和时间段。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表6第2栏和第3栏中的百分率计算方法&quot;" target="&quot;雇主的责任与义务&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附表6中规定了具体的百分比计算方式来确定附加费的具体金额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1009cd645f2a253ea46bb7c8dd54bc47</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员死亡事件&quot;" target="&quot;未成年人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"未成年人作为监护人提出申请或处理雇员死亡事件中的事务。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a3ec4e0b16148270927aaef6bc6cb14</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL AND MEDICAL EXPENSES AUDIT CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FUNERAL AND MEDICAL EXPENSES AUDIT CERTIFICATE can be issued and signed by the CHIEF OFFICER or their representative."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fa74d0f00f96c28e36e2d2dc5c9e2eda</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL AND MEDICAL EXPENSES AUDIT CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In court, the FUNERAL AND MEDICAL EXPENSES AUDIT CERTIFICATE is accepted as evidence without further proof if it appears to be issued and signed by the CHIEF OFFICER or their representative."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fa74d0f00f96c28e36e2d2dc5c9e2eda</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNERAL AND MEDICAL EXPENSES AUDIT CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;PROVINCIAL GOVERNMENT DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PROVINCIAL GOVERNMENT DEPARTMENT has authority over the FUNERAL AND MEDICAL EXPENSES AUDIT CERTIFICATE, including issuing and signing it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fa74d0f00f96c28e36e2d2dc5c9e2eda</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CHIEF OFFICER's signature on the FUNERAL AND MEDICAL EXPENSES AUDIT CERTIFICATE is recognized in court as evidence without further proof."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fa74d0f00f96c28e36e2d2dc5c9e2eda</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;INSPECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An inspector can enter non-residential premises to inspect the compliance records related to employees' regulations, which may involve chief officers or their managers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6C(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may require details from the claimant, employer (and principal contractor if applicable), under section 6C(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6C(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6E(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both these sections involve appeals against the Commissioner's decisions, linking them through legal processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6C(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;DETERMINATION UNDER SECTION 6C(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar relationship as above, with determination also subject to appeal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6D(6)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may require details from the claimant and employer under section 6D(6)(b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6D(6)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 42D(6)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These sections are related as they both pertain to decisions made by the Commissioner that can be appealed to the court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-266c63bff8f647150f70f543690f359f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6D(6)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;DETERMINATION UNDER SECTION 6D(6)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Same as previous relationships, this section's determination is also appealable."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6E(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may require details from the claimant, employer (and principal contractor if applicable), under section 6E(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca6a3d09e67d65c6e2efdbaf610d6291</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6E(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;DETERMINATION UNDER SECTION 6E(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This determination can be appealed to the COURT under similar conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEVEL 5 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical practitioners who fail to report suspected occupational diseases without a reasonable excuse are liable to a fine at level 5."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05288c51fb6c9855d3f031e51b7e2be3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE FEES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 10 COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical attendance fees are not counted in the total compensation calculated according to Section 10, as per subsection (3). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION UNDER SECTION 6(5)&quot;" target="&quot;SURCHARGE UNDER SECTIONS 6C(8), 6D(3), AND 6E(9)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation under Section 6(5) does not include surcharges from Sections 6C(8), 6D(3), and 6E(9). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 10 COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;EXCESS AMOUNT PAID UNDER SECTIONS 7 AND 9&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation from Section 10 is excluded in determining any excess amounts paid before death according to subsection (4). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURCHARGE UNDER SECTIONS 6C(8), 6D(3), AND 6E(9)&quot;" target="&quot;EXCESS AMOUNT PAID UNDER SECTIONS 7 AND 9&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Surcharges under Sections 6C, 6D, and 6E are not considered when calculating the excess amount paid under Sections 7 and 9. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf2b2485fa1ca142d969f0703e2e3861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST DETERMINATION OF COMMISSIONER IN FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical payments also fall under the same legal framework and subject to similar appeal processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLATE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">19.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"APPELLATE COURT is another term for COURT OF APPEAL, indicating it refers to the same entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"COURT OF APPEAL is the appellate court mentioned in the text that can hear appeals from lower courts and is synonymous with APPELLATE COURT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f62200ffc7f6236194042490c461241</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLATE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;THE ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Appellate Court has jurisdiction over appeals against arbitration tribunal's decisions regarding charges or expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e105b81cb8e7429af8bdd848fcb41de5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;42 DAYS PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST DETERMINATION OF COMMISSIONER IN FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appeals must be filed within 42 days from certificate issue date, or with Court's permission extended beyond this period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST DETERMINATION OF COMMISSIONER IN FATAL CASES&quot;" target="&quot;DETERMINATION UNDER SECTION 6B(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Specific determinations under Section 6B are covered by the appeal process defined in this section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST DETERMINATION OF COMMISSIONER IN FATAL CASES&quot;" target="&quot;DETERMINATION UNDER SECTION 6C(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, determinations under Section 6C are also covered by the appeal process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MID-TERM PAYMENT CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES ALLOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mid-term payment certificates may be related to FUNERAL EXPENSES ALLOCATION as part of compensation processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINAL DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR FATAL CASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Final determinations are crucial for determining the final amount of COMPENSATION FOR FATAL CASES."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK GOVERNING FATAL CASES&quot;" target="&quot;FUNERAL EXPENSES ALLOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal framework governs how FUNERAL EXPENSES are allocated in fatal cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK GOVERNING FATAL CASES&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL PAYMENTS DISTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, the legal framework also dictates MEDICAL PAYMENTS distribution processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL PAYMENTS DISTRIBUTION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees receive MEDICAL PAYMENTS according to the legal framework governing fatal cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-932bd52b3e4a92915c346a0ad3c1fd7a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income is a factor in determining the amount of compensation that will be provided to an Employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;7(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income is used to calculate the compensation amount under section 7(1)(a), which applies when an employee has not reached 40 years old at the time of injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;7(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7(2) sets a minimum threshold for the compensation that must be paid, regardless of income levels as calculated by other sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;40 YEARS OLD&quot;" target="&quot;56 YEARS OLD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The age categories 40 years old and 56 years old determine different levels of compensation for employees who have suffered permanent total disability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c02219b95b2d6273001fc2088c7c1d25</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1991年第435號法律公告修訂;由1993年第66號第3條修訂;由1995年第566號法律公告修訂;由1996年第36號第5條修訂)&quot;" target="&quot;1983年第79號法律公告修訂;由1985年第321號法律公告修訂;由1987年第390號法律公告修訂;由1989年第386號法律公告修訂;由1991年第435號法律公告修訂;由1993年第463號法律公告修訂;由1995年第566號法律公告修訂;由1996年第36號第5條修訂)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这些修订条款相互关联，共同构成了关于补偿金额的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;(2) 根據第(1)款須付的補償額在任何情況下不得少於在附表6第2欄中相對於該附表第1欄所指明的第7(2)條之處指明的款額。&quot;" target="&quot;(3) 為施行本條 —— (A) 如永久喪失工作能力,是因附表1所指明的損傷所引致的,而喪失賺取收入能力的百分率或合計百分率,在附表1是指明為百分之一百或高於百分之一百者;或 (B) 如永久喪失工作能力,是因附表1沒有指明的損傷所引致的,而喪失賺取收入能力的百分率或合計百分率,是普通評估委員會、特別評估委員會或法院評估為百分之一百或高於百分之一百者,&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这两款条款共同规定了补偿金额的具体计算方式。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;(1) WHERE PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY RESULTS FROM THE INJURY, THE AMOUNT OF COMPENSATION SHALL BE— (A) IN THE CASE OF AN EMPLOYEE UNDER 40 YEARS OF AGE AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT,&quot;" target="&quot;附表6第2欄中相對於該附表第1欄所指明的第7(2)條之處指明的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第一款详细规定了补偿金额的具体计算方式，而第二款则提供了具体的参考数值。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;96&quot;" target="&quot;補償額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"补偿金额的具体数值是根据员工年龄和伤害性质确定的，这里给出了具体数额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表1所指明的損傷&quot;" target="&quot;多項損傷,不論是(A)或(B)段所述的損傷,或是兼有該兩段所述的損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附表1明确了具体损害类型，而多种类型的损害在评估补偿金额时需要考虑。"&lt;SEP&gt;"附表1明确了具体损害类型，而多項損傷则涵盖了所有可能的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表1所指明的損傷&quot;" target="&quot;普通評估委員會、特別評估委員會或法院&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附表1明确了具体损害类型，而评估委员会和法院在确定补偿金额方面具有决定权。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表1所指明的損傷&quot;" target="&quot;永久地完全喪失工作能力的情況&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"补偿金额取决于是否属于附表1明确列出的情况，如果是则按总和计算；如果不是，则需根据特定百分比确定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會、特別評估委員會或法院&quot;" target="&quot;附表6第2欄中相對於該附表第1欄所指明的第7(2)條之處指明的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"评估委员会和法院在确定补偿金额方面具有决定权。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會、特別評估委員會或法院&quot;" target="&quot;多項損傷,不論是(A)或(B)段所述的損傷,或是兼有該兩段所述的損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"多种类型的损害在评估补偿金额时需要考虑。"&lt;SEP&gt;"多种类型的损害在评估补偿金额时需要考虑，由相关委员会进行评定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會、特別評估委員會或法院&quot;" target="&quot;附表1沒有指明的損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"未在附表1中明确列出的损害类型，在评估补偿金额时也需要考虑，由相关委员会进行评定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會、特別評估委員會或法院&quot;" target="&quot;補償額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这些委员会和机构有权确定具体的赔偿数额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE UNDER 40 YEARS OLD&quot;" target="&quot;WORK-RELATED INJURY LEADING TO PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"员工年龄是计算补偿金额的一个重要因素，特别是对于因工作相关伤害导致永久完全丧失劳动能力的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表6第2欄中相對於該附表第1欄所指明的第7(2)條之處指明的款額&quot;" target="&quot;補償額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附表6提供了具体的补偿金额参考值，用于确定最终的赔偿数额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;損傷須當作引致永久地完全喪失工作能力&quot;" target="&quot;多項損傷,不論是(A)或(B)段所述的損傷,或是兼有該兩段所述的損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"损害被视作导致永久完全丧失劳动能力的情况包括多种类型。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;損傷須當作引致永久地完全喪失工作能力&quot;" target="&quot;補償額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"损害被视作为导致永久完全丧失劳动能力的情况时，需要支付相应的补偿金额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;多項損傷,不論是(A)或(B)段所述的損傷,或是兼有該兩段所述的損傷&quot;" target="&quot;附表1沒有指明的損傷&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附表1未明确列出的损害类型也被纳入考虑范围。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aff2de3c762d6244933fabeb0079feb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表1沒有指明的損傷&quot;" target="&quot;百分率&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"没有在附表1中明确列出的损害情况下的赔偿额计算依据特定的百分比。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION IN CASE OF PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE UNDER 40 YEARS OF AGE AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compensation for an employee under 40 years of age at the time of the accident is calculated based on a specific formula."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-29e09c4bccf616e923c3efce314be187</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION IN CASE OF PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE OF OR OVER 40 YEARS AGE BUT UNDER 56 YEARS OF AGE AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compensation for an employee of or over 40 years age but under 56 years of age at the time of the accident is calculated based on a different formula."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-29e09c4bccf616e923c3efce314be187</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION IN CASE OF PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE OF OR OVER 56 YEARS AGE AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compensation for an employee of or over 56 years age at the time of the accident is calculated based on yet another formula."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-29e09c4bccf616e923c3efce314be187</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION IN CASE OF PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;L.N. 79 OF 1983; L.N. 321 OF 1985; L.N. 390 OF 1987; L.N. 386 OF 1989; L.N. 435 OF 1991; L.N. 463 OF 1993; L.N. 566 OF 1995; 36 OF 1996 S. 5&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The laws and notifications listed have amended the compensation calculation formulas over time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-29e09c4bccf616e923c3efce314be187</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION IN CASE OF PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;MATHEMATICS (EARNINGS CALCULATION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mathematics is used to calculate earnings, which are a key component in determining the amount of compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-29e09c4bccf616e923c3efce314be187</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION IN CASE OF PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;SOCIAL SCIENCES (COMPENSATION PSYCHOLOGY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Social sciences and psychology may influence how compensation is perceived and calculated, though not directly in the provided text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-29e09c4bccf616e923c3efce314be187</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7(2)&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition of 'permanent total incapacity' in SECTION 7(2) is related to the injuries specified in FIRST SCHEDULE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-430e5976cb2d37cf2cc19b50c8f851c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7(2)&quot;" target="&quot;HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'hovercraft' is mentioned in the context of sections that apply to contracts involving such means of carriage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5ff7ccd88e0bf1fa24f736784b46e37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L.N. 79 OF 1983&quot;.." target="&quot;SECTION 5&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"L.N. 79 OF 1983 amends SECTION 5, indicating a legislative relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-430e5976cb2d37cf2cc19b50c8f851c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST SCHEDULE (AMENDED 76 OF 1982 S. 6)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The First Schedule specifies conditions for permanent total incapacity and the compensation percentages associated with them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d80227f925bf1b081dc41765e6e6934</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERMANENT TOTAL INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF EARNING CAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms relate to the extent of loss in earning capacity due to injuries or accidents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-779a6ebdcf1cc3fbd67a4dc22862c59e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD, SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD OR THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These entities are involved in assessing permanent total incapacity which may be related to injuries specified in FIRST SCHEDULE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-430e5976cb2d37cf2cc19b50c8f851c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER, AN ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD OR A SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner or an Assessment Board may require the injured employee to attend for examination or assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ab861803e98b52f9a42ed6d058e8b49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An accident triggers the need for an injured employee to attend for assessment and may result in claims related to compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ab861803e98b52f9a42ed6d058e8b49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"INJURED EMPLOYEES are entitled to receive PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCES under sections 36B and 36I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITALIZATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court's decision does not provide compensation for hospitalization if the injured employee is treated as a free patient or in other forms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0777124042c66cc9558d8401a55e7156</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITALIZATION&quot;" target="&quot;CARE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Care expenses include hospitalization costs if the injured employee is treated as a free patient or in other forms, but no compensation is required during such periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0777124042c66cc9558d8401a55e7156</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;協議&quot;" target="&quot;第(6)款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"協議需符合第(6)款規定才能被處長批准並向僱員宣讀和解釋以保障其利益。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad03aa80581d9d78c4971adade589820</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;協議&quot;" target="&quot;第(5)(A)款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據本條訂立的協議可由處長批准,並明示其所作批准。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad03aa80581d9d78c4971adade589820</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;協議&quot;" target="&quot;第(5)(B)款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據本條訂立的協議也可被處長拒絕批准。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad03aa80581d9d78c4971adade589820</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE REQUIRING ATTENTION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's approval is necessary for agreements related to the employee's permanent incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE REQUIRING ATTENTION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court can convert approved agreements into its commands regarding compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE REQUIRING ATTENTION&quot;" target="&quot;ATTENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee's need for continuous attention is a key factor in determining compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Agreements are made under the Ordinance and require approval from the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER can approve or invalidate AGREEMENTS made under certain conditions related to employee's old age, serious physical defect, or infirmity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the authority to cancel an agreement if certain conditions are met, as outlined in Section 16CB."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1683d49752acaec3491f38a426aac742&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691e0bbfff602acd26ed9f7e9579a105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 10&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 10 is relevant to compensation that may be assessed if an agreement is cancelled under Section 16CB."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-691e0bbfff602acd26ed9f7e9579a105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The assessment of compensation for agreements cancelled by the Commissioner is made according to Section 16A, as stated in Section 16CB(3)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-691e0bbfff602acd26ed9f7e9579a105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AGREEMENTS can reduce or remove the right of employees to receive COMPENSATION for accidents caused by old age, serious physical defects, or infirmity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1683d49752acaec3491f38a426aac742</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERMANENT INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court determines whether an employee's incapacity is permanent and applies relevant provisions accordingly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70e316f848fd5f9f0f6efb5f28f0e45b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERMANENT INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;RECOVERY OF INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Permanent incapacity could lead to recovery of income through legal means, affecting the continuation or termination of periodical payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LUMP SUM PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both lump sum and periodical payments are methods of compensating the employee based on their permanent incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;LUMP SUM CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Periodical Payments can be calculated in a lump sum manner based on probable earnings changes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bad177b227e380cc066abb25e6c2cf7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;DEATH OR PERMANENT INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Death or permanent incapacity following temporary incapacity stops periodical payments from being deducted from compensation under sections 6-9."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bad177b227e380cc066abb25e6c2cf7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 6, 7, 8, OR 9 COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Periodical Payments are not deducted from Section 6, 7, 8 or 9 Compensation in the event of death or permanent incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bad177b227e380cc066abb25e6c2cf7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Periodical payments are made during the period of temporary incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70e316f848fd5f9f0f6efb5f28f0e45b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1995 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;L.N.&quot; &quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity L.N. is associated with section 4 of Act 1 of 1995."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-caf4b3f0aa7e762095c32496aac13d2b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPENDIX 1 DAMAGE&quot;" target="&quot;PERMANENT TOTAL DISABILITY COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appendix 1 Damage is directly related to Permanent Total Disability Compensation as it specifies a percentage of compensation based on this type of damage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-68ef0e8f1f38a0c8885d599e4ee4a20e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPENDIX 1 DAMAGE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court can make an order based on agreements approved by the Commissioner regarding Appendix 1 Damage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-68ef0e8f1f38a0c8885d599e4ee4a20e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERMANENT PARTIAL DISABILITY COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;MULTIPLE APPENDICES DAMAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Multiple Appendices Damage affects the calculation of Permanent Partial Disability Compensation, indicating its importance in determining total compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-68ef0e8f1f38a0c8885d599e4ee4a20e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;某百分率而定出的補償額&quot;" target="&quot;部分身體受傷&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"对于未完全丧失工作能力的部分身体损伤，补偿金额基于附表1中规定的相应比例来确定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;部分身體受傷&quot;" target="&quot;附表1及附註所指明的百分率計算比例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"对于部分身体受伤的情况，补偿金额基于附表1和注释中规定的相应比例来确定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;百分率&quot;" target="&quot;喪失一隻手的一整個手指&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據28A條款，喪失一個整只的手指會判給特定的補償百分率。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;一項或多項損傷(不論是否附表1所指明者)引致永久地部分喪失工作能力&quot;" target="&quot;僱員的特別情況&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇员因一项或多项损伤（无论是否在附表1中明确列出）导致的部分丧失工作能力，其补偿金额需考虑雇员的具体情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;損傷(不論是否附表1所指明者)引致永久地部分喪失工作能力&quot;" target="&quot;收入能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"损害（无论是否在附表1中明确列出）导致的部分丧失工作能力，影响雇员的收入能力。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;損傷(不論是否附表1所指明者)引致永久地部分喪失工作能力&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"损害（无论是否在附表1中明确列出）导致的部分丧失工作能力，影响雇员的工作能力和收入。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;損傷(不論是否附表1所指明者)引致永久地部分喪失工作能力&quot;" target="&quot;損失賺取收入能力情況&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"损害（无论是否在附表1中明确列出）导致的部分丧失工作能力，影响雇员的赚取收入的能力。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e4b1d219d95c2446efb2aa90f70f687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
