  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Chinese Medicine Practitioner is part of an Ordinary Assessment Board that assesses loss of earning capacity. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF EARNING CAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Dentist is part of an Ordinary Assessment Board that assesses loss of earning capacity. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF EARNING CAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Claims for compensation are assessed in relation to loss of earning capacity, which is a key factor considered by assessment boards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
