  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The percentage of loss of earning capacity is prescribed in the Schedule as a method for calculating compensation for occupational injuries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PROFESSIONAL CERTIFICATES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All are types of registered medical professionals who can provide necessary certificates for injury assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb0545d506978169e320db3a0cda4273</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT INCOME CALCULATION METHODOLOGY&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY TOTAL DISABILITY COMPENSATION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The methodology is used to calculate the compensation amount under temporary total disability provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb0545d506978169e320db3a0cda4273</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY PARTIAL DISABILITY COMPENSATION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD, SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD OR COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
