  <data key="d6">chunk-cb0545d506978169e320db3a0cda4273</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT OR APPRENTICESHIP AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY TOTAL DISABILITY COMPENSATION MECHANISM, TEMPORARY PARTIAL DISABILITY COMPENSATION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The agreement is used to calculate pre-accident earnings which are crucial for the compensation mechanisms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb0545d506978169e320db3a0cda4273</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION PAYMENT DATE CALCULATION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINARY ASSESSMENT BOARD, SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD OR COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These entities may use this mechanism to determine when payments should be made based on employment contracts and agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb0545d506978169e320db3a0cda4273</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第2條修訂&quot;" target="&quot;1906年第16號第13條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision in the 2nd article is based on the amendment from the 16th clause of the 1st article in the 1906 legislation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱用合約或學徒訓練合約&quot;" target="&quot;按期付款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The periodic payment is tied to the employment or apprenticeship contract terms regarding wage payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;按期付款&quot;" target="&quot;法院命令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Court orders can influence the timing of periodic payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;按期付款&quot;" target="&quot;1個月&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The maximum interval for periodic payment cannot exceed one month."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;按期付款&quot;" target="&quot;僱員假若如繼續根據他在意外發生時受雇所根據的僱用合約或學徒訓練合約受僱則須獲付工資的日期相同&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date for periodic payment is the same as if the employee continued to be employed under their original contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;按期付款&quot;" target="&quot;停止喪失工作能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"When an employee stops being incapacitated, they are still required to receive periodic payments according to their incapacity period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院命令&quot;" target="&quot;24個月&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court can allow a period of up to 24 months for periodic payments, with an additional maximum extension of 12 months based on individual circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1個月&quot;" target="&quot;第5條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第5條规定了作为期一个月并可按月续期的合同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75ec5cbcc26a69d2fa91ff3cd7cec100</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1個月&quot;" target="&quot;通知期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"通知期不得少于一个月，适用于由第5条规定的为期一个月且可按月续期的合同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75ec5cbcc26a69d2fa91ff3cd7cec100</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱員假若如繼續根據他在意外發生時受雇所根據的僱用合約或學徒訓練合約受僱則須獲付工資的日期相同&quot;" target="&quot;法院按個別情況所容許另加不多於12個月的較長期間&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The extended period for periodic payments, up to 36 months in total, is based on the original contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;按期付款或整筆款項&quot;" target="&quot;補償額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Periodic payments or lump sums cannot be deducted from compensation amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱員在喪失工作能力期間可自僱主收取的任何付款、津貼或利益&quot;" target="&quot;停止喪失工作能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The benefits or allowances received during incapacity affect the determination of when an employee stops being incapacitated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f81782570d5f6ddacfd246ea376a2ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT COMPENSATION SCHEME&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts can issue orders regarding the repayment of periodic payments under the Employment Compensation Scheme."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-30cbd8927d8b6504c1eddb029a57bc60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT COMPENSATION SCHEME&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees can receive payments under the Employment Compensation Scheme when they lose work capacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-30cbd8927d8b6504c1eddb029a57bc60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第76號第7條&quot;" target="&quot;第63號第4條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第63號第4條修订了第76號第7條的内容。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c933b85a12f5b604848118a1cb645e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第76號第7條&quot;" target="&quot;第64號第2條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第64號第2條进一步修订了第76號第7條的内容。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c933b85a12f5b604848118a1cb645e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第76號第7條&quot;" target="&quot;第36號第7條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第36號第7條再次修订了第76號第7條的内容。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c933b85a12f5b604848118a1cb645e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第76號第7條&quot;" target="&quot;第67號第3條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第67號第3條增补了关于追讨补偿的具体途径。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c933b85a12f5b604848118a1cb645e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第76號第7條&quot;" target="&quot;第25號第2條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第25號第2條进一步修订了关于在区域法院追讨补偿的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c933b85a12f5b604848118a1cb645e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第67號第3條&quot;" target="&quot;第44號第15條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第67號第3條增补了关于在区域法院提出申索的规定，该规定由第44号法律修订而来。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c933b85a12f5b604848118a1cb645e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《小額錢債審裁處條例》(第338章)&quot;" target="&quot;區域法院&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据《小額錢債審裁處條例》，可以将某些民事债项提交至小額錢債審裁处或区域法院追讨。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c933b85a12f5b604848118a1cb645e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;區域法院&quot;" target="&quot;小額錢債審裁处&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在小额钱债审裁处无法解决争议时，可以将案件转至区域法院审理。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OR PERMANENT INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;24 MONTHS OF PERIODICAL PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"After 24 months (or less by court order) of periodical payments, an employee is deemed to have suffered permanent incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bad177b227e380cc066abb25e6c2cf7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court has jurisdiction over temporary incapacity cases, determining periodical payments and other matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70e316f848fd5f9f0f6efb5f28f0e45b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may determine claims in respect of injuries resulting in temporary incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1b7183db745ed54dff547be6105981a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 365)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This ordinance provides the framework for claims related to temporary incapacity due to injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1b7183db745ed54dff547be6105981a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;16A. DETERMINATION OF CLAIMS IN RESPECT OF INJURIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16A outlines the process for determining claims related to temporary incapacity due to injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1b7183db745ed54dff547be6105981a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES EARNED BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Temporary incapacity days due to compensation under the Employees' Compensation Ordinance (Cap. 282) affect wage calculations for determining holiday pay rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9d14b62c50b2a0a92ac73c8ef0642fe9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Temporary incapacity for which compensation may be payable under the Employees' Compensation Ordinance is related to sickness day and holiday or annual leave."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employees' Compensation Ordinance (Cap. 282) provides compensation for temporary incapacity, which is considered in wage calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d14b62c50b2a0a92ac73c8ef0642fe9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;SICKNESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sickness day covers absences due to temporary incapacity for which compensation may be payable under the Employees' Compensation Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7 OR 9&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7 or 9 of the ordinance applies when permanent incapacity occurs, and the Court plays a role in determining compensation amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70e316f848fd5f9f0f6efb5f28f0e45b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7 OR 9&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 7 OR 9 of the ORDINANCE applies when an accident results in permanent incapacity for work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c1ed02e78cf2ee9e321f22dbe3ba84b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LEGAL LIABILITY FOR MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURED AT WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer's legal liability for medical expenses is related to the employee injured at work, as it specifies who must pay the medical bills in case of workplace injuries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LEGAL LIABILITY FOR MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL TREATMENT ABROAD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer's legal liability for medical expenses does not include treatment abroad, as specified by law unless otherwise agreed upon in writing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LEGAL LIABILITY FOR MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION OTHER THAN MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In addition to medical expenses, the employer's legal liability includes other forms of compensation for employees injured at work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LEGAL LIABILITY FOR MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer's legal liability is based on the duration of medical treatment provided by a registered doctor, registered Chinese medicine practitioner or registered dentist."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LEGAL LIABILITY FOR MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;FREE MEDICAL TREATMENT OFFERED BY EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer's legal liability includes the provision of free medical treatment to employees injured at work, as long as it is offered in writing and accepted by the employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURED AT WORK&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The registered medical practitioners are involved in providing treatment to employees injured at work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURED AT WORK&quot;" target="&quot;FREE MEDICAL TREATMENT OFFERED BY EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Free medical treatment offered by the employer is a form of compensation for employees who have been injured at work, as specified in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b09cd3013853d4b808aa668049f33e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇員&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主和雇員之間涉及假期的計算與選擇權，包括年假的分配方式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"僱主有責任為因工受傷的雇員提供免費醫治或者支付醫療費。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b1de7cbb89da3f1adf715fabc5ea88cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇員&quot;" target="&quot;原僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據法例, 原僱主須在指明日期前向未獲再次聘用的僱員支付款項; 若雇員沒有實際或視同被重新聘請, 他們有權獲得補償。"&lt;SEP&gt;"雇员原先受聘于原僱主,后被解聘并由替代僱主打聘。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90c2a473a826b49cb3c1eb8a7d8ebc0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇員&quot;" target="&quot;繼承人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"若繼承人在特定情況下成為新的雇主, 他們需遵守原始命令重新聘請該僱員; 同時, 雇員亦有可能由原僱主轉至繼承人的手下。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e90c2a473a826b49cb3c1eb8a7d8ebc0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇員&quot;" target="&quot;替代僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"替代僱主需要按照某些条款聘用有关雇员,构成其受雇合同的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇員&quot;" target="&quot;OPTION FOR COMMON LEAVE YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇員根據僱主選擇的 12個月期間來決定年假的分配和使用方式。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b1de7cbb89da3f1adf715fabc5ea88cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;免費醫治&quot;" target="&quot;法律責任&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"提供免費醫治可能會免除部分法律責任，但不完全免除所有類別的醫療費用支付義務。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;註冊醫生&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主需指明由註冊醫生提供的免費醫治類別，並不得向該僱員追討費用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;註冊醫生&quot;" target="&quot;醫治&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"医治可以由注册医生进行，他们具有医疗专业知识和资格。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;註冊醫生&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"註冊醫生可以要求僱員進行身體檢查，如果情況需要也可以指定其他註冊醫生、中醫或牙醫進行檢查。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;註冊醫生&quot;" target="&quot;療計劃&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"註冊醫生是治療僱員的一部分，其意見在決定是否符合停工留薪期方面重要。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;註冊中醫&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"同上，但涉及的是由註冊中醫提供的免費醫治或治療費。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-574ed7315054d653adc55bc2682e9c19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;註冊中醫&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"同上，適用於註冊中醫的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;註冊中醫&quot;" target="&quot;療計劃&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"註冊中醫也是治療僱員的一部分，其意見同樣影響停工留薪期的判定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;物理治療&quot;" target="&quot;職業治疗&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"物理治疗和职业治疗都是由注册专业人士提供的治疗方法，但它们之间存在区别。例如，职业治疗通常更侧重于帮助患者恢复日常生活技能。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;物理治療&quot;" target="&quot;醫治&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"物理治疗是一种医治病痛的方法之一，尽管它与医学治疗有所不同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;職業治療&quot;" target="&quot;註冊職業治療師&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"职业治疗通常由注册的职业治疗师提供。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;醫治&quot;" target="&quot;註冊脊醫&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"某些类型的医治病痛也可以由注册的脊医提供。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;要求支付医疗费的书面要求及已付该笔医疗费用的收据&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇员有权向雇主提交书面请求并附上付款证明，以追讨应由雇主承担的医疗费用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb6435e29bd09601d766c4d2267e2500</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;区域法院&quot;" target="&quot;小額錢債審裁處&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"小額錢債審裁處的司法管轄權範圍超出時，會將案件轉交區域法院處理。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;区域法院&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主可以依据本条例向第三者提起诉讼，以追讨因意外而产生的赔偿款额。"&lt;SEP&gt;"僱主可依据本条例向第三者提起诉讼，以追讨因意外而产生的赔偿款额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d99f404dbd425b6d201f5bef0ae66380</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;区域法院&quot;" target="&quot;雇员&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇员可以依据本条例向第三者提起诉讼以追讨损害赔偿。但须顾及凭藉(b)段规定而成为或相当可能会成为第三者须支付予该僱主的款额。"&lt;SEP&gt;"雇员可以依据本条例向第三者提起诉讼以追讨损害赔偿，但根据本段可予追讨的款额，不得超出法庭认为如非因本条例条文则会判给该僱員的損害賠償額(如有的话)。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d99f404dbd425b6d201f5bef0ae66380</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;区域法院&quot;" target="&quot;弥偿者&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第24条可被要求支付彌償的任何人，均有权利为追讨其因意外而有义务支付的任何款项，针对第三者提起诉讼。但须顾及凭藉(b)段规定而成为或相当可能会成为第三者须支付予该僱主的款额。"&lt;SEP&gt;"根据第24条可被要求支付彌償的任何人，均有权利为追讨其因意外而有义务支付的任何款项，针对第三者提起诉讼，但须顾及凭藉(b)段规定而成为或相当可能会成为第三者须支付予该僱主的款额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d99f404dbd425b6d201f5bef0ae66380</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;医疗费&quot;" target="&quot;补偿&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在区域法院提出医疗费用申索时，可以同时要求其他形式的补偿。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;香港&quot;" target="&quot;1972年第48號法律公告&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal announcement of 1972 has relevance to Hong Kong's laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;香港&quot;" target="&quot;1981年第177號法律公告&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal announcement of 1981 is relevant to the laws in force in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;香港&quot;" target="&quot;1998年第25號第2條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision made in 1998 has an impact on the laws applicable in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;香港&quot;" target="&quot;本部&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"本部的规定适用于仲裁地点在香港的情况，即使实际仲裁地不在香港。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ec40a32e838182a39a402688664a335</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员&quot;" target="&quot;普通评委会或特别评委会&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(3)款规定,普通评估委员会向雇员发出了维持或更改的评估详情的证明书。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员&quot;" target="&quot;第三者&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第三者负有就该损伤向雇员支付损害赔偿的法律责任，雇员可以依据本条例申索补偿。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d99f404dbd425b6d201f5bef0ae66380</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员&quot;" target="&quot;原诉法庭或区域法院&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇员可为追讨损害赔偿而在原诉法庭或区域法院针对第三者进行法律程序。在区域法院进行时须受《区域法院条例》规限。"&lt;SEP&gt;"雇员可以为追讨损害赔偿而在原诉法庭或区域法院针对第三者进行法律程序。在区域法院进行时须受《区域法院条例》规限。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d99f404dbd425b6d201f5bef0ae66380</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员&quot;" target="&quot;弥偿者&quot;">
  <data key="d4">39.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第24条可被要求支付彌償的任何人，均有权利为追讨其因意外而有义务支付的任何款项，针对第三者提起诉讼。但须顾及凭藉(b)段规定而成为或相当可能会成为第三者须支付予该僱主的款额。"&lt;SEP&gt;"根据第24条可被要求支付彌償的任何人，均有权利为追讨其因意外而有义务支付的任何款项，针对第三者提起诉讼，但须顾及凭藉(b)段规定而成为或相当可能会成为第三者须支付予该僱主的款额。"&lt;SEP&gt;"根据第24条可被要求支付彌償的任何人，均有权利为追讨其因该意外而有义务支付的任何款项，针对第三者提起诉讼。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d99f404dbd425b6d201f5bef0ae66380</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员&quot;" target="&quot;就业条例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"就业条例详细规定了雇员的权利和义务，包括工作性质、报酬等具体事项。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3451e297aa0bd05f84186c235d841d44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;注册医生&quot;" target="&quot;注册中医师&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"两者都是受法律监管的医疗专业人员，但提供服务可能有所不同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;注册医生&quot;" target="&quot;私营业机构条例(第633章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条例规定了私立医疗结构的运营规则，并涉及注册医生在其中的角色和职责。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;注册医生&quot;" target="&quot;证明书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"注册医生可以签发适当的医生证明书，用于各种医疗情况的认证。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1998年第25號第2條&quot;" target="&quot;1998年第25號第2條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"修订条文是对原条文的更新或修改。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1982年第76號第8條廢除&quot;" target="&quot;1980年第44號第15條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该废除条款与之前的修订有关，可能是因为新的法律或规定取代了旧的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIRD SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Third Schedule governs the period during which an employee receives medical treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIRD SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Medical Practitioners are involved in providing certified medical treatments under the Third Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员受伤事件&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT OF MEDICAL EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇主在雇员受伤后有责任支付医疗费用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员要求赔偿&quot;" target="&quot;法律修订和废除事件&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇员在受伤后可能依据不同的法律规定提出赔偿请求，并且这些规定可能会被修改或废除。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;注册牙医&quot;" target="&quot;雇员受伤后的治疗期间&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"注册牙医也是在处理员工受伤后治疗的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇主责任条款&quot;" target="&quot;区域法院诉讼&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"区域法院审理涉及雇主责任的案件，特别是医疗费用支付要求等。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;医疗费用支付要求&quot;" target="&quot;雇主责任保险条款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇主责任保险涉及员工受伤后的治疗期间的医疗费用支付问题。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雇员受伤后的治疗认证要求&quot;" target="&quot;法律修订和废除事件&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法律规定了在特定情况下，需要注册医生、中医师或牙医出具证明才能获得赔偿。这些规定可能会被修改或废除。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea32034dab707f5f6e140aef3c87e1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FREE MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees can receive free medical treatment from their employer under specific circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PHYSIOTHERAPY&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL THERAPY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Physiotherapy and Occupational Therapy are mentioned as types of medical treatment, though not directly related in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150ac34f962a55c7a622046976949d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PHYSIOTHERAPIST&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Physiotherapy is given under the supervision of either a registered physiotherapist or a registered medical practitioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL THERAPIST&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational therapy can be provided by an occupational therapist, who may also work with a registered medical practitioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER (OUTSIDE HONG KONG)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A registered medical practitioner outside Hong Kong can provide treatment relevant to the employer's liability for work-related injuries abroad."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER (OUTSIDE HONG KONG)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY FOR WORK-RELATED INJURIES ABROAD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The registered medical practitioner outside Hong Kong is involved in determining the employer's liability for injuries sustained abroad."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af55493786feba6de502e98ed832cde8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1995&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance defines the rights and responsibilities of employees regarding medical expenses due to work-related injuries outside Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d8e006856fc24f02eba931eaf4c63a4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1995&quot;" target="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance outlines the conditions under which accidents occurring outside Hong Kong are covered by compensation laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d8e006856fc24f02eba931eaf4c63a4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1995&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 2 TO 10 AND 13 AND 14 OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendments made by sections 2 to 10 and 13 and 14 of this Ordinance do not apply to claims for compensation or other rights, obligations or liabilities in respect of accidents happening before the commencement of this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6ccfc41c467ba461a212761d1ed82e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accidents that lead to death or incapacity of an employee may trigger a claim for compensation, as regulated by the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80bd6fbaafa695488034148c221f9cda</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employee can be involved in, or affected by, the occurrence of an Accident leading to incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accidents can occur at the Workplace, as defined by industrial activities carried out there."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e87bb6b8feb2f7d365e7f2290bc5e29c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Accident can result in an Employee Injured, potentially leading to incapacity or death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e87bb6b8feb2f7d365e7f2290bc5e29c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ORDINANCE deals with actions related to ACCIDENTS that occur in employment contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e37def8625e820a47ed5130364eb70d4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;SAFETY OF PERSONS AT WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accidents at work are related to the safety of persons, which is a key concern under statutory duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5742863cc938d9f9470985855601b925</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTORS AND DENTISTS&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSED RETAILER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The text mentions that licensed retailers can sell medicines prescribed by registered doctors and dentists, indicating a relationship between them in the context of prescription drugs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6781f980c6134c143f1e75549acfb5a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTORS AND DENTISTS&quot;" target="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Chinese medicine practitioners and registered doctors/dentists are involved in prescribing medications, with specific regulations for each category. This indicates a relationship based on their roles in the healthcare system."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6781f980c6134c143f1e75549acfb5a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSED RETAILER&quot;" target="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Licensed retailers can sell medicines prescribed by Chinese medicine practitioners, as mentioned in the text, indicating an interaction between these two entities in the context of prescription drugs and traditional Chinese medicine products."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6781f980c6134c143f1e75549acfb5a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A prescription issued by a REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER must display the practitioner's name, patient's name, drug names and dosages, as well as the date of issue."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a9f135881cefdec226e999451dec41e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR/DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A prescription issued by a REGISTERED DOCTOR/DENTIST must also be shown to comply with regulations under (9), including displaying the doctor's or dentist's name, patient's name, drug names and dosages, as well as the date of issue."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a9f135881cefdec226e999451dec41e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549) defines the details that must be included in a PRESCRIPTION given by a registered Chinese medicine practitioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;CHINESE HERBAL MEDICINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A PRESCRIPTION may include information about CHINESE HERBAL MEDICINE, such as its name and quantity if prescribed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;PROPRIETARY CHINESE MEDICINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A PRESCRIPTION can also detail PROPRIETARY CHINESE MEDICINE, including product names and dosages or the contents of each Chinese herbal medicine it contains."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;中醫&quot;" target="&quot;處方藥物&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"中醫開出處方，涉及處方藥物的費用和名稱。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e7838850b120bb3976756876786fd0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;處方藥物&quot;" target="&quot;中成藥 (PROPRIETARY CHINESE MEDICINE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"中成藥是處方的一部分，通常需要顯示其產品名稱及劑量。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e7838850b120bb3976756876786fd0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE HERBAL MEDICINE&quot;" target="&quot;RETAILER LICENCE ISSUED UNDER SECTION [SECTION NUMBER] OF THE CHINESE MEDICINAL MATERIALS ORDINANCE (CAP. 549 SUB. LEG. F)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Retailer licences are required for the sale of Chinese herbal medicines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Retailers need a licence to sell Chinese herbal medicines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE HERBAL MEDICINE&quot;" target="&quot;PHARMACY AND POISONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 138)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Chinese herbal medicines must be registered under this ordinance to avoid employer liability for costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PHARMACY AND POISONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 138)&quot;" target="&quot;RETAILER LICENCE ISSUED UNDER SECTION [SECTION NUMBER] OF THE CHINESE MEDICINAL MATERIALS ORDINANCE (CAP. 549 SUB. LEG. F)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Retailers of Chinese herbal medicines must comply with this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-226a5e625c1a8d9a1eec41b16cf5ab0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PHARMACY AND POISONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 138)&quot;" target="&quot;PROPRIETARY CHINESE MEDICINE REGISTERED UNDER SECTION &quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Proprietary Chinese medicines registered under Section 121 of the Pharmacy and Poisons Ordinance are governed by that ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;" target="&quot;RETAILER LICENCE ISSUED UNDER SECTION 114 OF THE CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Retailer Licence is issued under the Chinese Medicine Ordinance, which governs its issuance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 118(1) OF THE CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 118(1) of the Chinese Medicine Ordinance grants a licence deemed to have been issued under Section 114."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioner operates within the framework of the Chinese Medicine Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETAILER LICENCE ISSUED UNDER SECTION 114 OF THE CHINESE MEDICINE ORDINANCE (CAP. 549)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may request proof of a Retailer Licence issued under the Chinese Medicine Ordinance for compliance checks."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-23e6ec634c556581f553eb9d0ddaf63f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;处长&quot;(" target="&quot;医疗费&quot;(">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"裁定是否有人对于在香港以外向僱员进行的医治负有第10A条规定的医疗费的法律责任;及如处长已裁定有人负有此种法律责任,他须裁定该医疗费的数额,并须向僱员及僱主发出一份述明医疗"(</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58338964f084327222ef921ec218f91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;裁決&quot;" target="&quot;申請&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"對於在香港以外向僱員進行的醫治負有法律責任的裁決是基於提出的申請。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-50672759d0eedd36be50c0f02eae5b67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;裁決&quot;" target="&quot;證明書&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"處長根據裁決結果發出醫療費數額的證明書。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-50672759d0eedd36be50c0f02eae5b67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申請&quot;" target="&quot;三方協議&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"申請需根據三方協議或其文本提出。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd4a36a8d591bd2dfc15340f652a220e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申請&quot;" target="&quot;更改命令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"申請可以引致更改命令的提出。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd4a36a8d591bd2dfc15340f652a220e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;證明書&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"處長或其代表簽署的證明書在法庭上被視為證據，除非有相反證據。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-50672759d0eedd36be50c0f02eae5b67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT REVIEW PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court Review Process allows for a review and potential alteration of the Commissioner’s determinations regarding medical expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cbcb1ef289ad456f0c48fcfc25edb43d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT INCOME CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY LOSS OF WORK CAPACITY AFTER ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of employment income is based on the loss of work capacity after an accident, considering different methods for similar earnings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ca5cfeffecbed01cff551f97c830898</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT INCOME CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;SIMILAR EARNINGS CALCULATION METHOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar earnings calculation method is a part of the process in calculating employment income when dealing with temporary loss of work capacity after an accident."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ca5cfeffecbed01cff551f97c830898</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSUMPTION PRICE INDEX&quot;" target="&quot;WORK INCAPACITY COMPENSATION CALCULATION METHODOLOGY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CONSUMPTION PRICE INDEX is used to adjust the income of an employee in WORK INCAPACITY compensation calculation methodology, reflecting changes over time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7d114925114937b88b0d806fd1a7519</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (CPI)&quot;" target="&quot;僱員的每月收入&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員的每月收入根據消費物價指數(CPI)在特定時期進行調整。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-36d3f58cc1b0180627d982d9257e5465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表6第2欄中相對於該附表第1欄所指明的款額&quot;" target="&quot;第11(5)條之處指明的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据法律规定,如果雇员收入每月少于附表6第2栏中的数额,则应按照该栏目的数值计算补偿。这表明两者之间存在直接关联和依赖关系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-613a87c26df0303e04bf8a71b1462496</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
