<edge source="&quot;第(7)款所提述的僱用合約&quot;" target="&quot;第40條的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(7)款提到的僱用合同要求僱主遵循第40条的规定，以确保公平和透明。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(7)款所提述的僱用合約&quot;" target="&quot;第3級罰款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"违反与第(7)款相关的僱用合同规定可能导致面临第3级罚款，这表明两者之间有关联性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(7)款所提述的僱用合約&quot;" target="&quot;第8款的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(7)款提到的僱用合同要求，僱主需要遵循第8条的规定以确保计算收入过程中的公平和透明。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第40條的規定&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第40条的规定，僱主需要在特定情况下提供足够的资料以确保公平和透明。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第40條的規定&quot;" target="&quot;第8款的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第40条的规定，僱主需要提供足够的资料给僱員或处长以计算收入；而第8条规定了如何具体执行这一要求。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第40條的規定&quot;" target="&quot;第3級罰款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"违反第40条的相关规定可能导致面临第3级罚款，这表明两者之间有关联性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(7A)款的規定&quot;" target="&quot;第8款的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(7A)款规定了僱員需提供资料给僱主遵守第40条的要求，而第8款则进一步规范了僱主如何处理这些信息以计算收入。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(7A)款的規定&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員需按照第(7A)款的要求向僱主提供足够信息，以便遵守相关法规。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(7A)款的規定&quot;" target="&quot;第3級罰款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"违反第(7A)款的规定可能导致面临第3级罚款，这表明两者之间有关联性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(7A)款的規定&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(7A)款的规定，僱主需要在特定情况下提供足够的资料给僱員以遵守相关法规；而这一要求与僱主的角色密切相关。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第8款的規定&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第8条的规定，僱主需要在规定时间内提供收入信息给僱員或处长以计算每月收入额；而这一要求与僱主的角色密切相关。"&lt;SEP&gt;"根据第8条的规定，僱主需要在规定时间内提供有关收入的信息给僱員或处长以计算每月收入额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第3級罰款&quot;" target="&quot;第9條的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"违反第(8)款规定将面临第3级罚款，这表明这两者之间有关联性，即不遵守规定的法律后果。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第3級罰款&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">20.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据法律规定，如果僱員违反相关条款规定可能导致面临第3级罚款，这表明两者之间有关联性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57fe6a1a322921301e20ac79c773cc67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ACCIDENT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation method is based on the employee's earnings at or before their Accident Date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c59e0c04b442ca3e395d9315796d6817</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ACCIDENT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;PREVIOUS 12 MONTHS OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Earnings are calculated over a period ending with the Employee's Accident Date if they have been long employed by the same employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c59e0c04b442ca3e395d9315796d6817</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ACCIDENT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY BEYOND THE 12-MONTH PERIOD AFTER THE DATE OF ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Temporary incapacity beyond the 12-month period after the Accident Date affects how earnings are calculated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c59e0c04b442ca3e395d9315796d6817</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY BEYOND THE 12-MONTH PERIOD AFTER THE DATE OF ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT ORDER UNDER SECTION 10(5)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court Order under Section 10(5) determines the period beyond which temporary incapacity is considered for earnings calculation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c59e0c04b442ca3e395d9315796d6817</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSUMER PRICE INDEX&quot;" target="&quot;RATE OF INCREASE IN THE CONSUMER PRICE INDEX AT THE END OF A 12-MONTH PERIOD AFTER THE DATE OF ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Consumer Price Index is used to adjust the rate of increase in earnings at the end of a 12-month period after the Accident Date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c59e0c04b442ca3e395d9315796d6817</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVERAGE RATE OF INCREASE IN RESPECT OF THE EARNINGS OF OTHER PERSONS OF SIMILAR EARNING CAPACITY EMPLOYED BY THE EMPLOYER IN SIMILAR EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;RATE OF INCREASE IN THE CONSUMER PRICE INDEX AT THE END OF A 12-MONTH PERIOD AFTER THE DATE OF ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Average Rate of Increase is used to calculate the earnings if similar employees are employed by the same employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c59e0c04b442ca3e395d9315796d6817</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVERAGE RATE OF INCREASE IN RESPECT OF THE EARNINGS OF OTHER PERSONS OF SIMILAR EARNING CAPACITY EMPLOYED BY THE EMPLOYER IN SIMILAR EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY EARNINGS OF AN EMPLOYEE AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The monthly earnings of an employee are adjusted based on the average rate of increase in respect of similar employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f99b49d1daa84b1f278cb269b06646d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSUMER PRICE INDEX REPORT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER FOR CENSUS AND STATISTICS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Consumer Price Index Report is compiled and published by the Commissioner for Census and Statistics."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f99b49d1daa84b1f278cb269b06646d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER FOR CENSUS AND STATISTICS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (消費物價指數)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consumer Price Index means CPI(A) in a Consumer Price Index Report compiled and published by the Commissioner for Census and Statistics."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f99b49d1daa84b1f278cb269b06646d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (消費物價指數)&quot;" target="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY AMOUNT WHICH, DURING THE 12 MONTHS PREVIOUS TO THE ACCIDENT, WAS BEING EARNED BY A PERSON OF SIMILAR EARNING CAPACITY IN THE SAME GRADE EMPLOYED AT THE SAME WORK BY THE SAME EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Consumer Price Index is used to adjust the earnings of an employee in similar employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f99b49d1daa84b1f278cb269b06646d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (消費物價指數)&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY EARNINGS OF AN EMPLOYEE AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consumer Price Index is referenced for adjusting monthly earnings beyond 24 months after the accident."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f99b49d1daa84b1f278cb269b06646d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY EARNINGS OF AN EMPLOYEE AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;24-MONTH PERIOD AFTER THE DATE OF THE ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The earnings at the time of accident are computed for a 24-month period after the date of the accident."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f99b49d1daa84b1f278cb269b06646d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY AMOUNT WHICH, DURING THE 12 MONTHS PREVIOUS TO THE ACCIDENT, WAS BEING EARNED BY A PERSON OF SIMILAR EARNING CAPACITY IN THE SAME GRADE EMPLOYED AT THE SAME WORK BY THE SAME EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;SAME CLASS OF EMPLOYMENT AND IN THE SAME DISTRICT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This average monthly amount is used when there are no similar employees in the same grade and district."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f99b49d1daa84b1f278cb269b06646d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SIXTH SCHEDULE, SECTION 11(5)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 11(5) of the Sixth Schedule is part of an Ordinance used for assessing compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db28cd6b23bdc6eed33984863e98ca47</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 11(5)&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED SECTIONS (6)">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 11(5)'s subsection (6) amends the interpretation of employment by the same employer, impacting its application in certain scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ba63e9eb3fbb2c29ada4788ed0dbf715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 11(5)&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED SECTIONS (7)">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 11(5)'s subsection (7) and its amendments deal with concurrent contracts of service and how earnings are computed for such cases, directly impacting the interpretation of SECTION 11(5)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ba63e9eb3fbb2c29ada4788ed0dbf715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 11(5)&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED SECTIONS (7A)">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 11(5)'s subsection (7A) relates to providing information requested by employers regarding concurrent contracts, which is relevant for compliance with other sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ba63e9eb3fbb2c29ada4788ed0dbf715</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FULL TIME EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 40&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition of FULL TIME EMPLOYMENT is provided in SECTION 40 which specifies the minimum hours and days required for such employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FULL TIME EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are considered under FULL TIME EMPLOYMENT, which defines their working hours and days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (7A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUBSECTION (7A) provides guidance on how employees should comply with SECTION 40 regarding concurrent contracts of service."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (8)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUBSECTION (8) elaborates on the requirements for employers to provide information related to SECTION 40 within a specified timeframe."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (9)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUBSECTION (9) defines penalties for employers who fail to comply with SUBSECTION (8), which is directly linked to the requirements of SECTION 40. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 76 OF 1982 S. 9&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition and amendments in AMENDED 76 OF 1982 S. 9 have a direct impact on the interpretation of SECTION 40 regarding full time employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40&quot;" target="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE ISSUED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The policy issued for this part may not exceed the obligation imposed by Section 40 on employers to insure for an amount in excess of the insured amount."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-10132a194a7ccd2dae34efb474098db1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 40 imposes an obligation on employers to insure for an amount that may exceed the insured amount, which is relevant to Employer's Liability under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-10132a194a7ccd2dae34efb474098db1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Under SECTION 40, a claimant can withdraw adjudication proceedings and restart them within the specified period if there is only one nominating body for a PAYMENT DISPUTE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (7B)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (7)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUBSECTION (7B) clarifies the conditions under which SUBSECTION (7) does not apply, based on compliance with SUBSECTION (7A). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (8)&quot;" target="&quot;MISLEADING STATEMENT OFFENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (8) defines the offence of making a misleading or false statement in writing to The Authority regarding compliance with an intruder alarm system requirement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (9)&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 36 OF 1996 S. 8&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment in AMENDED 36 OF 1996 S. 8 directly affects the penalty defined by SUBSECTION (9). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;家庭成員&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 1982年第76號第10條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members are mentioned in the amendment of 1982年第76号第10条, indicating they have a role or benefit under this provision."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;家庭成員&quot;" target="&quot;有權獲得補償的人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members are defined as those who can receive compensation according to the provisions for individuals entitled to compensation in the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-435a72f0a09b4a0be544ae91d6f3f83f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;家庭成員&quot;" target="&quot;第6B(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity '第6B(1)(A)' is related to '家庭成員' because it determines how compensation should be distributed among family members in certain cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4aa913268fc2903010ad7c595b9f18e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;家庭成員&quot;" target="&quot;醫護費&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity '家庭成員' is related to '醫护费', because family members may receive medical expense payments in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4aa913268fc2903010ad7c595b9f18e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEMBERS OF HIS FAMILY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee's death benefits are to be distributed among his family members as per the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d87e36b5ad46db41c716cf2910faa95c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A court claim can result in an order for the payment of compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d87e36b5ad46db41c716cf2910faa95c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REPEALED 52 OF 2000 S. 7&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity 'REPEALED 52 OF 2000 S. 7' is related to 'AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15', as the latter amends a section that replaces the former."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4aa913268fc2903010ad7c595b9f18e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第6A條&quot;" target="&quot;殯殮費&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity '第6A條' is related to '殯殮費', as the latter specifies that funds allocated under this regulation are for funeral expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4aa913268fc2903010ad7c595b9f18e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;醫護費&quot;" target="&quot;僱員死亡之前因意外引致接受医治或在医院接受康复护理所招致的费用(由该僱员支付者除外)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"医护费指的是特定条件下员工因事故产生的医疗费用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-272edd512c0a77f2dcb99ca42f01d356</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;受養人&quot;" target="&quot;補償的分發&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity '受养人' is related to '补偿的分发', as the latter specifies that compensation can be distributed to dependents under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4aa913268fc2903010ad7c595b9f18e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURY COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation for employee injury is a specific type of compensation mentioned within the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f42f51d2c6e983618042024d83fb403</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURY COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE'">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical attendance is covered under the employee injury compensation scheme, which is distributed according to specific sections mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f42f51d2c6e983618042024d83fb403</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL ATTENDANCE'" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical attendance costs can be covered by the compensation, which is distributed according to specific sections mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f42f51d2c6e983618042024d83fb403</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6E(5)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 6E(5) deals with expenses related to the EMPLOYEE, specifically for funeral and medical attendance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a0cf86f8afb0c798</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 8(2)(B)(I)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 8(2)(B)(I) provides for the payment of compensation directly to the EMPLOYEE or handling it through the COURT as per circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a0cf86f8afb0c798</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 10&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 10 provides for lump sum payments directly to the EMPLOYEE or handling it through the COURT as per circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a0cf86f8afb0c798</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 10&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S COMPENSATION(GENERAL ASSESSMENT) COMMITTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 10 is related to compensation that might be assessed by the Employer's Compensation(General Assessment) Committee, as mentioned in Section 16CB."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-691e0bbfff602acd26ed9f7e9579a105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 10&quot;" target="&quot;LEVEL 6 FINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 10 of the Ordinance is related to compensation that can lead to a fine at Level 6 if not adhered to properly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7788fe09e12252d0bb714e4f775b4322</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 10&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE GIVEN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 10 details conditions for giving notice that impacts payment obligations upon termination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04cd6ed43a9db3f3a7e91d2bf134ecfa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 10&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Termination by an employee not in accordance with SECTION 10 does not apply to subsection (a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d88cda6d2e850ba77bbd055819688849</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 10&quot;" target="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 10 is relevant to calculating maternity leave pay for days due to temporary incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5b551a4a483944d6cf3179909e4812f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPENDANT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER may be involved in applications made by DEPENDANTS under ORDINANCE rules, ensuring their benefit from compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COMMISSIONER may be involved in applications made by DEPENDANTS under ORDINANCE rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a0cf86f8afb0c798</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTRAR OF THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The REGISTRAR OF THE COURT provides receipts that serve as sufficient discharge for amounts paid to the COURT under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d19ac100c430c329d42230a7654f3c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION 14. 關於意外通知和補償申請的規定&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ORDINANCE includes specific provisions, such as REGULATION 14, which governs notification and compensation applications for accidents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d19ac100c430c329d42230a7654f3c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKPLACE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee can be involved in a workplace accident while performing their duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKPLACE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A compensation application is made following a work-related accident."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKPLACE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;DEATH LOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The death location may be related to the workplace where the accident occurred, especially if it involves an employee's death due to the accident."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKPLACE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S KNOWLEDGE OF ACCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer may be aware of an accident, which could affect legal actions and compensation applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5b9b6bd7c435d5501f5beca435a1caa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKPLACE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;INFORMAL INQUIRY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Informal inquiries into workplace accidents help determine the causes and circumstances of such incidents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inquiries into workplace accidents are conducted by Occupational Safety Officers and their reports are submitted to the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05288c51fb6c9855d3f031e51b7e2be3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKPLACE ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE SAFETY REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Workplace Safety Regulations aim to ensure the prevention and management of Workplace Accidents by providing necessary facilities for treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b74f875ef514e4d7940f5dbe0d7910e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;ACCIDENT CAUSING PERSONAL INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An ACCIDENT CAUSING PERSONAL INJURY leads to a COMPENSATION APPLICATION which must be made within certain time frames as per the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49920e3fc93948bee580896f50d6da6a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;OFFICE OR OTHER PLACE CUSTOMARILY USED BY THE EMPLOYER FOR THE PURPOSE OF PAYMENT OF WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are locations where wages may be paid according to the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af3fa69740e6c0d13188b3cd0b0d9a52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Written Notice is posted in a Conspicuous Place at the Place of Employment as per requirement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8f51952a48de0746c8700f0d84b90238</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;INDUSTRIAL EMPLOYMENT (HOLIDAYS WITH PAY AND SICKNESS ALLOWANCE) ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Places of employment are regulated by the Industrial Employment (Holidays with Pay and Sickness Allowance) Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-919e8934f076d1a9c5aea1486aa3f1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person working in any place of employment at any kind of work whatsoever incidental to or connected with the process, trade or business for which the place of employment is used shall be deemed to be employed therein."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61eb86110cfbe6bc5c9e56f62d9d038f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;4TH, 5TH, 6TH, 7TH, 13TH OR 17TH CLAUSE OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These clauses define the legal procedures for proceedings against offences under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC ANALYST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certificate from a Public Analyst is admissible in evidence during legal proceedings under this Ordinance, according to section 4. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce083c97323a19a9162d045f2002c1d4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational Safety Officers are involved in both sample division and record retention processes that can lead to Legal Proceedings as described in sections 3-6 of the text. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce083c97323a19a9162d045f2002c1d4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;EVIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings involving evidence of employment and employer relationships are discussed in detail."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d0bd5cc3392e5c0de523f5bb0536a64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings are conducted in the court as per legal regulations and procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3977494e2da78f664ddb0fbbd085bf83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings are not affected by appeals as per the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3977494e2da78f664ddb0fbbd085bf83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;OPEN COURT PROCEEDING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings may also be conducted as open court proceedings based on certain conditions or applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3977494e2da78f664ddb0fbbd085bf83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 84&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 84 applies to the enforcement of Mainland awards and can be used as a basis for legal proceedings in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bcca397988541ca9ac3822ff7a363627</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;MAINLAND AWARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mainland awards are considered binding and can be relied upon in any legal proceedings in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bcca397988541ca9ac3822ff7a363627</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR OTHER DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings can include court or other dispute resolution proceedings as part of their scope."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;管工或其他職員&quot;" target="&quot;通知&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"管工或其他職員可接收有關通知,以監督僱員的工作安全。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在某些情況下,處長不能作出裁定時,須由法院進行裁定。"&lt;SEP&gt;"法院在處理補償申索時會考慮處長根據第(3)(a)(i)款作出的查詢結果。\ "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42e445b0642be8d3a51c65d52cad0740&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de67114856d774592b4fb886fb31e9f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主也可能需要在法院提出補償申索,並涉及相關的法律程序。"&lt;SEP&gt;"根據文本描述,僱主或其配偶可以向法院提出申請,以轉換臨時付款證明書為法庭命令。這顯示了僱主與法院之間的互動和法律程序關係。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-140ad6aa8f9e18c2087a074a7e55b9b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;補償款項受益人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院有權命令將補償款項從根據本條例條文而須付給雇員或家庭成員的補償額中扣除。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a6ff3e19762d07ee36fb89575db50a74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;僱主的處所&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第6條提出的補償申索中,法院可考慮處長就所得結果而作出的書面報告。"\</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42e445b0642be8d3a51c65d52cad0740</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;司法管轄權的法庭或審裁處&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者都是處理僱員工資或薪金爭議的機構,但沒有直接關係描述可以提供。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;主管當局&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"主管當局可以将公約裁决的撤销或暂停请求转给法院处理，且法院有权决定是否推迟执行程序及命令提供保证。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b4dba8dcefb2d368c753859f749fd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTION AWARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院负责强制执行国际公约裁决，并在特定情况下可拒绝其执行。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b4dba8dcefb2d368c753859f749fd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院审查仲裁协议的有效性，决定是否可以拒绝执行该协议下的裁决。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b4dba8dcefb2d368c753859f749fd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;上訴&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据法律规定，任何人不得针对法院关于裁决执行的决定提出上诉。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b4dba8dcefb2d368c753859f749fd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;裁决撤销或暂停请求&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院有权处理关于公約裁決撤銷或暫時中止的相关申请，并决定是否推迟执行程序。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b4dba8dcefb2d368c753859f749fd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;主張承認或執行裁決的一方當事人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院可以根據申請延緩作出決定並裁定對方提供擔保。這顯示了雙方在法律程序中的互動關係。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-637d9e3dd1440e4117d86911ea5a7841</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;對方當事人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院的決定可能會影響到對方當事人的權益，尤其是涉及提供擔保的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-637d9e3dd1440e4117d86911ea5a7841</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院&quot;" target="&quot;第36條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第36條規定了法院在特定情況下可以拒絕認可或執行仲裁裁決，這直接影響到法院和相關當事人的關係。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-637d9e3dd1440e4117d86911ea5a7841</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;通知&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主需要根據規定向相關人員發出通知以處理意外事件。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;通知&quot;" target="&quot;產假開始日期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"女性僱員需要在放取產假前通知其僱主確切的產假開始日期。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb1fa32929a7020d65f293e8c9d7dd58</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;補償申請&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員遭遇意外後可以提出補償申請。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86c763b37e9e3638b9a073d36c6b4de6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYEE is required to give NOTICE OF ACCIDENT to EMPLOYER as soon as practicable after an accident occurs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6087ed3d45150a001bf9f66572bde4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may require an employer to provide a Notice of Accident if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;DEATH NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Notice of Accident might precede a Death Notice if the accident results in death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;RELEVANT LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Relevant Legislation, including both '64 OF 1992 S. 3' and '67 OF 1996 S. 4', governs the process of providing a Notice of Accident."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYEE can make APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION within 24 months from the occurrence of the accident causing injury or death, subject to certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6087ed3d45150a001bf9f66572bde4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can受理compensation applications even without a timely APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION if it finds reasonable grounds for not giving NOTICE OF ACCIDENT or making application within 24 months."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6087ed3d45150a001bf9f66572bde4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER OR ANY PERSON EMPLOYED BY HIM&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer or any person employed by him controls the employee and is responsible for their safety on premises belonging to the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-92743ab978843e283d6914a0d34ee3ea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;支付補償的法律責任&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主可能因意外而需承擔支付補償的法律責任。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eae344452d3fef20d9a84a14e26b325a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;支付補償的法律責任&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員在遭受意外後，可能會根據相關法例獲得補償，涉及支付補償的法律責任。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eae344452d3fef20d9a84a14e26b325a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外通知&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主需根據意外情況發出意外通知以履行義務。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56d9a950f8e72e839cb27b535da95ff4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;意外通知&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"處長可要求僱主在特定期間內提交進一步的意外通知。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56d9a950f8e72e839cb27b535da95ff4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE DEATH NOTIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE DEATH NOTIFICATION can lead to a COMPENSATION CLAIM if legal responsibility for payment arises from the death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86b556980892b37b85caf641b152672a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FAMILY MEMBERS OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE may be notified by the employer and could potentially make a COMPENSATION CLAIM if applicable."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86b556980892b37b85caf641b152672a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS NOTIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may inform family members of their right to compensation if a claim for compensation arises due to an employee's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f922ec3eb4453fd0e3ed3576f92a000e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT is responsible for determining the amount of compensation payable and making orders in respect thereof, including any order as to costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court may consider a report from the Commissioner in deciding a compensation claim under section 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f3f1d97c7e20d014b257a54d818ab74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68cfffcc2e250c3bcedc1cbea93ab48</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;REGIONAL COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All COMPENSATION CLAIMS must be heard by REGIONAL COURT, regardless of the amount involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d68cfffcc2e250c3bcedc1cbea93ab48</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TOTAL CONTRACTOR is responsible for handling COMPENSATION CLAIMS made by EMPLOYEES, including those indirectly through SUBCONTRACTORS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ad747843ea1e53c58713c22b928c5ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTE OF LIMITATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation claims are directly related to the statute of limitations period," explained in paragraph (5)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Compensation claims are subject to a statute of limitations period after which legal procedures cannot be barred or rendered ineffective," stated in paragraph (5)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5264a8fa197e6ad59c59c71f8b3763e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation claims are related to employer's liability as determined by legal procedures and assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd413c3e0e2d3c065b140491b75c8888</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱主的處所&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主如雇員死於其處所,則須當作對該雇員之死有所知悉。"\</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42e445b0642be8d3a51c65d52cad0740</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;RELEVANT LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Relevant Legislation, such as '76 OF 1982 S. 13', mandates the provision of a Death Notice in specific circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;64 OF 1992 S. 3&quot;" target="&quot;67 OF 1996 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legislation '64 OF 1992 S. 3' was replaced by the later amendment in '67 OF 1996 S. 4', indicating a legislative evolution."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f45f6c1c93d50d9cf7dd1bef9a6ec44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE TO EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Upon receiving a notice from the employer, the Commissioner may make inquiries and take actions regarding compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f922ec3eb4453fd0e3ed3576f92a000e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE DEATH NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"When notified by the employer, the Commissioner is required to make inquiries regarding possible compensation claims related to employee deaths."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f922ec3eb4453fd0e3ed3576f92a000e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT NOTIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;PHYSICIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Accident Notification triggers a requirement for an Employee to undergo a physical examination by a Physician appointed by the Employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT NOTIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If an Employee is receiving Traditional Chinese Medicine treatment, their Accident Notification may lead to a health check conducted by a Practitioner designated by the Employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT NOTIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Accident Notification can result in a requirement for an Employee to undergo a dental examination if they are receiving Dental treatment, with such examinations being carried out by Dentists appointed by the Employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PHYSICIAN&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Physicians are designated as medical professionals who can conduct health checks on employees, under the supervision of their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Traditional Chinese Medicine Practitioners may be called upon to perform health checks if an employee is receiving treatment from them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Dentists are designated as medical professionals who can conduct health checks on employees, under the supervision of their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both PRACTITIONER and DENTIST are roles that can be involved in medical examinations of an EMPLOYEE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-be12459eb42b5303144e2a38dc8cf0c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Dentists can provide dental-related prostheses or surgical appliances as part of their practice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;註冊牙醫&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"同上，適用於註冊牙醫的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;身體檢查&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主可以要求僱員進行身體檢查，并且需要支付相關費用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6a5821c406f8b08deabbe52c126132b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION REPORT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EMPLOYEE has the right to request and receive a copy of their MEDICAL EXAMINATION REPORT from the employer without charge if requested in writing. Failure by the employee to accept medical examinations as required may affect their rights to compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1faa1664ffe65d577dff74396c2e0ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIVATE REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EMPLOYEE has the right to undergo a medical examination with their PRIVATE REGISTERED DOCTOR, but they are responsible for the costs. If necessary, the employer can require treatment from a registered doctor without cost to the employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1faa1664ffe65d577dff74396c2e0ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are required to receive treatment from registered doctors, Chinese medicine practitioners, or dentists without incurring any costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-41bbb00ceaa0cfa991f173d4f0741862</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIM FOR EMPLOYEE'S DEATH&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The actions and decisions made by registered practitioners can impact the validity of compensation claims for an employee's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-41bbb00ceaa0cfa991f173d4f0741862</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION AND TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees must undergo medical examinations and treatments prescribed by registered practitioners, which are crucial for their health and safety."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employee is required by law to undergo a medical examination if notified by the Employer after an accident occurs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60357a5d0f946dc1e998d1bea10860b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bbb00ceaa0cfa991f173d4f0741862</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION AND TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;2006年第16號第16條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This amendment in 2006 further specifies the procedures related to medical examinations, including periodic requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60357a5d0f946dc1e998d1bea10860b6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRACTITIONER&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to renew a practitioner's licence, establishing a relationship of oversight and regulation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRACTITIONER&quot;" target="&quot;PRACTICAL GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Practitioners are expected to follow practical guidelines, indicating the relationship between practitioners and established standards of practice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;REPORT ON THE EXAMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A MEDICAL EXAMINATION leads to a REPORT ON THE EXAMINATION which is required for further actions like compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-be12459eb42b5303144e2a38dc8cf0c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE must undergo a MEDICAL EXAMINATION before being employed in certain trades, industries or processes as required by the Second Schedule."&lt;SEP&gt;"An examination is required under subsection (2) or (3), and failure in this may affect compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employees are required to attend medical examinations as arranged by their employers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employees are required to undergo medical examinations before employment as per the Employment Ordinance 16 of 2006 S. 19."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6b2c9739d4904eac9e0c6be6072cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-338f6b52974bc08baebc662da42c4477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e7d6d62033f777323f252b1d52645d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amended provisions affect the process and requirements of a medical examination in relation to compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amended provisions affect the process and requirements of a medical examination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical examinations are conducted by registered medical practitioners as per the Employment Ordinance 16 of 2006 S. 19."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-28e7d6d62033f777323f252b1d52645d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A medical certificate can lead to the need for a medical examination of the pregnant employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c53400793123be7f8846d77b56748e48</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"處長可以要求僱員進行醫學檢查以取得第二意見。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9abcb1aa4ccb5d467cb0175ca3011bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certificate from a medical examination can be used as evidence to claim sickness allowance, especially for pregnancy-related issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9af043de8381bfd2d54ddf7a99fe8b0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REPORT ON THE EXAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If there are disputes regarding compensation, the REPORT ON THE EXAMINATION may be submitted to the COURT for further determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-be12459eb42b5303144e2a38dc8cf0c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee is entitled to have their own registered medical practitioner present during the examination at their expense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S DEATH&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The death may be caused by the failure to follow instructions from a registered medical practitioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amended provisions affect the role and responsibilities of registered medical practitioners in relation to compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amended provisions affect the role and responsibilities of registered medical practitioners."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;RECOGNIZED SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A registered medical practitioner, registered Chinese medicine practitioner or registered dentist provides the necessary treatment for employees under a recognized scheme."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4af496fc2b1c26e3d6bca76a4b99c25f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TREATMENT BY REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;INJURY AND RESULTING INCAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The treatment by a registered medical practitioner can affect the nature and duration of injury and resulting incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TREATMENT BY REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER OR REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amended provisions affect the treatment process and responsibilities in relation to compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amended provisions affect the treatment process and responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURY AND RESULTING INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation is payable based on injury and resulting incapacity, which can be affected by treatment or examination failures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURY AND RESULTING INCAPACITY&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amended provisions affect the determination of injury and resulting incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court will make a determination based on the amended provisions when dealing with claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S DEATH&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amended provisions affect the determination of employee's death in relation to injury and compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amendment affects how death is deemed in relation to injury and compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation rules are amended, affecting the payment in cases of injury and death."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amended provisions affect the determination of compensation in relation to injury and death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3060c6c2405e1ec77fec151e62494218</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;" target="&quot;1988年第59號第4條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal provisions mentioned are related in terms of amendments and replacements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c031adb2191e2fdd70a1cfb2171a003</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15; 16 OF 2006 S. 16&quot;" target="&quot;1996年第36號第11條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal provisions mentioned are related in terms of amendments and replacements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c031adb2191e2fdd70a1cfb2171a003</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S DEATH&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Long service payment is contingent on the death of an employee, as it relates to years of service for which such payments might be due."&lt;SEP&gt;"The long service payment is related to the employee's death, as it pertains to years of service for which such a payment might apply."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2193ccb19ec3e792d874a92951eae0f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1988年第59號第4條&quot;" target="&quot;審核&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"審核的規定由1988年第59號第4條代替。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ab6c8718eab2752969763d7d57fe2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1996年第36號第11條&quot;" target="&quot;審核&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"審核的規定由1996年第36號第11條修訂及廢除部分條文。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ab6c8718eab2752969763d7d57fe2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;喪失賺取收入能力百分率&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"普通評估委員會根據第16D(5)條就喪失賺取收入能力百分率作出評估,並可能受到反對書影響。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-92d63fd21b0cce3b9e5c075238ab83af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;特別評估委員會&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者都是對僱員進行查訊或評估的機構,但沒有直接關係描述可以提供。"&lt;SEP&gt;"普通評估委員會和特別評估委員會都可以根據第(1)款審核其所作的評估，並可同時考慮任何根據第16G(1)條提出的反對。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"普通評估委員會須以書面通知僱主有關該項審核及其所持的第(1)款指明的審核理由，並在適用情況下述明根據第16G(1)條提出的反對是有獲考慮的。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"普通評估委員會可以要求僱員出席接受查訊或評估。"&lt;SEP&gt;"普通評估委員會須以書面通知僱員有關該項審核及其所持的第(1)款指明的審核理由，並在適用情況下述明根據第16G(1)條提出的反對是有獲考慮的。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"普通評估委員會須以書面通知處長有關該項審核及其所持的第(1)款指明的審核理由，並在適用情況下述明根據第16G(1)條提出的反對是有獲考慮的。"&lt;SEP&gt;"處長可以通知受傷僱員出席普通評估委員會的查訊或評估。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;第9(1A)條適用的補償申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"當普通評估委員會覺得與該項評估有關的補償申索屬第9(1A)條適用者時，不得完成審核，但須將該申索轉介特別評估委員會。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;喪失賺取收入能力百分率&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"特別評估委員會根據第16E(8)或(9)條就喪失賺取收入能力百分率作出評估,並可能受到反對書影響。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-92d63fd21b0cce3b9e5c075238ab83af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"特別評估委員會須以書面通知僱主有關該項審核及其所持的第(1)款指明的審核理由，並在適用情況下述明根據第16G(1)條提出的反對是有獲考慮的。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"特別評估委員會可以要求僱員出席接受查訊或評估。"&lt;SEP&gt;"特別評估委員會須以書面通知僱員有關該項審核及其所持的第(1)款指明的審核理由，並在適用情況下述明根據第16G(1)條提出的反對是有獲考慮的。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"特別評估委員會須以書面通知處長有關該項審核及其所持的第(1)款指明的審核理由，並在適用情況下述明根據第16G(1)條提出的反對是有獲考慮的。"&lt;SEP&gt;"處長可以通知受傷僱員出席特別評估委員會的查訊或評估。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;第9(1A)條適用的補償申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"特別評估委員會負責處理根據普通評估委員會轉介而來的、屬第9(1A)條適用者的補償申索。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-193cb7d25870869b93d954860d0aaace</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;審核&quot;" target="&quot;1992年第63號第7條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"審核的規定在1992年由1992年第63號第7條修訂。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ab6c8718eab2752969763d7d57fe2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;審核&quot;" target="&quot;2002年第16號第33條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"審核的規定在2002年由2002年第16號第33條進一步修訂。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ab6c8718eab2752969763d7d57fe2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;審核&quot;" target="&quot;第16G(2)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第16G(2)條作出審核。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ab6c8718eab2752969763d7d57fe2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱主及僱員&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"處長在接獲反對書後,會考慮相關因素並作出決定,影響僱主和僱員的補償評估結果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"處長需向僱主及僱員發出證明書以維持、更改或取消補償評估。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ab6c8718eab2752969763d7d57fe2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92d63fd21b0cce3b9e5c075238ab83af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱主及僱員&quot;" target="&quot;法院或勞資審裁處&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院或勞資審裁處需向僱主及僱員解釋命令內容,並考慮其意見作出決定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6485a8e98861158f8d237502e6fe9bcc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱主及僱員&quot;" target="&quot;適用性&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"本條例對僱主和僱員均有適用性,規定他們的權利與義務。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2e09be0ac839e84e94f72793a659214</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;付款期&quot;" target="&quot;第(8)款所提述的有關付款期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"付款期由第(8)款定义。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-272edd512c0a77f2dcb99ca42f01d356</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;發出日期&quot;" target="&quot;殯殮費和醫護費證明書或殯殲费和医护费审核证明书上所载的日期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"发岀日期是指相关证书上的日期。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-272edd512c0a77f2dcb99ca42f01d356</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE COMPENSATION ASSISTANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 365)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has authority to assess compensation claims under this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1b7183db745ed54dff547be6105981a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The certificate is issued as proof of the Commissioner's determination under Subsection (1)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2914073de37bf0e7df21cb9ca18483a2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner signs and issues certificates, which are legal documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c5bdac67e9c03ff3905f24c9ae12c304</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates issued by the Commissioner can be admitted in evidence without further proof in court."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COURT can order actions regarding CERTIFICATES, such as making decisions about sums paid under certificates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c5bdac67e9c03ff3905f24c9ae12c304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2792d26b948960fecf0ee999232dc4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee receives compensation from the employer based on the details provided in the certificate issued by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c5bdac67e9c03ff3905f24c9ae12c304</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ORDINANCE provides the basis for CERTIFICATES and their issuance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f2792d26b948960fecf0ee999232dc4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDING FOR REVOCATION OR REVIEW OF TRIBUNAL ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates may detail the decisions or pending cases related to revocation or review of tribunal orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 43P PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates issued by registrars of tribunals or courts are relevant to SECTION 43P PROCEEDINGS and can be used as evidence without further proof unless contradicted."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates issued by registered Chinese medicine practitioners are mentioned in the context of transition provisions for employee rights verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61eb86110cfbe6bc5c9e56f62d9d038f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16A(10)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36C&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amount $47,310 is specified for SECTION 36C under the context of SECTION 16A(10)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-463028737c14d4a1b81570efedfe747c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts can determine offences related to the failure to comply with payment periods and other sections. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;CONVICTION UPON INDICTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employer who fails without reasonable excuse to comply with the requirements of a notice commits an offence that can result in conviction upon indictment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5ead5337f34ae6c6d3adbc5b06e2bc74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;SUMMARY CONVICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The same failure by an employer may also lead to summary conviction, which is less severe than conviction upon indictment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5ead5337f34ae6c6d3adbc5b06e2bc74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;IMPORTING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Importing a non-compliant product can result in an offence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLYING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Supplying or offering products without compliance with noise emission markings constitutes an offence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers can enforce compliance with the provisions and may encounter offences as described in SECTION 26."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e43310bb8a059a1a014c1ba9a611877f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations can declare offences to be of strict liability or authorize imprisonment sentences."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-990bd24369be2bc2f9bdd440773f2e19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;WRITTEN STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A WRITTEN STATEMENT that includes false particulars can lead to an OFFENCE by the EMPLOYER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-312b267feca3c2a25982c678db5c0527</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3, FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The offences related to providing a false or incomplete written statement are punishable by fines at level 3 and level 5."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-312b267feca3c2a25982c678db5c0527</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;PART XIII&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part XIII deals with offences, which are related to violations of licensing and operational procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Individuals can commit offences if they wilfully contravene specific sections as outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33a64188afa193f5265ae78f3b8acbe6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 72A(3)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating SECTION 72A(3) results in an OFFENCE and a fine at level 5."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee's employer failing without reasonable excuse can result in a fine at level 6 for the offence of non-compliance. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffbe5c02e6f3e1420b13f54196f78358</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1), (3) OR (4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity who commits an offence under subsections (1), (3) or (4) is liable to a fine at level 6 on first conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed8223cf90d5d4646feb10ec51169ca9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity 'ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1)' is subject to a fine at level 6 upon first conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-767fcab98a545fabc81b28e3a6ad1ac3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (5)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Those committing an offence under Subsection (5) are liable for a fine at level 6 on first conviction. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OR (2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A fine at level 6 is a punishment for committing an offence under subsections (1) or (2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;第二次或其後定罪&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The second or subsequent conviction is punishable by a fine at level 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;每日$20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Daily fines apply for the initial conviction and continue during the crime period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON WHO USES OR CAUSES TO BE USED ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person who uses a prescribed product improperly commits an offense and is liable to a fine at level 6 on first conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;CONDITIONS OR LIMITATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating CONDITIONS OR LIMITATIONS results in a fine at level 6 upon second or subsequent convictions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7a153c57e6b577c1b46cd329273673a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;AREA, PLACE, PREMISES OR ACTIVITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Area, place, premises or activity can be subject to fines of level 6 for contravening conditions or limitations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7a153c57e6b577c1b46cd329273673a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;33(B), (C) &amp; (D) CLAUSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under clauses 33(b), (c) and (d) can result in a fine at level 6 upon second or subsequent convictions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7a153c57e6b577c1b46cd329273673a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONSIBLE PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Responsible Person who fails to comply with the requirements can face a fine of Level 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-58cf55b6baed9ac9a3c4052538486aa3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;SAME EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine at level 6 is applicable to an employer who contravenes subsection (1)(a) or (b). The same employer's actions are relevant in determining the offense and penalty."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dcef1d93167679643a824fa74e4d13d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY AVERAGE OF THE WAGES EARNED BY A FEMALE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine is related to offenses involving wages, which can be calculated based on monthly averages. The same employer's actions are relevant in determining the offense and penalty."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dcef1d93167679643a824fa74e4d13d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;TRADE UNIONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 332)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FINE AT LEVEL 6 is specified as the penalty for offences under the TRADE UNIONS ORDINANCE (Cap. 332), particularly those related to preventing union activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bb269a993727b98b029449c2f2612dff</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;PENALTY FOR PREVENTING UNION ACTIVITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PENALTY FOR PREVENTING UNION ACTIVITIES includes a specific fine at level 6 for the offence of preventing or deterring workers from exercising their union rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bb269a993727b98b029449c2f2612dff</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 72B(1)(A), (B), (C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contravening any of the provisions of SECTION 72B(1)(a), (b), or (c) results in a fine at level 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 18(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under SECTION 18(2) can result in a fine at level 6 as per the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR 1 YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations leading to a fine at level 6 can also result in one year of imprisonment as per the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16B. CANCELLATION OF INJURIES CLAIM CERTIFICATE BY THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16A provides a basis for court actions that Section 16B can override or modify."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eba7d646d2449192a3db7213315460a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16B. CANCELLATION OF INJURIES CLAIM CERTIFICATE BY THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee can also be an applicant for the cancellation of a certificate issued under Section 16A(2) or (5)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eba7d646d2449192a3db7213315460a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16B. CANCELLATION OF INJURIES CLAIM CERTIFICATE BY THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner is another party that can apply for the cancellation of a certificate issued under Section 16A(2) or (5)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eba7d646d2449192a3db7213315460a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16A&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE ISSUED UNDER SECTION 16A(2) OR (5)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates issued under Section 16A are the subject of potential cancellation as per Section 16B."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eba7d646d2449192a3db7213315460a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE ISSUED UNDER SECTION 16A(2) OR (5)&quot;" target="&quot;SUM PAID OR TO BE PAID&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The certificate can involve sums that may be affected by a court's decision to cancel the certificate under Section 16B."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eba7d646d2449192a3db7213315460a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE ISSUED UNDER SECTION 16A(2) OR (5)&quot;" target="&quot;INJURY CLAIM CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Injury claim certificates are the specific type of certificates that can be issued and potentially cancelled as per Sections 16A and 16B."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eba7d646d2449192a3db7213315460a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT handles APPLICATIONS made within 6 months of the date of issue of a certificate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f2792d26b948960fecf0ee999232dc4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AN APPLICATION leads to decisions about COMPENSATION, as per the provisions of the ORDINANCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f2792d26b948960fecf0ee999232dc4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;TRIPARTITE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The tripartite agreement is a document that must be provided with an application for re-employment benefits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9b2c9282e23c05c84bef3cbc6edb690</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;PRELIMINARY QUESTION OF LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An APPLICATION can be made for a PRELIMINARY QUESTION OF LAW regarding issues arising during arbitral proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-76cb33f1b7685e188783adaf8e60f8f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16CA. DETERMINATION OF COMPENSATION BY AGREEMENT IN CERTAIN CASES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compensation for an injured employee is determined by agreement, which involves the employer and the employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0d861619a56054d36c585396a6494755</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16CB. CANCELLATION OF AGREEMENTS BY DIRECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director can cancel agreements under certain conditions, involving both parties in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0d861619a56054d36c585396a6494755</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16CB. CANCELLATION OF AGREEMENTS BY DIRECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee can be affected if their compensation agreement with the employer is cancelled by the Director."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0d861619a56054d36c585396a6494755</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT OF SERVICE OR APPRENTICESHIP&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director's actions are related to agreements and contracts of service or apprenticeship, as they have the authority to cancel such agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0d861619a56054d36c585396a6494755</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT OF SERVICE OR APPRENTICESHIP&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee's employment status and rights are defined under a contract of service or apprenticeship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0d861619a56054d36c585396a6494755</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16CA&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16CA provides the basis for agreements that can be cancelled by the Commissioner under Section 16CB."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-691e0bbfff602acd26ed9f7e9579a105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY FOR LABOUR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary for Labour is responsible for appointing the members of the Employees' Compensation (Ordinary Assessment) Committee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-259358639f98ae3f9ccaff8ed680037d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTORS, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONERS, OR REGISTERED DENTISTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered doctors, registered Chinese medicine practitioners or registered dentists are members of the Employees' Compensation (Ordinary Assessment) Committee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-259358639f98ae3f9ccaff8ed680037d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;SENIOR LABOUR OFFICER OR LABOUR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A senior labour officer or a labour officer is also a member of the Employees' Compensation (Ordinary Assessment) Committee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-259358639f98ae3f9ccaff8ed680037d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Ordinary Assessment Board may refer claims to a Special Assessment Board if the claim involves section 9(1A). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner appoints the boards and determines their terms of office. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;LABOUR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Labour Officer is a member of the boards appointed by the Commissioner. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;1982年第76號第14條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 14 of the ordinance adds provisions for Employees' Compensation (Ordinary Assessment) Boards. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;16D. EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (ORDINARY ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16D defines the composition and procedures of Employees' Compensation (Ordinary Assessment) Boards. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Labour Officer, being a member of an Ordinary Assessment Board, is involved with the Special Assessment Boards through this connection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;SENIOR LABOUR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Senior Labour Officer may be appointed to serve on an Ordinary or Special Assessment Board which includes Labour Officers as members."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Labour Officers can also be appointed to serve on a Special Assessment Board, alongside other members such as the Commissioner and possibly additional qualified persons."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical practitioners must notify the Commissioner of suspected occupational diseases, using a form provided or approved by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05288c51fb6c9855d3f031e51b7e2be3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;" target="&quot;FORM PROVIDED OR APPROVED BY THE COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical practitioners must use forms provided or approved by the Commissioner for reporting occupational diseases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05288c51fb6c9855d3f031e51b7e2be3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1982年第76號第14條&quot;" target="&quot;16F, 16G(4) OR (7), 16GA(5) OR (8)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The provisions related to these sections have been amended by the law mentioned in this article."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-514e0a6ffa9d391d835f484bdbaa5724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1982年第76號第14條&quot;" target="&quot;1985年第31號第8條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are laws that have amended the provisions related to assessment boards and certificates, showing a connection through legal amendments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-514e0a6ffa9d391d835f484bdbaa5724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16E. 僱員補償(特別評估)委員會&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16E refers claims to a Special Assessment Board, indicating the relationship between these two boards. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYERS' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH ADVISOR DOCTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Occupational Health Advisor Doctor can be a member of the Employers' Compensation (Special Assessment) Committee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYERS' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;SENIOR LABOR AFFAIRS OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Senior Labor Affairs Officer is one of the members appointed to serve on the Employers' Compensation (Special Assessment) Committee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYERS' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;LABOR AFFAIRS OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Labor Affairs Officers are members of the Employers' Compensation (Special Assessment) Committee appointed by the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Labor Affairs Officer is a member of the committee appointed by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH ADVISOR DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Occupational Health Advisor Doctor can participate in meetings of the Special Assessment Board as a member of an appointed committee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SENIOR LABOR AFFAIRS OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Senior Labor Affairs Officer works under the Commissioner and is involved in committees like the Special Assessment Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHAIRMAN OF THE SPECIAL ASSESSMENT COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chairman is appointed by the Commissioner to lead the Special Assessment Board meetings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHAIRMAN OF THE SPECIAL ASSESSMENT COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner appoints the Chairman for the Special Assessment Board and its committees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a21e7be563e120a46acd1d6f45ede27</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner appoints the boards for their operations and composition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH CONSULTANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational Health Consultant is a member of these boards, contributing to their decision-making process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;SENIOR OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Senior Occupational Health Officer is also a member of these boards, participating in the evaluation processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational Health Officer serves as a member of these boards, contributing to their functions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (SPECIAL ASSESSMENT) BOARDS&quot;" target="&quot;SENIOR LABOUR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Senior Labour Officer is part of the composition of these boards and plays a role in their operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0512d455417ff415dc742891f2498109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SENIOR OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A senior occupational health officer or any occupational health officer is a member of the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Occupational Health Officer is involved in the process of assessing claims for compensation, though not specifically a member of any assessment board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The board includes members who are occupational health officers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 8 AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 8 Agreements can be used as one method to determine certain compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates under Section 16A are a way to settle specific types of compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16CA AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16CA Agreements can be used as another method for determining certain compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee is entitled to make an application for enforcing a claim for compensation if injured."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner receives notice from the District Court regarding claims that result in death from injuries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER FROM WHOM THE COMPENSATION IS RECOVERABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer from whom compensation is recoverable is the one under whose employment the employee suffered incapacity or died due to an occupational disease."&lt;SEP&gt;"This employer is directly responsible for compensating claims arising from an occupational disease contracted in their employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF INCAPACITY OR DEATH&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notice of incapacity or death identifies the last employer during the prescribed period immediately preceding the event, who is responsible for initiating compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;DISEASE WAS NOT CONTRACTED WHILST THE EMPLOYEE WAS IN HIS EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If it is proven that the disease was not contracted while the employee was in any employer's employment, then other employers may be liable for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER EMPLOYERS WHO EMPLOYED HIM IN SUCH EMPLOYMENT DURING SUCH PERIOD AS HE OR THEY MAY POSSESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Other employers may be involved in claims for compensation if it is proven that the disease was contracted during their employment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Other employers who employed the employee during the relevant period are potentially responsible for contributing to compensation if it is proven that the disease was contracted elsewhere."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSESSMENT PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Special Assessment Board follows the procedure determined by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-419f5ab2145d9ab1c03798719541af19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;[FROM &quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;]" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary (from Commissioner) is involved in specifying the form of certificates of assessment issued by both Ordinary and Special Assessment Boards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF ASSESSMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Special Assessment Board issues a certificate of assessment to the employee, employer, and Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF ASSESSMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are also recipients of the certificate of assessment issued by both Ordinary and Special Assessment Boards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW OF ASSESSMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can receive objections to assessments within 14 days from employers or employees, initiating a review process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVIEW OF ASSESSMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees also have the right to object to assessments and initiate a review process through written objections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3ba6e4c8e42988a064ffe8e2ff8f96e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通评委会或特别评委会&quot;" target="&quot;第16E、16F条以及本条款适用范围说明&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(5)款,尽管有其他规定,普通评估委员会在对与补偿申索有关的评估进行审核时需转介给特别评估委员会。这些条款适用于此情况下的申索。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第16A条发出口头证词及进行中的法律程序&quot;" target="&quot;反对书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(2)款,提交的反对书使依据第16A条发出的口头证词和正在进行的法律程序无效。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;反对书&quot;" target="&quot;特别评估委员会&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(5)款,提交的反对书可能涉及需要由特别评委会处理的补偿申索。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737d4df7f01f646261bb3f23aa0c6c79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;证明书&quot;" target="&quot;注册中西医&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"同样类型的证明书也可以由注册中医或注册牙医来签发以满足不同的医疗服务需求。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57d43cae31ae1724eef1b31ed4309ff6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16F CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner receives and processes 16F certificates related to objections or referrals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21097621f6720ea0958fecf07d8dcf43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16F CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Special Assessment Board's decisions can be challenged through 16F certificates, which are issued in response to objections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21097621f6720ea0958fecf07d8dcf43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16D(5) ASSESSMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Special Assessment Board handles assessments under section 16D(5), which can be referred from the Ordinary Assessment Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21097621f6720ea0958fecf07d8dcf43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16E(8) ASSESSMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner is involved in processing and reviewing 16E(8) assessments, as well as handling objections to them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21097621f6720ea0958fecf07d8dcf43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16GA REVIEW&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Special Assessment Board's decisions can be reviewed under section 16GA, which is a mechanism for further evaluation of their assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21097621f6720ea0958fecf07d8dcf43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OBJECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An OBJECTOR can be either an EMPLOYEE or an employer, depending on the context of the objection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0aa6a1ecbb96f241ec693e9b7796d393</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OBJECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER forwards objections from OBJECTORS to the appropriate BOARD, indicating a relationship of handling disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0aa6a1ecbb96f241ec693e9b7796d393</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OBJECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 5 OF 1988&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 5 OF 1988 establishes rules that OBJECTORS must follow when making objections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0aa6a1ecbb96f241ec693e9b7796d393</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 5 OF 1988&quot;" target="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 5 OF 1988 is part of the DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS, establishing a foundational rule for handling objections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0aa6a1ecbb96f241ec693e9b7796d393</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16A(4)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 16A(4)(A) is part of the broader DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS as it outlines specific actions during an objection process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0aa6a1ecbb96f241ec693e9b7796d393</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16E, 16F&quot;" target="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTIONS 16E and 16F are integral parts of the DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS, providing detailed procedures for handling claims referred to a Special Assessment Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0aa6a1ecbb96f241ec693e9b7796d393</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF ORIGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The dispute resolution process may involve a court of origin as part of the overall legal framework for handling conflicts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ad963d62d75768847794433df9caf4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;INTERIM MEASURE REQUEST DISCLOSURE RISK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interim measure request disclosure risks are managed as part of the overall dispute resolution process, ensuring fairness and effectiveness."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98a7cf7df4d78e9604020dd5f5323409</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16D(5)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Special Assessment Board is associated with claims under subsection (5) of section 16D."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Special Assessment Board may review assessments made under this section. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1eeedbfd93d66d01580f5f057b6a2dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16D(5)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINARY EVALUATION COMMITTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This section is relevant to the Ordinary Evaluation Committee's assessment process. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16F&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner is notified of assessments under this section, as per procedural requirements. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16F&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Special Assessment Board issues certificates under section 16F in respect of claims it reviews. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da37f195f3ad2a893b50923a13911e53</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16GA(2)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16GA(2) excludes the application of certain subsections where an assessment is reviewed, specifically mentioning Special Assessment Board. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1eeedbfd93d66d01580f5f057b6a2dfb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIAL EVALUATION COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16E(8) OR (9)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These sections are directly related to the Special Evaluation Committee’s jurisdiction. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16E(8) OR (9)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Special Assessment Board can refer claims to these sections for further evaluation. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16G(1)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This section applies when reviewing assessments by the Special Assessment Board, as per procedural requirements. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-924ba54f67533a1228efb89110dcadb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16E&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16E applies to claims referred by the Special Assessment Board. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da37f195f3ad2a893b50923a13911e53</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16F, 16G(3), 16GA(4)&quot;" target="&quot;1985年第31號第8條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The provisions related to these sections have been amended by the law mentioned in this article."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-514e0a6ffa9d391d835f484bdbaa5724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工資或薪金&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主須根據僱員休假缺勤的情況支付相應的工資或薪金。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;司法管轄權的法庭或審裁處&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主可能需要在具有司法管轄權的法庭或審裁處提出關於工資或薪金的訴訟。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56cceac4667a58d36b3976e9f95e0382</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE OF ABSENCE FROM WORK&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee may be granted leave of absence from work for an examination or assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ab861803e98b52f9a42ed6d058e8b49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENTS UNDER SECTION 10&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee is receiving periodical payments under section 10, which affects the employer's obligation to grant a leave of absence and pay wages during such period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ab861803e98b52f9a42ed6d058e8b49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACTION FOR CIVIL DEBT IN ANY COURT OR TRIBUNAL OF COMPETENT JURISDICTION&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION IN THE COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A claim for wages or salary can be brought as an action for civil debt in court, either independently or with other claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ab861803e98b52f9a42ed6d058e8b49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;第30B条所指雇员&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine at level 5 is related to employees mentioned under section 30B according to legal procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;CONDITIONS OR LIMITATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating CONDITIONS OR LIMITATIONS results in a fine at level 5 upon first conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7a153c57e6b577c1b46cd329273673a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;AREA, PLACE, PREMISES OR ACTIVITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Area, place, premises or activity can be subject to fines of level 5 for contravening conditions or limitations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7a153c57e6b577c1b46cd329273673a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;WRITTEN STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If an EMPLOYER includes false information in the written statement, they are liable to a fine of level 5 upon conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d94d21b562915559fff6272dbbdb3b70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1)">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employer who includes false information recklessly under subsection (1) may be liable to a fine at level 5. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a3bfa1b02f074277b3b1a27f3afcb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (4)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine at level 5 is the maximum penalty for failing to comply with a notice in writing from an employee under subsection (4)(b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a3bfa1b02f074277b3b1a27f3afcb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;1965 C. 62 S. 9(2) U.K.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine at level 5 is derived from the corresponding provision in UK legislation, section 9(2) of chapter 62 of 1965. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a3bfa1b02f074277b3b1a27f3afcb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment agencies are subject to fines at Level 5 for certain offences, such as those under Sections 57(1)(B) &amp; (C). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 72A(3)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 72A(3)'s violation results in a FINE at level 5."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1992 S. 9&quot;" target="&quot;1996 S. 12&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 12 of Act 36 of 1996 amends the provisions related to subsection (3)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-baa998ea27b6baa036c2807f3cddf020</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Regional Court handles appeals from various bodies including those related to specific clauses under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-baa998ea27b6baa036c2807f3cddf020</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The REGIONAL COURT is the entity that has jurisdiction over issues related to compensation claims as per the text provided, and it aligns with the powers of a court under the Regional Court Ordinance (Cap. 336). The term 'Court' in the first part can be interpreted broadly to include regional courts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51aca9ef532467f1fd709d3d772f4ca8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Regional Court's decisions can be reviewed by the Appeal Tribunal, and in certain cases, the Appeal Tribunal may send a compensation claim back to the Regional Court for reassessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd413c3e0e2d3c065b140491b75c8888</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT&quot;" target="&quot;LAW REVISION AND REFORM (COMPREHENSIVE) ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal procedures in Regional Court are subject to revisions under the Law Revision and Reform Ordinance, which can affect how compensation claims are handled."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd413c3e0e2d3c065b140491b75c8888</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16A, 16D, 16E, 16G, 16GA CLAUSES&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Decisions or assessments made based on these clauses can be appealed within a specified period to the Regional Court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-baa998ea27b6baa036c2807f3cddf020</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appeals can be made against decisions or assessments made by the Director, and there is a specified appeal period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-baa998ea27b6baa036c2807f3cddf020</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 8 AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16A CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 8 Agreements and Section 16A Certificates are both methods of determining compensation claims, but they serve different purposes for specific types of cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 8 AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16CA AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Section 8 Agreement and Section 16CA Agreement can be used to determine certain compensation claims, though the latter is a newer addition with different conditions for application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16A CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16CA AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16A Certificates and Section 16CA Agreements both deal with specific types of compensation claims, but the latter is a newer form that may have additional requirements or conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9e62cff17ccfc412cc70505158f5a23e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTRATION DOCTOR, TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, DENTIST&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In cases where an employee's condition changes due to injury, the involvement of a registered medical professional is required to support claims for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d285e5cc0dd5b45c7925c806f32ec724</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court reviews applications by employers regarding the continuation, increase, decrease, conversion to lump sum, or ending of periodical payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;WORK CAPACITY OF EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The work capacity of the employee is considered when reviewing and making decisions about periodical payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERIODICAL PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The death of an employee may result in the termination or modification of existing periodical payment arrangements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;55 OF 1969 S. 16&quot;" target="&quot;17 OF 1969 S. 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16 of Ordinance No. 55 of 1969 is replaced by this provision, affecting the process for ending or diminishing periodical payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;10(5), 16(4) &amp; 19(3)&quot;" target="&quot;20. 對僱主終止或減少按期付款權力的限制&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These clauses provide exceptions to the employer's rights regarding termination or reduction of periodical payments, affecting their application process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea6d20dfaa02a409f86af6c45c243e0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31D(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The circumstances in SECTION 31D(2), which involve non-renewal and non-reengagement, are related to the death of an employee as per Section 31M."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d33baa15beb160832b6e2302162f04d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The death of an employee affects the status and rights under their employment contract, especially regarding termination notices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2f5d9b3d656df85c08982a8986732f4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee's death can impact contractual obligations and benefits as defined in the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The death of an employee triggers actions under Part VIA of this Ordinance on employment protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9ed372c34a6ff55010cb2f16481f447c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2f5d9b3d656df85c08982a8986732f4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The personal representative of a deceased employee may have rights or claims related to the employment termination due to the employee's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2f5d9b3d656df85c08982a8986732f4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The personal representative of a deceased employee can file claims related to the Death of Employee under Part VIA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9ed372c34a6ff55010cb2f16481f447c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;31YA CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 31YA clause applies when an employee dies, affecting the payment of long service payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e5131fef8ae89d5a0f48b17c1599d19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CLAIMS&quot;" target="&quot;DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 336)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court Ordinance, Cap. 336, governs all claims for compensation heard by the District Court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;APPEALS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court of Appeal has jurisdiction over appeals from the decisions of the District Court, except as otherwise provided by law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT OF APPEAL requires leave from the COURT for any appeal under this section."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Court of Appeal is an appellate court that can hear appeals from the decisions made by lower courts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f62200ffc7f6236194042490c461241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698354d68541c6722cada50bb05de978</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Appeal Board can refer questions of law arising in an appeal to the Court of Appeal for determination by way of case stated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60c17dd78d73fb0b81ce0ba9e3153396</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court of Appeal has the authority to grant leave for appeal against arbitral awards, and its decisions can be further appealed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9174a61c7bf0b325fa1fb34e7b741c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 336)&quot;" target="&quot;CIVIL ACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Court Ordinance Cap. 336 provides the legal framework for civil actions and compensation claims in the District Court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 336)&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPEAL BOARD's Chairman is appointed based on the qualification defined in DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (Cap. 336). This establishes a legal basis for appointment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c65da5be1610c7210df4b6d277a43ffa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 336)&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CHIEF EXECUTIVE uses qualifications defined by DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (Cap. 336) to appoint the Chairman of APPEAL BOARD, showing a legal reference."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c65da5be1610c7210df4b6d277a43ffa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 336)&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL BOARD HEARING PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The procedures outlined in Section 21(1) and 20(4) of the District Court Ordinance govern how Appeal Board hearings are conducted, including continuity measures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL ACTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST ORDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Civil actions in the District Court can include interest orders as part of judgments and settlements involving compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47d0715aec1431ae85a3a9f75d33c852</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL承判商&quot;" target="&quot;SUB承判商&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TOTAL承判商" and "SUB承判商" are terms used in a contractual relationship where TOTAL承判商 engages SUB承判商 for specific work or services, implying a hierarchical business arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f62200ffc7f6236194042490c461241</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL承判商&quot;" target="&quot;前判次承判商&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The superior nominated subcontractor (前判指定次承判商) can deduct from the sum due to it by way of set-off, which is related to TOTAL承判商's payment obligations under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL承判商&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a principal contractor (如TOTAL承判商) pays wages to an employee according to section 43C or 43G, the employer's legal responsibility for those wages is terminated under section 43K."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL承判商&quot;" target="&quot;通知書的送達&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notices can be delivered in various ways including face-to-face delivery (面交上述人士), which applies to TOTAL承判商 according to section 43L(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYEES can be directly hired by SUBCONTRACTORS under agreements with TOTAL CONTRACTOR, and TOTAL CONTRACTOR is legally responsible for them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ad747843ea1e53c58713c22b928c5ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TOTAL CONTRACTOR may face LEGAL LIABILITIES in cases where EMPLOYEES hired through SUBCONTRACTORS suffer harm or make claims, as TOTAL CONTRACTOR is ultimately responsible under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ad747843ea1e53c58713c22b928c5ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY ISSUED BY INSURER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Total contractor can obtain an insurance policy issued by the insurer to cover their legal liabilities and those of subcontractors, with coverage not less than the specified amount in Schedule 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdcb847cbe822aecbab442ce9430887f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL FOR WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TOTAL CONTRACTOR may be involved in disputes over wages that go through the SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL FOR WAGES, as it handles such cases involving unpaid wages from SUBCONTRACTORS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1f7e01a5307e145a0563e90666073bf5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTIFICATION REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE must send a written notice to the TOTAL CONTRACTOR before making any claims or applications against them, containing specific details as required by law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NOTIFICATION REQUIREMENT is applicable to an EMPLOYEE who needs to send specific details before making any claims or applications against the TOTAL CONTRACTOR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5dea5aae61ffe2f36c7ee939e119437c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTIFICATION REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE YEAR DETERMINATION POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Notification Requirement for an election under the Leave Year Determination Policy must be met before implementation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8f51952a48de0746c8700f0d84b90238</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE款額&quot;" target="&quot;彌償款項&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"THE款額"和"彌償款項"都涉及到损害赔偿金额，但前者是实际获得的赔偿额上限，后者是在特定条件下需要支付的实际补偿额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a5734a3528df7505e20e5f0156116bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">23.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal procedures are suspended when the court refers parties to arbitration, according to legal rules and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal procedures in court proceedings are governed by the Rules of Court and other legal frameworks."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court can issue orders regarding the return of compensation款项, as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5264a8fa197e6ad59c59c71f8b3763e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-211e080c19540ebafb0dc80d25b20e46</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE SINGLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal procedures are mentioned in relation to the insurance single, indicating a direct relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;REASONABLE PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The reasonable period for compliance is a key part of the legal procedure to ensure employers and occupiers have time to rectify issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-92398049cd93d8f432b90b9d7cf63d15</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Specified documents relate directly to legal procedures and can be evidence for court cases or tribunal decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bf4100b4fcbad386ad1781e51770f26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE ACCIDENT INVESTIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal procedures can involve investigations into workplace accidents, as mentioned in the text. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f10185e6fc563260f4e1f20ab8c394fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL WORK SAFETY REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal procedures may relate to violations of personal work safety regulations. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f10185e6fc563260f4e1f20ab8c394fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;PROPERTY SEIZURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Property seizure measures can be retained as security for arbitral awards if a lawsuit is stayed due to an arbitration agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-211e080c19540ebafb0dc80d25b20e46</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Appeal Board has powers similar to those of the Court of First Instance, as specified in subsection (7)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Witnesses before the Appeal Board are entitled to the same immunities and privileges as if they were witnesses in civil proceedings before the Court of First Instance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed6bb61c777b6fe07e21fb258ca9224</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;CRIMES ORDINANCE (CAP. 200)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court of First Instance provides privileges and immunities to witnesses giving evidence at an inquiry, similar to those under the Crimes Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d187f5859fc0e151b7a45dda2b23c53</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;CORONIAL INQUEST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Witnesses giving evidence at a coronial inquest are entitled to similar privileges as those before the Court of First Instance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d187f5859fc0e151b7a45dda2b23c53</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court of First Instance has the authority to grant interim measures related to arbitration proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d2fe562ab74fde36758e6db7f158f71b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;INTERIM MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court of First Instance can grant interim measures in relation to both Hong Kong and non-Hong Kong arbitration procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d2fe562ab74fde36758e6db7f158f71b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both entities deal with arbitration procedures, but the Court of First Instance may intervene when appropriate according to specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fd04bf2888da55881f593f9613b44e9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16A CERTIFICATE DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT may determine a SECTION 16A CERTIFICATE which impacts repayment orders under subsection (4)." "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f8e345be219d3fc366dc62469796daf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16CA SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT may settle an agreement under SECTION 16CA, affecting the limitation of actions." "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f8e345be219d3fc366dc62469796daf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT may issue a CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT which impacts the limitation of actions." "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f8e345be219d3fc366dc62469796daf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION ASSESSMENT FOR FATAL CASE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates of Compensation Assessment for Fatal Case can be finally determined by a court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;36 OF 1996 S. (REPEALED)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1) PROCEEDINGS FOR DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The enactment 36 OF 1996 S. (REPEALED) affects the limitation of actions for proceedings." "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f8e345be219d3fc366dc62469796daf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE must provide a WRITTEN NOTICE OF INTENTION before instituting or abandoning proceedings for damages." "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f8e345be219d3fc366dc62469796daf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;" target="&quot;12 MONTHS PERIOD FROM RECEIPT OF DUE NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 12 MONTHS PERIOD FROM RECEIPT OF DUE NOTICE affects the validity of a WRITTEN NOTICE OF INTENTION." "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f8e345be219d3fc366dc62469796daf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;" target="&quot;3 MONTHS PERIOD AFTER DETERMINATION, SETTLEMENT, OR REVIEW CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 3 MONTHS PERIOD AFTER DETERMINATION, SETTLEMENT, or REVIEW CERTIFICATE affects the limitation of actions for proceedings." "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f8e345be219d3fc366dc62469796daf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE UNDER SECTION 16A&quot;" target="&quot;COURT DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates under Section 16A can be finally determined by a court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16CA SETTLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE GIVEN TO EMPLOYER UNDER SUBSECTION (2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16CA settlement requires notice to the employer, as per subsection (2)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REPEALED 36 OF 1996 S. 19&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE GIVEN TO EMPLOYER UNDER SUBSECTION (2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The repealed section did not affect the notice obligations under subsection (2)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;HIGHER COURT DETERMINATION OF COMPENSATION VALUE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts can make final determinations, which higher courts may review."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMON LAW DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts can determine common law damages as part of their jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURES FOR RESOLVING WORK-RELATED INJURY DISPUTES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts can determine legal procedures for resolving work-related injury disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE GIVEN TO EMPLOYER UNDER SUBSECTION (2)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S CIVIL LAW RESPONSIBILITIES UNDER THIS REGULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers have civil law responsibilities that include notice obligations under this regulation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE GIVEN TO EMPLOYER UNDER SUBSECTION (2)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S NOTICE OBLIGATIONS UNDER THIS REGULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer's notice obligations under this regulation include giving notice as per subsection (2)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON WHO MAY BE CALLED UPON TO PAY AN INDEMNITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S CIVIL LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The person called upon to pay an indemnity may be the employer, who has civil liability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION VALUE DETERMINED BY COURT OR REGIONAL COURT&quot;" target="&quot;HIGHER COURT DETERMINATION OF COMPENSATION VALUE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regional courts and higher courts may both determine compensation values, with the possibility of review by a higher court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-897a61a0387ff5cb7f8548d9dd8705bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Appeal Tribunal can order the calculation of interest on compensation amounts, based on certain conditions and rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd413c3e0e2d3c065b140491b75c8888</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL has the authority to calculate and award interest on various款项 or费用 in arbitration procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-26d3619691b8c4b07bbc74f1edf654f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"During the ARBITRATION PROCEDURE, the tribunal can determine the appropriate rates and periods for calculating单利息或複利息 on awarded amounts or costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-26d3619691b8c4b07bbc74f1edf654f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;DAMAGES AWARDED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of compensation can include interest on damages awarded, as per legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3aa4260f473f5ab1bb0de261f78fc6e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer's civil liability is independent but may be affected by the value of compensation awarded under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3aa4260f473f5ab1bb0de261f78fc6e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;CRIMINAL LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Civil liability may arise from workplace accidents, which can also lead to criminal liability depending on the severity of the violation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fbbb4670a77162b48a5d0767257af240</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES AWARDED&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEEDINGS UNDER ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Proceedings can determine if damages awarded should reduce or not affect the employer’s liability as per the provisions of this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3aa4260f473f5ab1bb0de261f78fc6e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;APPELLATE TRIBUNAL DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The appellate tribunal may assess compensation and deduct costs from it, affecting the final determination on employer's liability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3aa4260f473f5ab1bb0de261f78fc6e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is liable to pay for the cost of supplying and fitting a prosthesis or surgical appliance required by an injured employee."&lt;SEP&gt;"The employer may be liable for the cost of supplying and fitting prosthetic devices or surgical appliances if caused due to an accident at work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c526fd9477b77161e84c476f0017da6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;COMMITTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The committee plays a role in approving the provision and fitting costs for prosthetic devices or surgical appliances under certain conditions, impacting employer's liability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is required by law to submit an injured employee to treatment by a registered medical practitioner, Chinese medicine practitioner or dentist."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c526fd9477b77161e84c476f0017da6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Board's approval is necessary for the employer to be liable for costs related to prosthesis or surgical appliance supplied outside Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c526fd9477b77161e84c476f0017da6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE INJURY INCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee injury incidents can lead to employer's liability claims, which are subject to insurance coverage as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6157228e3518a3c9dd66f98867aa8a6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE ISSUED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The policy of insurance issued for this part covers the amount not exceeding the employer's liability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-10132a194a7ccd2dae34efb474098db1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36LA OR 44&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 36LA or 44 deals with the legal responsibility of the employer, which is relevant to Insurer's Liability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-10132a194a7ccd2dae34efb474098db1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLATE TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Appellate Tribunal can review and potentially remit cases back to the District Court for assessment of compensation under the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71e61f5794135dfe2a1a6e5ae434940c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW AMENDMENT AND REFORM (CONSOLIDATION) ORDINANCE (CAP. 23)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Law Amendment and Reform (Consolidation) Ordinance provides specific rules for reducing damages recoverable independently of the main Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71e61f5794135dfe2a1a6e5ae434940c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW AMENDMENT AND REFORM (CONSOLIDATION) ORDINANCE (CAP. 23)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 25 OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 25 of the Law Amendment and Reform Ordinance defines conditions under which a third party can be indemnified."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddbe221813d2b91715360a8a16979bab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW AMENDMENT AND REFORM (CONSOLIDATION) ORDINANCE (CAP. 23)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 24 OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 24 of the Law Amendment and Reform Ordinance outlines who can be called on to pay an indemnity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddbe221813d2b91715360a8a16979bab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 21(3)&quot;" target="&quot;(4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Without prejudice to section 21(3), subsection (4) provides additional details on assessing compensation including interest."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5368f346dbcfde8d0b6c8190b98be08d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1982 S. 20&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 25(1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The addition of subsection (4) is based on section 20 of Act No.76, 1982."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5368f346dbcfde8d0b6c8190b98be08d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 25(1)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;THE LAW REVISION AND REFORM (COMPREHENSIVE) ORDINANCE (CAP. 23)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Law Revision and Reform Ordinance provides the basis for section 25(1)(b)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5368f346dbcfde8d0b6c8190b98be08d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 25(1)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;2000年第52号第16条&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16 of Act No.52, 2000 amends section 25(1)(b)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5368f346dbcfde8d0b6c8190b98be08d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECOVERY OF COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The recovery of compensation is related to the employee who has not been at fault."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddbe221813d2b91715360a8a16979bab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECOVERY OF COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 25 OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 25 deals with recovery of compensation from third parties in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddbe221813d2b91715360a8a16979bab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECOVERY OF COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 24 OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 24 relates to the indemnity that may be sought for recovered compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddbe221813d2b91715360a8a16979bab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP CAPTAIN AND SEAMEN WORKING ON HONG KONG SHIPS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ship captains and seamen working on Hong Kong ships are a subset of employees covered by the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddbe221813d2b91715360a8a16979bab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;船長及海員&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員包括了船長和海員，他們在香港船舶上工作。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-19284fbf4d548ad004ef52e2b76eaa7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;船長及海員&quot;" target="&quot;意外通知和補償申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"船長及海員可以接受意外通知和補償申索,即使發生在船上。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-19284fbf4d548ad004ef52e2b76eaa7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;女皇陛下領地或於女皇陛下行使司法管轄權的地方&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在某些情況下,經宣誓的供詞可在這些地方被接納為證據。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-19284fbf4d548ad004ef52e2b76eaa7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《1894年商船法令》*(1894 C. 60 U.K.)#&quot;" target="&quot;供詞&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據該法例,供詞可以在特定情況下被接受為證據。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-19284fbf4d548ad004ef52e2b76eaa7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG SHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Merchant Shipping Act 1894 defines the term 'Hong Kong ship' as any vessel registered or licensed in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894&quot;" target="&quot;SHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Merchant Shipping Act 1894 uses the term 'ship' to define a vessel under its jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894&quot;" target="&quot;VESSEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Merchant Shipping Act 1894 defines the term 'vessel' as part of its legal framework for maritime regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894&quot;" target="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Seafarers are mentioned in relation to employment and responsibilities under The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894&quot;" target="&quot;MASTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'master' is used within the context of seafarers, indicating its relevance to ship captains or commanders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;SHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"HONG KONG SHIP is a specific type of SHIP registered or licensed in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hong Kong ships are a subset of vessels as defined by The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Seafarers working on Hong Kong ships fall under the jurisdiction and legal framework established by The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;MASTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'master' is specifically mentioned in relation to Hong Kong ships, indicating its importance for ship captains or commanders operating these vessels."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;CEMETERY FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Cemetery fees for seafarers working on Hong Kong ships may be covered by the legal framework established in The Merchant Shipping Act 1894 and other ordinances like those related to ship registration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894 (TRANSLATED)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The translated version of the Merchant Shipping Act 1894 includes provisions relevant to Hong Kong ships and their seafarers, as defined by various ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition of HONG KONG SHIP is provided under ORDINANCE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ordinance specifically mentions 'a Hong Kong ship' as an application context for certain provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a9118870da5f24590e5c8c51628539</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;VESSEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"HONG KONG SHIP includes any ship or vessel registered or licensed in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Seafarers work on and are employed by ships as defined under The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ships require seafarers for operation and maintenance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc7d1c0aae3b001a86a1081e8e6c52d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;MASTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ship captains (masters) manage the operations of ships as defined in relevant ordinances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ships have masters or captains who operate them, a term also used in the context of Hong Kong ships within The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc7d1c0aae3b001a86a1081e8e6c52d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING (SEAMEN) ORDINANCE (CAP. 478)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Merchant Shipping (Seamen) Ordinance defines terms related to ships, which are also relevant under The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;NAVIGATION AND HARBOURS ORDINANCE (CAP. 313)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Navigation and Harbours Ordinance defines terms related to ships, which are also relevant under The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS INVOLVING SHIPS AND SEAFARERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings can involve ships, which are defined under various maritime laws including The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894 (TRANSLATED)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The translated version of the Merchant Shipping Act 1894 includes provisions relevant to ships in general and those registered or licensed in Hong Kong, as defined by various ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;VESSEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SHIP and VESSEL are used interchangeably to refer to ships or vessels in the context of this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ship and vessel are used interchangeably in the context of maritime regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc7d1c0aae3b001a86a1081e8e6c52d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SHIPS are subject to the provisions of this Ordinance as defined by it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHIP&quot;" target="&quot;MERCHANT SHIPPING (SEAFARERS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 478)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SHIPS and SEAFARERS, including masters, are defined by the MERCHANT SHIPPING (SEAFARERS) ORDINANCE (Cap. 478)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESSEL&quot;" target="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Seafarers work on vessels as defined by The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESSEL&quot;" target="&quot;MASTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Vessels are operated by masters according to maritime laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vessels have masters or captains who operate them, a term also used in the context of Hong Kong ships within The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc7d1c0aae3b001a86a1081e8e6c52d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESSEL&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING (SEAMEN) ORDINANCE (CAP. 478)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Merchant Shipping (Seamen) Ordinance defines terms related to vessels, which are also relevant under The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESSEL&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894 (TRANSLATED)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The translated version of the Merchant Shipping Act 1894 includes provisions relevant to vessels in general and those registered or licensed in Hong Kong, as defined by various ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESSEL&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"VESSELS are also covered under the ORDINANCE, with similar definitions and applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESSEL&quot;" target="&quot;PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Vessels are a type of premises where activities and incidents related to safety might occur."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bca658a6c295daa0f1b015fffbbdfb79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESSEL&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC PLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition of VESSEL excludes it from being considered in public places for the purposes of WORKPLACE regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-126e18663d810ba6b83365ff30027a71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;" target="&quot;MASTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">19.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SEAFARER includes master, which is a specific type of seafarer as defined by the Merchant Shipping (Seafarers) Ordinance (Cap. 478)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Seafarers work under and are employed by shipmasters as defined by maritime laws like The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."&lt;SEP&gt;"Seafarers, including masters, operate ships as defined by relevant ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc7d1c0aae3b001a86a1081e8e6c52d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING (SEAMEN) ORDINANCE (CAP. 478)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Merchant Shipping (Seamen) Ordinance directly addresses seafarers, who are also covered by The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS INVOLVING SHIPS AND SEAFARERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings involving seafarers fall within the scope of maritime laws like The Merchant Shipping Act 1894 and are also covered by other ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894 (TRANSLATED)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The translated version of the Merchant Shipping Act 1894 includes provisions relevant to seafarers working on ships and vessels, as defined by various ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SEAFARERS are defined by this Ordinance and include masters as well as other seafarers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The seafarer is specifically excluded from certain provisions within the main Ordinance, highlighting their unique status under maritime law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786c67dfb1439b58fce397c3168c9e29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURTS have jurisdiction over cases involving SEAFARERS, especially when employers submit or agree to such jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49920e3fc93948bee580896f50d6da6a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG SHIPS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SEAFARERS are members of the crew of HONG KONG SHIPS as defined by relevant legislation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49920e3fc93948bee580896f50d6da6a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER&quot;" target="&quot;MERCHANT SHIPPING (SEAFARERS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 478)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This ordinance directly concerns seafarers who are not covered by the main Ordinance in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-786c67dfb1439b58fce397c3168c9e29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MASTER&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING (SEAMEN) ORDINANCE (CAP. 478)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'master' is used in the context of seafarers under The Merchant Shipping (Seamen) Ordinance, which aligns with its use in The Merchant Shipping Act 1894."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MASTER&quot;" target="&quot;THE MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894 (TRANSLATED)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The translated version of the Merchant Shipping Act 1894 includes provisions relevant to masters or ship captains operating ships and vessels, as defined by various ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fe09d9921bb58d6dfaa46f122e1840f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MASTER&quot;" target="&quot;SEAFARERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms are key personnel on a ship, with the master overseeing seafarers and their roles in compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21a9118870da5f24590e5c8c51628539</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MASTER&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Masters, a type of SEAFARER, have specific roles under the ORDINANCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4d76a0b22237a0d626c699347fd4848</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894&quot;" target="&quot;《1894年商船法令》&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'Merchant Shipping Act 1894' is the English translation of '《1894年商船法令》', indicating a direct relationship in legal context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21a9118870da5f24590e5c8c51628539</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MERCHANT SHIPPING ACT 1894&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance refers to and applies parts of the Merchant Shipping Act 1894, establishing a clear connection between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21a9118870da5f24590e5c8c51628539</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPOSITION&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation claims may involve depositions as part of legal proceedings under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21a9118870da5f24590e5c8c51628539</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPOSITION&quot;" target="&quot;TESTIMONY OF WITNESS OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'TESTIMONY OF WITNESS OUTSIDE HONG KONG' refers to a deposition that can be admitted as evidence under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8875aca5fc071476a8bdfdd21f6d729c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPOSITION&quot;" target="&quot;经营业务的人&quot;(PERSON CARRYING ON BUSINESS)">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms are related as they can both be involved in legal proceedings and evidence provision for claims involving business operations outside Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8875aca5fc071476a8bdfdd21f6d729c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MERCHANT SHIPPING (SEAFARERS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 478)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment agencies operating under a permit to maintain a crew department granted or deemed granted under the Merchant Shipping (Seafarers) Ordinance are exempt from certain regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3b8b40b208f0fb021cf679f8d096916</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF ACCIDENT AND CLAIM FOR COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;SEAFARER (海員)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The notice of accident and claim for compensation are related to the seafarer under Cap. 478, as defined by the Merchant Shipping (Seafarers) Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d21c68431de960cb287d0f1ae3444dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER (海員)&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION APPLICATION FOR SEAFARER DEATH&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The application for compensation is specifically related to a seafarer's death under Cap. 478, as defined by the Merchant Shipping (Seafarers) Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d21c68431de960cb287d0f1ae3444dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAFARER (海員)&quot;" target="&quot;SHIP LOST WITH ALL HANDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The loss of a ship with all hands affects seafarers and their compensation applications under Cap. 478, as defined by the Merchant Shipping (Seafarers) Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d21c68431de960cb287d0f1ae3444dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WITNESS EVIDENCE OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;JUDGE OR MAGISTRATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Evidence from witnesses outside Hong Kong can be accepted in legal proceedings before a judge or magistrate under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d21c68431de960cb287d0f1ae3444dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WITNESS EVIDENCE OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;BRITISH CONSUL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The British consul may provide evidence or certification for witness statements made outside Hong Kong, which could be used as evidence by judges or magistrates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d21c68431de960cb287d0f1ae3444dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TESTIMONY OF WITNESS OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;范围适用&quot;(RANGE APPLICABILITY)">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'TESTIMONY OF WITNESS OUTSIDE HONG KONG' is applicable under certain conditions, including the range of places where it can be made."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8875aca5fc071476a8bdfdd21f6d729c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUSTICE OR MAGISTRATE IN HER MAJESTY'S DOMINIONS OR IN ANY PLACE WHERE HER MAJESTY EXERCISES JURISDICTION&quot;" target="&quot;BRITISH CONSULAR OFFICER ELSEWHERE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both can certify a deposition, though the former is in Her Majesty's dominions and the latter elsewhere."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8875aca5fc071476a8bdfdd21f6d729c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BRITISH CONSULAR OFFICER ELSEWHERE&quot;" target="&quot;经营业务的人&quot;(PERSON CARRYING ON BUSINESS)">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms are related as they can be involved in certifying depositions or providing evidence for claims, though the former is a business context and the latter an official one."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8875aca5fc071476a8bdfdd21f6d729c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;外地补偿&quot;(FOREIGN COMPENSATION)" target="&quot;范围适用&quot;(RANGE APPLICABILITY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term '范围适用' refers to the applicability of foreign compensation under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8875aca5fc071476a8bdfdd21f6d729c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOREIGN COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON CARRYING ON BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Foreign Compensation is applicable when an employee from Hong Kong works outside and gets injured, especially if their employer operates within Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8308cea0d5fc5589bf46df7d1755b30d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOREIGN COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees might receive foreign compensation in addition to or instead of local compensation, depending on where and when the injury occurred."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3b44850af90a02b11f7716520e896fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 310)&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON CARRYON BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'person carrying on business' is defined in the Business Registration Ordinance (Cap. 310), which relates to entities operating within Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8308cea0d5fc5589bf46df7d1755b30d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 310)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Business Registration Ordinance (Cap. 310) is an ordinance that defines terms used within the context of business registration and operation in Hong Kong, including 'person carrying on business'. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8308cea0d5fc5589bf46df7d1755b30d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL INJURY BY ACCIDENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee can suffer personal injury by accident during employment activities, which is a key concern addressed by this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3b44850af90a02b11f7716520e896fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL DEBT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation paid under this Ordinance may be recoverable as a civil debt if there is overcompensation from foreign sources."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3b44850af90a02b11f7716520e896fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL DEBT&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority is charged with paying sums awarded under subsection (6)(e), which are enforceable as a civil debt."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT OR AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;AGEING OR SEVERE PHYSICAL DEFECTS/DISABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contracts or agreements can include provisions for handling situations where an employee is particularly vulnerable due to age or severe physical defects/disabilities, impacting their employment and safety."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3b44850af90a02b11f7716520e896fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACTING OUT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CONTRACTING OUT clause refers to agreements where an EMPLOYEE relinquishes rights to compensation from the employer for personal injury by accident arising out of and in the course of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1683d49752acaec3491f38a426aac742</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACTING OUT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CONTRACTING OUT involves reducing or giving up the right of an employee to COMPENSATION under certain conditions related to old age, serious physical defects, or infirmity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1683d49752acaec3491f38a426aac742</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACTING OUT&quot;" target="&quot;SAVING AS TO EXISTING CONTRACTS OF SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The saving clause for existing contracts of service does not apply to the contracting out terms, indicating a distinction in their applicability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-117a12d3025ead7fc5f26f4bb1ca96c5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACTING OUT&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contracting out terms can potentially affect or override provisions related to medical plans for employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-117a12d3025ead7fc5f26f4bb1ca96c5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OLD AGE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYEES are particularly liable due to their OLD AGE in terms of accidents and injuries at work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1683d49752acaec3491f38a426aac742</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERIOUS PHYSICAL DEFECTS OR INFIRMITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYEES with SERIOUS PHYSICAL DEFECTS or INFIRMITY are also considered when determining liability for accidents and compensation rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1683d49752acaec3491f38a426aac742</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner certifies agreements regarding compensation for occupational diseases to ensure fairness and reasonableness."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e00fdf9b02a058deef2e0c53efa1c4d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF WORK CAPACITY OR DEATH DUE TO OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation is determined based on the income of the employee when working for the employer who last employed them before the occurrence of loss of work capacity or death due to occupational disease."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b8bab0fa8e650dc6d58da85c05c8bf94</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF WORK CAPACITY OR DEATH DUE TO OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee may suffer from an occupational disease that leads to the loss of work capacity or death, which can result in a claim for compensation against their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b8bab0fa8e650dc6d58da85c05c8bf94</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE EMPLOYER WHO LAST EMPLOYED THE EMPLOYEE ENGAGED IN SUCH WORK BEFORE THE OCCURRENCE OF LOSS OF WORKING CAPACITY OR DEATH WITHIN A SPECIFIED PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE WHO CONTRACTED A WORK-RELATED ILLNESS OR INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The last employer of the employee engaged in such work before the occurrence of loss of working capacity or death within a specified period is directly related to the employee who contracted a work-related illness or injury, as they may be responsible for providing information and compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-65a9f0efd50c34c4817bca268994887b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE EMPLOYER CLAIMING ANOTHER EMPLOYER AS A PARTY IN LEGAL PROCEEDINGS REGARDING COMPENSATION CLAIMS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE WHO CONTRACTED A WORK-RELATED ILLNESS OR INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer claiming another employer as a party in legal proceedings regarding compensation claims is directly related to the employee who contracted a work-related illness or injury, as they may be involved in disputes over responsibility for providing compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-65a9f0efd50c34c4817bca268994887b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE WHO CONTRACTED A WORK-RELATED ILLNESS OR INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court plays a role in determining the legal responsibilities of employers regarding employees who contracted work-related illnesses or injuries, including decisions on compensation and liability sharing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-65a9f0efd50c34c4817bca268994887b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;EMERGENCY RELIEF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court has the authority to grant emergency relief measures pending arbitration determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3161c0abf732689fd0fb63c291711d64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;AWARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court may refuse to grant leave for the enforcement of any award made by an arbitral tribunal that includes a challenged arbitrator or can set aside such an award if it upholds the challenge."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0ca78018d1b3e2ef66e8091b3209bc2c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT DECISIONS ON ARBITRATOR CHALLENGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court makes decisions on arbitrator challenges, which can affect the validity of an award and the continuation of arbitration proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0ca78018d1b3e2ef66e8091b3209bc2c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court has jurisdiction over arbitral proceedings and can grant interim measures, which are ancillary to the tribunal's primary role."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6100d8c7e7c5fa3f9af262a8c8cb68f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNCITRAL Model Law provides a framework for interpreting interim measures granted by the Court in relation to arbitral proceedings outside Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6100d8c7e7c5fa3f9af262a8c8cb68f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;HIGH COURT CHIEF JUDGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The HIGH COURT CHIEF JUDGE has the authority to make rules for the better carrying out of this Division."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80fae333d21f2886ed576bdc768e41f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE WHO CONTRACTED A WORK-RELATED ILLNESS OR INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;FAMILY MEMBERS OF AN EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Family members are related to the employee who contracted a work-related illness or injury as they may be involved in legal proceedings and claims for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-65a9f0efd50c34c4817bca268994887b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE WHO CONTRACTED A WORK-RELATED ILLNESS OR INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;THE PROCESS BY WHICH AN ILLNESS DEVELOPS GRADUALLY DUE TO EXPOSURE IN A PARTICULAR TYPE OF JOB&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The process by which an illness develops gradually due to exposure in a particular type of job is directly related to the employee who contracted a work-related illness or injury, as it explains how and why they became ill."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-65a9f0efd50c34c4817bca268994887b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER WHO LAST EMPLOYED THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The last employer during the prescribed period is responsible for compensating the employee for occupational diseases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55b9afafd03eeeed71ede32974cead3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE’S EARNINGS UNDER THE EMPLOYER FROM WHOM COMPENSATION IS RECOVERABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation amounts are calculated based on the earnings from the employer who is recoverable for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55b9afafd03eeeed71ede32974cead3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;WILFUL AND INTENT TO DECEIVE REPRESENTATION IN WRITING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Wilful and intent to deceive representation in writing can affect compensation for occupational diseases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55b9afafd03eeeed71ede32974cead3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT WITHIN THE PRESCRIBED PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE GIVEN BY THE EMPLOYER TO THE EMPLOYEE OR FAMILY MEMBERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notice given by the last employer during the prescribed period pertains to employment within that period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55b9afafd03eeeed71ede32974cead3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF INCAPACITY OR DEATH&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The notice of incapacity or death pertains directly to the last employer who employed the employee during the prescribed period preceding the event."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF INCAPACITY OR DEATH&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER EMPLOYERS WHO EMPLOYED HIM IN SUCH EMPLOYMENT DURING SUCH PERIOD AS HE OR THEY MAY POSSESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The notice of incapacity or death may require information from these employers if they were the last ones to employ the employee during the prescribed period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISEASE WAS NOT CONTRACTED WHILST THE EMPLOYEE WAS IN HIS EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee's history of employment may be relevant when determining if the disease was contracted elsewhere during the prescribed period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a364dde1ed8396d855ac25cb593a8ce7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRADE, INDUSTRY OR PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nature of the EMPLOYEE's occupation is related to the TRADE, INDUSTRY or PROCESS specified in the Second Schedule for determining the PRESCRIBED PERIOD."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-338f6b52974bc08baebc662da42c4477</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A COURT may determine the date of INCAPACITY based on a medical examination by a REGISTERED DOCTOR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-338f6b52974bc08baebc662da42c4477</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered doctors can provide treatment that may involve the use of prosthetic devices or surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE HEALTH CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The REGISTERED DOCTOR, along with other registered professionals, can issue an EMPLOYEE HEALTH CERTIFICATE under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd5f66bf87b244d8c901c733042ddc26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;MIDWIFE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both are medical professionals, there is no direct relationship specified between a registered doctor and a midwife in this text. However, they may work together within a healthcare setting."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f158408c588106f3a0fd30a322902be</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL PROFESSIONAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered doctors fall under the broader category of medical professionals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF ATTENDANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered doctors are responsible for issuing certificates of attendance when conducting examinations in relation to pregnancy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;RECOGNIZED SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered doctors, as part of recognized treatment schemes, can issue necessary medical documents and certificates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED DOCTOR&quot;" target="&quot;2020年第13號第11條增補&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This amendment affects registered doctors in terms of issuing certificates for specific conditions, including those involving hospital settings and employee healthcare."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to amend the Second Schedule through orders published in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-082f06bd634567bd06a50adf127eb9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION FOR APPREHENSION OF ABSCONDING EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Second Schedule provides guidelines and procedures for issuing warrants related to the application for apprehension of an absconding employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3b75037d48822c36000fbac9c3ce438</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Second Schedule is subject to amendment by the Legislative Council as part of broader legislative processes in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3b75037d48822c36000fbac9c3ce438</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE PAY FOR LATTER PERIOD OF MATERNITY LEAVE&quot;$80,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The specific details and format changes are detailed in the Second Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6c5efdd1d212ba3c8e515e418526d4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;TIPS AND SERVICE CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance defines the term 'tips and service charges' as part of employee wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0cbd71f092df4f0f0a3f86b5141618df</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;MINOR EMPLOYMENT CLAIMS ADJUDICATION BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance refers to the Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board established under the Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board Ordinance (Cap. 453)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0cbd71f092df4f0f0a3f86b5141618df</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT and LABOUR TRIBUNAL can refer to the EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE for guidance on employee rights and protections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LABOUR TRIBUNAL uses the EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE as a reference when adjudicating claims related to employment rights and protections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY FOR A BOND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance outlines the process for a surety to be discharged from their obligation under a bond."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edaba831bd1e0154426defdca143f061</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"District Judge has jurisdiction over applications made under the Employment Ordinance, particularly regarding bonds and sureties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edaba831bd1e0154426defdca143f061</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG REGIONAL COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance is relevant in the context of proceedings that may involve Hong Kong Regional Courts, particularly regarding employer debt recovery."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edaba831bd1e0154426defdca143f061</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION FOR WARRANT FOR APPREHENSION OF ABSCONDING EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Application for a warrant to apprehend an absconding employer is made under the Employment Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edaba831bd1e0154426defdca143f061</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER DEBT RECOVERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer debt recovery is a key aspect of the Employment Ordinance, involving various procedures and applications under it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edaba831bd1e0154426defdca143f061</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance governs the rights and obligations of applicants (employees)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-67218fecb16f152219fae29882c0cc1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot; SECOND SCHEDULE, PART I, PARAGRAPH 3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance includes specific provisions in its second schedule that are relevant to employment matters and applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;GUARANTEE REQUIREMENT UNDER EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance specifies a guarantee requirement that is to be enforced by relevant authorities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-74275f2bcd7afd62cd2b27056407d1e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRE-EMPLOYMENT HEALTH CHECK REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are subject to pre-employment health checks as per the Employment Ordinance 16 of 2006 S. 19, which is a requirement for employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-28e7d6d62033f777323f252b1d52645d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATHEMATICS OF RISK ASSESSMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SOCIAL SCIENCES IN OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both social sciences and mathematics play roles in assessing risks related to occupational safety and health."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-28e7d6d62033f777323f252b1d52645d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT HISTORY&quot;" target="&quot;PRESUMPTION OF CAUSE FOR OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment history is crucial for determining the presumption of cause for occupational disease according to the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-082f06bd634567bd06a50adf127eb9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESUMPTION OF CAUSE FOR OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT FROM 1964 S.5 AND AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The presumption of cause for occupational disease is based on employment history, which includes the amendments from 1964."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-082f06bd634567bd06a50adf127eb9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-OCCUPATIONAL DISEASE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION RIGHTS FOR EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-occupational diseases do not affect compensation rights as per the text, but they are distinguished from occupational diseases which can impact such rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-082f06bd634567bd06a50adf127eb9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DEAFNESS (COMPENSATION) ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board is mentioned in relation to the Occupational Deafness (Compensation) Ordinance, indicating a connection through administrative or regulatory roles."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6577b4d90591dfe2444055a054a19ef4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DEAFNESS (COMPENSATION) ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;HEALTH署长 (DIRECTOR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director of Health is involved in the administration and interpretation of the Occupational Deafness (Compensation) Ordinance, suggesting an administrative relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6577b4d90591dfe2444055a054a19ef4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS (义制品人体器官)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board is responsible for managing issues related to prostheses, indicating a direct relationship in terms of administrative oversight."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6577b4d90591dfe2444055a054a19ef4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE (外科器具)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board oversees both prostheses and surgical appliances, indicating a related category of medical devices under the board's jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6577b4d90591dfe2444055a054a19ef4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;HEALTH署长 (DIRECTOR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director of Health appoints members of the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board, establishing a direct administrative link between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6577b4d90591dfe2444055a054a19ef4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director appoints members to form the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The board deals with prostheses as part of its responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SURVEILLANCE APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The board handles surgical appliances, which are related to prosthesis in medical context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Members of the board include registered medical practitioners."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Members of the board also include registered Chinese medicine practitioners."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-966009ce5701084bfffbbea532d598a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;INJURED EMPLOYEE(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board determines whether a prosthesis or surgical appliance required by an injured employee is necessary for him, based on the nature and extent of his injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board assesses the cost of supplying and fitting a prosthesis to an injured employee, if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESES AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board assesses the cost of supplying and fitting a surgical appliance to an injured employee, if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEALTH署长 (DIRECTOR)&quot;" target="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE (外科器具)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director of Health is involved in the administration of issues related to surgical appliances through the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board, indicating an administrative relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6577b4d90591dfe2444055a054a19ef4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS (义制品人体器官)&quot;" target="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE (外科器具)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Prostheses and Surgical Appliances are defined in the text as artificial items used for medical purposes, indicating a related category of medical devices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6577b4d90591dfe2444055a054a19ef4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE (外科器具)&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR OF HEALTH&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director of Health is responsible for defining the term 'surgical appliance' as an artificial item supporting directly or indirectly a part of the body impaired by injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-427b651b5a2a0a36734fd93776b2efbd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE (外科器具)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, under the same employment contract, employers are also responsible for providing surgical appliances to employees who have suffered work injuries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-427b651b5a2a0a36734fd93776b2efbd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR OF HEALTH&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS (義製人體器官)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director of Health is responsible for defining the term 'prosthesis' as an artificial item replacing a part of the body removed or amputated due to injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-427b651b5a2a0a36734fd93776b2efbd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS (義製人體器官)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Under an employment contract, employers have legal responsibilities towards providing prostheses for injured workers as part of their compensation package."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-427b651b5a2a0a36734fd93776b2efbd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36B&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The cost for supplying and fitting a prosthesis or surgical appliance is governed by section 36B."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cost of supplying and fitting a prosthesis or surgical appliance is covered under section 36B as part of the broader definition of compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chinese medicine practitioners might also be involved in treatments requiring prosthetic devices or surgical appliances, depending on the context of traditional and modern medical practices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHETIC DEVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Prosthetic devices are a specific type of prosthesis or surgical appliance used for medical purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Surgical appliances fall under the broader category of prostheses or surgical appliances, both being related to medical treatments and devices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-194bd276c174598edc7fcf0c6886ead7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee may require a prosthesis or surgical appliance due to personal injury caused during employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c526fd9477b77161e84c476f0017da6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER, REGISTERED DENTIST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A registered medical practitioner, Chinese medicine practitioner or dentist may provide a prosthesis or surgical appliance to an employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c526fd9477b77161e84c476f0017da6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BOARD assesses and certifies the necessity and cost related to PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Board certifies the prosthesis or surgical appliance supplied and fitted to the employee under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c526fd9477b77161e84c476f0017da6e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director can approve the supply and fitting of prostheses or surgical appliances manufactured or on sale elsewhere, not just in Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Director holds and manages funds related to prostheses or surgical appliances in disputes between employers and employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5980c15d89bdf2ef4857f80a2f6b149c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72e470440b916fe7d89e88eb4a51cf95</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHETIC ORGAN OR SURGICAL DEVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMITTEE evaluates the costs related to prosthetic organs or surgical devices, including their supply and fitting."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eea091e3d60115d9c86a868057c8f1d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED DENTIST(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Dentists may be consulted by the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board regarding the necessity of a surgical appliance for an injured employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36D&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BOARD issues certificates supporting requests under SECTION 36D which are made by the DIRECTOR for payment of costs related to prosthesis or surgical appliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-786468d759a9a7b3ea39a79ba530682c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;COST OF THE PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BOARD determines the cost of supplying and fitting the prosthesis or surgical appliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;DURABILITY OF THE PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BOARD considers the durability when assessing the necessity of a new prosthesis or surgical appliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;10 YEARS AFTER THE DATE OF ORIGINAL FITTING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BOARD evaluates the probable cost over 10 years after original fitting for certification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates issued by the BOARD are admitted in evidence without further proof in COURT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BOARD has the authority to issue notices and can require actions from the DIRECTOR as per section 36M."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;36C&quot;" target="&quot;LIMIT OF EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY TO PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 36C specifies the limit of an employer's legal responsibility to pay under Section 36B based on accidents and related costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5980c15d89bdf2ef4857f80a2f6b149c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36B&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36C&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 36C defines the limit of employer's liability to pay under SECTION 36B."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c5e2e52d53aa59764f7b51002074a7ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36B&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLYING AND FITTING PROSTHESES/SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 36B governs claims for supplying and fitting prostheses or surgical appliances, which are treated similarly to claims under SECTION 36I. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36C&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DIRECTOR can send a written request for payment according to SECTION 36C, related to the liability defined by SECTION 36B and SIXTH SCHEDULE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c5e2e52d53aa59764f7b51002074a7ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36D&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissions issue certificates supporting claims made under SECTION 36D as per their role in verifying such claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c5e2e52d53aa59764f7b51002074a7ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36D&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DIRECTOR initiates claims under SECTION 36D by serving a request on the EMPLOYER for payment of costs related to prosthesis or surgical appliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-786468d759a9a7b3ea39a79ba530682c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS/SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court determines disputes regarding the necessity or cost of prosthesis or surgical appliance supplied to an employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33fb429edfbad9e4130f4746d5db62bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS/SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;GENERAL REVENUE OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"General revenue funds the costs of prostheses and surgical appliances for injured employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e69f47e10b2e6f7fc8c8517ea228736e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;36F DISPUTES DETERMINATION BY COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court determines disputes regarding the necessity or cost of prosthesis or surgical appliance supplied to an employee and makes orders accordingly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33fb429edfbad9e4130f4746d5db62bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;36G APPLICATION TO THE COURT FOR ENFORCEMENT OR DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This application is made by the Director for enforcing claims on costs or determining disputes, involving actions of the court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33fb429edfbad9e4130f4746d5db62bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLYING AND FITTING PROSTHESES/SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Claims related to supplying and fitting prostheses/surgical appliances must be made within 5 years from the occurrence of an accident giving rise to injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e6419607ae811f4fc50b4b883814d09</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPLYING AND FITTING PROSTHESES/SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;" target="&quot;ACCIDENT GIVING RISE TO INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The accident that gives rise to injury is directly linked with the claim for supplying and fitting prostheses/surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e6419607ae811f4fc50b4b883814d09</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPLYING AND FITTING PROSTHESES/SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESES/SURGICAL APPLIANCES MAINTENANCE AND REPLACEMENT COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Maintenance and replacement costs are related to the initial supplying and fitting of prostheses/surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e6419607ae811f4fc50b4b883814d09</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPLYING AND FITTING PROSTHESES/SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;" target="&quot;1971 S. 2, AMENDED 44 OF 1980 S. 15&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legislation from 1971 and its amendment in 1980 provide the legal framework for claims related to supplying and fitting prostheses/surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e6419607ae811f4fc50b4b883814d09</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPLYING AND FITTING PROSTHESES/SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36B PROSTHETIC/SURGICAL APPLANCE SUPPLIES AND FITTINGS (TREATED UNDER SECTION 36K)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Claims for supplying and fitting prostheses or surgical appliances under SECTION 36B are treated similarly to claims made under SECTION 36I. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;36J&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY TO PAY FOR MAINTENANCE AND REPLACEMENT COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 36J specifies conditions under which an employer is liable to pay for maintenance and replacement costs of prostheses or surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e6419607ae811f4fc50b4b883814d09</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY TO PAY FOR REPAIR AND RENEWAL COSTS&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESES OR SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer's liability to pay for the cost of repair and renewal of prostheses or surgical appliances is defined in Section 36I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2324450e48323612f50ab8e4445e0eb9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36J LIMITATION ON EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESES OR SURGICAL APPLIANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 36J limits the employer's liability to pay for the cost of repair and renewal as specified in Section 36I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2324450e48323612f50ab8e4445e0eb9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36J LIMITATION ON EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;BOARD FOR ASSESSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Board assesses costs according to Section 36M(2)(c) and (3), which is referenced in the limitation on employer's liability under Section 36J."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2324450e48323612f50ab8e4445e0eb9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36J LIMITATION ON EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;SIXTH SCHEDULE SPECIFYING AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Sixth Schedule specifies the amounts that limit the employer's liability as detailed in Section 36J."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2324450e48323612f50ab8e4445e0eb9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36J&quot;" target="&quot;143,320&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amount $143,320 is specified for SECTION 36J."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-463028737c14d4a1b81570efedfe747c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36D-36H MODIFICATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36K (TREATMENT OF CLAIMS UNDER SECTION 36I)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Modifications to sections 36D-36H apply under SECTION 36K for claims made under SECTION 36I. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM UNDER SECTION 36I (NO DISPUTE ON NECESSITY)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S RESPONSIBILITY UNDER SECTION 36I (NO DISPUTE ON NECESSITY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is responsible for claims under SECTION 36I without dispute on necessity. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 76 OF 1982 S. 25&quot;" target="&quot;LAWS AND REGULATIONS UPDATES (THROUGH AMENDMENTS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments through laws like SECTION 76 of 1982 have updated the regulations governing claims under SECTION 36I and related sections. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDMENTS (L.N. 321 OF 1985; L.N. 390 OF 1987; ETC.)&quot;" target="&quot;LAWS AND REGULATIONS UPDATES (THROUGH AMENDMENTS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments like those in L.N. 321 of 1985 and L.N. 390 of 1987 have updated the laws governing claims under SECTION 36I and related sections. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36K (TREATMENT OF CLAIMS UNDER SECTION 36I)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL CLAIMS MANAGEMENT PROCESS UNDER SECTION 36K&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal process for managing claims under SECTION 36I is detailed in SECTION 36K. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36K (TREATMENT OF CLAIMS UNDER SECTION 36I)&quot;" target="&quot;MODIFICATIONS TO SECTIONS 36D-36H (APPLICABLE UNDER SECTION 36K)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Modifications to sections 36D-36H are applicable under the treatment of claims made under SECTION 36I. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR PAYMENT OF COST (SECTION 36I)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S RESPONSIBILITY UNDER SECTION 36I (NO DISPUTE ON NECESSITY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is responsible for paying the cost of claims under SECTION 36I without dispute on necessity. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S RESPONSIBILITY UNDER SECTION 36I (NO DISPUTE ON NECESSITY)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36I CLAIM FOR PAYMENT (NO DISPUTE ON NECESSITY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is responsible for paying claims under SECTION 36I without dispute on necessity. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36D-36H (MODIFICATIONS APPLICABLE TO SECTION 36K CLAIMS)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL CLAIMS MANAGEMENT PROCESS UNDER SECTION 36K&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Modifications to sections 36D-36H apply under the legal claims management process for claims made under SECTION 36I. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Modifications to sections 36D-36H are applicable under the legal claims management process for claims made under SECTION 36I. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 76 OF 1982 S. 25 (AMENDMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;LAWS AND REGULATIONS UPDATES (THROUGH AMENDMENTS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments to SECTION 76 of 1982 have updated the laws governing claims under SECTION 36I and related sections. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL CLAIMS MANAGEMENT PROCESS UNDER SECTION 36K&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36B PROSTHETIC/SURGICAL APPLANCE CLAIMS (TREATED UNDER SECTION 36K)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Claims for prosthetic or surgical appliance supplies and fittings under SECTION 36B are treated similarly to claims made under SECTION 36I. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdcbcb18d7b9887f495f81165f5fb4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36D, SECTION 36E, SECTION 36F, SECTION 36G, SECTION 36H&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36I&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 36D to 36H apply with modifications in respect of claims under section 36I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36I&quot;" target="&quot;SURCHARGE OR INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Surcharges and interests related to compensation may be calculated under section 36I as part of the broader definition of compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36I&quot;" target="&quot;PROSTHESIS AND SURGICAL APPLIANCES BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 36I applies to cases where the total amount of probable cost of normal repair and renewal of any prosthesis or surgical appliance needs assessment by the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36I&quot;" target="&quot;INJURED EMPLOYEE(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 36I is relevant to injured employees whose prostheses or surgical appliances need repair or renewal over a period of 10 years after the date of original fitting."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG GOVERNMENT GENERAL REVENUE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36L(1)(I)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The government general revenue is responsible for the cost of supplying and fitting a prosthesis or surgical appliance as per section 36B."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG GOVERNMENT GENERAL REVENUE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36L(1)(II)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The government general revenue covers normal repair and replacement costs of the prosthesis or surgical appliance for an injured employee as per section 36I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER OF LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36E(1), SECTION 36F(2), SECTION 36G&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner of Labour has the right to claim and receive funds for normal repair and replacement costs as per sections 36E, 36F, and 36G."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36L(2)(A), SECTION 36L(2)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Hospital Authority is responsible for the payment of costs related to normal repair and replacement as per sections 36E, 36F, and 36G."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6e62d63292a05cf6bb5e6be00c591105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG HOUSING SOCIETY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While not directly related to housing, the Hospital Authority might collaborate with the Society on community health initiatives or social welfare programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7a31b81a1625e550531d4c12b4182702</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE COMPANY/INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR (1993年第66號第6條增补)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In certain circumstances, the Director can sue insurance companies on behalf of injured employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e69f47e10b2e6f7fc8c8517ea228736e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IV部&quot;" target="&quot;第V部&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IV部和第V部分别定义了不同的法律条款，但都属于同一法规体系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IV部&quot;" target="&quot;1982年第76號第28條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1982 law replaced the IV part, indicating a change in legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DIRECTOR may take proceedings directly against the INSURER for a claim under this Part as if the insurer were the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8df740cc032fb332ff71c24c0e55c9c5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurer and Policy of Insurance are directly related as the insurer is responsible for policies issued to individuals or entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The insurer is involved in issuing a policy of insurance, which defines the terms and conditions for coverage."&lt;SEP&gt;"The insurer issues a policy of insurance that covers specified liabilities for the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-740adc792b975b3e69e6b1a7c25c776a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;40A. 載於保險單內的強制性資料&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An insurer is required to include the mandatory information according to Section 40A into an insurance policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8565a0dde3a6e724288267c5d06fe0dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;CHINESE LANGUAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The insurer is mentioned alongside Chinese languages, indicating a connection through legal procedures and policy terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts or tribunals can influence the actions of insurers through determinations and judgments regarding claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a384314fa98b789ae4d76d79c9eae831</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT/TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A court or tribunal may determine the amount of compensation payable to an employee, which the insurer must then cover if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ab8247f4347839df18b680f569571c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE OR OTHER PERSON HAVING A CLAIM AGAINST THE PERSON INSURED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee or other person having a claim against the person insured may take proceedings against the insurer under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-740adc792b975b3e69e6b1a7c25c776a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The holding company and its subsidiaries are covered by an insurance policy taken out by a group of companies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The insurer is responsible for covering the liabilities of subsidiaries insured under a policy taken out by a group of companies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has powers that may be hindered by insurers, as stated in subsection (4)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner is notified by insurers of any proposed increase in premiums as per regulations made by the Chief Executive in Council."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ede1afd089da6234965403cda2d41666&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa06844e99812b2f5f3eb2b64f82eb38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Executive in Council can make regulations affecting insurers through the power to issue directives."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Executive in Council has the authority to make regulations requiring insurers to notify increases in premiums to the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ede1afd089da6234965403cda2d41666&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa06844e99812b2f5f3eb2b64f82eb38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURED EMPLOYEE(S)&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH OFFICER(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational Health Officers are involved in assessing whether prostheses or surgical appliances are needed for injured employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Medical Practitioners may be consulted by the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board regarding the necessity of a prosthesis for an injured employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROSTHESIS&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chinese Medicine Practitioners may be consulted by the Prostheses and Surgical Appliances Board regarding the necessity of a prosthesis for an injured employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-38b1c51d4d144335e7ee22a31484c537</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COST OF THE PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DIRECTOR receives certificates regarding the cost of supplying and fitting prosthesis or surgical appliance from the BOARD."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;36M条的施行而出席&quot;" target="&quot;委員會&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 委員會 can notify an employee to attend for purposes of section 36M, similar to other notifications under the same conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;委員會&quot;" target="&quot;受傷僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 受傷僱員 may be required by the 委員會 to attend and accept inquiries or assessments for purposes of section 36M."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a2bf80964aaaae8baf6e4ab980412a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPLY AND FITTING OF PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;NORMAL REPAIR AND RENEWAL OF PROSTHESIS OR SURGICAL APPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both activities are related to the maintenance and provision of prostheses or surgical appliances for INJURED EMPLOYEES."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 24&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A CLAIMANT has until the period specified in SECTION 24 to initiate new ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS after withdrawing previous ones."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 31&quot;" target="&quot;LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 31 is part of the broader LEGISLATION that defines offenses and penalties for employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cbf72b50ae34f7ab9f1b18ab52fd7f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第24条员工权利适用范围&quot;" target="&quot;根据本部就供应和装配义製人體器官或外科器具的费用及对该等义製人體器官或外科器具作维修和更换的费用提出的申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claims for the supply and fitting of prostheses or surgical appliances are related to employee rights under section 24."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第36N条文适用范围&quot;" target="&quot;根据本部就供应和装配义製人體器官或外科器具的费用及对该等义製人體器官或外科器具作维修和更换的费用提出的申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claims for the supply and fitting of prostheses or surgical appliances are covered under section 36N."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第24条和31条的结合适用范围&quot;" target="&quot;根据本部就供应和装配义製人體器官或外科器具的费用及对该等义製人體器官或外科器具作维修和更换的费用提出的申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claims are applicable under the combined scope of sections 24 and 31."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;署长采取的步骤&quot;" target="&quot;24或31条的结合适用范围&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The steps taken by the Director (署长) apply to both section 24 or 31, as combined in their application scope."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;署长采取的步骤&quot;" target="&quot;根据本部就供应和装配义製人體器官或外科器具的费用及对该等义製人體器官或外科器具作维修和更换的费用提出的申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director's steps are related to the claims for supply and fitting of prostheses or surgical appliances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;署长采取的步骤&quot;" target="&quot;根据第36B条向受傷僱員供應和裝配義製人體器官或外科器具;及根据第36I條對該義製人體器官或外科器具作正常維修和更換。&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director's steps include the supply and fitting of prostheses or surgical appliances under section 36B, as well as their normal repair and renewal under section 36I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;署长采取的步骤&quot;" target="&quot;根据第24条僱員所具有的权&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director's steps are related to the rights of employees under section 24, which may include supply and fitting activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-607cc87ad2d00618b2e8b6ad160e563d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPULSORY INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;THE COMPANY (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compulsory insurance provisions may indirectly relate to the operations of companies as defined in THE COMPANY (CAP. 622), though no direct relationship is explicitly stated in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf8f4dc35687742a08f334ea70c92fd9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPULSORY INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director, who has rights vested under certain sections, may be involved with compulsory insurance claims as per the context of the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf8f4dc35687742a08f334ea70c92fd9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART IV&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director's rights are mentioned in relation to PART IV of the document, indicating their involvement with this part."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf8f4dc35687742a08f334ea70c92fd9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART IV&quot;" target="&quot;CONSEQUENTIAL AND OTHER AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part IV and consequential amendments are related as they both pertain to sections or parts of a larger legislative framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-938a5862de0ab4ab87d0bfde97f7d287</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMPANY (CAP. 622)&quot;" target="&quot;E.R. 1 OF 2014&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"E.R. 1 OF 2014 indicates that THE COMPANY (CAP. 622) has been amended, suggesting a connection through legal changes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf8f4dc35687742a08f334ea70c92fd9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;GROUP OF COMPANIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'company' is defined in the Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622) and applies to a group of companies, indicating an inclusive relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2fae8b17287c09754a8180334dba81fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A company can be a subsidiary, as defined by the Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622). "&lt;SEP&gt;"A subsidiary has its meaning under section 15 of the Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), which is related to company definitions and thus indirectly relates to companies in general."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d06ee4edd39803f9b252b767c726ef91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fae8b17287c09754a8180334dba81fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR, MANAGER, SECRETARY OR OTHER SIMILAR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A company's offense can be attributed to the neglect of a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-feeece6356508f661dcb4d399a15acfe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;PARTNER IN THE FIRM OR ANY PERSON CONCERNED IN ITS MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A company's offense can also be attributable to any partner in the firm or person concerned in its management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-feeece6356508f661dcb4d399a15acfe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;RELATED COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Under SECTION 32E(1), a company and its related companies can be considered interchangeable when discussing contract renewals or re-employment offers, highlighting the interconnected nature of business entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bab69b3c78835240d5782d563ec35c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDIARY COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'company' includes its subsidiary companies as defined in The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), indicating a relationship where the parent company and its subsidiaries are considered associated entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;ASSOCIATED COMPANIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Companies that have one another as subsidiaries or are both subsidiaries of a third party are deemed to be associated companies, according to The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622). This relationship is crucial for understanding the legal implications in employment contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;THE COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'company' is defined in the context of The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), providing a legal framework for understanding company relationships and their implications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION FOR LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A company can apply for a license to operate an employment agency, subject to certain conditions and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fa5fcead28ed6dc73acdd53533256cb4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A company can be issued a license or certificate of exemption by the LICENSEE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A company may receive a certificate of exemption, which is related to licensing procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;SUMMONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A summons concerning a company can be served by leaving it at, or sending it to the registered office of the company via registered post."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad2c9fb7be1050f82eb2460f4de56e54</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUP OF COMPANIES&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'group of companies' includes subsidiaries, as defined under the Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2fae8b17287c09754a8180334dba81fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUP OF COMPANIES&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY GROUP DEFINED BY SECTION 2(1) OF THE COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Group of companies is legally defined in this manner according to the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUP OF COMPANIES&quot;" target="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A group of companies can take out a policy of insurance that covers the liabilities of all specified entities within the group."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUP OF COMPANIES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All companies in the group of companies insured under SUBSECTION (1C) shall be regarded as having complied with SUBSECTION (1), affecting employee's employment liability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37d1a5d83703c47f3bc06048ecc6e08a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY WITH MEANING GIVEN BY SECTION 15 OF THE COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsidiary has a specific legal definition as per the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A holding company owns a subsidiary, which means the subsidiary operates under its control and management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2fbd733817e8b83d49f91e4a4cbe908</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S EMPLOYER BEING A SUBSIDIARY OF A HOLDING COMPANY WHICH IS ALSO INSURED UNDER THE POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee's employer is a subsidiary of the holding company, and both are insured under the same policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While not directly related in text, both concepts can be managed by parent companies through subsidiary structures; death impacts employment and company operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d06ee4edd39803f9b252b767c726ef91</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY (公司)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'construction work' is defined in the context without direct relationship to 'company', but both terms are relevant within company operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eccadbd7c68a667581159c35e652034</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY (公司)&quot;" target="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES (住宅處所)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Companies can own or manage domestic premises as part of their property portfolio."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eccadbd7c68a667581159c35e652034</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY (公司)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDIARY (附屬公司)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A company can have a subsidiary as defined by the Companies Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2adc43ad09777ee724aaeaf83575ad0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY (公司)&quot;" target="&quot;ASSOCIATED COMPANIES (相聯公司)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Companies are associated if one is a subsidiary of the other or both are subsidiaries of a third party, according to legal definition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2adc43ad09777ee724aaeaf83575ad0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY (公司)&quot;" target="&quot;ASSOCIATED COMPANIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'associated companies' is defined based on the relationship between a company and its subsidiary, as well as their common parent company."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2351949864b29078618f803ef4d2c6cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY (公司)&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANIES ORDINANCE (第622章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'company' in the Companies Ordinance defines legal entities that are subject to its provisions, including associated companies and subsidiaries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2351949864b29078618f803ef4d2c6cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY (公司)&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR, MANAGER, SECRETARY OR OTHER SIMILAR OFFICER (董事、經理、秘書或其他類似職員)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These roles are typically held by individuals within a company structure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY (公司)&quot;" target="&quot;PARTNERSHIP (合夥)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Companies and partnerships are both types of business entities governed by similar regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY (控權公司)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A holding company might be involved in construction projects, thus relating through business activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eccadbd7c68a667581159c35e652034</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIFTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;WORKS SPECIFIED IN THE FIFTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The works mentioned are defined by the content of the Fifth Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIFTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;APPENDIX OR SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appendix or schedule is a part of the Fifth Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIFTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 40(1B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 40(1B) is covered in detail under the Fifth Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;PREMISES USED EXCLUSIVELY FOR RESIDENTIAL PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Domestic premises refer to specific types of premises as described."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;ANNOYANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Annoyance could be relevant to DOMESTIC PREMISES if the noise from construction affects residential areas."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC PLACES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Domestic Premises and Public Places are mentioned as sources of noise under the regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both domestic premises and public places are mentioned in the text where noise regulations apply, indicating a broader scope of application for these rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce50382ff024b176dc7ebf19fb5b68d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE AT NIGHT OR ON A GENERAL HOLIDAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The text specifies that noise in domestic premises is regulated during holidays and nighttime hours."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC PLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both DOMESTIC PREMISES and PUBLIC PLACE are locations where noise-related activities can occur."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;MUSICAL INSTRUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DOMESTIC PREMISES allow the operation of MUSICAL INSTRUMENTs, such as record or cassette players."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;LOUD-SPEAKER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DOMESTIC PREMISES permit the use of LOUD-SPEAKERS for sound amplification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;GAME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Activities like playing games can take place in DOMESTIC PREMISES, potentially causing noise annoyance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;TRADE OR BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Carrying on a trade or business is an activity that could occur in DOMESTIC PREMISES and might generate noise."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a0b3234913f2437002d1d69a535cc59</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES" are not issued for DOMESTIC PREMISES, as they are excluded in the definition of places where noise may be a source of annoyance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AUTHORIZED OFFICERS have the power to enter and search DOMESTIC PREMISES under certain conditions, including suspicion of offenses or presence of evidence related to offenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4c7d7ad99b2b6121e30cb678dc647a4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;MAGISTRATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A MAGISTRATE issues warrants allowing entry into DOMESTIC PREMISES by AUTHORIZED OFFICERS when there is suspicion of offenses or evidence thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"A magistrate may issue a warrant to enter domestic premises if there is evidence of an offence under this Part."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7d7ad99b2b6121e30cb678dc647a4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DOMESTIC PREMISES are subject to inspections and searches conducted under the authority of ORDINANCES, particularly when offenses or evidence thereof are suspected."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4c7d7ad99b2b6121e30cb678dc647a4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;IDENTITY CARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Identity cards may not typically be used in domestic premises, but they are relevant when discussing occupiers' responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e2a533c6d1827b9ef6feae269cab454</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts may be involved in cases related to domestic premises as they are part of legal interpretations and rulings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7249fad978915b4915d01ecac03019f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;DANGEROUS OCCURRENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Dangerous occurrences can occur on domestic premises, which might lead to court interventions or regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7249fad978915b4915d01ecac03019f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY WITH MEANING GIVEN BY SECTION 13 OF THE COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Holding company has a specific legal definition as per the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION OR DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A holding company is legally responsible for the compensation or damages paid by its subsidiary when an employee is injured at work, as long as certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2fbd733817e8b83d49f91e4a4cbe908</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;A POLICY OF INSURANCE TAKEN OUT BY A GROUP OF COMPANIES PURSUANT TO SECTION 40(1C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The policy taken out by a group of companies covers the holding company and its subsidiaries, making them liable for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE ISSUED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY COVERING EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY TO PAY COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This type of policy is specifically defined in relation to employment injuries and deaths."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE ISSUED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART&quot;" target="&quot;INSURER'S LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Insurer's Liability is limited by the available amount covered by the policy of insurance issued for this part."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-10132a194a7ccd2dae34efb474098db1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVAILABLE AMOUNT COVERED BY THE POLICY OF INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;AMOUNT AFTER DEDUCTION OF INSURER'S PAYMENTS UNDER THE SAME EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The available coverage is calculated based on this defined method."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL DEFINITIONS OF COMPANY-RELATED TERMS LIKE GROUP OF COMPANIES, HOLDING COMPANY, SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Companies Ordinance provides the specific legal meanings used in this context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b577aefb31326e0dd35b3e4acfd2057</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STATE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 4 specifically excludes employment by or under the State from its application, indicating a clear relationship with STATE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f93037749b5c82c21a4dffe24495861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STATE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPETENT COURT OF THIS STATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A competent court of this State is within the jurisdiction of the state and can provide necessary legal support for arbitration proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-375bde2b853ea690587e97e345bd3671</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STATE&quot;" target="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A State can adopt fewer circumstances in which enforcement may be refused according to the conditions set forth in article 17I, but this would not contradict harmonization goals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e279133cb6f847782cd0ab6a19c0d64f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Executive in Council can issue Gazette notices to exempt employments from certain sections, showing a direct relationship through the process of regulation and amendment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f93037749b5c82c21a4dffe24495861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner is subject to the authority of the Chief Executive in Council who can make regulations regarding insurance matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ede1afd089da6234965403cda2d41666</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;35. EXEMPTIONS FROM PROVISIONS OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL can publish an order to exempt areas, places, premises or activities from the Ordinance provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7a153c57e6b577c1b46cd329273673a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;LICENCES AND CERTIFICATES OF EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Executive in Council has the power to make regulations regarding Licences and Certificates of Exemption, including their issue, renewal, fees, and procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b820d3fdcb65775124275159131a823e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations pertain to Employment Agencies as they are entities that may be licensed or exempted by the Chief Executive in Council."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b820d3fdcb65775124275159131a823e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;PLACE OF BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The regulations include procedures for changes in the Place of Business of an employment agency, indicating a direct relationship with this entity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b820d3fdcb65775124275159131a823e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE IN COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Executive in Council has the authority to make regulations concerning employment at any location."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d32c74af47d4bd7932dd3de0fb1f8ae1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPENDIX 4&quot;" target="&quot;MATHEMATICS (APPLICABLE AMOUNTS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appendix 4 specifies applicable amounts which are related to mathematical calculations for insurance policies and employment law liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f93037749b5c82c21a4dffe24495861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1995 YEAR 47 AMENDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;2000 YEAR 56 AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both amendments modify the original sections, showing a relationship through legislative changes over time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f93037749b5c82c21a4dffe24495861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;28 OF 2012 AMENDMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;E.R. 1 OF 2018 AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These amendments are related as they both represent updates or modifications to the original sections, indicating a relationship through legislative processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2f93037749b5c82c21a4dffe24495861</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EFFECTIVE INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The effective insurance policy must cover an amount not less than the specified amount in Schedule 4 to comply with legal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdcb847cbe822aecbab442ce9430887f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EFFECTIVE INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"There is no requirement for coverage of damages awarded by courts outside Hong Kong under an effective insurance policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdcb847cbe822aecbab442ce9430887f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY ISSUED BY INSURER&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Company group can obtain an insurance policy issued by the insurer to cover their legal liabilities and those of affiliated entities, with coverage not less than the specified amount in Schedule 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdcb847cbe822aecbab442ce9430887f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY GROUP&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Control Company within a company group may be held legally responsible under certain circumstances regarding employee injuries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-740adc792b975b3e69e6b1a7c25c776a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;事故&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"多於1名僱員的喪失工作能力或死亡可歸因於一個並非由某宗突發及可識別的事故所引起的因由,則視為各別事故所導致。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-269d623b6606eba8ac3002fec6213eae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;事故&quot;" target="&quot;地點&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"與總承判商所承擔的建造工作在多少個地點進行無關，但可能涉及多個地點發生事故的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-269d623b6606eba8ac3002fec6213eae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S CRIME&quot;" target="&quot;PENALTY FOR NON-PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer's crime of non-payment is defined and penalized with a fine and imprisonment if convicted."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S CRIME&quot;" target="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-EMPLOYMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer's crime can involve not complying with re-employment orders, leading to further legal consequences including fines and compensation dates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal amendments have been made to the fourth schedule over time, indicating its importance in policy updates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ba7e2407b8844aba128e42ffefa2f5d5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;L.N. 98 OF 2003&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"L.N. 98 of 2003 is the legislative basis for the Fourth Schedule which defines minimum insurance cover."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 40(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule details the minimum insurance cover for Section 40(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 40(1B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule also covers Section 40(1B), detailing related provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 40(1C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, the Fourth Schedule includes details for Section 40(1C)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE COUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee count is a key factor defined by the Fourth Schedule for determining insurance coverage under Section 40(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;EVENT COVERAGE AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule defines event coverage amounts for different scenarios under Section 40(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGISLATIVE NOTICE (L.N.) SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule operates within the legislative notice system as indicated by L.N. 98 OF 2003 and others."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction works are a context for which insurance coverages are defined by the Fourth Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule's provisions are relevant to the construction industry, which it aims to regulate through insurance coverages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule itself is a legal document defining insurance coverages for construction works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGISLATIVE UPDATE MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule operates within a legislative update mechanism, reflecting changes over time such as those noted by L.N. 25 OF 2018 and E.R. 1 OF 2018."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE SAFETY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction site safety is a context for which insurance coverages under Section 40(1) operate, ensuring safe working conditions through regulation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION ENGINEERING WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule's provisions apply to various types of construction engineering works, including those covered under Section 40(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;L.N. 25 OF 2018&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"L.N. 25 of 2018 introduces changes to the Fourth Schedule, affecting its provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule includes provisions for amendments, reflecting legislative changes as noted by L.N. 25 OF 2018 and others."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;L.N. 209 OF 2025&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"L.N. 209 of 2025 introduces further amendments to the Fourth Schedule, continuing its evolution over time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb529b0707db1b4e516f08ed3339967d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;第72(1)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule and [第72(1)條] are both part of the legislation, indicating a relationship in terms of their inclusion within the same document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da53ed52a17c537de0b1301ebe9c9aa8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POLICY OF INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner requires the production of policies of insurance as specified in the notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bfb4e2ef783a3573d88736c7ce485115</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT (意外)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An accident or series of accidents arising out of one event can lead to incapacities or deaths of employees, which are covered under the policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCIDENT (意外)&quot;" target="&quot;INCAPACITIES OR DEATHS OF MORE THAN ONE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accidents can lead to multiple incapacities or deaths among employees, which are covered under the policy of insurance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCAPACITIES OR DEATHS OF MORE THAN ONE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;SUDDEN AND IDENTIFIABLE EVENT (突發可識別事件)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Multiple incapacities or deaths can be considered a single accident if they arise from a sudden and identifiable event."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 30B&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 30B refers to specific employee liabilities that may not require additional insurance coverage outside Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFINITION OF THE AVAILABLE AMOUNT COVERED BY THE POLICY OF INSURANCE (可得的保險單承保款額)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 38&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 38 provides the definition of the available amount covered by the policy, which is crucial for understanding liability limits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 38&quot;" target="&quot;BANKRUPTCY ORDINANCE (CAP. 6)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 38 of the Bankruptcy Ordinance defines conditions under which holiday pay, annual leave pay, end-of-year payment, maternity leave pay, paternity leave pay or sickness allowance should be considered wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 38&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 17C&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 17C mentions that its provisions do not constitute a final arbitration award, as noted in Section 38."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-74be062ba4c04dd5b51c11f6d66083c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 38&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 17D&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 38 provides context for Section 17D, which deals with modifications, suspensions, and terminations of interim measures or preliminary orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a8aef97985d67c64a247cd4ac0838cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOR THE AVOIDANCE OF DOUBT (為免存疑)&quot;" target="&quot;IT IS DECLARED THAT (宣布如下)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"For the avoidance of doubt, it is declared that certain provisions apply to specific scenarios in insurance policies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-09e282cd999f281d4422d40832df059c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (1B) excludes certain terminations covered by subsection (1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b944c917df94b8aea60532ac3450cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B)&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This subsection specifies conditions under which the termination does not apply to the provisions in subsection (1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b944c917df94b8aea60532ac3450cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE TERMINATION BY EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (1B) covers specific scenarios where an employee's contract is terminated, excluding certain terminations. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b944c917df94b8aea60532ac3450cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B)&quot;" target="&quot;PROVISIONS OF SUBSECTION (1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The provisions in subsection (1)(a) do not apply when the conditions specified in subsection (1B) are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b944c917df94b8aea60532ac3450cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE PROBATION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (1B) considers the employee's probation period, if any, before applying its provisions. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b944c917df94b8aea60532ac3450cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1B)&quot;" target="&quot;END OF YEAR PAYMENT CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (1B) affects how end-of-year payments are calculated for employees whose contracts terminate under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12b944c917df94b8aea60532ac3450cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1C)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER WHO TERMINATES CONTINUOUS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT OF A PREGNANT EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (1C) excludes the application of Subsection (1)(b) in civil proceedings, thus affecting how employers can terminate contracts during such cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5d10f3a9af779ebd8f5d93a83026e213</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AN EMPLOYER WHO CONTRAVENES SUBSECTION (1)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 6 AND TO IMPRISONMENT FOR 2 YEARS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employer who contravenes Subsection (1) is liable to a fine at level 6 and imprisonment for two years."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8565a0dde3a6e724288267c5d06fe0dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;41(1)&quot;" target="&quot;PARAGRAPHS (A) TO (G) OF SECTION 41(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Paragraphs (a) to (g) of Subsection (1) specify the mandatory information that must be included in an insurance policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8565a0dde3a6e724288267c5d06fe0dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner specifies the form for displaying notices, which are required to be shown by employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are employed on premises where notices must be displayed according to policies issued by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Intruder Alarm System is installed in, over, under or in the vicinity of any Premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db5cb02beaa944fb9a1df344fab4d2a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;ACTIVITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Activities take place within premises, which could include workplaces and other locations where injuries might occur."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bca658a6c295daa0f1b015fffbbdfb79</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;IMPROVEMENT NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An IMPROVEMENT NOTICE can be served on PREMISES, indicating a specific location where actions are required."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-46d0d7db59a8dee1e09d7d4424293375</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;PLANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PLANT can be found within PREMISES and includes various equipment relevant to the location's operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-46d0d7db59a8dee1e09d7d4424293375</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC PLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PUBLIC PLACE is included under PREMISES and can be any public street, pier, or garden among other locations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-46d0d7db59a8dee1e09d7d4424293375</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPIER OF PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The OCCUPIER OF PREMISES controls or has responsibility over the PREMISES where employees work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a215b7541a9d5eb966c5aa9ffed5374</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;PLANT OR SUBSTANCES KEPT AT PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Premises should be safe and without risks to health, including any plant or substances kept there."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;SUSPENSION NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Suspension Notices are issued in relation to specific Premises where there is an imminent risk of death or serious bodily injury."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fbb962605c6a7e5085bf69519da702fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE SAFETY RISK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Workplace Safety Risks are identified in relation to specific Premises where activities or conditions pose imminent risks."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fbb962605c6a7e5085bf69519da702fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">31.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Occupational Safety Officer can enter premises under certain conditions as outlined in the directive."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Occupational Safety Officer may enter and inspect premises if they believe on reasonable grounds that the premises are being used as a workplace or where there is a contravention of this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"An occupational safety officer can enter premises under section 22 to conduct various activities related to safety and health inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The occupational safety officer is concerned with the condition and use of specific premises as potential workplaces."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3282c20ec28d4bb14aec7fe4e4eafbe8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c1ae5b0a8aff1b3116e95deba9e3ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d2094275e74c7538edf07aca95a54a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fab369635d3856df5fe750567a820e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY DIRECTIVE 22&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The directive provides rules for entering and securing unoccupied premises by an Occupational Safety Officer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98d2094275e74c7538edf07aca95a54a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE OF THE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;DATES OF COMMENCEMENT AND EXPIRY OF THE PERIOD OF INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date of issue of the policy is related to the dates when insurance coverage begins and ends, as specified in the policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DATE OF ISSUE OF THE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;POLICY NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both policy number and date of issue are mentioned together, indicating a direct relationship in terms of when an insurance policy is issued."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DATES OF COMMENCEMENT AND EXPIRY OF THE PERIOD OF INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES INSURED UNDER THE POLICY AT THE TIME OF ISSUE THEREOF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The dates of commencement and expiry are related to the employees insured under a specific policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLE DEFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;CRIMES AND PENALTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers who lack a reasonable defence for non-compliance with policy requirements may face criminal charges and penalties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;30B条所提述而又在香港以外执行工作的僱員&quot;" target="&quot;第47号法令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 47th Ordinance applies to employees mentioned in the 30B clause who work outside Hong Kong, affecting their insurance coverage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;家庭傭工&quot;" target="&quot;第66号法令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 66th Regulation specifically addresses domestic workers and affects their insurance requirements under policies issued by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第47号法令&quot;" target="&quot;第52号法令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Ordinances are part of a series of amendments, with the 52nd Law making further provisions regarding reasonable defence for employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第3级罚款&quot;" target="&quot;第5级罚款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The penalties increase from third-level to fifth-level fines as specified in different laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04f9381ba412450dd157e86dc940f7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第5级罚款&quot;" target="&quot;SIN行&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of '罪行' is directly linked to '第5级罚款', as it describes offenses that can result in a fine of the 5th level."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47f5ddfc5b519fcf524c4d9bd233c4e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第5级罚款&quot;" target="&quot;连续五年合同&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据连续五年合同，雇主未在规定时间内支付长期服务金将构成犯罪并面临第5级罚款。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a3ec4e0b16148270927aaef6bc6cb14</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMOUNT OF THE LIABILITY INSURED UNDER THE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;DOMESTIC SERVANTS EMPLOYED IN, OR IN CONNECTION WITH, THE PRIVATE HOUSEHOLD OF THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amount of liability is related to domestic servants employed by the employer under an insurance policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1995年第47號第7條修訂&quot;" target="&quot;1995年第47號第7條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The text mentions both phrases together, suggesting they are related in terms of legal revisions or amendments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;36LA OR 44条进行的法律程序中&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fine at level 3 is mentioned within the context of legal procedures involving sections 36LA and 44, indicating a direct relationship in terms of penalties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance prescribes a fine at level 3 for the specified offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR MAGISTRATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A court or magistrate may impose a fine at level 3 on the employer upon conviction for the specified offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;1980年第44章第15條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 15 of Chapter 44 from 1980 amends the fine level to be applied under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine at level 3 is a punishment for contraventions of the regulations made thereunder."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;OWNER, TENANT, OCCUPIER OR PERSON IN CHARGE OF DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The owner, tenant, occupier, or person in charge of domestic premises can be fined at level 3 if they permit noise that is a source of annoyance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO MAKES NOISE DUE TO ACTIVITIES SUCH AS PLAYING OR OPERATING MUSICAL INSTRUMENTS, USING AMPLIFICATION DEVICES, ETC.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Any person making noise due to activities such as playing or operating musical instruments using amplification devices can be fined at level 3."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;WRITTEN STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYER who fails without reasonable excuse to comply with the requirement for a written statement can be fined at level 3."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d94d21b562915559fff6272dbbdb3b70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (4)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine at level 3 is specified as the penalty for a second or subsequent conviction in subsection (4)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a3bfa1b02f074277b3b1a27f3afcb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;1965 C. 62 S. 18 U.K.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine at level 3 is derived from the corresponding provision in UK legislation, section 18 of chapter 62 of 1965. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a3bfa1b02f074277b3b1a27f3afcb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 41F(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under SECTION 41F(1) can result in a fine at level 3 as per the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 49A&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under SECTION 49A can result in a fine at level 3 as per the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;不合理的借口&quot;" target="&quot;提供任何虚假或误导性信息的雇主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Unreasonable excuses are related to providing false or misleading information by an employer, indicating a direct relationship between them and potential legal consequences."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f9b169ef4b1de04369879d234076f1c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURER'S LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36LA OR 44&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurer's liability applies in proceedings under Section 36LA or 44, concerning employer's legal responsibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-10132a194a7ccd2dae34efb474098db1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Insurance Company can be joined as a party in legal proceedings initiated by the Court or Tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ff7a7ad14c10761bcb15431ef57d8f8f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;LAWYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lawyers may communicate information to courts or other judicial authorities in legal proceedings, which can take place in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4158bcd358cce62e9937de8896e1ba0b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;THE INSURANCE ORDINANCE (CAP. 41)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance companies are mentioned as one of the entities that can receive disclosed data under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON INSURED&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee or other person having a claim against the person insured must also commence proceedings against the person insured before proceeding against the insurer unless specific conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f50ffa55ee49cc2d1e6b1641b82f27dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 42&quot;" target="&quot;DISCLAIM LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 42 provides an exception where certain conditions are met, allowing a claimant to bypass proceedings against the person insured and go directly to the insurer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f50ffa55ee49cc2d1e6b1641b82f27dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTROL COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDIARY COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Control Company may be responsible for the legal liabilities of a subsidiary company regarding employee injuries under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-740adc792b975b3e69e6b1a7c25c776a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;ASSOCIATED COMPANIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A subsidiary company and its parent or other subsidiaries of a common third party are considered associated companies, as defined by The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;THE EMPLOYER (COMPANY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer can be a company that includes its subsidiary in the context of employment contracts and renewals under certain sections, as per The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;THE COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'subsidiary' is defined in the context of The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), providing a legal framework for understanding subsidiary relationships and their implications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION OR DAMAGES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee may be entitled to compensation or damages if they are injured during their employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2fbd733817e8b83d49f91e4a4cbe908</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION OR DAMAGES&quot;" target="&quot;40(1C) CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Clause 40(1C) outlines the conditions under which a holding company is responsible for compensation or damages paid by its subsidiary to an injured employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2fbd733817e8b83d49f91e4a4cbe908</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSPECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;INSPECTOR'S AUTHORIZATION DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The authorization document allows an inspector to enter and inspect non-residential premises without a warrant."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSPECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Inspectors are taken to be appointed as Occupational Safety Officers immediately before the commencement, according to the Commissioner's authority under Section 19 of the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3c3394a6b72977677a8a437b4151b9d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-RESIDENTIAL PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER OF AN EMPLOYEE WHO IS EMPLOYED BY A SUBSIDIARY INSURED UNDER A POLICY OF INSURANCE TAKEN OUT BY A GROUP OF COMPANIES PURSUANT TO SECTION 40(1C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer of an employee insured under the policy is responsible for ensuring compliance with regulations within non-residential premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECORD OR DOCUMENT RELATED TO EMPLOYEES' COMPLIANCE WITH REGULATIONS WITHIN NON-RESIDENTIAL PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;MANAGEMENT OF A NON-RESIDENTIAL PREMISE OR ITS APPARENT MANAGER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Managers or apparent managers of non-residential premises are responsible for maintaining records related to employees' compliance with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c766b49f034ebbb22f19aa37de351708</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPUTY COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner includes the Deputy Commissioner for Labour as a person authorized to act on his behalf."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner may designate a deputy commissioner for labour to conduct formal inquiries into workplace accidents or dangerous occurrences on his behalf."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Deputy Commissioner for Labour is a subordinate of the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1dbb46e60da08be769a0481277a08538&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPUTY COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;ASSISTANT COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Assistant Commissioner for Labour reports to the Deputy Commissioner for Labour."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Deputy Commissioner for Labour includes the Assistant Commissioner for Labour as a subordinate within his authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPUTY COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"As a Deputy Commissioner for Labour, this role is part of the broader Labour Department's functions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPUTY COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Deputy Commissioner for Labour may be involved in the inspection process of residential premises under Commissioner's authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPUTY COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;INSPECTION AND EXAMINATION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Deputy Commissioner may be involved in inspection and examination events related to residential premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPUTY COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;FORMAL INQUIRY INTO WORKPLACE ACCIDENT OR DANGEROUS OCCURRENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Deputy Commissioner for Labour can be designated by the Commissioner to conduct formal inquiries into workplace accidents or dangerous occurrences."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Deputy Commissioner for Labour can conduct formal inquiries and has the authority to direct witnesses' attendance, similar to civil proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1dbb46e60da08be769a0481277a08538</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPUTY COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;CIVIL PROCEEDINGS BEFORE A COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Deputy Commissioner for Labour conducting an inquiry has similar powers as witnesses in civil proceedings, such as the ability to receive relevant evidence and examine parties on oath."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1dbb46e60da08be769a0481277a08538</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSISTANT COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Assistant Commissioner for Labour is also a subordinate of the Commissioner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner also includes the Assistant Commissioner for Labour as a person authorized to act on his behalf."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSISTANT COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Assistant Commissioner for Labour works within the Labour Department to enforce labour regulations and conduct inspections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSISTANT COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY, COVER NOTE OR OTHER DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Assistant Commissioner can also require production and inspection of insurance documents during inspections as per Section 45A."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSISTANT COMMISSIONER FOR LABOUR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 40 OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Assistant Commissioner can investigate offenses under Section 40 as per the authority of the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">64.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner advises the Labour Department, providing expertise in necessary areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner authorizes Labour Department officers to conduct prosecutions under section 43P, indicating a relationship between the two entities in terms of legal authority and administrative functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner authorizes Labour Department officers to conduct prosecutions under this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the authority to grant exemptions and keep a public register at the head office of the Labour Department."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner is part of the Labour Department, overseeing various operations and inspections related to labour regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner is required to make available at the head office of the Labour Department for public inspection all workplace codes of practice without charge."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner operates within the LABOUR DEPARTMENT and has authority over codes of practice."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Labour Department operates under the authority of the Commissioner, particularly in matters related to prosecution as indicated by '處長在根據第(1)款同意提出檢控前,須先聆聽被指稱犯罪的人的陳詞', showing an inter-agency relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de69b2333ff7d9bb2dd79e072a634503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b297641c5fc96a9b02649fb896184fdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1833f1af069fda07edd900b2ad5d51e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fd592d376d0854e1e9f902478b9ced3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb3c1a7d6211fc1cac75a7aeaaff11f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbbb4670a77162b48a5d0767257af240</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE CODES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Workplace codes are issued by the Labour Department and may include approved occupational safety or health guidelines, standards, rules, specifications, or provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fabbc3eeb929a4a143a6817fd7b457aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE CODES OF PRACTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LABOUR DEPARTMENT is responsible for issuing and maintaining workplace codes of practice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1833f1af069fda07edd900b2ad5d51e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Labour Department is where public can inspect workplace codes of practice made available by the Commissioner through publication in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fbbb4670a77162b48a5d0767257af240</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;HEAD OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The head office of the Labour Department is where the register of exemptions must be kept and made available for public inspection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2fd592d376d0854e1e9f902478b9ced3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONDITIONS OF SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CONDITIONS OF SERVICE are subject to amendments and revisions as indicated by 'Format changes—2015年第3號編輯修訂紀錄', which involves the Labour Department in their administration and enforcement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de69b2333ff7d9bb2dd79e072a634503</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FORMAT CHANGES—2015年第3號編輯修訂紀錄&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Labour Department is involved in the process of making format changes as indicated by 'Format changes—2015年第3號編輯修訂紀錄', highlighting their role in administrative and procedural matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de69b2333ff7d9bb2dd79e072a634503</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;1984年第48號第24條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Labour Department is involved in the conditions of service as indicated by '由1984年第48號第24條修訂', showing their role in administrative and procedural matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de69b2333ff7d9bb2dd79e072a634503</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;THE FACTORY AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Factory and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (59章) involves interactions with the Labour Department regarding inspections, regulations, and enforcement of labour laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c09a594dc48c807d71b9bc97e24d4b0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT ADVICE PROVIDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Advice providers assist the Labour Department in carrying out its purposes as outlined by the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b297641c5fc96a9b02649fb896184fdd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT SITE VISITATION RESTRICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Labour Department is restricted from disclosing information about employment site visits to employers or agents as per the Employment Site Visitation Restriction clause."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b297641c5fc96a9b02649fb896184fdd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREMISES OF AN EMPLOYER WHERE PERSONS ARE EMPLOYED&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to enter and inspect premises where persons are employed, other than domestic premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;40TH SECTION CRIME EVIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner is involved in the inspection of premises where evidence related to section 40 crimes might be found, as per legal authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae9a7e8f27b80b32998caf906ca2a86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIRCUIT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;THE FACTORY AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Circuit Judge may issue warrants for searches under The Factory and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance when there are reasonable grounds to suspect violations of the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c09a594dc48c807d71b9bc97e24d4b0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESIDENTIAL PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner has authority to inspect residential premises as per Section 45A."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESIDENTIAL PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY, COVER NOTE OR OTHER DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance documents are relevant to inspections in residential premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE POLICY, COVER NOTE OR OTHER DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner can require production and inspection of insurance documents during inspections as per Section 45A."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40 OFFENSE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner has authority to investigate offenses under Section 40 as per Section 45A."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12cbce1945bd7c28729e716e02489760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COVER NOTE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Cover notes related to policies of insurance are also subject to Commissioner's inspection requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bfb4e2ef783a3573d88736c7ce485115</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSPECTION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER'S NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner's notice allows for inspections of documents and records as specified in the notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5ead5337f34ae6c6d3adbc5b06e2bc74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSPECTION&quot;" target="&quot;WARRANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The absence of the need for a warrant during inspections suggests that these are routine and do not require judicial approval under ordinary circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER'S NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner issues notices that require specific actions from the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5ead5337f34ae6c6d3adbc5b06e2bc74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;HINDRANCE AND OBSTRUCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Any person who hinders or impedes the Commissioner in exercising his powers commits an offence related to hindrance and obstruction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5ead5337f34ae6c6d3adbc5b06e2bc74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;NINTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to amend the Ninth Schedule by notice published in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1780efd8ae08a5db55e3f208ec193d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to refuse issuing, renewing or revoking licences for employment agencies based on certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-602c441cf667030bb7c11323e7c28f43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;NAME OF ANOTHER EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can consider the name similarity between an employment agency and another one when making decisions about licensing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-602c441cf667030bb7c11323e7c28f43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;UNDISCHARGED BANKRUPT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a licensee is an undischarged bankrupt, The Commissioner may refuse issuing or renewing licences based on this condition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-602c441cf667030bb7c11323e7c28f43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 54 EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to withdraw an exemption granted under section 54 if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 53(1) REFUSAL GROUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The grounds for withdrawal of exemptions include those contained in Section 53(1), which the Commissioner can use to refuse issuing or renewing a licence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner is responsible for notifying holders of certificates of exemption about withdrawal and requesting return of documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY (HOLDER)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Holders of employment agency certificates are subject to the decisions made by the Commissioner regarding exemptions and must comply with his directives."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER must publish the details of all licenses and certificates in the GAZETTE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;CODES OF PRACTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER has the authority to issue codes of practice for employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER'S NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner's notice may request employers to produce documents as specified in the notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5ead5337f34ae6c6d3adbc5b06e2bc74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR JUDGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documents presented to a court or judge are accepted as evidence without further proof."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d32c74af47d4bd7932dd3de0fb1f8ae1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A document is produced by a public officer and presumed to be true until the contrary is proved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61eb86110cfbe6bc5c9e56f62d9d038f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR MAGISTRATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or magistrate presumes that a document signed by a public officer or his agent is true."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61eb86110cfbe6bc5c9e56f62d9d038f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documents are relevant in arbitral proceedings but not required to be produced unless similar requirements exist in civil court proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e0829311bda6ca8e30706b5b4b72bc86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;WITNESSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Witnesess can be directed to produce documents, indicating a procedural relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e0829311bda6ca8e30706b5b4b72bc86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUMMARY CONVICTION&quot;" target="&quot;CRIMINAL OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A CRIMINAL OFFENSE can lead to a SUMMARY CONVICTION which results in fines and imprisonment as per section 47."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUMMARY CONVICTION&quot;" target="&quot;CONVICTION ON INDICTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both types of convictions are penalties for failing to comply with safety measures under the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0812f6740fa10908c6c96dfb7b577a49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR, MANAGER, SECRETARY OR SIMILAR OFFICER OR MAIN AGENT OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A director, manager, secretary or similar officer or main agent of a body corporate can commit an offence if they consent to, connive at, or neglect their duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa06844e99812b2f5f3eb2b64f82eb38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;MEMBER OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a member manages the body corporate and commits an offence due to their actions, that individual is considered to have committed the same offence as per regulations made by the Chief Executive in Council."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa06844e99812b2f5f3eb2b64f82eb38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;ANY IN-CORPORATE PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OF THE OFFENCE TO DISCLOSE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION OBTAINED OFFICIALLY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Any corporate person who commits an offence under subsection (1) is considered as a body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aae626926134b8ac6b7cded959f0e21a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director of the Body Corporate has immediate authority over the management activities of the body corporate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The director of the body corporate has authority over its management, and can delegate this authority to officers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Officers are involved in managing the body corporate under the immediate authority of a director or by delegation from one."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Building Management Ordinance does not include corporations registered under it, distinguishing its scope from that of other bodies corporate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Body Corporate is managed by its Directors."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd34572cc7a7c12a47fc15cbaf1c545c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;OFFICER(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Officers manage parts of the Body Corporate under the authority delegated by Directors."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd34572cc7a7c12a47fc15cbaf1c545c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documents for BODY CORPORATE can be sent via registered post to its registered office in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a825b77831d51f05d63ae1b415705940</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Directors of a body corporate can be held guilty for the offenses committed by it under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The offense under Section 43P is presumed to have been committed with the consent or connivance of any director if it's proved that at the time, the director was concerned in the management of the body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;MANAGER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Managers of a body corporate can be held guilty for the offenses committed by it under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The offense under Section 43P is presumed to have been committed with the consent or connivance of any manager if it's proved that at the time, the manager was concerned in the management of the body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Secretaries of a body corporate can be held guilty for the offenses committed by it under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BODY CORPORATE can be affected by decisions made by the SECRETARY regarding registration and appeals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The offense under Section 43P is presumed to have been committed with the consent or connivance of any secretary if it's proved that at the time, the secretary was concerned in the management of the body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89bbff8bbf3f0985059cdccf2a6fe747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER SIMILAR OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The offense under Section 43P is presumed to have been committed with the consent or connivance of any other similar officer if it's proved that at the time, the officer was concerned in the management of the body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The offense under Section 43P is presumed to be attributable to any neglect on the part of a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer if it's proved that at the time, they knew or ought to have known that an award made by the tribunal had been made against the body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Partners in a firm can be held guilty for the offenses committed by their firm under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER PARTNER IN THE FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Other partners in a firm can be held guilty for the offenses committed by their firm under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON CONCERNED IN THE MANAGEMENT OF THE FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Persons concerned in the management of a firm can be held guilty for the offenses committed by their firm under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CLAIMANT can be a body corporate that may fall under certain conditions where security for costs might be required."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6127a28d22b5d9d9145842f6c4caba9c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A BODY CORPORATE can be registered or refused registration as a NOMINATING BODY based on decisions of the SECRETARY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-89bbff8bbf3f0985059cdccf2a6fe747</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation is regulated by the legal ordinance, which defines its nature and limitations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL AID ORDINANCE (CAP. 91)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal ordinance refers to and interacts with the Legal Aid Ordinance, particularly in defining terms like 'aided person'."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;46. 補償不能予以轉讓、押記或扣押&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This section of the ordinance defines how compensation is handled legally."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG RAILWAYS COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance applies to HONG KONG RAILWAYS COMPANY, but only in a way that is practicable and compatible with their functions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-471ea86899263b19957a8682c15503f9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;KOWLOON-CANTON RAILWAY CORPORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance also applies to KOWLOON-CANTON RAILWAY CORPORATION under similar conditions as HONG KONG RAILWAYS COMPANY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-471ea86899263b19957a8682c15503f9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;MTR CORPORATION LIMITED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance applies to MTR CORPORATION LIMITED, but only in a way that is practicable and compatible with their functions or powers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-471ea86899263b19957a8682c15503f9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 52(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 52(1) is part of the Ordinance, providing a basis for certain actions or applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 54(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 54(1) is also part of the same Ordinance as Article 52(1), offering another related provision."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 58&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 58 is a separate clause within the same Ordinance, possibly relating to different actions or applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT INTERFERENCE IN ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance defines when and how courts can interfere with arbitrations, which is a key aspect regulated under this law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8c1c54aae15fa21fd2f3fa9a3916e793</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance applies specifically to certain Main Private Contracts, defining their scope and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66157f73d78c8a042051d0b5db5e4492</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SUBCONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subcontracts of the Main Private Contract are also subject to The Ordinance's regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66157f73d78c8a042051d0b5db5e4492</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance defines which construction works are covered under certain Main Private Contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66157f73d78c8a042051d0b5db5e4492</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AIDED PERSON WITHIN THE MEANING OF THE LEGAL AID ORDINANCE (CAP. 91)&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation for an aided person is subject to specific legal conditions as defined by the Legal Aid Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AIDED PERSON WITHIN THE MEANING OF THE LEGAL AID ORDINANCE (CAP. 91)&quot;" target="&quot;1992年第63號第15條增補&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This addition defined the term 'aided person' and its implications for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR OF LEGAL AID&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director of Legal Aid has a first charge over compensation paid to certain aided persons under the Legal Aid Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR OF LEGAL AID&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL AID ORDINANCE (CAP. 91)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director of Legal Aid is the beneficiary of any unpaid contribution or deficiency under section 18A of the Legal Aid Ordinance (Cap. 91). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL AID ORDINANCE (CAP. 91)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LEGAL AID ORDINANCE (CAP. 91) is a specific type of ORDNANCE that governs legal aid provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第V部&quot;" target="&quot;1964年第19號第6條增補&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1964 amendment added to Part V of the ordinance, modifying its content and scope."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1992年第63號第15條修訂&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This revision amended the conditions under which compensation can be assigned or charged, impacting how it is handled legally."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-679d548673cb77dcfe447573286cf62e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE PREMIUM&quot;" target="&quot;47. DEDUCTION OF INSURANCE PREMIUMS FROM EARNINGS TO BE AN OFFENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This section explicitly states that the deduction of insurance premiums from earnings is an offense, linking it directly to the concept of INSURANCE PREMIUM."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUDICIAL OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A COURT may command a JUDICIAL OFFICER to order the payment of deducted insurance premiums back to an employee in case of conviction for such offenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Judicial Officer's role is to provide certificates that can be used in legal proceedings, and their statements are considered facts within court procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUDICIAL OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;PRESIDENT OF THE TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The President of the Tribunal has authority over Judicial Officers, who issue certificates that are crucial in legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CRIMINAL OFFENSE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation under the LEGAL AID ORDINANCE (CAP. 91) can be related to criminal offenses, as improper deductions may lead to legal penalties and compensation claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CRIMINAL OFFENSE&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3 AND IMPRISONMENT FOR 6 MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A CRIMINAL OFFENSE of improperly deducting insurance premiums can result in a FINE at level 3 and imprisonment for 6 months."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;44 OF 1980 S. 15, 76 OF 1982 S. 29, 63 OF 1992 S. 16, AND 52 OF 2000 S. 23&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These sections are part of the ORDNANCE that provide legal basis for the deduction and compensation related to insurance premiums."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd33f100307534902fe4100976fabc93</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR 6 MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or magistrate can order imprisonment for 6 months in addition to any fines imposed on an employer convicted of the offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers can refer cases for conviction by courts or magistrates who may order compensation in addition to fines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or magistrate can produce a document without further proof from a public officer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5742863cc938d9f9470985855601b925&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61eb86110cfbe6bc5c9e56f62d9d038f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY DUTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts or magistrates enforce statutory duties by imposing fines and ordering compensation for violations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5742863cc938d9f9470985855601b925</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR 6 MONTHS&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance specifies imprisonment for 6 months as an additional penalty for the same offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR 6 MONTHS&quot;" target="&quot;1982年第76章第29條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 29 of Chapter 76 from 1982 amends the imprisonment term to be applied under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱用合約&quot;" target="&quot;學徒訓練合約&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both employment contracts and apprenticeship agreements are mentioned in the context of not being terminated during an employee's incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;學徒訓練合約&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主不得在特定情況下終止學徒訓練合約。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-688810e0abd091776de88edcaaba1bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;16A(2)條&quot;" target="&quot;普通評估委員會或特別評估委員會&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both 16A(2) and related clauses require the Director's consent or actions by an evaluation committee for contract termination during incapacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會或特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"普通評估委員會或特別評估委員會可以向處長發出證明書。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-688810e0abd091776de88edcaaba1bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會或特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;第16A(2)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第16A(2)條，普通評估委員會可以向處長和僱員發出證明書。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-688810e0abd091776de88edcaaba1bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會或特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;第16CA條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第16CA條涉及的是進入協議，與普通評估委員會的職能相關。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-688810e0abd091776de88edcaaba1bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通評估委員會或特別評估委員會&quot;" target="&quot;第10條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第10條，補償可能會被支付給僱員以解決某些情況下的問題。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-688810e0abd091776de88edcaaba1bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1992年第63章第16條&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer must comply with Section 16 of Chapter 63 from 1992 regarding contract termination during incapacity without the Director's consent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2000年第52章第23條&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 23 of Chapter 52 from 2000 specifies rights and obligations for employees under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1995年第1號第15條&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director's role is central in approving contract terminations during incapacity, as per Section 15 of the 1995 Amendment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b965639f18b2c29c5f672b6067f9d701</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEVEL 6 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (7)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"First conviction under Subsection (7)(a) results in a fine at level 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEVEL 6 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 25(1)(E)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A first-time offender commits an offence and may be liable to a fine at level 6 as specified in section 25(1)(e). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEVEL 6 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Persons who fail to comply with the Authority's notices are subject to fines at level 6 for first-time offenses. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEVEL 6 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;CHARGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Level 6 fine is a specific type of charge that can be imposed for certain offenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-77530b0513e9222b2220609d22541c30</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Legislative Council has the power to revise or amend the Ordinance, including provisions related to fines and compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7788fe09e12252d0bb714e4f775b4322</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL has the authority to amend various amounts and schedules, while the COMMISSIONER can also make amendments through orders in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ab9313c7b307d3d1ed4c3e3eadfe7ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Executive has the authority to allow extensions for publishing resolutions passed by the Legislative Council within a specific period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chief Executive has the authority to make regulations subject to Legislative Council approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66c75321ad1bdf83283c50d27bc8b7e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa88f4f6c68bdcdf602f197a3d1b3c60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL's resolutions are published in the GAZETTE, as per section 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3bc7b3a739542b0651749e63bbf9e5d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda can be amended by the LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL's resolutions, according to sections 12(a) and (b)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council has the power to pass or not pass resolutions regarding Technical Memoranda, which affects their implementation and validity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7e7556ee34515464c79e90674823db90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bc7b3a739542b0651749e63bbf9e5d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;PROHIBITION OR CONTROL OF THE EMISSION OF NOISE FROM MOTOR VEHICLES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations concerning the prohibition or control of noise emissions from motor vehicles require approval from the Legislative Council."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-379c4ce8ea1b640a4bc34adf7620d112</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;DISCLOSURE OF CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION OBTAINED OFFICIALLY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Legislative Council has the authority to approve regulations related to the disclosure of confidential information obtained officially, which can affect various trades and businesses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-379c4ce8ea1b640a4bc34adf7620d112</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;THE FACTORY AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 59)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Legislative Council's approval is required for regulations made by the Chief Executive concerning this ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa88f4f6c68bdcdf602f197a3d1b3c60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;PROTECTION OF WAGES ON INSOLVENCY ORDINANCE (CAP. 380)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Legislative Council can amend references to $22,500 in sections related to the Protection of Wages on Insolvency Ordinance (Cap. 380). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-553752aa230afc1ddedc93862b70955f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;EXEMPTION CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Legislative Council has the power to amend schedules related to exemption clauses as mentioned in section 6. Power to amend Schedules 1 and 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council has the power to amend schedules related to exemption clauses, which includes control over how these clauses affect various legal responsibilities as mentioned in section 6. Power to amend Schedules 1 and 2."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL OF EXEMPTION CLAUSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">33.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Legislative Council's power to amend schedules related to exemption clauses includes control over how these clauses affect liability for negligence and breach of contract as mentioned in section 6. Power to amend Schedules 1 and 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legislative Council's power to amend schedules related to exemption clauses includes control over how these clauses affect various legal responsibilities, including those for negligence and breach of contract as mentioned in section 6. Power to amend Schedules 1 and 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control over exemption clauses includes managing their impact on various legal responsibilities, including those for negligence and breach of contract as stated in section 5. Varieties of Exemption Clauses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;AVOIDANCE OF LIABILITY FOR NEGLIGENCE, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Legislative Council's power to amend schedules related to exemption clauses includes control over how these clauses affect the avoidance of liability for negligence and breach of contract as mentioned in section 6. Power to amend Schedules 1 and 2."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;NEGLECT, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Legislative Council's power to amend schedules related to exemption clauses includes control over how these clauses affect the legal responsibilities for negligence and breach of contract as mentioned in section 6. Power to amend Schedules 1 and 2."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEVENTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;1982年第76號第32條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This clause was repealed in relation to the Seventh Schedule, showing a direct impact on it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db8de87b8402a32b88814909eb8b04f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEVENTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to amend Seventh Schedule via Gazette as well."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db8de87b8402a32b88814909eb8b04f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEVENTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;附表7&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附表7与第七附件在内容上有所关联，但具体关系需要进一步分析以确定其确切性质。目前仅能确认它们都是法律公告的一部分，并且可能涉及相似的主题或领域。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-778870820135900ac4ff3ee48543f5bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEVENTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED L.N. 93 OF 2010; L.N. 126 OF 2012; L.N. 31 OF 2015; L.N. 30 OF 2017; L.N. 60 OF 2019; L.N. 42 OF 2021; L.N. 36 OF 2023; L.N. 43 OF 2025&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这些法律公告修订了第七附件，表明它们之间存在直接的修改和被修改的关系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-778870820135900ac4ff3ee48543f5bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEVENTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;SIXTH SCHEDULE REPLACED 52 OF 2000 S. 27&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第六附表取代了第五十二号法律公告，并且可能间接影响或关联第七附件的内容和结构。需要进一步分析以确定具体关系强度。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-778870820135900ac4ff3ee48543f5bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEVENTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;APPORTIONMENT OF COMPENSATION PAYABLE TO ELIGIBLE MEMBERS OF THE FAMILY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Seventh Schedule provides the framework for distributing compensation to eligible family members as detailed in Apportionment of Compensation Payable to Eligible Members of the Family."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f6942b65bc123e327e9f90372813c148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
