  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 19 of Repealed Act No. 66 of 1993 is repealed, affecting the provisions of this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REPEALED 1 OF 1995 S. 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16 of Repealed Act No. 1 of 1995 is repealed, impacting the provisions of this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REPEALED 63 OF 1992 S. 19&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 19 of Repealed Act No. 63 of 1992 is repealed, affecting the provisions of this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;《勞工補償條例》*或《勞工補 COMPENSATION ORDINANCE' OR 'COMPENSATION REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This Ordinance may refer to or be related with the Labour Compensation Ordinance in certain contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;《僱員補償條例》(第282章)或《僱員補 COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This Ordinance may refer to or be related with the Employment Compensation Ordinance in certain contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments can be made to this Ordinance and its related regulations over time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;OBJECT OF THIS ORDINANCE (ENGLISH VERSION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The English version of the object of this Ordinance is stated to be 'to facilitate the fair and speedy resolution of disputes by arbitration without unnecessary expense.' This aligns with the purpose mentioned in Chinese."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c8bbf5a007054d5e9238f9704d8e1b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;PRINCIPLES OF THIS ORDINANCE (ENGLISH VERSION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The English version of the principles of this Ordinance includes key freedoms and limitations on court intervention, which are consistent with their Chinese counterparts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c8bbf5a007054d5e9238f9704d8e1b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both documents reference each other, indicating they are related in terms of their legal frameworks or principles."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c8bbf5a007054d5e9238f9704d8e1b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;THE UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNCITRAL Model Law is referenced and potentially applicable under certain conditions as per Article 16(1), which may influence the application of THIS ORDINANCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd3867158c784daaa4eb73ead4db9ca6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REPEALED ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This Ordinance replaces and governs arbitrations initiated under the Repealed Ordinance as if it had not been enacted."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e0e013fee151f1254a38965f636a0159</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;APPOINTED ARBITRATORS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This Ordinance upholds arbitrator appointments made before its enactment, ensuring continuity in arbitration proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e0e013fee151f1254a38965f636a0159</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance does not apply to certain types of construction contracts as defined by specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACTING OUT OF ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This Ordinance explicitly states that provisions in contracts or agreements cannot override it, indicating a clear relationship between the two concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-62cc8e230a5d660ff292c1740f8b1b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;APPEALS TO THE COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Court proceedings include the possibility of appealing decisions made by the court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An arbitration agreement may lead to court proceedings if an award needs enforcement or there are disputes over the validity of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03ab3758cb9962eb7aad59c32353f872</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;THE LEGAL PRACTITIONERS ORDINANCE (CAP. 159)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 44 to Section 47 of the Legal Practitioners Ordinance do apply in connection with court proceedings related to arbitral proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85b8cad9edd61a2498008aaa9412835f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;THE TRADE FACILITATION AND CUSTOMS COOPERATION AGREEMENT示范法&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The agreement's rules may indirectly influence court procedures, especially those related to arbitral proceedings as mentioned."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85b8cad9edd61a2498008aaa9412835f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE OR AGENT OF A PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee or agent can be liable for acts done in connection with court proceedings if proven to act dishonestly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc6d15568c3f749767f8090588c63f24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL OR MEDIATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal or mediator is not liable for the consequences of their functions related to court proceedings unless specifically mentioned otherwise."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc6d15568c3f749767f8090588c63f24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Unless otherwise determined, the costs of adjudication proceedings will be borne by the claimant after their termination through a withdrawal notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71987cb00c98805ab9ed06eb948af233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEALS TO THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An appeal is a form of appeal to the court as described under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RULES OF COURT&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF JUSTICE'S AUTHORITY TO MAKE RULES OF COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Justice has the authority to make Rules of Court, which regulate legal procedures and appeals under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RULES OF COURT&quot;" target="&quot;HIGH COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rules of Court are derived from and governed by the High Court Ordinance (Cap. 4)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc6d15568c3f749767f8090588c63f24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF JUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;HKIAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Justice can approve rules made by HKIAC to facilitate its functions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-678280ae191a89f40bc665d65f091cbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF JUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Justice has the authority to approve HKIAC's rules which are based on UNCITRAL Model Law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-678280ae191a89f40bc665d65f091cbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF JUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;COSTS AWARDED OR ORDERED BY AN ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CHIEF JUSTICE determines the JUDGMENT RATE which affects COSTS awarded or ordered by an ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7a7d382b60c68c418d8128c80396b687</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF JUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;HIGH COURT ORDINANCE (CAP. 4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Justice determines the rate of interest under section 49(1)(b) of the High Court Ordinance (Cap. 4). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd8b5a6b74d6568cda4bfce7dd132460</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF JUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY FOR JUSTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary for Justice and the Chief Justice jointly approve rules, indicating a collaborative relationship in rule-making."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3450bee90618bb17df6c3522ce7aa42</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF JUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;ADVISORY BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Justice gives prior approval for rule-making by the Advisory Body, indicating a supervisory role."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3450bee90618bb17df6c3522ce7aa42</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RULES OF COURT FOR REGULATING PROCEEDINGS BEFORE THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF JUSTICE'S AUTHORITY TO MAKE RULES OF COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Justice's authority to make Rules of Court includes regulating proceedings before the court."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authority granted to the Chief Justice includes making rules for regulating proceedings before the court, as stated in this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RULES OF COURT FOR REGULATING PROCEEDINGS BEFORE THE COURT&quot;" target="&quot;APPEALS TO THE COURT UNDER THE PROVISIONS OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rules of Court apply to appeals under this Ordinance, ensuring consistent procedures are followed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-01f73d3a0eb5a63d428e456a11dad9c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"There is no appeal against decisions regarding challenges made by parties within 30 days after receiving a rejection notice from the Arbitration Tribunal, implying that there's no direct relationship for appeal in this context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3906bbf7ee03793cf876d19cdfab509</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION COMMISSION DEMONSTRATION ACT OF TRADE LAW COMMITTEE (TRADE LAW COMM.) 13(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"There are no provisions for appeal in relation to the challenge process as per The Trade Law Commission's Demonstration Act, specifically Article 13(2), indicating that challenges and decisions are final."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3906bbf7ee03793cf876d19cdfab509</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT RULING ON CHALLENGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"There is no direct relationship for appeal against the Court’s ruling on a challenge as per the given text, suggesting an end to the dispute resolution process at this stage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3906bbf7ee03793cf876d19cdfab509</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court handles appeals against arbitration awards, confirming, varying, remitting for reconsideration or setting aside the award."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e17ae2e1dd0c38e2c8a34618b769e578</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legislation for Statutory Holidays has been amended multiple times to include and modify various holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Statutory Laws governing holidays have been amended over time as per the relevant amendments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE is translated as EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE, both referring to the same regulation under different names."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-832a99374a792105c8856a7a8ed4e220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1980&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Workmen's Compensation (Amendment) Ordinance 1980 amends the existing Workmen's Compensation Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-361bcf47bf6b781fdf79ee1bc93fdfaa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1982&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Workmen's Compensation Ordinance is repealed or deleted by the Employees' Compensation Amendment Ordinance 1982, but its provisions continue to apply to certain claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e1f50784d6cf63dc01f3a41116ed7b1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1988&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Workmen's Compensation Ordinance is repealed or deleted by the Employees' Compensation Amendment Ordinance 1988, but its provisions continue to apply to certain claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e1f50784d6cf63dc01f3a41116ed7b1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1993&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Workmen's Compensation Ordinance is repealed or deleted by the Employees' Compensation Amendment Ordinance 1993, but its provisions continue to apply to certain claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e1f50784d6cf63dc01f3a41116ed7b1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;TRANSITION PROVISIONS OF 1995 EMPLOYEE COMPENSATION AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The transition provisions apply to both workmen's and employees' compensation ordinances, indicating a unified approach."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a52f2dcf46c7d731442f86d90c2b5ddd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;《勞工補償條例》&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The translation of 'Workmen's Compensation Ordinance' is '《勞工補償條例}'."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1ddc182c8f11077e959dbc0ab877a19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION REGULATIONS (CAP. 282 SUB. LEG. A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION REGULATIONS is translated as EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION REGULATIONS, both referring to the same regulation under different names."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-832a99374a792105c8856a7a8ed4e220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1980年勞工補償(修訂)條例&quot;" target="&quot;《釋義及通則條例》(第1章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1980年勞工補償(修訂)條例 is translated as 'Amendment of references in Ordinances and documents to Workmen's Compensation Ordinance or Workmen's Compensation Regulations', which refers to the Employees' Compensation Ordinance (Cap. 282) under释义及通用条款条例第1章."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-832a99374a792105c8856a7a8ed4e220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《釋義及通則條例》(第1章)&quot;" target="&quot;修訂條例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 《釋義及通則條例》(第1章) is translated as 'Amended E.R. 1 of 2018', which refers to the revision条例."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-832a99374a792105c8856a7a8ed4e220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;修訂條例&quot;" target="&quot;《勞工補償規例》†&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 修訂條例 amends references in Ordinances and documents to Workmen's Compensation Regulations, referring specifically to The Labour Compensation Regulation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-832a99374a792105c8856a7a8ed4e220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE释义及通则条例&quot;(CHAPTER 1)" target="&quot;THE劳工补偿条例&quot;(AMENDED BY修订条例)">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definitions and general principles in THE释义及通则条例 (Chapter 1) still apply to the interpretation of THE劳工补偿条例 after amendments, as it is not explicitly repealed or modified by the amendment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-abdf9c32782fd80416c088ae1552593e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE释义及通则条例&quot;(CHAPTER 1)" target="&quot;THE 1980年第44號第16條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definitions and general principles in THE释义及通则条例 (Chapter 1) still apply to the interpretation of Article 16 of the 1980年第四十四号法令, as it is not explicitly repealed or modified by subsequent amendments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-abdf9c32782fd80416c088ae1552593e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE释义及通则条例&quot;(CHAPTER 1)" target="&quot;THE 1982年僱員补偿(修訂)條例&quot;(AMENDED BY修订条例)">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definitions and general principles in THE释义及通則条例 (Chapter 1) still apply to the interpretation of Article 35 of the 1982年第76号法令, as it is not explicitly repealed or modified by subsequent amendments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-abdf9c32782fd80416c088ae1552593e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE释义及通则条例&quot;(CHAPTER 1)" target="&quot;THE 1988年僱員补偿(修訂)條例&quot;(AMENDED BY修订条例)">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definitions and general principles in THE释义及通則条例 (Chapter 1) still apply to the interpretation of Articles 4(a) &amp; (b), 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, 12, and 13 of the 1988年第59号法令, as they are not explicitly repealed or modified by subsequent amendments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-abdf9c32782fd80416c088ae1552593e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE释义及通则条例&quot;(CHAPTER 1)" target="&quot;THE 1993年僱員补偿(修訂)條例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definitions and general principles in THE释义及通則条例 (Chapter 1) still apply to the interpretation of any future amendments or revisions, as it is not explicitly repealed or modified by subsequent legislation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-abdf9c32782fd80416c088ae1552593e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
