  <data key="d5">"喪失中指涉及中指指骨與掌骨之間的關節，兩者相關於手指的部分損傷情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fe10bdcc6509915c50dbde896f285728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;手指&quot;" target="&quot;小指近掌的指骨關節&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"小指近掌的指骨關節是手指的一部分，描述了其解剖學上的關係。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;同一宗受傷事件中同一隻手喪失2個或多於2個手指&quot;" target="&quot;喪失該手的第二個手指&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在同一宗受傷事件中，如果已經喪失了一個或多個手指，再喪失一個或多個手指會有額外的補償百分率。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;喪失該手的第二個手指&quot;" target="&quot;同一宗受傷事件中,一隻在以往的受傷事件中已喪失一個或多於一個手指的手&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在同一宗受傷事件中的手，如果已經有過一次或多次損失手指的情況，再喪失另一個手指會影響補償百分率。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;喪失該手的第三個手指&quot;" target="&quot;同一宗受傷事件中,一隻在以往的受傷事件中已喪失一個或多於一個手指的手&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在同一宗受傷事件中的手，如果已經有過一次或多次損失手指的情況，再喪失另一個手指會影響補償百分率。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;喪失該手的最後一個手指 (由1993年第66號第21條增補)&quot;" target="&quot;同一宗受傷事件中,一隻在以往的受傷事件中已喪失一個或多於一個手指的手&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在同一宗受傷事件中的手，如果已經有過一次或多次損失手指的情況，再喪失另一個手指會影響補償百分率。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第二、第三、第四或第五(附帶)&quot;" target="&quot;喪失掌骨——第一(附帶)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者都是手部骨骼的損傷情況，描述了其類似性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;自臀以下起喪失一腿 &quot;" target="&quot;自膝或膝以上起喪失一腿 &quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩種情況都涉及腿部的部分損失，但位置不同，影響程度有所區別。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;臀骨關節強硬——在最自然位置 &quot;" target="&quot;在最惡劣位置 &quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"描述了同一部位在同一事件中的不同狀態，反映了傷情的嚴重性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;自膝以下起喪失一腿 &quot;" target="&quot;膝關節強硬——在最自然位置 &quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩種情況都涉及腿部的部分損失和功能受限，但位置不同，影響程度有所區別。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;喪失一腳 &quot;" target="&quot;足踝關節強硬——在最自然位置 &quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者都是同一部位的不同傷情狀態，描述了其類似性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c3900ed248a8474ab2f01af53f32e5d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;劣位置&quot;" target="&quot;膝關節強硬——在最自然位置&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"劣位置"和"膝關節強硬——在最自然位置"都描述了身體某部位的不正常狀態，表明二者之間存在相關性。前者是整體的位置問題，后者則是特定關節的僵硬問題。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;膝以下起喪失一腿&quot;" target="&quot;足踝關節強硬——在最自然位置&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"膝以下起喪失一腿"和"足踝關節強硬——在最自然位置"都涉及腿部的不同部位，前者是整個小腿的缺失，后者則是腳踝處的僵硬問題。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;膝以下起喪失一腿&quot;" target="&quot;喪失一腳&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"膝以下起喪失一腿"和"喪失一腳"都描述了腿部的部分損傷情況，前者涉及整個小腿缺失，后者則是單個腳的完全失去。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;膝以下起喪失一腿&quot;" target="&quot;大腳趾的2節&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"膝以下起喪失一腿"和"大腳趾的2節"都涉及腿部或足部的不同部位損傷，前者是小腿缺失，后者則是單個腳趾的部分失去。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;膝以下起喪失一腿&quot;" target="&quot;膝關節強硬——在最自然位置&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"膝以下起喪失一腿"和"膝關節強硬——在最自然位置"都涉及腿部的不同部位，前者是整個小腿的缺失，后者則是特定關節的僵硬問題。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;足踝關節強硬——在最自然位置&quot;" target="&quot;喪失腳趾——一隻腳的所有腳趾&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"足踝關節強硬——在最自然位置"和"喪失腳趾——一隻腳的所有腳趾"都涉及同一部位的不同問題，前者是關節僵硬，后者則是腳趾的完全失去。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;一目失明&quot;" target="&quot;一耳失聰&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"一目失明"和"一耳失聰"都是描述感官的損傷情況，二者之間存在一定的相關性，都涉及人體某一部位的功能喪失。&lt;SEP&gt;"一目失明"和"一耳失聲"都是描述感官的損傷情況，二者之間存在一定的相關性，都涉及人體某一部位的功能喪失。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雙耳失聾&quot;" target="&quot;喪失外耳或外耳變形&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雙耳失聲"和"喪失外耳或外耳變形"都是描述聽力問題的不同表現，前者是耳朵完全失去功能，后者則是外耳的物理損傷。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;雙耳失聾&quot;" target="&quot;喪失整個鼻子&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雙耳失聲"和"喪失整個鼻子"都涉及人體不同部位的功能或結構問題，前者是聽力完全喪失，后者則是鼻部的缺失。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;喪失脾&quot;" target="&quot;脾&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"脾"和"喪失脾"直接描述了同一器官的不同狀態，前者是正常情況下的脾臟，而后者則是其被損傷或完全失去的情況。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;喪失一個腎——如另一個腎正常&quot;" target="&quot;尿道損傷——如尿道收窄而需採用擴張術,頻率少於每2星期一次&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"喪失一個腎"和"尿道損傷"都涉及人體不同部位的功能問題，前者是腎臟的缺失，后者則是尿道的部分損傷。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;喪失一個腎——如另一個腎正常&quot;" target="&quot;膀胱功能受損——損害的形式是尿急或其他輕度膀胱功能失調&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"膀胱功能受損"和"喪失一個腎"都涉及泌尿系統的問題，前者是膀胱的功能異常，后者則是腎臟的部分缺失。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370d29656d7b785c75ee619521adae70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;張術&quot;" target="&quot;尿道被切斷&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"張術涉及頻率每2星期一次或以上的情況，其中提到尿道被切斷。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;膀胱功能受損&quot;" target="&quot;反射功能良好但沒有隨意控制能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"膀胱功能受損與反射功能良好但沒有隨意控制能力之間存在相關性，因為前者可能會導致後者的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;膀胱功能受損&quot;" target="&quot;反射功能欠佳且沒有隨意控制能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"膀胱功能受損可能引致更嚴重的反射功能問題，如反射功能欠佳且沒有隨意控制能力。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;膀胱功能受損&quot;" target="&quot;無反射功能亦無隨意控制能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"膀胱功能受損可能會導致完全失去反射和随意控制能力的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;肛門直腸功能受損&quot;" target="&quot;有反射調節功能但無隨意控制能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"肛門直腸功能受損與有反射調節功能但無隨意控制能力之間存在相關性，因為前者可能會導致後者的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;肛門直腸功能受損&quot;" target="&quot;無反射調節功能亦無隨意控制能力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"肛門直腸功能受損可能引致更嚴重的反射問題和随意控制能力喪失，如無反射調節功能亦無隨意控制能力。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;永久地完全喪失某一身體部分的功能&quot;" target="&quot;局部喪失某一身體部分或永久地局部喪失某一身體部分的功能&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"前者是後者的特殊情況，即當某一身體部位完全喪失功能時可視為局部喪失該部位。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;永久地完全喪失某一身體部分的功能&quot;" target="&quot;喪失一隻手的2個或多於2個部分&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"前者是後者的一種具體情況，即失去多於兩個手的部分等同於完全喪失手臂功能。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;以往已喪失一臂、一腿或一目&quot;" target="&quot;完全喪失工作能力所得的補償減去因以往喪失一臂、一腿或一目的補償&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"後者是前者結果的一部分，即過去已經失去某一部位的人，在再次損傷時可以獲得相應比例的補償。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-322513bf44130124c21efa39b0f38a1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF 2 LIMBS&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF BOTH HANDS OR OF ALL FINGERS AND BOTH THUMBS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both limb loss scenarios are related as they involve significant body parts being lost."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF 2 LIMBS&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF BOTH FEET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both limb loss scenarios affect mobility, though different limbs are involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF 2 LIMBS&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL LOSS OF SIGHT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Partial and total body part losses can impact a person's overall functionality."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF 2 LIMBS&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL PARALYSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve complete loss of bodily function, though through different mechanisms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF 2 LIMBS&quot;" target="&quot;INJURIES RESULTING IN BEING PERMANENTLY BEDRIDDEN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Severe limb injuries can lead to permanent immobility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF 2 LIMBS&quot;" target="&quot;PARAPLEGIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve significant loss of mobility, though affecting different parts of the body."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF 2 LIMBS&quot;" target="&quot;ANY OTHER INJURY CAUSING PERMANENT TOTAL DISABLEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Severe limb injuries can lead to complete disability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF BOTH FEET&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL LOSS OF SIGHT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions are severe disabilities that can occur independently or in combination, affecting quality of life significantly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF BOTH FEET&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL PARALYSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loss of both feet is a subset of total paralysis which involves the loss of function in all four limbs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF BOTH FEET&quot;" target="&quot;INJURIES RESULTING IN BEING PERMANENTLY BEDRIDDEN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions can result from severe trauma, leading to long-term immobility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL LOSS OF SIGHT&quot;" target="&quot;PARAPLEGIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Total loss of sight and paraplegia are both serious disabilities that significantly impact a person's ability to function independently."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL PARALYSIS&quot;" target="&quot;INJURIES RESULTING IN BEING PERMANENTLY BEDRIDDEN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions can result from severe trauma, leading to long-term immobility and bedridden state."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INJURIES RESULTING IN BEING PERMANENTLY BEDRIDDEN&quot;" target="&quot;PARAPLEGIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions result from severe injuries leading to long-term immobility and bedridden state."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARAPLEGIA&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF ARM AT SHOULDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Paraplegia involves the loss of function in the lower body while an injury at the shoulder can affect upper limb mobility, both impacting overall functionality."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF ARM AT SHOULDER&quot;" target="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF SHOULDER JOINT— IN OPTIMUM POSITION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve the shoulder and its functionality, though different conditions are described."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f16e9e25a3dbce715e72ac73a5f618f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF ARM AT SHOULDER&quot;" target="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF SHOULDER JOINT—OPTIMUM POSITION 35% WORST POSITION 55%&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ankylosis of the shoulder joint can result from an injury at the shoulder, affecting mobility and function."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF ARM AT SHOULDER&quot;" target="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF THE ELBOW JOINT—OPTIMUM POSITION 30% WORST POSITION 50%&quot;">
  <data key="d4">30.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ankylosis at the elbow can result in limited mobility, affecting arm function from shoulder to wrist."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF ARM BETWEEN ELBOW AND SHOULDER&quot;" target="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF THE ELBOW JOINT—OPTIMUM POSITION 30% WORST POSITION 50%&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ankylosis of the elbow joint can result from an injury between the shoulder and elbow, affecting mobility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF THE ELBOW JOINT—OPTIMUM POSITION 30% WORST POSITION 50%&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF ARM BETWEEN WRIST AND ELBOW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">36.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ankylosis at the elbow can result in limited mobility between the wrist and elbow, affecting arm function."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ankylosis at the elbow can result in limited mobility, affecting arm function from wrist to elbow."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ankylosis of the elbow joint can result from an injury between the wrist and elbow, affecting mobility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF HAND AT WRIST&quot;" target="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF—INTERPHALANGEAL JOINT OF THE THUMB 4% METACARPOPHALANGEAL JOINT OF THE THUMB 8%&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ankylosis of the hand joints can result from a loss at the wrist, affecting finger and thumb mobility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF—INTERPHALANGEAL JOINT OF THE THUMB 4% METACARPOPHALANGEAL JOINT OF THE THUMB 8%&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF INDEX FINGER—3 PHALANGES 12%&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ankylosis of the thumb joints can result in limited mobility, similar to a loss of one or more fingers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afc47af5e3a98c6449c05cd6d36ada3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANKYLOSIS&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF FINGER PHALANGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ankylosis can result in loss of finger phalanges due to joint fixation and immobility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b55604062bb0cbe53d5f4ed852d4e931</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANKYLOSIS&quot;" target="&quot;GUILLOTINE AMPUTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions involve severe damage to the fingers, though Ankylosis is a fixed state while Guillotine Amputation involves surgical removal of parts of the finger."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b55604062bb0cbe53d5f4ed852d4e931</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF FINGER PHALANGES&quot;" target="&quot;GUILLOTINE AMPUTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loss of phalanges can lead to conditions similar to Guillotine Amputation, where specific parts are removed but not necessarily the entire digit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b55604062bb0cbe53d5f4ed852d4e931</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF A SECOND FINGER OF THE HAND&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF A THIRD FINGER OF THE HAND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are additional losses to the same hand, with similar or identical conditions for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF A THIRD FINGER OF THE HAND&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF THE LAST FINGER OF THE HAND (ADDED 66 OF 1993 S. 21)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All are additional losses to the same hand, with similar or identical conditions for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF LEG AT HIP&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF LEG AT OR ABOVE KNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are severe injuries to different parts of the leg, with similar compensation percentages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF HIP JOINT— IN OPTIMUM POSITION &quot;" target="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF KNEE JOINT— IN OPTIMUM POSITION &quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve joint immobility in optimal positions and have related compensations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF LEG BELOW KNEE&quot;" target="&quot;ANKYLOSIS OF ANKLE JOINT— IN OPTIMUM POSITION &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are lower limb injuries with similar compensation percentages for mobility issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF FOOT&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF TOES— ALL OF ONE FOOT &quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve significant loss of foot structure, with related compensations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF SIGHT OF ONE EYE&quot;" target="&quot;LOSS OF HEARING OF ONE EAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are single organ losses and have similar compensation percentages for unilaterality."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF ENTIRE NOSE &quot;" target="&quot;APPARENT DEFORMITY OF NOSE (ADDED 66 OF 1993 S. 21)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve significant facial deformities, with related compensations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF SPLEEN &quot;" target="&quot;ALL OTHER INJURIES MENTIONED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While not directly related to the hand or ear conditions, all are individual organ losses that follow similar compensation guidelines in workers' compensation systems."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b11e95eaf0a598a5659d67096901ffbb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OR DEFORMITY OF OUTER EAR&quot;" target="&quot;URETHRAL INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions are listed under separate codes but could coexist in a patient's medical record."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9feb94b0a3568b8878b4c9f11e9ff410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF ENTIRE NOSE&quot;" target="&quot;IMPAIRMENT OF ANORECTAL FUNCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both are specific loss of body parts, they do not directly relate to each other based on the given text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9feb94b0a3568b8878b4c9f11e9ff410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPARENT DEFORMITY OF NOSE&quot;" target="&quot;URETHRAL INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions are listed under separate codes but could coexist in a patient's medical record."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9feb94b0a3568b8878b4c9f11e9ff410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF SPLEEN&quot;" target="&quot;IMPAIRMENT OF URINARY BLADDER FUNCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both involve internal organs, there is no direct relationship between the loss of spleen and impairment of urinary bladder function based on the given text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9feb94b0a3568b8878b4c9f11e9ff410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF ONE KIDNEY&quot;" target="&quot;URETHRAL INJURY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions are listed under separate codes but could coexist in a patient's medical record."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9feb94b0a3568b8878b4c9f11e9ff410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;URETHRAL INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;IMPAIRMENT OF ANORECTAL FUNCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve injuries to different parts of the body, and while they do not directly relate based on the given text, they are both listed as separate conditions in a medical context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9feb94b0a3568b8878b4c9f11e9ff410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;URETHRAL INJURY&quot;" target="&quot;IMPAIRMENT OF URINARY BLADDER FUNCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve injuries to different parts of the body and could coexist in a patient's record but do not directly relate based on the given text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9feb94b0a3568b8878b4c9f11e9ff410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IMPAIRMENT OF URINARY BLADDER FUNCTION&quot;" target="&quot;IMPAIRMENT OF ANORECTAL FUNCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both involve functional impairments, they affect different parts of the body and are listed as separate conditions in a medical context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9feb94b0a3568b8878b4c9f11e9ff410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF HAND PARTS&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERITY-BASED PERCENTAGE APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loss of hand parts, such as thumb and fingers, are subject to severity-based percentage application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOSS OF TOE PARTS&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERITY-BASED PERCENTAGE APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar to loss of hand parts, the loss of toe parts is also governed by a severity-based percentage application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PHYSICAL FACTORS CAUSING OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;" target="&quot;RADIATION-INDUCED DISEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Physical factors causing occupational diseases include radiation-induced diseases, such as those caused by electromagnetic radiation or ionizing particles exposure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PHYSICAL FACTORS CAUSING OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;" target="&quot;ELECTROMAGNETIC RADIATION EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Electromagnetic radiation is a physical factor that can cause occupational diseases, as indicated in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PHYSICAL FACTORS CAUSING OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;" target="&quot;IONIZING PARTICLES EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ionizing particles exposure is another example of a physical factor causing occupational diseases mentioned in the context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RADIATION-INDUCED DISEASES&quot;" target="&quot;INDUSTRIES INVOLVING ELECTROMAGNETIC OR IONIZING PARTICLES EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Industries involving electromagnetic or ionizing particles exposure are at risk of radiation-induced diseases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIES INVOLVING ELECTROMAGNETIC OR IONIZING PARTICLES EXPOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;HEALTH IMPACT STUDIES ON OCCUPATIONAL EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Health impact studies on occupational exposure can provide insights into the risks faced by industries involving electromagnetic or ionizing particles exposure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIES INVOLVING ELECTROMAGNETIC OR IONIZING PARTICLES EXPOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;RADIATION PROTECTION EQUIPMENT AND PROTOCOLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Industries involved in radiation exposure require specific protection equipment and protocols to ensure the safety of their workers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION POLICIES FOR OCCUPATIONAL INJURIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational health regulations and compensation policies for occupational injuries are interrelated, as the former can influence how the latter is applied in practice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE SAFETY STANDARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both standards and regulations related to workplace safety and occupational health are addressed through improvement notices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-92398049cd93d8f432b90b9d7cf63d15</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RADIATION SAFETY TRAINING FOR EMPLOYEES&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH STANDARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational health standards include radiation safety training for employees to ensure their well-being and safety in workplaces involving radiation exposure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RADIATION SAFETY TRAINING FOR EMPLOYEES&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH RESEARCH INSTITUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational health research institutions can contribute to the development of radiation safety training programs for employees in industries involving electromagnetic or ionizing particles exposure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RADIATION SAFETY TRAINING FOR EMPLOYEES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE WELLNESS PROGRAMS FOR RADIATION-EXPOSED WORKERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Wellness programs for radiation-exposed workers are often complemented by safety training to ensure their health and well-being."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH STANDARDS&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORKS FOR OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupational health standards require regulatory frameworks for ensuring workplace safety as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-94a1139425d270c7317d6d6a1dd6e020</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH STANDARDS&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY AND HEALTH REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Safety and health regulations are established to meet occupational health standards, which is a key theme in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-94a1139425d270c7317d6d6a1dd6e020</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY BODIES FOR OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH ADVOCACY GROUPS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulatory bodies for occupational safety and advocacy groups work together to ensure the protection of workers' health in various industries, including those involving radiation exposure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f30d14d75a76f9e89eb6fe137661d148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;任何職業&quot;" target="&quot;手或前臂(包括手肘)的腱或相關腱鞘的外傷性炎症&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"涉及體力勞動、或手或手腕頻常活動或反覆動作的職業容易引發該病症。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f469a8579bea72a36a2413fd894d87a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;任何職業&quot;" target="&quot;腕管綜合症&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"重複使用內部部件震動的手提有動力供應的工具會增加患此病風險。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f469a8579bea72a36a2413fd894d87a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;手或前臂(包括手肘)的腱或相關腱鞘的外傷性炎症&quot;" target="&quot;手指、手或臂作重複動作的職業&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"這些疾病通常是因反覆活動而產生，上述職業是其原因之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"這些職業可能會導致手部或前臂因反覆活動而產生類似問題。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-50b429f7441b76e64978fbbde04359c3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;任何涉及接觸患炭疽的動物或處理(包括起卸或運送)動物產品或殘留物的職業&quot;" target="&quot;炭疽&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"直接相關於接觸患病動物及其產品,易引發該疾病。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f469a8579bea72a36a2413fd894d87a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;任何涉及接觸馬科動物或其屍體的職業&quot;" target="&quot;馬鼻疽&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"與接觸馬科動物或其屍體密切相關,易導致感染。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f469a8579bea72a36a2413fd894d87a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;老鼠、田鼠或野鼠,或其他哺乳類小動物&quot;" target="&quot;发霉干草或其他发霉蔬菜产品中的尘埃暴露&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"老鼠等动物可能携带病原体，增加发霉干草和其他发霉蔬菜产品的尘埃暴露风险。"\</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4c2ba02a120b5445fb0fcfab455eea53</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;狗房&quot;" target="&quot;照料或处理狗隻&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在狗房工作涉及直接接触和照顾狗只。\ "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4c2ba02a120b5445fb0fcfab455eea53</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;狗房&quot;" target="&quot;老鼠、田鼠或野鼠,或其他小哺乳類动物&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在受到或可能受到这些小型哺乳动物侵扰的地方工作包括在狗房中工作。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;牛科动物或牛肉产品,或猪只或猪肉产品&quot;" target="&quot;农务、园艺或林务工作,或起卸或处理储存中的上述干草或其他蔬菜产品的工作,或处理蔗渣的工作&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"从事农业相关工作的人员可能接触到牛科动物及其制品，或者在处理这些产品的过程中暴露于发霉的干草等。\ "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4c2ba02a120b5445fb0fcfab455eea53</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;結核病患者&quot;" target="&quot;照料因身體或精神虛弱而致令需要照料的結核病患者&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"照料因身體或精神虛弱而需照護的結核病患者是對結核病患者的附帶服務。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-448a3a690b34d790fafbe2c72700661b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;結核病患者&quot;" target="&quot;嚴重急性呼吸系統綜合症&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩種疾病都涉及到醫療環境中的接觸風險，但前者主要通過呼吸道傳播，後者則可能在醫院等場所中交叉感染。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-448a3a690b34d790fafbe2c72700661b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;結核病患者&quot;" target="&quot;结核病 &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"医治或护理结核病患者的职业直接涉及到结核病这一病症。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a99af9933148a4cfe141c19ede6d5607</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;結核病患者&quot;" target="&quot;魯氏菌的實驗樣本或疫苗&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"結核病患者可能接觸到與魯氏菌相關的實驗樣本或疫苗，這增加了複雜性。但文本中並未明確指出直接關係。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e298de9a3d303228555899208700c934</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;照料因身體或精神虛弱而致令需要照料的結核病患者&quot;" target="&quot;以研究工作者身分進行與結核病有關的研究工作&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者的活動可能會有交集，例如在實驗室中對需照護的結核病患者的樣本進行分析。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-448a3a690b34d790fafbe2c72700661b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;研究工作者身分進行與結核病有關的研究工作&quot;" target="&quot;實驗室工作人員、病理學家或驗屍工作人員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者都涉及與結核病相關的工作，但前者是從事研究，後者則可能在實驗中接觸傳染物。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-448a3a690b34d790fafbe2c72700661b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;實驗室工作人員、病理學家或驗屍工作人員&quot;" target="&quot;以研究工作者身分進行與結核病有關的研究工作&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者的職業都可能接觸到結核病樣本，但前者更注重於科學研究。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e298de9a3d303228555899208700c934</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;病毒性肝炎&quot;" target="&quot;非經腸道而患上的病毒性肝炎&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"這兩個概念都涉及病毒性肝炎的不同傳播途徑，但前者是泛指，後者特指通過血液或病原體傳染。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-448a3a690b34d790fafbe2c72700661b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;豬型鏈球菌傳染病&quot;" target="&quot;飼鳥病/鸚鵡熱&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩種疾病都是由動物相關的職業接觸所導致，但涉及不同的動物和病原體。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-448a3a690b34d790fafbe2c72700661b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;飼鳥病/鸚鵡熱&quot;" target="&quot;餵養或處理受感染的鳥類、其遺體或未經處理的產品的人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"接觸受感染的鳥類及其相關物質會導致人體患病。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e298de9a3d303228555899208700c934</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;退伍軍人病&quot;" target="&quot;嚴重急性呼吸系統綜合症&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"這兩個概念都涉及到因工作環境而感染疾病的風險，但前者是特定於冷卻系統的維修人員，後者則是更廣泛地涉及醫護職業。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-448a3a690b34d790fafbe2c72700661b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;嚴重急性呼吸系統綜合症&quot;" target="&quot;甲型禽流感&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both diseases are mentioned in the same legal context and involve similar occupational exposure risks."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-397a21e488bbd089378ec2e94d69e1bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;未經烹煮的已死家禦或雀鳥或其部分或其殘留物&quot;" target="&quot;屬甲型禽流感病源的家禦或雀鳥&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"二者均與甲型禽流感相關，前者是來源，后者可能是接觸途徑。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06ac5b599c206250c4e25463f6b6527b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;從事與甲型禽流感有關連的研究工作的研究工作者&quot;" target="&quot;處理屬甲型禽流感病源的物料的實驗室工作人員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者均直接參與了對甲型禽流感相關材料或樣品的研究和處理，存在密切職業接觸。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06ac5b599c206250c4e25463f6b6527b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;從事與甲型禽流感有關連的研究工作的研究工作者&quot;" target="&quot;NOTIFIABLE OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Research workers involved in research related to avian influenza fall under Notifiable Occupational Diseases according to the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;從事與甲型禽流感有關連的研究工作的研究工作者&quot;" target="&quot;處理屬甲型禽流感病源的家禦或雀鳥、未經烹煮的已死家禦或雀鳥或其部分或其殘留物、或未經處理的家禦或雀鳥產品的工作人員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles are involved in handling or studying avian influenza pathogens, sharing a common occupational risk."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;鉛或鉛化合物中毒&quot;" target="&quot;使用或處理鉛、鉛化合物或含鉛物質的職業&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩者都直接涉及與鉛或其化合物接觸，但前者更強調健康影響。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e298de9a3d303228555899208700c934</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;砷或砷化合物中毒&quot;" target="&quot;煙霧、塵埃或蒸氣中的職業暴露&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"砷或砷化合物中毒与在烟雾、尘埃或蒸汽中职业暴露有关联。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f0ecd9f44b5bcdd46ef57df26ba77a9f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
