<edge source="&quot;HEAT CATARACT&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES (由1983年第386號法律公告代替。由1987年第52號法律公告修訂;由1991年第397號法律公告修訂;由1993年第410號法律公告修訂)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This disease is caused by frequent or prolonged exposure to rays from molten or red-hot material, which can be associated with manual labour causing severe or prolonged friction or pressure on the hand and knee."&lt;SEP&gt;"This disease is caused by frequent or prolonged exposure to rays from molten or red-hot material."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a173f515c3a7b233c06630f4bb889f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEAT CATARACT&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES (FORMAT CHANGES—E.R. 1 OF 2018)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This disease is caused by frequent or prolonged exposure to rays from molten or red-hot material, which can be associated with manual labour causing severe or prolonged friction or pressure on the hand and knee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a173f515c3a7b233c06630f4bb889f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEAT CATARACT&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES (編輯修訂——2018年第1號編輯修訂紀錄)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This disease is caused by frequent or prolonged exposure to rays from molten or red-hot material, which can be associated with manual labour causing severe or prolonged friction or pressure on the hand and knee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a173f515c3a7b233c06630f4bb889f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEAT CATARACT&quot;" target="&quot;REPETITIVE MOTION-INDUCED HAND OR FOREARM CRAMPS (AMENDED—2018 NO. 2 AMENDMENT RECORD)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Neither condition is directly related to quarry operations, but both are occupational diseases as defined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEAT CATARACT&quot;" target="&quot;BAROTRAUMA, INCLUDING DECOMPRESSION SICKNESS, BAR INJURIES AND BONE NECROSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are occupational diseases listed under 'Must be Reported Occupational Diseases' but do not have a direct relationship to each other."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98d195ac6ea8e6425cbc78e7f365cca6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEAT CATARACT&quot;" target="&quot;NOTIFIABLE OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Heat cataract is recognized as a Notifiable Occupational Disease for frequent or prolonged exposure to molten materials."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEAT CATARACT&quot;" target="&quot;RAYS FROM MOLTEN OR RED-HOT MATERIAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Frequent or prolonged exposure to molten materials is a risk factor for developing heat cataracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DYSBARISM, INCLUDING DECOMPRESSION SICKNESS, BAROTRAUMA AND OSTEONECROSIS&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES (FORMAT CHANGES—E.R. 1 OF 2018)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This disease is caused by subjection to compressed or rarefied air or other gases or gaseous mixtures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a173f515c3a7b233c06630f4bb889f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DYSBARISM, INCLUDING DECOMPRESSION SICKNESS, BAROTRAUMA AND OSTEONECROSIS&quot;" target="&quot;NOTIFIABLE OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This condition is categorized as a Notifiable Occupational Disease due to occupational exposure to compressed or rarefied air."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DYSBARISM, INCLUDING DECOMPRESSION SICKNESS, BAROTRAUMA AND OSTEONECROSIS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPRESSED OR RAREFIED AIR OR OTHER GASES OR GASEOUS MIXTURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Exposure to compressed or rarefied air is a known cause of dysbarism."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTHRITIS&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES (FORMAT CHANGES—E.R. 1 OF 2018)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This disease is caused by subjection to compressed or rarefied air or other gases or gaseous mixtures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a173f515c3a7b233c06630f4bb889f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES (FORMAT CHANGES—E.R. 1 OF 2018)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This disease is caused by manual labour causing severe or prolonged friction or pressure on the hand."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a173f515c3a7b233c06630f4bb889f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;TRAUMATIC INFLAMMATION OF THE TENDONS OF THE HAND OR FOREARM (INCLUDING ELBOW), OR OF THE ASSOCIATED TENDON SHEATHS (AMENDED L.N. 146 OF 1999)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions are related to repetitive movements and manual labor causing friction or pressure on body parts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b65ba7ca0b25e8b8db22e6c1edfd463f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;BURSITIS OR SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS ARISING AT OR ABOUT THE KNEE DUE TO SEVERE OR PROLONGED EXTERNAL FRICTION OR PRESSURE AT OR ABOUT THE KNEE (BEAT KNEE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions are related as they arise from similar causes, namely repetitive movements and manual labor causing friction or pressure on body parts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b65ba7ca0b25e8b8db22e6c1edfd463f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;BURSITIS OR SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS ARISING AT OR ABOUT THE ELBOW DUE TO SEVERE OR PROLONGED EXTERNAL FRICTION OR PRESSURE AT OR ABOUT THE ELBOW (BEAT ELBOW)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both conditions are related as they arise from similar causes, namely repetitive movements and manual labor causing friction or pressure on body parts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b65ba7ca0b25e8b8db22e6c1edfd463f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;ANTHRAX&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both can be caused by occupational exposure, Subcutaneous Cellulitis of the Hand is more commonly associated with manual labor causing friction or pressure on body parts while Anthrax involves contact with infected animals and their products."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b65ba7ca0b25e8b8db22e6c1edfd463f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;GLANDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both can be caused by occupational exposure, Subcutaneous Cellulitis of the Hand is more commonly associated with manual labor causing friction or pressure on body parts while Glanders involves contact with equine animals and their carcasses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b65ba7ca0b25e8b8db22e6c1edfd463f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;INFECTION BY LEPTOSPIRA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both can be caused by occupational exposure, Subcutaneous Cellulitis of the Hand is more commonly associated with manual labor causing friction or pressure on body parts while Infection by Leptospirosis involves work in infested places and handling animals or their products."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b65ba7ca0b25e8b8db22e6c1edfd463f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;FARMER'S LUNG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both can be caused by occupational exposure, Subcutaneous Cellulitis of the Hand is more commonly associated with manual labor causing friction or pressure on body parts while Farmer's Lung involves inhaling moldy hay dust."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b65ba7ca0b25e8b8db22e6c1edfd463f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;NOTIFIABLE OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Manual labor causing severe or prolonged friction on the hand is recognized under this category of occupational disease."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCUTANEOUS CELLULITIS OF THE HAND (BEAT HAND)&quot;" target="&quot;MANUAL LABOUR CAUSING SEVERE OR PROLONGED FRICTION OR PRESSURE ON THE HAND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Severe or prolonged friction on the hand due to manual labor can lead to subcutaneous cellulitis."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0819ca2b3488bb6689f9f89ac9c337d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
