</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL TREATMENT OR NURSING STAFF ENGAGED IN SARS CARE&quot;|" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL CONTACT WITH SARS-INFECTED INDIVIDUALS BY REASON OF EMPLOYMENT (A) - NURSING&quot;|">
