  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;PLANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Plant equipment is often utilized in percussive piling activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;TOOLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tools are used to operate machinery and plant for percussive piling."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;GEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gear is part of the equipment necessary for conducting percussive piling operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE FROM CONSTRUCTION SITES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Percussive piling is a type of construction activity that can produce significant noise from construction sites and may require special permits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c80a5edef13387c70f1ddbc0ac7e4acd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PERCUSSIVE PILING is a specific type of construction activity for which conditions may be imposed on the CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT, as stated in section 6(6)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Percussive piling requires a construction noise permit to be carried out legally."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4bda701f7b69fa34380775a0f86642cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Percussive piling is subject to noise regulations and can result in offenses if not carried out according to the rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK TIME RESTRICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Percussive piling is restricted during certain hours and on general holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION EQUIPMENT USAGE RESTRICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The use of certain equipment, like portable powered mechanical equipment, may be restricted during percussive piling operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;PERCUSSIVE DEVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PERCUSSIVE PILING involves the use of various types of PERCUSSIVE DEVICE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-72a00cd6e89601305d8b400d5eef9c21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Authority can refuse to issue a permit for percussive piling between 7 AM and 7 PM on non-general holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERCUSSIVE PILING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction activities may include percussive piling between 7 AM and 7 PM on non-general holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILE&quot;" target="&quot;MACHINERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Machinery is involved in the sinking or driving of piles, which includes percussive piling."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILE&quot;" target="&quot;PLANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Plant equipment can be used for the sinking or forming of a pile in the ground by various means including hammering and jacking."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILE&quot;" target="&quot;TOOLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tools are essential for operating machinery and plant during pile driving operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILE&quot;" target="&quot;GEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gear is part of the equipment necessary for conducting pile driving activities, including percussive piling."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POWERED MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FUNCTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FUNCTIONS include the use and operation of POWERED MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT as defined in regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-56e97ce586530c13a293f392668859be</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POWERED MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM NOISE LEVELS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Maximum noise levels apply specifically to powered mechanical equipment as part of the conditions for a construction noise permit."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNCTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;MACHINERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Machinery is involved in the execution of functions such as operations referred to in paragraph (a), (b), (c), (d), (e) or (f)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNCTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;PLANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Plant equipment can be used for executing various functions including those related to piling and other ground works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNCTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;TOOLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tools are essential in the execution of functions such as operations referred to in paragraph (a), (b), (c), (d), (e) or (f)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNCTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;GEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gear is part of the equipment necessary for executing various functions including those related to piling and other ground works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;蒸氣或液壓&quot;" target="&quot;USE OF MACHINERY, PLANT, TOOLS, GEAR AND MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both '蒸氣或液壓' and 'USE OF MACHINERY, PLANT, TOOLS, GEAR AND MATERIALS' are related to the use of mechanical energy in construction work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A construction noise permit must be obtained for certain activities related to construction work during specific times or on general holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c80a5edef13387c70f1ddbc0ac7e4acd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">33.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AUTHORITY has the power to issue and manage CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMITS, including imposing conditions on them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The AUTHORITY is responsible for issuing CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMITS, which are guided by TECHNICAL MEMORANDUMs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The AUTHORITY issues, amends, varies, or cancels CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMITS based on certain conditions and procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Authority has the power to issue and cancel construction noise permits, as well as amend or vary their conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c46d2bc84b41a7759d92a2cdbd5b2891&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bda701f7b69fa34380775a0f86642cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72a00cd6e89601305d8b400d5eef9c21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION FOR CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An APPLICATION FOR CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT must be made to the AUTHORITY in a prescribed form and manner, accompanied by the required fee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c46d2bc84b41a7759d92a2cdbd5b2891</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Issuance of a CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT can be influenced by TECHNICAL MEMORANDA, which set out principles and standards that must not be contravened."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4bda701f7b69fa34380775a0f86642cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public interest may require the issuance or cancellation of a construction noise permit, affecting various conditions and permissions."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED LOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Conditions of the construction noise permit can specify locations where certain activities are permitted or required to be displayed."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA ISSUED UNDER SECTION 9(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical memoranda issued under Section 9(1) can affect the issuance and conditions of a construction noise permit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISORY AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUPERVISORY AUTHORITY has the authority to issue and cancel CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMITS, which can impact APPELLANT's business operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A CONSTRUCTION SITE is the location where CONSTRUCTION WORK takes place."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AUTHORITY's functions include managing noise emanating from CONSTRUCTION SITE based on TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71a89fc961d4c4ccbebf98c5fc224109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction Site is another type of premise where NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES may be issued by the AUTHORITY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATION PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Occupation Permit may be required for a construction site after completion of work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-622e9afcf96894f3c8695345444428d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction Work is performed at a construction site as per the terms of a Construction Contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-622e9afcf96894f3c8695345444428d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Progress payments are related to carrying out construction work on the construction site."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR can direct inspections of the CONSTRUCTION SITE, which is relevant to payment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d879d95be32b955d798da85e699506e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXTRACTION FROM THE EARTH&quot;" target="&quot;DREDGING OR ANY WORK IN CONNECTION WITH DREDGING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve work related to extracting materials from a source, though EXTRACTION FROM THE EARTH can be more general and includes surface activities while dredging is underwater."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECLAMATION OF ANY FORESHORE AND SEA-BED&quot;" target="&quot;DREDGING OR ANY WORK IN CONNECTION WITH DREDGING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both involve work in the sea, with RECLAMATION being land creation and DREDGING related to seabed activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILING OR ANY WORK IN CONNECTION WITH PILING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PILING is a specific type of CONSTRUCTION WORK."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;USE OF MACHINERY, PLANT, TOOLS, GEAR AND MATERIALS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Machinery and tools are used in CONSTRUCTION WORK."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4d107bfd5d6737d06b2fc1d377e10585</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCREW PILE&quot;" target="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SCREW PILE is a specific type of pile involved in piling work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CAST-IN-PLACE PILE&quot;" target="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CAST-IN-PLACE PILE is a specific method used in the process of piling."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPOSITE PILE&quot;" target="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COMPOSITE PILE is another type of pile involved in piling work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SAND PILE&quot;" target="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SAND PILE refers to a specific kind of material used in the process of piling."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORED PILE&quot;" target="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BORED PILE is a specific method used in the process of piling."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;" target="&quot;SHEET PPILE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SHEET PPILE is another type of pile involved in piling work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;" target="&quot;CAISSON PPILE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CAISSON PPILE is another type of pile involved in piling work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;" target="&quot;POWERED MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT (機動設備)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Powered mechanical equipment can be used in piling work for driving or sinking piles into the ground."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PILING (打樁工程)&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY (局長)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While the Secretary for Environment and Ecology may oversee environmental impact assessments during piling work, there is no direct relationship between these terms in this context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE (地方)&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC PLACE (公眾地方)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PLACE includes public places, which are accessible to the general public."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC PLACE (公眾地方)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED OWNER (登記車主)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of public places does not include registered owners, who are related to vehicle ownership and traffic regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC PLACE (公眾地方)&quot;" target="&quot;VEHICLE (車輛)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public places include areas where vehicles can be parked or accessed by road traffic."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddefd61217d789ac2863952eb4183a7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY FOR ENVIRONMENT AND ECOLOGY&quot;" target="&quot;ROAD TRAFFIC ORDINANCE (CAP. 374)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'Secretary' in the Road Traffic Ordinance refers to the Secretary for Environment and Ecology."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce50382ff024b176dc7ebf19fb5b68d4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC PLACES&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE AT NIGHT OR ON A GENERAL HOLIDAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The text also mentions public places as locations where noise can be an offense, especially if it's due to activities like playing musical instruments or using amplification devices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d6887e7ca7e46f1099049e513eb84c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRAM&quot;" target="&quot;VEHICLE TRAVELLING IN A PUBLIC PLACE, WHETHER OR NOT MECHANICALLY PROPELLED, WHICH IS CONSTRUCTED OR ADAPTED FOR USE ON ROADS.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TRAM is a specific type of vehicle that travels in public places and can be mechanically propelled or adapted for road use."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bceea1993ba0ed4cdb5b89c8edf8b0ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRAM&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE CAUSED BY OPERATIONS IN DOMESTIC PREMISES, PUBLIC PLACES, TRADE ADVERTISING, OR ANIMAL KEEPING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">30.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Trams can cause noise that may be regulated under the provisions related to domestic premises and public spaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trams can generate noise that may fall under the regulations concerning operations in domestic premises and public places."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bceea1993ba0ed4cdb5b89c8edf8b0ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NORTH-WEST RAILWAY&quot;" target="&quot;KOWLOON-CANTON RAILWAY CORPORATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 372)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The North-West Railway is defined under the Kowloon-Canton Railway Corporation Ordinance, Cap. 372."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bceea1993ba0ed4cdb5b89c8edf8b0ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NORTH-WEST RAILWAY&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE CAUSED BY OPERATIONS IN DOMESTIC PREMISES, PUBLIC PLACES, TRADE ADVERTISING, OR ANIMAL KEEPING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">30.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The North-West Railway's vehicles can cause noise that may be regulated under the provisions related to domestic premises and public spaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"The North-West Railway's vehicles can generate noise that may be regulated under the provisions related to domestic premises and public spaces."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bceea1993ba0ed4cdb5b89c8edf8b0ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NORTH-WEST RAILWAY&quot;" target="&quot;KOWLOON-CANTON RAILWAY CORPORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'North-west Railway' is defined within the context of Kowloon-Canton Railway Corporation Ordinance (Cap. 372). This indicates a legal and regulatory relationship between these two entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-309604fa3106e70bedbe6af0b9f1e7a3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;KOWLOON-CANTON RAILWAY CORPORATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 372)&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE CAUSED BY OPERATIONS IN DOMESTIC PREMISES, PUBLIC PLACES, TRADE ADVERTISING, OR ANIMAL KEEPING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">34.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Kowloon-Canton Railway Corporation Ordinance may provide the legal framework for regulating noise caused by railway operations in public spaces."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bceea1993ba0ed4cdb5b89c8edf8b0ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VEHICLE TRAVELLING IN A PUBLIC PLACE, WHETHER OR NOT MECHANICALLY PROPELLED, WHICH IS CONSTRUCTED OR ADAPTED FOR USE ON ROADS.&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE CAUSED BY OPERATIONS IN DOMESTIC PREMISES, PUBLIC PLACES, TRADE ADVERTISING, OR ANIMAL KEEPING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">34.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Vehicles traveling in public places can cause noise that may be regulated under the provisions related to domestic premises and public spaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vehicles traveling in public places can generate noise that may be regulated under the provisions related to domestic premises and public spaces."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bceea1993ba0ed4cdb5b89c8edf8b0ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;KOWLOON-CANTON RAILWAY CORPORATION&quot;" target="&quot;MTR CORPORATION LIMITED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both MTR Corporation Limited and Kowloon-Canton Railway Corporation are subject to similar conditions under The Ordinance regarding their operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both entities are involved in transportation infrastructure and may have overlapping operations or competitive dynamics within Hong Kong's public transport sector."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-471ea86899263b19957a8682c15503f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a31b81a1625e550531d4c12b4182702</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITES&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING NOISE PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction Sites are subject to Building Noise Permits, which regulate the noise levels during construction activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-309604fa3106e70bedbe6af0b9f1e7a3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Supervisor has the authority to revise or revoke a Building Noise Permit based on certain conditions being violated or other reasons for public interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"The supervisor has the authority to issue a building noise permit and impose conditions on it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-870a1a55ba8a2e008f20db40471921e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3df2a801b8139ee63d424aaec7ccaaa2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;撞擊式打樁工程&quot;" target="&quot;非公眾假日&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在非公眾假日的上午7時至下午7時進行撞擊式打樁工程需持有有效許可證，否則違法。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75a63fc1bac46279a18763a5809259bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;撞擊式打樁工程&quot;" target="&quot;公眾假日&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在公眾假日或晚上7時後進行撞擊式打樁工程屬犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75a63fc1bac46279a18763a5809259bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE FROM CONSTRUCTION SITES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction work can generate noise from construction sites which is regulated by laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c80a5edef13387c70f1ddbc0ac7e4acd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER, TENANT OR OCCUPIER OF DOMESTIC PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The owner, tenant or occupier of domestic premises can perform certain construction work without a permit during specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;$200,000 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (7)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Second or subsequent convictions under Subsection (7)(b) result in a $200,000 fine."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;$200,000 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OR (2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Second or subsequent conviction incurs a fine of $200,000 in addition to the initial conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;$200,000 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;第二次或其後定罪&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The second or subsequent conviction incurs a maximum fine of $200,000."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;$200,000 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;每日$20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The daily fine can accumulate to a maximum of $200,000 over time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;$200,000 FINE&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON WHO USES OR CAUSES TO BE USED ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person who uses a prescribed product improperly commits an offense and is liable to a fine of $200,000 on second or subsequent conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE POLLUTION PREVENTION MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction noise permit regulations include measures to prevent noise pollution."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENSE UNDER THIS SECTION&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK WITHOUT PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Carrying out construction work without a permit constitutes an offense under this section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal framework governs construction activities, including the use of permits and compliance with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32B(3)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32B(3) is a legal framework for handling the renewal or re-engagement by the previous owner during business ownership changes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32PA is part of the legal framework governing engagement and re-engagement under orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK&quot;" target="&quot;CIVIL DEBT RECOVERY PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal framework includes procedures for civil debt recovery, such as wage attachment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AWARD ENFORCEABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal Framework outlines how arbitration awards can be enforced within and outside Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9f1ee15f14896a24f23432269f049b12</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE REGULATIONS ENFORCEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PENALTIES FOR NOISE VIOLATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Noise regulations enforcement can result in legal penalties for violations of noise control measures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL ENFORCEMENT MECHANISMS&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE REGULATIONS IMPLEMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal enforcement mechanisms are in place to implement and enforce noise regulations for construction activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f2283841f29f58e1152dc9a3680675</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE CONTROL REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE FROM CONSTRUCTION WORK CONTRARY TO REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The noise from the construction work is in violation of NOISE CONTROL REGULATIONS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3df2a801b8139ee63d424aaec7ccaaa2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE CONTROL REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;VEHICLE DESIGN STANDARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations can authorize the use or application of vehicle design standards to control noise emissions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aeefdaa960889b928783eadf5af4d4f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISOR&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical memorandums guide supervisors in issuing building noise permits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3df2a801b8139ee63d424aaec7ccaaa2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISOR&quot;" target="&quot;REVOCATION OF BUILDING NOISE PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Supervisor can revoke a Building Noise Permit if its terms are breached, the application was misleading, false, incorrect, or incomplete, or for public interest reasons (excluding pile driving operations). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-870a1a55ba8a2e008f20db40471921e5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISOR&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST TIME CONVICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A SUPERVISOR might handle cases involving FIRST TIME CONVICTIONS, especially in the context of workplace or public place noise compliance issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISOR&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL COMMITTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPEAL COMMITTEE can issue instructions to the SUPERVISOR regarding the exercise of functions granted by this regulation, and the SUPERVISOR must comply with these instructions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b856945c331d2adb7af607cfc2cd9f8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISOR&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL HEARING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SUPERVISOR must comply with instructions issued by the APPEAL COMMITTEE regarding the exercise of functions granted by this regulation during APPEAL HEARINGS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b856945c331d2adb7af607cfc2cd9f8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">23.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AUTHORITY is guided by TECHNICAL MEMORANDUMs when performing their functions regarding noise from construction sites."&lt;SEP&gt;"The AUTHORITY shall be guided by TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM when carrying out functions regarding noise from CONSTRUCTION SITE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Authority issues technical memorandums applicable to specified ranges or locations within the Hong Kong territory for managing construction noise permits."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71a89fc961d4c4ccbebf98c5fc224109&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72a00cd6e89601305d8b400d5eef9c21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SECRETARY has the authority to issue TECHNICAL MEMORANDUMs, which guide various aspects related to construction site noise and permits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-72a00cd6e89601305d8b400d5eef9c21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;PERCUSSIVE DEVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TECHNICAL MEMORANDUMs may set out different principles and standards for various types of PERCUSSIVE DEVICE used in percussive piling."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-72a00cd6e89601305d8b400d5eef9c21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda issued under section 9 or 10 must be published in the Gazette before being laid on the table of the Legislative Council."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66c75321ad1bdf83283c50d27bc8b7e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;SITTING OF THE LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda are laid on the table of the Legislative Council during its sittings, and actions can be taken based on these documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66c75321ad1bdf83283c50d27bc8b7e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memorandums issued under Section 10 are referenced for identifying noise sensitive receivers when issuing NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL HEARING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"No one may question the content of TECHNICAL MEMORANDUMs issued under Sections 9(1) or 10(1), as determined in APPEAL HEARINGS according to this regulation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b856945c331d2adb7af607cfc2cd9f8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memorandums issued under section 9(1) or 10(1) cannot be questioned in any appeal under this Part, suggesting a legal framework for these documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf98c13106216ee2990969e11aafbee7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE FROM CONSTRUCTION WORK CONTRARY TO REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST CONVICTION FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"First conviction for violating regulations results in a fine at level 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3df2a801b8139ee63d424aaec7ccaaa2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE FROM CONSTRUCTION WORK CONTRARY TO REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SECOND OR SUBSEQUENT CONVICTION FINE OF $200,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Second or subsequent convictions result in a much higher fine of $200,000."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3df2a801b8139ee63d424aaec7ccaaa2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE FROM CONSTRUCTION WORK CONTRARY TO REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINUED OFFENCE FINE DAILY $20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Continued offences lead to daily fines of $20,000 during the period of violation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3df2a801b8139ee63d424aaec7ccaaa2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST CONVICTION FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;" target="&quot;IMPORTATION, MANUFACTURE OR SUPPLY, OFFER OR EXPOSE FOR SUPPLY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"First conviction fine applies to importation, manufacture or supply activities during the warranty period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;監督&quot;" target="&quot;申請人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"監督處理來自申請人的建築噪音許可證申請,並作出相關決定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9053b5bb875d947585293b13bbe5f25e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;監督&quot;" target="&quot;特區政府&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"監督有權報告特區政府中公職人員違反規定的行為，並要求政務司司長進行調查和採取行動。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-87b463683890ea692cb1904bcc74ba11</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;監督&quot;" target="&quot;政務司司長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"政務司司長根據監督的報告進行行動，以確保特區政府遵守相關規定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-87b463683890ea692cb1904bcc74ba11</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申請人&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據規定,申請必須符合特定格式並由申請人簽署。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0de67114856d774592b4fb886fb31e9f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AUTHORITY is guided by TECHNICAL MEMORANDA when considering applications for construction noise permits."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Authority is guided by Technical Memoranda when undertaking noise measurement or assessment tasks."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ac0836d4d9cd8980aca2b9281cb718a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c46d2bc84b41a7759d92a2cdbd5b2891</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPLICANT must adhere to principles and standards set out in TECHNICAL MEMORANDA when applying for a CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4bda701f7b69fa34380775a0f86642cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary has the authority to issue Technical Memoranda and make them available for public inspection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ac0836d4d9cd8980aca2b9281cb718a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;" target="&quot;CIRCULATION IN THE GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda are made available for public inspection through circulation in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ac0836d4d9cd8980aca2b9281cb718a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The GAZETTE is used for publishing Technical Memoranda as per section 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3bc7b3a739542b0651749e63bbf9e5d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE REDUCTION NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda provide standards for noise levels that Noise Reduction Notices are based on, indicating a direct relationship in terms of regulatory compliance and enforcement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7e7556ee34515464c79e90674823db90</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE SENSITIVE RECEIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda define noise sensitive receivers in terms of places where annoyance can be considered."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9af0d61962337f7b194e565a06d8c298</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPLICANT is the entity that applies for a CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT from the AUTHORITY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4bda701f7b69fa34380775a0f86642cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;SUSPENSION NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Applicant can be served with a suspension notice, which may affect their rights or operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8247282749bd85cb6d48e946a81b3c1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;RELIGIOUS OATH / NON-RELIGIOUS DECLARATION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The applicant can choose between a religious oath or non-religious declaration when supporting the warrant application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78c6c93b249203abfbdb5ba16af8eb78</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;DATE OF APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date of the application is relevant to identifying and verifying the timing of the applicant's request for a warrant."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78c6c93b249203abfbdb5ba16af8eb78</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;SWEARING IN (OATH OR AFFIRMATION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The applicant must swear in, either by oath or affirmation, when supporting their warrant application with a declaration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78c6c93b249203abfbdb5ba16af8eb78</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An arbitration agreement involves applicants who initiate the dispute resolution process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03ab3758cb9962eb7aad59c32353f872</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;EXPERT REPORT OR EVIDENTIARY DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPLICANT may provide EXPERT REPORT OR EVIDENTIARY DOCUMENTS to the ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39b02ac25884a8c6102243f2b93f0c03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;HEARINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPLICANT may request HEARINGS, which are decided upon by the ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39b02ac25884a8c6102243f2b93f0c03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CANCELLATION OF CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority has the authority to cancel a construction noise permit under certain circumstances."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDMENT OR VARIATION OF CONDITIONS&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority can amend or vary conditions of a construction noise permit, impacting its validity and application."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IMPOSITION OF NEW CONDITIONS&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority may impose new conditions on an existing construction noise permit when necessary."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED TIME&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Specified times are set for when certain construction work can be carried out, based on maximum noise level restrictions and other conditions."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED RANGE&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG TERRITORY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Specified ranges are established as part of the authority's management over specific areas in the Hong Kong territory regarding construction noise permits."::</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d7aa41ab04a649aeb83e8611a7626ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG TERRITORY&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE REGULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical memoranda on noise regulations can be issued for the entire Hong Kong territory, with specific guidelines applicable in designated areas."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86dd5816dd56bd7bc4f23ec93e31f0f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical memoranda on noise regulations can be published in the Gazette, providing guidelines and standards for building site noise."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86dd5816dd56bd7bc4f23ec93e31f0f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM (NOISE FROM PLACES OTHER THAN DOMESTIC PREMISES, PUBLIC PLACES OR CONSTRUCTION SITES)&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SECRETARY makes available for public inspection copies of TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM regarding noise from places other than domestic premises, public places or construction sites."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71a89fc961d4c4ccbebf98c5fc224109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM (NOISE FROM PLACES OTHER THAN DOMESTIC PREMISES, PUBLIC PLACES OR CONSTRUCTION SITES)&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE EMANATING FROM PLACES OTHER THAN DOMESTIC PREMISES, PUBLIC PLACES OR CONSTRUCTION SITES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda are specifically issued for NOISE EMANATING FROM PLACES OTHER THAN DOMESTIC PREMISES, PUBLIC PLACES OR CONSTRUCTION SITES."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71a89fc961d4c4ccbebf98c5fc224109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM (NOISE MEASUREMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUPERVISION relies on TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM for guidance in measuring noise levels at various sites including CONSTRUCTION SITE."&lt;SEP&gt;"SUPERVISION uses TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM for guidance in measuring and assessing noise levels at CONSTRUCTION SITE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71a89fc961d4c4ccbebf98c5fc224109</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISION&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers are subject to supervision, as indicated when they need to show identification and authorization documents while exercising their powers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60c17dd78d73fb0b81ce0ba9e3153396</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISION&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NOTICE SERVICE can serve notices to any person as per the regulations, involving methods like personal service or registered post."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a63521ff775998da1314db4dd547a7d9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL (LEGCO)&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda issued by the Secretary must be submitted to and inspected at a Legislative Council meeting, indicating an interaction between these two entities in the legislative process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ac0836d4d9cd8980aca2b9281cb718a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL (LEGCO)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBMISSION TO LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL MEETING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Submissions to Legislative Council meetings, including Technical Memoranda, are reviewed by the LEGCO members during their sessions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ac0836d4d9cd8980aca2b9281cb718a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE LONG官&quot;" target="&quot;CROWN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Administrative Long官 is part of the Crown's legal structure in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-603a9b33a6e3900af70fd439592326ba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GAZETTE PUBLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;14-DAY PERIOD FOR PUBLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical memorandum revisions must be published in the gazette within 14 days after resolution or an extended period allowed by the Chief Executive."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GAZETTE PUBLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can publish specified forms in the Gazette according to the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fe986d49a20cfdf5d43e02699374c050</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEDURAL RULES&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM PUBLICATION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The publication mechanism for technical memorandums follows procedural rules as outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVISION OF TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM DECISION-MAKING PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Revisions to a technical memorandum require decision-making through a process that aligns with its issuance authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXTENSION OF DEADLINE&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM EXTENSION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The extension of deadlines for technical memorandums is managed by the mechanism outlined in this text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND LEGISLATIVE SITTING OF THE NEXT SESSION&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST MEETING AFTER EXTENSION (NEXT SESSION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"First meeting after an extension occurs during the second legislative sitting of the next session."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESOLUTION BY LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;LEGISLATIVE PROCEDURE RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legislative Council resolutions are subject to procedural rules for technical memorandums."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE LONG官'S AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM ISSUANCE PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The issuance process for technical memorandums is subject to the authority of the Administrative Long Official."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE SESSION CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEDURAL GUIDELINES FOR TECHNICAL MEMORANDA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legislative session calculations are guided by procedural guidelines for technical memorandums."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGISLATIVE BODY AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDUM DECISION-MAKING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical memorandum decision-making authority is derived from legislative body authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d890da037d9bf78ea552ca6dad1de5c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SITTING OF THE LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;LEGISLATIVE COUNCUL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Sitting of the Legislative Council is a formal meeting where decisions and actions are taken by the Legislative Council."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66c75321ad1bdf83283c50d27bc8b7e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SITTING OF THE LEGISLATIVE COUNCIL&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Gazette is used to publish Technical Memoranda before they are laid on the table of the Legislative Council during its sittings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66c75321ad1bdf83283c50d27bc8b7e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;发出噪音地方的业主、租户、占用人或掌管人&quot;" target="&quot;消减噪音通知书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"发出噪音的地方的相关人员会收到消减噪音的通知书，必须在规定的时间内采取措施减少噪音。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae9659112e4d17d9b06e19d0d8a43760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;消减噪音通知书&quot;" target="&quot;监督&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"监督负责监控和执行消减噪音通知书中规定的事项，并有权撤销或变更这些通知。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae9659112e4d17d9b06e19d0d8a43760</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AUTHORITY has the power to issue NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES when satisfied that noise is emanating from certain places."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 13(1)(B) NOT YET IN OPERATION&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SECTION 13(1)(B) provision for issuing NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES is not yet in operation, meaning it cannot be used at the moment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 13(1)(B) NOT YET IN OPERATION&quot;" target="&quot;1994 YEAR 2 ORDINANCE AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1994 amendment to the ordinance is related to SECTION 13(1)(B), which currently is not in operation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 13(1)(B) NOT YET IN OPERATION&quot;" target="&quot;2021 YEAR 2 EDIT RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 2021 edit record amends the SECTION 13(1)(B), which is currently not in operation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST TIME CONVICTION&quot;" target="&quot;SECOND OR SUBSEQUENT CONVICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The penalties for FIRST TIME CONVICTION and SECOND OR SUBSEQUENT CONVICTIONS differ, with the latter being more severe in terms of fines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CRIME OF NON-COMPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BOOKED WRITTEN NOTIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A BOOKED WRITTEN NOTIFICATION is a form of communication that may be used to inform someone about non-compliance with noise regulations, potentially leading to CRIME OF NON-COMPLIANCE if not addressed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1740b8b8c7e777efdccf16fb8d3a59de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority has the power to issue NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICES when certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9af0d61962337f7b194e565a06d8c298</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;PLANT, MACHINERY, VEHICLE, EQUIPMENT OR PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Noise abatement notices may require the operation of plant, machinery, vehicle, equipment or process to comply with specified standards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9af0d61962337f7b194e565a06d8c298</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;THE AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority has the power to issue and cancel noise abatement notices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;21 DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A noise abatement notice does not take effect until 21 days after it is served."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority can authorize any public officer to exercise powers as specified by the Authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;CODES OF PRACTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority has the power to issue and revise codes of practice, which are practical guidelines for industries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f02d6ddba7929fb360049bae6cab88e4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Codes of practice or their revisions must be published in the Gazzette according to the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f02d6ddba7929fb360049bae6cab88e4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEMS&quot;" target="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM INSTALLATION CONTROL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Control is responsible for ensuring that intruder alarm systems are installed with effective automatic devices to stop signals within 15 minutes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEMS&quot;" target="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEMS NOISE ABATEMENT NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Intruder Alarm Systems Noise Abatement Notice specifically targets intruder alarm systems for noise abatement purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM INSTALLATION CONTROL&quot;" target="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEMS REGULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The regulation covers installation control for intruder alarm systems, ensuring they are installed correctly and effectively."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTOMATIC DEVICE FOR SIGNAL STOPPAGE&quot;" target="&quot;15 MINUTES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The automatic device must stop any audible signal within 15 minutes after it is triggered."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ae1515a72d04834906dde05638fab9b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;MACHINERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Machinery can be part of an intruder alarm system, especially if it involves automated detection systems."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;PLANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Plant equipment might not directly relate to the operation of an intruder alarm system but could support its deployment in a designated area."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;TOOLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tools are used for installing and maintaining an intruder alarm system, which is part of security operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;GEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gear such as sensors might be a component in the operation or maintenance of an intruder alarm system."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ead066fe98080d41598700f44491db70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION OWNER OF VEHICLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registration Owner of Vehicle is responsible for ensuring that an Intruder Alarm System installed in, over, under or in the vicinity of a vehicle has an efficient automatic device."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db5cb02beaa944fb9a1df344fab4d2a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATION ON INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The regulation specifies the requirements for intruder alarm systems to ensure they do not emit audible signals without direct physical contact and must stop within 5 minutes after activation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e18098fcb5747dd72313d5ee7912acb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;NOISY PRODUCTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both entities fall under broader regulations aimed at controlling potentially disruptive technologies in vehicles or public spaces."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e18098fcb5747dd72313d5ee7912acb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VEHICLE&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"No direct relationship between Vehicle and Secretary can be identified from the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db5cb02beaa944fb9a1df344fab4d2a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VEHICLE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECT SUBSTANTIAL CONTACT WITH VEHICLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Direct Substantial Contact with Vehicle refers to actions causing activation of the alarm system which are not directly related to the vehicle itself but can affect its operation, as per legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db5cb02beaa944fb9a1df344fab4d2a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISY PRODUCTS&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATION ON INTRUDER ALARM SYSTEMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations on intruder alarm systems indirectly affect the control of noisy products, as both are managed under similar regulatory frameworks and may share enforcement mechanisms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e18098fcb5747dd72313d5ee7912acb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISY PRODUCTS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL OF NOISY PRODUCTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The regulation of NOISY PRODUCTS is directly related to CONTROL OF NOISY PRODUCTS as it outlines the standards and penalties for non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0549d4328512324b45d1f4f3e4461ed4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTROL OF NOISY PRODUCTS REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary has the authority to amend regulations related to noisy products through notices in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e18098fcb5747dd72313d5ee7912acb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTROL OF NOISY PRODUCTS&quot;" target="&quot;BUSINESS OPERATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Business operations are directly impacted by CONTROL OF NOISY PRODUCTS as they must ensure compliance with relevant standards to avoid legal issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0549d4328512324b45d1f4f3e4461ed4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS OPERATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Business operations can be impacted by management practices at a construction site."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;犯罪&quot;" target="&quot;產品&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"製造或供應特定產品可能構成犯罪，尤其是當這些產品不符合指示牌、標籤或其他標誌的要求時。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;犯罪&quot;" target="&quot;第一次定罪&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"首次被判犯下上述任何一項罪行時，判罰為處罰的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;訂明的指示牌、標籤或標誌&quot;" target="&quot;輸入、製造或供應,或為供應而要約或展示&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"若這些產品與指示牌、標籤或標誌所載資料不符，則相關人員可能犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;輸入、製造或供應,或為供應而要約或展示&quot;" target="&quot;第(3)(B)(I)或(II)款的規定,或沒有按此二者的規定作出安裝或配備&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"若未遵守這些特定規定，相關人員可能犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;生意或業務&quot;" target="&quot;第27(1)條訂立的規例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在進行生意或業務過程中涉及特定活動時，需遵守由第27(1)條訂立的規例。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2027fc353aa43ba4dd84704864f404ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANUFACTURE, ETC. OF PRODUCTS NOT IN COMPLIANCE WITH NOISE STANDARDS&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATIONS MADE UNDER SECTION 27(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations made under Section 27(1) specify the requirements for fitting or equipping products to prevent noise emissions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5285a98388a7108ff07a189d749db20c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 14(3) NOT YET IN OPERATION&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATIONS MADE UNDER SECTION 27(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The operation of Section 14(3), which is related to the regulations under Section 27(1), has not yet commenced."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5285a98388a7108ff07a189d749db20c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE EMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations can prescribe devices or equipment to prevent noise emissions and specify fines for non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;PENALTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A regulation may define penalties for violations, with a maximum fine of $200,000."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6aeefdaa960889b928783eadf5af4d4f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can create and amend regulations regarding offences, including their nature and penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner enforces regulations that may relate to bodily injury, such as those concerning workplace safety."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bca658a6c295daa0f1b015fffbbdfb79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-990bd24369be2bc2f9bdd440773f2e19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A RECORD includes information recorded in electronic form, which is governed by REGULATIONS under the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-126e18663d810ba6b83365ff30027a71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;SENTENCE OF IMPRISONMENT FOR A PERIOD OF NOT MORE THAN 12 MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations can authorize the imposition of a sentence of imprisonment for up to 12 months for certain offences."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-990bd24369be2bc2f9bdd440773f2e19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations are imposed by or under this Ordinance, which can include workplace regulations and codes of practice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2fd592d376d0854e1e9f902478b9ced3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC ACCESS REGISTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations require the Commissioner to maintain a public register of exemptions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2fd592d376d0854e1e9f902478b9ced3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD OR DOCUMENT RELATING TO AN EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations can prescribe what records or documents are related to an employment agency and how they should be handled."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE EMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;PRODUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Products must be fitted with prescribed plates, labels, or markings related to noise emission compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE EMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;FINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-compliance with noise emissions can result in fines for the offender."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRODUCT&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AUTHORITY can require a person to provide specific PRODUCTS for testing as per regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-30c0c6e4486519ef84f7ca9a05c6e39c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRODUCT&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE IN THE PRESCRIBED FORM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notices must be served in a specific form for the AUTHORITY to require actions related to PRODUCTS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-30c0c6e4486519ef84f7ca9a05c6e39c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRODUCT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 25(1)(E)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The product is identified using model, type, manufacturer's serial number or other markings as specified in section 25(1)(e). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANUFACTURING&quot;" target="&quot;FINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Manufacturing a non-compliant product can lead to fines for the offender."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb1255c2f5701b5ef025263ed94bd7e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPIER OF PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The OCCUPIER OF PREMISES may face a fine if they do not ensure the safety and health of employees as required."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a215b7541a9d5eb966c5aa9ffed5374</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court has the authority to impose fines on employers convicted of offences under the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-07f949d11fd1c1d8a909fd36ccac57d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRAVENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contravention of a regulation can be an offence with penalties not exceeding a fine at level 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61eb86110cfbe6bc5c9e56f62d9d038f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1), (3) OR (4)&quot;" target="&quot;A FINE OF $200,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity who commits an offence under subsections (1), (3) or (4) is liable to a fine of $200,000 on second or subsequent conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed8223cf90d5d4646feb10ec51169ca9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1), (3) OR (4)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE OF $20,000 FOR EACH DAY DURING WHICH THE OFFENCE CONTINUES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity who commits an offence under subsections (1), (3) or (4) is liable to a fine of $20,000 for each day during which the offence continues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed8223cf90d5d4646feb10ec51169ca9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1), (3) OR (4)&quot;" target="&quot;保证期 (WARRANTY PERIOD)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'warranty period' in relation to products under subsections (1), (3) or (4) refers to the duration during which the product is guaranteed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed8223cf90d5d4646feb10ec51169ca9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1), (3) OR (4)&quot;" target="&quot;任何人犯第(1)款所订的罪行 —— 纠正经第一次定罪,可处第&quot; &quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity who commits an offence under subsections (1), (3) or (4) is subject to the penalties mentioned after '纠正经第一次定罪,可处第'."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed8223cf90d5d4646feb10ec51169ca9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE OF $20,000 FOR EACH DAY DURING WHICH THE OFFENCE CONTINUES&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity 'ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1)' is subject to a fine of $20,000 for each day during which the offence continues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-767fcab98a545fabc81b28e3a6ad1ac3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;保证期內不符合噪音标准的产品的制造等&quot;" target="&quot;&quot;任何人由於生意或業務而輸入、製造或供應,或為供應而要約或展示,任何為施行本部而訂明的產品&quot; &quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity who inputs, manufactures or supplies products for business purposes that do not meet noise standards during the warranty period is committing a crime."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed8223cf90d5d4646feb10ec51169ca9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;保证期內不符合噪音标准的产品的制造等&quot;" target="&quot;&quot;任何人由於生意或業務而輸入、製造或供應,或為供應而要约或展示&quot; &quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity who inputs, manufactures or supplies products for business purposes that do not meet noise standards during the warranty period is committing a crime."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed8223cf90d5d4646feb10ec51169ca9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND OR SUBSEQUENT CONVICTION FINE $200,000&quot;" target="&quot;IMPORTATION, MANUFACTURE OR SUPPLY, OFFER OR EXPOSE FOR SUPPLY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Second conviction fine applies to importation, manufacture or supply activities during the warranty period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUED OFFENSE DAILY FINE $20,000&quot;" target="&quot;IMPORTATION, MANUFACTURE OR SUPPLY, OFFER OR EXPOSE FOR SUPPLY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Continued offense fine applies to importation, manufacture or supply activities during the warranty period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WEAR AND TEAR BEYOND NORMAL&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINUANCE OF OFFENSE DAILY FINE $20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Exceeding normal wear and tear leads to continued offense fines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MODIFICATION INCREASING NOISE EMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINUANCE OF OFFENSE DAILY FINE $20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Modifying a product to increase noise emission leads to continued offense fines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MODIFICATION INCREASING NOISE EMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;WARRANTY PERIOD (保固期)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Modification increasing noise emissions is relevant within the warranty period of products."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESCRIBED STANDARDS FOR NOISE EMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;WARRANTY PERIOD (保固期)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Prescribed noise standards apply within the warranty period of products."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESCRIBED STANDARDS FOR NOISE EMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE STANDARDS WITHIN WARRANTY PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Prescribed noise standards are relevant within the warranty period of products."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;USE OF PRODUCTS OTHER THAN INTENDED MANNER&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINUANCE OF OFFENSE DAILY FINE $20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Using products in a manner other than intended can lead to continued offense fines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e980522a1add368d13a641e842c93a83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;" target="&quot;$200,000 FINE ON SECOND OR SUBSEQUENT CONVICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entity 'ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1)' is subject to a $200,000 fine on second or subsequent convictions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-767fcab98a545fabc81b28e3a6ad1ac3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEASUREMENT, INSPECTION OR TEST&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The authority mandates that products be subjected to measurement, inspection or test in prescribed forms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-30c0c6e4486519ef84f7ca9a05c6e39c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEASUREMENT, INSPECTION OR TEST&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An AUTHORIZED OFFICER can carry out MEASUREMENT, INSPECTION OR TEST to determine if an OFFENCE AGAINST THIS ORDINANCE has been committed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8024a8a38a1cf4faa9e3a31112f97d7c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE IN THE PRESCRIBED FORM&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The authority issues notices that are required to be in a prescribed form, which governs the procedures and requirements of product testing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-30c0c6e4486519ef84f7ca9a05c6e39c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Persons who own, use, import, manufacture, supply, offer for supply any product prescribed under this Part must comply with the Authority's notices. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;FINE OF $200,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Repeat offenders committing an offense under subsection (5) may be liable to a fine of $200,000 as specified in the regulation. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The occupational safety officer can request a person for certain types of information related to workplace identification and potential contraventions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fab369635d3856df5fe750567a820e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person may be required to provide specific kinds of information as requested by the occupational safety officer, based on their reasonable belief."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fab369635d3856df5fe750567a820e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPIER OF PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person may be asked to provide information that could identify the occupier of certain premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6fab369635d3856df5fe750567a820e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A PERSON has the right to challenge an award made by the ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL as provided for in various sections and schedules of this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-caff1791e8e9f461d58d69581c8df6cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY THE AUTHORITY IN WRITING&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers are authorized by the Authority for specific purposes under this regulation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY THE AUTHORITY IN WRITING&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 25(1)(E)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers authorized by the Authority are required to carry out measurements, inspections or tests on products as specified in section 25(1)(e). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 25(1)(E)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE OF $200,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fine of $200,000 is specified as a penalty for second or subsequent conviction under section 25(1)(e). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aad6b1b45211aa087c009dc4e318a023</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE OF $200,000&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OR (2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A fine of $200,000 is a punishment for committing an offence under subsections (1) or (2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (5)&quot;" target="&quot;$200,000 FINE ON SECOND OR SUBSEQUENT CONVICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Those committing an offence under Subsection (5) are liable for a fine of $200,000 on second or subsequent conviction. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37eade578e866e449433b5cf2ef5311c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;USE OF PRODUCTS NOT IN COMPLIANCE WITH NOISE STANDARDS&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO USES, OR CAUSES TO BE USED, ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART WHICH DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The use of non-compliant products is directly related to the offence described in this part."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OR (2)&quot;" target="&quot;PUNISHMENT DAILY $20,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Daily fine of $20,000 is a punishment for continuing to commit the offence under subsections (1) or (2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OR (2)&quot;" target="&quot;A FINE AT LEVEL 6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"First-time conviction is liable for a fine at level 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO COMMITS AN OFFENCE UNDER SUBSECTION (1) OR (2)&quot;" target="&quot;$20,000 DAILY FINE FOR EACH DAY DURING WHICH THE OFFENCE CONTINUES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Continuous offence results in a daily fine of $20,000 on top of the initial conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5997efc3513d7a18a8e6ffade96f199b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;30 DAYS IMMEDIATELY PRIOR TO THE DATE OF THE TEST&quot;" target="&quot;ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMITION PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The period of 30 days prior to the test is relevant in determining compliance with noise emission requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;30 DAYS IMMEDIATELY PRIOR TO THE DATE OF THE TEST&quot;" target="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO HAS IN HIS POSSESSION ANY PRODUCT WHICH WHEN TESTED UNDER CONDITIONS PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (3) DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMITION PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The period of 30 days prior to the test is relevant in determining compliance with noise emission requirements for products in possession."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO USES, OR CAUSES TO BE USED, ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART WHICH DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;OWNER OF ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART WHICH DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person who uses a non-compliant product can be considered as the owner of that product if they knowingly permit or suffer its use."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO USES, OR CAUSES TO BE USED, ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART WHICH DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;OWNER OF ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART WHICH DOES NOT COMPLY WITH ANY REQUIREMENT RELATING TO NOISE EMITION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The owner of a non-compliant product can be held responsible for its use if they knowingly permit or suffer it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59eee484f73e813248a005b2d6fef14a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANUFACTURER OF THE PRODUCT&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority can issue directions based on instructions from the manufacturer regarding product usage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEALS COMMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;APPEALS AGAINST REFUSAL OF BUILDING NOISE PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Appeals Commission handles appeals against the refusal or granting of a building noise permit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING NOISE CONTROL REGULATIONS ENFORCEMENT AND SUPERVISION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The application process for construction noise permits involves supervision to ensure compliance with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISION REFUSAL DECISION&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING NOISE PERMIT APPLICATION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Supervision decisions can affect whether a building noise permit is granted during non-public holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERVISION OF CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITIES&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING NOISE CONTROL REGULATIONS ENFORCEMENT AND SUPERVISION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Enforcement involves supervising construction activities to ensure compliance with noise control regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING NOISE PERMIT APPLICATION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON WHO USES OR CAUSES TO BE USED ANY PRODUCT PRESCRIBED FOR THE PURPOSES OF THIS PART&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The person must follow directions regarding product use when applying for a building noise permit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE OPERATIONS DURING NON-PUBLIC HOLIDAYS&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISION OF CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITIES DURING NON-PUBLIC HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Supervision of construction activities during non-public holidays impacts the operations allowed on those days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cbc913a82bac150b6a4b08953fa04d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ECONOMIC HARDSHIP&quot;" target="&quot;APPEALS AGAINST REFUSAL OF AUTHORITY TO ISSUE CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT, ETC.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appeals can be made based on economic hardship caused by refusal or cancellation of construction noise permits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEALS AGAINST REFUSAL OF AUTHORITY TO ISSUE CONSTRUCTION NOISE PERMIT, ETC.&quot;" target="&quot;BUSINESS CONTINUITY PLANNING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Business continuity planning can be influenced by the possibility of appeals against refusal or cancellation of construction noise permits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOISE CONTROL MEASURES IMPLEMENTATION&quot;" target="&quot;PERMIT ISSUANCE PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Permit issuance procedures may include noise control measures implementation for construction sites."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35333cbaccd9be2f64c80f729f9d5ffb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPELLANT can appeal against the Authority's decision regarding a construction noise permit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA UNDER SECTION 9(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda under Section 9(1) are relevant to decisions affecting APPELLANT due to economic hardship concerns."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 13 NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPELLANT may face a SECTION 13 NOTICE due to economic hardship or non-compliance with permit conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16 NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPELLANT may face a SECTION 16 NOTICE due to economic hardship or non-compliance with permit conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appellants must lodge a notice of appeal within 21 days after receiving the service of the notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An appeal may arise from an arbitration agreement, involving parties who seek to overturn a decision."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03ab3758cb9962eb7aad59c32353f872</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;MACAO&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appellants may seek to overturn decisions made by arbitral tribunals in Macao similar to those found in other jurisdictions like Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03ab3758cb9962eb7aad59c32353f872</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLATE COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA UNDER SECTION 9(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda under Section 9(1) are relevant to decisions that can be appealed by the APPELLANT through the APPELLATE COMMITTEE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 8 NOTICE OF DECISION&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AUTHORITY issues a decision notice that can be appealed by the APPELLANT within 21 days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 8 NOTICE OF DECISION&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA UNDER SECTION 10(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda under Section 10(1) are relevant to decisions affecting APPELLANT due to economic hardship concerns."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTIFICATION DELIVERY ISSUES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 13 NOTICE UNDER (C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notification delivery issues can be a reason for appealing SECTION 13(1)(c) notices, affecting APPELLANT's business operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16 NOTICE UNDER (A) OR (B)&quot;" target="&quot;ECONOMIC HARDSHIP DUE TO PERMIT CANCELLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Permit cancellation can cause ECONOMIC HARDSHIP to the APPELLANT, which may be a reason for appealing SECTION 16(A) or (B) notices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPELLANT'S BUSINESS OPERATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;ECONOMIC HARDSHIP DUE TO PERMIT REFUSAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The refusal of a construction noise permit can cause ECONOMIC HARDSHIP to the APPELLANT's business operations, which may be grounds for appeal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c94f4e8cb6c69c21ed7b5db12f709e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TECHNICAL MEMORANDA ISSUED UNDER SECTION 10(1)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 13 OR 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Technical Memoranda issued under Section 10(1) can influence or be a basis for appeals against notices served under Sections 13 or 16."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a461efee858ab690fe058321b8a0025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL COMMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Notice of Appeal is the formal document required for appealing to the Appeal Commission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL COMMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC INTEREST STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The operation of a notice can be suspended based on a public interest statement in case of an appeal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE CHIEF OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL COMMISSION CHAIRPERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Chief Officer appoints the Chairperson of the Appeal Commission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE CHIEF OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSION MEMBERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Chief Officer appoints members of the Appeal Commission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT JUDGE QUALIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL COMMISSION CHAIRPERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person appointed as the Chairperson must be qualified according to the Regional Court Judge Qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL COMMISSION CHAIRPERSON&quot;" target="&quot;TERM OF OFFICE FOR COMMISSIONERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both the Chairperson and Commission Members have a term of office, which can be renewed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE SUSPENSION&quot;" target="&quot;THE 1998 AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments made by the 1998 Amendment affect how notices are suspended during appeals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2024 AMENDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE CHIEF OFFICER'S APPOINTMENT POWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 2024 Amendment modifies the appointment power of the Administrative Chief Officer regarding commission members."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c9d82cf88dd3738b34743e6dd94bc9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION FOR APPREHENSION OF ABSCONDING EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"District Judge issues a warrant in accordance with the Second Schedule for applications regarding apprehension of absconding employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3b75037d48822c36000fbac9c3ce438</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;WARRANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A warrant can be discharged by a District Judge based on an employer's compliance or other arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The District Judge issues a warrant as in Form 2 in Part II ordering that the Employer be apprehended and brought before a District Judge."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86f4348a1c4677448f8348eacdd112bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb63fc0b243ea63257ead6ec4cad1834</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Judge investigates an application made under section 67 regarding probable cause for believing that the Employer intends to evade payment of Debt."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb63fc0b243ea63257ead6ec4cad1834</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Judge ensures that the Employer pays the full amount of Debt to the Employee, either through bond or other arrangements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb63fc0b243ea63257ead6ec4cad1834</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Judge has the authority to discharge sureties from their obligations if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86f4348a1c4677448f8348eacdd112bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;BOND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The District Judge has the authority to order that a bond entered under paragraph 5 is void if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86f4348a1c4677448f8348eacdd112bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION FOR DISCHARGE OF BOND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The application for discharge of bond is processed by a District Judge who decides on its appropriateness based on certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86f4348a1c4677448f8348eacdd112bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG REGIONAL COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"District Judge may call upon employers to appear before Hong Kong Regional Court in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edaba831bd1e0154426defdca143f061</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;BAILIFFS OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Bailiffs bring the employer before a District Judge to address the issue of guarantee requirement under employment ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-74275f2bcd7afd62cd2b27056407d1e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG POLICE FORCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The police force and district judge are involved in enforcing legal actions, with the police bringing individuals before judges for hearings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-74275f2bcd7afd62cd2b27056407d1e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DISTRICT JUDGE is a party that can call upon SURETY(1) to fulfill obligations related to EMPLOYER's payment of EMPLOYEE(S)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af8bb2bf50613f2cddc9c821004e6e7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DISTRICT JUDGE is a party that can call upon SURETY(2) to fulfill obligations related to EMPLOYER's payment of EMPLOYEE(S)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af8bb2bf50613f2cddc9c821004e6e7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL HEARING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPEAL COMMITTEE conducts APPEAL HEARINGS, where they can determine, overturn or change decisions and rules related to the appeals; their decisions are binding on all parties involved in the case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b856945c331d2adb7af607cfc2cd9f8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;上诉委员会&quot;" target="&quot;原审法院&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"上诉委员会有权向原审法院提交藐视法庭的指控，并且证人出席上诉委员会聆讯的权利与在原审法庭中出席民事程序聆讯相同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-252ecead925f3c7e306c921cf96537d5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;上诉委员会&quot;" target="&quot;证人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"上诉委员会可以传召证人作证，而这些证人在上诉委员会中的权利类似于他们在原审法院中的权利。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-252ecead925f3c7e306c921cf96537d5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;证人&quot;" target="&quot;藐视法庭罪&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"如果证人拒绝按照上诉委员会的要求作出誓言、交出文件或回答问题，则可能构成藐视法庭的行为。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-252ecead925f3c7e306c921cf96537d5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF LAW&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS are not bound by the rules of evidence, unlike in a COURT OF LAW."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30ea89e5165c3d71c14d8648bf53596</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL HEARING CONTINUITY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 21(1)&lt;OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 21(1) ensures continuity of appeal hearings even if the Chairman is unable to perform his functions due to illness, absence from Hong Kong or other causes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL HEARING CONTINUITY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 20(4)&lt;OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 20(4) provides a panel of individuals that can be appointed by the Chairman to continue appeal hearings if necessary, ensuring continuity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT (CAP. 336)&quot;" target="&quot;DISTRICT JUDGE APPOINTMENT PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Regional Court under Cap. 336 is involved in the appointment process for District Judges who can act as Chairmen or panel members during Appeal Board hearings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL BOARD HEARING PROCEDURES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 21(1)&lt;OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 21(1) outlines procedures related to the appointment of a person to act as Chairman, which affects Appeal Board hearing continuity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL BOARD HEARING PROCEDURES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 20(4)&lt;OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 20(4) provides a panel from which the Chairman can appoint individuals to act in specific roles, including during Appeal Board hearings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78ade03ea05b85190f660e01dfba1ccc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An authorized officer is a type of public officer who has been given specific powers by The Authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION OF PERSONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 177)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An AUTHORIZED OFFICER can require a person to produce an ID card issued under the REGISTRATION OF PERSONS ORDINANCE for inspection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Authorized officers must show identity cards issued under the Registration of Persons Ordinance when required."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7d7ad99b2b6121e30cb678dc647a4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;PLACE OF OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Authorized officers have the power to enter any place where a violation of the Ordinance may be occurring or has occurred."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;OBJECTS FOR PROOF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Authorized officers can search for objects that could prove or strongly suggest violations of the Ordinance in a given place."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;OBSERVATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Authorized officers can observe places or situations where violations may be occurring."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16(1) NOTICE DELIVERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Authorized officers can deliver notices under Section 16(1) of the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;SOCIAL SCIENCES (BEHAVIORAL STUDIES)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Authorized officers might need to understand behavioral studies for better enforcement, though not directly related by the text provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Authorized officers act under the legal authority granted by The Authority to enforce laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENCE AGAINST THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The presence of an AUTHORIZED OFFICER is related to the possibility or confirmation of an OFFENCE AGAINST THIS ORDINANCE being committed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8024a8a38a1cf4faa9e3a31112f97d7c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION UNDER SECTION 24&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An AUTHORIZED OFFICER may enter and search a PLACE by producing WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION UNDER SECTION 24."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8024a8a38a1cf4faa9e3a31112f97d7c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 13(1), 13(4), 16(1) OR 16(3)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An AUTHORIZED OFFICER may enter a PLACE for the purpose of exercising powers under these sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8024a8a38a1cf4faa9e3a31112f97d7c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;OBSERVATION AND MONITORING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An AUTHORIZED OFFICER may observe and monitor activities related to MEASUREMENT, INSPECTION OR TEST."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8024a8a38a1cf4faa9e3a31112f97d7c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;MAGISTRATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An AUTHORIZED OFFICER can obtain a warrant from a MAGISTRATE to enter domestic premises without consent if an offense is suspected or evidence of such exists."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4c7d7ad99b2b6121e30cb678dc647a4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AUTHORIZED OFFICERS enforce ORDINANCES by carrying out measurements, inspections, tests, and serving notices as necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4c7d7ad99b2b6121e30cb678dc647a4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AUTHORITY can make a complaint or lay information with the help of an AUTHORIZED OFFICER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;MAGISTRATES ORDINANCE (CAP. 227)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An AUTHORIZED OFFICER is appointed under section 13 of the MAGISTRATES ORDINANCE to conduct proceedings for offences against this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTRATION OF PERSONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 177)&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PUBLIC OFFICER can require details of identity and produce an ID card under the REGISTRATION OF PERSONS ORDINANCE (Cap. 177)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e43310bb8a059a1a014c1ba9a611877f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTERING AND INSPECTING POWERS&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers can exercise entering and inspecting powers as authorized by The Authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEASUREMENT, INSPECTION, TESTING&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers have powers to conduct measurements, inspections, and tests as part of their duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 13(1) NOTICE DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers have the power to deliver notices as specified in Section 13(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATHEMATICS (QUANTIFICATION)&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers may use quantification in their measurements and inspections as part of their duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HUMAN RIGHTS COMPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers must ensure their actions comply with human rights standards as part of their duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddc943ee0b925d64ce2ff3b4b8fcc772</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Magistrate may issue a warrant authorizing an Occupational Safety Officer to enter and use necessary force if the magistrate is satisfied on sworn information that certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3282c20ec28d4bb14aec7fe4e4eafbe8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A MAGISTRATE can issue a warrant to an OFFICER who is assisted by persons engaged on account of the COMMISSIONER, potentially involving YOUNG PERSON OR CHILDREN in industrial undertakings under the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59). "&lt;SEP&gt;"A Magistrate can issue a warrant based on an application from the Commissioner for an Occupational Safety Officer to enter and use necessary force in certain premises under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-106089b31da6304da0bc926c63d44161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3282c20ec28d4bb14aec7fe4e4eafbe8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;53(5) OR 55(4)条的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Magistrates are involved in issuing warrants based on these provisions, which pertain to domestic premises and evidence of an offence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An OFFICER can obtain a warrant from a MAGISTRATE to enter premises suspected of containing evidence or where an offense against the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59) is believed to be occurring."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-106089b31da6304da0bc926c63d44161</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;YOUNG PERSON OR CHILD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A MAGISTRATE can issue a warrant allowing an OFFICER to enter premises where evidence of offenses against the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59) may be found, which could involve YOUNG PERSON OR CHILDREN in industrial undertakings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-106089b31da6304da0bc926c63d44161</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAGISTRATE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both court and magistrate have the authority to order disclosure of sensitive information related to complaints or manufacturing/commercial secrets as deemed necessary for justice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both court and magistrate have the authority to order the disclosure of certain sensitive information under specific legal procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-029d1e15c5db53ebcfd1168d7ac7bbab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IDENTITY CARD ISSUED UNDER THE REGISTRATION OF PERSONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 177)&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PUBLIC OFFICER can request the production of an ID card issued under this ordinance for inspection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e43310bb8a059a1a014c1ba9a611877f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WARRANT&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An authorized officer must produce a warrant when entering any place by authority of subsection (3) or (4)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Similar to the Commissioner, public officers do not need a warrant for inspections during reasonable times."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e43310bb8a059a1a014c1ba9a611877f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WARRANT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner does not need a warrant to enter and inspect the place of business, indicating that no warrant is required during inspection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WARRANT&quot;" target="&quot;FORM 2 IN PART II&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A warrant is as in Form 2 in Part II ordering the apprehension and bringing before a District Judge."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb63fc0b243ea63257ead6ec4cad1834</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WARRANT&quot;" target="&quot;PRISON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A warrant can lead to an employer being committed to prison if they fail to comply with the order."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86f4348a1c4677448f8348eacdd112bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRODUCTION OF INCORRECT OR INACCURATE DRAWINGS, RECORDS OR DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;WILFUL OR RECKLESS GIVING OF INCORRECT INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are offenses involving incorrect information or documents in compliance with section 25 requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47304134f07a5f479481f92c36a5c012</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WITHHOLDING OF RELEVANT INFORMATION&quot;" target="&quot;FAILURE WITHOUT REASONABLE EXCUSE TO COMPLY WITH REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Withholding relevant information is a form of failure to comply without reasonable excuse under the same section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47304134f07a5f479481f92c36a5c012</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5 FOR OFFENCES COMMITTED UNDER SECTION 26&quot;" target="&quot;WILFUL RESISTANCE OR OBSTRUCTION BY A PUBLIC OFFICER, FAILURE WITHOUT REASONABLE EXCUSE TO COMPLY WITH REQUIREMENTS, PRODUCTION OF INCORRECT OR INACCURATE DRAWINGS, RECORDS OR DOCUMENTS, WILFUL OR RECKLESS GIVING OF INCORRECT INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These offenses are subject to the same fine level 5 under section 26."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47304134f07a5f479481f92c36a5c012</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION MAKING POWER OF THE SECRETARY FOR ENVIRONMENT AFTER CONSULTATION WITH THE ENVIRONMENTAL CONSULTATIVE COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY FOR ENVIRONMENT, ENVIRONMENTAL CONSULTATIVE COMMITTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary for Environment has regulation-making power after consultation with the Environmental Consultative Committee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47304134f07a5f479481f92c36a5c012</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION MAKING POWER UNDER SECTION 27(1)&quot;" target="&quot;VARIOUS FEES FOR DIFFERENT SITUATIONS AS PER SECTION 27(2), REGULATION MAKING POWER TO SET OUT GENERAL PROVISIONS FOR EFFECTIVE IMPLEMENTATION AND ACHIEVEMENT OF OBJECTIVES UNDER SECTION 27(3) &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 27(1)'s regulation-making power covers various aspects including fees, general provisions for effective implementation and achievement of objectives."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47304134f07a5f479481f92c36a5c012</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEALS AGAINST REGULATIONS MADE UNDER SECTION IV OF THE REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATION MAKING POWER OF THE SECRETARY FOR ENVIRONMENT AFTER CONSULTATION WITH THE ENVIRONMENTAL CONSULTATIVE COMMITTEE, REGULATION MAKING POWER UNDER SECTION 27(1) &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appeals against regulations made under section IV are related to the regulation-making powers of the Secretary for Environment and Environmental Consultative Committee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47304134f07a5f479481f92c36a5c012</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDMENT E.R. 2 OF 2021&quot;" target="&quot;WILFUL RESISTANCE OR OBSTRUCTION BY A PUBLIC OFFICER, FAILURE WITHOUT REASONABLE EXCUSE TO COMPLY WITH REQUIREMENTS, PRODUCTION OF INCORRECT OR INACCURATE DRAWINGS, RECORDS OR DOCUMENTS, WILFUL OR RECKLESS GIVING OF INCORRECT INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment E.R. 2 of 2021 affects the offenses listed under section 26."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47304134f07a5f479481f92c36a5c012</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART VI - MISCELLANEOUS REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATION MAKING POWER OF THE SECRETARY FOR ENVIRONMENT UNDER PART VI, MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS AND REGULATIONS, REGULATION MAKING POWER FOR EFFECTIVE IMPLEMENTATION UNDER PART VI &quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part VI includes miscellaneous regulations and the Secretary for Environment's regulation-making power under it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47304134f07a5f479481f92c36a5c012</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE SECRETARY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary interacts with Employment Agencies as part of their regulatory functions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT&quot;" target="&quot;30 OF 1994 L.N.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Advisory Council on the Environment's composition was determined by the amendment '30 of 1994 L.N.', which is a legal notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT&quot;" target="&quot;362 OF 1997 L.N.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Advisory Council on the Environment's composition was further determined by the amendment '362 of 1997 L.N.', which is a legal notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT&quot;" target="&quot;361 OF 1997 L.N.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Advisory Council on the Environment's composition was further determined by the amendment '361 of 1997 L.N.', which is a legal notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISCLOSURE OF CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION OBTAINED OFFICIALLY&quot;" target="&quot;TRADE, BUSINESS OR PROFESSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The disclosure of confidential information related to trade, business, or profession is regulated by laws that protect such confidentiality unless specific conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-379c4ce8ea1b640a4bc34adf7620d112</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 4 AND TO IMPRISONMENT FOR 6 MONTHS.&quot;" target="&quot;A PERSON WHO DISCLOSES OR GIVES TO ANOTHER PERSON ANY INFORMATION THAT CONCERNS A TRADE, BUSINESS OR PROFESSION, IS CONFIDENTIAL AND HAS COME TO HIS KNOWLEDGE OR INTO HIS POSSESSION IN THE COURSE OF THE DISCHARGE OF HIS FUNCTIONS UNDER THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A person who discloses confidential information is subject to a fine at level 4 and imprisonment for 6 months."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aae626926134b8ac6b7cded959f0e21a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Directors can delegate their management authority to officers within the body corporate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Directors and officers of a body corporate are subject to different regulations depending on whether the corporation is registered under the Building Management Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Officers within a body corporate may be affected by specific regulations if their corporation is not registered under the Building Management Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-594b3f94b09a41a66ac58f172b6c0c83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPIER OF PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The officer may request information from the occupier of premises that are believed to be a workplace."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cb675ac0cac90a784b227b042225f64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The officer can enter the workplace in accordance with section 22 and make requests for information."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cb675ac0cac90a784b227b042225f64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;INFORMATION THAT MAY IDENTIFY THE OCCUPIER OF PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The officer can request identifying information from individuals who are believed to be occupiers of premises."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cb675ac0cac90a784b227b042225f64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;FALSE OR MISLEADING INFORMATION PROVIDED BY A PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The officer can penalize individuals who provide false or misleading information in response to a request."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5cb675ac0cac90a784b227b042225f64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;YOUNG PERSON OR CHILD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An OFFICER can require a YOUNG PERSON OR CHILD who has been employed in an industrial undertaking to sign a declaration regarding their employment conditions under the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-106089b31da6304da0bc926c63d44161</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An OFFICER can take persons engaged by the COMMISSIONER for assistance in carrying out duties related to the Factories and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance (Cap. 59). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-106089b31da6304da0bc926c63d44161</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An officer is considered a public officer when assisting with duties under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b297641c5fc96a9b02649fb896184fdd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY SECURITY OF PAYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Construction Industry Security of Payment Ordinance defines terms that are also used in the Building Management Ordinance, indicating a relationship through shared terminology and legal context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f191206611c2d612e34771fce129216e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Building Management Ordinance defines the term 'construction contract' which is crucial for understanding agreements in construction projects."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances involve the authority of the Building Authority, though in different capacities—construction and building management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06e739d62dd19f34a46b38a2c7902502</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 123)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The two ordinances both pertain to buildings but address different aspects of construction and maintenance, with potential overlap in the Building Authority's role."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06e739d62dd19f34a46b38a2c7902502</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 57)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance may intersect with the Building Management Ordinance, particularly concerning workers' roles in building management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06e739d62dd19f34a46b38a2c7902502</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Building Management Ordinance (Cap. 344) defines common parts, impacting the scope of the main ordinance's application to construction sites."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4113afe7255cfeb2800c08deeeac90a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLE PRECAUTIONS AND EXERCISED DUE DILIGENCE&quot;" target="&quot;PROPER SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Taking reasonable precautions and exercising due diligence can establish a proper system for preventing offenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROPER SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;EFFECTIVE OPERATION OF THE SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The effective operation of the system is established through the implementation of a proper system."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEEDINGS HAVE BEEN INSTITUTED&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED OFFENSE(S) WITH RESPECT TO A SPECIFIED PLACE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Proceedings have been instituted for offenses that are specified with respect to a specific place."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEEDINGS HAVE BEEN INSTITUTED&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authority can initiate legal proceedings against a specified person for a specified offence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8555cdc45377153d4e3dfbeaa45b31ab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEEDINGS HAVE BEEN INSTITUTED&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED PERSON (指明的人)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal proceedings have been instituted against a specified person, which implies the existence of an individual or entity targeted by these actions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8555cdc45377153d4e3dfbeaa45b31ab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPENDIX (附表)&quot;" target="&quot;NOTIFICATION FORMAT FOR SPECIFIED OFFENSE(S) WITH RESPECT TO A SPECIFIED PLACE (附表所指明的通知格式)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The notification format for offenses is detailed in the appendix of the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIRCULATION OF NOTICE IN THE GAZETTE&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED OFFENSE(S) WITH RESPECT TO A SPECIFIED PLACE (附表所指明的罪行与指定地点有关)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The notice in the gazette is circulated for offenses that are specific to a place."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROCEDURES FOR SPECIFIED OFFENSES AT A SPECIFIED PLACE&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED OFFENSE(S) WITH RESPECT TO A SPECIFIED PLACE (附表所指明的罪行与指定地点有关)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal procedures are established for offenses that are specific to a place."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2ND ANNIVERSARY DATE FROM NOTIFICATION SENT TO SPECIFIED PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED OFFENSE(S) WITH RESPECT TO A SPECIFIED PLACE (附表所指明的罪行与指定地点有关)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The second anniversary date from the notification sent to a specified person is relevant for offenses that are specific to a place."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED OFFENSE(S) WITH RESPECT TO A SPECIFIED PLACE (附表所指明的罪行与指定地点有关)&quot;" target="&quot;NOTIFICATION SENT TO THE SPECIFIED PERSON (通知已送达指定人士)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The notification sent to the specified person is related to offenses that are specific to a place."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2a6827e6d05ee12b48810a8b5429419c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED PERSON (指明的人)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED OFFENCE (指明罪行)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A specific person is associated with a particular offense that has been defined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8555cdc45377153d4e3dfbeaa45b31ab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED OFFENCE (指明罪行)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED PLACE (指明地方)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The specified offence relates to a specific place, either domestic premises, public places or construction sites, or other locations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8555cdc45377153d4e3dfbeaa45b31ab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS GUIDELINES (業務守則)&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISION (監督)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Supervision can issue business guidelines for various industries as part of good management practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Supervision has the authority to create and modify business guidelines for different industries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8555cdc45377153d4e3dfbeaa45b31ab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CODES OF PRACTICE&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Codes of practice or their revisions must be published in the Gazzette to take effect."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f02d6ddba7929fb360049bae6cab88e4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CODES OF PRACTICE&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers may refer to codes of practice for guidance on good management practices as required by section 28A(3)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f02d6ddba7929fb360049bae6cab88e4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CODES OF PRACTICE&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Codes of practice issued under the ORDINANCE take priority over those issued by other means."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-08d5ac982d50689641df03f0066401a3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CODES OF PRACTICE&quot;" target="&quot;WORKPLACE DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Codes of practice influence the content or form of workplace documents as they are prioritized in certain situations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-08d5ac982d50689641df03f0066401a3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CODES OF PRACTICE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Codes of practice can be issued for employment agencies to follow, setting out principles, procedures, guidelines, and standards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROTECTION OF GOVERNMENT AND PUBLIC OFFICERS&quot;" target="&quot;21 OF 2024 S. 78&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment '21 of 2024 s. 78' modifies the protection for government and public officers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIMIT OF TIME FOR LAYING INFORMATION, ETC.&quot;" target="&quot;6 MONTHS FROM THE TIME THE MATTER FIRST CAME TO KNOWLEDGE OF AUTHORITY OR AN AUTHORIZED OFFICER EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The limit of time for laying information is 6 months from the first knowledge by authority or an authorized officer, which is a specific event related to this limitation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIMIT OF TIME FOR LAYING INFORMATION, ETC.&quot;" target="&quot;1 YEAR FROM THE COMMISSION OF THE OFFENCE EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The limit of time for laying information can also be 1 year from the commission of the offence, which is another specific event related to this limitation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIMIT OF TIME FOR LAYING INFORMATION, ETC.&quot;" target="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT COMPOSITION DETERMINATION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Events such as the composition determination of the Advisory Council on the Environment and limitations for laying information are related, both impacting governance processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENT CONSULTATION COMMITTEE&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT AND PUBLIC OFFICERS PROTECTION AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Environment Consultation Committee's composition and functions are indirectly affected by amendments concerning government and public officers' protection, as both relate to governance structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT AND PUBLIC OFFICERS PROTECTION EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLAINTS OR INFORMATIONS LAYING TIME LIMIT AMENDMENT EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Events such as amendments to the time limit for laying complaints or informations and events related to government and public officers' protection are interconnected, both impacting governance processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION'S CERTIFICATE DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Secretary for Administration's certificate determination is an event that can affect the Advisory Council on the Environment, as both are related to governance structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHIEF SECRETARY FOR ADMINISTRATION'S CERTIFICATE DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;ENVIRONMENT CONSULTATION COMMITTEE EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Secretary for Administration's certificate determination is an event that can affect the Environment Consultation Committee, as both are related to governance structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT AND PUBLIC OFFICERS PROTECTION AMENDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT COMPOSITION DETERMINATION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Events such as the composition determination of the Advisory Council on the Environment and amendments to government and public officers' protection are related, both impacting governance structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENT CONSULTATION COMMITTEE COMPOSITION DETERMINATION EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLAINTS OR INFORMATIONS LAYING TIME LIMIT AMENDMENT EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The composition of the Environment Consultation Committee and the time limit for laying complaints or informations are both events that can be influenced by legal amendments, indicating a connection in terms of governance processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT COMPOSITION DETERMINATION EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;ENVIRONMENT CONSULTATION COMMITTEE COMPOSITION DETERMINATION AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Events such as the composition determination of the Advisory Council on the Environment and amendments to the composition of the Environment Consultation Committee are related, both impacting governance structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADVISORY COUNCIL ON THE ENVIRONMENT COMPOSITION DETERMINATION EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLAINTS OR INFORMATIONS LAYING TIME LIMIT AMENDMENT EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Events such as the composition determination of the Advisory Council on the Environment and amendments to complaints or informations laying time limits are related, both impacting governance processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPLAINTS OR INFORMATIONS LAYING TIME LIMIT AMENDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ENVIRONMENT CONSULTATION COMMITTEE COMPOSITION DETERMINATION AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments to the time limit for laying complaints or informations and amendments to the composition of the Environment Consultation Committee are related as they both pertain to governance structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-099eacc9afaf5bbbe28a2b0f8d5df40a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
