  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MAGISTRATES ORDINANCE includes a 4th clause that defines time limits for laying information regarding offences."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ddee27cc5f92142cd2814225d68af96b</data>
