<edge source="&quot;AN EXPLOSION OR FIRE THAT—(A) CAUSES DAMAGE TO THE STRUCTURE OF ANY WORKPLACE, OR TO ANY PLANT OR SUBSTANCE AT A WORKPLACE; AND (B) PREVENTS THE CONTINUATION OF ORDINARY WORK AT THE WORKPLACE.&quot;" target="&quot;AN ELECTRICAL SHORT CIRCUIT OR ELECTRICAL FAILURE OF ELECTRICAL PLANT THAT—(A) IS FOLLOWED BY, OR ASSOCIATED WITH, AN EXPLOSION OR FIRE; OR (B) CAUSES STRUCTURAL DAMAGE TO THE PLANT,&quot;">
