  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 4 of 2022 s. 8 refers to the Seventh Schedule for specific amounts in column 1 and column 2."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39a972ad1794d993013818a26feb4894</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
