  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANDATORY PROVIDENT FUND SCHEMES&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer-funded MPFS benefits held in mandatory provident fund schemes may be used for a reduction under subsection (2) or (3) of the long service payment if they relate to the employee's years of service and have not been previously reduced."&lt;SEP&gt;"Long service payment may be reduced by the aggregate amount of employer-funded MPFS benefits held in mandatory provident fund schemes or paid directly to the employee that relate to the employee's years of service."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad13daf2441a168160e4226aa7ac493d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;4 OF 2022 S. 10&quot;" target="&quot;31YAA SECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The provision in section 10 of the 2022 amendment replaces part of what is now covered by Section 31YAA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5c317132f5543388aa4ec358d54fbcf1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(1A)款&quot;" target="&quot;第(1B)款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(1A)款和第(1B)款在规定上相互补充,特别是在终止怀孕雇员的连续性雇佣合同方面。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f27dbcc6e99e201ae8e2112a4a41612</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(1A)款&quot;" target="&quot;2022年第4号第11条&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(1A)款由2022年第4号第11条修订。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3db531f9fed0b652cc40ad79eb2a48c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(1A)款&quot;" target="&quot;金或利益或權益&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(1A)款，某些类型的权益如酬金、雇主供款职业退休计划利益和强积金计划权益不会被扣除。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf0d42aa8ddf0d9c1bf8ce8c4d98678b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(1A)款&quot;" target="&quot;支付长期服务金&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"即使支付了长期服务金，第(1A)款仍然有效，不影响某些类型的权益如酬金、雇主供款职业退休计划利益和强积金计划权益。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf0d42aa8ddf0d9c1bf8ce8c4d98678b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;31YAA. GRATUITY OR BENEFIT TO BE REDUCED BY AMOUNT OF LONG SERVICE PAYMENT IN CERTAIN CASES&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条款涉及长期服务金,并规定了其与某些情况下酬金及利益或权益的关系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3db531f9fed0b652cc40ad79eb2a48c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;31YAA. GRATUITY OR BENEFIT TO BE REDUCED BY AMOUNT OF LONG SERVICE PAYMENT IN CERTAIN CASES&quot;" target="&quot;附表11第5条&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条款提及了附表11第5条,表明两者之间存在相关性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3db531f9fed0b652cc40ad79eb2a48c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;31YAA. GRATUITY OR BENEFIT TO BE REDUCED BY AMOUNT OF LONG SERVICE PAYMENT IN CERTAIN CASES&quot;" target="&quot;某僱員死亡&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条款规定了在雇员死亡时,长期服务金须扣除酬金及利益或权益的款额。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3db531f9fed0b652cc40ad79eb2a48c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表11第5条&quot;" target="&quot;31ZEA.条&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附表11第5条和31ZEAT均被提及作为参考,表明两者之间存在相关性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3db531f9fed0b652cc40ad79eb2a48c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;长期服务金须扣除酬金及利益或权益的款额 (31YA)&quot;" target="&quot;某僱員死亡&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条款直接规定了在雇员死亡时如何处理长期服务金与酬金及利益的关系。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3db531f9fed0b652cc40ad79eb2a48c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ZEA&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE 11 OF 2022 S. 11&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ZEA is related to the addition of section 5 in Schedule 11 of 2022 s. 11."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-54addea578982eb79d7f3048cf09c6a2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;31RA CLAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 31RA clause refers to the employment contract for long service payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e5131fef8ae89d5a0f48b17c1599d19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;31YA CLAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This clause specifies the conditions under which long service payment must be reduced due to certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-54addea578982eb79d7f3048cf09c6a2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETIREMENT PLAN&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Long service payment can be affected by the retirement plan due to potential overlapping benefits or deductions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-54addea578982eb79d7f3048cf09c6a2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITIES BASED ON LENGTH OF SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The long service payment may be reduced by the amount of gratuities based on length of service, as both are related to an employee's years of service."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0b522ee3e92b516e9befd9d3479f215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITIES BASED ON LENGTH OF SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON A&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Person A is entitled to gratuities based on length of service due to the death of the specified employee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person A may receive gratuities based on length of service due to an employee's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a21b404a5b0d354defe8dd03eb692b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f087949a68abbda398ef78592fe5cb12</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITIES BASED ON LENGTH OF SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gratuities based on length of service may affect the calculation of severance payment as per transition rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SEVERANCE PAYMENT may be reduced if gratuities based on length of service have been paid to an employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6ca736f121ac163d07969e939b811f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16880dc0f6b710adfcdbea0c6c5c09ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITIES BASED ON LENGTH OF SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT REDUCTION CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Conditions for reducing SEVERANCE PAYMENT include gratuities based on length of service having been paid to an employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6ca736f121ac163d07969e939b811f0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;31RA SECTION&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 31RA defines conditions under which a long service payment can be made."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0b522ee3e92b516e9befd9d3479f215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITY OR BENEFIT&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A GRATUITY OR BENEFIT is determined by the terms in the CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT, particularly regarding conditions upon an employee's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b66ec28db0dbcb16e24e4d4df0ef35a2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITY OR BENEFIT&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">30.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gratuity or benefit is related to the employee's years of service for which long service payment is payable."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gratuity or benefit is related to years of service for which a long service payment may be payable, affecting its reduction under Subsection (3)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Long service payment is related to gratuity or benefit, as both can be paid in certain circumstances of employee death."&lt;SEP&gt;"The pre-transition portion of the long service payment is reduced by the aggregate amount related to gratuities or benefits that qualify under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-233de206d4d440690ca3d19bf8ddb77c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dabef41d299eda51d77087c2ca170398&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b785a6d2d7fe1aa9d111846965f88378&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e5131fef8ae89d5a0f48b17c1599d19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITY OR BENEFIT&quot;" target="&quot;YAA. 在某些情況下,酬金或利益或權益須扣除長期服務金的款額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gratuity or benefit is subject to reduction under YAA when certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-233de206d4d440690ca3d19bf8ddb77c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITY OR BENEFIT&quot;" target="&quot;MANDATORY PROVIDENT FUND SCHEMES (MPFS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mandatory provident fund schemes are related to gratuity or benefit as they can be part of employee benefits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e5131fef8ae89d5a0f48b17c1599d19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 31YB&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The long service payment under section 31RA reduces the aggregate amount of gratuities and benefits as specified in SECTION 31YB."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 31YB&quot;" target="&quot;GRATUITIES AND BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 31YB specifies that gratuities and benefits are to be reduced by a long service payment, directly linking these entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 31RA&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 31RA is the source of the long service payment which affects gratuities and benefits as per SECTION 31YB."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRATUITIES AND BENEFITS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31YC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both sections deal with entitlements to gratuities or benefits in relation to an employee's death, indicating a thematic relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 31YC&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 31YC indicates that a long service payment made to one individual can affect another's entitlements, suggesting an indirect relationship through the concept of long service payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e1bbd2f99a9b879945f0bc0e8afde73b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;甲方&quot;" target="&quot;乙方&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"甲方和乙方都涉及长期服务金的支付,但角色不同。甲方是接收方,乙方可能是支付条件的一部分或受益人之一。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fb9bafd0cba5b9cfa67282f7c70bf83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱員死亡&quot;" target="&quot;僱主供款職業退休計劃利益&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員死亡可能影响其在职业退休计划中的权益。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fb9bafd0cba5b9cfa67282f7c70bf83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱員死亡&quot;" target="&quot;僱主供款強積金計劃權益&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員死亡同样会影响其在强积金计划中的权益。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7fb9bafd0cba5b9cfa67282f7c70bf83</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱員死亡&quot;" target="&quot;強積金&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
