  <data key="d4">26.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers have a role in handling situations where the death of an employer or employee can impact employment-related matters and claims."&lt;SEP&gt;"The death of an employer is a critical event that impacts the employment relationship and related legal provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The death of an employer or employee can impact the rights and claims under Employment Protection laws, especially in terms of continuity with a new executor or administrator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
