  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱傭保障&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment protection rights are granted to employees under the '僱傭保障' (Employment Protection), showing a direct relation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06d9351b59c3c08e06761abd48f7ff73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱傭保障&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees have rights protected by Employment Protection, which may conflict with employers who might reduce these protections,"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06d9351b59c3c08e06761abd48f7ff73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《工廠及工業經營條例》(第59章)&quot;" target="&quot;第32K條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The '第32K條' (Section 32K of the Factory and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance, Chapter 59) is referenced in relation to employment protection,"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06d9351b59c3c08e06761abd48f7ff73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《工廠及工業經營條例》(第59章)&quot;" target="&quot;6條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The clause '第6條' is part of the '《工廠及工業經營條例》(第59章)', indicating a specific provision within this legal document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7afd3d77979ccf6bd91ad9b535aba7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第32K條&quot;" target="&quot;《僱員補償條例》(第282章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The '第32K條' (Section 32K of the Employment Ordinance, Chapter 282) is also mentioned in connection with employment protection,"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06d9351b59c3c08e06761abd48f7ff73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第32K條&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The clause '第32K條' is related to the rights of employees in employment contracts, indicating its importance for employee protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7afd3d77979ccf6bd91ad9b535aba7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第32K條&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The clause '第32K條' is also relevant to employers as it sets out valid reasons that can justify actions against employees under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7afd3d77979ccf6bd91ad9b535aba7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;21B(2)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;33(4B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both clauses are part of different sections within the same legal framework, possibly related to employment termination conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7afd3d77979ccf6bd91ad9b535aba7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;21B(2)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;72B(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All three clauses (21B(2)(b), 33(4B), and 72B(1)) are mentioned in the same context, possibly related to employment termination conditions under different sections of a legal document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7afd3d77979ccf6bd91ad9b535aba7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;48條&quot;" target="&quot;《僱員補償條例》(第282章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The clause '第48條' is part of the '《僱員補償條例》(第282章)', indicating a specific provision within this legal document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7afd3d77979ccf6bd91ad9b535aba7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;21B(1)条&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entitlement to employment protection is based on 21B(1)条, which outlines the conditions for termination of an employee's contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;72B(1)条&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entitlement to employment protection includes scenarios based on 72B(1)条, which also outlines conditions for termination of an employee's contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;工廠及工業經營條例 (第59章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entitlement to employment protection includes scenarios based on the Factory and Industrial Undertakings Ordinance, Chapter 59 of Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;21B(2)(B)条&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The entitlement is related to conditions under 21B(2)(B)条 for continuous employment contracts not less than 24 months."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINUOUS CONTRACT FOR A PERIOD OF NOT LESS THAN 24 MONTHS ENDING WITH THE RELEVANT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee is entitled to protection if they have a continuous contract for at least 24 months and are dismissed by the employer with intent to reduce their rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f1489ce71ef2c2d18cbecd427f12202</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE ANY RIGHT, BENEFIT OR PROTECTION CONFERRED OR TO BE CONFERRED UPON THE EMPLOYEE BY THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee is entitled to protection if dismissed by the employer with intent to reduce their rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f1489ce71ef2c2d18cbecd427f12202</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER, WITHOUT HIS CONSENT AND, IN THE ABSENCE OF AN EXPRESS TERM IN HIS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT WHICH SO PERMITS, VARIES THE TERMS OF HIS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE ANY RIGHT, BENEFIT OR PROTECTION CONFERRED OR TO BE CONFERRED UPON THE EMPLOYEE BY THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee is entitled to protection if the employer unilaterally changes their contract with intent to reduce their rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f1489ce71ef2c2d18cbecd427f12202</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;DISMISSED BY THE EMPLOYER OTHER THAN FOR A VALID REASON WITHIN THE MEANING OF SECTION 32K AND IN CONTRAVENTION OF— (I) SECTION 15(1), 21B(2)(B), 33(4B) OR 72B(1); (II) SECTION 6 OF THE FACTORIES AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 59); OR (III) SECTION 48 OF THE EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee is entitled to protection if dismissed without valid reason and in contravention of specific sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f1489ce71ef2c2d18cbecd427f12202</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUOUS CONTRACT FOR A PERIOD OF NOT LESS THAN 24 MONTHS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION (32A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The continuous contract for at least 24 months is a condition under which the employee can receive protection."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entitlement to protection is granted under a continuous contract for at least 24 months."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION (32A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The dismissal due to the employer's intention is a condition under which the employee can receive protection."&lt;SEP&gt;"The protection is granted when an employee is dismissed due to the employer's intention to extinguish or reduce."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION (32A - CONDITION A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The dismissal due to the employer's intention is a condition under which the employee can receive protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION (32A - CONDITION B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The dismissal due to the employer's intention is a condition under which the employee can receive protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION (32A - CONDITION C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The dismissal due to the employer's intention is a condition under which the employee can receive protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUOUS CONTRACT FOR A PERIOD OF NOT LESS THAN 12 MONTHS ENDING WITH THE RELEVANT DATE AND HE IS DISMISSED BY THE EMPLOYER BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION (32A - CONDITION A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Condition A of the protection is met when an employee has a continuous contract for at least 12 months and is dismissed due to the employer's intention."&lt;SEP&gt;"The continuous contract for at least 12 months and dismissal due to the employer's intention is a condition under which the employee can receive protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUOUS CONTRACT FOR A PERIOD OF NOT LESS THAN 12 MONTHS ENDING WITH THE RELEVANT DATE AND HE IS DISMISSED BY THE EMPLOYER BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION (32A - CONDITION B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Condition B of the protection is met when an employee has a continuous contract for at least 12 months and is dismissed due to the employer's intention."&lt;SEP&gt;"The continuous contract for at least 12 months and dismissal due to the employer's intention is a condition under which the employee can receive protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUOUS CONTRACT FOR A PERIOD OF NOT LESS THAN 12 MONTHS ENDING WITH THE RELEVANT DATE AND HE IS DISMISSED BY THE EMPLOYER BECAUSE THE EMPLOYER INTENDS TO EXTINGUISH OR REDUCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ENTITLEMENT TO EMPLOYMENT PROTECTION (32A - CONDITION C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Condition C of the protection is met when an employee has a continuous contract for at least 12 months and is dismissed due to the employer's intention."&lt;SEP&gt;"The continuous contract for at least 12 months and dismissal due to the employer's intention is a condition under which the employee can receive protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14c0e0b770ad5a127f415b9e1dc1b2e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISMISSED BY THE EMPLOYER OTHER THAN FOR A VALID REASON WITHIN THE MEANING OF SECTION 32K AND IN CONTRAVENTION OF— (I) SECTION 15(1), 21B(2)(B), 33(4B) OR 72B(1); (II) SECTION 6 OF THE FACTORIES AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 59); OR (III) SECTION 48 OF THE EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;" target="&quot;VALID REASON IS SHOWN FOR THAT DISMISSAL WITHIN THE MEANING OF SECTION 32K&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a valid reason is shown, the dismissal does not fall under protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f1489ce71ef2c2d18cbecd427f12202</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 21B(1)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee's exercise of rights mentioned in SECTION 21B(1) does not require showing that the employment was terminated for a valid reason."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66cccec6ac7d06fb5417245d5fe5f3b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72B(1)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee's actions as specified in SECTION 72B(1) do not need to be shown as having caused termination without a valid reason by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66cccec6ac7d06fb5417245d5fe5f3b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6 OF FACTORIES AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 59)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Actions mentioned in SECTION 6 of the FACTORIES AND INDUSTRIAL UNDERTAKINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 59) do not necessitate showing a valid reason for termination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66cccec6ac7d06fb5417245d5fe5f3b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32A(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;DISMISSAL BY EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'dismissal' in SECTION 32A(1)(A) is related to the concept of an employee being dismissed by their employer as defined in section (4) and further elaborated in sections (1), (2), and (3)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f107e63d68c2fdb52424f9892f32be51</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;續訂或新訂合約(視屬何情況而定)的條文&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer's offer to renew or re-engage an employee is subject to the terms of the renewed or new contract, which must match the previous contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-44e57b1615ed5c8b1f49eb6a6ecd4472</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;續訂或新訂合約(視屬何情況而定)的條文&quot;" target="&quot;合理地拒絕該項要約&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The terms of the renewed or new contract determine whether an employee can reasonably refuse a renewal offer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-44e57b1615ed5c8b1f49eb6a6ecd4472</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;續訂或新訂合約(視屬何情況而定)的條文&quot;" target="&quot;第31J條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第31J條不適用於已故僱主遺產代理人續訂或重新聘用的情況，但續訂或新訂合同條款需符合特定條件。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;合理地拒絕該項要約&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee has the right not to accept a renewal or re-engagement offer if it does not meet certain conditions as specified in 32C(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-44e57b1615ed5c8b1f49eb6a6ecd4472</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RENEWAL&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A new contract of employment may be offered through RENEWAL, altering its terms compared to the previous one."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b8714cccfc72c7380caa9903fb713cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EMPLOYEE can be RE-ENGAged under a new CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT with potentially different conditions from the original contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b8714cccfc72c7380caa9903fb713cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REMEDIES&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The terms of the CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT determine whether an employee has REMEDIES if they are unfairly terminated or not re-engaged under new conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b8714cccfc72c7380caa9903fb713cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REMEDIES&quot;" target="&quot;32C. GENERAL EXCLUSIONS FROM RIGHT TO REMEDIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The section 32C outlines general exclusions from an employee's RIGHT TO REMEDIES under specific conditions related to contract renewal or re-engage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b8714cccfc72c7380caa9903fb713cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT TO REMEDIES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE may have a RIGHT TO REMEDIES unless certain conditions for renewal or re-engage are met, as outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b8714cccfc72c7380caa9903fb713cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RONGXIN&quot;" target="&quot;FORMER OWNER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The former owner is associated with Rongxin before the business ownership change."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1cb0098fa2f01839bce9b10d85c36181</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RENEWAL OR RE-ENGAGEMENT BY THE PREVIOUS OWNER&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSTITUTION OF NEW OWNER FOR PREVIOUS OWNER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SUBSTITUTION of new owner for previous owner is part of the renewal or re-engagement process by the PREVIOUS OWNER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RENEWAL OR RE-ENGAGEMENT BY THE PREVIOUS OWNER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32B(3)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32B(3) applies when the previous owner renews or re-engages under a new contract of employment, substituting the new owner for the previous one."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFER TO RENEW OR RE-ENGAGE UNDER A NEW CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LIKE OFFER MADE BY THE PREVIOUS OWNER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LIKE OFFER made by the previous owner is similar to the offer from the new owner, both affecting employment continuity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REFUSAL OF OFFER BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32C(1) OR (2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32C(1) or (2) applies when an employee refuses a renewal or re-engagement offer, similar to the refusal of the previous owner's like offer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32C(1) OR (2)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 32C(1) OR (2) deals with situations where an employee's contract is terminated, especially in cases of unreasonably refusing the offer from the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1896582b740b6a3f00c9bfa592f3ab2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32C(1) OR (2)&quot;" target="&quot;NINTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both SECTION 32C(1) or (2) and NINTH SCHEDULE deal with the rights, obligations, and regulations concerning employment contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1896582b740b6a3f00c9bfa592f3ab2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS OWNERSHIP TRANSFERS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL/RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Business ownership transfers can lead to employment contract renewals or re-engagements as part of organizational change."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS OWNERSHIP TRANSFERS&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK FOR EMPLOYMENT CONTRACTS AFTER BUSINESS TRANSFERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal frameworks like Section 32B(3) are relevant in handling employment contracts after business transfers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS OWNERSHIP TRANSFERS&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PRINCIPLES FOR CONTRACT MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal principles for contract management are relevant in handling business ownership transfers to ensure smooth transitions and compliance with employment laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL/RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The personal representative of the deceased employer is responsible for renewing or re-engaging employees after the death, impacting their employment status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fbef4b639390d1d66289078a98204ee1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL/RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Renewal or re-engagement by a personal representative can affect whether an employee is entitled to severance payment after the death of their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fbef4b639390d1d66289078a98204ee1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS RESTRUCTURING&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT MANAGEMENT DURING ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Business restructuring can involve managing employment contracts as part of organizational changes, ensuring legal compliance and employee rights protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL COMPLIANCE DURING CONTRACT RENEWAL/RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW PRINCIPLES FOR CONTINUITY OF EMPLOYMENT RELATIONSHIPS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal compliance is crucial for adhering to principles that ensure the continuity of employment relationships during contract renewals or re-engagements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW PRINCIPLES FOR CONTINUITY OF EMPLOYMENT RELATIONSHIPS&quot;" target="&quot;BUSINESS CONTROL CHANGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Principles for continuity of employment relationships apply during business control changes, ensuring smooth transitions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd0ed9e34d0172cc5c8b4ab3e5316192</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32C(1)&quot;" target="&quot;REFUSAL OF THE OFFER BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The refusal of the offer by the employee under SECTION 32C(1) is governed by specific conditions and provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bab69b3c78835240d5782d563ec35c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32C(2)&quot;" target="&quot;REFUSAL OF THE OFFER BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar to SECTION 32C(1), SECTION 32C(2) also governs the refusal of an offer by the employee, with potential differences in application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bab69b3c78835240d5782d563ec35c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFER BY THE NEW OWNER&quot;" target="&quot;REFUSAL OF THE OFFER BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The new owner's offer to re-engage or renew a contract can be refused by the employee under specific conditions outlined in SECTION 32C(1) and (2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bab69b3c78835240d5782d563ec35c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32E(1)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee's rights under SECTION 32E(1), related to the concept of 'related company', are relevant in understanding broader employment contexts. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bab69b3c78835240d5782d563ec35c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE EMPLOYER (COMPANY)&quot;" target="&quot;THE COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'employer' is defined in the context of The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), providing a legal framework for understanding employer relationships and their implications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREVIOUS OWNER (COMPANY)&quot;" target="&quot;NEW OWNER (COMPANY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If both previous owner and new owner are associated companies, the provisions of section 32D do not apply to them as per The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), indicating a relationship where ownership changes but maintains legal association."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREVIOUS OWNER (COMPANY)&quot;" target="&quot;THE COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'previous owner' is defined in the context of The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), providing a legal framework for understanding ownership relationships and their implications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NEW OWNER (COMPANY)&quot;" target="&quot;THE COMPANIES ORDINANCE (CAP. 622)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'new owner' is defined in the context of The Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622), providing a legal framework for understanding ownership relationships and their implications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c28e990fb442886ba69eb65de9d2282</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE triggers the legal obligation involving SURETY(1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af8bb2bf50613f2cddc9c821004e6e7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE triggers the legal obligation involving SURETY(2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af8bb2bf50613f2cddc9c821004e6e7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;EXECUTOR OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER'S ESTATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The death of the employer leads to involvement of their executor in handling employee-related matters and claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;RE-EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Re-employment can be influenced by the circumstances surrounding the death of an employee or their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER OR EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;RIGHT TO SUE ARISING UNDER THE VIA SECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Claims arising under the Via section can be impacted by the death of an employer or employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1edc8d1eae523643c8ff13994558a8c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE EIGHTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;PART I OF THE EIGHTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part I of the Eighth Schedule is a component part that deals with employer's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE EIGHTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;PART II OF THE EIGHTH SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part II of the Eighth Schedule is another component part dealing with employee's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REPEALED 51 OF 2000 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;32H&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Repealed section 51 of 2000 s. 4 affects the interpretation and application of section 32H."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR REMEDIES&quot;" target="&quot;32I&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Claim for remedies is defined by section 32I, which outlines specific conditions under which an employee can seek such remedies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR REMEDIES&quot;" target="&quot;3 MONTHS PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A claim must be made within three months from the relevant date as per section 32I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR REMEDIES&quot;" target="&quot;6 MONTHS EXTENSION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An extension of up to six months can be granted by the Commissioner for filing a claim under section 32I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM FOR REMEDIES&quot;" target="&quot;9 MONTHS PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A nine-month period from the relevant date is allowed before an employee loses their right to seek remedies as per section 32I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;32G, 32I, 32J&quot;" target="&quot;THE RELEVANT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The relevant date is a critical term used in sections 32G, 32I, and 32J to define the time frame for claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE RELEVANT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;2013年第1號編輯修訂紀錄&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The relevant date is affected by amendments made in 2013 as per E.R. 1 of 2013, which impacts the time frames for claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《勞資審裁處條例》(第25章)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner, as per section 32I of the Labour Tribunal Ordinance (Cap. 25), has authority to grant extensions for filing claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《勞資審裁處條例》(第25章)&quot;" target="&quot;JUSTICE OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Justice Officer is an official body established under The Labour Tribunal Ordinance (Cap. 25), which has jurisdiction over the tribunal's operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adb3767092cbae0c3a6518107e6865b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE REDUNDANCY CLAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL CONTRAVENTION CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both clauses deal with reasons for employment termination, specifically legal contraventions and redundancy conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6297aac0b94f77cc5b93128ce6315ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE REDUNDANCY CLAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;32K COMPLIANCE ABSENCE NOT REASONABLE CAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both clauses are part of a set of rules governing reasons for dismissal, though they address different specific scenarios (redundancy vs. compliance absence)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6297aac0b94f77cc5b93128ce6315ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL CONTRAVENTION CLAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;32K COMPLIANCE ABSENCE NOT REASONABLE CAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The clause about compliance absence not being a reasonable cause for dismissal is related to the broader legal contravention context, as both deal with employment termination due to non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6297aac0b94f77cc5b93128ce6315ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;32K&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32K guides the court in considering circumstances when adjudicating claims for employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22d580b5b472939d182c05bf201c52ef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL can award compensation to the EMPLOYEE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL handles claims and makes awards related to EMPLOYEES who have been dismissed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL makes decisions involving EMPLOYEES, including conciliation and reinstatement orders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court or Labour Tribunal may make an award for terminal payments to the employee under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4254cc0d21afce88f6eb9b8c9366f7cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236ae534fe116485f7714d0a24fe4030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc0e662ccd81354d4e411a146aa85d0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL may request a report from the COMMISSIONER regarding claims under the Labour Tribunal Ordinance (Cap. 25)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-236ae534fe116485f7714d0a24fe4030</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;AWARD OF TERMINAL PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL has the authority to make an award of terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1958590510250b6ab53b0fe3e4cc53e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32M&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or Labour Tribunal may make an award of compensation under SECTION 32M if no order for reinstatement nor re-engagement is made and the employee is dismissed by the employer in contravention of certain sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32O&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or Labour Tribunal may make an award of compensation under SECTION 32M even if no order for reinstatement is made, but it can be influenced by the presence of a re-engagement order under SECTION 32O."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or Labour Tribunal may not make an award of compensation if an order for reinstatement is made, as per the conditions in SECTION 32P(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or Labour Tribunal may not make an award of compensation if an order for re-engagement is made, as per the conditions in SECTION 32P(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or Labour Tribunal may make an award of compensation if the employee is dismissed by the employer in contravention of certain sections, as per SECTION 32P(1)(b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 15(1), 21B(2)(B), 33(4B) OR 72B(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or Labour Tribunal may consider dismissals in contravention of these sections when making an award of compensation, as per SECTION 32P(1)(b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or Labour Tribunal may consider dismissals in contravention of this ordinance when making an award of compensation, as per SECTION 32P(1)(b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner for Labour may amend the amount specified in SECTION 32P(4) by notice in the Gazette, which affects compensation awards made by the court or Labour Tribunal, as per SECTION 32P(5). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-852d5344329889ebbea0dad97630dd26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER AND EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court or Labour Tribunal must give an opportunity to both employer and employee to present their cases in respect of the application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT DISPUTES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment disputes can be determined by the court or Labour Tribunal as per legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32A(1)(C)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE's dismissal can be challenged based on circumstances defined in SECTION 32A(1)(C)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2cc0e662ccd81354d4e411a146aa85d0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院或勞資審裁處&quot;" target="&quot;第32A(1)(C)條所述的任何情況&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第3B款規定,在特定情況下即使只有僱員同意,法院或勞資審裁處仍需作出命令。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6485a8e98861158f8d237502e6fe9bcc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院或勞資審裁處&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院或勞資審裁處可作出復職和再次聘用的命令,要求僱主履行相應義務。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1fe911eff5398e571f9ad7003cdfbaa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院或勞資審裁處&quot;" target="&quot;終止僱傭金&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院或勞資審裁處可作出按其認為在有關情況下屬公正和恰當的並由僱主支付予僱員的終止僱傭金的判給。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院或勞資審裁處&quot;" target="&quot;更改命令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院或勞資審裁處有權作出更改命令,前提是信納特定事宜。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd4a36a8d591bd2dfc15340f652a220e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第32A(1)(C)條所述的任何情況&quot;" target="&quot;第3B款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"某些特定情況由第32A(1)(C)條界定,而第3B款則規定即使只有僱員同意法院或勞資審裁處仍需作出命令。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6485a8e98861158f8d237502e6fe9bcc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT OR LABOUR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL must give the EMPLOYEE an opportunity to present its arguments regarding reinstatement or re-employment orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-994a5726bf785617e7fce7f56d8f7b24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;CONCILIATION OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LABOUR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL can request the CONCILIATION OFFICER to submit a report containing relevant information regarding employment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-994a5726bf785617e7fce7f56d8f7b24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both orders are related as they pertain to the reintegration of an employee into their job after dismissal, with reinstatement being a preferred option if possible."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both orders are related to proceedings involving AWARDS made by the TRIBUNAL, with potential set-aside or review implications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2200d76e6cc5397e7868136950dfb19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;CONCILIATION HELD UNDER THE LABOUR TRIBUNAL ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CONCILIATION HELD UNDER THE LABOUR TRIBUNAL ORDINANCE may lead to a REINSTATEMENT ORDER if conciliation is successful."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-236ae534fe116485f7714d0a24fe4030</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;ORDER FOR RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are types of orders that may be issued by LABOUR TRIBUNAL or COURT to address issues between EMPLOYEE and EMPLOYER, with different specific terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f17d41b36a40e80f45f0f635b4ad7eb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32N&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of sums under SECTION 32N does not consider the effect of a REINSTATEMENT ORDER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32NB&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of average monthly wages according to SECTION 32NB is not affected by a REINSTATEMENT ORDER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;SET-ASIDE PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Set-Aside PROCEEDINGS can affect REINSTATEMENT ORDERS issued by the TRIBUNAL regarding awards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER FOR REINSTATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can make an ORDER FOR REINSTATEMENT as part of its decision-making process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee588c56ed96e2cbc4dc5b9474b0fa9a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER FOR REINSTATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 43P PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'ORDER FOR REINSTATEMENT' is defined in relation to proceedings under SECTION 43P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER FOR REINSTATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ORDER FOR RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are types of orders made under section 32N and include variations under sections 32PA or 32PC."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER FOR REINSTATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER (处长)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Executive Officer's written consent is required for an order for reinstatement as stated in section 43S(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER specifies terms related to an EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT, including remuneration and rights restoration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ABSENCE FROM WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER addresses the employee's absence from work as a factor in determining re-engagement terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;REMUNERATION FOR EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER includes provisions for REMUNERATION FOR EMPLOYMENT, ensuring continuity of payment during absences and upon re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;SENIORITY AND PENSION RIGHTS RESTORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER mandates the restoration of SENIORITY and PENSION RIGHTS to the employee, ensuring continuity in these benefits during absences and upon re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT DATE SPECIFIED IN ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER specifies a RE-ENGAGEMENT DATE for when an employee must be restored to their position, ensuring continuity in employment terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;ARREARS OF PAY AND STATUTORY ENTITLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER addresses ARREARS OF PAY and STATUTORY ENTITLEMENTS that may be due to the employee, ensuring they are restored upon re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY ENTITLEMENTS RESTORED BY EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER involves STATUTORY ENTITLEMENTS that must be restored by the employee, ensuring compliance with legal requirements upon re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32N&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of sums under SECTION 32N does not consider the effect of a RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32NB&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of average monthly wages according to SECTION 32NB is not affected by a RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CLAIM&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COMMISSIONER may provide information relevant to an EMPLOYMENT CLAIM upon request from LABOUR TRIBUNAL."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a2200d76e6cc5397e7868136950dfb19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER FOR RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER (处长)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Executive Officer's written consent is required for an order for re-engagement as stated in section 43S(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ABSENCE FROM WORK&quot;" target="&quot;REMUNERATION FOR EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The absence from work affects REMUNERATION FOR EMPLOYMENT during the period of absence and may impact future entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aecc73acec9207974419a084f55bb8c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S ABSENCE FROM WORK&quot;" target="&quot;ALTERNATIVE EMPLOYER ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee's absence is a condition for engaging with the alternative employer, which can affect employment terms and re-engagement dates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5f2987225afe9dd68f368ce40455e94</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA(1)'s definition is repealed by ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32N(4)(D)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA is for the implementation of Section 32N(4)(d), which is affected by ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32N(6)(G)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA is for the implementation of Section 32N(6)(g), which is affected by ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32O&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32O's terms are relevant to the conditions of re-engagement, which is affected by ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32P&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32P's terms are relevant to the conditions of re-engagement, which is affected by ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32PB&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32PB's terms are relevant to the conditions of re-engagement, which is affected by ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32PC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32PC's terms are relevant to the conditions of re-engagement, which is affected by ORDINANCE 21 OF 2018 S. 4."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32N(4)(D)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA(1)'s definition supports the implementation of Section 32N(4)(d). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32N(6)(G)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA(1)'s definition supports the implementation of Section 32N(6)(g). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The order of variation may specify dates and conditions related to section 32NA(1), such as payment deadlines for sums mentioned in it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PB&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both sections are relevant to the conditions of re-engagement, working together in this context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PB&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32PC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both sections are relevant to the conditions of re-engagement, working together in this context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PC&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All three sections work together to define and enforce the terms related to re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aba3b5abf67fe3a7e79ef593d8eff491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA&quot;" target="&quot;TERMINAL PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 32NA specifies that terminal payments are part of the sums payable to an employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR DISMISSAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 32NA includes compensation for dismissal as a sum payable under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER has the authority to amend certain provisions under SECTION 32NA through Gazette notices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9753c3a1c2b341d043e3d787b77e6045</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TERMINAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If no order for reinstatement or re-engagement is made, then TERMINAL PAYMENTS may be awarded by the COURT OR LABOUR TRIBUNAL."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1958590510250b6ab53b0fe3e4cc53e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TERMINAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY ENTITLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The respective provisions governing the calculation of statutory entitlements shall apply to the calculation of terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TERMINAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTIONS 31I AND 31IA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 31I and 31IA specifically govern severance payment, which is related to terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TERMINAL PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTIONS 31Y, 31YAA AND 31YA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 31Y, 31YAA and 31YA apply to any long service payment paid under this section, which is related to terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;不獲僱主提供工作的正常工作日&quot;" target="&quot;每日病假津貼額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这些日子在计算每日病假津贴时会被排除在外。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de9d7bf328eb68da98c29ac72b529085</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;平均工資&quot;" target="&quot;產假、侍產假、休息日、病假日、假日或年假&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"計算平均工資時,僱員放取這些假期不會影響其平均工資。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;產假、侍產假、休息日、病假日、假日或年假&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payments for these leave types are included in wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7243d6ae166cfdb764a13e61a193cccf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;同一僱主&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在同一僱主下的僱員可以參考同僱主其他僱員的工資來計算其每月平均工資。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;同樣工作&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"從事同樣工作的僱員之間,可以互相比較和參考各自的收入水平。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;同一地區的同一行業或職業&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在同一地區、同一行業或職業中的不同僱主可能會提供相似的工作機會給僱員。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f8f159cb841c798f1b18dd22fda97160</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of average monthly wages is governed by specific provisions in the Employees' Compensation Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY OR ANNUAL LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These types of leave are included in the calculation of average monthly wages for compensation purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE WITH THE AGREEMENT OF THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Leaves taken with employer's agreement also factor into the average monthly wage calculation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVERAGE MONTHLY WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;NORMAL WORKING DAY ON WHICH THE EMPLOYEE IS NOT PROVIDED WITH WORK BY THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Days when no work is provided by the employer are included in calculating average monthly wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY OR ANNUAL LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE WITH THE AGREEMENT OF THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both types of leave are considered in the calculation of average monthly wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY OR ANNUAL LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;NORMAL WORKING DAY ON WHICH THE EMPLOYEE IS NOT PROVIDED WITH WORK BY THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both types of leave are included in the calculation of average monthly wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY OR ANNUAL LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;NORMAL WORKING DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These leaves are not considered in calculating the daily average of wages for sickness allowance as they do not involve work or full payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5e29cfe8eddddf302f5a14076a67a7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY OR ANNUAL LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE OF THE WAGES EARNED BY AN EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The daily wage calculation is affected when these leaves are considered."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-84eda1f018d06824b6b2e9602213349f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE WITH THE AGREEMENT OF THE EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;NORMAL WORKING DAY ON WHICH THE EMPLOYEE IS NOT PROVIDED WITH WORK BY THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both types of leave are included in the calculation of average monthly wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a63ef432e83e1ac4184a66b9247423f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE WITH EMPLOYER AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY, ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Leaves such as maternity leave and paternity leave are taken by employees with the agreement of their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TERMINATION OF EMPLOYMENT ENTITLEMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE WITH EMPLOYER AGREEMENT, TEMPORARY INCAPACITY COMPENSATION UNDER EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These are all factors that can affect the entitlements upon termination of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd469871354ff220088ed4c17affde45</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;產假薪酬或款項&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第III部須支付的任何產假薪酬或款項是終止僱傭金的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遣散費或長期服務金&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第VA部須支付的任何遣散費或根據第VB部須支付的任何長期服務金是終止僱傭金的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;疾病津貼或款項&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第VII部須支付的任何疾病津貼或款項是終止僱傭金的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;年假薪酬&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第VIIIA部須支付的任何年假薪酬是終止僱傭金的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;年假薪酬&quot;" target="&quot;僱員補償條例(第282章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"《僱員補償條例》規定了年假薪酬的計算方法和扣除條件,如已支付的款項需從年假薪酬中扣除。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7bf34bf4406f6219987d03f2fb1fb1f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;年假薪酬&quot;" target="&quot;工資&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"工資與年假薪酬之間存在直接聯繫, 工資的計算影響著年假薪酬的確定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7bf34bf4406f6219987d03f2fb1fb1f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;年假薪酬&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"员工在享有年假时可以得到相应的补偿性报酬。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;年假薪酬&quot;" target="&quot;41E. RESTRICTION ON PAY IN LIEU OF LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"年假薪酬的具体规定受到'关于以代替支付为由禁止将某些条文列入雇佣合同的条款'的影响。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;終止僱傭金&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員在僱傭合約終止時有權享有而未獲支付的根據本條例可享有的法定權利,或假若他獲准許繼續其原有僱傭工作或以僱傭合約的原有條款受僱以達致根據本條例就有關享有權而規定的最短可享利益服務年資,則他在僱傭合約終止時可合理地預期有權享有的本條例下的法定權利。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;最短可享利益服務年資&quot;" target="&quot;本條例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據本條例就有有關享有權而規定的最短可享利益服務年資與僱員在僱傭合約終止時有權享有而未獲支付的法定權利相關。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c82c895f7b30d4831c428126a0af9486</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;本條例&quot;" target="&quot; REVISED PROVISIONS &quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The current ordinance's clauses continue to be applicable for claims, rights, obligations, and legal liabilities occurring before the revision dates as specified by the 2006 Year Ordinance for Verifying Employee Rights (Traditional Chinese Medicine) (Miscellaneous Amendments)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5da6949c23456cb6ff0bf575c38285c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;本條例&quot;" target="&quot;第32PA(7)(A)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第32PA(7)(A)條是本条例的一部分,用于规定替代僱主聘用雇员的具体条款。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;本條例&quot;" target="&quot;青年或兒童&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据本条例，对于涉及青年或儿童的罪行有相关规定和保护措施。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-63d24225c9fe2991b4b3b7b5c007e031</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;本條例&quot;" target="&quot;規例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"規例"是根据"本条例"来具体实施和执行的，确保相关规定的落实。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-63d24225c9fe2991b4b3b7b5c007e031</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(3)款&quot;" target="&quot;第(4)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(4)(a) 款提及的資格項目涉及在第(3)款中被扣除的部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f69b51e9b7108cc072600c8e1b97b079</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISMISSAL WITHOUT DUE NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COURT can award payment in lieu of notice for DISMISSAL WITHOUT DUE NOTICE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a47dd87b7de189aa048a8aef9b8e4899</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-ENGAGEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 31I and 31IA apply to any severance payment paid under this section, implying a connection between reinstatement or re-engagement and the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNREASONABLE VARIATION OF THE TERMS OF THE CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;UNREASONABLE DISMISSAL BY THE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Unreasonable variation of terms can be treated as unreasonable dismissal by the employer, leading to terminal payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03e96febd7377c249ee658b10e9575db</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32M, SECTION 32O&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYEE can receive compensation under sections 32M or 32O of the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4254cc0d21afce88f6eb9b8c9366f7cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CROWN GAZETTE&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary may publish notices in the Crown Gazette to amend schedules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-178a551bcbbb140ed32885ff11a760d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;三方協議&quot;" target="&quot;原僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"三方協議需包含原僱主作为一方参与其中。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;三方協議&quot;" target="&quot;替代僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"三方協議需包含替代僱主作为另一方参与其中。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a9d9155ba523e4b47345476918c5dd94</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;三方協議&quot;" target="&quot;更改命令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"更改命令需指明為使有關聘用視為一項遵從原本命令的再次聘用,替代僱主須按三方協議指明的條款聘用有關僱員。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd4a36a8d591bd2dfc15340f652a220e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;原僱主&quot;" target="&quot;繼承人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據法例, 原僱主須在指明日期前向未獲再次聘用的僱員支付款項; 若繼承人在特定情況下成為新的雇主, 他們需遵守原始命令重新聘請該僱員。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e90c2a473a826b49cb3c1eb8a7d8ebc0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;原僱主&quot;" target="&quot;勞動法庭&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"勞動法庭可以作出重新聘用的命令, 要求原僱主履行相關責任; 若有需要, 也可以變更命令以符合新的雇主。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e90c2a473a826b49cb3c1eb8a7d8ebc0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;原僱主&quot;" target="&quot;替代僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"替代僱主与原僱主之间存在雇佣关系的转变,涉及雇员的聘用和解聘。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edb26226d8073f24c3695c26d7ad7c24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee's employment period with the original employer should be counted towards their tenure under the replacement employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The original employer has existing contractual obligations and entitlements with the employee, which may be affected by a change in employment status."&lt;SEP&gt;"The original employer is responsible for paying sums mentioned in section 32NA(1) by the date specified."&lt;SEP&gt;"The original employer's engagement is considered a re-engagement if the alternative employer hires the employee under an order of variation, implying a legal connection between the two entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9b2c9282e23c05c84bef3cbc6edb690</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;REPLACEMENT EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The replacement employer takes over the employment relationship, continuing the employee's tenure from the original employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9b2c9282e23c05c84bef3cbc6edb690</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;ALTERNATIVE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An alternative employer can engage an employee in compliance with the principal order issued by the original employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-420f23bd6d18962ea805d721d98c3ed6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR RELATIONS BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both parties interact through court or labor relations board orders to ensure compliance and resolution of employment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REPLACEMENT EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If not re-engaged within the specified date, the replacement employer must engage the employee according to the order of variation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The employee can enjoy rights based on their tenure at both the original and replacement employers, as stated in the tripartite agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9b2c9282e23c05c84bef3cbc6edb690</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT DATE SPECIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An order of variation specifies the re-engagement date and consequences if the employee is not re-engaged by that date with the original employer or alternative employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5f2987225afe9dd68f368ce40455e94</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;32PA. AMENDMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The order of variation may refer to or be based on 32PA amendment order for specifying dates and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Order of Variation is made under Section 32PA, indicating a legal process and compliance with that section."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 32PA provides the basis for making orders of variation that can treat alternative employer's engagement as re-engagement by the original employer, establishing a formal relationship between these two legal concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;ALTERNATIVE EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An order of variation made under section 32PA can treat the alternative employer's engagement as re-engagement by the original employer, establishing a legal relationship between these entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;REENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The order of variation treats engagement by the alternative employer as re-engagement, complying with a principal order."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;PRINCIPAL ORDER(32N)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The order of variation is made under Section 32PA to comply with a principal order (Section 32N)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;REENGAGEMENT COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The order of variation ensures reengagement compliance with a principal order, maintaining continuity and employment periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S EXISTING AND FUTURE ENTITLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The order of variation affects how an employee's existing and future entitlements are reckoned, ensuring continuity in employment periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;ABSENCE FROM WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The order of variation considers absence from work in determining continuity and employment periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDER OF VARIATION&quot;" target="&quot;REENGAGEMENT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The order of variation ensures reengagement compliance and forms the basis for a reengagement agreement with the alternative employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REPLACEMENT EMPLOYER'S ENGAGEMENT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Re-engagement date is a term that the replacement employer must adhere to when engaging the employee according to the order of variation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7b9a3a57d23c9da8be50f232f54b9af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ALTERNATIVE EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">23.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The alternative employer can hire the employee in such a way that it is treated as re-engagement by the original employer according to section 32PA and order of variation, indicating an indirect relationship through legal terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The alternative employer engages the employee as per an order of variation, treating it as re-engagement by the original employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The alternative employer engages the employee, potentially affecting their relationship with the original employer under court or labor relations board orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee is directly involved in situations governed by Section 32PA and its orders of variation, which can affect their employment status and rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b5f12c8826e21caf6dccd1e4c65cb58</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32PA specifies terms that form part of the contract of employment with the alternative employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;" target="&quot;RECONCILIATION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32PA addresses continuity and absence from work during the reconciliation period for reckoning entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT IN LIEU OF NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32PA considers the absence from work due to payment in lieu of notice for reckoning entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;" target="&quot;RELEVANCE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32PA uses the relevance date for reckoning entitlements during re-engagement processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32PA&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32PA addresses financial obligations, such as payment in lieu of notice, for reckoning entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71350626a55fa7b808223b0a1848a949</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR RELATIONS BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Principal order is issued by a court or labour relations board to ensure compliance and re-engagement of an employee as per specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee's rights and obligations are defined under the principal order, which may involve re-engagement with either the original or alternative employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-11a5ba6a3113013f7678b33327fe6133</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR LABOUR RELATIONS BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT OR Labour RELATIONS BOARD decides on applications for relief related to employees and their employment status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d4769919f14cc0f877d3fa0c4e17e775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION FOR RELIEF&quot;" target="&quot;ORIGINAL ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPLICATION FOR RELIEF is based on changes that have occurred since the ORIGINAL ORDER was issued."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d4769919f14cc0f877d3fa0c4e17e775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ORIGINAL ORDER affects the employment status of the EMPLOYEE, which can be challenged through an APPLICATION FOR RELIEF."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d4769919f14cc0f877d3fa0c4e17e775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;RELIEF FROM PAYING SUM MENTIONED IN SECTION 32NA(1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The relief described in SECTION 32NA(1)(B) pertains to the employer's liability for payment of a sum as specified under Section 32NA(1)(b)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f25bacc107a2662a1a2b75591817ea36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;SEX DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 480)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA(1)(b) is part of the Sex Discrimination Ordinance, which defines sexual discrimination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;DISABILITY DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 487)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA(1)(b) is part of the Disability Discrimination Ordinance, which defines disability discrimination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;FAMILY JOB DISCRIMINATION ORDANCE (CAP. 527)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA(1)(b) is part of the Family Job Discrimination Ordinance, which defines family status discrimination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;RACE DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 602)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 32NA(1)(b) is part of the Race Discrimination Ordinance, which defines race discrimination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-043bc143a4819027bfbd201d7960512a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEX DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 480)&quot;" target="&quot;DISABILITY DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 487)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are part of the legal framework to prevent and address different forms of discrimination, but they focus on distinct grounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sex Discrimination Ordinance and the Disability Discrimination Ordinance are both part of a broader set of anti-discrimination laws, but they address different grounds for discrimination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-889aa8c79dffab2f7d3682d1fe6bfb39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEX DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 480)&quot;" target="&quot;FAMILY STATUS DISCRIMINATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 527)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are part of the legal framework to prevent and address different forms of discrimination, but they focus on distinct grounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sex Discrimination Ordinance and the Family Status Discrimination Ordinance are both part of a broader set of anti-discrimination laws, but they address different grounds for discrimination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-889aa8c79dffab2f7d3682d1fe6bfb39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
