  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are part of the legal framework to prevent and address different forms of discrimination, but they focus on distinct grounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sex Discrimination Ordinance and the Race Discrimination Ordinance are both part of a broader set of anti-discrimination laws, but they address different grounds for discrimination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-889aa8c79dffab2f7d3682d1fe6bfb39</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
