  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are referenced as exceptions to the total wage deductions allowed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdc4a39840a667a7878ee99d632412a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARDIANSHIP OF MINORS ORDINANCE (CAP. 13)&quot;" target="&quot;MATRIMONIAL PROCEEDINGS AND PROPERTY ORDINANCE (CAP. 192)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All three ordinances are referenced in the context of wage deductions exceptions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdc4a39840a667a7878ee99d632412a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ATTACHMENT ORDER MADE UNDER SECTION 20(1) OF THE GUARDIANSHIP OF MINORS ORDINANCE (CAP. 13)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's approval is required for certain deductions, including those related to an attachment order under the Guardianship of Minors Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d4260c7d330eaf337c4690f784c02608</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 9A(1) OF THE SEPARATION AND MAINTENANCE ORDERS ORDINANCE (CAP. 16)&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's approval is required for certain deductions, including those related to an attachment order under the Separation and Maintenance Orders Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d4260c7d330eaf337c4690f784c02608</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 28(&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has authority over wage deductions as per Section 28 of relevant ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d4260c7d330eaf337c4690f784c02608</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S DEPENDANTS&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL BENEFIT SCHEME, SUPERANNUATION SCHEME, RETIREMENT SCHEME OR THRIFT SCHEME LAWFULLY ESTABLISHED FOR THE BENEFIT OF THE EMPLOYEE OR HIS DEPENDANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
