</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEDUCTIONS WHICH ARE REQUIRED OR AUTHORIZED UNDER ANY ENACTMENT TO BE MADE FROM THE WAGES OF AN EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;DEDUCTIONS WHICH ARE REQUIRED OR AUTHORIZED UNDER ANY ENACTMENT TO BE MADE FROM THE WAGES OF AN EMPLOYEE&quot;">
