</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGE DEDUCTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;DEDUCTIONS IN RESPECT OF ABSENCE FROM WORK OR ANY DEDUCTION PURSUANT TO AN ATTACHMENT ORDER MADE UNDER SECTION 20(1) OF THE GUARDIANSHIP OF MINORS ORDINANCE (CAP. 13), SECTION 9A(1) OF THE SEPARATION AND MAINTENANCE ORDERS ORDINANCE (CAP. 16)&quot;">
