<edge source="&quot;UNNAMED ORGANIZATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE SICK LEAVE ENTITLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unnamed organization has policies regarding the entitlements of employees for sick leaves including conditions and calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-635fb659aa7fe54dd44ec966f454cd08</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNNAMED ORGANIZATION&quot;" target="&quot;WORKERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The unnamed organization refers to the employer who pays workers or employees as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a38f5270b24602bceb3522785e4ed41d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;被解僱的僱員&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主可能解僱僱員,並需根據相關條例支付相應補償。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c12a66b5fa9d29ed0b0dc7f747de3d29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;被解僱的僱員&quot;" target="&quot;任何正常工作日不獲其僱主提供工作&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"未安排的工作日可能影響僱員在被解僱時獲得補償款額的計算。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c12a66b5fa9d29ed0b0dc7f747de3d29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第7條終止該合約本須付給的款額&quot;" target="&quot;每日平均款额的7倍的額外款項&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第7條終止合同時僱主需支付的基本款額是計算额外款項的基础。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c12a66b5fa9d29ed0b0dc7f747de3d29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;12個月期間&quot;" target="&quot;每日病假津貼額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"计算每日病假津贴的工资平均额时需要参考过去一年内的收入情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de9d7bf328eb68da98c29ac72b529085</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;12個月期間&quot;" target="&quot;假期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"12個月期間用於計算假期，特別是年假的有權享有的天數。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b1de7cbb89da3f1adf715fabc5ea88cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;12個月期間&quot;" target="&quot;每日年假薪酬額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"计算每日年假薪酬额时,考虑的是过去12个月或较短期间的工资收入。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6957d2ae600df45cdcfeef087031ad45</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;正常工作日不獲其僱主提供工作&quot;" target="&quot;放取任何產假、侍產假、休息日、病假日、假日或年假&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"這些假期和未被安排工作的日子均影響每日平均款額的計算。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c12a66b5fa9d29ed0b0dc7f747de3d29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;暫時喪失工作能力以致缺勤,而就此僱員根據《僱員補償條例》(第282章)第10條會獲付補償,&quot;" target="&quot;未獲付給工資或全部工資的期間&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"因暂时丧失工作能力而未能工作的期间内,根据条例可获得补偿。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c12a66b5fa9d29ed0b0dc7f747de3d29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;放取任何產假、侍產假、休息日、病假日、假日或年假&quot;" target="&quot;產假、侍產假&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"产假和侍产假属于可以申请的假期之一，会影响工资平均额计算中的日子。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de9d7bf328eb68da98c29ac72b529085</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;及第(5A)款&quot;" target="&quot;及(5B)款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"及第(5A)款和及(5B)款是同一章节的不同条款，内容相互补充。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《第599章》&quot;" target="&quot;附表12第2部&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"《第599章》规定了某些情况下无法按照附表12第2部的方式证明病假日的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《第599章》&quot;" target="&quot;严重和故意的不當行為&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"严重和故意的不当行为导致雇员受《第599章》规定所规限。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《第599章》&quot;" target="&quot;僱主为该医疗计划所聘用的注册医生、中医或牙医诊治 (AS AN ACTION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在遵守《第599章》规定的前提下，雇员可能需要接受注册医生、中医或牙医的诊治。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;認可醫療計劃&quot;" target="&quot;療計劃&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"認可醫療計劃是治療和停工留薪期判定的重要依据，由僱主經辦並涵蓋特定治療項目。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;留院病人 (AS A CONDITION)&quot;" target="&quot;认可医疗计划&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"认可医疗计划下，留院病人可能接受治疗或不拒绝治疗的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;留院病人 (AS A CONDITION)&quot;" target="&quot;合理辯解而不理會 (AS AN ACTION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"留院病人在无合理辩解的情况下可能不会接受治疗或拒绝治疗。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;留院病人 (AS A CONDITION)&quot;" target="&quot;僱主办有认可医疗计划 (AS A CONDITION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇员在办理了认可医疗计划的情况下，可能成为留院病人接受治疗或拒绝治疗的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;合理辯解而不理會 (AS AN ACTION)&quot;" target="&quot;注册医生、中医或牙医&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"注册医生、中医或牙医在雇员无合理辩解而拒绝医疗计划下的诊治时可能采取的行动。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;合理辯解而不理會 (AS AN ACTION)&quot;" target="&quot;僱主为该医疗计划所聘用的注册医生、中医或牙医诊治 (AS AN ACTION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在雇员无合理辩解的情况下，可能需要接受注册医生、中医或牙医的诊治。"&lt;SEP&gt;"雇员在无合理辩解的情况下，可能不会接受注册医生、中医或牙医的诊治。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;合理辯解 (AS A CONDITION)&quot;" target="&quot;僱主为该医疗计划所聘用的注册医生、中医或牙医诊治 (AS AN ACTION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇员在有合理辩解的情况下，可能不会接受注册医生、中医或牙医的诊治。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c2430bc80d4a39f49af281f4bcdadcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;療計劃&quot;" target="&quot;《僱員補償條例》(第282章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"療計劃與《僱員補償條例》相關，涉及僱員因傷病無法工作的情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f6a6d424be7f6f190f288a07aa1af339</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1983&quot;" target="&quot;2022年第5號&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1983 amendment ordinance is superseded or modified by the 2022 amendment, as indicated in the editorial note."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6ca8ea4c3347749e50a0bfdf049de28</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1983&quot;" target="&quot;2022年6月17日&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment to the Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 1983 was officially noted on 2022年6月17日."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-94369d11b6a74581ea67e2ddddb841fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2022年第5號&quot;" target="&quot;指明日期 (SPECIFIED DATE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The specified date in 2022第5號 refers to June 17, 2022, according to the editorial note."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6ca8ea4c3347749e50a0bfdf049de28</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BAA&quot;" target="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BAA includes maternity leave in the calculation of wages for compensation purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BAA&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Annual leave is considered in the wage calculations according to BAA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BAA&quot;" target="&quot;NORMAL WORKING DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Normal working day, even without work provided by the employer, is included in calculating wages under BAA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BAA&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY FOR COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Temporary incapacity for compensation due to injury or illness is part of the types of leave affecting wage calculations according to BAA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BAA&quot;" target="&quot;DISMISSAL OF EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BAA outlines conditions and penalties related to dismissal during certain leaves, including sickness day."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employees' Compensation Ordinance is referenced in calculating daily average wages under BAA for compensation purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fef56ddac89c58276c95d49a4ad2fde</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Daily Average Wages is derived from the Wages earned by employees over a 12-month period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dea1924fb64e67aeda866266fbf06fab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;35. RATE OF SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Daily Average Wages are used to determine the Rate of Sickness Allowance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dea1924fb64e67aeda866266fbf06fab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE, PATERNITY LEAVE, REST DAY, SICKNESS DAY, HOLIDAY, ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY, COMPENSATION UNDER EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Temporary incapacity and sickness days are both reasons for an employee's absence from work which may be compensated under the Employees' Compensation Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TEMPORARY INCAPACITY, COMPENSATION UNDER EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;" target="&quot;SICKNESS DAY WITH PAYABLE SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A sickness day with payable sickness allowance is a form of temporary incapacity for which compensation may be provided under the Employees' Compensation Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE CALCULATION METHOD FOR WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;SICKNESS DAY WITH PAYABLE SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The daily average calculation method considers wages earned during sickness days with payable sickness allowance for wage calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-afdf177e9ad5a7628d89b95831acbba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AN EMPLOYER WHO TERMINATES THE CONTINUOUS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT OF AN EMPLOYEE ON ANY SICKNESS DAY TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF WHICH SICKNESS ALLOWANCE IS PAYABLE UNDER THIS SECTION SHALL BE TAKEN FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (4B)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (4BAB)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer who terminates the contract of employment on a sickness day is subject to additional conditions specified in Subsection 4BAB."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AN EMPLOYER WHO TERMINATES THE CONTINUOUS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT OF AN EMPLOYEE ON ANY SICKNESS DAY TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF WHICH SICKNESS ALLOWANCE IS PAYABLE UNDER THIS SECTION SHALL BE TAKEN FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (4B)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (4BB)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer who terminates the contract of employment on a sickness day is subject to penalties specified in Subsection 4BB."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AN EMPLOYER WHO TERMINATES THE CONTINUOUS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT OF AN EMPLOYEE ON ANY SICKNESS DAY TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF WHICH SICKNESS ALLOWANCE IS PAYABLE UNDER THIS SECTION SHALL BE TAKEN FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (4B)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (4C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer who terminates the contract of employment on a sickness day is required to pay sickness allowance as specified in Subsection 4C."&lt;SEP&gt;"The employer who terminates the contract of employment on a sickness day is subject to additional conditions specified in Subsection 4C."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AN EMPLOYER WHO TERMINATES THE CONTINUOUS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT OF AN EMPLOYEE ON ANY SICKNESS DAY TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF WHICH SICKNESS ALLOWANCE IS PAYABLE UNDER THIS SECTION SHALL BE TAKEN FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (4B)&quot;" target="&quot;16 OF 2006 S. 7&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer who terminates the contract of employment on a sickness day is subject to additional conditions specified in Section 7 of Act 16 of 2006."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AN EMPLOYER WHO TERMINATES THE CONTINUOUS CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT OF AN EMPLOYEE ON ANY SICKNESS DAY TAKEN BY THE EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF WHICH SICKNESS ALLOWANCE IS PAYABLE UNDER THIS SECTION SHALL BE TAKEN FOR THE PURPOSES OF SUBSECTION (4B)&quot;" target="&quot;57 OF 1983 S. 5&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer who terminates the contract of employment on a sickness day is subject to additional conditions specified in Section 5 of Act 57 of 1983."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (4BAB)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (4BB)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection 4BAB modifies the application of Subsection 4BB in civil proceedings." "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AN EMPLOYER SHALL NOT BE LIABLE TO PAY SICKNESS ALLOWANCE TO AN EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF ANY SICKNESS DAY—&quot;" target="&quot;57 OF 1983 S. 5&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is not liable to pay sickness allowance for certain days as specified in Section 5 of Act 57 of 1983."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AN EMPLOYER SHALL NOT BE LIABLE TO PAY SICKNESS ALLOWANCE TO AN EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF ANY SICKNESS DAY—&quot;" target="&quot;16 OF 2006 S. 7&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is not liable to pay sickness allowance for certain days as specified in Section 7 of Act 16 of 2006."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;57 OF 1983 S. 5&quot;" target="&quot;16 OF 2006 S. 7&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 5 of Act 57 of 1983 and Section 7 of Act 16 of 2006 both deal with the liability to pay sickness allowance for certain days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ec139f7ebf5b8697a790c183eb4ae20d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
