  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MEDICAL PROFESSIONAL signs and issues certificates under the provisions of the 33A clause."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60efa76430de6c8c3995f39eeee4cc13</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL PROFESSIONAL&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are types of registered medical practitioners who can provide healthcare services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NURSE&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL EXAMINATION IN RELATION TO PREGNANCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Nurses can assist or participate in medical examinations related to pregnancy and may be involved in issuing certificates of attendance for these examinations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF ATTENDANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chinese medicine practitioners can also issue certificates of attendance, especially if the examination is conducted by them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER OPERATED SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered medical practitioners, including those employed by recognized schemes, can issue certificates under certain conditions related to employee healthcare."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER OPERATED SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both types of registered medical practitioners may be engaged by employer-operated schemes for issuing certificates under specific conditions related to employee healthcare."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fcd2a26e931b9fa624c25b0caadbcdb5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL (醫院)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered medical practitioners can issue certificates for recognized schemes of medical treatment operated by employers, and hospitals are involved in the context of such schemes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL (醫院)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered Chinese medicine practitioners can also issue certificates for recognized schemes of medical treatment, alongside registered medical practitioners, and hospitals are involved in the context of such schemes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL (醫院)&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hospitals can be involved in operating recognized schemes of medical treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL PROFESSIONAL (醫療專業人員)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical professionals include registered medical practitioners as one of their categories."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDICAL PROFESSIONAL (醫療專業人員)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are included in the category of medical professionals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;署长 (SECRETARY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary has the authority to recognize or revoke schemes of medical treatment, as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;合理理由 (REASONABLE EXCUSE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reasonable excuses can be a condition that allows employees to avoid certain scheme-related treatments, as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;条例 (ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The recognition and revocation of schemes are governed by ordinances such as those mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;医疗计划的认可 (RECOGNITION OF MEDICAL PLAN)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Recognition of medical plans is a process that can be applied to recognized schemes, as discussed in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;撤销认可 (REVOCATION OF RECOGNITION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revocation of recognition for certain schemes is mentioned in the context of medical plans and treatment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEME OF MEDICAL TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;施行 (IMPLEMENTATION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Implementation details, such as issuing certificates by registered practitioners, are part of recognized scheme operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NURSES REGISTRATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 164)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both registered Chinese medicine practitioners and nurses are included under the Nurses Registration Ordinance, indicating a related regulatory framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;疾病津貼 (DISEASE ALLOWANCE)&quot;" target="&quot; REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered medical practitioners are involved in providing treatments that may be covered by disease allowances under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;疾病津貼 (DISEASE ALLOWANCE)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both registered medical and Chinese medicine practitioners can provide services potentially eligible for disease allowances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;医疗计划 (MEDICAL PLAN)&quot;" target="&quot; REGISTERED MEDICAL PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered medical practitioners are part of the professionals who may be involved in recognized medical plans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;医疗计划 (MEDICAL PLAN)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both registered medical and Chinese medicine practitioners can provide services under recognized medical plans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;修订 (AMENDMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments to ordinances can affect the recognition and implementation of medical plans, schemes, and treatment procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73492d2774f700c9b55459d33fea445f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
