  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The section is amended by the 2007 amendment, specifically in s.10 of that amendment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-50f5783bb484aaac6f6157b8db1e24bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 33(4C)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 35A&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of sickness allowance for Section 33(4C) is governed by transitional provisions in Section 35A."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-50f5783bb484aaac6f6157b8db1e24bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE 1977 AMENDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 35A&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 35A amends an existing section under the 1977 amendment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-50f5783bb484aaac6f6157b8db1e24bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 35A&quot;" target="&quot;1996年第60號條例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 35A provides transitional provisions for Section 35 under the 1996 legislation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-50f5783bb484aaac6f6157b8db1e24bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECORD OF EMPLOYMENT START AND END DATES&quot;" target="&quot;ACCUMULATED PAID SICK LEAVE DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RECORD OF EMPLOYMENT START AND END DATES is used to calculate ACCUMULATED PAID SICK LEAVE DAYS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-323c200d08170c4d996dbd247312e21a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECORD OF EMPLOYMENT START AND END DATES&quot;" target="&quot;PAID SICK LEAVE DAYS TO BE DEDUCTED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RECORD OF EMPLOYMENT START AND END DATES is used to determine the PAID SICK LEAVE DAYS TO BE DEDUCTED."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-323c200d08170c4d996dbd247312e21a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECORD OF EMPLOYMENT START AND END DATES&quot;" target="&quot;DISABILITY BENEFIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RECORD OF EMPLOYMENT START AND END DATES may be relevant for calculating DISABILITY BENEFIT, though the direct relationship is not explicitly stated in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-323c200d08170c4d996dbd247312e21a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;緊接該等病假日開始前&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱員在紧接该等病假日开始前所累积的有薪病假日总数用于计算扣除其连续放的有薪病假日数。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ede40d11dd383fafe8000e746a4c43b7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 33(2A)&quot;" target="&quot;1983 AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1983 amendment introduced Section 33(2A), which is part of the record-keeping requirements for paid sickness days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f5c7df56b94c0c429230f0546be40142</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 33(2A)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (1)(B) references SECTION 33(2A) in detailing the accumulation of paid sickness days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b7ac404a1875f5a77717c1b39619c73d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 33(2A)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 33(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both sections deal with the accumulation of paid sickness days, though in different contexts. SECTION 33(2A) is specifically referenced within SUBSECTION (1)(B). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b7ac404a1875f5a77717c1b39619c73d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 33(2)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (1)(B) details how to accumulate and deduct paid sickness days under both SECTION 33(2A) and SECTION 33(2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b7ac404a1875f5a77717c1b39619c73d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECORD KEEPING REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection (1A) outlines specific requirements for recording sickness days under certain sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f5c7df56b94c0c429230f0546be40142</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT TERMINATION RECORD ACCESS&quot;" target="&quot;DISCREPANCY IN RECORDS HANDLING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Discrepancies in records handling can affect access and verification of employment termination details, especially concerning sick leave records."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f5c7df56b94c0c429230f0546be40142</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE IN WRITING SERVED BY REGISTERED POST&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both NOTICE IN WRITING SERVED BY REGISTERED POST and GAZETTE are methods used to communicate requirements from the COMMISSIONER, as described in section 38."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART VIII&quot;" target="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement includes annual leave pay payable under Part VIII."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;農曆年初一&quot;" target="&quot;法定假日*&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"農曆年初一是法定假日之一，根据相关法律条款规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;農曆年初一&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"农历年初一是按照阴历来计算的法定假日，与公历日期不同步。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;星期日&quot;" target="&quot;法定假日*&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"星期日可能被视为法定假日的一部分，在某些情况下可以替代农历新年第一天的假期。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有薪假日&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAYS WITH PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of paid holidays is defined and regulated by Part VIII, as indicated in the 1973 law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有薪假日&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 僱主 is responsible for providing paid holidays to the EMPLOYEE, as per Part VIII."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1973年第39號第5條增補&quot;" target="&quot;格式變更—2012年第2號編輯修訂紀錄&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1973 law was added by the 1983 amendment, and later its format changed in 2012."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;農曆年初四&quot;" target="&quot;2011年第23號第5條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"如果农历新年第一天适逢星期日，则法定假日顺延至农历年初四，这根据2011年修订后的法律条款确定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;農曆年初二&quot;" target="&quot;1982年第27號第2條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"農曆年初二是根据1982年修订后的法律条款确定的一个法定假日，如果适逢星期日则顺延至农历新年第四天。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f729e4dc4d8c13592d31110960bc5996</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;農曆年初二&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"农历年初二是按照阴年来计算的法定假日，与公历日期不同步。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;農曆年初三&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"农历年初三是按照阴年来计算的法定假日，与公历日期不同步。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;清明節&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"清明节是根据阴阳合历确定的法定假日。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;勞動節&quot;" target="&quot;中华人民共和国&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"劳动节是在中华人民共和国成立后设立的一个法定假日。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;端午節&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"端午节是按照农历确定的法定假日，与公历日期不同步。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;中秋节翌日&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"中秋节翌日是根据阴阳合历确定的法定假日，具体日期可能与公历不同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;重陽節&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"重阳节是按照农历确定的法定假日，与公历日期不同步。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;冬節或聖誕節&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"冬至或者圣诞节是否作为法定假日由雇主决定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1月1日&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"1月1日是按照阳历来计算的法定假日。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;香港特別行政區成立紀念日&quot;" target="&quot;中华人民共和国&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"香港特别行政区成立纪念日是在中华人民共和国领导下设立的一个法定假日。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;國慶日&quot;" target="&quot;中华人民共和国&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"国庆日在中华人民共和国建立后设立，是一个重要的法定假日。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;佛誕&quot;" target="&quot;释迦牟尼佛&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"佛诞是纪念释迦牟尼佛诞生的日子。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;佛誕&quot;" target="&quot;第(1)(DA)款在1998年暫停實施&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(1)(da)款的暫停實施與佛誕無直接關係，但可能影響相關假期安排。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d9186420295a7ef185edec447e7f6b0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;聖誕節後第一個周日&quot;" target="&quot;国际性的工人阶级纪念日&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"圣诞节后第一个周日可能与一些国际性工人阶级纪念活动相关联，具体关系需进一步明确。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;复活節&quot;" target="&quot;公历&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"复活节是根据宗教传统确定的日期，通常不固定在阳历的具体某一天。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6dc88cb5a70d0e4c2d56e0663d5e01f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱主與僱員&quot;" target="&quot;法定假日(1986年, 2015年等)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主与僱员之间可以通过协商确定替代或另定某些法定假日。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7430d09345738519e0c07e81b09c47d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法定假日(1986年)&quot;" target="&quot;1986年第35號公告&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"1986年的公告对1986年的法定假日有明确规定或修改。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7430d09345738519e0c07e81b09c47d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;保留條文&quot;" target="&quot;法定假日(1976年)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"1976年的规定被后续修订所保留。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7430d09345738519e0c07e81b09c47d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE SECOND DAY OF LUNAR NEW YEAR&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The second day of Lunar New Year can be a statutory holiday if it falls on a non-Sunday, according to the statute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE THIRD DAY OF LUNAR NEW YEAR&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The third day of Lunar New Year can be a statutory holiday if it falls on a non-Sunday, as per the statute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHING MING FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ching Ming Festival is listed as one of the statutory holidays in the relevant statutes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR DAY&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Labour Day, being the first day of May, is a statutory holiday according to the statute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TUEN NG FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tuen Ng Festival is included as one of the statutory holidays in the relevant statutes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE CHINESE MID-AUTUMN FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The day following the Chinese Mid-Autumn Festival can be a statutory holiday if it falls on a non-Sunday, as per the statute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHUNG YEUNG FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Chung Yeung Festival is listed among the statutory holidays in the relevant statutes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Chung Yeung Festival is a statutory holiday in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE CHINESE WINTER SOLSTICE FESTIVAL OR CHRISTMAS DAY&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chinese Winter Solstice Festival or Christmas Day can be a statutory holiday at the employer's option, as defined by the statute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE FIRST DAY OF JANUARY&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The first day of January is a statutory holiday according to the relevant statutes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG SPECIAL ADMINISTRATIVE REGION ESTABLISHMENT DAY&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Establishment Day, being the first day of July, is a statutory holiday as per the statute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAYS&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers must notify employees about the granting of an alternative holiday within 48 hours before or after a statutory holiday as per Notice Requirement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STATUTORY HOLIDAY REGULATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (2) AND (2A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection 2 and 2A regulate the granting of alternative holidays in relation to statutory holiday regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1986, 1997, AND 2015 AMENDMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;STATUTORY LAWS AND AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendments in 1986, 1997, and 2015 have impacted the statutory laws related to holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a1f7138b70fc0e22900e2a496ae78b23</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHINESE WINTER SOLSTICE FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;WINTER SOLSTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Chinese Winter Solstice Festival and the Winter Solstice are related as they refer to the same event, with different names."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NATIONAL DAY (CHINA)&quot;" target="&quot;PEOPLE'S REPUBLIC OF CHINA (PRC)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"National Day is a public holiday in PRC, celebrating the founding of the People's Republic of China."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BIRTHDAY OF THE BUDDHA&quot;" target="&quot;BUDDHISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Birthday of the Buddha is an important Buddhist festival celebrated by Buddhists worldwide."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST WEEKDAY AFTER CHRISTMAS DAY&quot;" target="&quot;EASTER MONDAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both First Weekday After Christmas Day and Easter Monday are alternative holidays, often used in place of statutory holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OPERATION OF SUBSECTION (1)(DA)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTIONS (1)(DA), (2) AND (2A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The operation of Subsection 1(1)(da) is suspended for the year 1998, as per Subsections (1)(da), (2) and (2A)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;60 DAYS PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 60-day period is part of the Notice Requirement for granting alternative holidays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOUBLE NINTH FESTIVAL (CHUNG YEUNG)&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Double Ninth Festival, also known as Chung Yeung Festival, is a public holiday in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WINTER SOLSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;LUNAR CALENDAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Winter Solstice can be celebrated according to the Lunar Calendar or Gregorian calendar depending on local customs and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PEOPLE'S REPUBLIC OF CHINA (PRC)&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC SECTOR EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public sector employees in PRC have labor rights as defined by the country's legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC SECTOR EMPLOYEES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public sector employees are entitled to certain employee benefits as per labor regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIVATE SECTOR EMPLOYEES&quot;" target="&quot;LABOR RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Private sector employees also have labor rights under the legal provisions of their respective countries or regions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOR RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Labor rights include the provision of employee benefits as part of employment terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adbe757d90ad335b39fd280c5f650025</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6 OF 137 OF 1997&quot;" target="&quot;SAVINGS PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6 of 137 of 1997 provides savings provisions for the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3046057490626908075c31f88e8c450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 2(1) OF 111 OF 1997 AND SECTION 2(B) OF 9 OF 2015&quot;" target="&quot;S. 2(1) OF 111 OF 1997 AND S. 2(B) OF 9 OF 2015&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These sections are directly referenced in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3046057490626908075c31f88e8c450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 41&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAY PAY RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 41 specifies the holiday pay rate as mentioned in Section 40."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3046057490626908075c31f88e8c450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 12(11)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT OF HOLIDAY PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 12(11) has a condition on when an employee can receive payment for holiday, affecting section 40's provision."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3046057490626908075c31f88e8c450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 39(4)&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAY UNDER SECTION 39(4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This section is referenced in the context of holidays, indicating its relevance to the discussion on holiday pay."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3046057490626908075c31f88e8c450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 40A.1)" target="&quot;LIMITATION ON SUBSTITUTING SALARY FOR LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 40A.1 addresses restrictions on using salary substitution for leave as discussed in Section 40."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3046057490626908075c31f88e8c450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(2)款&quot;" target="&quot;1997年第137号第4条修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision of 第(2)款 in 1997, specifically the fourth article of No. 137 of 1997."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6401943df7f64de20cb83d590f559418</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(2)款&quot;" target="&quot;2007年第7号第11条修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision of 第(2)款 in 2007, specifically the eleventh article of No. 7 of 2007."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6401943df7f64de20cb83d590f559418</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(2)款&quot;" target="&quot;1984年第48号第18条增补&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The addition to 第(2)款 in 1984, specifically the eighteenth article of No. 48 of 1984."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6401943df7f64de20cb83d590f559418</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(2)款&quot;" target="&quot;第(4)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(4)(b) 款提及的資格項目可能根據第(2)款未被扣減。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f69b51e9b7108cc072600c8e1b97b079</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(1)款&quot;" target="&quot;规則&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在第一款中，'規則'指的是由咨询机构依据第98ZM条规定制定的具体条款。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ec40a32e838182a39a402688664a335</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第40条&quot;" target="&quot;1997年第137号第4条修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision of 第40条 in 1997, specifically the fourth article of No. 137 of 1997."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6401943df7f64de20cb83d590f559418</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第40条&quot;" target="&quot;2007年第7号第11条修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision of 第40条 in 2007, specifically the eleventh article of No. 7 of 2007."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6401943df7f64de20cb83d590f559418</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
