  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The addition to 第40条 in 1984, specifically the eighteenth article of No. 48 of 1984."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6401943df7f64de20cb83d590f559418</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDED 137 OF 1997 S. 4&quot;" target="&quot;ADDED 48 OF 1984 S. 18&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are legislative amendments related to the definition and calculation of wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7243d6ae166cfdb764a13e61a193cccf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;假日薪酬額&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Holiday pay is a component of wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7243d6ae166cfdb764a13e61a193cccf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;假日薪酬額&quot;" target="&quot;《僱員補償條例》(第282章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance (Cap. 282) provides legal framework for holiday pay calculation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7243d6ae166cfdb764a13e61a193cccf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;每日平均款額&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Daily average amount refers to the calculation method used in determining wage components, including holiday pay."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7243d6ae166cfdb764a13e61a193cccf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;同一地區的同一行業或職業從事同樣工作的人&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">根據第(5)款，僱員的日平均工資可以參考同一地區、同一行業或職業從事同樣工作的其他人所賺取的工資計算。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14678de8548f803294fa05856c13dfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLIDAY PAY RATE CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES EARNED BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of holiday pay is based on wages earned over a 12-month period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9d14b62c50b2a0a92ac73c8ef0642fe9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLIDAY PAY RATE CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE AGREEMENT WITH EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Leave agreements with employers affect how holidays and other leaves are calculated into wages, impacting the holiday pay rate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9d14b62c50b2a0a92ac73c8ef0642fe9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGES EARNED BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Maternity leave days are included in the wage calculations for determining holiday pay rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9d14b62c50b2a0a92ac73c8ef0642fe9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGES EARNED BY THE EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Annual leave days are included in the wage calculations for determining holiday pay rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9d14b62c50b2a0a92ac73c8ef0642fe9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAILY AVERAGE OF THE WAGES EARNED BY AN EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAY PAY PAYABLE TO THE EMPLOYEE IN RESPECT OF THAT HOLIDAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Holiday pay is calculated based on the daily average wage, which can be adjusted for holidays taken."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-84eda1f018d06824b6b2e9602213349f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPROPRIATE DAY&quot;" target="&quot;FINAL EMPLOYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The appropriate day determines the start of the final employment period, which ends at the termination of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-547fc5c5737727c52b8d88a47acddc1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPROPRIATE DAY&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of an appropriate day is foundational in defining a leave year, as it marks either the beginning or relates to significant dates within such years."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-547fc5c5737727c52b8d88a47acddc1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPROPRIATE DAY&quot;" target="&quot;NOTIONAL LEAVE PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The appropriate day influences how notional leave pay is calculated and defined for employees entitled under section 41F(3). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-547fc5c5737727c52b8d88a47acddc1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINAL EMPLOYMENT PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The final employment period, starting from the appropriate day, encompasses one or more leave years."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-547fc5c5737727c52b8d88a47acddc1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE YEAR&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">21.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ANNUAL LEAVE is calculated based on the LEAVE YEAR, which represents each year of employment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Annual leave entitlement is calculated per leave year based on the period of employment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The concept of 'leave year' does not apply to annual leave entitlement under subsection (3). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e9e62e9c51234e7e58e65ee8d9b2c47e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1ba134cba7bc0ad2b2ef34e757e78d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE YEAR&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE PAY ON CESSATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Annual leave pay depends on whether the leave year has expired or not, affecting when payment is due."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE YEAR&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAY YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Leave year and holiday year are related as they both determine the period during which leave can be taken or compensated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTIONAL LEAVE PAY&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 61 OF 1993 S. 6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amended section 6 defines when notional leave pay commences based on the first day of close down or employment commencement date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed2004c9e59e7e54ef6756f3c59d039a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 41C&quot;" target="&quot;REPLACED 53 OF 1990 S. 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 41C replaces an earlier provision, likely altering how annual leave pay is calculated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed2004c9e59e7e54ef6756f3c59d039a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSE DOWN&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Close down affects the calculation of notional leave pay and may impact an employee's entitlements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employees may be required to take annual leave or stop working during a close down period as specified in subsection (1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c46e076b844c67b6ef12faaaccec1c4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed2004c9e59e7e54ef6756f3c59d039a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSE DOWN&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDED 61 OF 1993 S. 6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amended section 6 references the concept of close down in determining notional leave pay commencement dates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed2004c9e59e7e54ef6756f3c59d039a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSE DOWN&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE ENTITLEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The close down notice does not affect the annual leave entitlement of employees who have been in continuous employment for 12 months or more."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-13c30dec17d1cd754d99b0830f49589c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSE DOWN&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 41F&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 41F governs the notice and conditions related to a proposed close down, which does not affect certain employees' leave entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-13c30dec17d1cd754d99b0830f49589c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSE DOWN&quot;" target="&quot;FORMULA FOR ANNUAL LEAVE CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The formula for calculating the employee's entitlement to annual leave is directly influenced by the closure and relevant days. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c46e076b844c67b6ef12faaaccec1c4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;41AA. 年假&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The provision defines an employee's right to annual leave based on their continuous employment period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed2004c9e59e7e54ef6756f3c59d039a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;假期年&quot;" target="&quot;有薪年假&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"有薪年假的计算周期为任何12个月期间，从开始日期起算，定义了假期年的概念。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d3b06c868aa0e560901379b31f38a6a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第5號第9條&quot;" target="&quot;停業&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第5号第9条,在特定条件下,因提供年假而提议的停业不会影响员工的连续假期天数限制。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9c777bc9929cfa20260878316c3ec4ad</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAID LEAVE&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ANNUAL LEAVE is a form of PAID LEAVE provided to employees under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;12 MONTHS&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Annual leave is granted within a period of 12 months starting after the end of the leave year."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e1ba134cba7bc0ad2b2ef34e757e78d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT REGULATION&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATION AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYMENT REGULATION may be subject to REGULATION AMENDMENT, such as in 2014."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUOUS SERVICE REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CONTINUOUS SERVICE REQUIREMENT influences how ANNUAL LEAVE is calculated over the years of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT TERM&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE ELIGIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee's EMPLOYMENT TERM impacts their eligibility for ANNUAL LEAVE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ANNUAL LEAVE is associated with the entitlement to take leave based on specific conditions and periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employees have a right to LEAVE ENTITLEMENT, including ANNUAL LEAVE, based on their employment period and continuous service requirement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7dbc6cb0d2646456eacee5097d668ff</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PRO RATA PORTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PRO RATA PORTION refers to a fraction of the total leave entitlement calculated over a period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e7dbc6cb0d2646456eacee5097d668ff</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE ENTITLEMENT CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee rights include the right to ANNUAL LEAVE ENTITLEMENT CALCULATION based on their employment period and continuous service requirement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7ea07c8002a487f595524992c8604b6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
