  <data key="d6">chunk-13c30dec17d1cd754d99b0830f49589c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PRO RATA BASIS CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pro rata basis calculation determines Annual Leave Entitlement for Employees who have not been employed for a full leave year."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8f51952a48de0746c8700f0d84b90238</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMON HOLIDAY YEAR SELECTION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are entitled to annual leave based on the selected holiday year by their employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a7a96ed62715f51c591ee8559b48c831</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE PERIOD OF 1 MONTH&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees will be informed of any changes to their holiday entitlements through a one-month notice period provided by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a7a96ed62715f51c591ee8559b48c831</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;41F條&quot;" target="&quot;OPTION FOR COMMON LEAVE YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"41F條和 OPTION FOR COMMON LEAVE YEAR 都涉及僱主對假期計算方式的选择权。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b1de7cbb89da3f1adf715fabc5ea88cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OPTION FOR COMMON LEAVE YEAR&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE YEAR DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The process of determining a Common Leave Year is initiated by the Employer's Option."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8f51952a48de0746c8700f0d84b90238</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;12 MONTH PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot; OPTION FOR COMMON LEAVE YEAR &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">" OPTION FOR COMMON LEAVE YEAR 允許僱主選用一個固定的 12個月期間來計算所有員工的年假。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b1de7cbb89da3f1adf715fabc5ea88cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;12 MONTH PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE YEAR DETERMINATION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A 12-month period is used as the Leave Year Determination Process by the Employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8f51952a48de0746c8700f0d84b90238</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Written notices are to be given to the arbitration body if applicable, ensuring proper communication within the arbitration process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eac62f2f1327a829e40a168eae3df71e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
