  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE CALCULATION METHOD CHANGE PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;LEAVE YEAR DETERMINATION POLICY IMPLEMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The process of changing the Annual Leave Calculation Method is part of implementing a new Leave Year Determination Policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8f51952a48de0746c8700f0d84b90238</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE YEAR DETERMINATION PROCESS IMPLEMENTATION&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE CALCULATION METHOD CHANGE IMPACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The implementation of the Leave Year Determination Process can impact how Annual Leave is calculated and managed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8f51952a48de0746c8700f0d84b90238</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱員補償條例(第282章)&quot;" target="&quot;工資&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據《僱員補償條例》, 工資的計算和支付有特定規定。例如,缺勤期間不計入工資計算中。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7bf34bf4406f6219987d03f2fb1fb1f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
