  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment stop date and termination date are related as they both indicate when an employee's employment ends."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment termination date and stop date are related as they both indicate when an employee's employment ends."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9b6eb32a58d1b44de6c2f126192d169</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
