  <data key="d6">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE PAY ON CESSATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;RESIGNATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Resignation is a reason for the cessation of employment, which can trigger payment of unused annual leave compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT IN LIEU OF UNUSED ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may receive payment in lieu of their unused annual leave upon cessation of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;41AA(8)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;41D CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both clauses deal with restrictions on substituting holiday pay with monetary compensation, but 41D provides specific conditions under which substitution is allowed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;41E. COMPENSATION IN LIEU OF UNUSED HOLIDAY DAYS&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAY YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compensation for unused holidays depends on the holiday year and its duration, affecting when payment is due."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f562ef17ff451340f1810793e3d7491</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;數&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"數字'數'与雇员相关，具体指明了计算年假薪酬时涉及的天数。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;數&quot;" target="&quot;工資&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"数字'數'涉及到工资的计算方式和标准。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;41E. RESTRICTION ON PAY IN LIEU OF LEAVE&quot;" target="&quot;工資&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"工资计算规则与'禁止将某些条文列入雇佣合同的条款'相关，特别是在替代支付方面。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-285c049da04e797b33870a3a643d86c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCLUSION OF CERTAIN PROVISIONS IN CONTRACTS OF EMPLOYMENT PROHIBITED&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 41E(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The prohibition against including certain provisions in contracts of employment directly relates to the application and interpretation of section 41E(2)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YEAR假歇業&quot;" target="&quot;1990年第53號第4條修訂&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision in 1990, specifically section 4, has amended the provisions related to year-end cessation of business and its impact on employee rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;停業通告&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The display of a notice of cessation of business is necessary for the protection and notification of employees who are affected by it with regards to their entitlements to annual leave."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;停業通告&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers are required to display a notice of cessation of business at least one month before it starts for the benefit of affected employees, ensuring their awareness and compliance with relevant regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b4ba9b3e2ec8a01b740be7e7f709ed8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE SHUTDOWN&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may be required to take annual leave during the period of closure due to employer's intention."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc3b1c37f3356b594664179bc904382f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSURE NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are informed of their status through the closure notice displayed by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c46e076b844c67b6ef12faaaccec1c4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORMULA FOR ANNUAL LEAVE CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;RELEVANT DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The formula for calculating the annual leave takes into account the relevant day, which is defined by when the closure begins. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c46e076b844c67b6ef12faaaccec1c4b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELEVANT CLOSURE DAYS&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Annual leave is calculated based on the number of relevant closure days, or exceeds it if the calculation results in a higher number."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e9e62e9c51234e7e58e65ee8d9b2c47e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANNUAL LEAVE PAY RECORD KEEPING REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The requirement for keeping records of annual leave pay is part of the broader EMPLOYMENT LAW REGULATIONS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-341592011806c965a734bf17f63882db</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SICKNESS ALLOWANCE, PAID HOLIDAYS, ANNUAL LEAVE WITH PAY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE can receive sickness allowance, paid holidays, and annual leave with pay according to employment law regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-341592011806c965a734bf17f63882db</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY ORDINANCE (CAP. 6)&quot;" target="&quot;BANKING INDUSTRY (UNDER THE BANKING ORDANACE CAP.155)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While unrelated to employment claims, both ordinances deal with financial matters; the Bankruptcy Ordinance deals with personal insolvency and the Banking Industry ordinance regulates banks."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9277263fe4be5c215993320cc63c410</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY ORDINANCE (CAP. 6)&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAY PAY, ANNUAL LEAVE PAY, END OF YEAR PAYMENT OR ANY PROPORTION THEREOF, MATERNITY LEAVE PAY, PATERNITY LEAVE PAY OR SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bankruptcy Ordinance includes provisions related to the payment of holiday pay and other types of leave payments in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY ORDINANCE (CAP. 6)&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANIES (WINDING UP AND MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 32)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances address the payment of certain types of leave and allowances in specific scenarios, such as bankruptcy or company winding up."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANIES (WINDING UP AND MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 32)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 265&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 265 of the Companies Ordinance defines conditions under which holiday pay, annual leave pay, end-of-year payment, maternity leave pay, paternity leave pay or sickness allowance should be considered wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANIES (WINDING UP AND MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 32)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 79&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 79 of the Companies Ordinance is referenced in conjunction with Sections 38 and 265 for defining conditions under which certain payments should be considered wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANIES (WINDING UP AND MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS) ORDINANCE (CAP. 32)&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAY PAY, ANNUAL LEAVE PAY, END OF YEAR PAYMENT OR ANY PROPORTION THEREOF, MATERNITY LEAVE PAY, PATERNITY LEAVE PAY OR SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Companies Ordinance includes provisions related to the payment of holiday pay and other types of leave payments in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLIDAY PAY, ANNUAL LEAVE PAY, END OF YEAR PAYMENT OR ANY PROPORTION THEREOF, MATERNITY LEAVE PAY, PATERNITY LEAVE PAY OR SICKNESS ALLOWANCE&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Holiday pay, annual leave pay, end-of-year payment or any proportion thereof, maternity leave pay, paternity leave pay or sickness allowance are considered wages under certain conditions as defined by the ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e3b8e5ac9feac4c8c89dafe20af1c65</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDED 53 OF 1977 S. 6&quot;" target="&quot;PART IXA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AMENDED 53 OF 1977 S. 6 is part of the legal framework that leads to PART IXA, which addresses liability for wages of sub-contractor's and nominated sub-contractor's employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-768a2ada446405fddb705e41250aee16</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1981 S. 10&quot;" target="&quot;PART IXA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"1981 S. 10 is part of the legal framework that leads to PART IXA, which addresses liability for wages of sub-contractor's and nominated sub-contractor's employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-768a2ada446405fddb705e41250aee16</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;48 OF 1984 S. 21&quot;" target="&quot;PART IXA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"48 OF 1984 S. 21 is part of the legal framework that leads to PART IXA, which addresses liability for wages of sub-contractor's and nominated sub-contractor's employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-768a2ada446405fddb705e41250aee16</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;28 OF 2012 SS. 912 &amp; 920&quot;" target="&quot;PART IXA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"28 OF 2012 SS. 912 &amp; 920 is part of the legal framework that leads to PART IXA, which addresses liability for wages of sub-contractor's and nominated sub-contractor's employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-768a2ada446405fddb705e41250aee16</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;21 OF 2014 S. 14&quot;" target="&quot;PART IXA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"21 OF 2014 S. 14 is part of the legal framework that leads to PART IXA, which addresses liability for wages of sub-contractor's and nominated sub-contractor's employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-768a2ada446405fddb705e41250aee16</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART IXA&quot;" target="&quot;1977年第54號第2條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"1977年第54號第2條 is part of the legal framework that leads to PART IXA, which addresses liability for wages of sub-contractor's and nominated sub-contractor's employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-768a2ada446405fddb705e41250aee16</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART IXA&quot;" target="&quot;LIABILITY TO PAY WAGES OF SUB-CONTRACTOR'S AND NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR'S EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PART IXA directly addresses the liability to pay wages of sub-contractor's and nominated sub-contractor's employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-768a2ada446405fddb705e41250aee16</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIABILITY TO PAY WAGES OF SUB-CONTRACTOR'S AND NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR'S EMPLOYEES&quot;" target="&quot;43A. 釋義 (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The interpretation provided in 43A. 釋義 (1) is part of the legal framework that defines liability to pay wages for sub-contractor's and nominated sub-contractor's employees, which is addressed by PART IXA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-768a2ada446405fddb705e41250aee16</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;RECLAMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RECLAMATION is a type of work included under the definition of BUILDING WORKS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1766fce0308d4fb774b3b29e83cb45eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;ROAD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ROAD construction falls under the broader category of BUILDING WORKS as defined."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1766fce0308d4fb774b3b29e83cb45eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;TUNNEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TUNNEL construction is a specific type of work included in the definition of BUILDING WORKS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1766fce0308d4fb774b3b29e83cb45eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;SEWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SEWER installation is part of the broader category of BUILDING WORKS as defined."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1766fce0308d4fb774b3b29e83cb45eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;DRAIN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DRAIN work is included in the definition of BUILDING WORKS, which encompasses various construction activities and installations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1766fce0308d4fb774b3b29e83cb45eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;WELL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"WELL installation falls under the broader category of BUILDING WORKS as defined."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1766fce0308d4fb774b3b29e83cb45eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;WATERWORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"WATERWORKS is a specific type of work included in the definition of BUILDING WORKS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1766fce0308d4fb774b3b29e83cb45eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;WORK (工作)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Work includes building works, which are a specific type of work performed by contractors and sub-contractors."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROPERTY OWNER OR OCCUPIER&quot;" target="&quot;ARCHITECT, SURVEYOR, CIVIL ENGINEER, URBAN PLANNER, STRUCTURAL ENGINEER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Property owners or occupiers may engage architects, surveyors, civil engineers, urban planners, or structural engineers for the planning and oversight of building works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0cb98b63e05e5bcca889147b0b338ac8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR employs the EMPLOYEE and is responsible for their wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a160d4a92860e123b37153b47528d3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR(S), along with MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR, share liability for employee wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a160d4a92860e123b37153b47528d3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER has the authority to permit additional time for serving notice and can impose penalties on non-compliance by the MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4c013f3a5fdc373a096e8c9e39e597f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Main nominated sub-contractor may have a hierarchical relationship with superior nominated sub-contractors in terms of work segments transfer and financial responsibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR DEBT RELATIONSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Main nominated sub-contractors may be responsible for debts related to employee wages under certain conditions as defined by 43G clause."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TUNNEL&quot;" target="&quot;PIPELINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are used to transport fluids or gases, as mentioned in Cap 652."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TUNNEL&quot;" target="&quot;CABLE LANDING STATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are part of telecommunication and power transmission networks, as stated in Cap 652."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TUNNEL&quot;" target="&quot;CULVERT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are used to manage fluid flow under obstacles, as mentioned in Cap 652."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER OR OCCUPIER OF PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;AGENT OR AUTHORIZED ARCHITECT, SURVEYOR OR CIVIL, MUNICIPAL OR STRUCTURAL ENGINEER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The agent or authorized architect, surveyor or civil, municipal or structural engineer acts on behalf of the owner or occupier."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER OR OCCUPIER OF PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR (指定次承判商)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An owner or occupier nominates a sub-contractor to perform work for them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT OR AUTHORIZED ARCHITECT, SURVEYOR OR CIVIL, MUNICIPAL OR STRUCTURAL ENGINEER&quot;" target="&quot;NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR (指定次承判商)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An agent or authorized architect may nominate a sub-contractor on behalf of the owner or occupier."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR (次承判商)&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR (上级次承判商)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A superior sub-contractor may subcontract part of their contracted work to another sub-contractor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR (指定次承判商)&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR (上级指定次承判商)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A superior nominated sub-contractor may subcontract part of their contracted work to another nominated sub-contractor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa4e81ff5495fa19b7b8105fa63909b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR OR SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal contractor or superior sub-contractor is responsible for paying wages initially, and may be required to pay if an award is made in favour of the employee by the Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board or Labour Tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5a544f1422493c38b567ef610eadf02d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR OR SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTED WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The principal contractor or superior sub-contractor is responsible for the work that has been subcontracted to them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-26bf6e9b9c68841eec3e4308ce698c89</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORK DETAILS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Work details are relevant information that must be provided in notifications sent by employees regarding wage claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5a544f1422493c38b567ef610eadf02d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE BY EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to permit an additional period for serving notice, impacting the 'Notice by Employee' process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1082e0d73690e2409d13d0dfdf0e64c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE OF A SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Superior Sub-contractors may be notified of an employee's request for wage information, based on legal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af77be8b003511c35b7551f4285bb427</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR may have its WAGES paid by the PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR to an EMPLOYEE, and it can claim contribution or set-off from other parties for these payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bfdf4a9968aec09594f73a07cdf18d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR is involved in paying WAGES to the EMPLOYEE through a principal contractor and may seek recovery of such wages via set-off or contribution."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bfdf4a9968aec09594f73a07cdf18d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SET-OFF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR can use SET-OFF as a method to recover WAGES paid to an EMPLOYEE from the PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR or other superior sub-contractors."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bfdf4a9968aec09594f73a07cdf18d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;書面要求&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Written requests for wage information are a key part of the legal process between employers and employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af77be8b003511c35b7551f4285bb427</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET-OFF&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"WAGES are involved in the process of recovery through SET-OFF between parties, particularly between a PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR and SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTORS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bfdf4a9968aec09594f73a07cdf18d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE'S WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;WORK ON WHICH THE EMPLOYEE WAS EMPLOYED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee's wages are related to the specific work they were employed on."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-26bf6e9b9c68841eec3e4308ce698c89</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTLEMENT UNDER SUBSECTION (2)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE OF WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Settlements under Subsection (2)(b) are related to the payment of employee's wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-26bf6e9b9c68841eec3e4308ce698c89</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAIN SUB-CONTRACTOR OR SUPERIOR SUB-CONTRACTOR'S LEGAL RESPONSIBILITY&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES DUE TO EMPLOYEES UNDER SECTION 43C&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The main sub-contractor or superior sub-contractor has legal responsibility for wages due to employees under Section 43C."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-26bf6e9b9c68841eec3e4308ce698c89</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR'S EMPLOYEES' WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL RESPONSIBILITY FOR WAGE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nominated sub-contractor is legally responsible for paying their employees' wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-26bf6e9b9c68841eec3e4308ce698c89</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST CONTACT WITH SUB-CONTRACTOR'S EMPLOYEES'" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR'S EMPLOYEES' WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"First contact with sub-contractor's employees involves discussing their wages and employment details."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-26bf6e9b9c68841eec3e4308ce698c89</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTORS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES OF NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Superior nominated sub-contractors are responsible for paying wages to the employees of nominated sub-contractors if the latter fails to do so."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79b86e6b5d2c9cc7cc776e8be6a979bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTORS&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTING RELATIONSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Superior nominated sub-contractors are part of the overall subcontracting relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEES OF NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTORS&quot;" target="&quot;SITE OF THE BUILDING WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may be employed at or related to the site of building works, even though their employment is with a nominated sub-contractor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79b86e6b5d2c9cc7cc776e8be6a979bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SMALL AMOUNT SALARY DISPUTE ARBITRATION OFFICE OR LABOR AND WELFARE TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Small Amount Salary Dispute Arbitration Office or Labor and Welfare Tribunal is responsible for resolving disputes related to wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79b86e6b5d2c9cc7cc776e8be6a979bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR(S)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR(S), jointly with MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR, are liable for the EMPLOYEE's wages if their employment relates to work contracted by the main sub-contractor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a160d4a92860e123b37153b47528d3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SITE OF BUILDING WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYEE's place of employment may be on the SITE OF BUILDING WORKS where work is performed by the sub-contractors."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a160d4a92860e123b37153b47528d3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE UNDER SECTION 43H&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NOTICE UNDER SECTION 43H is a requirement for employees to notify MAIN NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR about unpaid WAGES, initiating potential wage claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a160d4a92860e123b37153b47528d3e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPERIOR NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The superior nominated sub-contractor pays wages to the employee as per section 43G, establishing a financial relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-be3c1325ae6d7ddc996c9ba2b65c0d1d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1988年第24號第2條修訂;由1995年第103號第17及26條修訂&quot;" target="&quot;43I. 僱主應僱員要求提供資料的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision of 1988 and 1995 amendments provide the legal basis for section 43I, which mandates that employers must supply information to employees under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14526d01cdd531d1142f16c1d5e43367</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;43I. 僱主應僱員要求提供資料的規定&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 43I requires an employer (who is a NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR) to provide information upon employee request, ensuring the employee's rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14526d01cdd531d1142f16c1d5e43367</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;43G CLAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR DEBT RELATIONSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 43G clause defines how wages due to an employee can become a debt between the main nominated sub-contractor and other parties involved in the subcontracting relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTING RELATIONSHIP&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE RIGHTS PROTECTION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The protection of employee rights is a key aspect of the subcontracting relationship, influenced by mechanisms that ensure fair treatment across different levels and parties involved in these arrangements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;43J CLAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL FINE FOR NON-COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-compliance with the 43J clause can result in legal fines, highlighting its importance within the legal framework of subcontracting relationships."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR DEBT RELATIONSHIP&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL FINE FOR NON-COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-compliance with debt resolution mechanisms can result in legal fines for parties involved, including employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR DEBT RELATIONSHIP&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE PAYMENT DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Dispute resolution mechanisms are essential for addressing wage payment issues that may lead to sub-contractor debt relationships."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGE PAYMENT MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE RIGHTS PROTECTION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Proper wage payment mechanisms are crucial to protect employee rights and ensure fair treatment of employees within the subcontracting hierarchy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DEDUCTION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR DEBT RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment deduction mechanisms can be used as a resolution mechanism for sub-contractor debt relationships under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FINE FOR NON-COMPLIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR DEBT RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failure in resolving sub-contractor debt relationships can result in legal fines, underscoring the importance of effective resolution mechanisms within the broader legal framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Failure to resolve sub-contractor debt relationships effectively can lead to legal fines, emphasizing the importance of these mechanisms within the broader legal framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE RIGHTS PROTECTION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTING HIERARCHY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The hierarchy and structure of sub-contractors play a role in protecting employee rights through established mechanisms, ensuring fair treatment across different levels within the subcontracting network."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR NETWORK DYNAMICS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE INFORMATION ACCESS RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee information access rights can impact the dynamics within the sub-contractor network by influencing communication and collaboration between different levels of subcontractors."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR NETWORK DYNAMICS&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK FOR SUB-CONTRACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The dynamics and interactions within the sub-contractor network are governed by a legal framework that ensures order, accountability, and compliance among all parties involved in subcontracting activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK FOR SUB-CONTRACTION&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR INFORMATION SHARING REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Information sharing requirements among sub-contractors contribute to a legal framework for subcontracting, ensuring transparency and accountability in financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Information sharing requirements within the sub-contractor network contribute to a legal framework that promotes transparency and accountability, ensuring smooth operations and compliance with relevant laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK FOR SUB-CONTRACTION&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR NETWORK GOVERNANCE STRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The governance structure of sub-contractor networks is integral to establishing a legal framework for subcontracting activities, ensuring order and accountability among parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK FOR SUB-CONTRACTION&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACTOR FINANCIAL RESPONSIBILITY MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Financial responsibility mechanisms among sub-contractors are integral to the overall legal framework, ensuring accountability and transparency in financial transactions within subcontracting relationships."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial responsibility mechanisms among sub-contractors are part of the broader legal framework governing subcontracting relationships, ensuring financial accountability and transparency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03a5a03e3846825046c524fcfca7051d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;前判次承判商&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a superior sub-contractor (如前判次承判商) pays wages to an employee according to section 43C or 43G, the employer's legal responsibility for those wages is terminated under section 43K."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;前判次承判商&quot;" target="&quot;通知書的送達&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notices can be delivered in various ways including face-to-face delivery (面交上述人士), which applies to the superior sub-contractor according to section 43L(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;前判指定次承判商&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a superior nominated subcontractor (如前判指定次承判商) pays wages to an employee according to section 43G, the employer's legal responsibility for those wages is terminated under section 43K."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第43C條&quot;" target="&quot;第43F(1)及43J(1)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 43K states that the employer's liability for wages paid by a principal contractor or superior sub-contractor under section 43C is terminated, subject to sections 43F(1) and 43J(1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第43G條&quot;" target="&quot;第43K條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 43K states that the employer's liability for wages paid by a superior nominated sub-contractor under section 43G is terminated, subject to sections 43F(1) and 43J(1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;通知書的送達&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notices can be delivered by leaving at the usual address, last known residence or business address of the employer (留在上述人士的通常地址、最後為人所知住址或營業地址), which applies to the employer according to section 43L(1)(b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;通知書的送達&quot;" target="&quot;以掛號郵遞方式寄往上述人士(B)段所提述的任何地址&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notices can be delivered by registered mail (以掛號郵遞方式寄往上述人士), which applies to the employer according to section 43L(1)(c). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;通知書的送達&quot;" target="&quot;留於該處所之日送達&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notices are considered delivered on the day they are left at a specified address (留於該處所之日送達), which applies to all recipients according to section 43L(2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b14e71147144e9b2f455f7918c813637</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTERED POST&quot;" target="&quot;LAST KNOWN RESIDENCE OR PLACE OF BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documents can be served by registered post to a receiving party's last known residence or place of business, as specified in subsection (3)(a)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2010年第9號第4條&quot;" target="&quot;LABOUR TRIBUNAL, MINOR EMPLOYMENT CLAIMS ADJUDICATION BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment from the law of 2010 No.9 Article 4 introduces Part IXB concerning offences related to payments by employers as determined by Labour Tribunal or Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-93a1fe97f228ec755ced3c31d6506c86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;劳资审裁处司法常务主任&quot;" target="&quot;小额薪酬索偿仲裁处案务主任&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"两者都是在不同部门担任类似职务的官员，负责处理相关案件。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14c658fc7f9efe67addd18c3054ce6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;判令 (AWARD)&quot;" target="&quot;指明权利 (SPECIFIED ENTITLEMENT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"两者都是处理劳动争议时的关键要素，前者是最终决定形式，后者则是具体权益内容的定义。"&lt;SEP&gt;"判令和指明权利都与劳资纠纷中的薪酬索偿有关，是裁决或裁定的具体内容。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14c658fc7f9efe67addd18c3054ce6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;判令 (AWARD)&quot;" target="&quot;第IXB部的释义 (DEFINITIONS IN PART IXB)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在劳资审裁处，判令是根据法律条款做出的具体决定或裁定；而在小额薪酬索偿仲裁处，则称为裁定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14c658fc7f9efe67addd18c3054ce6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;判令 (AWARD)&quot;" target="&quot;主任 (REGISTRAR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"负责做出裁决或裁定的官员角色在不同部门中具有相似的功能，即根据法律条款确定具体的判决结果。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14c658fc7f9efe67addd18c3054ce6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;指明权利 (SPECIFIED ENTITLEMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;第IXB部的释义 (DEFINITIONS IN PART IXB)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"指明权利是根据法律条款确定的具体权益，包括工资、年终酬金等。这些定义共同构成了劳资纠纷处理的基础。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14c658fc7f9efe67addd18c3054ce6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;指明权利 (SPECIFIED ENTITLEMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;主任 (REGISTRAR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"负责解释和执行具体权益定义的角色，在劳资审裁处或小额薪酬索偿仲裁处都至关重要，确保法律条款得到正确应用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14c658fc7f9efe67addd18c3054ce6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第IXB部的释义 (DEFINITIONS IN PART IXB)&quot;" target="&quot;主任 (REGISTRAR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第IXB部分定义了负责处理案件的不同官员角色和职责范围。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14c658fc7f9efe67addd18c3054ce6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL FOR WAGE DISPUTES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are types of tribunals mentioned in the text, with LABOR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL being broader and SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL FOR WAGE DISPUTES being a specific type within it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b27a008edb9bce1c0b390190fc14d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOR AND INDUSTRIAL RELATIONS TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT TERMINATION COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The tribunal deals with compensation for the termination of employment contracts, which is relevant to EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT TERMINATION COMPENSATION mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b27a008edb9bce1c0b390190fc14d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL FOR WAGE DISPUTES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT TERMINATION COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are tribunals that can handle disputes related to employment contracts, including termination compensation, though SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL FOR WAGE DISPUTES is more specific in its scope."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b27a008edb9bce1c0b390190fc14d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRAR OF LABOUR TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registrar of Labour Tribunal is the official who makes decisions for the tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d4bd265e2aa3d3a8af55fbca1b13963</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRAR OF MINOR EMPLOYMENT CLAIMS ADJUDICATION BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registrar of Minor Employment Claims Adjudication Board is the official who makes decisions for this specific tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d4bd265e2aa3d3a8af55fbca1b13963</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The offense under Section 43P is presumed to be attributable to any neglect on the part of a partner if it's proved that at the time, they knew or ought to have known that an award made by the tribunal had been made against the firm."&lt;SEP&gt;"The offense under Section 43P is presumed to have been committed with the consent or connivance attributable to any neglect on the part of a partner if it's proved that at the time, the partner knew or ought to have known that an award made by the tribunal had been made against the firm."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;JUSTICE OFFICER (司法常務官)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Justice officers can be involved in the certification of documents related to tribunal proceedings, which are crucial for legal procedures under Section 43P."&lt;SEP&gt;"Justice officers play a role in certifying tribunal awards and documents related to offences under Section 43P, ensuring the integrity of legal processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF LAW (法院)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tribunals and courts work together in the legal process for offences under Section 43P, with tribunals making initial determinations that can be reviewed by higher courts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;AWARD OF TRIBUNAL IN RESPECT OF WHICH THE OFFENCE WAS COMMITTED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tribunal awards are crucial in determining the guilt or innocence of offences under Section 43P, as they provide evidence that can be used in court proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both TRIBUNAL and COURT are involved in proceedings, with documents related to either entity being considered as specified document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;PRELIMINARY ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Preliminary orders are issued by the arbitral tribunal and expire after 20 days unless modified or replaced with an interim measure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4667827d445ebb505094eb4b58494cea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The tribunal is the central authority in arbitration proceedings, with jurisdiction over disputes and power to rule on pleas of lack of jurisdiction or exceeding scope."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f295ffb815631fda7aa87257db86215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT SPECIFIED IN ARTICLE 6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a plea regarding the tribunal's jurisdiction is raised as a preliminary question, the court specified in Article 6 can decide the matter without appeal after receiving notice of that ruling from the arbitral tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f295ffb815631fda7aa87257db86215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal has the authority to order temporary measures before issuing a final award on disputes, which are short-term actions taken by parties as directed by the tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f295ffb815631fda7aa87257db86215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;PRELIMINARY QUESTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal has the power to rule on preliminary questions, such as its own jurisdiction, which are raised during arbitration proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f295ffb815631fda7aa87257db86215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;FINAL AWARD ON DISPUTES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The final award is issued by the arbitral tribunal after considering all disputes and pleas related to jurisdiction or authority of the tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f295ffb815631fda7aa87257db86215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGES OR ANY OTHER SUM PAYABLE UNDER SECTION 23, 24 OR 25&quot;" target="&quot;END OF YEAR PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are types of payments that can be part of an award in a tribunal case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d4bd265e2aa3d3a8af55fbca1b13963</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 23, 24 OR 25&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement includes wages or any other sum payable under section 23, 24 or 25."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PART IIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement covers end of year payment payable under Part IIA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PART IIIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement covers paternity leave pay payable under Part IIIA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PART VII&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement encompasses sickness allowance or sum payable under Part VII."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PART VIIIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement covers holiday pay payable under Part VIIIA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUM MENTIONED IN SECTION 32NA(1)(A)(I)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The sum mentioned in section 32NA(1)(a)(i) is part of the entitlements covered by the definition of 'entitlement'."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32O, 32M(2), AND 32P&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement includes terminal payments and compensation payable under sections 32O, 32M(2), and section 32P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;UNREASONABLE VARIATION OF THE TERMS OF THAT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement can be affected by the unreasonable variation of the terms of an employee's contract under section 32O."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;TERMINATION OF THE EMPLOYEE'S CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlements are awarded upon termination of employment as per section 32O."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENTITLEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REINSTATEMENT OR RE-ENGAGEMENT ORDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Entitlement includes sums payable under reinstatement or re-engagement orders made under section 32N (as varied)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART IIA&quot;" target="&quot;END OF YEAR PAYMENT OR PROPORTION THEREOF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part IIA may apply and determine the conditions for end-of-year payments or proportions thereof."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6cdefd54629d3267d124166ba92131ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32NA(1)(A)(I)&quot;" target="&quot;SUM MENTIONED IN SECTION 32NA(1)(A)(I)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The sum mentioned in the same clause is directly related to entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1c30b39b26dc22df210f2ea63b93552</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2010年第9號條例 (EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE AMENDMENT NO. 9 OF 2010)&quot;" target="&quot;生效日期 (COMMENCEMENT DATE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment is related to the commencement date, which is specified as October 29, 2010."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f6302661df10aad972a6e63a05f0aa6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCTOBER 29, 2010&quot;" target="&quot;生效日期 (COMMENCEMENT DATE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The text explicitly states that the commencement date is October 29, 2010."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f6302661df10aad972a6e63a05f0aa6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;生效日期/COMMENCEMENT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;《2010年僱傭(修訂)條例》/EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2010&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term '生效日期' refers to the date on which the '2010年僱傭(修訂)條例' comes into operation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-93f4d21b8a3685a0451d126a19e9d5b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;生效日期/COMMENCEMENT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;$350,000/FINE OF $350,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term '生效日期' is associated with the fine of $350,000 for non-payment as it specifies when this penalty applies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-93f4d21b8a3685a0451d126a19e9d5b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;生效日期/COMMENCEMENT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;监禁3年/IMPRISONMENT FOR THREE YEARS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term '生效日期' is linked to the imprisonment of three years as a consequence of not paying according to an award after its implementation date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-93f4d21b8a3685a0451d126a19e9d5b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT ORDER PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A court order payment has a specified compensation date that must be adhered to, otherwise penalties apply."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT ORDER PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Court order payments are related to employment rights as they ensure the payment of amounts due under certain rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2bd97dc6398909a1c1fef16b0ff6406a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL AWARD&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER COMMITMENT OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TRIBUNAL AWARD specifies conditions that, if not met by the employer, constitute an EMPLOYER COMMITMENT OFFENSE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b797e4b1aa3d7cb527163dd9230cfd06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIBUNAL AWARD&quot;" target="&quot;INSTALMENT OR PART OF INSTALMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TRIBUNAL AWARD may include payments by instalments or parts thereof as specified entitlements under the award."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b797e4b1aa3d7cb527163dd9230cfd06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER COMMITMENT OFFENSE&quot;" target="&quot;$350,000 FINE AND 3 YEARS IMPRISONMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EMPLOYER COMMITMENT OFFENSE results in a fine of $350,000 and imprisonment for 3 years."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b797e4b1aa3d7cb527163dd9230cfd06</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 43P&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court is responsible for prosecuting offences under Section 43P and determining guilt based on evidence presented."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 43P&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE (初审法院)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The initial court handles cases involving offences under Section 43P and determines whether to proceed with further legal actions or dismiss the case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;董事、合夥人等的法律责任&quot;" target="&quot;商号的管理人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both entities deal with legal responsibilities of individuals involved in corporate or partnership settings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-13ee9a92c0574802dd2767b6923aabc1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;商號&quot;" target="&quot;董事、經理、秘書或其他類似的人員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"商號的管理涉及其董事、經理、秘書或其他類似人員,這些人在某些情況下可能同意或縱容違法行為。此外,他們也可能因疏忽而被視為犯了相同罪行。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa12a0d33858fa1c978c751c1c56644d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;商號&quot;" target="&quot;第43P條所訂罪行&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據法律規定,商號及其管理人員可能因為特定情況下的違法行為而受到追究。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa12a0d33858fa1c978c751c1c56644d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;董事、經理、秘書或其他類似的人員&quot;" target="&quot;第43P條所訂罪行&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據法律規定,這些人在特定情況下可能同意、縱容違法行為或者因疏忽而被視為犯了相同罪行。"&lt;SEP&gt;"根據法律規定,這些人在特定情況下可能同意、縱容違法行為或者因疏忽而被視為犯了相同罪行。這表明他們之間存在密切相關性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa12a0d33858fa1c978c751c1c56644d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;董事、經理、秘書或其他類似的人員&quot;" target="&quot;商號的任何其他合夥人或涉及管理的人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據法律規定,這些人在特定情況下可能同意、縱容違法行為或者因疏忽而被視為犯了相同罪行。這表明他們之間存在密切相關性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa12a0d33858fa1c978c751c1c56644d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第43P條所訂罪行&quot;" target="&quot;商號的任何其他合夥人或涉及管理的人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據法律規定,這些人在特定情況下可能同意、縱容違法行為或者因疏忽而被視為犯了相同罪行。"&lt;SEP&gt;"根據法律規定,這些人在特定情況下可能同意、縱容違法行為或者因疏忽而被視為犯了相同罪行。這表明他們之間存在密切相關性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-aa12a0d33858fa1c978c751c1c56644d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANAGER&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles can be held responsible for the offenses of a body corporate under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANAGER&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles can be held responsible for the offenses of a body corporate or firm under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANAGER&quot;" target="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Managers and partners in a firm share similar legal responsibilities as described above."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANAGER&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER PARTNER IN THE FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles can be held responsible for the offenses of their firm under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANAGER&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON CONCERNED IN THE MANAGEMENT OF THE FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Managers and persons concerned in management share similar legal responsibilities as described above."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER PARTNER IN THE FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles can be held responsible for the offenses of their firm under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The offense under Section 43P is presumed to have been committed with the consent or connivance of any other partner if it's proved that at the time, the partner was concerned in the management of the firm."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-effb99400ad285817b5c201e84a15ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 43P&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A partner in a firm is presumed to have committed the offence with consent, connivance, or due to neglect if they were involved in managing the firm at the time of the offence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;NEGLECT ON PART OF PARTNER IN FIRM (其他合伙人或任何其他管理该公司的人员)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A partner in a firm can be involved in the offence through their management responsibilities, including potential negligence or connivance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;CORPORATE GOVERNANCE (公司治理)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Corporate governance principles may affect how partners in firms operate and manage their responsibilities, potentially influencing the offences they might commit or be involved with under Section 43P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Directors and partners in a firm share similar legal responsibilities as described above."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Secretaries and partners in a firm share similar legal responsibilities as described above."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTNER IN A FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON CONCERNED IN THE MANAGEMENT OF THE FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Partners and persons concerned in management share similar legal responsibilities as described above."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OTHER PARTNER IN THE FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles can be held responsible for the offenses of their firm under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OTHER PARTNER IN THE FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles can be held responsible for the offenses of their firm under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OTHER PARTNER IN THE FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON CONCERNED IN THE MANAGEMENT OF THE FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both roles can be held responsible for the offenses of their firm under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 43P&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR, MANAGER, SECRETARY OR OTHER SIMILAR OFFICER—OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate can be involved in committing an offence under Section 43P if they are concerned in its management or knew about a tribunal award against it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 43P&quot;" target="&quot;AWARD OF TRIBUNAL IN RESPECT OF WHICH THE OFFENCE WAS COMMITTED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The award of a tribunal is relevant to determining whether an offence under Section 43P was committed with consent, connivance or due to neglect."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 43P&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE (初审法院)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The initial court is responsible for determining the guilt or innocence in cases involving offences under Section 43P, which can lead to further legal proceedings if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR, MANAGER, SECRETARY OR OTHER SIMILAR OFFICER—OF THE BODY CORPORATE&quot;" target="&quot;CORPORATE GOVERNANCE (公司治理)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Corporate governance can impact the management responsibilities of officers within a body corporate, which are relevant to offences under Section 43P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESUMPTION UNDER SUBSECTION (3) OR (4)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL PRESUMPTION (法律推定)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal presumptions are used to establish guilt in cases where direct evidence may not be available, such as under subsections 3 and 4 of Section 43P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT (首述文件)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL DOCUMENT CERTIFICATION PROCESS (文件核證程序)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal document certification processes are used to verify the authenticity of documents, which is essential in court proceedings under Section 43P and 43R."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUSTICE OFFICER (司法常務官)&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF LAW (法院)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Justice officers work with courts in the legal process for offences under Section 43P, providing necessary certifications and documentation to support court proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR OF TRIBUNAL (審裁處的主任)&quot;" target="&quot;COURT PROCEEDING UNDER SECTION 43P AND 43R&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The director of the tribunal is involved in proceedings related to offences under Section 43P and can certify documents for these legal processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR OF TRIBUNAL (審裁處的主任)&quot;" target="&quot;CORPORATE GOVERNANCE (公司治理)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Corporate governance principles can influence the actions and decisions made by tribunal directors, who are responsible for overseeing legal processes under Section 43P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF LAW (法院)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL OFFICER (法律官员)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts rely on legal officers for guidance and support during the prosecution of offences, including those under Section 43P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF LAW (法院)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL DOCUMENT CERTIFICATION PROCESS (文件核證程序)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal document certification processes are integral in ensuring the authenticity of documents used in court proceedings for offences under Section 43P, maintaining the integrity of legal procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE (初审法院)&quot;" target="&quot;APPEALS COURT (上诉法院)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appeals courts review decisions made by initial courts, including those related to offences under Section 43P, ensuring that legal proceedings are fair and just."&lt;SEP&gt;"The initial court may refer cases to higher courts like the appeals court for further review if there are disputes over legal proceedings under Section 43P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-570101da2940bef859df7e44c939408a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESIDING OFFICER OF THE TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The presiding officer of the tribunal is involved in making judgments that affect court procedures and evidence acceptance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bf4100b4fcbad386ad1781e51770f26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESIDING OFFICER OF THE TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;JUDICIAL COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both the presiding officer of the tribunal and judicial commissioners are key figures in conducting judicial proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bf4100b4fcbad386ad1781e51770f26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUDICIAL COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Judicial commissioners are also involved in judicial proceedings, similar to the role of the presiding officer regarding document authenticity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bf4100b4fcbad386ad1781e51770f26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court must accept specified documents as evidence without further proof unless contradicted, and these documents include claims submitted to the tribunal or orders made by it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0bf4100b4fcbad386ad1781e51770f26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST-MENTIONED DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FIRST-MENTIONED DOCUMENT" refers to a copy of "SPECIFIED DOCUMENT", which are both important in the context of legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRESIDENT OF THE TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court must consider the certificate issued by the President of the Tribunal or its representative as evidence without further proof."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION UNDER SECTIONS 32PA AND 32PC&quot;" target="&quot;REINSTATEMENT ORDER OR RE-EMPLOYMENT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Applications under Sections 32PA and 32PC can lead to decisions on reinstatement or re-employment orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e830aa0329b87250f2426040cef8661</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;司法常務官&quot;" target="&quot;再次聘用的命令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"司法常務官与再次聘用的命令相关，涉及发出证明书以指明事实。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdbfe84655d9fdb85d6dbec5df3b3bf3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;司法常務官&quot;" target="&quot;复职的命令&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"司法常務官与复职的命令相关，涉及发出证明书以指明事实。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bdbfe84655d9fdb85d6dbec5df3b3bf3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;再次聘用的命令&quot;" target="&quot;復職的最後日期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"再次聘用的命令指明了僱員未獲按特定條件復職的情況,並規定支付相關款項。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1fe911eff5398e571f9ad7003cdfbaa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;再次聘用的命令&quot;" target="&quot;工作性質&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"再次聘用的命令指明了工作的性質、報酬及相關權利和特權。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1fe911eff5398e571f9ad7003cdfbaa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 43P PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE ISSUED BY REGISTRAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certificate issued by the registrar is relevant and admissible in evidence for proceedings under SECTION 43P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f09b62cc9d4b821cc4d9de53b398e431</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTRAR OF A TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRAR OF A COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The REGISTRAR OF A TRIBUNAL and the REGISTRAR OF A COURT both issue certificates that are admissible in evidence under section 43P proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTRAR OF A COURT&quot;" target="&quot;HIGH COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registrar of the High Court is a specific type of registrar mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTRAR OF A COURT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF FINAL APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Registrar of the Court of Final Appeal is another specific type of registrar mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4649bb5ab39a6d3abacb660b72c2b5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AWARD OF THE TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CLAIMANTS receive awards from the TRIBUNAL, which may be subject to payment or set-aside proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6778be16322ee3f645a000f95b6d6e2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1984年第48號第24條&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's consent is required for the implementation of certain provisions as indicated by '由1984年第48號第24條修訂', showing a legal and administrative relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de69b2333ff7d9bb2dd79e072a634503</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORMAT CHANGES—2015年第3號編輯修訂紀錄&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's role is integral to the process of making changes as indicated by 'Format changes—2015年第3號編輯修訂紀錄', showing a direct involvement in administrative procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de69b2333ff7d9bb2dd79e072a634503</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONS OF SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner's consent for certain actions is required, which impacts the CONDITIONS OF SERVICE as indicated by '由1984年第48號第24條修訂', showing a legal and administrative relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de69b2333ff7d9bb2dd79e072a634503</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGES AND WAGE PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;END OF YEAR PAYMENT OR PROPORTION THEREOF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms relate to financial conditions of employment and may be applicable in different scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6cdefd54629d3267d124166ba92131ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE PERIOD FOR TERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The notice period for termination is a condition that must be specified within the employment contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6cdefd54629d3267d124166ba92131ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTELLIGIBLE METHOD OF COMMUNICATION&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL REQUIREMENTS AND COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An intelligible method of communication ensures compliance with legal requirements, especially in providing necessary information to employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6cdefd54629d3267d124166ba92131ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INFORMATION PROVISION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE IN WRITING CONTAINING CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The process of providing information includes delivering a notice in writing containing specific employment conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6cdefd54629d3267d124166ba92131ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT SIGNING PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LEGISLATION COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both processes are crucial for ensuring compliance with employment legislation, especially when formal contracts are involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6cdefd54629d3267d124166ba92131ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEDURAL REQUIREMENTS FOR CONTRACTS&quot;" target="&quot;COMMUNICATION METHODS BEFORE EMPLOYMENT START DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Procedural requirements include communication methods that should be used before the start of employment to ensure all necessary information is provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6cdefd54629d3267d124166ba92131ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employment contract contains the terms that define the relationship between employer and employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1093ec98fdeda43f43128129d5d24cf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contract terms, including wages, must be provided to employees as required by law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1093ec98fdeda43f43128129d5d24cf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contract terms, such as wages, directly impact an employee's rights and obligations under the employment agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1093ec98fdeda43f43128129d5d24cf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;USAGES OF TRADE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal shall decide in accordance with the terms of the contract and take into account usages of trade applicable to the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6bbcea8f9e587ebf99b65f0299e0286b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;TRADE USAGES APPLICABLE TO THE TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Usages of trade applicable to the transaction should be taken into account while deciding on contract terms and arbitration proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6bbcea8f9e587ebf99b65f0299e0286b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 14 OF THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 14 defines legal obligations related to title, which can still be limited in contracts with non-consumer parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 14 defines legal obligations related to title, which cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 15 OF THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 15 defines implied warranties regarding the quality of goods that can still be limited in contracts with non-consumer parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 15 defines implied warranties regarding the quality of goods that cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms when dealing as a consumer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16 OF THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16 defines implied warranties regarding fitness for particular purposes that can still be limited in contracts with non-consumer parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 16 defines implied warranties regarding the fitness of goods for particular purposes that cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms when dealing as a consumer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT TERMS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 17 OF THE SALE OF GOODS ORDINANCE (CAP. 26)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 17 defines implied warranties regarding goods conforming to description that can still be limited in contracts with non-consumer parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 17 defines implied warranties regarding goods conforming to description that cannot be excluded or restricted by contract terms when dealing as a consumer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eddc386a4530fb8f47bfa480b977ad29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKPLACE CONDITIONS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Workplace conditions are part of the broader contract that defines the employer-employee relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1093ec98fdeda43f43128129d5d24cf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EVERY EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Every employer is required to inform their employees about changes in conditions and wage details."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-36d63c63cafeb631b985e26ad3fb4262</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN AMENDMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A written amendment can be made to a contract of employment, which needs validation procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-36d63c63cafeb631b985e26ad3fb4262</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGE PERIOD CONCERNED&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE DETAILS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Wage details are specific to the wage period concerned and must be provided at payment time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-36d63c63cafeb631b985e26ad3fb4262</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;44 &amp; 45 CLAUSES CONDITIONS&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE DETAILS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The conditions in clauses 44 and 45 include wage rates, overtime rates, and any allowances which are detailed information for employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-36d63c63cafeb631b985e26ad3fb4262</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDMENT 41 OF 190 S.20&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEDURES TO VALIDATE AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment procedures must be followed when making changes to the contract of employment, especially where validation is required."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-36d63c63cafeb631b985e26ad3fb4262</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RATE OF WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;RECORDS OF EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Records of employees include the rate of their wages as per legal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f15fe91e28bec496f95bc0e2d20ab50c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OVERTIME RATE&quot;" target="&quot;RECORDS OF EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee records must detail overtime rates applicable to them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f15fe91e28bec496f95bc0e2d20ab50c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ALLOWANCES&quot;" target="&quot;RECORDS OF EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Allowances are part of the details recorded for employees by employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f15fe91e28bec496f95bc0e2d20ab50c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OVERTIME EARNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;RECORDS OF EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee records include overtime earnings as required under regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f15fe91e28bec496f95bc0e2d20ab50c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEDUCTIONS FROM WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;RECORDS OF EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Records of employees must document any deductions from their wages and reasons for such deductions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f15fe91e28bec496f95bc0e2d20ab50c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORMAT CHANGES—E.R. 3 OF 2015&quot;" target="&quot;RECORDS TO BE KEPT BY EMPLOYERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Format changes specified in E.R. 3 of 2015 dictate the records employers must keep for compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f15fe91e28bec496f95bc0e2d20ab50c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECORDS TO BE KEPT BY EMPLOYERS&quot;" target="&quot;CABINET GAZETTE ANNOUNCEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Announcements in the Cabinet Gazette specify which classes of employers must keep certain records to comply with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f15fe91e28bec496f95bc0e2d20ab50c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EVERY EMPLOYER WHO IS A MEMBER OF A CLASS SPECIFIED UNDER SUBSECTION (2)&quot;" target="&quot;RECORDS IN SUCH FORM AS MAY BE SPECIFIED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers who are members of a class specified under Subsection (2) must keep records in the form as may be specified by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0409e534977d79adcbe523886e26b9cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECORDS IN SUCH FORM AS MAY BE SPECIFIED&quot;" target="&quot;INFORMATION OR PARTICULARS IN RESPECT OF A TIME OR PERIOD MORE THAN 6 MONTHS IMMEDIATELY PRECEDING THE DATE OF THE NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Records must not include information or particulars in respect of a time or period more than 6 months immediately preceding the date of the notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0409e534977d79adcbe523886e26b9cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE IN THE GAZETTE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can specify any class of employers through notices in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0409e534977d79adcbe523886e26b9cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER OR CLASS OF EMPLOYERS&quot;" target="&quot;RETURNS IN SUCH FORM AND AT SUCH TIMES AS HE MAY IN ANY SUCH NOTICE DIRECT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employers or classes of employers must submit returns as directed by the Commissioner's notice, which can be sent via registered post or published in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0409e534977d79adcbe523886e26b9cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSENT FORM, REQUEST FORM, NOTICE, CERTIFICATE, APPLICATION FORM, RECORD OR RETURN&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner may publish in the Gazette forms and notices related to employers' records or returns."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0409e534977d79adcbe523886e26b9cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1988年第52號第15條修訂&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER OR CLASS OF EMPLOYERS (FOR APPLICATION FOR FORM)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments from 1988, Section 52, Article 15 apply to employers or classes of employers for the application form."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0409e534977d79adcbe523886e26b9cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT RECORDS&quot;" target="&quot;WORK RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment records include work records of employees over a 12-month period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fe986d49a20cfdf5d43e02699374c050</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT RECORDS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE NAME AND DETAILS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employee name and details are part of the employment records that must be kept by employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fe986d49a20cfdf5d43e02699374c050</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORK RECORD&quot;" target="&quot;6-MONTH PERIOD AFTER CESSATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Work records need to be retained for a period of 6 months after an employee's cessation of employment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fe986d49a20cfdf5d43e02699374c050</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The license must specify the business premises where the employment agency operates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db7c4caf2703152da21b6fa8c5646ce3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS PREMISES&quot;" target="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documents can also be served to the business premises as the last known address of the receiving party."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22aad013b6ace7041cfc26259ab41c0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;假及假日&quot;" target="《最低工資條例》(第608章)">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">涉及僱傭關係中的假期和薪酬細則，兩者相關聯。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffd253a6ffc2d98305e581075ce59a38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;實習學員&quot;" target="某機構">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">實習學員的培訓安排由某機構負責或認可，與機構有直接關系。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffd253a6ffc2d98305e581075ce59a38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作經驗學員&quot;" target="某機構">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">工作經驗學員修讀的是該機構提供的課程，兩者相關聯。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffd253a6ffc2d98305e581075ce59a38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;某機構&quot;" target="《最低工資條例》(第608章)">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">該機構發出的文件或聲明涉及條例中的特定情況，如實習學員和工作經驗學員的身份確認等，與法例相關。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffd253a6ffc2d98305e581075ce59a38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MINIMUM WAGES ORDINANCE (CAP. 608)&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE PERIOD (WAGE PERIOD)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition of 'wage period' in THE MINIMUM WAGES ORDINANCE (CAP. 608) is referenced for clarification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb72900ee9c54337fb981f2f7d6cc6a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MINIMUM WAGES ORDINANCE (CAP. 608)&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'wages' as defined in THE MINIMUM WAGES ORDINANCE (CAP. 608) is used to clarify the meaning of wages within other provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb72900ee9c54337fb981f2f7d6cc6a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE MINIMUM WAGES ORDINANCE (CAP. 608)&quot;" target="&quot;WORKING HOURS (HOURS WORKED)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'working hours' as defined in THE MINIMUM WAGES ORDINANCE (CAP. 608) is used to clarify the meaning of working hours within other provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb72900ee9c54337fb981f2f7d6cc6a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPENDIX 9&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary has the authority to amend APPENDIX 9 through gazette notifications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb72900ee9c54337fb981f2f7d6cc6a0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGE RECORD&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The WAGE RECORD contains information about an EMPLOYEE’s wages paid during each wage period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3e6409377b6b4bbb92085773b4d5b79e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT RECORD&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EMPLOYMENT RECORD covers the employee's employment history, including their wage and employment details for the preceding 12 months."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3e6409377b6b4bbb92085773b4d5b79e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L.N. 34 OF 1990&quot;" target="&quot;7 OF 2007 S. 16&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both L.N. 34 of 1990 and 7 of 2007 s. 16 are amendments to the requirement for employers to keep wage records."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3e6409377b6b4bbb92085773b4d5b79e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L.N. 34 OF 1990&quot;" target="&quot;4 OF 2022 S. 17&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both L.N. 34 of 1990 and 4 of 2022 s. 17 are related in that they both amend the requirement for employers to keep wage records."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3e6409377b6b4bbb92085773b4d5b79e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;7 OF 2007 S. 16&quot;" target="&quot;4 OF 2022 S. 17&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both 7 of 2007 s. 16 and 4 of 2022 s. 17 are amendments to the requirement for employers to keep wage records."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3e6409377b6b4bbb92085773b4d5b79e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF BUSINESS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employment agency must specify its place of business in the issued licence and display it prominently at that location."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ff957c4b25c4b72be5b7c3c1525b4deb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF BUSINESS&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 3 OF UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The law specifies that a written communication can be considered as delivered if it's sent to the place of business."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-526d89a1459376fe55b0af078fc2a455</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF BUSINESS&quot;" target="&quot;THIS LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The law considers the place of business in determining if an arbitration is international or not."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a98fdad24b6b0148ebf6a921fbf604fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLACE OF BUSINESS&quot;" target="&quot;HABITUAL RESIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Place of business and habitual residence are related in determining which has a closer connection to an arbitration agreement when multiple places exist or no place of business exists."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e027acdec4c66c21703cf2589ec26926</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MINIMUM WAGE ORDINANCE (CAP. 608)&quot;" target="&quot;HOURS WORKED (工作時數)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hours worked is defined as having the same meaning as in the Minimum Wage Ordinance (Cap. 608). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-45d3d232b5b9df510faacc808489eadb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MINIMUM WAGE ORDINANCE (CAP. 608)&quot;" target="&quot;HOURS WORKED, WAGE PERIOD, WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These terms have the same meanings as defined in the Minimum Wage Ordinance for purposes of subsections (3)(ea) and (5). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1780efd8ae08a5db55e3f208ec193d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NINTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to amend the Ninth Schedule by notice published in the Gazette."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-45d3d232b5b9df510faacc808489eadb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NINTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ninth Schedule may be amended and applies to specified employees as defined in related sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1780efd8ae08a5db55e3f208ec193d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NINTH SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY $17,600&quot; (MONETARY CAP ON KEEPING RECORDS OF HOURS WORKED)">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NINTH SCHEDULE sets a monetary cap on keeping records of hours worked by the EMPLOYER for an EMPLOYEE at $17,600 per month."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1896582b740b6a3f00c9bfa592f3ab2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;PRE-TRANSITION EMPLOYMENT PERIOD, WHOLE EMPLOYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pre-transition and whole employment periods are defined specifically for a specified employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1780efd8ae08a5db55e3f208ec193d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRE-TRANSITION EMPLOYMENT PERIOD (轉制前僱傭期)&quot;" target="&quot;WHOLE EMPLOYMENT PERIOD (整段僱傭期)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These periods are interrelated, with the pre-transition period preceding and potentially influencing the whole employment period."&lt;SEP&gt;"These terms refer to different time frames related to the same employee's employment, with pre-transition being before a certain date and whole referring to the entire duration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1780efd8ae08a5db55e3f208ec193d60</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSEE (持牌人)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Licencees operate within the framework of employment agencies, as defined by regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fbb70bb06a25c64d5b60d4ef9c96b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATES OF EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates of exemption are applicable to employment agencies, both licensed and exempted."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2237564658a1150599559d04fcf04a08</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Licenses apply to employment agencies that have been granted a license under the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2237564658a1150599559d04fcf04a08</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED PERSON (相關人士)&quot;" target="&quot;ASSOCIATE (相關人士)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms refer to individuals associated with a company or partnership in different contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fbb70bb06a25c64d5b60d4ef9c96b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED PERSON (相關人士)&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR, MANAGER, SECRETARY OR OTHER SIMILAR OFFICER (董事、經理、秘書或其他類似職員)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A related person can be a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of an organization."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSOCIATE (相關人士)&quot;" target="&quot;PARTNER IN A PARTNERSHIP (合夥人)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Partners in a partnership can be considered associates of the business entity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENCE (牌照)&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSING AUTHORITY (發牌機制)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Licences are issued by licensing authorities, which regulate the operation of employment agencies and other businesses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE (持牌人)&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSE (牌照)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Licencees are the holders of licences issued according to regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fbb70bb06a25c64d5b60d4ef9c96b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION (豁免证明书)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY (职业介绍所)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Exemption certificates may be relevant for employment agencies in certain circumstances, though not directly defined here."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0fbb70bb06a25c64d5b60d4ef9c96b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LICENSEE must understand the explanation of CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION as per relevant regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1783e936e85cdc622ad6f3d15623b397</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COMMISSIONER has the authority to grant written permission for certain agreements, which affects the actions of a LICENSEE and ASSOCIATE OF A LICENSEE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the authority to inspect records kept by the licensee at their place of business."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the authority to refuse, issue or renew a license and revoke it if certain conditions are not met by the Licensee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf1cb5b59a9e111ec611acd3b69ca0ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ed1612036892adf32beecde8586556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICANT FOR LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Licensee and Applicant for License are related as both may be subject to licensing decisions made by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE APPEALS BOARD'S DISMISSAL OF THE APPEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a Licensee's appeal is dismissed by the Administrative Appeals Board, it affects their ability to challenge licensing decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Licensees are the entities that operate as Employment Agencies under regulatory frameworks."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Licensees operate under a regulatory framework that includes record-keeping and reporting requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;ACCOUNTING YEAR OF THE EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The licensee must retain records for a period of not less than 12 months after the expiration of each accounting year of the employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-63ed1612036892adf32beecde8586556</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;ASSOCIATE OF A LICENSEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A LICENSEE and ASSOCIATE OF A LICENSEE are both entities that can engage in prohibited acts as defined by the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf1cb5b59a9e111ec611acd3b69ca0ea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;GAZETTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LICENSEE must publish the details of all licenses and certificates in the GAZETTE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner issues certificates of exemption to employment agencies that meet specific criteria."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employment agency can hold a certificate of exemption, which is related to licensing procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL UNIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A RESIDENTIAL UNIT can be an existing residential unit if a CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION has been issued under certain conditions, or if an OCCUPATION PERMIT has been issued in other cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;MARITIME CREW SERVICE PERMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES are not applicable for operations covered by MARITIME CREW SERVICE PERMIT as per regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES are not applicable for operations covered by MARITIME CREW SERVICE PERMIT as per the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1783e936e85cdc622ad6f3d15623b397</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;CENTRAL PEOPLE'S GOVERNMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment agencies carried on or subvented by the Central People's Government are exempt from certain regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3b8b40b208f0fb021cf679f8d096916</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;LICENCE OR CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employment agency requires a licence or certificate of exemption to operate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fa5fcead28ed6dc73acdd53533256cb4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">50.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has authority over employment agencies and can require them to furnish information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has authority over employment agencies, including their place of business inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has authority to enter and inspect the place of business of an employment agency without a warrant at any reasonable time."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the authority to grant exemptions or withdraw them from Employment Agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the authority to issue licences to operate an employment agency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the power to exempt an employment agency from obtaining a license under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409891bfe2bfb21a0731ddceffe7a7d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff957c4b25c4b72be5b7c3c1525b4deb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;NAME OF ANOTHER EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment agencies' names must not be identical or nearly resemble each other to avoid public deception."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-602c441cf667030bb7c11323e7c28f43</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY LICENSEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Employment Agency Licensee is associated with an Employment Agency that may be subject to regulation or licensing by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 54 EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment agencies can be granted or have their exemption withdrawn under Section 54 based on certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;JOB APPLICANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment Agencies register Job Applicants who seek job placement services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG IDENTITY CARD NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Job applicants are required to provide their Hong Kong Identity Card numbers for record-keeping purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;PASSPORT NUMBER AND CITIZENSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-resident job applicants must provide passport number and citizenship details as part of the registration process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;FEE AND COMMISSION RECEIVED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment Agencies charge fees and commissions for their services, which are recorded in the applicant's file."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S NAME OR ADDRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Job placements require recording of employer names or addresses as part of the employment process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;ACCOUNTING PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment Agencies must maintain records for a minimum period after each accounting year ends, typically 12 months."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERS, RECORDS, AND RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment Agencies must maintain and submit prescribed registers, records, and returns to the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY HIM IN THAT BEHALF OR ANY POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers and police of a certain rank can inspect the places of business of employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-409891bfe2bfb21a0731ddceffe7a7d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 51(1) OFFENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employment agency commits an offence if it fails to furnish required information or provides false information under Section 51(1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 57(1)(A) OFFENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employment agency commits an offence and is liable for a fine of $350,000 and imprisonment for 3 years if it contravenes Section 57(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 57(1)(B) &amp; (C) OFFENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employment agency commits an offence and is liable to a fine at level 5 if it contravenes Section 57(1)(b) or (c). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR 3 YEARS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment agencies can be imprisoned for up to three years if they commit an offence under Section 57(1)(A). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION (豁免證明書)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-profit organizations may be subject to regulations and requirements related to certificate issuance processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY DOCUMENT (規管文件)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulations apply to non-profit organizations, including licensing and employment practices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION (豁免證明書)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 54, SECTION 52, SECTION 3 OF 8 OF 2018 S. 3 (第54條、第52條及第8號法律公告第三章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The certificate of exemption is issued under section 54 and subject to other sections mentioned."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY (職業介紹所)&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORK (規管框架)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment agencies operate within a regulatory framework that includes licensing requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EDUCATION INSTITUTION (教育機構)&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT EMPLOYMENT ACTIVITIES (學生就業活動)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Education institutions may be involved in student employment activities, which can be regulated by relevant laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STUDENT (學生)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT REGULATION (就業法例)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Students may be subject to specific regulations regarding their employment activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRADUATE (畢業生)&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY DOCUMENT (規管文件)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Graduates are covered by regulatory documents that govern various aspects of their professional lives, including licensing and employment practices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE (雇員)&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT EMPLOYMENT ACTIVITIES (學生就業活動)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Student employment activities involve employees, who are governed by labor laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATHEMATICS (數學)&quot;" target="&quot;CONTEXT (上下文)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mathematics can be used to interpret the context within which regulatory frameworks operate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 54, SECTION 52, SECTION 3 OF 8 OF 2018 S. 3 (第54條、第52條及第8號法律公告第三章)&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY DOCUMENT (規管文件)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulatory documents are based on specific sections of the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 54, SECTION 52, SECTION 3 OF 8 OF 2018 S. 3 (第54條、第52條及第8號法律公告第三章)&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORK (規管框架)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The regulatory framework is based on specific sections of the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 54, SECTION 52, SECTION 3 OF 8 OF 2018 S. 3 (第54條、第52條及第8號法律公告第三章)&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATION BUREAU'S PERMANENT SECRETARY (教育局常任秘書長)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Education Bureau's Permanent Secretary may be involved in the interpretation and application of specific sections of the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 54, SECTION 52, SECTION 3 OF 8 OF 2018 S. 3 (第54條、第52條及第8號法律公告第三章)&quot;" target="&quot;INTERPRETATION (解釋)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections of the law may require interpretation to clarify their application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION OF PART 50 (第50部分的應用)&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORK (規管框架)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The application of Part 50 is part of a broader regulatory framework that governs various business practices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PECUNIARY ADVANTAGE (財務利益)&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY DOCUMENT (規管文件)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulatory documents may address financial advantages and conflicts of interest in business practices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY DOCUMENT (規管文件)&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT EMPLOYMENT ACTIVITIES (學生就業活動)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Student employment activities are subject to regulatory documents that govern their conduct and rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY DOCUMENT (規管文件)&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSING AUTHORITY (發牌機制)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulatory documents provide the basis for licensing authorities to issue licenses and regulate businesses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORK (規管框架)&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSING AUTHORITY (發牌機制)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The regulatory framework includes licensing authorities that issue licenses to businesses and other entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a12f68db2756f89b8999b59583f0a9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIRECTOR, MANAGER, SECRETARY&quot;" target="&quot;RELATED PERSON (有關連人士)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Directors, managers, and secretaries are considered related persons within the context of a company or partnership."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3b8b40b208f0fb021cf679f8d096916</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTNER IN A PARTNERSHIP&quot;" target="&quot;RELATED PERSON (有關連人士)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Partners in a partnership are also considered related persons under this regulation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3b8b40b208f0fb021cf679f8d096916</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERMANENT SECRETARY FOR EDUCATION&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Permanent Secretary for Education recognizes educational institutions, which can be involved in issuing exemptions related to employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fa5fcead28ed6dc73acdd53533256cb4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VOCATIONAL INTRODUCTION OFFICE&quot;" target="&quot;LICENCE OR CERTIFICATE OF EXEMPTION (FOR EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A vocational introduction office operates under the same licensing or exemption rules as an employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fa5fcead28ed6dc73acdd53533256cb4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY LICENSE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Directors are required to apply on behalf of the company for an Employment Agency License."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-db7c4caf2703152da21b6fa8c5646ce3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENCES&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner issues licences, which are required for operating an employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ff957c4b25c4b72be5b7c3c1525b4deb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENCES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 53&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 53 provides conditions or exceptions for licences, affecting their validity and management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ff957c4b25c4b72be5b7c3c1525b4deb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An agency must obtain a separate licence for each name used, indicating the relationship between an AGENCY and its required LICENSURE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSURE&quot;" target="&quot;VOCATIONAL PLACEMENT OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A vocational placement office must obtain a licence, showing that such an entity is subject to licensing requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-44018ff1aa4d2c7d7a1459a8a7843427</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第62条订立的任何规例&quot;" target="&quot;申请人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"申请人需要遵守根据第62条规定制定的相关规定，否则可能影响其申请结果。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ef694c060ae6aadfab94a822e1411ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner has the authority to refuse a license based on various conditions related to the licensee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;FALSE OR MISLEADING INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The licensee must not provide false or misleading information in their application for a license, as this can lead to refusal of issuance or renewal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;FIT AND PROPER PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner assesses whether a Licensee is fit and proper to operate an employment agency based on various criteria such as criminal history, compliance with regulations, etc."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIAD SOCIETY&quot;" target="&quot;FRAUD, DISHONESTY OR EXTORTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Membership in the Triad Society can be considered a form of fraud or dishonesty which may disqualify an individual from operating as a licensee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENSE AGAINST PERSON OF CHILD, YOUNG PERSON OR WOMAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A related person's conviction for offenses against children, young persons, or women can affect the fitness of the Licensee to operate an employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDIVIDUAL EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENSE AGAINST PERSON OF CHILD, YOUNG PERSON OR WOMAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An individual employee's conviction for offenses against children, young persons, or women can affect the fitness of the Licensee to operate an employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION MADE UNDER SECTION 62&quot;" target="&quot;VIOLATION OF REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations of regulations made under Section 62 can lead to refusal or revocation of the employment agency's license by the Commissioner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30f0221d62ed77d081c1e001cb1f4e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE APPEALS BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If an applicant is aggrieved by the Commissioner's decision, they can appeal to the Administrative Appeals Board within 28 days after notification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE APPEALS BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Appeals Board handles appeals from licensees or applicants against decisions of the Licensing Authority (Commissioner). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE APPEALS BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADMINISTRATIVE APPEALS BOARD is where BODY CORPORATES appeal against decisions made by the SECRETARY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-89bbff8bbf3f0985059cdccf2a6fe747</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSING AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICANT FOR LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Applicant for License interacts with the Licensing Authority (Commissioner) in seeking or appealing a license decision."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1329e5f1d0b2492c939208fe56bae067</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;54. COMMISSIONER'S POWER OF EXEMPTION&quot;" target="&quot;REPEALED 28 OF 1992 S. 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Repealed section 4 of the 1992 Act affects Commissioner's power to grant exemptions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;54. COMMISSIONER'S POWER OF EXEMPTION&quot;" target="&quot;55. REVOCATION OF EXEMPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can revoke exemptions granted under section 54 if certain conditions are no longer met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-57b85f514b9c18e05b5af602d54bc564</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 53(1) REFUSAL GROUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT AGENCY (HOLDER)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The refusal grounds in section 53(1) can be applied to employment agencies, affecting their status and operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e75048e9ce4b436dfa55abbe5d61e73f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JOB APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG IDENTITY CARD NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Job applicants are required to provide their Hong Kong Identity Card numbers for registration purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JOB APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;PASSPORT NUMBER AND CITIZENSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-resident job applicants must provide passport number and citizenship details as part of the application process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JOB APPLICANT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Job applicants are subject to the regulations set by the Commissioning Authority, which oversees employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEE AND COMMISSION RECEIVED&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD-KEEPING REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The fees and commissions received are part of the record-keeping requirement for employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S NAME OR ADDRESS&quot;" target="&quot;REPORTING REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer names or addresses must be recorded as part of the reporting requirements to regulatory bodies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECORD-KEEPING REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REPORTING PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Record-keeping requirements dictate the periods during which records must be maintained before they can be reported or submitted."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REPORTING REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulatory bodies require employment agencies to report and submit certain information within specified periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY BODY&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner is a key regulatory body that oversees and regulates employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-067e7bd64c7c5b9cd0bc7a9d57842457</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY BODY&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OR OTHER JUDICIAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both courts and regulatory bodies are involved in ensuring legal rights and interests, which can relate to the transmission of information regarding arbitrations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a252d91181bacec6fcd6f1d54297b19a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY BODY&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Government bodies may act as regulatory bodies or interact with them in various capacities related to arbitration processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a252d91181bacec6fcd6f1d54297b19a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ORFS AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Communication with regulatory bodies is also mentioned as part of the process for ORFS agreements for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4158bcd358cce62e9937de8896e1ba0b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATORY BODY&quot;" target="&quot;LAWYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lawyers may communicate information to regulatory bodies in legal proceedings, which can take place in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4158bcd358cce62e9937de8896e1ba0b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSOCIATE OF A LICENSEE&quot;" target="&quot;PRESCRIBED COMMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An ASSOCIATE OF A LICENSEE can share in the PRESCRIBED COMMISSION, but only with another LICENSEE or a bona fide partner/shareholder of the employment agency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf1cb5b59a9e111ec611acd3b69ca0ea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1975 ACT S. 2&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1975 Act Section 2 amends the Commissioner's powers, likely affecting their role in regulating employment agencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;1992 ACT S. 6&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 1992 Act Section 6 further defines and expands the Commissioner's authority over employment agencies, including inspection rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2018 AMENDMENT S. 6&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORY FRAMEWORK FOR EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 2018 Amendment Section 6 introduces new sections that form part of the regulatory framework for employment agencies, impacting their operations and inspections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee0cf79121cc26199f0bf5c4d14a8ce8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY HIM IN THAT BEHALF&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers authorized by the Commissioner have similar powers as the Commissioner in entering and inspecting places of business for employment agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner authorizes public officers to act on his behalf in certain investigations and searches."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409891bfe2bfb21a0731ddceffe7a7d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY HIM IN THAT BEHALF OR ANY POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Commissioner and public officers/police of a certain rank have investigative powers over employment agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public officers authorized by the Commissioner or police officers of a certain rank have similar investigative powers as those granted to employment agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner and public officers/police of a certain rank share investigative powers, with the former authorizing the latter."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-409891bfe2bfb21a0731ddceffe7a7d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner can authorize police officers not below the rank of inspector for specific actions such as entering and searching premises without a warrant."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;MAGISTRATE'S WARRANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Magistrate's Warrant authorizes police officers not below the rank of inspector to enter and search domestic premises at any reasonable time if there is evidence of an offence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;52(2A), (2B), OR (2C)条的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Police officers not below the rank of inspector are responsible for enforcing provisions under 52(2A), (2B), or (2C)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR&quot;" target="&quot;56(1), (2), OR (3)条的規定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Police officers not below the rank of inspector are responsible for enforcing provisions under 56(1), (2), or (3)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE, RECORD OR OTHER DOCUMENT WHICH MAY BE EVIDENCE OF AN OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;MAGISTRATE'S WARRANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documents that may be evidence of an offence can be seized and detained by police officers with a Magistrate's Warrant."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;51(2)条的規定&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner is responsible for enforcing the provisions under 51(2), which relate to suspected offences that may require investigation without a warrant."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;提供明知或理應知道在要项上属虚假或误导的信息&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED BY HIM IN THAT BEHALF, POLICE OFFICER NOT BELOW THE RANK OF INSPECTOR, MAGISTRATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public officers and magistrates may be involved in situations where providing false or misleading information is a violation of the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9dd5fc5d6041ac2cbd3c37735096a0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 52(1)&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENT 1988 NO.24 ARTICLE 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 1988 No.24 Article 2 modifies or affects Article 52(1), indicating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 52(1)&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENT 1992 NO.28 ARTICLE 7&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 1992 No.28 Article 7 modifies or affects Article 52(1), indicating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 54(1)&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENT 1995 NO.103&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 1995 No.103 may modify or affect Article 54(1), indicating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 54(1)&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENT 1992 NO.28 ARTICLE 7&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 1992 No.28 Article 7 modifies or affects Article 54(1), indicating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 58&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENT 1995 NO.103&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 1995 No.103 may modify or affect Article 58, indicating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUDICIAL OFFICER ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 227)&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 26&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 26 is from the Judicial Officer Ordinance, which may interact or reference provisions in other ordinances like this one."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PROVISIONS OF 2018 NO.8 ARTICLE 7&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 57(1)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The provision of the 2018 No.8 Article 7 may interact or reference Article 57(1)(a), indicating a potential relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PROVISIONS OF 2018 NO.8 ARTICLE 7&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 57(1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The provision of the 2018 No.8 Article 7 may interact or reference Article 57(1)(b), indicating a potential relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PROVISIONS OF 2018 NO.8 ARTICLE 7&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 57(1)(C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The provision of the 2018 No.8 Article 7 may interact or reference Article 57(1)(c), indicating a potential relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8d055b17ca5d7c4bc065dbbfefc9360</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行發生的日期後12個月內作出或提出。&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 51(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The offense can be reported within one year after the incident, as per SECTION 51(2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第5級罰款。&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 57(1)(B)或(C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating sections 57(1)(b) or (c) can result in a fine at level 5. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 51(2)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under SECTION 51(2) are punishable by a fine at level 3, as amended. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 53(5)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under SECTION 53(5) are punishable by a fine at level 3, as amended. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 55(4)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under SECTION 55(4) are punishable by a fine at level 3, as amended. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 52(2A), (2B) OR (2C)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under sections 52(2A), (2B) or (2C) are punishable by a fine at level 3, as amended. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 56(1), (2) OR (3)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 3.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under sections 56(1), (2) or (3) are punishable by a fine at level 3, as amended. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FURNISHES ANY INFORMATION WHICH HE KNOWS OR REASONABLY OUGHT TO KNOW TO BE FALSE OR MISLEADING IN ANY MATERIAL PARTICULAR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 60(5)(A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Providing false or misleading information under SECTION 60(5)(a) is an offense. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAILS WITHOUT REASONABLE EXCUSE TO PRODUCE ANY RECORD OR OTHER DOCUMENT RELATING TO THE EMPLOYMENT AGENCY WHEN REQUIRED BY THE COMMISSIONER OR ANY PUBLIC OFFICER AUTHORIZED IN THAT BEHALF BY THE COMMISSIONER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 60(5)(B)(I)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failure to produce records under SECTION 60(5)(b)(i) is an offense. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FURNISHES TO THE COMMISSIONER OR ANY SUCH PUBLIC OFFICER ANY INFORMATION WHICH HE KNOWS OR REASONABLY OUGHT TO KNOW TO BE FALSE OR MISLEADING IN ANY MATERIAL PARTICULAR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 60(5)(B)(II)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Providing false or misleading information under SECTION 60(5)(b)(ii) is an offense. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f9d29873d319193f6158b93270b8f1d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 51(1) OFFENCE&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLAINT OR INFORMATION WITHIN 12 MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Complaints or information can be made within 12 months after the commission of an offence under Section 51(1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXEMPT CERTIFICATE HOLDER&quot;" target="&quot;LICENSED EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Exempt certificate holders are treated similarly to licensed employment agencies in terms of applicable sections, such as Sections 52 and 57. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSED EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 56, 57, 58 &amp; 59&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 56, 57, 58, and 59 apply to licensed employment agencies in the same manner as they do for exempt certificate holders. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSED EMPLOYMENT AGENCY&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 52(2A), (2B) &amp; (2C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 52(2A), (2B) and (2C) apply to licensed employment agencies in the same way as they do for exempt certificate holders. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba134fe326f216878a32b9c716807cc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LICENSES&quot;" target="&quot;EXECUTIVE COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Executive Council has the power to establish regulations concerning licenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2237564658a1150599559d04fcf04a08</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART XIII&quot;" target="&quot;PENALTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part XIII includes provisions for penalties associated with the offences described in that part."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-950a35becf4c52961439921c1e246ea5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;第11E或11F(3)或(4)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"违反第11E或11F(3)或(4)条将构成犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;第IV部&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"违反第IV部的相关规定将构成犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;1970年第71號第4條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条文修订了关于罪行和罚则的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;1984年第48號第26條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条文修订了关于罪行和罚则的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;第67(2)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"故意违反第67(2)条将构成犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;第39條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"未给雇员提供根据第39条应享有的假日将构成犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;第40或40A(2)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"未付给雇员根据第40或40A(2)条应得的任何假日薪酬将构成犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;1990年第53號第5條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条文修订了关于未给雇员提供假期和疾病津贴的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;第41AA或 41F(3)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"未付给雇员根据第41AA或41F(3)条应得的任何假期将构成犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;假期薪酬&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"未付给雇员根据第41AA(6)条应得的休息日或假日工资将构成犯罪。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;罪行及罰則&quot;" target="&quot;第41AA(6)條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条文修订了关于假期薪酬的规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5f7b047f9f55a2ab249abdbcd1a65d36</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;假期薪酬&quot;" target="&quot;有薪年假&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"假期薪酬是指与员工应得的带薪休假相关的款项，这部分内容定义了计算方式。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d3b06c868aa0e560901379b31f38a6a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY REST DAY OR HOLIDAY AS REQUIRED UNDER SECTION 41AA(6)&quot;" target="&quot;SALARY FOR LEAVE AS REQUIRED AS UNDER SECTION 41AA OR 41F(3)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The salary for any rest day or holiday as required under Section 41AA(6) is related to the compensation for leave, though not explicitly stated in the text but inferred from similar context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALARY FOR LEAVE AS REQUIRED OR ALLOWED UNDER SECTION 41AA OR 41F(3)&quot;" target="&quot;COMPENSATION AS REQUIRED UNDER SECTION 41D&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The salary for leave as required or allowed under Section 41AA or 41F(3) is related to the compensation as required by Section 41D, both are forms of financial compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VIOLATION OF SECTIONS 40A(1) OR 41B&quot;" target="&quot;NON-COMPLIANCE WITH REQUIREMENTS BY PUBLIC OFFICERS UNDER SECTION 72 (EXCLUDING CLAUSES (1)(A), (B) AND (C))&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violation of Sections 40A(1) or 41B is related to non-compliance with requirements by public officers under Section 72, both are forms of legal violations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VIOLATION OF SECTIONS 40A(1) OR 41B&quot;" target="&quot;NON-COMPLIANCE WITH CONDITIONS IMPOSED WHEN GRANTING EXEMPTION UNDER SECTION 73(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-compliance with conditions imposed when granting exemption under Section 73(2) is related to violation of Sections 40A(1) or 41B, both are forms of legal non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-COMPLIANCE WITH REQUIREMENTS BY PUBLIC OFFICERS UNDER SECTION 72 (EXCLUDING CLAUSES (1)(A), (B) AND (C))&quot;" target="&quot;PROVIDING FALSE OR INCOMPLETE INFORMATION IN MATTERS REQUIRING DATA UNDER SECTION 72 (EXCLUDING CLAUSE (1)(B) AND (C))&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Providing false or incomplete information is a specific form of non-compliance with requirements by public officers under Section 72, making the relationship strong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-COMPLIANCE WITH REQUIREMENTS BY PUBLIC OFFICERS UNDER SECTION 72 (EXCLUDING CLAUSES (1)(A), (B) AND (C))&quot;" target="&quot;VIOLATION OF SECTION 41E(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violation of Section 41E(1) is related to non-compliance with requirements by public officers under Section 72, both are forms of legal violations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-959a685251e7365e7f28bf1cf3fab67d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 67(2)&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Wilfully contravening section 67(2) results in an offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-589a96d26470d384098a64e36e5d4b0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 39&quot;" target="&quot;HOLIDAY PAY UNDER SECTIONS 40 OR 40A(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failure to grant holiday under section 39 leads to an offense regarding holiday pay under sections 40 or 40A(2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-589a96d26470d384098a64e36e5d4b0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 39&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 17E&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 39 is referenced in the note to Section 17D, suggesting a related context for provisions on providing guarantees for interim measures or preliminary orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a8aef97985d67c64a247cd4ac0838cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SICKNESS ALLOWANCE UNDER SECTION 33&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failing to pay sickness allowance under section 33 leads to an offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-589a96d26470d384098a64e36e5d4b0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REST DAY OR HOLIDAY UNDER SECTION 41AA(6)&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failure to grant rest day or holiday as required by section 41AA(6) results in an offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-589a96d26470d384098a64e36e5d4b0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72 OTHER THAN SUBSECTION (1)(A), (B) AND (C)&quot;" target="&quot;OFFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failing to comply with requirements under sections other than subsections (1)(a), (b) and (c) of section 72 results in an offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-589a96d26470d384098a64e36e5d4b0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENSE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 40A(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failing to comply with section 40A(1) results in an offense."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-589a96d26470d384098a64e36e5d4b0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY PERSON WHO FAILS TO COMPLY WITH THE REQUIREMENTS OF A NOTICE IN WRITING OR A NOTICE PUBLISHED IN THE GAZETTE UNDER SECTION 48(1)&quot;" target="&quot;A PERSON WHO IS GUILTY OF AN OFFENCE UNDER THIS SECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The latter specifies the penalty for the former's offense, indicating a direct relationship between non-compliance and legal consequences."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c67d6508bb7b512b62a5354363134f30</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72A(3)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5/6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating SECTION 72A(3) results in a fine at level 5 or 6 as specified by the legislation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cbf72b50ae34f7ab9f1b18ab52fd7f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72A(3)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 72A(3) is a specific provision within the LEGISLATION, defining an offense with associated fines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cbf72b50ae34f7ab9f1b18ab52fd7f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72B(1)(A), (B), (C) OR (D)&quot;" target="&quot;FINE AT LEVEL 5/6&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating SECTION 72B(1)(A), (B), (C) or (D) results in a fine at level 6 as specified by the legislation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cbf72b50ae34f7ab9f1b18ab52fd7f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72B(1)(A), (B), (C) OR (D)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 72B(1)(A), (B), (C) or (D) are specific provisions within the LEGISLATION, defining offenses with associated fines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cbf72b50ae34f7ab9f1b18ab52fd7f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72B(1)(A), (B), (C)&quot;" target="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR 1 YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating SECTION 72B(1)(a), (b), or (c) results in imprisonment for 1 year, along with a fine at level 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR 1 YEAR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 41AA(4), (5)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violations under SECTION 41AA(4) or (5) are punishable by imprisonment for one year according to the law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IMPRISONMENT FOR 1 YEAR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may be indirectly related to imprisonment if their employer violates laws that lead to such penalties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE RELATING TO SECTIONS 32 AND 72(1)(A), (B) AND (C)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32, 72A(3), AND 72B(1)(A), (B), OR (C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating any of the sections in SECTION 32, 72A(3), and 72B(1)(a), (b), or (c) results in an OFFENCE relating to these sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WITHHOLDING INFORMATION AS REQUIRED UNDER SECTION 72(1)(B) OR (C)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 72(1)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Withholding information as required under SECTION 72(1)(b) or (c) is an OFFENCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WITHHOLDING INFORMATION AS REQUIRED UNDER SECTION 72(1)(B) OR (C)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 72(1)(C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Withholding information as required under SECTION 72(1)(c) is an OFFENCE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 72B(1)(A), (B), OR (C)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 72B(1)(A), (B), OR (C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating any of the provisions in SECTION 72B(1)(a), (b), or (c) results in an OFFENCE under this section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 72(1)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32, 72A(3), AND 72B(1)(A), (B), OR (C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating any of the sections in SECTION 32, 72A(3), and 72B(1)(a), (b), or (c) can result in an OFFENCE under SECTION 72(1)(b)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 72(1)(C)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32, 72A(3), AND 72B(1)(A), (B), OR (C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Violating any of the sections in SECTION 32, 72A(3), and 72B(1)(a), (b), or (c) can result in an OFFENCE under SECTION 72(1)(c)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c62e4d3b32ca7459c870b08308d480ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72(1)(C)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are indirectly related as the violation of SECTION 72(1)(c) could affect their rights and information they receive from employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 25A&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are indirectly related as the violation of SECTION 25A could affect their rights to interest on late payments from employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 45&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 17J&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 17J does not have effect and is superseded by Section 45, which provides relevant provisions instead."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06afdeae20298d16d6b6fe33975e54ea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 45&quot;" target="&quot;COURT-ORDERED INTERIM MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 45 provides detailed provisions for court-ordered interim measures in arbitration proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06afdeae20298d16d6b6fe33975e54ea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 72A(1), (2)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may be affected by violations of SECTION 72A(1) or (2) which could impact their rights and information from employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ad689dd49be1734c5e08c5a4e747265</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;63D. 輕微罪行&quot;" target="&quot;第18(2)、26、27、28(2)、29、30、41AA(4)或(5)、41F(1)、41G、44、45、47(1)、49A或72A(1)或(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第18(2)、26、27、28(2)、29、30、41AA(4)或(5)、41F(1)、41G、44、45、47(1)、49A或72A(1)或(2)條的規定违反者即属犯罪"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a0b18fbc4380b6448b0da3a5d111b4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;勞工處人員&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长有权授权劳工处人员代表其提出检控"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a0b18fbc4380b6448b0da3a5d111b4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;律政司&quot;" target="&quot;處長&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"处长与律政司在罪行检控过程中有合作关系，但具体职责分工未明示"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a0b18fbc4380b6448b0da3a5d111b4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;传票送达方式1&quot;" target="&quot;传票&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Method 1 is one of the ways a summons can be delivered according to Section 64A."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-beb3c1a7d6211fc1cac75a7aeaaff11f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;传票送达方式2&quot;" target="&quot;传票&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Method 2 is another way a summons can be delivered according to Section 64A."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-beb3c1a7d6211fc1cac75a7aeaaff11f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUMMONS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A summons related to an employee's alleged offense may be served by leaving a copy with someone for him at his last or usual place of abode or at his place of employment as stated on the summons."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad2c9fb7be1050f82eb2460f4de56e54</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON CONCERNED IN THE MANAGEMENT OF THE FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Directors and persons concerned in management share similar legal responsibilities as described above."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSON CONCERNED IN THE MANAGEMENT OF THE FIRM&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Secretaries and persons concerned in management share similar legal responsibilities as described above."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c560e10db0daa7f51fa59f7a6b462aa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 65&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 65 of the Ordinance details the legal responsibility for paying outstanding wages and fines for employers convicted of offences."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-07f949d11fd1c1d8a909fd36ccac57d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 7 OF THE AMENDMENT ACT 31 OF 1992&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The amendment act modifies Section 65, providing specific conditions under which an employer can be ordered to pay wages or other sums outstanding at the time of conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-07f949d11fd1c1d8a909fd36ccac57d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENT 3 OF 2017&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 3 of 2017 further modifies Section 65, detailing conditions under which an employer can be ordered to pay wages or other sums outstanding at the time of conviction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-07f949d11fd1c1d8a909fd36ccac57d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART XIV&quot;" target="&quot;MISCELLANEOUS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part XIV includes miscellaneous provisions related to wage protection and other legal matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-07f949d11fd1c1d8a909fd36ccac57d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regional Court Judges handle employment disputes as part of their judicial functions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;GUARANTOR OF GUARANTEE DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The REGIONAL COURT JUDGE can order the release of an EMPLOYER who has been detained based on applications from the GUARANTOR OF GUARANTEE DOCUMENT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffe2fc373a4f6caf645c752f135c7582</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;GUARANTEE DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The REGIONAL COURT JUDGE can declare a GUARANTEE DOCUMENT invalid if certain conditions are met regarding debt recovery procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffe2fc373a4f6caf645c752f135c7582</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;DEBT RECOVERY PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The actions of the EMPLOYER and GUARANTOR OF GUARANTEE DOCUMENT can trigger decisions by the REGIONAL COURT JUDGE related to DEBT RECOVERY PROCEDURES."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffe2fc373a4f6caf645c752f135c7582</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ATTACHMENT OF WAGES&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts are not allowed to order the attachment of wages, except under specific conditions regarding civil debts owed to the government."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGIONAL COURT JUDGE'S APPLICATION PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;ABSCONDING EMPLOYER PREVENTION MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regional Court Judges' application procedure is part of measures to prevent absconding employers from escaping their obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ABSCONDING EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;呈遞的申請書&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The application form is used to address matters related to an absconding employer, indicating a direct relationship between them in legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGE PROTECTION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mechanisms for protecting wages are part of broader dispute resolution mechanisms in employment law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;ABSCONDING EMPLOYER PREVENTION MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Prevention measures include mechanisms for resolving employment disputes, such as those involving absconding employers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;CIVIL DEBT RECOVERY ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Dispute resolution mechanisms in employment law can involve acts related to civil debt recovery and wage protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL DEBT RECOVERY PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW COMPLIANCE MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compliance mechanisms under civil debt recovery include procedures that ensure adherence to employment laws, such as wage protection and attachment acts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL DEBT RECOVERY PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE ATTACHMENT ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Wage Attachment Act is part of the broader procedure for civil debt recovery in cases involving wage disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW ENFORCEMENT MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;CIVIL DEBT RECOVERY ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Enforcement mechanisms under employment law include acts related to civil debt recovery, such as wage protection and attachment procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW ENFORCEMENT MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;ABSCONDING EMPLOYER PREVENTION MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Enforcement mechanisms under employment law include measures to prevent absconding employers from escaping their obligations, such as wage attachment procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW ENFORCEMENT MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE ATTACHMENT PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Attachment procedures are part of the broader enforcement mechanism for ensuring compliance with employment laws, including wage protection acts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGE ATTACHMENT PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;CIVIL DEBT RECOVERY ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Civil Debt Recovery Act includes procedures for wage attachment as part of civil debt recovery mechanisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Civil Debt Recovery Act includes specific procedures for wage attachment as a means to recover civil debts and enforce employment law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ARBITRATION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE ATTACHMENT ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arbitration mechanisms can be part of the legal framework for wage attachment acts in employment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL PROTECTION AGAINST ABSCONDING EMPLOYERS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT ENFORCEMENT MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mechanisms to enforce employment contracts include protection against absconding employers who fail to comply with wage obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL PROCEDURE LAW&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE ATTACHMENT ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Civil Procedure Law provides the legal basis and procedures for wage attachment acts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL PROCEDURE LAW&quot;" target="&quot;ABSCONDING EMPLOYER PREVENTION MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Civil Procedure Law includes measures to prevent absconding employers from escaping their wage obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGE PROTECTION ACT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW COMPLIANCE MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Wage Protection Act is a compliance mechanism under employment law to protect wages and ensure legal protection against employers who fail to pay wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WAGE PROTECTION ACT&quot;" target="&quot;ABSCONDING EMPLOYER PREVENTION MEASURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Wage Protection Act is part of measures aimed at preventing absconding employers from escaping their wage obligations, including attachment procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT LAW ENFORCEMENT MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;WAGE ATTACHMENT ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The wage attachment act is a mechanism for enforcing employment contract law regarding wages and payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL DEBT RECOVERY ACT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT LAW COMPLIANCE MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compliance mechanisms under employment law include acts related to civil debt recovery and wage protection measures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8b57ac243904d2f7c387b12d47bb079b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SAVING AS TO EXISTING CONTRACTS OF SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The saving clause specifically mentions medical plans under the repealed Industrial Employment (Paid Holidays and Sick Benefits) Ordinance, suggesting it is relevant to this entity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-117a12d3025ead7fc5f26f4bb1ca96c5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL EMPLOYMENT (HOLIDAYS WITH PAY AND SICKNESS ALLOWANCE) ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director recognizes and approves medical schemes under the Industrial Employment (Holidays with Pay and Sickness Allowance) Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-919e8934f076d1a9c5aea1486aa3f1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTER, RECORD, TABLE OR OTHER DOCUMENT AS REQUIRED BY THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Director can require the production, inspection, review, audit, and duplication of documents as required by this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-919e8934f076d1a9c5aea1486aa3f1c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工廠及工業經營條例&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據《工廠及工業經營條例》,僱主需要提供與青年或兒童相關的資料以及工作情況和待遇。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ca8eaf190829e68d29722b559c43b7e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;青年或兒童&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主有責任按照《工廠及工業經營條例》的要求管理並報告涉及青年或兒童的工作情況和待遇。"&lt;SEP&gt;"青年或儿童"由"僱主"在受僱当日雇用于特定地点。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-63d24225c9fe2991b4b3b7b5c007e031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca8eaf190829e68d29722b559c43b7e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DUTY EXECUTIONER&quot;" target="&quot;PROSECUTION SOURCE DISCLOSURE PROHIBITION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public duty executioners are bound by laws prohibiting disclosure of prosecution sources, ensuring confidentiality in their work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b297641c5fc96a9b02649fb896184fdd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROTECTION OF INFORMANTS'" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees who provide information for legal or regulatory purposes are protected from termination, as stated in the text. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f10185e6fc563260f4e1f20ab8c394fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STATUTORY DUTY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EMPLOYEE may be involved in situations where they are required to fulfill STATUTORY DUTIES, which can lead to interactions or incidents covered by the ORDINANCE and ACCIDENTS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e37def8625e820a47ed5130364eb70d4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YOUNG OR CHILDREN&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT PROHIBITION OR CONTROL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment prohibitions or controls specifically target young or children in employment settings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5742863cc938d9f9470985855601b925</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工業、職業或行業&quot;" target="&quot;豁免&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"某些工業、職業或其部分可獲得豁免,不受本條例規範。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2e09be0ac839e84e94f72793a659214</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;規例&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主"需遵守由行政长官会同行政会议制定的相关规例以禁止或控制雇佣行为。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-63d24225c9fe2991b4b3b7b5c007e031</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;公職人員&quot;" target="&quot;職能、職責及權力&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"獲委任或授權的公職人員有特定的功能和權限去執行本條例。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2e09be0ac839e84e94f72793a659214</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE 2006 ORDINANCE FOR EMPLOYEE BENEFITS VERIFICATION (TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE) (MISCELLANEOUS AMENDMENTS)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION OF ACUPUNCTURISTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance mentions certificates issued by registered acupuncturists, which are relevant to the verification process under the 2006 Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c873f5413d1d5feab5151fcff500980c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE 2006 ORDINANCE FOR EMPLOYEE BENEFITS VERIFICATION (TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE) (MISCELLANEOUS AMENDMENTS)&quot;" target="&quot;DOCTORS' CERTIFICATES / MEDICAL CERTIFICATES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance includes doctors' certificates, which are part of the verification process for employee benefits under traditional Chinese medicine."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c873f5413d1d5feab5151fcff500980c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE 2006 ORDINANCE FOR EMPLOYEE BENEFITS VERIFICATION (TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE) (MISCELLANEOUS AMENDMENTS)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE MATERNITY LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance addresses the verification process for employee maternity leave, which is part of the benefits covered under traditional Chinese medicine."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c873f5413d1d5feab5151fcff500980c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE 2006 ORDINANCE FOR EMPLOYEE BENEFITS VERIFICATION (TRADITIONAL CHINESE MEDICINE) (MISCELLANEOUS AMENDMENTS)&quot;" target="&quot;SICK LEAVE VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance includes provisions for verifying sick leave, which is part of the employee benefits verification process under traditional Chinese medicine."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c873f5413d1d5feab5151fcff500980c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATION FOR EMPLOYEE BENEFITS (CHINESE MEDICINE) ORDINANCE 2006&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED CHINESE MEDICINE PRACTITIONER CERTIFICATE OR MEDICAL CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certificates or medical certificates issued by a registered Chinese medicine practitioner are relevant to the Certification for Employee Benefits (Chinese Medicine) Ordinance 2006."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a51df42b306df663c2f2ed8490af27a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
