  <data key="d6">chunk-a51df42b306df663c2f2ed8490af27a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATION FOR EMPLOYEE BENEFITS (CHINESE MEDICINE) ORDINANCE 2006&quot;" target="&quot;THE 2007 EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 2007 Employment (Amendment) Ordinance amends the Certification for Employee Benefits (Chinese Medicine) Ordinance 2006, affecting its applicability and interpretation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a51df42b306df663c2f2ed8490af27a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2007&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACTS OF EMPLOYMENT ENTERED INTO ON OR AFTER THE DATE OF COMMENCEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2007 applies to contracts of employment entered into on or after the date of commencement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e095601c7c6a51576f540b31e9f541b8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2007&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2007 provides rules and regulations for employees' contracts entered into on or after the commencement date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e095601c7c6a51576f540b31e9f541b8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMENCEMENT DATE: 1 DECEMBER 2006&quot;" target="&quot;THE ORIGINAL ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The original ordinance is affected by The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2007, which commences on December 1, 2006."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e095601c7c6a51576f540b31e9f541b8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YEAR-END BONUS OR PART-YEAR-END BONUS DUE FOR PAYMENT ON OR AFTER THE COMMENCEMENT DATE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2007 affects the calculation of year-end bonuses or part-year-end bonuses for employees whose contracts are entered into on or after the commencement date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e095601c7c6a51576f540b31e9f541b8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDING ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2007&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2007 is an Amending Ordinance itself, which amends other existing laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a365e751a6908c5178b1168febad9bcd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDING ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;END OF YEAR PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Amending Ordinance affects how End of Year Payment is calculated for contracts entered into before its Commencement Date but terminated on or after it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a365e751a6908c5178b1168febad9bcd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMENDING ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;MATERNITY PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Amending Ordinance also impacts the calculation of Maternity Pay for certain conditions related to the Commencement Date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a365e751a6908c5178b1168febad9bcd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2007&quot;" target="&quot;COMMENCEMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2007 specifies that its application starts from a certain Commencement Date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a365e751a6908c5178b1168febad9bcd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
