  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The key date for an employee is relevant in determining which set of rules (original text or amended text) applies, especially concerning holiday pay or annual leave pay."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98d46f6e07563bbf79e567c647ecf4fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED PROVISION&quot;" target="&quot;FORMER PROVISION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SPECIFIED PROVISION replaces or amends the FORMER PROVISION, as described in paragraphs (a)(i) and (ii). The relationship is based on how the new provisions are defined relative to the old ones."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3a43725922c10caf8be455ef54288f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORMER PROVISION&quot;" target="&quot;MATERIAL DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MATERIAL DATE can be related to the effective date of FORMER PROVISION, especially in cases where an employee's termination occurs before notification. The relationship is based on paragraph (a)(i) and (ii) of the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b3a43725922c10caf8be455ef54288f1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
