<edge source="&quot;區域法院法官&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"區域法院法官命令僱主提交保证书或将债务款项全额支付给员工，否则可能面临监禁。"&lt;SEP&gt;"區域法院法官需要傳召僱主到庭，並可能命令其提供新的担保人以取代原有擔保人。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d109565430987af7bbb5aad3681f0e0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ef1890ed05a41bc045fd740d85a179</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;區域法院法官&quot;" target="&quot;債項款額&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"區域法院法官命令确保债务款项全额支付，并规定了具体的保证形式和条件以保障此款项的偿还。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d109565430987af7bbb5aad3681f0e0c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;區域法院法官&quot;" target="&quot;擔保人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"區域法院法官可以根據申請解除擔保人的義務。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e2ef1890ed05a41bc045fd740d85a179</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;債項款額&quot;" target="&quot;僱主&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"僱主需要根据区域法院法官的要求提交保证或直接将债务款项全额支付给员工，否则可能面临法律后果。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d109565430987af7bbb5aad3681f0e0c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR OF GUARANTEE DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DEBT RECOVERY PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DEBT RECOVERY PROCEDURES can influence whether a GUARANTOR OF GUARANTEE DOCUMENT's obligations under the document are released or remain in effect."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ffe2fc373a4f6caf645c752f135c7582</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEBT&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sureties are responsible for ensuring the debt is paid if the employer fails to comply with orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-86f4348a1c4677448f8348eacdd112bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORM 3 IN PART II&quot;" target="&quot;SURETIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Form 3 in Part II is used for a bond with sureties approved by the District Judge as security for payment to the employee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sureties are required as part of a bond in Form 3 in Part II for securing payment to the Employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eb63fc0b243ea63257ead6ec4cad1834</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WARRANT IN ACCORDANCE WITH PARAGRAPH 3 OF PART I OF THE SECOND SCHEDULE TO THE EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (SECOND SCHEDULE - PART I, PARAGRAPH 3)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The warrant is issued in accordance with the specific paragraph of the Employment Ordinance's second schedule."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78c6c93b249203abfbdb5ba16af8eb78</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST COLUMN OF SCHEDULE (NAME AND ADDRESS OF EMPLOYEE)&quot;" target="&quot;SECOND COLUMN OF SCHEDULE (AMOUNT OF WAGES AND/OR OTHER MONEYS OWING TO EMPLOYEE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The first column lists the names and addresses of employees, while the second column specifies the amount owed to each employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78c6c93b249203abfbdb5ba16af8eb78</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND COLUMN OF SCHEDULE (AMOUNT OF WAGES AND/OR OTHER MONEYS OWING TO EMPLOYEE)&quot;" target="&quot;THIRD COLUMN OF SCHEDULE (REASON FOR WHICH MONEYS OWING)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The third column provides reasons for the amounts owed in the second column."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78c6c93b249203abfbdb5ba16af8eb78</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULING A WARRANT APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;RECOVERY OF WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Scheduling a warrant application is related to recovering wages that are owed by an employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-78c6c93b249203abfbdb5ba16af8eb78</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;宗敎形式宣誓&quot;" target="&quot;支持申請的誓章&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The religious affirmation is used in the affidavit to support an application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;非宗敎形式宣誓&quot;" target="&quot;支持申請的誓章&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both religious and non-religious affirmations can be used in the affidavit to support an application, depending on personal preference or context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱傭條例&quot;" target="&quot;支持申請的誓章&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance is referenced within the affidavit to support applications, indicating its importance and relevance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;全體及每名香港警務人員及執達主任&quot;" target="&quot;呈遞的申請書&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Police officers and executive officers in Hong Kong are involved in submitting application forms as part of their duties or responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申請人姓名&quot;" target="&quot;僱主姓名&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The applicant's name is contrasted with the employer's name, indicating a relationship between them regarding employment matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WARRANT FOR APPREHENSION OF ABSCONDING EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;FORM 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Form 2 is used to present an application for apprehending an absconding employer as part of the legal process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;呈遞的申請書&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER, &amp;C.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioners and other officials are involved in the process of submitting applications as part of their official duties or responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;呈遞的申請書&quot;" target="&quot;表格1, 表格2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Forms 1 and 2 are used to submit an application, indicating a direct relationship between them for legal purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申請人姓名, 僱主姓名&quot;" target="&quot;香港警務人員及執達主任&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Applicants' names and employer's name may be involved with police officers or executive officers as part of the legal process for applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The names of the applicant and employer may be involved with police officers or executive officers as part of the legal process for applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b88142ce6c5ae26fdcafd8cc6d03845</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG POLICE FORCE&quot;" target="&quot;BAILIFFS OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are law enforcement entities in Hong Kong, with the police force commanding bailiffs to carry out specific actions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-74275f2bcd7afd62cd2b27056407d1e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT NAME NOT PROVIDED&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER NAME NOT PROVIDED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The applicant and employer names are not provided but both are involved in a dispute over unpaid wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-74275f2bcd7afd62cd2b27056407d1e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER NAME&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE NAME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EMPLOYER NAME is legally obligated to pay EMPLOYEE NAME according to the terms specified in the document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-28dd92b4da310e01f1cd35fba648f1f9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEIRS, EXECUTORS AND ADMINISTRATORS&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The HEIRS, EXECUTORS and ADMITRATORS are involved in the legal obligations related to the death of EMPLOYER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af8bb2bf50613f2cddc9c821004e6e7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEIRS, EXECUTORS AND ADMINISTRATORS&quot;" target="&quot;SURETY(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The HEIRS, EXECUTORS and ADMITRATORS are involved in the legal obligations related to the death of EMPLOYER."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af8bb2bf50613f2cddc9c821004e6e7d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;已故僱主&quot;" target="&quot;遺產代理人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在計算第31B(1)條所指明的期間時,僱員僱傭期的連續性不得視為被在該段相隔期間內任何一個星期所打斷。"&lt;SEP&gt;"已故僱主的遺產可能轉移給遺產代理人，涉及業務擁有權變更。第31J條不適用於此情況。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06ca767f5789d5728ccabfdda973865e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;已故僱主&quot;" target="&quot;續訂合約&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"已故僱主死亡後，其遺產代理人可以續訂原僱傭合約。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;已故僱主&quot;" target="&quot;新僱傭合約再次聘用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"已故僱主的遺產代理人可以用新的僱傭合同重新聘用被解僱的僱員。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;已故僱主&quot;" target="&quot;本附表&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"除本附表另有規定外,就一名已死亡的僱主而言,凡提述僱主所作事情或所作與僱主有關的事情時均須解釋為包括提述該已故僱主任何遺產代理人所作事情。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06ca767f5789d5728ccabfdda973865e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遺產代理人&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在私人住戶工作或其受僱的工作是与私人住戶有关的僱員,本附表內凡提述遺產代理人時均解釋為包括任何因已故僱主的死亡而獲轉移該住戶管理權的人。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06ca767f5789d5728ccabfdda973865e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遺產代理人&quot;" target="&quot;受僱為家庭傭工,在私人住戶工作或其受僱的工作是與私人住戶有關的僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"受僱為家庭傭工等類別的人士,包括已故僱主死亡後獲轉移管理權的人。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-52b5d6dfa3dda96fdf1eccd1652082bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遺產代理人&quot;" target="&quot;本附表內凡提述僱主所作事情或所作與僱主有關的事情時&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在計算服務年數時,包括已故僱主的遺產代理人的行為和相關事項。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-52b5d6dfa3dda96fdf1eccd1652082bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遺產代理人&quot;" target="&quot;本附表內凡提述僱主被要求或獲授權作出的事情,或被要求或獲授權作出與他有關的事情時&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在計算服務年數時,包括已故僱主的遺產代理人的行為和相關事項。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-52b5d6dfa3dda96fdf1eccd1652082bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遺產代理人&quot;" target="&quot;本附表內凡提述第31RB條使本條例第VB部適用於受僱為家庭傭工,在私人住戶工作或其受僱的工作是與私人住戶有關的僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"涉及將特定條例應用於已故僱主遺產代理人的行為。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-52b5d6dfa3dda96fdf1eccd1652082bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遺產代理人&quot;" target="&quot;除本附表另有規定外,就一名已死亡的僱主而言&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在計算服務年數時,包括已故僱主遺產代理人的相關事項和行為。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-52b5d6dfa3dda96fdf1eccd1652082bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;新僱傭合約再次聘用&quot;" target="&quot;書面向要約續訂合約&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"書面形式的要約可以用于續訂或重新聘用僱員，具體條款需符合特定條件以避免解僱。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;4個星期內生效&quot;" target="&quot;續訂或新訂合約(視屬何情況而定)的條文與緊接僱主死亡前的有效合約的相應條文無異&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"續訂或重新聘用合同需在已故僱主死亡後四個星期内生效，且條款需符合特定條件。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有效合約&quot;" target="&quot;續訂或新訂合約(視屬何情況而定)的條文與緊接僱主死亡前的有效合約的相應條文無異&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"續訂或重新聘用合同需保持與原有效合同的一致性，以避免解僱。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;要約&quot;" target="&quot;書面形式&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"書面形式的要約可以用于續訂或重新聘用合同，具體條款需符合特定條件以避免解僱。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;重新聘用&quot;" target="&quot;續訂或新訂合約(視屬何情況而定)的條文與緊接僱主死亡前的有效合約的相應條文無異&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"重新聘用需符合特定條件，以避免解僱並保持原合同條款一致。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cad6d0a2eed4fbaf59a6253fe84df6ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遗嘱执行人&quot;" target="&quot;已故雇主死亡前的有效合同条款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据规定，解雇赔偿费是否合理取决于与已故雇主死亡前有效合同条款的关系。遗嘱执行人的角色在此背景下显得重要。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e941c75e00a3faa0f2daf5fb450b75f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;遗嘱执行人&quot;" target="&quot;续订的合同或新合同条款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第4段和第31L(1)条的规定表明，遗嘱执行人取代已故雇主后，续订或新合同条款不能被视为与原有效合同条款不同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e941c75e00a3faa0f2daf5fb450b75f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;续订的合同或新合同条款&quot;" target="&quot;连续性合同&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第3段规定了在已故雇主死亡后，因续约或再次聘用而受聘的情况被视为未被解雇，并且影响到连续性合同的有效期计算。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e941c75e00a3faa0f2daf5fb450b75f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;解雇赔偿费&quot;" target="&quot;第4段规定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第5条规定，在某些情况下拒绝要约不合理，则无权获得解雇赔偿费。这表明了解雇赔偿费和第4段规定的关联性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e941c75e00a3faa0f2daf5fb450b75f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第31D(2)条&quot;" target="&quot;必要期间&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第6条规定，在决定是否合理拒绝要约时，需要考虑第3段和第31D(2)条的条款。这表明了‘必要期间’与这些法律规定的关联性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e941c75e00a3faa0f2daf5fb450b75f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A personal representative may offer renewal or re-employment instead of severance payment in certain circumstances following the death of an employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fbef4b639390d1d66289078a98204ee1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">31.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The personal representative is a successor to the deceased employer's responsibilities and liabilities as per Part VB of this Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The personal representative is appointed after the death of the deceased employer and manages their affairs, including employment contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The personal representative of the deceased employer can make offers for renewal or re-engagement of employment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The personal representative of the deceased employer takes over the business and is responsible for renewing or re-engaging employees after the death of the original employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e17f3710da650d1e14713613a2dff129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a79efc9c7d5b3c5051c209e7d8238e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2419e9b08cdfdf99b66599d9de26ba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The personal representative can offer a contract of employment that may include renewal or re-engagement terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e17f3710da650d1e14713613a2dff129</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31B(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 31B(1) considers the employment period of an employee under a personal representative, including intervals between the deceased employer's death and re-engagement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a79efc9c7d5b3c5051c209e7d8238e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;DEATH OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The death of the deceased employer triggers actions by their personal representative, such as renewing or re-engaging employees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A long service payment may be payable by the personal representative in place of the deceased employer, according to Schedule 6 of Cap 57 RTF (14-05-2026). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f2419e9b08cdfdf99b66599d9de26ba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;PART VB OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part VB of this Ordinance includes provisions that allow the personal representative to act in place of the deceased employer for various purposes, including long service payments. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f2419e9b08cdfdf99b66599d9de26ba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The deceased employer originally signed and managed contracts with employees, which continue under their personal representative after death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a79efc9c7d5b3c5051c209e7d8238e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The deceased employer's liability for long service payment may be transferred or assumed by the personal representative as per Schedule 6 of Cap 57 RTF (14-05-2026). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f2419e9b08cdfdf99b66599d9de26ba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUITABLE EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A renewed or re-engaged contract may be considered suitable employment, depending on the terms offered."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e17f3710da650d1e14713613a2dff129</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNREASONABLY REFUSED OFFER&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An employee who unreasonably refuses an offer for renewal or re-engagement is not entitled to severance payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e17f3710da650d1e14713613a2dff129</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART VA OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The part of this ordinance applies to employees in domestic service roles within private households after their original employer has died."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0a79efc9c7d5b3c5051c209e7d8238e8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART VA OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part VA of this Ordinance deals with severance payments and related liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1c5d2b28a0cc543e1f646cbc0388c9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECEASED EMPLOYER'S LIABILITY FOR SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The liability for severance payment may fall on the deceased employer or their personal representative after death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1c5d2b28a0cc543e1f646cbc0388c9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER'S PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The death of the personal representative can affect the handling and responsibility for severance payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1c5d2b28a0cc543e1f646cbc0388c9eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31N&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The personal representative can make claims under Section 31N regarding benefits or rights related to the deceased employee's contract termination due to death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2f5d9b3d656df85c08982a8986732f4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 31N&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 31N is relevant in claims by the personal representative of a deceased employee, especially if made within one month after the relevant date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2f5d9b3d656df85c08982a8986732f4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE EMPLOYEE HAS UNREASONABLY REFUSED&quot;" target="&quot;DOING OF ANYTHING BY, OR IN RELATION TO, AN EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The phrase 'unreasonably refused' is related to actions taken by or in relation to an employee regarding claims and severance payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da53ed52a17c537de0b1301ebe9c9aa8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;3 MONTHS&quot;" target="&quot;6 MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The text mentions substituting '3 months' with '6 months', indicating a relationship between these time frames in context of claims by personal representatives."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da53ed52a17c537de0b1301ebe9c9aa8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYEE&quot;" target="&quot;DOING OF ANYTHING BY, OR IN RELATION TO, AN EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Personal representative actions are included under the doing of anything by or in relation to an employee as per the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da53ed52a17c537de0b1301ebe9c9aa8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIRD SCHEDULE ADDED 67 OF 1974 S. 6&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Severance payment rights devolve according to provisions outlined in the Third Schedule, which is added by Section 6 of Act 67 of 1974."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da53ed52a17c537de0b1301ebe9c9aa8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;S. 72(1)&quot;" target="&quot;指明條例&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section S. 72(1) is related to the regulation known as '指明條例', both being parts of the legal framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da53ed52a17c537de0b1301ebe9c9aa8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;附表4&quot;" target="&quot;第四附件&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appendix 4 and Fourth Schedule are equivalent terms referring to additional documentation within a larger set of regulations or laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da53ed52a17c537de0b1301ebe9c9aa8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR RELATIONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 55)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are part of the broader legal system addressing employee rights, though they focus on different aspects such as labour relations versus compensation for injuries or illnesses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06d23d2b54047f6e0d92f6798bcab7c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR RELATIONS ORDINANCE (CAP. 55)&quot;" target="&quot;PNEUMOCONIOSIS AND MESOTHELIOMA (COMPENSATION) ORDINANCE (CAP. 360)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances are part of the legal framework addressing employee rights and compensation, though they focus on different health issues such as labour relations versus specific occupational diseases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06d23d2b54047f6e0d92f6798bcab7c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PNEUMOCONIOSIS AND MESOTHELIOMA (COMPENSATION) ORDINANCE (CAP. 360)&quot;" target="&quot;SAVING IN CASE OF DISEASES OTHER THAN OCCUPATIONAL DISEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The compensation for pneumoconiosis or mesothelioma is not affected by the Part IIIA, as it falls under specific conditions where employees can still claim compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-533e2e3a18d5f29b15e52de1cd74da33</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PNEUMOCONIOSIS AND MESOTHELIOMA (COMPENSATION) ORDINANCE (CAP. 360)&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL DEAFNESS (COMPENSATION) ORDINANCE (CAP. 469)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both ordinances deal with compensation for specific occupational diseases, indicating a related context of employee rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-533e2e3a18d5f29b15e52de1cd74da33</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PNEUMOCONIOSIS AND MESOTHELIOMA (COMPENSATION) ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE (AMENDED BY 48 OF 1984 S.33)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule is added to the Pneumoconiosis and Mesothelioma (Compensation) Ordinance by amendment 48 of 1984 section 33."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e77a632eea87bc5c9d8f63b609eb9c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PNEUMOCONIOSIS AND MESOTHELIOMA (COMPENSATION) ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;TABLE (COLUMN 1: AGE; COLUMN 2: YEARS OF SERVICE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The table provides details related to the compensation for Pneumoconiosis and Mesothelioma, including age and years of service criteria."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e77a632eea87bc5c9d8f63b609eb9c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE (AMENDED BY 48 OF 1984 S.33)&quot;" target="&quot;FIFTH SCHEDULE (REPEALED SINCE JUNE 27, 1998)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fourth Schedule is repealed by the Fifth Schedule which was itself repealed since June 27, 1998."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e77a632eea87bc5c9d8f63b609eb9c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOURTH SCHEDULE (AMENDED BY 48 OF 1984 S.33)&quot;" target="&quot;TABLE (COLUMN 1: AGE; COLUMN 2: YEARS OF SERVICE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The table provides details related to the Fourth Schedule, including age and years of service criteria."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e77a632eea87bc5c9d8f63b609eb9c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIFTH SCHEDULE (REPEALED SINCE JUNE 27, 1998)&quot;" target="&quot;TABLE (COLUMN 1: AGE; COLUMN 2: YEARS OF SERVICE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fifth Schedule provided details related to the table before it was repealed since June 27, 1998."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e77a632eea87bc5c9d8f63b609eb9c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER—LONG SERVICE PAYMENTS (FORMAT CHANGES—E.R. 3 OF 2017)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER'S DEATH (FORMAT CHANGES)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Death of Employer and Long Service Payments are related in terms of format changes, both being affected by E.R. 3 of 2017."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e77a632eea87bc5c9d8f63b609eb9c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER—LONG SERVICE PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL/RE-EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The death of the employer can affect employment contract renewal or re-employment, as specified in the regulation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bbdbf6e636df660b4b25abee0836e54e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEATH OF EMPLOYER—LONG SERVICE PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINUOUS EMPLOYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Continuous employment period is considered when determining long service payments after an employer's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bbdbf6e636df660b4b25abee0836e54e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S ESTATE REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINUOUS EMPLOYMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The estate representative of the deceased employer can renew or re-employ, affecting continuous employment periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bbdbf6e636df660b4b25abee0836e54e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER'S ESTATE REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL/RE-EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The estate representative has the authority to renew or re-employ employees after an employer's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bbdbf6e636df660b4b25abee0836e54e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CAP 57 RTF (14-05-2026)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31Z&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 31Z does not apply to changes in business ownership when passed to a personal representative after the death of the deceased employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CAP 57 RTF (14-05-2026)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31ZB&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 31ZB treats the death of the deceased employer as a termination for certain purposes, but allows re-engagement by a personal representative."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CAP 57 RTF (14-05-2026)&quot;" target="&quot;PART VB OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part VB of this Ordinance is the context in which sections like Section 31ZB operate, dealing with employment after a deceased employer's death."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CAP 57 RTF (14-05-2026)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31R OR 31RA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 31R or 31RA are used to determine continuous employment for certain rights and benefits after the death of a deceased employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART VB OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;LONG SERVICE PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance specifies conditions and implications related to long service payment liabilities, which can be transferred or assumed by a personal representative of the deceased employer. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f2419e9b08cdfdf99b66599d9de26ba7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RENEWAL OR RE-ENGAGEMENT TAKING EFFECT NOT LATER THAN 4 WEEKS AFTER THE DEATH OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees can be renewed or re-engaged by the personal representative within four weeks after the death of the deceased employer, maintaining their employment status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERVAL BETWEEN THE DEATH AND THE DATE ON WHICH THE RENEWAL OR RE-ENGAGEMENT TAKES EFFECT&quot;" target="&quot;NUMBER OF YEARS OF SERVICE SPECIFIED IN SECTION 31R OR 31RA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The interval between the death and re-engagement is considered in calculating continuous years of service for certain rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WEEK WHICH FALLS WITHIN THAT INTERVAL&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL BY A PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A week within this interval can be counted as part of the employee's continuous contract if renewed by a personal representative."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT RENEWAL BY A PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;TREATMENT AS NOT BEING BROKEN BY ANY WEEK WHICH FALLS WITHIN THAT INTERVAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The continuity of employment is not broken by any week within the interval if renewed or re-engaged by a personal representative."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RE-ENGAGEMENT UNDER A NEW CONTRACT OF EMPLOYMENT BY SUCH A PERSONAL REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are re-engaged under new contracts after their original employer dies, managed by the personal representative of that deceased employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TREATMENT AS NOT HAVING BEEN DISMISSED BY REASON OF A RENEWAL OR RE-ENGAGEMENT TAKING EFFECT AFTER THE DEATH OF THE DECEASED EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees are not considered dismissed if their contracts are renewed or re-engaged by a personal representative after the death of the deceased employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TREATMENT AS HAVING BEEN EMPLOYED UNDER A CONTINUOUS CONTRACT FOR THE REQUISITE NUMBER OF YEARS OF SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees can be treated as having been employed under a continuous contract for certain years, even if their contracts were renewed or re-engaged after the death of the deceased employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-85644a914cfa94d353943cc7d1724450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1995&quot;" target="=&quot;$180,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The maximum amount of wages earned by the employee during the period is capped at $180,000 before the ordinance's commencement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dba340f7980f6229a5082026062a8004</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1995&quot;" target="=&quot;$210,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The maximum amount of wages earned by the employee during the period is $210,000 from October 1, 1995 to September 30, 1996."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dba340f7980f6229a5082026062a8004</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1995&quot;" target="=&quot;$230,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The maximum amount of wages earned by the employee during the period is $230,000 from October 1, 1996 to September 30, 1997."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dba340f7980f6229a5082026062a8004</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 1995&quot;" target="=&quot;$250,000&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The maximum amount of wages earned by the employee during the period is $250,000 from October 1, 1997 to September 30, 1998."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dba340f7980f6229a5082026062a8004</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
