<edge source="&quot;FINANCIAL SUPPORT FOR ARBITRATION (仲裁的財務支援)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AWARD (仲裁裁決)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Financial support for arbitration may be related to the outcome, specifically an arbitration award."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fecad4beaf00010bb9b31611ad456e88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIRD PARTY FINANCIER (第三者資助方)&quot;" target="&quot;THIRD PARTY FINANCIER (第三者資助方)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'third party financier' is used to describe a financial supporter of arbitration in the context provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fecad4beaf00010bb9b31611ad456e88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISCLOSURE ABOUT END OF THIRD PARTY FUNDING OF ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;FUNDING AGREEMENT (ENDS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A funding agreement ending triggers a disclosure about its end, which may or may not involve the arbitration body depending on circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"This disclosure concerns the ending of a funding agreement, excluding cases where arbitration has ended."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd5d5713c2c272a2a9c9f2f00a8d2933</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COUNSELING INSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consulting institutions may be involved in arbitrating disputes, though not directly mentioned here. The context suggests a relationship through the arbitration process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5247edeafb01587bde32ae379e5261dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUTHORIZED ORGANIZATION&quot;" target="&quot;JUDICIAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Authorized organizations can play roles in judicial proceedings as they are part of the legal system and may be involved indirectly or directly in such processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5247edeafb01587bde32ae379e5261dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUDICIAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Judicial proceedings and arbitration tribunals both fall under legal processes and can interact in terms of compliance with certain regulations or procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5247edeafb01587bde32ae379e5261dc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSULTATIVE BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LAW DEPARTMENT can appoint a CONSULTATIVE BODY as an advisory body to monitor and review the operation of Part 10B."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce27b5b185900927943da2e18ee8c5d0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;AUTHORIZED INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LAW DEPARTMENT can appoint an AUTHORIZED INSTITUTION as someone who exercises powers under section 98P."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce27b5b185900927943da2e18ee8c5d0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAW DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;OUTCOME RELATED FEE STRUCTURE AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION (ORFS AGREEMENT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ORFS AGREEMENT for arbitration is a key document in the LAW DEPARTMENT's purpose of ensuring such agreements are not prohibited by common law doctrines and can be enforced."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce27b5b185900927943da2e18ee8c5d0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSULTATIVE BODY&quot;" target="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The consultative body, with approval from the Chief Judge of the High Court, has the power to make rules for various purposes including those related to arbitration agreements and personal injury claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6183d5dd90a32799bbb3d1b3a01652ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION (ARBITRATION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ORFS agreement for arbitration is related to the concept of arbitration as defined in the text, including court procedures and emergency arbitrator proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b8df8f796c1527424030ca7952635395</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL INJURIES CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ORFS agreement for arbitration is void and unenforceable to the extent that it relates to a personal injuries claim."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6183d5dd90a32799bbb3d1b3a01652ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;CLIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The client must give written notice regarding the ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eac62f2f1327a829e40a168eae3df71e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;CONDITIONAL FEE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An ORFS agreement for arbitration can include a conditional fee agreement as one of the descriptions of costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL EXPENSES INSURANCE PREMIUM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A legal expenses insurance premium is considered a cost under an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;NORMAL FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The normal fee can be part of the costs specified in an ORFS agreement for arbitration if there's no conditional fee agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNDING AGREEMENT WITHIN THE MEANING OF PART 10A&quot;" target="&quot;PART 10B NOT APPLICABLE TO FUNDING AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The funding agreement within the meaning of Part 10A is specifically excluded from the application of Part 10B, as stated in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b8df8f796c1527424030ca7952635395</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION (ARBITRATION)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL EXPENSES INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both concepts are related to financial aspects of disputes and proceedings, with arbitration involving court procedures and legal expenses insurance covering certain legal costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b8df8f796c1527424030ca7952635395</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL EXPENSES INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;MONEY OR MONEY'S WORTH&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal expenses insurance covers certain legal fees which can be considered as money's worth under specific conditions, as defined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b8df8f796c1527424030ca7952635395</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL EXPENSES INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;律師&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"律师涉及法律费用保险，可能作为被保险人或保险公司处理相关理赔事宜。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce0cbc87febf0559389231de15b6441b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEE OR REIMBURSEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms refer to costs or advances paid by a client for legal services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-454f67393ac66e31ad436e5012345559</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEE OR REIMBURSEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONDITIONAL FEE AGREEMENT (CFA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CFA involves fee arrangements, which can include reimbursement of expenses or financial benefits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-454f67393ac66e31ad436e5012345559</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEE OR REIMBURSEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT (DBA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DBA is a type of fee arrangement based on damages, potentially involving costs and reimbursements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-454f67393ac66e31ad436e5012345559</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEE OR REIMBURSEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;HYBRID DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT (HDBA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"HDBA combines elements of DBAs and may involve fee arrangements including costs and reimbursements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-454f67393ac66e31ad436e5012345559</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCIAL BENEFIT&quot;" target="&quot;EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Financial benefit can include expenses or payments related to legal services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-454f67393ac66e31ad436e5012345559</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPENSES&quot;" target="&quot;CLIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Clients are responsible for or may be reimbursed by expenses incurred during legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-454f67393ac66e31ad436e5012345559</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLIENT&quot;" target="&quot;DISCLOSURE ABOUT END OF ORFS AGREEMENT FOR ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The client is responsible for disclosing information about the end of an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-eac62f2f1327a829e40a168eae3df71e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;律師&quot;" target="&quot; MONEY OR MONEY'S WORTH &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"律师处理涉及金钱或等值物的事务，包括费用、赔偿和其他形式的价值。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce0cbc87febf0559389231de15b6441b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;律師&quot;" target="&quot;ORFS協議&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"律師與當事人訂立ORFS協議,需通知其他相關方。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0dbf6f53e54d631a68b2a604874d6c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;出庭律师&quot;" target="&quot;仲裁&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"出庭律师在仲裁程序中代表当事人进行法律辩护和处理相关事务。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce0cbc87febf0559389231de15b6441b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;执业律师&quot;" target="&quot;资助协议&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"执业律师可能涉及与资助协议相关的收费结构，特别是在某些特定情况下提供服务。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce0cbc87febf0559389231de15b6441b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONAL FEE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUCCESS FEE (SUCCESS FEE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Success fee is a component of conditional fee agreements, specifically related to the success in an outcome as per such agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2799d5a0031a68f64f3cd87dbc0dabae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONAL FEE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUCCESS FEE (成功收費)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'success fee' is defined within the context of a conditional fee agreement, referring to the payment calculated based on the success outcome for the client."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONAL FEE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUCCESSFUL OUTCOME (成果)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A successful outcome is central to determining whether a success fee can be charged under a conditional fee agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'successful outcome' is a key element that triggers the payment of fees under a conditional fee agreement, making it directly related to this type of arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of 'successful outcome' in a conditional fee agreement is directly related to the success criteria that determine whether fees are payable."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONAL FEE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT (DBA費用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While both are fee arrangements tied to client success in legal matters, they differ in the specific conditions under which fees can be charged."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONAL FEE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DBA FEES (DBA费用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">21.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both types of agreements involve fee payments based on successful outcomes for clients, though they are defined and structured differently."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both types of agreements involve fee payments based on successful outcomes for clients, though they are structured differently in terms of when and how fees can be charged."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONAL FEE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUCCESS FEE AS DEFINED BY SECTION 98ZC(2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A success fee as defined by section 98ZC(2) is part of the costs if there's a conditional fee agreement in an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUCCESSFUL OUTCOME (SUCCESSFUL OUTCOME)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Successful outcomes are relevant to damages-based agreements, defining what constitutes a successful result under these agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2799d5a0031a68f64f3cd87dbc0dabae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;HYBRID DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both agreements involve a lawyer agreeing to be paid based on the client's financial benefit, but with different payment structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98e9907f4439e46ca077ec9da34b8a1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUCCESS FEE (成功收費)&quot;" target="&quot;DBA FEES (DBA费用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms refer to fees based on successful outcomes in legal matters, though they arise from different types of agreements and are calculated differently."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both terms refer to payments based on successful outcomes, though they arise from different types of agreements: conditional and damages-based respectively."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUCCESS FEE (成功收費)&quot;" target="&quot;SUCCESSFUL OUTCOME (成果)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 'success fee' is directly related to a successful outcome as defined by both conditional and damages-based agreements, making it the basis for potential payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUCCESS FEE (成功收費)&quot;" target="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT (DBA費用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 'success fee' in both types of agreements is based on the successful outcome, though it specifically refers to a conditional fee agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUCCESSFUL OUTCOME (成果)&quot;" target="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT (DBA費用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In both conditional and damages-based agreements, successful outcomes are tied to potential financial gains for the client which can trigger fee payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'successful outcome' is a key factor in determining whether DBA fees can be charged, as it relates to the financial benefits obtained by the client."&lt;SEP&gt;"The concept of 'successful outcome' is central to both conditional fee agreements and damages-based agreements, determining the potential for fee payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUCCESSFUL OUTCOME (成果)&quot;" target="&quot;SUCCESS FEE (成功收费)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'successful outcome' directly influences whether and how much a success fee can be charged under both types of agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUCCESSFUL OUTCOME (成果)&quot;" target="&quot;DBA FEES (DBA费用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The successful outcome is the basis for potential DBA fees, as it determines whether and how much financial benefit has been obtained by the client."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUCCESSFUL OUTCOME (成果)&quot;" target="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT (DBA费用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 'successful outcome' is a key factor that triggers the potential for DBA fees, as it relates to financial benefits obtained by the client."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT (DBA費用)&quot;" target="&quot;DBA FEES (DBA费用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'DBA fees' directly refers to the payments made based on financial benefits obtained by the client under a damages-based agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DBA FEES (DBA费用)&quot;" target="&quot;SUCCESS FEE (成功收费)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both terms refer to fee payments based on successful outcomes in legal matters, though they arise from different types of agreements and are calculated differently."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS協議&quot;" target="&quot;普通法的助証罪&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第98ZF條明確指出,普通法的助証罪不適用於ORFS協議。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bdc18a88b44e3aeac65b0b72ead47ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS協議&quot;" target="&quot;唆訟者罪&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第98ZG條和第98ZH條表明,唆訟者罪也不適用於ORFS協議。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bdc18a88b44e3aeac65b0b72ead47ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS協議&quot;" target="&quot;包攬訴讼的侵權法律責任&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第98ZF條和第98ZG條指出,包攬訴訟的侵權法律責任也不適用於ORFS協議。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bdc18a88b44e3aeac65b0b72ead47ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS協議&quot;" target="&quot;第4分部&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第4部分适用于与仲裁相关的ORFS协议。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ec40a32e838182a39a402688664a335</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS協議&quot;" target="&quot;第7分部 —— 其他措施及保障&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第7分部涉及其他措施和保障,包括与ORFS协议相关的资料传递规则。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc6ead6e2679a8dfdba550b0494d664b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS協議&quot;" target="&quot;當事人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"當事人參與ORFS協議,須由律師發出書面通知其姓名或名稱。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0dbf6f53e54d631a68b2a604874d6c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORFS協議&quot;" target="&quot;仲裁機構&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ORFS協議需向仲裁的其他各方及仲裁機構披露。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0dbf6f53e54d631a68b2a604874d6c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通法的助証罪&quot;" target="&quot;唆訟者罪&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"二者都是普通法下的相關罪行,且第98ZF條和第98ZG條都指出這些罪行不適用於ORFS協議。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bdc18a88b44e3aeac65b0b72ead47ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;普通法的助証罪&quot;" target="&quot;包攬訴讼的侵權法律責任&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"二者都是普通法下的相關法律責任,且都受到ORFS協議條款的影響。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bdc18a88b44e3aeac65b0b72ead47ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第98ZF條&quot;" target="&quot;第98ZH條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"兩條條款共同作用,確保ORFS協議不受普通法下特定罪行和侵權行為的影響。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bdc18a88b44e3aeac65b0b72ead47ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第98ZG條&quot;" target="&quot;第10B部&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第98ZI條表明,即使仲裁地點不在香港,第10B部仍然適用於ORFS協議,這體現了兩者之間的聯繫。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bdc18a88b44e3aeac65b0b72ead47ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第98ZH條&quot;" target="&quot;第10B部&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雖然第98ZF、98ZG和98ZH條主要關注仲裁地點在香港的情況,但第98ZI條表明這些規定與第10B部之間存在聯繫。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8bdc18a88b44e3aeac65b0b72ead47ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;咨询机构&quot;" target="&quot;规则&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"咨询机构根据第98ZM条制定的规则用于界定ORFS协议的有效性和可强制执行性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ec40a32e838182a39a402688664a335</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;规则&quot;" target="&quot;人身伤害申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第98ZK条的规定，在涉及人身伤害索赔的范围内，与仲裁相关的ORFS协议无效且不可强制执行。但这一规定不适用于所有情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ec40a32e838182a39a402688664a335</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;HIGH COURT CHIEF JUDGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Chief Judge of the High Court gives prior approval for the consultative body to make certain types of rules, which impacts arbitration agreements and personal injuries claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6183d5dd90a32799bbb3d1b3a01652ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HIGH COURT CHIEF JUDGE&quot;" target="&quot;RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The High Court Chief Judge may make rules for more effective implementation of this section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f87d18cc47acf07db6f5458960b21f19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EACH OTHER PARTY TO THE ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;THE ARBITRATION BODY (IF ANY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties must notify each other and the arbitration body as required by procedural rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b83c6369ee22a5baf386b25e3605cb81</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ARBITRATION BODY (IF ANY)&quot;" target="&quot;LAWYER'S OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lawyers' offices ensure procedural compliance with arbitration, which may be reviewed by courts or arbitral tribunals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b83c6369ee22a5baf386b25e3605cb81</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY COURT OR ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;LAWYER'S OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts or arbitral tribunals may consider compliance with procedural requirements, which are enforced by lawyers' offices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b83c6369ee22a5baf386b25e3605cb81</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NORMAL FEE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal may order a party to pay the normal fee if there's no conditional fee agreement in an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 SECTION 1-7&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 1 OF SCHEDULE 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 1 of Schedule 2 can be included as one of the descriptions of costs under an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 SECTION 1-7&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 2 OF SCHEDULE 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 2 of Schedule 2 can be included as one of the descriptions of costs under an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 SECTION 1-7&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 3 OF SCHEDULE 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 3 of Schedule 2 can be included as one of the descriptions of costs under an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 SECTION 1-7&quot;" target="&quot;SECTIONS 4 AND 7 OF SCHEDULE 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 4 and 7 of Schedule 2 can be included as one of the descriptions of costs under an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 SECTION 1-7&quot;" target="&quot;SECTIONS 5, 6 AND 7 OF SCHEDULE 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 5, 6 and 7 of Schedule 2 can be included as one of the descriptions of costs under an ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COSTS ORDERED BY ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An arbitral tribunal has the authority to order costs, including those specified in an ORFS agreement for arbitration or a normal fee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5edce5a2ca2140e309b11b70c29b15f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOMESTIC ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Domestic arbitration agreements are specified as a type that can be covered by certain sections of Schedule 2."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ad741dbed5c956a0e2be863adf9b077</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SUBCONTRACT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A construction subcontract agreement is considered in the context of a main construction contract, potentially subject to its terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ad741dbed5c956a0e2be863adf9b077</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SUBCONTRACT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both the main construction contract and subcontract agreement may include arbitration clauses, potentially subjecting them to similar provisions in Schedule 2."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ad741dbed5c956a0e2be863adf9b077</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TABLE 2&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Table 2 includes all terms applicable to arbitration agreements as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca57b579105e713a9a47fbe85dd981f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG CONSTRUCTION SUBCONTRACTING CASES&quot;" target="&quot;SUBCONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subcontracting cases are directly related to subcontracts, as they involve the division and reassignment of construction operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f0a5fd141643101c1f971cefdaf4f9ef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG CONSTRUCTION SUBCONTRACTING CASES&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arbitration agreements in subcontracting cases apply according to Schedule 2 provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f0a5fd141643101c1f971cefdaf4f9ef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION OPERATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SUBCONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction operations can be subcontracted, indicating a direct relationship between the two concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f0a5fd141643101c1f971cefdaf4f9ef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SPECIFIED STRUCTURE refers to any building, structure or works specified in Schedule 2. SUBCONTRACT (分包合約)—see section 5 is related as it deals with the construction of such structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (CONTRACT A)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A subcontract is defined in relation to another construction contract where the former may be a part of the latter's scope of work or supply requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f53c86b3a5549c4a064860e12f41a1b1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Subcontract is a part or extension of the MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT, governed by similar rules and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66157f73d78c8a042051d0b5db5e4492</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment disputes can involve SUBCONTRACTS, as seen in the context of main private contracts and subcontracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OPT-IN PROVISIONS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Opt-in provisions automatically apply to arbitration agreements in certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f0a5fd141643101c1f971cefdaf4f9ef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY COUNCIL ORDINANCE (CAP. 587)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 100 AND 101&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 100 and 101 are part of the Construction Industry Council Ordinance (Cap. 587)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY COUNCIL ORDINANCE (CAP. 587)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 99&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 99 is mentioned in relation to Section 102, which does not derogate from its operation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY COUNCIL ORDINANCE (CAP. 587)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ordinance refers to arbitration agreements in the context of Sections 100 and 101 not applying under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 100(A) OR (B)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 100 defines conditions under which subsections 2, 3, and 4 apply to arbitration agreements in construction contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;" target="&quot;NATURAL PERSON WHO IS ORDINARILY RESIDENT OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection conditions specify that a natural person resident outside Hong Kong is not covered by the arbitration agreement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;" target="&quot;BODY CORPORATE—INCORPORATED UNDER THE LAW OF A PLACE OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection conditions specify that a body corporate incorporated outside Hong Kong is not covered by the arbitration agreement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;" target="&quot;ASSOCIATION—FORMED UNDER THE LAW OF A PLACE OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection conditions specify that an association formed outside Hong Kong is not covered by the arbitration agreement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;" target="&quot;CENTRAL MANAGEMENT AND CONTROL EXERCISED OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection conditions specify that central management and control exercised outside Hong Kong excludes entities from coverage under the arbitration agreement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;" target="&quot;RELEVANT OPERATION WHICH IS TO BE PERFORMED OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection conditions specify that relevant operations performed outside Hong Kong exclude entities from coverage under the arbitration agreement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON TO WHOM THE WHOLE OR ANY PART OF THE RELEVANT OPERATION IS SUBCONTRACTED UNDER THE SUBCONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection conditions specify that subcontracting parties are excluded from coverage under the arbitration agreement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSTANTIAL PART OF THE RELEVANT OPERATION WHICH IS SUBCONTRACTED UNDER THE SUBCONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection conditions specify that a substantial part of subcontracted operations performed outside Hong Kong excludes entities from coverage under the arbitration agreement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (2), (3), (4)&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON TO WHOM THE WHOLE OR ANY PART OF THE RELEVANT OPERATION THAT IS SUBCONTRACTED UNDER THE SUBCONTRACT HAS NO PLACE OF BUSINESS IN HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection conditions specify that entities without a place of business in Hong Kong are excluded from coverage under the arbitration agreement provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FURTHER SUBCONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 APPLY TO A SUBCONTRACTING PARTIES' ARBITRATION AGREEMENT UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Further subcontracting can extend Schedule 2's application to additional parties under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 APPLY TO A SUBCONTRACTING PARTIES' ARBITRATION AGREEMENT UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;" target="&quot;SUBCONTRACTING PARTIES' ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule 2's provisions apply to arbitration agreements included in further subcontracting, extending the scope of coverage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2015年第11號第4條修訂&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1), (2), (3), (4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The revision updates and modifies Subsections 1 to 4, affecting their applicability in arbitration agreements for construction contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELEVANT OPERATION THAT IS SUBCONTRACTED UNDER THE SUBCONTRACT IS FURTHER SUBCONTRACTED TO ANOTHER PERSON UNDER A FURTHER CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (FURTHER SUBCONTRACT)&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 APPLY TO A SUBCONTRACTING PARTIES' ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Further subcontracting can extend the application of Schedule 2's provisions to additional parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROVISIONS IN SCHEDULE 2 APPLY TO THE ARBITRATION AGREEMENT SO INCLUDED IN THAT FURTHER SUBCONTRACT AS IF THAT FURTHER SUBCONTRACT WERE A SUBCONTRACT UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE 2 APPLY TO A SUBCONTRACTING PARTIES' ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule 2's provisions apply to arbitration agreements in further subcontracting as if they were primary subcontracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 102&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (1), (2), (3), (4)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 102 provides exceptions and conditions that can override the applicability of Subsections 1 to 4 in arbitration agreements for construction contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION OPERATIONS (建造工程)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction contract defines the scope of construction operations, which are key terms in arbitration agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK (建造工作)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A construction contract involves work that is defined by 'construction work', indicating a direct relationship between the two terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約)&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT (總私人承包合約)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A main private contract is a specific type of construction contract as defined in the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約)&quot;" target="&quot;OWNER (擁有人)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An owner enters into construction contracts for work to be carried out on their property or sites they own."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約)&quot;" target="&quot;PANEL OF ADJUDICATORS (審裁員名單)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudicators may be involved in resolving disputes arising from 'construction contracts', linking the two terms through legal processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (付款申索)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment claims arise from 'construction contracts', directly linking these two terms in financial obligations and disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約)&quot;" target="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The construction contract is relevant to the determination of a set aside application as it pertains to the subject matter of the dispute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION OPERATIONS (建造工程)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約 HAS THE MEANING GIVEN TO IT BY SECTION 2(1))&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 2 defines the meaning of 'construction contract,' which is essential in defining 'construction operations.'"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1) HAS EFFECT SUBJECT TO SUBSECTION (2)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約), CONSTRUCTION OPERATIONS (建造工程)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection 1's effect is limited by Subsection 2, which conditions the applicability of arbitration agreements based on parties' place and operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1) DOES NOT APPLY IF—&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (建造合約), CONSTRUCTION OPERATIONS (建造工程)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsection 1's applicability is conditional on specific conditions related to parties' place and operations in Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c552b5974a2cb841d6608ab71d886584</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 100 AND 101&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 99&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 99's operation is unaffected by Sections 100 and 101 when specific conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 100 AND 101&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The applicability of Sections 100 and 101 depends on the arbitration agreement's terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e40e8a615669f7f3c43f8171f5d7b57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART 11A&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part 11A can apply to an arbitration if agreed by the parties involved, regardless of where the arbitration takes place."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART 11A&quot;" target="&quot;COMMENCEMENT DATE: 1 JANUARY 2018.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part 11A becomes applicable on January 1, 2018, for arbitrations and related proceedings if agreed by the parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;PART 11A OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part 11A defines IPR dispute as a term within its scope."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;PATENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR dispute includes patent as one type of IPR under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;GEOGRAPHICAL INDICATION (地理标志)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR dispute includes geographical indication as one type of IPR under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;DESIGN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR dispute includes design as one type of IPR under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;COPYRIGHT OR RELATED RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR dispute includes copyright or related rights as one type of IPR under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;DOMAIN NAME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR dispute includes domain name as one type of IPR under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;INTEGRATED CIRCUIT LAYOUT DESIGN (集成电路布图设计)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR dispute includes integrated circuit layout design as one type of IPR under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;PLANT VARIETY RIGHT (植物新品种权)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR dispute includes plant variety right as one type of IPR under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION, BUSINESS SECRETS, INDUSTRIAL KNOWLEDGE RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR dispute includes confidential information and business secrets as part of industrial knowledge rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;ACTION FOR COUNTERFEITING (假冒诉讼)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Action for counterfeiting is a type of IPR dispute under the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Articles of UNCITRAL Model Law are referenced in Hong Kong's legal framework for dealing with issues related to IPR disputes, as seen in sections 81 and 86."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75abbf9735ce9959e08a7259663fa08d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arbitration agreements provide a mechanism for resolving IPR disputes as per the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d9d91db74534ffd661699611c1087da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE产权 (知识产权)&quot;" target="&quot;PART 11A OF THE ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part 11A deals with provisions related to intellectual property rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-da8c2939156a68d994838f2e9bd0f166</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PASSING OFF OR SIMILAR ACTION AGAINST UNFAIR COMPETITION&quot;" target="&quot;INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHT (IPR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Passing off or similar action against unfair competition is a type of intellectual property right that protects goodwill."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1c7a6213a2f876bebd1fa609680c4fd8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PASSING OFF OR SIMILAR ACTION AGAINST UNFAIR COMPETITION&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION (註冊)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registration can be part of the protection mechanism for passing off or similar action against unfair competition, though it is not explicitly mentioned in the text as a direct relationship but relevant to IPRs in general."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1c7a6213a2f876bebd1fa609680c4fd8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHT (IPR)&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION (註冊)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registration is a process that can protect various types of intellectual property rights, including those not explicitly mentioned like passing off or similar action against unfair competition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1c7a6213a2f876bebd1fa609680c4fd8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERPRETATION: IPR DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interpretation of IPR disputes includes provisions for arbitration as a means to resolve such issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98b6711af3c5bbaf4412b6b0eda86915</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED ENTITY&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SPECIFIED ENTITY, as defined by Hong Kong law or other jurisdictions, can be parties to an ARBITRATION AGREEMENT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49949a92adb17e5dadd770d704b72f8e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED ENTITY&quot;" target="&quot;IPR DISPUTES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SPECIFIED ENTITY can be a party to an IPR dispute that may be subject to arbitration under Hong Kong law or other jurisdictions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49949a92adb17e5dadd770d704b72f8e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IPR DISPUTES&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IPR DISPUTES are capable of settlement through arbitration according to the agreement between the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49949a92adb17e5dadd770d704b72f8e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 70 OF THE ARBITRATION ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 70 of the Arbitration Ordinance limits the powers granted to an arbitral tribunal in determining IPR disputes based on agreements between the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49949a92adb17e5dadd770d704b72f8e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OPTION I OF ARTICLE 7(1) OF THE UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration procedure is derived from Option I of Article 7(1) of the UNCITRAL Model Law, which sets out how parties can agree to arbitrate an IPR dispute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39620e4541eb49ae7a7ea14a2cf664bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OPTION I OF ARTICLE 7(1) OF THE UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;" target="&quot;KNOWLEDGE PROPERTY RIGHT DISPUTE (IPR DISPUTE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration procedure applies to disputes arising from knowledge property rights as per Option I of Article 7(1) of the UNCITRAL Model Law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39620e4541eb49ae7a7ea14a2cf664bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED ENTITY (指明實體)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Specified entities under Hong Kong law can be given jurisdiction to decide IPR disputes, but this does not preclude arbitration as per Section 103E of the UNCITRAL Model Law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39620e4541eb49ae7a7ea14a2cf664bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED ENTITY (指明實體)&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A public contract involves one or more owners where at least one owner must be a specified entity according to the definition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f53c86b3a5549c4a064860e12f41a1b1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED ENTITY (指明實體)&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A main private contract involves one or more owners none of which is a specified entity according to the definition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f53c86b3a5549c4a064860e12f41a1b1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIRD PARTY LICENSEE (第三方特許持有人)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Third party licensees are considered in the context of IPR disputes and their rights or liabilities can be determined through arbitration procedures as per Section 103E."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39620e4541eb49ae7a7ea14a2cf664bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIRD PARTY LICENSEE (第三方特許持有人)&quot;" target="&quot;PARTY TO THE ARBITRAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A THIRD PARTY LICENSEE is not a direct party in the arbitration proceedings, yet their rights and liabilities are still affected by the outcomes of these proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b2687bf72645c6f4d1292a242f8ee55</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 70 OF THE UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 70 provides arbitral tribunals with powers to award remedies in deciding IPR disputes, which is part of the arbitration procedure outlined by the Model Law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39620e4541eb49ae7a7ea14a2cf664bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 103E OF THE UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 103E addresses the enforceability of arbitral awards in IPR disputes, which is part of the broader arbitration procedure as per Section 70 and other sections of the Model Law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39620e4541eb49ae7a7ea14a2cf664bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY (IP)&quot;" target="&quot;EXCLUSIVE LICENSEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EXCLUSIVE LICENSEE has a specific type of license under INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY, distinguishing it from NON-EXCLUSIVE LICENSEE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b2687bf72645c6f4d1292a242f8ee55</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY (IP)&quot;" target="&quot;NON-EXCLUSIVE LICENSEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"NON-EXCLUSIVE LICENSEE also holds rights over INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY but with less exclusive control compared to EXCLUSIVE LICENSEE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b2687bf72645c6f4d1292a242f8ee55</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTIONS 86(2)(A), 89(3)(A), 95(3)(A) AND 98D(3)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTIONS 86(2)(B), 89(3)(B), 95(3)(B) AND 98D(3)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The sections are related in the context of arbitration and public policy, particularly concerning intellectual property rights disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e876339a2824bdfc9f79a847c9528353</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AWARD (裁決)&quot;" target="&quot;PATENTS ORDINANCE (CAP. 514) &quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The award is mentioned in relation to decisions made under the Patents Ordinance, specifically regarding patents and their validity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d9d91db74534ffd661699611c1087da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHORT-TERM PATENT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Short-term patents are subject to arbitration agreements as per section 103J of the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2d9d91db74534ffd661699611c1087da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHORT-TERM PATENT&quot;" target="&quot;THE PATENT ORDINANCE (PO)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SHORT-TERM PATENT is defined under THE PATENT ORDINANCE (PO). The PO governs the rights and enforcement procedures for such patents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7dab1df7b5bb64669485d4dce1155fb1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHORT-TERM PATENT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS can be used to enforce RIGHTS related to SHORT-TERM PATENTS under THE PATENT ORDINANCE (PO)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7dab1df7b5bb64669485d4dce1155fb1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHORT-TERM PATENT&quot;" target="&quot;PO&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'short-term patent' is defined by section 2(1) of the PO, establishing a clear relationship between these two entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8322a8472d188ae5550ad46529f8b37b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PATENT ORDINANCE (PO)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS are mentioned in relation to enforcing RIGHTS under THE PATENT ORDINANCE (PO), specifically regarding SHORT-TERM PATENTS. The PO's provisions apply to these proceedings as if they were enforcement procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7dab1df7b5bb64669485d4dce1155fb1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PATENT ORDINANCE (PO)&quot;" target="&quot;ENFORCEMENT OF PATENT RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ENFORCEMENT OF PATENT RIGHTS is a key aspect of THE PATENT ORDINANCE (PO), particularly in the context of SHORT-TERM PATENTS and ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7dab1df7b5bb64669485d4dce1155fb1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENFORCEMENT OF PATENT RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ENFORCEMENT OF PATENT RIGHTS and ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS are interconnected, with the latter potentially used to enforce such rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7dab1df7b5bb64669485d4dce1155fb1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PATENTS ORDINANCE (CAP. 514)&quot;" target="&quot;PO&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'PO' is defined as the Patents Ordinance (Cap. 514), indicating a direct relationship between these two entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8322a8472d188ae5550ad46529f8b37b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL OR MEDIATOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE OR AGENT OF THE TRIBUNAL OR MEDIATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee or agent of the ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL OR MEDIATOR is legally responsible for their actions related to the exercise or performance of arbitration functions only if these acts are done dishonestly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c6ad0ff0d84a37cbf46865a76db573d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL OR MEDIATOR&quot;" target="&quot;MEDIATOR (調解員)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'mediator' refers to a mediator appointed under section 32 or referred to in section 33, and is legally responsible for their actions only if these acts are done dishonestly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c6ad0ff0d84a37cbf46865a76db573d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE OR AGENT OF THE TRIBUNAL OR MEDIATOR&quot;" target="&quot;MEDIATOR (調解員)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employee or agent of the ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL OR MEDIATOR is legally responsible for their actions related to the exercise or performance of mediation functions only if these acts are done dishonestly, similar to a mediator's responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c6ad0ff0d84a37cbf46865a76db573d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER AND MANAGER&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner and Manager can appoint an Arbitration Tribunal, which establishes a relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6afb8943a99ee7bf996b0ce17c18a04b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER AND MANAGER&quot;" target="&quot;MEDIATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner and Manager can exercise or execute administrative functions related to Mediation Procedure, establishing a connection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6afb8943a99ee7bf996b0ce17c18a04b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER AND MANAGER&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commissioner and Manager are involved in arbitration procedures by appointing arbitrators or exercising administrative functions related to it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6afb8943a99ee7bf996b0ce17c18a04b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE FUNCTION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Arbitration Tribunal is involved in administrative functions, creating a relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6afb8943a99ee7bf996b0ce17c18a04b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE FUNCTION&quot;" target="&quot;MEDIATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mediation Procedure involves administrative functions, establishing a link between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6afb8943a99ee7bf996b0ce17c18a04b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEDIATION PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of mediation procedure is explained to be similar to arbitration proceedings within the same legal framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8214b3161676dee8df8d19240ebf6752</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
