  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;适用范围* (第1条)&quot;" target="&quot;国际商事仲裁&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 1(1) defines the scope as applicable to international commercial arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;仲裁地点在本国内的情况&quot; (第1条2款)" target="&quot;营业地点&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 1(2) specifies that if the arbitration takes place within a country, it is related to business locations there."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;国际仲裁的情形&quot; (第1条3款)" target="&quot;与争议事项关系最密切的地点&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 1(3)(b)(ii) refers to places most closely connected with the dispute as those where a significant part of commercial obligations are performed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;营业地点&quot;" target="&quot;惯常住所&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 1(4)b defines that if there is no business location, the habitual residence will be used instead."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;国际商事仲裁&quot;" target="&quot;本法之规定,除第8、9、17H、17I、17J、35及36条外&quot; (第1条2款)">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 1(2) specifies that the law applies to international commercial arbitration except for certain provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;集体反思&quot; (第1条5款)" target="&quot;加密对话继续展开,其复杂的模式显示出几乎超乎寻常的预见性&quot; (第1条5款)">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Article 1(5) and the ongoing encrypted dialogue reflect a collective consideration of complex issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b88d5ece94b64060cd9c9c3ca51a624</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIS LAW&quot;" target="&quot;STATE(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
