  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"General principles are relevant to how Article 32(2)(a) is interpreted, especially concerning defenses and counter-claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c4488b1327869fe2b0410a202e25b48</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 2A&quot;" target="&quot;INTERNATIONAL ORIGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The note on Article 2A explicitly mentions its international origin as one of the factors in interpretation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c4488b1327869fe2b0410a202e25b48</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 4 - WAIVER OF RIGHT TO OBJECT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 11&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 11 is referenced as a note in Article 4, indicating cross-referencing between the two sections."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-867eea6bba840f054f655ce7e36c7717</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
