  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ELECTRONIC COMMUNICATION (電子通信)&quot;" target="&quot;TELEGRAPHY (電報)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Telegraphy was an early form of electronic communication that has evolved into modern digital forms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ELECTRONIC COMMUNICATION (電子通信)&quot;" target="&quot;TELEX COMMUNICATION (電傳通信)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Telex communication is another historical form of electronic communication, now largely replaced by more advanced technologies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ELECTRONIC COMMUNICATION (電子通信)&quot;" target="&quot;FAX MACHINE (傳真機)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fax machines are a specific type of device used for sending and receiving faxes as part of electronic communications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSION (委員會)&quot;" target="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM (爭議解決機制)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The commission is responsible for formulating mechanisms and procedures for dispute resolution, including arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM (爭議解決機制)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATOR (仲裁員)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An arbitrator is a key component in the dispute resolution mechanism, facilitating fair and impartial decision-making."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM STATEMENT AND DEFENSE STATEMENT (索賠聲明和抗辯聲明)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Claim statements and defense statements can be part of an arbitration agreement when disputes arise between parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN FORM (書面形式)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The written form is a requirement for valid arbitration agreements, ensuring clarity and enforceability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMUNICATION PROTOCOL (通信協議)&quot;" target="&quot;INTERNATIONAL STANDARDIZATION ORGANIZATION (國際標準化組織)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"International standardization organizations develop and promote communication protocols to enhance global interoperability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMUNICATION PROTOCOL (通信協議)&quot;" target="&quot;ELECTRONIC COMMUNICATION PROTOCOL (電子通信協議)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Electronic communication protocols are a subset of broader communication protocols used for electronic communications, including data electric documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK (法律框架)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The framework of the arbitration agreement includes various forms and requirements, such as written form and content recording."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACTUAL RELATIONSHIP (合同關係)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An arbitration agreement is an agreement by parties to submit disputes related to their contractual or non-contractual legal relationship for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DATA STORAGE AND RETRIEVAL MECHANISM (數據存儲和調取機制)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Data storage and retrieval mechanisms are essential for maintaining records of arbitration agreements and related communications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DATA ELECTRIC DOCUMENT SYSTEM (數據電文系統)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Data electric document systems support the creation, storage, and retrieval of arbitration-related documents in digital form."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION INSTITUTION (仲裁機構)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arbitration institutions provide the framework and support necessary to facilitate arbitration agreements and processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd35e44f40ed90831a05d2c28acb9a5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITING&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration agreement must be in writing according to the definition provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITING&quot;" target="&quot;REFERENCE TO DOCUMENT CONTAINING ARBITRATION CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A reference to a document containing an arbitration clause is considered writing according to the definition of arbitration agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITING&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 7. DEFINITION OF ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 7 defines what constitutes an arbitration agreement in writing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 7. DEFINITION OF ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;REFERENCE TO DOCUMENT CONTAINING ARBITRATION CLAUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 7 defines when a reference to an arbitration clause is considered in writing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 7. DEFINITION OF ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;本條例第19條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition of Article 7 is referenced in this clause, indicating its importance and adoption."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 7. DEFINITION OF ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;本條備選案文一獲採納&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Alternative proposal for Article 7 was adopted as the definition of arbitration agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;契約性或非契約性的法律關係&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of arbitration agreements covers both contractual and non-contractual legal relationships, according to its definition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REFERENCE TO DOCUMENT CONTAINING ARBITRATION CLAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A reference to a document containing an arbitration clause is considered part of the arbitration agreement, according to its definition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-370a790bb1d210c95f7d43dd74075952</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT REFERRAL PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration agreement defines the conditions under which disputes can be referred to court for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd6c63034b5446fb90d89932614a5d4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT'S INTERIM MEASURE OF PROTECTION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration agreement does not preclude a party from requesting interim measures of protection from the court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ef9a8b87aa1cf04b46aaf871b5f39a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NATIONALITY EXCLUSION FOR ARBITRATOR SELECTION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATOR SELECTION WITHOUT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The selection of arbitrators can proceed without agreement on nationality exclusion unless specifically agreed upon by the parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ef9a8b87aa1cf04b46aaf871b5f39a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR DESIGNATION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties have the freedom to agree on the process for designating an arbitrator, or it can be done without their agreement if no specific method is agreed upon."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ef9a8b87aa1cf04b46aaf871b5f39a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR SELECTION WITHOUT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can freely determine the number and selection process of arbitrators, or it may be done without their agreement if no specific method is agreed upon."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ef9a8b87aa1cf04b46aaf871b5f39a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THREE-ARBITRATOR ARBITRATION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPOSITION OF ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL (CHAPTER III, ARTICLE 10)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The composition of the arbitration tribunal includes three arbitrators in a typical process unless otherwise specified by parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ef9a8b87aa1cf04b46aaf871b5f39a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE RULES (ARTICLE 11)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arbitration proceedings follow specific rules, including those for designating arbitrators and their composition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ef9a8b87aa1cf04b46aaf871b5f39a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR OTHER INSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Courts or other institutions play a role in resolving disputes when parties cannot reach an agreement on arbitrators."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a0165ce281c7667854e6df58da6d1a76</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR OTHER INSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL and COURT OR OTHER INSTITUTION are both institutions that can make decisions regarding the termination of an arbitrator's mandate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98d869f809c494e89028b24de4ba24f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 11. APPOINTMENT OF ARBITRATORS&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 11 outlines procedures that parties can follow to appoint arbitrators."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c4487876b424618c4533648d46889bd3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NATIONALITY OF ARBITRATORS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATOR INDEPENDENCE AND IMPARTIALITY CONSIDERATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nationality of the arbitrators may be considered to ensure their independence and impartiality, especially when appointing a sole or third arbitrator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6cff72e41603eed38553fb4f306a008</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;RECUSAL REASONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Recusal reasons are based on agreements made during arbitration procedures that can affect the arbitrator's impartiality or independence after being appointed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6cff72e41603eed38553fb4f306a008</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECUSAL REASONS&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can request recusal based on reasons that may raise doubts about the arbitrator's impartiality or independence after being appointed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6cff72e41603eed38553fb4f306a008</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR QUALIFICATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The parties agree on the qualifications required for arbitrators, which are considered by the court or other authority when appointing an arbitrator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6cff72e41603eed38553fb4f306a008</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR QUALIFICATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATOR INDEPENDENCE AND IMPARTIALITY CONSIDERATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The qualifications of an arbitrator are relevant to ensuring their independence and impartiality, which is a key consideration for the court or other authority when appointing an arbitrator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6cff72e41603eed38553fb4f306a008</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECUSAL APPLICATION CRITERIA&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can apply for recusal based on criteria that may affect the arbitrator's impartiality or independence after being appointed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6cff72e41603eed38553fb4f306a008</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR INDEPENDENCE AND IMPARTIALITY CONSIDERATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties' agreement includes considerations of an arbitrator's independence and impartiality, which are crucial for fair arbitration procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties' agreement on qualifications includes considerations of independence and impartiality, which are crucial in ensuring fair arbitration procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b6cff72e41603eed38553fb4f306a008</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUNDS FOR CHALLENGE OF ARBITRATOR&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEDURE FOR APPLYING FOR RECUSAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The grounds for challenging an arbitrator determine when and how a party can apply for recusal, including the time limit of 15 days after becoming aware of relevant circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-963f917b5a00c96d5b43bd1832480a19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEDURE FOR APPLYING FOR RECUSAL&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can apply for recusal according to procedures they agree upon, otherwise within 15 days after knowing about the arbitrator's appointment or any relevant circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-963f917b5a00c96d5b43bd1832480a19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEDURE FOR APPLYING FOR RECUSAL&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"During arbitration proceedings, parties may need to follow specific procedures when applying for an arbitrator's recusal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-963f917b5a00c96d5b43bd1832480a19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 13&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATOR'S WITHDRAWAL FROM OFFICE FOR ANY OTHER REASON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are reasons for the termination of an arbitrator's mandate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a15346ce9b7bc33ce02e54674e507b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 13&quot;" target="&quot;REVOCATION OF HIS MANDATE BY AGREEMENT OF THE PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both can lead to the termination of an arbitrator's mandate through different mechanisms (mandate revocation vs. agreement)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a15346ce9b7bc33ce02e54674e507b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 14&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATOR'S WITHDRAWAL FROM OFFICE FOR ANY OTHER REASON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both can be causes for an arbitrator to withdraw from office for other reasons, leading to the termination of their mandate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a15346ce9b7bc33ce02e54674e507b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 14&quot;" target="&quot;REVOCATION OF HIS MANDATE BY AGREEMENT OF THE PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are reasons for the termination of an arbitrator's mandate, though one is due to withdrawal and the other to a party agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a15346ce9b7bc33ce02e54674e507b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR'S WITHDRAWAL FROM OFFICE FOR ANY OTHER REASON&quot;" target="&quot;REVOCATION OF HIS MANDATE BY AGREEMENT OF THE PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both can result in the termination of an arbitrator's mandate, though through different means (agreement vs. other reasons). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a15346ce9b7bc33ce02e54674e507b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR'S WITHDRAWAL FROM OFFICE FOR ANY OTHER REASON&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 15. APPOINTMENT OF SUBSTITUTE ARBITRATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The withdrawal of an arbitrator for any reason can trigger the need to appoint a substitute as per Article 15."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a15346ce9b7bc33ce02e54674e507b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHAPTER IV. JURISDICTION OF THE ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 16. POWER TO DETERMINE ITS OWN JURISDICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 16 is part of Chapter IV, dealing with the jurisdiction of the arbitral tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3a15346ce9b7bc33ce02e54674e507b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR(S) APPOINTED BY A PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES TO THE ARBITRAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties to arbitral proceedings may appoint arbitrators and can raise pleas regarding jurisdiction or authority of the tribunal appointed by them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f295ffb815631fda7aa87257db86215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSION MEETING IN 2006&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 34&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A note references Section 34, which likely contains additional details relevant to arbitration proceedings discussed in the commission meeting held in 2006."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f295ffb815631fda7aa87257db86215</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 17(2)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL is responsible for deciding on the application of interim measures as per ARTICLE 17(2)(A). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8630302d71316afe5c4d5a0aacb23fcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 17(2)(B)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL is responsible for deciding on the application of interim measures as per ARTICLE 17(2)(B). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8630302d71316afe5c4d5a0aacb23fcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 17(2)(C)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL is responsible for deciding on the application of interim measures as per ARTICLE 17(2)(C). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8630302d71316afe5c4d5a0aacb23fcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 17B&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The note at the end of ARTICLE 17B refers to SECTION 36, indicating a cross-reference between these two articles. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8630302d71316afe5c4d5a0aacb23fcb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES INVOLVED IN THE DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal makes decisions regarding the parties involved in the dispute, including granting preliminary orders and interim measures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7edd9fa2d61911f5177713c81f63dd22</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERIM MEASURE REQUESTED&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal considers requests for interim measures and decides whether to grant them as part of preliminary orders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7edd9fa2d61911f5177713c81f63dd22</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 17C&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 37&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 17C refers to Section 37 for additional information on related communications and procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-74be062ba4c04dd5b51c11f6d66083c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 37&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR can receive and take into account any relevant document, evidence or information according to SECTION 37."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30ea89e5165c3d71c14d8648bf53596</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 37&quot;" target="&quot;FURTHER WRITTEN SUBMISSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 37 allows for further written submissions to be made when necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30ea89e5165c3d71c14d8648bf53596</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 37&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTS AND EVIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 37 permits the submission of any relevant documents and evidence, whether or not admissible in a court of law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30ea89e5165c3d71c14d8648bf53596</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 37&quot;" target="&quot;INDEPENDENT EXPERT REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 37 allows for independent expert reports to be commissioned when necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30ea89e5165c3d71c14d8648bf53596</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY REQUESTING AN INTERIM MEASURE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal may require the party requesting an interim measure to provide appropriate security in connection with the measure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY REQUESTING AN INTERIM MEASURE&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 17D. MODIFICATION, SUSPENSION, TERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 17D allows the arbitral tribunal to modify, suspend or terminate an interim measure upon application of any party or on its own initiative."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY APPLYING FOR A PRELIMINARY ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal shall require the party applying for a preliminary order to provide security in connection with the order unless it considers it inappropriate or unnecessary to do so."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY APPLYING FOR A PRELIMINARY ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 17E. PROVISION OF SECURITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 17E requires the party applying for a preliminary order to provide security, unless deemed inappropriate by the tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5a0d3077063fc6ed9e1ac8dc5d7668e3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY APPLYING FOR A PRELIMINARY ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;THE ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal may require the party applying for a preliminary order to disclose material changes and continue this obligation until an opportunity is given to present its case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY APPLYING FOR A PRELIMINARY ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;COSTS AND DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The party applying for a preliminary order may be liable for any costs and damages caused to other parties, as determined by the arbitral tribunal after reviewing all circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;COSTS AND DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If the arbitral tribunal determines that the interim measure or preliminary order should not have been granted, the party requesting it may be liable for any costs and damages caused to other parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERIM MEASURE OR PRELIMINARY ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;COSTS AND DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interim measures or orders can lead to costs and damages if they are later deemed inappropriate by the arbitral tribunal, affecting both parties involved in arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b469129a05952ad01a4e34a3cd47777e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 17H&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 61 OF THE EXAMPLE LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 61 of the Example Legislation replaces ARTICLE 17H according to the note."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-610c6dec3dfd2d606eea19c4dfbadfa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF THE STATE WHERE RECOGNITION OR ENFORCEMENT IS SOUGHT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If the arbitral tribunal has not determined security, the court may need to make a decision based on its consideration of third parties' rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5195e3e252b673b130b3aa632c54f19f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 61&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 17I&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 61 has effect in substitution for article 17H as stated in the note."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5195e3e252b673b130b3aa632c54f19f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 36(1)(A)(I)&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 36(1)(A)(IV)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are grounds for refusing recognition or enforcement of an interim measure, with (I) being a specific condition and (IV) another one among several options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are grounds for refusing recognition or enforcement of an interim measure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e480062fbbb42a0ea09ed97057c60af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 36(1)(A)(II)&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 36(1)(A)(III)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are conditions under which a court may refuse to recognize and enforce the interim measures, based on compliance issues or tribunal decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are conditions under which recognition or enforcement of interim measures can be refused, with (II) being a specific condition and (III) another one among several options."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4e480062fbbb42a0ea09ed97057c60af</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 18. EQUAL TREATMENT OF PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 46(2) AND (3)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 46(2) and (3) replace Article 18 regarding the equal treatment of parties, providing a different legal framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06afdeae20298d16d6b6fe33975e54ea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 46(2) AND (3)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 46&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These sections together replace the original Article 18, providing a new legal basis for equal treatment of parties in arbitral proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06afdeae20298d16d6b6fe33975e54ea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 46&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PARTIES' AGREEMENT may involve compliance with SECTION 46 to avoid SUBSTANTIAL INJUSTICE during ARBITRAL PROCEEDINGS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRAL PROCEEDING CONDUCT&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES EQUALITY TREATMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The conduct of arbitral proceedings involves treating parties equally and ensuring each party has a full opportunity to present their case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd9db0a37334cbb0b10298bc47259fa1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES EQUALITY TREATMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEDURE AGREEMENT FREEDOM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both principles are related to how parties should be treated in arbitration proceedings—equality of treatment ensures fair process, while freedom of agreement allows for flexibility on procedural matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd9db0a37334cbb0b10298bc47259fa1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEDURE AGREEMENT FREEDOM&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION LOCATION DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can freely agree on the procedure for arbitration, including the location; if no agreement is reached, the arbitral tribunal determines it based on circumstances and parties' convenience."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dd9db0a37334cbb0b10298bc47259fa1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 19(2)&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 22(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both articles discuss the freedom of parties to agree on arbitration-related matters and provide fallback options if such agreements are not reached."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e8e0d2ae5a1dc045b65776863de6e9a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENTARY EVIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal may order documentary evidence to be accompanied by translations into agreed or determined languages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf8d77c0073f8253192bb2eb6ce56e99</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEARINGS&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RESPONDENT can request hearings, which are subject to the discretion of the ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL based on procedural considerations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The RESPONDENT is notified of and participates in HEARINGS as required by the ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ccfc28d1a77070797c9452e760bfd7f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39b02ac25884a8c6102243f2b93f0c03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEARINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CLAIMANT has the potential to participate in hearings if requested or deemed necessary by the ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ccfc28d1a77070797c9452e760bfd7f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEARINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL has the authority to decide whether hearings should be held and when they are necessary for the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ccfc28d1a77070797c9452e760bfd7f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEARINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL decides whether to hold HEARINGS or proceed based on DOCUMENTS AND OTHER MATERIALS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39b02ac25884a8c6102243f2b93f0c03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HEARINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PARTIES participate in HEARINGS, either requesting or being notified of them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39b02ac25884a8c6102243f2b93f0c03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENTS AND OTHER MATERIALS&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PARTIES provide and receive DOCUMENTS AND OTHER MATERIALS in the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39b02ac25884a8c6102243f2b93f0c03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 52&quot;" target="&quot;TERMINATION OF ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 52 provides rules for the TERMINATION OF ARBITRATION PROCEDURE, including under what circumstances hearings may be held or terminated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-39b02ac25884a8c6102243f2b93f0c03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPERT WITNESS&quot;" target="&quot;EXPERT REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An expert witness can be designated by the arbitral tribunal to provide a report, which is part of the arbitration process. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPERT WITNESS&quot;" target="&quot;ORAL REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An expert witness can provide oral reports, which are part of the procedural steps in arbitration proceedings. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPERT WITNESS&quot;" target="&quot;WRITTEN REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An expert witness can also submit written reports as per Article 26(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUFFICIENT CAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claimant must show sufficient cause to avoid the termination of arbitration proceedings as per Article 25(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUFFICIENT CAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The respondent must show sufficient cause to avoid the automatic continuation of arbitration proceedings despite failure in submitting a statement of defence, as per Article 25(b). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEDURAL STEP&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal has procedural steps such as terminating proceedings or continuing them based on parties' actions. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEDURAL REQUIREMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal enforces procedural requirements such as submission of statements and attendance at hearings. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION RULES AND PROCEDURES&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEDURAL COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties must comply with the arbitration rules and procedures, failure of which may lead to specific consequences. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8e9a7aaa471f2d1e4f0d2af386c0f6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPERT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal has the authority to appoint experts and require them to participate in hearings, showing a direct interaction between the arbitration tribunal and experts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edc4c9a782cb874c7fb36432df37d995</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPERT&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can provide information or documents to experts as required by the arbitral tribunal, establishing a relationship with experts through the tribunal's process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edc4c9a782cb874c7fb36432df37d995</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPERT&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 54&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 54 provides the basis for experts to be appointed and participate in hearings, establishing a relationship with experts through legal provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edc4c9a782cb874c7fb36432df37d995</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF THIS STATE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration tribunal may request assistance from courts of this state for taking evidence, indicating an interaction between different judicial bodies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edc4c9a782cb874c7fb36432df37d995</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF THIS STATE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 55&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 55 outlines the rules under which courts can assist in taking evidence from parties or experts, indicating an interaction between different judicial bodies and their procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edc4c9a782cb874c7fb36432df37d995</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEDURE TERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;CHAPTER VI. MAKING AWARDS AND TERMINATION OF PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Chapter VI focuses on making awards and terminating procedures, which includes the termination of arbitration proceedings as a part of its scope."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-edc4c9a782cb874c7fb36432df37d995</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAKING OF AWARD AND TERMINATION OF PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CHAPTER VI.  MAKING OF AWARD AND TERMINATION OF PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Chapter VI directly addresses the making of an award and termination of proceedings, which is a key part of Article 28."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-375bde2b853ea690587e97e345bd3671</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 28. RULES APPLICABLE TO SUBSTANCE OF DISPUTE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 28 outlines rules applicable to the substance of disputes, which is a core function of an arbitral tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-375bde2b853ea690587e97e345bd3671</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EX AEQUO ET BONO OR AMIABLE COMPOSITEUR&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal may decide ex aequo et bono or as amiable compositeur only if the parties have expressly authorized it to do so."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-341dbfe6e21afa768ee74c7e3db0be67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECISION-MAKING BY PANEL OF ARBITRATORS&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEDURE PROBLEMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In all cases, questions of procedure may be decided by a presiding arbitrator if so authorized by the parties or all members of the arbitral tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-341dbfe6e21afa768ee74c7e3db0be67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES REACHING A SETTLEMENT IN AN ARBITRATION CASE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can reach a settlement in arbitration proceedings, and the arbitral tribunal should record it as an award if requested by parties without objection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-341dbfe6e21afa768ee74c7e3db0be67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES REACHING A SETTLEMENT IN AN ARBITRATION CASE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AWARDS BASED ON SETTLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arbitration awards based on settlements have the same status and effect as other arbitral decisions when made by the tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-341dbfe6e21afa768ee74c7e3db0be67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN AWARD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AWARDS must be recorded in writing, signed by the ARBITRATORS or ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL members."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03bb9907c4707aee4e32c05a81efe12a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION LOCATION&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration takes place at a specific location which is determined for the AWARDS and proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-03bb9907c4707aee4e32c05a81efe12a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES INVOLVED&quot;" target="&quot;AGREED TERMS AWARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties Involved may agree on terms which lead to an Agreed Terms Award."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0cddff72aaf0d2c6f21cba88e08e8e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL MANDATE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AWARD CORRECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The mandate of the ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL terminates with the termination of arbitral proceedings, and corrections or interpretations can be made to the arbitration award."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5943028cc6f3beb70826c83454e86767</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CORRECTION AND INTERPRETATION OF AWARD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AWARD CORRECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Corrections and interpretations are part of the process when dealing with an ARBITRATION AWARD, which may need clarification or rectification by the arbitral tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5943028cc6f3beb70826c83454e86767</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION AWARD CORRECTION&quot;" target="&quot;INTERPRETATION OF ARBITRATION_AWARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interpretations can lead to corrections of the arbitration award if deemed necessary and reasonable by the arbitral tribunal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5943028cc6f3beb70826c83454e86767</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION AWARD CORRECTION&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 7.01-69&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRATION AWARD CORRECTION can be made based on ARTICLE 34.01-2(1), which allows the TRIBUNAL to correct any error within 30 days of the award."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5490186775273077486362a56a5b981f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AWARD CORRECTION REQUEST&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can make an Award Correction Request to the Arbitration Tribunal within 30 days of receiving the award."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d17ccb7c45bbf013a4a9b072f210aedd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERPRETATION REQUEST&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Parties may request Interpretation from the Arbitration Tribunal for specific points or parts of the award, and if justified, the tribunal will provide an interpretation within 30 days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d17ccb7c45bbf013a4a9b072f210aedd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPLEMENTARY AWARD REQUEST&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can request a Supplementary Award from the Arbitration Tribunal for matters not included in the original award but raised during arbitration, and if justified, it will be made within 60 days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d17ccb7c45bbf013a4a9b072f210aedd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CORRECTION AND INTERPRETATION PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Arbitration Tribunal has a period of 30 days to correct errors or provide interpretations after receiving the request from Parties, which can be extended if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d17ccb7c45bbf013a4a9b072f210aedd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPLEMENTARY AWARD EXTENSION PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If needed, the Arbitration Tribunal may extend the period for making a Supplementary Award beyond 60 days after receiving such requests from Parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d17ccb7c45bbf013a4a9b072f210aedd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT REVIEW OF ARBITRATION AWARDS&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court may review the decisions made by the arbitration tribunal, potentially leading to their modification or annulment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f2047b71041716475b6c4ce04dcb74ab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THREE MONTHS&quot;" target="&quot;SETTING ASIDE PROCEEDINGS SUSPENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The period for setting aside proceedings suspension is three months from receiving the arbitral award or related request disposal date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f35bbfd9ee83b0701ea2384c506063d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION裁决&quot;" target="&quot;管轄法院&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The jurisdictional court is responsible for recognizing and enforcing the arbitral award in accordance with relevant laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f35bbfd9ee83b0701ea2384c506063d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;书面申请&quot;" target="&quot;裁决书正本或其副本&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A written application must include a copy or original of the arbitration award to be recognized and enforced by the jurisdictional court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f35bbfd9ee83b0701ea2384c506063d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 35&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 36&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both articles are part of a legal framework dealing with arbitration awards and their recognition or enforcement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70d6872db724ae32c205d96d7e3c902f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 36&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Article 36 refers to grounds for refusing recognition or enforcement of an arbitration agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-665407cfb1dd4211e1d5ff880154e6bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 36&quot;" target="&quot;COURT OF THE COUNTRY IN WHICH, OR UNDER THE LAW OF WHICH, THAT AWARD WAS MADE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court in which the arbitration took place or under whose law it was made has jurisdiction to set aside or suspend an arbitral award as per Article 36(1)(v)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-665407cfb1dd4211e1d5ff880154e6bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 36&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court may adjourn its decision and order the other party to provide appropriate security if an application for setting aside or suspension of an award has been made under Article 36."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e279133cb6f847782cd0ab6a19c0d64f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PARTY RELYING ON AN AWARD OR APPLYING FOR ITS ENFORCEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The party relying on an award must apply to the court for its enforcement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70d6872db724ae32c205d96d7e3c902f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;7TH CLAUSE OF THE ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 7th clause of the arbitration agreement is relevant when appointing arbitrators and conducting arbitral proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70d6872db724ae32c205d96d7e3c902f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPROPRIATE NOTICE FOR APPOINTING ARBITRATORS AND THE ARBITRAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appropriate notice for appointing arbitrators and the arbitral proceedings may be requested by the court to ensure fairness in arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-70d6872db724ae32c205d96d7e3c902f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;商事性質的關係&quot;" target="&quot;空中、海上、鐵路或公路的客貨載運&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"商事性質的關係包括了各種商業交易，其中就包含了空海鐵公運輸。這顯示了這些關係在商業活動中的重要性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-637d9e3dd1440e4117d86911ea5a7841</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;投資&quot;" target="&quot;ARTICLE 36. GROUNDS FOR REFUSING RECOGNITION OR ENFORCEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"投資是商事性質關係的一種，而 ARTICLE 36 該條款可能涉及與投資相關的仲裁裁決。這顯示了兩者之間的聯繫。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-637d9e3dd1440e4117d86911ea5a7841</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARTICLE 36. GROUNDS FOR REFUSING RECOGNITION OR ENFORCEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">" ARTICLE 36 該條款涉及仲裁協議，規定在某些情況下可以拒絕認可或執行仲裁裁決。這顯示了兩者之間的直接聯繫。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-637d9e3dd1440e4117d86911ea5a7841</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRADE FACILITATION AND ARBITRATION COMMISSION (贸法委)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance refers to the Trade Facilitation and Arbitration Commission, also known as 貿法委, in relation to arbitration matters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4ea69c357721dd337ab1f2ad1b4f0333</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLE ARBITRATOR&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Sole Arbitrator is appointed when parties fail to agree on the number of arbitrators in an Arbitration Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sole arbitrator is appointed in case parties fail to agree on the number of arbitrators under an arbitration agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4ea69c357721dd337ab1f2ad1b4f0333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-818682a0f1950aff44c4e7f18a331608</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRANSACTION(S)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TRANSACTION(S) are the basis of rights to relief claimed in ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS and may lead to their consolidation or hearing sequence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ee3bd35452fe0a7b5e9fa7dc2c1f8074</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL ISSUE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can decide LEGAL ISSUES related to arbitration processes, including appointments and costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ff2369343594485564382d2d30ba3755</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECISION OF PRELIMINARY QUESTION OF LAW BY COURT&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL FROM A DECISION OF THE COURT UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The decision of the COURT on a PRELIMINARY QUESTION OF LAW can be appealed under subsection (1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-76cb33f1b7685e188783adaf8e60f8f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECISION OF PRELIMINARY QUESTION OF LAW BY COURT&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION UNDER SUBSECTION (1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An APPLICATION under subsection (1) leads to a DECISION of the COURT on a preliminary question of law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-76cb33f1b7685e188783adaf8e60f8f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERIOUS MISCONDUCT EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;QUESTIONING ARBITRATION AWARDS BASED ON SERIOUS MISCONDUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A SERIOUS MISCONDUCT EVENT can lead to an APPLICATION for questioning arbitration awards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-76cb33f1b7685e188783adaf8e60f8f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERIOUS MISCONDUCT EVENT FOR QUESTIONING ARBITRATION AWARD&quot;" target="&quot;DECISION OF PRELIMINARY QUESTION OF LAW BY COURT (REPEATED)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DECISION of the COURT on a PRELIMINARY QUESTION OF LAW can be influenced by SERIOUS MISCONDUCT EVENTS related to questioning arbitration awards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-76cb33f1b7685e188783adaf8e60f8f5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERIOUS IMPROPRIETY EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A SERIOUS IMPROPRIETY EVENT can be grounds for a party to apply to the COURT to challenge an arbitration award."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8d82bf83563624acdc014bb3783db688</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERIOUS IMPROPRIETY EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties involved in the ARBITRATION PROCEDURE can raise a SERIOUS IMPROPRIETY EVENT as grounds for challenging an arbitration award before the COURT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8d82bf83563624acdc014bb3783db688</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERPRETATION OF UNCERTAIN OR AMBIGUOUS AWARD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL may need to interpret or clarify uncertain or ambiguous awards, which can be a basis for challenging the award in COURT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8d82bf83563624acdc014bb3783db688</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FRAUDULENT MEANS&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC POLICY VIOLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A FRAUDULENT MEAN constitutes a PUBLIC POLICY VIOLATION that could lead to an arbitration award being challenged by the COURT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8d82bf83563624acdc014bb3783db688</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC POLICY VIOLATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can declare an ARBITRATION TRIBUNAL's decision invalid if it is found to be in violation of PUBLIC POLICY, including through FRAUDULENT MEANS or other improper actions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8d82bf83563624acdc014bb3783db688</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSTANTIAL INJUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL's decisions can lead to or prevent SUBSTANTIAL INJUSTICE, depending on compliance with procedural rules and agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERIOUS IRREGULARITY&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can address SERIOUS IRREGULARITIES that affect ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL's decisions and AWARDS, potentially revoking them or remanding for reconsideration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;3 MONTHS LIMIT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL must issue a new AWARD within 3 months if it is REMANDED by the COURT, otherwise, the original decision stands."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOCATION POWER&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT has REVOCATION POWER over ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL's decisions and AWARDS under certain conditions of SUBSTANTIAL INJUSTICE or SERIOUS IRREGULARITY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST DECISION&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PARTIES can file an APPEAL AGAINST DECISION to the COURT regarding ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL's AWARD or procedural issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION FOR APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT handles APPLICATION FOR APPEAL from PARTIES related to AWARDS and SERIOUS IRREGULARITIES in ARBITRAL PROCEEDINGS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b5a62633bac9b2c0c6ed1e0aa83ce66e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FRAUD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fraud is a serious irregularity that could lead to setting aside an AWARD by the ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b2fac04904854d200ea9c9161cb98c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST ARBITRAL AWARD ON QUESTION OF LAW&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties can appeal ARBITRARY AWARD ON QUESTION OF LAW decisions to the COURT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5540da5689ed24920444d2c678531763</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 6(4)(C)(I) OR (II)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 6(4)(c)(i) or (ii) of this Schedule sets criteria that are not to be considered by the Court when deciding on a question of law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e17ae2e1dd0c38e2c8a34618b769e578</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE OF THE COURT OR THE COURT OF APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The leave of the Court or the Court of Appeal is required for any further appeal from an order of the Court under subsection (5)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e17ae2e1dd0c38e2c8a34618b769e578</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPEAL DECISION&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPEAL DECISION is influenced by the outcomes of ARBITRATION PROCEDURES; permission for an appeal may depend on the nature and significance of legal issues arising from arbitration decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3fe51ca84063bb48ff26e0744002a148</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEAVE TO APPEAL&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Leave to appeal is granted by the Court based on specific criteria outlined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c9174a61c7bf0b325fa1fb34e7b741c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT OR APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can order security for costs from the APPLICANT or APPELLANT, who must exhaust available recourses first."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2da7991e9473f6c5aadfd4a87f21c511</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICANT OR APPELLANT&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL's award and reasons are subject to review by the COURT, involving the APPLICANT or APPELLANT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2da7991e9473f6c5aadfd4a87f21c511</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法人團體&quot;" target="&quot;組織&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法人團體是一種特定類型的組織，根據香港以外地方的法律成立或組成。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0a46c25800fae1ea9c732dab0043f67</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;原訟法庭&quot;" target="&quot;根據第(2)款,就合併處理、同時聆訊或以一項緊接另一項的方式聆訊的仲裁程序委任仲裁員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院在特定情況下有權任命仲裁員，這與其職能相關。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-631cf173f722fbf772a243932dfa28ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 3&quot;" target="&quot;COMMENCEMENT OF THIS ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule 3 is related to the commencement of this ordinance as it contains provisions relating to its effectiveness."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f43eb8e125ae108a081ead56528fd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 3&quot;" target="&quot;GUIDELINES FOR APPLICATION OF REASONABLENESS TEST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The guidelines provide context and additional details for the application of reasonableness test, which may be relevant when interpreting Schedule 3."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0d95ad1d2c3e1a79bcbb97aba7400ea9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OLD ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration procedure and old ordinance are interconnected, with procedures under the old ordinance continuing after the new schedule comes into effect."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51f43eb8e125ae108a081ead56528fd1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION PROCEDURES&quot;" target="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNCITRAL Model Law defines arbitration procedures that are referenced in the text, influencing how arbitrations are conducted."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e0e013fee151f1254a38965f636a0159</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPOINTMENT ADVISORY BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION(APPOINTMENT OF ARBITRATORS AND UMPIRES)RULES(CAP. 341 SUB. LEG. B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The rules for appointing members of the Appointment Advisory Board are based on Cap. 341 sub. leg. B, which is now known as Cap. 609 sub. leg. B."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-605f21b5a2eb897deb796a8915dad75c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPOINTMENT ADVISORY BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The appointment of members for the Advisory Board affects arbitration agreements and their continuation post-Ordinance enactment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-605f21b5a2eb897deb796a8915dad75c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPOINTMENT ADVISORY BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION (APPOINTMENT OF ARBITRATORS AND UMPIRES) RULES (CAP. 341 SUB. LEG. B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Appointment Advisory Board established under rule 3 of the Arbitration Rules continues to have effect after the Ordinance's enactment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2015年第11號第7條&quot;" target="&quot;生效日期 (COMMENCEMENT DATE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The effective date is specified in section 7 of the 2015 Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance, which is July 17, 2015."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;貿法委示範法 (UNCITRAL MODEL LAW)&quot;" target="&quot;原本條例 (PRE-AMENDED ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pre-amended ordinance refers to the UNCITRAL Model Law, particularly Article 21 in this context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2015年仲裁(修訂)條例 (2015年第11號)&quot;" target="&quot;生效日期 (COMMENCEMENT DATE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 2015 Arbitration Amendment Ordinance has its effective date on July 17, 2015."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commencement date is July 17, 2015 for the Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2015年仲裁(修訂)條例 (2015年第11號)&quot;" target="&quot;原本條例 (PRE-AMENDED ORDINANCE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pre-amended ordinance is in effect before the new Ordinance's implementation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;生效日期 (COMMENCEMENT DATE)&quot;" target="&quot;仲裁程序及相關程序的進行&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arbitration and related proceedings governed by the effective date continue as per the Ordinance's provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;生效日期 (COMMENCEMENT DATE)&quot;" target="&quot;相關程序 (ALL RELATED PROCEEDINGS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All related proceedings are governed by the effective date of the new Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;原本條例 (PRE-AMENDED ORDINANCE)&quot;" target="&quot;仲裁程序及相關程序的進行&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitration and related proceedings governed by the pre-amended ordinance continue before the effective date of the new Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-83a6ab35c70f5935f2a22cd6ce3b6e03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2015 (11 OF 2015)&quot;" target="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNCITRAL Model Law is the basis for the provisions in the Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2015."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2015 (11 OF 2015)&quot;" target="&quot;SAVINGS AND TRANSITIONAL PROVISIONS RELATING TO ARBITRATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2017&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2015 is the basis for some of the provisions in the Savings and Transitional Provisions Relating to Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2017."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2015 (11 OF 2015)&quot;" target="&quot;PART 3 ADDED BY S. 7 OF 2017&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2015 is the context in which Part 3 added by Section 7 of the Savings and Transitional Provisions Relating to Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2017 was enacted."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SAVINGS AND TRANSITIONAL PROVISIONS RELATING TO ARBITRATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2017&quot;" target="&quot;UNCITRAL MODEL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNCITRAL Model Law influences the savings and transitional provisions in the Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2017."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SAVINGS AND TRANSITIONAL PROVISIONS RELATING TO ARBITRATION (AMENDMENT) ORDINANCE 2017&quot;" target="&quot;PART 3 ADDED BY S. 7 OF 2017&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Savings and Transitional Provisions Relating to Arbitration (Amendment) Ordinance 2017 includes Part 3 added by Section 7 of the same ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-773d781fb9041ec95db87fc55340cd49</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PRE-AMENDED ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMENCEMENT DATE: 1 JANUARY 2018.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pre-amended Ordinance applies until January 1, 2018, after which Part 11A may apply if agreed by the parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE PRE-AMENDED ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The pre-amended Ordinance continues to apply to arbitrations and related proceedings until the new section's commencement date on January 1, 2018."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTING ASIDE OF THE AWARD IN THE ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;RELATED PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Related proceedings include arbitral procedures resumed after setting aside an award in the arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMENCEMENT DATE: 1 JANUARY 2018.&quot;" target="&quot;RELATED PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Related proceedings are subject to Part 11A's applicability starting from January 1, 2018, if agreed by the parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca44dbb10a88be455b8df250e7a7b82b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY SECURITY OF PAYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING INDUSTRY (SECURITY OF PAYMENTS) ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are related to the security of payment in construction industry, with similar objectives but different titles."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3af7bc872d7fc7932c078771ff368e80</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY SECURITY OF PAYMENT ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Construction Industry Security of Payment Ordinance provides mechanisms for adjudication proceedings to resolve disputes quickly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3af7bc872d7fc7932c078771ff368e80</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The issuance of an adjudication notice initiates the process leading to adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A CLAIMANT may initiate ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS for resolving payment disputes through an ADJUDICATION NOTICE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 41(A), (E), (F) OR (G)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS are terminated on grounds set out in SECTION 41, a claimant can restart them within the specified period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;28 DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A CLAIMANT has 28 days to initiate new ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS after previous ones are terminated on specific grounds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S JURISDICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR'S JURISDICTION includes the conduct of ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS as stated in section 34(1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3e060ad7c0dcaf66b5c6e6d5a4b6243</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PAYMENT DISPUTE initiates ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS under section 24. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3e060ad7c0dcaf66b5c6e6d5a4b6243</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;COURT EVIDENCE RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While not binding, COURT EVIDENCE RULES can still influence the consideration of evidence in ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS due to their general relevance. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3e060ad7c0dcaf66b5c6e6d5a4b6243</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">26.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An ADJUDICATOR is appointed to consider and determine payment disputes in ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ADJUDICATOR conducts ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS for resolving PAYMENT DISPUTES in a structured manner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ADJUDICATOR conducts adjudication proceedings as deemed appropriate within the powers under section 35."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30ea89e5165c3d71c14d8648bf53596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-304365a41d317ba2bf7cdd71b9dcffa2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ea4a40e2dfeb073559acd2aab072a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36 WHEN POWERS OF ADJUDICATOR NOT AFFECTED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATION proceedings are not affected by failures in serving an adjudication response or reply to an adjudication response under sections 31 and 32."&lt;SEP&gt;"The powers of the ADJUDICATOR are not affected by failures in serving an adjudication response or reply to an adjudication response under sections 31 and 32 during ADJUDICATION proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Determinations made in adjudication proceedings may be enforced by the Court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f87d18cc47acf07db6f5458960b21f19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;DIVISION 7—GENERAL AND MISCELLANEOUS MATTERS RELATING TO ADJUDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Division 7 deals with general and miscellaneous matters related to adjudication, including proceedings involving adjudication."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80fae333d21f2886ed576bdc768e41f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction contract parties have rights regarding payment disputes that can be submitted in adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80fae333d21f2886ed576bdc768e41f7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Confidentiality requirements apply specifically to adjudication proceedings and related data disclosures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY OF ADJUDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The confidentiality of adjudication proceedings is directly related to the information disclosed during these proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;DISCLOSURE RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Disclosure rules apply to information related to adjudication proceedings, regulating what can and cannot be disclosed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction contracts can be involved in adjudication proceedings, particularly when payment disputes arise from such contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nominating body appoints the adjudicator for ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS and incurs related expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nominating body provides services related to adjudication proceedings and may charge fees for such services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ea4a40e2dfeb073559acd2aab072a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;INDEPENDENT EXPERT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Independent experts may be appointed for ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS, involving costs related to their work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-705ea4a40e2dfeb073559acd2aab072a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE INSPECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction site inspections can be part of the evidence or process in ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-705ea4a40e2dfeb073559acd2aab072a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary refers to the Development Authority's representative in certain contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-622e9afcf96894f3c8695345444428d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATION PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Occupation Permit may be issued after a Construction Contract has been fulfilled and inspected."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-622e9afcf96894f3c8695345444428d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATION PERMIT&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECTOR OF LANDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DIRECTOR OF LANDS issues certificates of compliance or consent to assign, and also issues occupation permits for the land on which a building is situated. These are directly related as they pertain to occupancy permissions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURE&quot;" target="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The terms 'specified structure' and 'related goods and services' are both defined in the context of construction contracts, indicating a relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public contracts can involve the supply of related goods and services for construction work on a public contract site."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction work involves the use of related goods and services such as materials, equipment, manpower resources, transportation, etc., which are essential for its completion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction work may also include the supply of related goods and services, which affects their respective contract values."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fed725f04c7bcd4c7d2f5a1a4787af6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d64bf6870cd28991e3919d0bb4b5dfa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSULTANCY SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consultancy services can be a type of service included under related goods and services in the context of construction work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fed725f04c7bcd4c7d2f5a1a4787af6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSIDERATION PAYABLE FOR CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consideration includes both construction work and related goods/services as defined by context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;A CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT TO THE EXTENT THAT IT CONTAINS PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Provisions in a contract can cover both construction and related goods/services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Progress payments can also be claimed for related goods and services supplied under a construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6daadd1f16d5e396cd12e56c0d0df02</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">49.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An adjudicator is not civilly liable for acts done or omitted in performing functions under the Ordinance, which implies a separation from nominating bodies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ADJUDICATOR may be appointed by a NOMINATING BODY and thus has potential conflicts of interest that need to be declared."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NOMINATING BODY appoints and manages the process for ADJUDICATORS, ensuring their independence and impartiality throughout proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nominating body is responsible for establishing and maintaining lists that include adjudicators who will make decisions on disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nominating body is responsible for establishing, maintaining, and appointing adjudicators as well as regulating their conduct and providing them with training."&lt;SEP&gt;"The selected NOMINATING BODY nominates and appoints an ADJUDICATOR in accordance with its adjudication rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1611b0ccefada6387970ed4d17809f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ace38a89f19c657876dcff9d5f230c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-169c5c3921ad759a4d5a8b8e69511b19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b53857aed1787aca531dea0f456e8ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1901c04f5d127d84848a2cd1cbc4a1bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudication rules are established and maintained by the nominating body to govern how disputes should be resolved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The selected NOMINATING BODY follows its own ADJUDICATION RULES for appointing an ADJUDICATOR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1611b0ccefada6387970ed4d17809f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;SELECTED BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A NOMINATING BODY can be selected by a RESPONDENT under section 27(3)(a), or by a CLAIMANT under section 27(4)(a). The term SELECTED BODY is synonymous with NOMINATING BODY in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nominated body becomes the selected body for adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">26.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If no nominating body or more than one is specified, the claimant must nominate 2 bodies under section 27(2)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CLAIMANT nominates 2 NOMINATING BODIES in the adjudication notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"The claimant must also serve the nominating body with a written notice of withdrawal if the adjudication proceedings are being terminated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nominating body and claimant are involved in initiating the adjudication proceedings, which can lead to Adjudicator's Determinations or their termination based on specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71987cb00c98805ab9ed06eb948af233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1611b0ccefada6387970ed4d17809f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d296364c6fb1e176227c199c33f148d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A nominating body is specified in a construction contract for handling payment disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NOMINATING BODY is specified within the CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT for handling payment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4537b3223942fe128431f147e0b27414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudication notices must be served in a way specified by the nominating body, according to section 68(1)(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"An adjudication notice can trigger the nomination process by a nominating body for an adjudicator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4537b3223942fe128431f147e0b27414</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar to the relationship with the Claimant, the Respondent is also part of the process that may result in Adjudicator's Determinations or their termination due to certain proceedings being halted."&lt;SEP&gt;"The RESPONDENT selects one of the nominated NOMINATING BODIES and informs the CLAIMANT."&lt;SEP&gt;"The respondent is one of the parties that may receive a written notice regarding the withdrawal of adjudication proceedings if it has been served by the nominating body."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71987cb00c98805ab9ed06eb948af233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1611b0ccefada6387970ed4d17809f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d296364c6fb1e176227c199c33f148d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">39.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nominating body plays a role in the appointment of the Adjudicator, and their actions can influence whether determinations are made or not based on specific conditions outlined."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nomination and appointment of an Adjudicator by the nominating body can influence whether or not Adjudicator's Determinations are made, as certain conditions may prevent determinations from being issued."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d296364c6fb1e176227c199c33f148d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY OF THE NOMINATING BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary oversees the performance of functions set out for a nominating body as defined in section 64."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLAINTS AGAINST A NOMINATING BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Nomination bodies can be subject to complaints or information that may lead to an inquiry by the Secretary as per section 62(1)(e). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION OF A NOMINATING BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Nomination bodies can apply for registration or renewal, which is a function of the Secretary as per section 62(2)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nominating body provides documents or information required by the Secretary."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nominating body provides documents or information to the Secretary when required by the Secretary's directive under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ace38a89f19c657876dcff9d5f230c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR PANEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nominating body includes individuals in the panel of adjudicators and may provide training for them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;TRAINING FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nominating body charges fees for including an individual in its panel of adjudicators and providing training to those included."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A respondent, in the context of a payment dispute, may be required to pay progress payments as part of the construction contract or supply related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYING PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Paying parties are responsible for making progress payments related to construction work."&lt;SEP&gt;"The paying party is responsible for making progress payments as per the construction contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3978c9d363a5060a5f5dafe37f64fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL UNIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Progress payments can be made for the construction of residential units on a construction site."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Progress payments can be claimed based on the construction work carried out under a construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6daadd1f16d5e396cd12e56c0d0df02</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Progress Payment is related to Construction Contract as it refers to payments under specific contract terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The progress payment amount is determined based on the construction contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3978c9d363a5060a5f5dafe37f64fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c90a7be5c9755cdde83e35c88dd2f63</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment response is required when a payment claim for a progress payment is served, indicating their interdependence within the contract process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Progress payments and their related deadlines are central to the process of serving a payment response in accordance with section 19."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad2f770d3edd7fc8b6985f3040077779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dc61c3e9d0b909249e0a6492fb80f00</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE DEADLINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment response deadline is related to progress payments as it dictates when responses regarding these claims need to be made."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0af4d7e54b59f5f639294394f679c069</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;ADMITTED AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both adjudicated amount and admitted amount are terms used in disputes over payment amounts, indicating a relationship between them regarding how these amounts are determined."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES TO ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties to adjudication proceedings may be liable for paying the ADJUDICATED AMOUNT, which is determined in the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-143b0fa3beba6c5913ea9659f090c4b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT'S RIGHT TO DELAY WORK OR SUPPLY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The adjudicated amount is a key factor in determining whether the claimant can exercise their right to delay work or supply under the construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6edcec90a44956192e9747946f6d5481</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The adjudicated amount is related to the terms of the construction contract, specifically concerning payment deadlines and amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6edcec90a44956192e9747946f6d5481</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The respondent has a financial obligation to pay the adjudicated amount by the payment deadline, which is a condition for the claimant's right to delay work."&lt;SEP&gt;"The respondent must pay the adjudicated amount by a specified deadline; failure to do so can lead to delays in work or supply under the construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6edcec90a44956192e9747946f6d5481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d229505b95cc3e576d9ad034318c66d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMITTED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMED AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADMITTED AMOUNT and CLAIMED AMOUNT are key figures in determining the resolution of payment disputes under construction contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98b9cc96db8e2ffdc374754939531431</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMITTED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;PREVIOUS HEARING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Admitted amounts from previous hearings are relevant to ongoing adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PANEL OF ADJUDICATORS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The panel of adjudicators is the list maintained by the nominating body that includes individuals who can act as adjudicators in disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e5c0a23f28a68cdcea8ea323f65ec01d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PANEL OF ADJUDICATORS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR TRAINING PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The adjudicator training program includes individuals who are part of the panel of adjudicators."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;審裁員&quot;" target="&quot;提名團體&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"審裁員名單由提名團體根據第64(a)條設立和維持。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;審裁員&quot;" target="&quot;審裁規則&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"審裁員需遵循《審裁規則》以進行審裁程序。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;審裁員&quot;" target="&quot;審裁通知&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"審裁通知是審裁過程的一部分,參閱第25(1)條。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;審裁員&quot;" target="&quot;審裁程序&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"審裁程序是指按照第3部審裁付款爭議的程序。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eb0a462e68a662039e8cb6e04cda3ba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;现有住宅单位&quot;" target="&quot;建筑工程豁免证明书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"建筑工程豁免证明书的发放与现有住宅单位相关，需满足特定条件以进行建筑工程。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;现有住宅单位&quot;" target="&quot;占用许可证&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"占用许可证是针对现有住宅单位所处建筑物发出的许可文件。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;地政总署署长&quot;" target="&quot;《建筑物条例(新界适用)条例》(第121章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条例规定了地政总署署长对建筑占用的通知权和同意权。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;地政总署署长&quot;" target="&quot;审裁员&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"地政总署署长在某些情况下可以发出通知，影响审裁员的决定过程。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《建筑物条例(新界适用)条例》(第121章)&quot;" target="&quot;建造合約&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条例涉及建筑合同的相关规定和豁免证明书的要求。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《建筑物条例(新界适用)条例》(第121章)&quot;" target="&quot;审裁程序 (ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条例与审裁员的决定过程相关，特别是在支付争议中。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《建筑物条例(新界适用)条例》(第121章)&quot;" target="&quot;公用部分 (COMMON PARTS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条例涉及公共部分的规定，与住宅单位相关。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申索方&quot;" target="&quot;建造合約&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在建筑合同中有涉及各方的权利和义务，包括索赔方的角色。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申索方&quot;" target="&quot;付款方&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment dispute arises between the payer and claimant when the claimant sends a claim to the payer, and certain events occur as specified in section 23(1). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-16c32b6c243652a8ef2eb45cb49c1e90</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;经审裁款额 (ADJUDICATED AMOUNT)&quot;" target="&quot;建造合約&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"建筑合同中的支付争议可能需要通过审裁员的决定来解决金额问题。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;公用部分 (COMMON PARTS)&quot;" target="&quot;建筑管理条例 (BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE)(CAP. 344)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条例定义了公共部分的含义，并可能影响现有住宅单位的相关规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;公用部分 (COMMON PARTS)&quot;" target="&quot;《建筑物管理条例》(BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE)(CAP. 344)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该条例定义了公共部分的含义，并可能影响现有住宅单位的相关规定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;支付争议 (PAYMENT DISPUTE)&quot;" target="&quot;审裁员 (ADJUDICATOR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"支付争议需要通过审裁员进行裁决以确定金额问题。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;《审裁规则》(THE ADJUDICATION RULES)&quot;" target="&quot;审裁员 (ADJURICATOR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"该规则规定了审裁员的行为准则和程序。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;地政总署 (LAND DEPARTMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;建筑工程豁免证明书&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"地政总署负责发放建筑工程豁免证明书，涉及现有住宅单位的建设活动。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;占用许可证 (OCCUPANCY PERMIT)&quot;" target="&quot;开发合约 (DEVELOPMENT CONTRACT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"占用许可可能与开发合同相关联，在某些情况下需要签订此类合同以获得许可。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;支付争议仲裁程序 (ARBITRATION PROCEEDINGS FOR PAYMENT DISPUTE)&quot;" target="&quot;审裁员 (ADJURICATOR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"支付争议的仲裁过程可能涉及审裁员的角色和决定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;建筑工程 (BUILDING WORKS)&quot;" target="&quot;开发合约 (DEVELOPMENT CONTRACT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"建筑工程项目通常与开发合同相关联，二者共同作用于住宅单位建设中。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;仲裁员 (ARBITRATOR)&quot;" target="&quot;审裁员 (ADJURICATOR)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"两者都是解决争议和纠纷的角色，但仲裁员在特定情况下可能会替代或补充审裁员的工作。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5e3783c121964370c7697806ed0bbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 123)&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPATION PERMIT (佔用許可證)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Buildings Ordinance provides the legal basis for issuing occupation permits, which are related to completed constructions under its jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDINGS ORDINANCE (CAP. 123)&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Building Authority's approval and consent are required for certain construction work under the Buildings Ordinance (Cap. 123)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-06e739d62dd19f34a46b38a2c7902502</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATION PERMIT (佔用許可證)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK (建造工作)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Occupation permits are issued after construction work is completed and inspected for compliance with regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupation permits are issued after construction work is completed, linking the two terms through regulatory processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATION PERMIT (佔用許可證)&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT (總私人承包合約)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A main private contract may include provisions related to obtaining an occupation permit, linking the two terms through legal agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OCCUPATION PERMIT (佔用許可證)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYING PARTY (付款方)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The paying party's obligations may include ensuring compliance with conditions for obtaining an 'occupation permit', linking these terms through financial and regulatory processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER (擁有人)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE (建造工地)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The owner of a property or site where construction takes place has direct control over the 'construction site'."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER (擁有人)&quot;" target="&quot;NOMINATING BODY (提名團體)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A nominating body can influence the selection of owners for certain projects as per their criteria and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER (擁有人)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYING PARTY (付款方)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The paying party and owner roles can overlap, as an owner might also act as a paying party in certain contractual agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER (擁有人)&quot;" target="&quot;PANEL OF ADJUDICATORS (審裁員名單)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An owner might be involved in disputes that are resolved by a panel of adjudicators, linking the two terms through legal processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER (擁有人)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (付款申索)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An owner might be involved in disputes over payment claims, directly linking the two terms through contractual obligations and legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PANEL OF ADJUDICATORS (審裁員名單)&quot;" target="&quot;NOMINATING BODY (提名團體)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nominating body establishes and maintains the panel of adjudicators, indicating a direct relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PANEL OF ADJUDICATORS (審裁員名單)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (付款申索)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudicators may be involved in resolving disputes related to payment claims, indicating a potential relationship through legal or administrative processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE (建造工地)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK (建造工作)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The term 'construction site' refers to places where 'construction work' takes place, showing their interdependence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE (建造工地)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (付款申索)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction sites are where work is carried out and payment claims arise from completed or ongoing projects at these locations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE (建造工地)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYING PARTY (付款方)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The paying party's obligations may extend to ensuring proper completion of 'construction sites' as per contractual agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK (建造工作)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYING PARTY (付款方)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The paying party is responsible for funding 'construction work', creating a financial relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK (建造工作)&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT (總私人承包合約)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction work forms a core part of 'main private contracts', linking these two terms through the nature and scope of construction projects."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY (提名團體)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (付款申索)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A nominating body may have some oversight or influence over the process of making payment claims, though this is more indirect and context-dependent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATING BODY (提名團體)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYING PARTY (付款方)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A nominating body might have some influence over the selection of paying parties for certain projects, though this is more indirect."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYING PARTY (付款方)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (付款申索)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The paying party is involved in making payment claims as per the terms of a contract, showing an indirect relationship through financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1bf52072b8dd02eb0cf0d0e08e22d0cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Paying parties and respondents are involved in payment disputes related to public contracts or construction work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;DEFECT OR NON-CONFORMANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The paying party's acceptance of defects or non-conformities influences the calculation of deductions from progress payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3978c9d363a5060a5f5dafe37f64fe66</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PAYING PARTY and CLAIMING PARTY are parties involved in the payment process where one makes a claim and the other responds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98b9cc96db8e2ffdc374754939531431</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The paying party serves a payment response, which may include an admitted amount or differences from the claimed amount."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d4be77f953bdd4a222130461f58fb29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;SET OFF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A paying party cannot use set off in the dispute resolution process if they fail to serve a payment response by the deadline, indicating their relationship through potential financial implications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0af4d7e54b59f5f639294394f679c069</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DEADLINE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claimant can delay carrying out construction if the payment deadline of the adjudicated amount has passed without full payment from the respondent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d229505b95cc3e576d9ad034318c66d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DEADLINE&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A notice of intention must be served at least 5 working days before the intended starting date and after the payment deadline has passed without full payment from the respondent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d229505b95cc3e576d9ad034318c66d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY FOR DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary for Development is involved in public contracts, which can include construction work on the construction site."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;SELECTED BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Selected bodies can be nominated by either claimants or respondents for adjudication of public contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-20e283bddbd3e4e77e96ddc072a75876</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;UTILITIES AND SERVICES INSTALLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Utilities and services installation is a component that can be included under public contract definitions as it involves various installations like electrical, mechanical, building services, electronic, radio, broadcasting, and telecommunication installations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-daaffb786a24be963871c47c40b85efb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both types of contracts involve similar conditions regarding ownership and specified entities, but with different criteria for classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public contracts and main private contracts are differentiated based on the ownership of the construction party; a public contract requires at least one owner to be a specified entity while a main private contract does not have this requirement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f53c86b3a5549c4a064860e12f41a1b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daaffb786a24be963871c47c40b85efb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSULTANCY SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public contracts may involve consultancy services in their administration and project management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-307d5bb8387dc47aa9c0f172efe39d0d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;SUBCONTRACT OF THE PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public contracts may have associated subcontracts that are subject to similar regulations and requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-307d5bb8387dc47aa9c0f172efe39d0d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This Ordinance applies to public contracts entered into on or after the commencement date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66cbfdf286322347be702ca6a2680df3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;SUBCONTRACT OF A PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A subcontract of a public contract is specifically mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66cbfdf286322347be702ca6a2680df3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESIDENTIAL UNIT&quot;" target="&quot;HOTEL AND GUESTHOUSE ACCOMMODATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 349)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The definition of Residential Unit does not include hotels or guesthouses as defined in the Hotel and Guesthouse Accommodation Ordinance (Cap. 349). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-236f00f9bfd67b3814958a8c6ddf9450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESIDENTIAL UNIT&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT HOSTEL OR STAFF QUARTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Student hostels or staff quarters are excluded from the definition of Residential Unit. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-236f00f9bfd67b3814958a8c6ddf9450</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY FOR DEVELOPMENT&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">3.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RESPONDENT is against whom adjudication proceedings are initiated, and the SECRETARY FOR DEVELOPMENT means the Secretary (局長). There's no direct relationship between them in this context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELECTED BODY&quot;" target="&quot;PREVAILING ADJUDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If the selected body prevails, it will be responsible for the outcome of the adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELECTED BODY&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SELECTED BODY is involved in the adjudication process as specified by the CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT, particularly when there's more than one nominating body or a previous adjudication has been terminated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTING WORK&quot;" target="&quot;MAIN PART OR ACCESSORY PARTS OF THE STRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CONSTRUCTING WORK includes work done on the main or accessory parts of the SPECIFIED STRUCTURE, such as making architectural features and installing facilities. This relationship is strong due to their direct involvement in construction activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04158b577f867f33b0abd25893c009fb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARCHITECTURAL FEATURES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Architectural features are part of the construction work, specifically mentioned as one of its components."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UTILITIES AND SERVICES INSTALLATION&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Utilities and services installation is a component of the construction work, included in both main and preparatory works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UTILITIES AND SERVICES INSTALLATION&quot;" target="&quot;PAINTING OR DECORATING EXTERNAL OR INTERNAL SURFACES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both utilities installation and painting/decorating are part of the broader scope of construction activities but serve different purposes, with no direct relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UTILITIES AND SERVICES INSTALLATION&quot;" target="&quot;SITE CLEARANCE, SITE INVESTIGATION, EXCAVATION, FILLING, TUNNELLING AND BORING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Site clearance and investigation can be preparatory to utilities installation but are not directly related."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UTILITIES AND SERVICES INSTALLATION&quot;" target="&quot;ACCESS ROADS AND SCAFFOLDING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Access roads and scaffolding may support the overall construction process, including utilities installations, though they serve different purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UTILITIES AND SERVICES INSTALLATION&quot;" target="&quot;SITE RESTORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Site restoration may involve some elements of utilities and services installations, particularly during the final stages of construction projects."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LANDSCAPING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Landscape work is part of the construction activities as mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAINTING OR DECORATING EXTERNAL OR INTERNAL SURFACES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Painting or decorating surfaces are included within the scope of construction work, both main and preparatory works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SITE CLEARANCE, SITE INVESTIGATION, EXCAVATION, FILLING, TUNNELLING AND BORING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Site clearance, investigation, excavation, filling, tunnelling, and boring are preparatory works for construction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS ROADS AND SCAFFOLDING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Access roads and scaffolding provision is part of the preparatory work for completing construction activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SITE RESTORATION&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Site restoration is included in the construction work, both main and preparatory works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8e519122ccc2d577ad6723a71d0f9b7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (CONTRACT A)&quot;" target="&quot;ANOTHER CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT (CONTRACT B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contract A can be considered as a subcontract of Contract B if it's entered for carrying out work or supplying goods and services under Contract B, regardless of party overlap."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f53c86b3a5549c4a064860e12f41a1b1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT A&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT B&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contract A is a subcontract to Contract B, related specifically to construction work or supplying related goods and services under Contract B."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fed725f04c7bcd4c7d2f5a1a4787af6d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSULTANCY SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consultancy services are related to construction work, providing planning and management services for it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-307d5bb8387dc47aa9c0f172efe39d0d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT OF THE PUBLIC CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction work can be part of the scope defined by a public contract, which might include subcontracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-307d5bb8387dc47aa9c0f172efe39d0d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL PRIVATE CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance also applies to total private contracts and their subcontracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66cbfdf286322347be702ca6a2680df3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL PRIVATE CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudicator's role involves TOTAL PRIVATE CONTRACTS where disputes may arise regarding payments or extensions of time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARCHITECTURAL OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING ORDINANCE (CAP. 123)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Architectural Officer's approval is required for some constructions as per the Building Ordinance, indicating a regulatory relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66157f73d78c8a042051d0b5db5e4492</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VALUE OF THE CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;" target="&quot;PROVISIONS UNDER WHICH THE CONSIDERATION PAYABLE FOR CONSTRUCTION WORK IS TO BE CALCULATED OTHERWISE THAN BY REFERENCE TO THE VALUE OF THE CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The value of the construction work is a basis for calculating consideration, but not in all cases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSIDERATION PAYABLE FOR CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL UNIT(S) IN HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consideration may involve residential units as part of a broader scope of works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;A CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT TO THE EXTENT THAT IT CONTAINS PROVISIONS&quot;" target="&quot;PROVISIONS UNDER WHICH THE CONSIDERATION PAYABLE FOR CONSTRUCTION WORK IS TO BE CALCULATED OTHERWISE THAN BY REFERENCE TO THE VALUE OF THE CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction contracts may contain provisions for calculating consideration differently from the value of construction work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROVISIONS UNDER WHICH THE CONSIDERATION PAYABLE FOR CONSTRUCTION WORK IS TO BE CALCULATED OTHERWISE THAN BY REFERENCE TO THE VALUE OF THE CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLY OF RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES (AS DEFINED BY CONTEXT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Provisions can cover the supply of related goods and services in addition to construction work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;A CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT TO THE EXTENT THAT IT IS FOR WORK CARRIED OUT OUTSIDE HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL PRIVATE WORKS CONTRACT (OR ITS SUBCONTRACT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction contracts for work outside Hong Kong may be part of a total private works contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESIDENTIAL UNIT(S) IN HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;THE BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Residential units in Hong Kong fall under the jurisdiction of the Building Management Ordinance as defined by the ordinance itself."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYEE(S) (AS DEFINED BY THE EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 57))&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE(S) (AS DEFINED BY THE BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)) - DEFINITION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employees may work at construction sites as defined by the Building Management Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE CONSTRUCTION ORDINANCE (AS IMPLIED BY CONTEXT)&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING WORK(S) (AS DEFINED BY THE BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344))&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Construction Ordinance may imply provisions related to building works as defined by the Building Management Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING WORK(S) (AS DEFINED BY THE BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344))&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLY OF RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES (AS DEFINED BY CONTEXT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Building works and related goods/services are interrelated in the context of construction contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION SITE(S) (AS DEFINED BY THE BUILDING MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 344)) - DEFINITION&quot;" target="&quot;THE EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 57)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance may apply to employees working at construction sites as defined by the Building Management Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a44f4fabcd33aba35991913cf5f1f2da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 57)&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Ordinance (Cap. 57) defines an employee, which affects the application of certain provisions under the main ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4113afe7255cfeb2800c08deeeac90a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 1—INTERPRETATION&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLIED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Division 1—Interpretation provides the definition of 'supplied', which is crucial for understanding how this term is used in context."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-62cc8e230a5d660ff292c1740f8b1b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 1—INTERPRETATION&quot;" target="&quot;BILLING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The interpretation section defines what a 'billing date' means, providing clarity on its usage within the ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-62cc8e230a5d660ff292c1740f8b1b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BILLING DATE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The billing date is defined in relation to the progress payment of a construction contract, indicating its importance for making claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6daadd1f16d5e396cd12e56c0d0df02</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BILLING DATE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM FOR PROGRESS PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Billing Date is relevant to Payment Claim for Progress Payment as it determines when a claim can be served under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1c90a7be5c9755cdde83e35c88dd2f63</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;CARRYING OUT CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Carrying out construction work under a contract entitles the person to progress payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-889afebd54a7251f29bdb7f6b9bc2a85</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLYING RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Supplying related goods and services under a contract also entitles the person to progress payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-889afebd54a7251f29bdb7f6b9bc2a85</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CARRYING OUT CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Carrying out construction work is done under a construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-889afebd54a7251f29bdb7f6b9bc2a85</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPLYING RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Supplying related goods and services is also part of the activities under a construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-889afebd54a7251f29bdb7f6b9bc2a85</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACT PRICE OR RATE FOR THE CONSTRUCTION WORK OR RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The contract price or rate for the work and services are key in assessing the progress payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3978c9d363a5060a5f5dafe37f64fe66</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFECT OR NON-CONFORMANCE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Defects or non-conformities in work and services under a construction contract can affect progress payment calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3978c9d363a5060a5f5dafe37f64fe66</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFECT RECTIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;DIMINUTION IN VALUE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Defect Rectification and Diminution in Value both deal with issues arising from construction work not conforming to requirements, though they address different aspects of the problem."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1c90a7be5c9755cdde83e35c88dd2f63</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT PROVISIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Progress payment provisions are certain clauses in construction contracts that the parties may agree upon regarding various aspects of progress payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad2f770d3edd7fc8b6985f3040077779</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certificate or assessment issued under a construction contract in response to an application for payment is taken to be a payment response."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment Response is required for each claim related to payments under the Construction Contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d4be77f953bdd4a222130461f58fb29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bca656554298bd4af2405476efe73616</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A payment response is served on the claiming party in response to a payment claim."&lt;SEP&gt;"The claiming party may delay work or supply if the paying party fails to pay the admitted amount in full by the payment deadline of the progress payment and serves an unsatisfactory payment response."&lt;SEP&gt;"The claiming party's right to delay work or supply is contingent upon receiving an unsatisfactory payment response from the paying party under section 59(2)(b)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d4be77f953bdd4a222130461f58fb29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89690e148d95bff497042548ed9e3555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE DEADLINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A payment response must be served by the payment response deadline to comply with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d4be77f953bdd4a222130461f58fb29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIM HANDLING PROCEDURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claim handling procedure involves the service of a payment response by the paying party in accordance with section 19."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4dc61c3e9d0b909249e0a6492fb80f00</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment disputes are resolved through the service of payment responses under section 19, which may involve full or partial dispute of claimed amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4dc61c3e9d0b909249e0a6492fb80f00</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A payment response that fails to pay the admitted amount in full by the deadline can trigger the need for a notice of intention."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-89690e148d95bff497042548ed9e3555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 3 — CERTAIN PROVISIONS IN CONSTRUCTION CONTRACTS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 20&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 20 sets the deadline for serving payment responses related to progress payments, also under Division 3 in construction contracts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad2f770d3edd7fc8b6985f3040077779</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction work can trigger or be related to events that lead to making a payment claim," as these claims are often based on completed work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ad2f770d3edd7fc8b6985f3040077779</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONAL PAYMENT PROVISIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Conditional Payment Provisions are specific clauses within a Construction Contract that affect payment terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bca656554298bd4af2405476efe73616</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITIONAL PAYMENT PROVISION&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (IN RELATION TO AN INTERIM PROGRESS PAYMENT)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Conditional payment provisions are related to the Payment Claim for an Interim Progress Payment, as they both involve conditions and obligations in a construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONEY OWING&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Money owing is associated with the cost of Construction Work performed under the contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONEY OWING&quot;" target="&quot;RELATED GOODS AND SERVICES (相關物料及服務)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Related goods and services contribute to the money owing for a project under the Construction Contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY A&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE (付款回應)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Party A, as a payer in the construction contract, has Payment Response obligations towards Party B or C."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY A&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Party A can specify circumstances where their submission, response, document or evidence (or any part of it) should not be considered by the Adjudicator within a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Party A can specify issues to the Adjudicator regarding submissions, responses, documents or evidence that were not known or should have been served before the adjudication notice is served."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba63535f02791b0eaca5f64d5b8ed57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712f0363a7a1263779f6581a9b8b41b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY B&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Party B is often the Claimant who may seek payment under the Construction Contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 4 —— PAYMENT CLAIMS AND PAYMENT RESPONSES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Division 4 deals with specific sections and provisions related to Construction Contracts, particularly concerning Payment Claims and Responses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 4 —— PAYMENT CLAIMS AND PAYMENT RESPONSES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT TERMS (建造合同條款)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction Contract Terms, including Division 4, outline specific provisions and obligations related to payment claims and responses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (IN RELATION TO AN INTERIM PROGRESS PAYMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;INTERIM PROGRESS PAYMENT (期進度款)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment Claims for Interim Progress Payments are directly related to the actual Interim Progress Payment amounts due under the contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (IN RELATION TO AN INTERIM PROGRESS PAYMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;INTERIM PROGRESS CLAIM (期進度款的申索)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interim Progress Claim is a specific type of Payment Claim for interim progress payments under the Construction Contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM (IN RELATION TO AN INTERIM PROGRESS PAYMENT)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION PROJECT PAYMENT TERMS (建造項目付款條款)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction Project Payment Terms govern how and when interim progress payments are claimed or made under the contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION PROJECT&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The construction project is relevant to the payment dispute as it involves building work that may be disputed for payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8719074a70eff81632691da24dedfc0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FURTHER PARTY (進一步付款方)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE (付款回應)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Further Party may have Payment Response obligations towards other parties in relation to interim progress payments or other contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OPERATION OF OTHER CONTRACTS OR AGREEMENTS (其他合同或協議的實施)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL RESPONSIBILITY (法律責任)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The operation of other contracts can affect the legal responsibility for payment obligations under a Construction Contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE (付款回應)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT OBLIGATION (付款義務)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A payment response is a fulfillment of the Payment Obligation in relation to an interim progress payment or other payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK COMPLETION DATE (施工完成日期)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DATE (付款日期)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The completion date of construction work influences when payment dates are due, as per contract terms and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK COMPLETION DATE (施工完成日期)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT OBLIGATION (付款義務)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The completion date of the work influences the Payment Obligation for final or interim payments under the contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-104729af58e2197afbd033252a8317e6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DUE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CLAIMING PARTY must wait for full payment before resuming work after 5 working days from receiving the due amount."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a39eb07c8451fb1542c2fcc4877cecdf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;DELIVERY NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CLAIMING PARTY sends an intention notice to the PAYMENT PARTY and OWNER, indicating their intent to delay construction or supply of goods/services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a39eb07c8451fb1542c2fcc4877cecdf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"After serving a payment claim, the claiming party must serve a notice of intention that meets specific requirements before delaying work or supply under section 59(3)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-89690e148d95bff497042548ed9e3555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claiming party's rights and obligations under section 59 are related to the construction contract, as they pertain to delays in work or supply."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-89690e148d95bff497042548ed9e3555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT defines the period during which a PAYMENT RESPONSE must be provided, ensuring timely communication between parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98b9cc96db8e2ffdc374754939531431</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;PREVIOUS HEARING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Previous hearings may involve claims for a specific amount, which is detailed in the claimant's notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACTUAL OBLIGATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PAYMENT RESPONSE process is a contractual obligation that must be followed to ensure proper handling of claims and responses according to the terms of the contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98b9cc96db8e2ffdc374754939531431</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31 ADJUDICATION RESPONSE FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment dispute resolution mechanism includes section 31 adjudication response failures, which affect how disputes are determined under sections 36 and 37."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32 REPLY TO ADJUDICATION RESPONSE FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment dispute resolution mechanism includes section 32 reply to adjudication response failures, which affect how disputes are determined under sections 36 and 37."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 35 REQUEST OR DIRECTION FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The payment dispute resolution mechanism includes section 35 request or direction failures, which affect how disputes are determined under sections 36 and 37."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE DEADLINE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The deadline for responding to a payment claim can be specified by parties in the construction contract, affecting when responses must be served."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0af4d7e54b59f5f639294394f679c069</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE DEADLINE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A payment dispute arises on the day following the payment response deadline."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f04c9983bdf92638bbe090b65a4a327a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作日&quot;" target="&quot;第54條&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"工作日在第54條中被定义为非公众假期、星期六或特定恶劣天气警告的日子。这影响了费用解释的计算方式。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作日&quot;" target="&quot;方、一方 (PARTY)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在规定的工作日内，当事人需要完成相关的法律行为或提交文件等。"&lt;SEP&gt;"在规定的工作日内，当事人需要完成相关的法律行为或提交文件等。这影响了当事人的行动和时间安排。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作日&quot;" target="&quot;解決爭議程序 (DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在规定的工作日内进行解决争议程序中的相关活动和文件提交等。这影响了整个过程的时间安排。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作日&quot;" target="&quot;審裁答覆 (REPLY TO AN ADJUDICATION RESPONSE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在规定的工作日内进行审裁回答的相关活动和文件提交等，确保程序按时推进。这影响了整个过程的时间安排。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作日&quot;" target="&quot;公眾假期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"工作日不包括公眾假期。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;工作日&quot;" target="&quot;黑色暴雨警告日或烈風警告日&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"工作日不包括《釋義及通則條例》界定的黑色暴雨警告日或烈風警告日。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;方、一方 (PARTY)&quot;" target="&quot;審裁答覆 (REPLY TO AN ADJUDICATION RESPONSE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"当事人需要对对方的审裁回答作出回应，以维护自己的权益和立场。"&lt;SEP&gt;"当事人需要对对方的审裁回答作出回应，以维护自己的权益和立场。这影响了双方之间的互动过程。"&lt;SEP&gt;"当事人需要对对方的审裁回答作出回应，在解决争议程序中起到重要作用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;裁定 (DETERMINATION)&quot;" target="&quot;審裁陳詞 (ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"裁定是由审裁员根据第42条作出的，并且需要通过提交审裁陈词来支持。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;裁定 (DETERMINATION)&quot;" target="&quot;解決爭議程序 (DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">21.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"裁定是通过解决争议程序得出的结果，影响着当事人的权利和义务。"&lt;SEP&gt;"解决争议程序的结果是通过作出裁定来实现的。"&lt;SEP&gt;"解决争议程序的结果是通过作出裁定来实现的。这影响了当事人的权利和义务分配。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;裁定 (DETERMINATION)&quot;" target="&quot;審裁答覆 (REPLY TO AN ADJUDICATION RESPONSE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"裁定是通过审裁回答来支持或反对某一决定的，这直接影响最终结果。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;解決爭議程序 (DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS)&quot;" target="&quot;審裁回應 (ADJUDICATION RESPONSE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"解决争议程序包括仲裁程序，而审裁回应是其中的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;解決爭議程序 (DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS)&quot;" target="&quot;審裁答覆 (REPLY TO AN ADJUDICATION RESPONSE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"回复审裁回应是在解决争议程序中的一部分，用于进一步沟通和澄清问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"审裁回答是对解决争议程序中的请求作出的回复。"&lt;SEP&gt;"解决争议程序中的审裁回答是其中的一部分，影响了整个过程的结果和走向。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;解決爭議程序 (DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS)&quot;" target="&quot;審裁陳詞 (ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在解决争议程序中，提交审裁陈词是关键步骤之一。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第54條&quot;" target="&quot;審裁付款爭議 (ADJUDICATION OF PAYMENT DISPUTES)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第54条解释了关于审裁程序费用的规定，影响着支付纠纷的解决方式。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce595edca85b7cf2be310394d2ac094c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE OR THE DISTRICT COURT&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The adjudicator's determinations are made under section 42 and involve proceedings in the Court of First Instance or the District Court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-16c32b6c243652a8ef2eb45cb49c1e90</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BLACK RAINSTORM WARNING DAY OR GALE WARNING DAY&quot;" target="&quot;WORKING DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These days are excluded from being considered working days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-16c32b6c243652a8ef2eb45cb49c1e90</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;付款回應期限終結&quot;" target="&quot;付款爭議&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The end of the response period for payment can lead to the generation of a payment dispute between parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-16c32b6c243652a8ef2eb45cb49c1e90</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申索處理程序&quot;" target="&quot;額外款項&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"申索處理程序涉及評定額外款項的款額和分析其法律責任。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0ad9b54c9ee91ca2e3599ed5448d03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;申索處理程序&quot;" target="&quot;付款爭議&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"通過申索處理程序評定額外款項可以避免或解決付款爭議。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0ad9b54c9ee91ca2e3599ed5448d03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;額外款項&quot;" target="&quot;付款爭議&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"因未支付或遲延支付額外款項而產生付款爭議。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0ad9b54c9ee91ca2e3599ed5448d03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;額外款項&quot;" target="&quot;建造合約&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"建造合約中包含額外款項的條款和評定程序。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0ad9b54c9ee91ca2e3599ed5448d03</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;建造合約&quot;" target="&quot;答辯人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在某些情况下,建造合约中的答辩人在付款争议的仲裁程序中扮演重要角色。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3fb320dd06f32faf0b373f1098dd9a0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIM HANDLING PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;ADDITIONAL PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A claim handling procedure deals with the analysis and determination of liability, as well as assessment of an additional payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f04c9983bdf92638bbe090b65a4a327a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDITIONAL PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM FOR ADDITIONAL PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claim for additional payment is related to any payment that may be provided in a construction contract due to certain events."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f04c9983bdf92638bbe090b65a4a327a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS FOR PAYMENT DISPUTES&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudication proceedings are initiated for resolving payment disputes within 28 days of their occurrence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f04c9983bdf92638bbe090b65a4a327a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;A CLAIMING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The A CLAIMING PARTY can initiate adjudication proceedings against the RESPONDENT for a payment dispute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e4a8b59b4e3e2ba05d0864cc47510c7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;A CLAIMING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The A CLAIMING PARTY sends an ADJUDICATION NOTIFICATION to start the process, involving the ADJUDICATOR in resolving the payment dispute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e4a8b59b4e3e2ba05d0864cc47510c7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;提名团体&quot;" target="&quot;审裁程序&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"提名团体与审裁程序相关,因为申索人需根据特定条款选择或重新选择提名团体以启动仲裁程序。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3fb320dd06f32faf0b373f1098dd9a0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;提名团体&quot;" target="&quot;有关审裁员须在以下期间内作出裁定并送达裁定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"审裁员必须在规定的时间内向指定的团体提交其决定,确保程序的透明和公正性。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f9946a33c62725ccbba5bb541cff6fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;审裁通知&quot;" target="&quot;答辯人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"审裁通知需送达给答辩人,以启动或重新开始仲裁程序。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3fb320dd06f32faf0b373f1098dd9a0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">23.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CLAIMANT must send an adjudication submission in response to a received ADJUDICATION NOTICE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CLAIMANT serves the ADJUDICATION NOTICE on the RESPONDENT, initiating the process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The claimant must serve an adjudication notice on the respondent regarding the nature and description of the payment dispute, claimed amount, admitted amount, and paid amount."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1611b0ccefada6387970ed4d17809f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b53857aed1787aca531dea0f456e8ca5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RESPONDENT receives and must respond to the ADJUDICATION NOTICE within 5 working days."&lt;SEP&gt;"The respondent receives the adjudication notice from the claimant which details the payment dispute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1611b0ccefada6387970ed4d17809f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An adjudication notice may be served in connection with a construction contract, as specified by subsection (1)(b)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The construction contract may specify one or more nominating bodies for resolving payment disputes through an adjudication notice."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;NEW ADJUDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The issuance of an adjudication notice can lead to new adjudications if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;28-DAY PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claimant has 28 days from the termination of a prior adjudication to initiate new proceedings if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;8 WORKING DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If more than one nominating body is specified, the claimant must serve on the selected body within 8 working days after serving the respondent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An ADJUDICATION NOTICE can be served in response to a PAYMENT DISPUTE under specific conditions outlined by the construction contract or selected body."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b19b1bce23dbf161109b02b0e7ddc678</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">21.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudications can also be sent via methods designated by the adjudicator if no method is specified by the nominating body."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Adjudication Notice is sent to Party A and sets out the conditions under which submissions, responses or replies must be made within a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The issuance of an adjudication notice leads to the appointment of an adjudicator by the nominated body."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba63535f02791b0eaca5f64d5b8ed57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4537b3223942fe128431f147e0b27414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTICE&quot;" target="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An adjudication notice is a type of document that may be subject to the service procedures outlined in this section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELECTED ARBITRATOR(S)&quot;" target="&quot;PREVAILING ADJUDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Selected arbitrators are involved in determining the prevailing outcome of the adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREVIOUS HEARING&quot;" target="&quot;PAID AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Paid amounts in previous hearings may be referenced or compared with current claims during adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0b219a4ff887909dc5fdeb24191ca220</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION RULES OF THE BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ADJUDICATION RULES OF THE BODY guide the appointment of ADJUDICATORS by the BODY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7ad6aa79a150340c8a28d98a0e6b1a24</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATION BODY&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claimant selects the nominating body which serves a notice to the respondent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-40b68681ecca6bd68067e789107e9bdc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATION BODY&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nominated body informs both the claimant and respondent about the appointed adjudicator within 7 working days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-40b68681ecca6bd68067e789107e9bdc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATION BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR is appointed by the NOMINATION BODY and must send a resignation notice to this body if there's a conflict of interest or doubts about independence/impartiality."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-145b271e55786ea72d8690e6e1f2ebf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATION BODY&quot;" target="&quot;DISCLOSURE OR PROVISION OF DATA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Disclosure or provision of data can occur with the consent of the nomination body under specific circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOMINATION BODY&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY DEVELOPMENT BOARD (CIDB)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The nomination body may be involved in the process related to construction industry development, which could affect dispute resolution procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONFLICT OF INTEREST&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An adjudicator can exclude a proposed new representative if there is a conflict of interest between them regarding a payment dispute."&lt;SEP&gt;"The adjudicator must disclose any conflict of interest that might affect their independence or impartiality in resolving the dispute."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-40b68681ecca6bd68067e789107e9bdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59f65136a37f2183ac96641ebb7819e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONFLICT OF INTEREST&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A conflict of interest can arise in relation to a payment dispute between a proposed new representative and an adjudicator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59f65136a37f2183ac96641ebb7819e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDEPENDENCE AND IMPARTIALITY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An ADJUDICATOR's role depends on maintaining INDEPENDENCE AND IMPARTIALITY, which requires declarations of any potential conflicts of interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"The independence and impartiality of an adjudicator may be questioned when proposing to change representation, potentially affecting the fairness of their decision-making process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-169c5c3921ad759a4d5a8b8e69511b19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59f65136a37f2183ac96641ebb7819e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONFLICTS OF INTEREST&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The role of an ADJUDICATOR involves the risk of CONFLICTS OF INTEREST that must be declared to maintain independence and impartiality."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-169c5c3921ad759a4d5a8b8e69511b19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CLAIMANT is responsible for submitting documents and evidence that are relevant to the adjudication process through ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION."&lt;SEP&gt;"CLAIMANT prepares and sends the ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION, which identifies the relevant ADJUDICATION NOTICE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47220fb088d5ae56db9b03a4c12e8f14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b53857aed1787aca531dea0f456e8ca5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION RESPONSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION triggers the need for ADJUDICATION RESPONSE from both parties involved in the adjudication process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47220fb088d5ae56db9b03a4c12e8f14</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION RESPONSE&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">22.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The RESPONDENT must send an ADJUDICATION RESPONSE to the CLAIMANT's submission."&lt;SEP&gt;"The RESPONDENT must submit an ADJUDICATION RESPONSE, which can include supporting documents and evidence related to the claims made by CLAIMANT."&lt;SEP&gt;"The RESPONDENT provides an ADJUDICATION RESPONSE which is addressed by the CLAIMANT's written submission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47220fb088d5ae56db9b03a4c12e8f14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b53857aed1787aca531dea0f456e8ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ddfde50b478473b5624659f6cfdd546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WRITTEN SUBMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR receives and considers WRITTEN SUBMISSIONs from both parties in making a decision."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2ddfde50b478473b5624659f6cfdd546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S JURISDICTION&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR'S JURISDICTION is limited to determining the PAYMENT DISPUTE as specified in section 33(1)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3e060ad7c0dcaf66b5c6e6d5a4b6243</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S JURISDICTION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT EVIDENCE RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR'S JURISDICTION is not bound by COURT EVIDENCE RULES when conducting adjudication proceedings, as mentioned in section 34(2)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a3e060ad7c0dcaf66b5c6e6d5a4b6243</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 35&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR must conduct adjudication proceedings in the way considered appropriate within the powers and subject to duties under SECTION 35."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30ea89e5165c3d71c14d8648bf53596</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDEPENDENT EXPERT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An independent expert can be appointed by an adjudicator to inquire or report on specific aspects of a payment dispute related to construction projects."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8719074a70eff81632691da24dedfc0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S POWER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 35 REQUEST OR DIRECTION FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR's power remains unaffected when any of the parties fail to comply with a request or direction given by the ADJUDICATOR under section 35."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S ROLE IN DISPUTE RESOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR plays a role in determining payment disputes through sections 31, 32, and 35 of the dispute resolution mechanism."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S CONSIDERATION OF MAILED DOCUMENTS/EVIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 37 CONSIDERATION OF SPECIFIC MAILED DOCUMENTS/EVIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR may consider specific mailed documents/evidence in determining the payment dispute under section 37."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION BASED ON AVAILABLE INFORMATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 36 WHEN POWERS OF ADJUDICATOR NOT AFFECTED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR's determination on the payment dispute is based on available information when there are failures in serving an adjudication response or reply to an adjudication response under sections 31 and 32."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION BASED ON AVAILABLE INFORMATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 31 ADJUDICATION RESPONSE FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR's determination on the payment dispute is based on available information when there are failures in serving an adjudication response under section 31."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION BASED ON AVAILABLE INFORMATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 32 REPLY FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR's determination on the payment dispute is based on available information when there are failures in serving a reply to an adjudication response under section 32."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION BASED ON AVAILABLE INFORMATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 35 REQUEST OR DIRECTION FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR's determination on the payment dispute is based on available information when there are failures in complying with a request or direction given by the ADJUDICATOR under section 35."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION BASED ON AVAILABLE INFORMATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 37 CONSIDERATION OF SPECIFIC MAILED DOCUMENTS/EVIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR's determination on the payment dispute is based on specific mailed documents/evidence considered under section 37, which may include unaware or unfairly ignored information."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 37 CONSIDERATION OF SPECIFIC MAILED DOCUMENTS/EVIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S CONSIDERATION OF UNAWARE INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR must consider unaware information in the context of section 37, where specific mailed documents/evidence are involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 37 CONSIDERATION OF SPECIFIC MAILED DOCUMENTS/EVIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION ON UNAWARE INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR's determination on unaware information is based on the specific mailed documents/evidence considered under section 37."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 37 CONSIDERATION OF SPECIFIC MAILED DOCUMENTS/EVIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S CONSIDERATION OF UNFAIRLY IGNORED INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR must consider unfairly ignored information in the context of section 37, where specific mailed documents/evidence are involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 37 CONSIDERATION OF SPECIFIC MAILED DOCUMENTS/EVIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION DEADLINE FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR may consider unaware information in the context of section 37, where specific mailed documents/evidence are involved and there is a failure to submit within the deadline."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 31 ADJUDICATION RESPONSE FAILURE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CLAIMANT's submission (other than an adjudication submission) within the period specified by the ADJUDICATOR is not affected if it fails to be served under section 31."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY A'S RESPONSE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Adjudicator must disregard Party A's submission, response or reply if it is not made within the specified period as per their own response."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bba63535f02791b0eaca5f64d5b8ed57</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 30(2)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED PERIOD (指明期間)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The specified period for an adjudication submission is defined by section 30(2). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-712f0363a7a1263779f6581a9b8b41b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 31(2)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED PERIOD (指明期間)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The specified period for an adjudication response, when applicable, is defined by section 31(2)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-712f0363a7a1263779f6581a9b8b41b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 32(2)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED PERIOD (指明期間)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The specified period for a reply to an adjudication response, when applicable, is defined by section 32(2)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-712f0363a7a1263779f6581a9b8b41b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 35(1)(G)&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIFIED PERIOD (指明期间)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The specified period for any further written submission is defined under section 35(1)(g). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-712f0363a7a1263779f6581a9b8b41b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REPRESENTATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A representative can be appointed to handle a payment dispute on behalf of the party involved. "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-712f0363a7a1263779f6581a9b8b41b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;A PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;PROPOSED NEW REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The party may propose to add or substitute a new representative who will represent the party in adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59f65136a37f2183ac96641ebb7819e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S RESIGNATION&quot;" target="&quot;CONFLICT WITH A PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A conflict with a party can lead to justifiable doubts about the independence or impartiality of an adjudicator, potentially resulting in their resignation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59f65136a37f2183ac96641ebb7819e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEDURES&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claimant's actions in withdrawing from adjudication proceedings are part of broader dispute resolution procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71987cb00c98805ab9ed06eb948af233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEDURES&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Dispute resolution procedures, including payment disputes, are integral to the adjudication process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;TERMINATION OF ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">47.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The process of determining Adjudicator's Determinations is closely linked with the termination conditions, as some determinations may not be made if proceedings are terminated for specific reasons."&lt;SEP&gt;"The termination conditions outlined in the text directly affect whether Adjudicator's Determinations are made, as some determinations may not be issued if proceedings are terminated for specific reasons."&lt;SEP&gt;"The termination of adjudication proceedings can affect the Adjudicator's Determinations, as some determinations may not be made if the process is terminated for certain reasons."&lt;SEP&gt;"The termination of proceedings due to various reasons (a)-(i) can directly impact the Adjudicator's Determinations, as some determinations may not be made if the process is terminated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d296364c6fb1e176227c199c33f148d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">28.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Claimant’s actions and participation in the proceedings are crucial for making Adjudicator's Determinations; their failure to serve an adjudication submission can lead to termination of proceedings (b)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Claimant’s actions and participation in the proceedings directly impact the making of Adjudicator's Determinations; their failure to serve an adjudication submission can lead to termination (b)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d296364c6fb1e176227c199c33f148d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">28.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Respondent’s actions and participation in the proceedings are also crucial for making Adjudicator's Determinations; their payment or agreement on a settlement can terminate further adjudication (d)(h)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Respondent’s actions and participation in the proceedings directly impact the making of Adjudicator's Determinations; their payment or agreement on a settlement can terminate further adjudication (d)(h)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d296364c6fb1e176227c199c33f148d6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;该审裁员根据第33条规定决定自己没有管轄权裁定有关付款争议&quot;" target="&quot;有关审裁员程序因第41条所列的理由而终止&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这两个条款描述了在特定情况下,审裁程序的终止或管辖权问题导致不同的法律后果。前者是程序结束的原因之一,后者是在无管辖权时的具体处理方式。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f9946a33c62725ccbba5bb541cff6fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;该审裁员根据第33条规定决定自己没有管轄权裁定有关付款争议&quot;" target="&quot;须就有关付款争议而支付的总款额(包括第(3)(B)款所指的款项及审裁程序费用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在无管辖权的情况下,虽然不能直接处理付款争议,但可能涉及相关费用。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f9946a33c62725ccbba5bb541cff6fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;根据该合同完成建造工作或完成为建造工作供应相关货物及服务的工期获延长多少日&quot;" target="&quot;须就有关付款争议而支付的总款额(包括第(3)(B)款所指的款项及审裁程序费用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这两个条款描述了在工程延期的情况下,可能需要额外支付的金额。前者是时间上的调整,后者涉及经济补偿。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f9946a33c62725ccbba5bb541cff6fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;须就有关付款争议而支付的总款额(包括第(3)(B)款所指的款项及审裁程序费用)&quot;" target="&quot;须支付的利息(如有的话)的款项(不不论以实际金额表示或藉参照任何比率表示)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在涉及付款争议时,可能需要额外支付利息作为补偿。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f9946a33c62725ccbba5bb541cff6fc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 42(7)&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR's determination must specify a period for payment under SECTION 42(7)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b49150680872ebc6da3ccdee23b5d249</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;TYPOGRAPHICAL ERROR CORRECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A DETERMINATION can be corrected for typographical or computational errors by an ADJUDICATOR, as per sections 45(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c883642e952f5d5b217f2a11baae78f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK VALUE CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The value of construction work is determined in a DETERMINATION and may be relevant to CONSTRUCTION WORK VALUE CALCULATION in subsequent adjudications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c883642e952f5d5b217f2a11baae78f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY OF ADJUDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Determinations made in adjudication proceedings are protected by confidentiality rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 42(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudicators determine values based on Section 42(1)(a), which pertains to the value of construction work or related goods and services under a contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c72baaf42bcfd44fb0bf40d018847b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 42(1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Construction contracts are directly related to Section 42(1)(a), which deals with the valuation of construction work or related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c72baaf42bcfd44fb0bf40d018847b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 6—SETTING ASIDE OR ENFORCEMENT OF DETERMINATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Division 6 outlines procedures for setting aside adjudicator determinations, which ADJUDICATORS are subject to through CLAIMANT or RESPONDENT applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c72baaf42bcfd44fb0bf40d018847b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 6—SETTING ASIDE OR ENFORCEMENT OF DETERMINATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CLAIMANT can apply for the SETTING ASIDE of an ADJUDICATOR's determination under Division 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c72baaf42bcfd44fb0bf40d018847b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 6—SETTING ASIDE OR ENFORCEMENT OF DETERMINATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similarly, the RESPONDENT has the right to apply for the SETTING ASIDE of an ADJUDICATOR's determination under Division 6."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2c72baaf42bcfd44fb0bf40d018847b9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court has the authority to decide on SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS based on certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR (審裁員)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ADJUDICATORS' actions and independence are key factors in determining whether a SET ASIDE APPLICATION is successful."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;FRAUD OR BRIBERY (欺詐或賄賂)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fraud or bribery can lead to a determination being set aside if proven in court."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;NATURAL JUSTICE PRINCIPLE (自然公正原則)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A serious violation of the natural justice principle may result in an application for setting aside a determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;DIVISION 6 OF THE TEXT DOCUMENT (第6分部)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Division 6 specifically deals with SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS and their procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 42(7) OF THE TEXT DOCUMENT (第42(7)條)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 42(7) is a key reference for the time limit within which an application can be made."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL PERMISSION (上訴許可)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court's decision on SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS may include granting or denying APPEAL PERMISSION."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;GUARANTEE (保證)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Guarantee is required for the application of a construction contract in certain cases related to set aside applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEDURE (審裁程序)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The adjudication procedure is integral to SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS as it involves the process of making and challenging determinations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL FRAMEWORK OF SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS (撤銷申請的法律框架)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal framework provides the basis for setting aside applications, including conditions under which they can be made and their procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AWARD (經審裁款額)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arbitration awards are subject to possible SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;14-DAY PERIOD (14日)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 14-day period is a critical time frame for submitting a set aside application after the determination has been made."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;SWORN STATEMENT (誓章)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sworn statements are required to support SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS, providing evidence and details of the case."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;NATURAL JUSTICE PRINCIPLE VIOLATION (嚴重違反自然公正原則的情況)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A violation of natural justice can be a ground for setting aside an application or determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;EXCEEDING JURISDICTION (超越其管轄權的作為)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Exceeding jurisdiction by the adjudicator is another potential reason for a set aside application to be successful."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL CHALLENGE (法律挑戰)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal challenges, such as those related to SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS, can impact the legal framework and procedures of arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;DETERMINATION (裁定)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Determinations are subject to possible set aside applications if they do not meet certain criteria or conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;COURT DECISION ON SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請的法院決定)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The court's decision on a set aside application can either approve or deny the application, impacting the legal framework and procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S INDEPENDENCE AND IMPARTIALITY (獨立或公正地行事)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The independence and impartiality of adjudicators are crucial in determining whether a set aside application is successful."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL OBLIGATION (法律責任)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal obligations, such as the payment of guaranteed amounts, can be involved in SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL DOCUMENT (文件)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal documents are necessary for supporting and substantiating set aside applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION (撤銷申請)&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCESS (審裁程序)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The adjudication process is central to SET ASIDE APPLICATIONS, involving the making of determinations and their challenges."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a4515c46a290954f33bec2c90fbb156f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIES TO ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT PERIOD FOR ADJUDICATED AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties must adhere to the PAYMENT PERIOD for ADJUDICATED AMOUNTS as determined in the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-143b0fa3beba6c5913ea9659f090c4b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SET ASIDE APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can consider and decide on a SET ASIDE APPLICATION if certain conditions are met such as fraud or denial of natural justice."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Court must not grant an enforcement application if a set aside application related to the determination is pending."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f87d18cc47acf07db6f5458960b21f19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-143b0fa3beba6c5913ea9659f090c4b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NATURAL JUSTICE&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An ADJUDICATOR must act independently and impartially to ensure NATURAL JUSTICE during the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-143b0fa3beba6c5913ea9659f090c4b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENFORCEMENT OF ADJUDICATION DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT can enforce an ADJUDICATION DETERMINATION in a manner similar to enforcing a judgment of the HIGH COURT (CIVIL JURISDICTION)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-143b0fa3beba6c5913ea9659f090c4b2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HIGH COURT IN ITS CIVIL JURISDICTION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Court can enforce determinations as if they were judgments of the High Court in its civil jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f87d18cc47acf07db6f5458960b21f19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENFORCEMENT APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An enforcement application can only be made by a party after the payment deadline of the adjudicated amount has expired and no set aside application in relation to the determination is pending."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f87d18cc47acf07db6f5458960b21f19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COURT OR OTHER DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment disputes can be submitted in court or other dispute resolution proceedings, and such submission does not terminate the adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISCLOSURE OR PROVISION OF DATA&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN PROVIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan providers may be involved in the disclosure or provision of certain data for enforcement actions related to adjudication procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKING INSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;THE BANKING ORDINANCE (CAP. 155)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Banking institutions, defined by The Banking Ordinance (Cap. 155), are mentioned as entities that can receive disclosed data under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL OPINION&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSIONAL ADVISOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal opinions may be sought from professional advisors for certain disclosures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROFESSIONAL ADVISOR&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL ADVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal advice can involve professional advisors as recipients of disclosed information under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OTHER ADVISORS&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSIONAL CONSULTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Professional consultation may involve other advisors as recipients of disclosed information under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The confidentiality of adjudication procedures must be maintained unless certain conditions are met for disclosure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEDURE&quot;" target="&quot;ENFORCEMENT ACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Enforcement actions can be necessary for certain disclosures made during adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-336d2be2a1671f4a9c20d61c824c7555</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISCLOSURE RULES&quot;" target="&quot;MONEY LENDERS ORDANCE (CAP. 163)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Money lenders licensed under this ordinance are also included in the exceptions for reasonable commercial disclosures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISCLOSURE RULES&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSIONAL ADVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Professional advice may require disclosure of certain information under the rules, as specified for legal or other professional purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79816614535478a4c5093238ccf5e99a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATING (審裁)&quot;" target="&quot;PROPORTIONS OF COSTS DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudicating includes accepting the appointment and considering determining payment disputes, which involves proportion determination of costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATIVE SUCCESS&quot;" target="&quot;PROPORTION DETERMINATION FACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Relative success is one factor considered by the adjudicator in determining the cost proportions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNREASONABLE ACTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;COSTS OF ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Unreasonable actions are factors that can affect the determination of costs for adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROPORTION DETERMINATION FACTORS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTIFICATION SUBJECT PROGRESS PAYMENT REASONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Proportion determination factors include matters related to progress payment reasons considered by the adjudicator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROGRESS PAYMENT REASONS FOR RESPONDENT (答辯人)&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS COSTS CONSIDERATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Progress payment reasons for a respondent are part of considerations when determining adjudication proceedings costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMANT'S WITHDRAWAL OF PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PROPORTION DETERMINATION BY ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claimant's withdrawal of proceedings is a matter that can be considered in determining the proportion of costs payable by a party."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OTHER MATTERS CONSIDERED BY ADJUDICATOR&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS COSTS DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Other matters, including those not explicitly listed, can be considered in determining the adjudication proceedings costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION NOTIFICATION SUBJECT PROGRESS PAYMENT REASONS&quot;" target="&quot;COST PROPORTIONS DETERMINATION FACTORS (裁定審裁程序費用的比例時須考慮的事宜)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Cost proportion determination factors include matters related to progress payment reasons considered by the adjudicator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROPORTION DETERMINATION BY ADJUDICATOR&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS COSTS DETERMINATION (確定審裁程序費用的比例)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The adjudicator's determination of cost proportions is directly related to the costs determined for adjudication proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATIVE SUCCESS IN ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PROPORTION OF ADJUDICATION PROCEEDS COSTS PAYABLE BY A PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Relative success in the proceedings can influence the proportion of costs payable by a party."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IMPROPER PURPOSE PARTICIPATION IN ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION (審裁員在裁定某方須按何比例支付審裁程序費用時)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Improper purpose participation in proceedings is a factor considered by the adjudicator when determining cost proportions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VEXATIOUS OR FRIVOLOUS PARTICIPATION IN ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION (審裁員在裁定某方須按何比例支付審裁程序費用時)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Vexatious or frivolous participation in proceedings is a factor considered by the adjudicator when determining cost proportions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLENESS LEADING UP TO ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PROPORTION OF ADJUDICATION PROCEEDS COSTS PAYABLE BY A PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reasonableness leading up to the proceedings is a factor in determining how much of the adjudication costs each party must pay."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REASONABLENESS LEADING UP TO ADJUDICATION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION (審裁員在裁定某方須按何比例支付審裁程序費用時)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reasonableness leading up to the proceedings is a factor considered by the adjudicator when determining cost proportions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR'S DETERMINATION (審裁員在裁定某方須按何比例支付審裁程序費用時)&quot;" target="&quot;PROPORTION OF ADJUDICATION PROCEEDS COSTS PAYABLE BY A PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The proportion of adjudication proceedings costs payable by a party is determined directly by the adjudicator."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c56a21239b5d0bf5cb22840251170eef</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEEDINGS TERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;DEFAULT OF A PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The default by the claimant without sufficient cause leads to proceedings being terminated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2dfe92de4b69d55e6e8223c18ca6b58c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEEDINGS TERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ADJUDICATOR has authority to terminate PROCEEDINGS TERMINATION based on specific grounds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROCEEDINGS TERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The COURT's action under SECTION 48 can impact whether ADJUDICATOR is entitled to fees and expenses for terminated proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 48&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjudicator is still entitled to be paid under SECTION 48 if the Court sets aside a determination."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 54(5)&quot;" target="&quot;TRUE REPRESENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECTION 54(5)'s definition of TRUE REPRESENTATION affects the adjudicator's entitlement to fees and expenses in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f4f0cfcab0e9f6d5a958dc7286fe8aad</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 54(5)&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 54(5) defines 'adjudicating' which impacts ADJUDICATOR's entitlement to fees and expenses under SECTION 33."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 41(E), (F) OR (G)&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Proceedings terminated on grounds in SECTION 41(E), (F) or (G) can affect payment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TIME-RELATED DISPUTE FOR MAIN PRIVATE CONTRACTS AND SUBCONTRACTS&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DISPUTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Time-related disputes for main private contracts and subcontracts can be related to payment disputes, as seen in the context of extension of time entitlements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e089cfc832db9c43bb24baa7baf3ed42</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELAY&quot;" target="&quot;INTENDED STARTING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of delay involves the date on which a party intends to start delaying construction work or supplying related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELAY&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF INTENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Notice of intention is part of the process for initiating a delay in carrying out construction work or supplying related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTENDED STARTING DATE&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE PERIOD BEFORE INTENDED STARTING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"There must be at least five working days between sending a notice of intention and the intended starting date for delays in construction work or supplying related goods and services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTENDED STARTING DATE&quot;" target="&quot;CLAIMANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The intended starting date is determined after the 5th working day following service of a notice of intention, which allows for potential delays in construction work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7d229505b95cc3e576d9ad034318c66d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMANT'S RIGHT TO DELAY WORK OR SUPPLY&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONSE TO PAYMENT CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The response to a payment claim is crucial for determining if the claimant has the right to delay work or supply under the contract conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a777e030a07f2f2f22690cfccc9cc19</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMANT'S RIGHT TO DELAY WORK OR SUPPLY&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The claimant has the right to delay work or supply under a construction contract if certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6edcec90a44956192e9747946f6d5481</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMANT'S RIGHT TO DELAY WORK OR SUPPLY&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The respondent's failure to pay the adjudicated amount by the payment deadline is a condition for the claimant to exercise their right to delay work or supply under the construction contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6edcec90a44956192e9747946f6d5481</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DUE DATE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT specifies that payment is due before work can proceed after a certain period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a39eb07c8451fb1542c2fcc4877cecdf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT DUE DATE&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PAYMENT PARTY is responsible for making full payment by the due date as per the CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a39eb07c8451fb1542c2fcc4877cecdf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY EXERCISING RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSECTION (2) CONDITIONS MET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SUBSECTION (2) CONDITIONS MET are the prerequisites for a CLAIMING PARTY to exercise its rights under subsection 1."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b64134587c2d761afb53bbca719b5f8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY EXERCISING RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;WORK RESUMPTION DEADLINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A claiming party must resume work within 5 working days after receiving full payment, indicating an implied deadline for resuming construction work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b64134587c2d761afb53bbca719b5f8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLAIMING PARTY EXERCISING RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK DELAY IMPLICATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A claiming party exercising its rights can delay construction work and has implications on the consequences of such delays for both parties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b64134587c2d761afb53bbca719b5f8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTENTION NOTIFICATION FORMALITY&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WORK DELAY IMPLICATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The INTENTION NOTIFICATION FORMALITY is required before a claiming party can delay the construction work and has implications on the consequences of such delays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b64134587c2d761afb53bbca719b5f8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION OR ADJUDICATION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACTUAL RIGHTS OF PAYING PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While the CLAIMING PARTY EXERCISING RIGHTS focuses on rights, ARBITRATION OR ADJUDICATION PROCESS may be involved in resolving disputes related to these contractual rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b64134587c2d761afb53bbca719b5f8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;局长&quot;" target="&quot;提名团体制定规则&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"局长有监督提名团体职能执行情况的职责，涉及制定和实施相关规则。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e57695981eedef2e56ada56aa3232e9d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;提名团体制定规则&quot;" target="&quot;公&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"公可能被授予协助或参与制定与提名团体相关的规则。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e57695981eedef2e56ada56aa3232e9d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY OF THE NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION RULES, PRACTICE NOTES, CODE OF CONDUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary can give directions regarding the contents of adjudication rules, practice notes or code of conduct to be made by a nominating body."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY OF THE NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLAINTS AGAINST A NOMINATING BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary may inquire or investigate into complaints against a nominating body as per section 62(1)(e). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY OF THE NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION OF A NOMINATING BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary can determine applications for registration, or renewal of registration, as a nominating body under section 62(2)(a). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY OF THE NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;DELEGATION BY THE SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary may delegate some functions to public officers but cannot re-delegate the power of delegation as per sections 62(3) and (4). "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY OF THE NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;APPEAL AGAINST DECISIONS OF THE SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"While not directly mentioned, there is a context for potential appeals against decisions of the Secretary as per section 63(1), though specific details are not provided in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-acae0e89e06c49b15fdd079c1d7a65d1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGISTRATION OF THE BODY CORPORATE AS A NOMINATING BODY&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SECRETARY has the power to register or refuse registration of a BODY CORPORATE as a NOMINATING BODY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-89bbff8bbf3f0985059cdccf2a6fe747</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATOR PANEL&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary receives documents or information from the nominating body regarding the panel of adjudicators."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL LEGAL LIABILITY EXEMPTION&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY FOR THE SAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary or the Special Administrative Region (SAR) government is exempt from civil legal liability when performing functions under this Ordinance in good faith."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUDICATION SERVICES&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY FOR THE SAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary or the SAR government directs and oversees adjudication services under this Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-401cd3cc83efdeb7f12cba3a9d1233da</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;SERVICE OF ADJUDICATION DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The service of adjudication documents is part of the broader context involving civil proceedings, arbitration, and other dispute resolution procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1901c04f5d127d84848a2cd1cbc4a1bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance specifies that certain documents cannot be compelled in civil proceedings related to payment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CIVIL PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties involved in the civil proceedings are subject to the rules and restrictions set by the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION PROCEEDINGS&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance covers various forms of dispute resolution proceedings, including civil and arbitration procedures related to payment disputes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVISION 3—SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Division 3 specifically deals with the service or delivery methods for documents such as adjudication notices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT PARTY (SENDER)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The construction contract party, as a sender, may use agreed-upon ways to serve documents according to section 69(2)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33f6ad83e6dad4d9e791254952be2f44</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The construction contract party is involved in the service of documents to another party under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22aad013b6ace7041cfc26259ab41c0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;RECEIVING PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documents are served to the receiving party as per the agreement or specified methods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22aad013b6ace7041cfc26259ab41c0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL ADDRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The service of documents can be left at the last known residential address of the receiving party."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22aad013b6ace7041cfc26259ab41c0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTERED MAIL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Registered mail is one method for serving documents, where they are sent by registered post."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22aad013b6ace7041cfc26259ab41c0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL DELIVERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Personal delivery involves handing over the document to a person directly as an alternative service method."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22aad013b6ace7041cfc26259ab41c0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;FAX TRANSMISSION RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fax transmission records can be used for serving documents by transmitting them via fax machine."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22aad013b6ace7041cfc26259ab41c0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;EMAIL TRANMISSION RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Email transmission records are a method of serving documents electronically to the last known email address of the receiving party."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-22aad013b6ace7041cfc26259ab41c0a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;PART 2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part 2 authorizes or requires documents to be served under its provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 27(3)(B) OR (4)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 27(3)(b) or (4)(b) is a specific provision for serving documents that falls under the scope of this section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;PART 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part 4 authorizes or requires documents to be served under its provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE OF DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;DATE OF SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The date of service is a critical aspect of the process outlined in this section, determining when a document has been properly served."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECEIVING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;SERVING PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The serving party is the entity that serves documents to the receiving party under this section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECEIVING PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;HAND DELIVERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hand delivery is one method for serving documents to the receiving party, as outlined in subsection (3)(b)(i)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART 2&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 27(3)(B) OR (4)(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 27(3)(b) or (4)(b) is a specific part of Part 2, providing detailed service requirements for certain documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PART 2&quot;" target="&quot;PART 4&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Part 4 and Part 2 both provide provisions related to the serving of documents under different circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FAX TRANSMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;ELECTRONIC MAIL TRANSMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both fax transmission and electronic mail transmission are methods of serving documents specified under this section."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80d3eaf058257b6baf9891597fa09fa7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 1, SCHEDULE 2, SCHEDULE 3, OR SCHEDULE 4&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL UNIT IN SECTION 2(1)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These schedules define or exclude certain premises from being considered residential units under Section 2(1)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-178a551bcbbb140ed32885ff11a760d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESIDENTIAL UNIT IN SECTION 2(1)&quot;" target="&quot;HOTEL OR INN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hotels and inns are explicitly excluded from the definition of a residential unit according to Schedule 1."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-178a551bcbbb140ed32885ff11a760d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;E.R. 2 OF 2026&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"E.R. 2 of 2026 indicates the amendment process for schedules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-178a551bcbbb140ed32885ff11a760d2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUND-BASED FACILITIES&quot;" target="&quot;AIRPORTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ground-based facilities include airports, which are essential for air navigation and transportation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c91eb1ea65f818d429644871f6909abf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUND-BASED FACILITIES&quot;" target="&quot;PORT INFRASTRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ground-based facilities encompass port infrastructure such as harbors and docks, crucial for maritime activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c91eb1ea65f818d429644871f6909abf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUND-BASED FACILITIES&quot;" target="&quot;BEACHES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ground-based facilities include beaches which are used for near-shore recreational activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c91eb1ea65f818d429644871f6909abf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GROUND-BASED FACILITIES&quot;" target="&quot;SEA WALLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ground-based facilities may involve sea walls as part of coastal protection infrastructure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c91eb1ea65f818d429644871f6909abf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PORT INFRASTRUCTURE&quot;" target="&quot;WATER SUPPLY INFRASTRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Port infrastructure may include water supply facilities such as docks and harbors, which are essential for maritime operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c91eb1ea65f818d429644871f6909abf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BEACHES&quot;" target="&quot;SEA WALLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Beaches can be protected by sea walls to prevent erosion or flooding, making them related in coastal management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c91eb1ea65f818d429644871f6909abf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEA WALLS&quot;" target="&quot;POWER SUPPLY INFRASTRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sea walls are part of the broader infrastructure that includes power supply facilities for energy and resource distribution."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c91eb1ea65f818d429644871f6909abf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDERGROUND TELECOMMUNICATION LINES&quot;" target="&quot;SUBMARINE CABLE LANDING STATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are related to telecommunication infrastructure, with underground lines connecting to submarine cable landing stations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32ad60a15446db31bacd7a2f6aa6e43a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAM&quot;" target="&quot;WATER TANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are water storage facilities used in the supply of water systems."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32ad60a15446db31bacd7a2f6aa6e43a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DAM&quot;" target="&quot;IMPOUNDING RESERVOIR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"They both serve the purpose of water storage for various uses,"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WATER TANK&quot;" target="&quot;WASTEWATER TREATMENT FACILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Water tanks and wastewater treatment facilities both deal with water, though for different purposes (storage vs. purification)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32ad60a15446db31bacd7a2f6aa6e43a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WASTEWATER TREATMENT FACILITIES&quot;" target="&quot;SOLID WASTE MANAGEMENT FACILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are part of the broader waste management system, treating different types of waste."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32ad60a15446db31bacd7a2f6aa6e43a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLID WASTE MANAGEMENT FACILITIES&quot;" target="&quot;CONSTRUCTION WASTE OR INERT CONSTRUCTION MATERIALS HANDLING FACILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Solid waste management facilities and construction waste handling facilities both deal with managing physical materials from human activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32ad60a15446db31bacd7a2f6aa6e43a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;ANY NEW LAND FORMED BY RECLAMATION OR SITE FORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Specified Structures include land formed by reclamation or site formation as part of the broader definition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;EARTH-RETAINING STRUCTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Earth-retaining structures are included under Specified Structures, which encompass various types of constructions and engineering facilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;CAVERN OR UNDERGROUND SPACE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Caverns or underground spaces fall within the scope of Specified Structures as defined in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;ANY RESIDENTIAL, COMMERCIAL, INDUSTRIAL, INSTITUTIONAL, COMMUNAL OR RECREATION BUILDING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Residential, commercial, industrial, institutional, communal or recreation buildings are part of the Specified Structures as per the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;WALKWAY, CYCLE TRACK, ROAD, HIGHWAY, RAILWAY, TRAMWAY, CABLEWAY, AERIAL ROPEWAY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Walkways, cycle tracks, roads, highways, railways, tramways, cableways and aerial ropeways are included in the definition of Specified Structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;AIRPORT, HELIPAD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Airports and helipads are part of the broader category of Specified Structures as defined by Cap 652 RTF (10-09-2026)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;CANAL, PORT, CONTAINER TERMINAL, TYPHOON SHELTER, DOCK, PIER, QUAY, JETTY, BEACON, LIGHTHOUSE, LANDING STEPS, MOORING DOLPHIN, FLOATING PONTOON, SLIPWAY, TIDE GAUGE STATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Canals, ports, container terminals, typhoon shelters, docks, piers, quays, jetties, beacons, lighthouses, landing steps, mooring dolphins, floating pontoons, slipways and tide gauge stations are included in the definition of Specified Structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;BEACH, PROMENADE, HARBOUR STEPS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Beaches, promenades, and harbour steps fall under the category of Specified Structures as per Cap 652 RTF (10-09-2026)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SPECIFIED STRUCTURES&quot;" target="&quot;SEAWALL, BREAKWATER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Seawalls and breakwaters are part of the broader definition of Specified Structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b71eda0d8198b06a05585fa2ca575cf4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BEACH&quot;" target="&quot;PROMENADE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are coastal recreational activities as mentioned under Cap 652."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROMENADE&quot;" target="&quot;HARBOUR STEPS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Harbour steps and promenades both serve the purpose of access to harbours for recreational use."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEAWALL&quot;" target="&quot;BREAKWATER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are protective structures used in coastal engineering, as stated under Cap 652."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POWER GENERATION PLANT&quot;" target="&quot;STORAGE FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"They both serve the purpose of energy management and storage for electricity supply,"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POWER TRANSFORMATION FACILITY&quot;" target="&quot;TELECOMMUNICATION LINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"They both serve the purpose of infrastructure for utility services,"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TREATMENT FACILITY&quot;" target="&quot;DISPOSAL OR DISCHARGE FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are used in managing and disposing of waste or treated substances, as mentioned under Cap 652."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SERVICE RESERVOIR&quot;" target="&quot;TANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"They both serve the purpose of storing water for various uses,"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUMPING FACILITY&quot;" target="&quot;CULVERT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are used in managing and moving fluids, as stated under Cap 652."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AQUEDUCT&quot;" target="&quot;CHANNEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"They both serve the purpose of water supply or drainage,"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f3f4b114096d8c9274040421c00bf9ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE CHINESE UNIVERSITY OF HONG KONG&quot;" target="&quot;CITY UNIVERSITY OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both universities operate within the same higher education system, but their specific interactions or dependencies are not detailed in the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fe86a1a9350c1738aa78cae05753c947</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG BAPTIST UNIVERSITY&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hong Kong Baptist University is an educational institution focused on higher education."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95e72d73e1e5cce4b4ca1307deee38ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG BROADBAND NETWORK LIMITED&quot;" target="&quot;BROADBAND INTERNET SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hong Kong Broadband Network Limited provides broadband internet services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95e72d73e1e5cce4b4ca1307deee38ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG HOUSING AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC HOUSING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hong Kong Housing Authority is responsible for public housing programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95e72d73e1e5cce4b4ca1307deee38ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HONG KONG HOUSING AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG HOUSING SOCIETY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both entities are related to housing in Hong Kong, with the Housing Authority likely overseeing or interacting with the Society."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7a31b81a1625e550531d4c12b4182702</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE HONG KONG POLYTECHNIC UNIVERSITY&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Hong Kong Polytechnic University focuses on education and research."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95e72d73e1e5cce4b4ca1307deee38ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE HONG KONG POLYTECHNIC UNIVERSITY&quot;" target="&quot;HONG KONG SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY PARKS CORPORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Polytechnic University may collaborate with the Science and Technology Parks Corporation on research projects, innovation initiatives, or shared facilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7a31b81a1625e550531d4c12b4182702</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE HONG KONG POLYTECHNIC UNIVERSITY&quot;" target="&quot;THE HONG KONG UNIVERSITY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
