  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both entities are marked with a similar status, suggesting they share the same context of being outdated or no longer applicable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The information under SCH. 2 U.K. is marked as omitted due to having lost its时效性, similar to the status of 'Omitted as spent—E.R. 1 of 2017' in another context."</data>
