  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both insurance contracts and land rights are mentioned in the text, indicating they could be related to legal agreements or documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
