</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance contracts may involve clauses that protect intellectual property rights as part of comprehensive coverage packages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY ESTABLISHMENT OR DISSOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance policies might cover risks related to the establishment or dissolution of a company, making them relevant in such contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;SECURITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance contracts could include provisions for securities as part of broader financial risk management strategies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
