</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INSURANCE CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;CLEARING HOUSE PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Clearing house participants might be involved in insurance transactions, especially those involving complex financial instruments or derivatives."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAND RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both land rights and intellectual property rights are legal agreements that could intersect in various business contexts, such as real estate development with proprietary technology."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAND RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY ESTABLISHMENT OR DISSOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Land rights can be a significant asset or liability for companies during establishment or dissolution processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAND RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;SECURITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Securities laws and land rights could intersect in the context of real estate investment trusts (REITs) or other property-related financial instruments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAND RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;CLEARING HOUSE PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Clearing house participants might be involved in transactions related to land rights, especially if they are part of a broader financial market."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY ESTABLISHMENT OR DISSOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Intellectual property can play a crucial role during the establishment or dissolution of companies, particularly in technology and innovation-driven sectors."</data>
