  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY ESTABLISHMENT OR DISSOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;CLEARING HOUSE PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Clearing house participants might be involved in transactions related to company establishment or dissolution, particularly if they involve complex financial instruments or derivatives."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f097a1fbc056ad13d4ef38369d6c79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECURITIES&quot;" target="&quot;CLEARING HOUSE PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Securities and clearing house participants are directly mentioned as being interrelated through the text, indicating a clear relationship in terms of business operations and legal agreements."</data>
