  <data key="d6">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY CONTRACT RELATING TO LAND INTERESTS&quot;" target="&quot;SECTIONS 7, 8, AND 9&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7, 8, and 9 do not apply to contracts relating to land interests."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANY INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS (PATENT, TRADE MARK, COPYRIGHT, REGISTERED DESIGN)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTIONS 7, 8, AND 9&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7, 8, and 9 do not apply to contracts relating to intellectual property rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTIONS 7, 8, AND 9&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 4 states that Sections 7(1) and (2) do not apply to employment contracts unless they are beneficial for the employee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-67bf23fb07f88af8a19b8d82bc9d8304</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7(1)&quot;" target="&quot;MARINE SALVAGE OR TOWAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7(1) explicitly applies to contracts of marine salvage or towage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 7(1) specifically applies to marine salvage or towage contracts, establishing a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7(1)&quot;" target="&quot;CHARTERPARTY OF A SHIP OR HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7(1) explicitly applies to charterparties of a ship or hovercraft."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 7(1) explicitly covers charterparties of ships or hovercrafts, indicating a clear relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7(1)&quot;" target="&quot;CARRIAGE OF GOODS BY SHIP OR HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7(1) applies to contracts for the carriage of goods by ship or hovercraft, establishing a direct connection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 7(1) explicitly applies to contracts for the carriage of goods by ship or hovercraft."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 7(1)&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 20 (AMENDED 68 OF 1992 S. 20)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 20, as amended by Section 68 of 1992, impacts the applicability and interpretation of Section 7(1) in certain contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARINE SALVAGE OR TOWAGE&quot;" target="&quot;CHARTERPARTY OF A SHIP OR HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are types of contracts that Section 7(1) applies to but have distinct definitions and contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARINE SALVAGE OR TOWAGE&quot;" target="&quot;CARRIAGE OF GOODS BY SHIP OR HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 7(1) covers both marine salvage or towage and the carriage of goods by ship or hovercraft, indicating they are related in terms of legal applicability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHARTERPARTY OF A SHIP OR HOVERCRAFT&quot;" target="&quot;CARRIAGE OF GOODS BY SHIP OR HOVERCRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both types of contracts fall under the purview of Section 7(1), indicating a relationship in legal applicability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3839e768a51af918bcfdbfd8b6130d8b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
