  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hovercraft, along with other modes of transport like ships, are excluded from certain provisions under section 8 except for consumer protection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a5ff7ccd88e0bf1fa24f736784b46e37</data>
