  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">118.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Buyer and seller's relationship affects the handling and control over goods during transit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BUYER acquires title based on the SELLER's authority or lack thereof under this Ordinance and related laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SELLER delivers goods to the BUYER according to their agreement or contract terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SELLER delivers specific GOODS to the BUYER or a CARRIER for transmission under the terms of CONTRACT. The transfer of property depends on whether the SELLER reserves the right of disposal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SELLER has the right to demand delivery from the BUYER and can hold them liable for neglect or refusal to take delivery of GOODS."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SELLER is obligated to deliver goods to the BUYER, and if they fail to do so, the BUYER can sue for damages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SELLER retains property rights over GOODS until certain conditions are met or payment is made; the RISK remains with the SELLER unless and until these conditions are fulfilled or payment occurs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SELLER sells goods to the BUYER in their business operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The buyer's acceptance or rejection of goods is related to actions taken by both parties, such as delivery and notification."&lt;SEP&gt;"The goods remain at SELLER's risk until property is transferred to BUYER; however, if delivery is delayed due to fault, then the risk shifts to the party in fault."&lt;SEP&gt;"The seller and buyer have a contractual relationship involving the sale of goods where payment terms are discussed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The seller has the duty to deliver goods and the buyer has the duty to accept and pay for them according to the terms of the sale agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The seller is responsible for delivering goods to the buyer and providing an opportunity for the buyer to examine them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The seller must ensure that they can transfer ownership rights without interference from third parties or undisclosed encumbrances, which affects the buyer's peaceful possession of goods."&lt;SEP&gt;"The seller's performance can be waived by the buyer or treated as a warranty breach rather than repudiation of contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-019dad10da4fa0e0f55e19465cb7641c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b288c9efaa7bb08b81764887c880c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2828dcd3a1acc333b703677e12c2630&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-535dface6286d8bede9ae8225e2d5326&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed27e8241086925853de29390c3f116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-651eb52af9704a88467e396e9e0d7166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6898f338d8c873d727625cb55234a222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-183ae686da520342fd44ebd9847a6fdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3304fe02529acf61f5b7a297e0a498dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08fbcc9c2ce9e3d4f773cc495db19495&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34bc94419b349addb3ca3738887910de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09f76424c00042dab76ada9f73a18154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65a567d66064fd14c157884db0005f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-097842d27813c438fcbfa56e8eef5ca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2195e6c40b4de08d5c7076514275f85</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;RISK &quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SELLER bears RISK for the GOODS until they are delivered and conditions are met; once property is transferred to BUYER, risk shifts unless there's a delay due to fault of either party."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-34bc94419b349addb3ca3738887910de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT FOR GOODS (支付货价)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sellers must prepare for payment obligations as part of delivering goods according to their agreement with buyers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2195e6c40b4de08d5c7076514275f85</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELLER&quot;" target="&quot;SEA TRANSIT INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"賣方需要通知買方以購買海運期間的保險，否則風險由賣方承擔。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c162b772c9e897f69948d67d21519288</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;RIGHT, ETC.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance can declare rights that may be enforceable through legal action."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed2ef74a32a03501189b4ee2f1d7da9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;AUCTION SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ordinance provides rules for auction sales including the conditions under which they are conducted and enforced."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed2ef74a32a03501189b4ee2f1d7da9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;僱員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
