  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMISSIONER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">30.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner appoints boards and determines their procedures under the ordinance. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the authority to grant exemptions from the operation of specific requirements within the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner has the authority to specify forms required for implementing the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commissioner plays a role in approving and overseeing agreements under the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab3acc9003eaebb164d56867334dedad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb828f2a7eae180f120101c1cd23e327&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe986d49a20cfdf5d43e02699374c050</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">54.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ORDINANCE is referenced in the context of arbitration proceedings and enforcement by the COURT."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COURT can受理compensation applications even without a NOTICE OF ACCIDENT or APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION being given, if it finds reasonable grounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COURT has jurisdiction over ORDINANCE and can make orders as per its provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COURT has the authority to make orders based on provisions of the ORDINANCE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The COURT is responsible for commanding the CONVICTED PERSON to submit financial data according to specific provisions in various ORDINANCES."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Court can enforce commands based on agreements approved by the Commissioner as per the Ordinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Court's role in arbitral proceedings is governed by the Ordinance, which provides legal framework for enforcement mechanisms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-19092b2cdc4468b2128aef41dc2b2b67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c14cf842653359f26af3af94b35c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb8be73ac22c1010a0cf86f8afb0c798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2783fda0cba2d6f90774b999de29ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2792d26b948960fecf0ee999232dc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6087ed3d45150a001bf9f66572bde4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f1ee15f14896a24f23432269f049b12</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Ordinance outlines the obligations of the Employee regarding accident notifications and compliance with medical examinations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ordinance provides conditions under which employees can receive compensation, affecting their employment status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7788fe09e12252d0bb714e4f775b4322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82b5f0bd8d67dc0cdec98d7b6bf55ef9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary's role involves carrying out assessments and decisions based on provisions within the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-691e0bbfff602acd26ed9f7e9579a105</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ORDINANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REGISTRATION OF PERSONS ORDINATION (CAP. 177)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The REGISTRATION OF PERSONS ORDINANCE provides the legal basis for ID cards that can be requested by AUTHORIZED OFFICERS during their duties related to enforcing ORDINANCES."</data>
