<edge source="&quot;RIGHT, ETC.&quot;" target="&quot;AUCTION SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rights declared by Ordinance can be enforceable through actions related to auctions as described in the Ordinance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed2ef74a32a03501189b4ee2f1d7da9e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMISSIONER (處長)&quot;" target="&quot;LABOUR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commissioner for Labour is a key figure involved in labor-related matters as indicated by its definition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16I(3)&quot;" target="&quot;WAGES OR SALARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Wages or salaries are mentioned in relation to specific sections, indicating their role within the legal framework for compensation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-124c51d196f065db08f6504baeaa703c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIAL INCAPACITY(&quot;" target="&quot;OUTWORKER(&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Outworkers are individuals who may experience partial incapacity as they work from home or other premises not managed by the principal contractor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d00e5d24fe5e70cf9bff7cadb2617bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTIAL INCAPACITY(&quot;" target="&quot;PRINCIPAL CONTRACTOR(&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of 'partial incapacity' is relevant to employees under a principal contractor's supervision, indicating potential impacts on their earning capacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d00e5d24fe5e70cf9bff7cadb2617bf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADOPTED PERSON&quot;" target="&quot;ADOPTION ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An adoption order legally establishes the relationship between the adopter and the adopted person, overriding other familial relationships."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-786e383c94a3c844d81a1afb79da985c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADOPTION ORDER&quot;" target="&quot;ADOPTION ORDINANCE (CAP. 290)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Adoption Ordinance provides legal framework for making adoption orders, which are crucial in establishing familial relationships."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-786e383c94a3c844d81a1afb79da985c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;僱員本身犯有嚴重和故意的不當行為&quot;" target="&quot;補償申索&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"如果僱員受傷可歸因於其本身的嚴重和故意的不當行為,則補償申索將被拒准。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f5b6c7d25f6395f43d3ccf96762b01c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;補償申索&quot;" target="&quot;蓄意加重其在受僱工作期間因工遭遇意外所致的傷勢&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"如果僱員蓄意加重其在受僱工作期間因工遭遇意外所致的傷勢,則補償申索將被拒准。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f5b6c7d25f6395f43d3ccf96762b01c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSECTION (1)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL AMOUNT OF COMPENSATION PAYABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This subsection determines the total amount of compensation for family members making the application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2914073de37bf0e7df21cb9ca18483a2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;送交&quot;" target="&quot;雇员的配偶&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"雇员的配偶是接收临时付款的对象之一。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adab7939e3cd66e530eb16d94f47de64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;送交&quot;" target="&quot;根据第6B(1)条作出申请的人&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"这些人是需要提交申请的对象。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adab7939e3cd66e530eb16d94f47de64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;临时付款&quot;" target="&quot;配偶&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"临时付款证明书或审核证明书中指名的配偶将收到这笔款项。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-adab7939e3cd66e530eb16d94f47de64</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;初步付款计算方法&quot;" target="&quot;死亡日期至临暂付款证明书发出日期之间相隔月份数目的乘积&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
