  <data key="d6">chunk-0f54e9b22c9d8618d9622420065b132a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;合資格項目&quot;" target="&quot;每一項第(1)(A)(III)款提述的僱主供款強積金計劃權益(屬僱主供款(強制性)強積金計劃權益者)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第(1C)(e)條明確列為合格項目之一。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f54e9b22c9d8618d9622420065b132a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LONG-TERM SERVICE FUND AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;PRE-PRIVATIZATION SERVICE YEARS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The long-term service fund amount is calculated based on pre-privatization service years, which are a key factor in determining the payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9661724896688b8cd0643c1a0b2fa146</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;30 REGULAR WORKING DAYS&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY PAID EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"For monthly paid employees, their calculation can be based on either 30 regular working days or other conditions as specified."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9661724896688b8cd0643c1a0b2fa146</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;支付該長期服務金(包括其轉制前部分及轉制後部分)所基於的該僱員服務期&quot;" target="&quot;有關酬金或利益或權益所關乎的有關僱員服務期&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"描述了計算長期服務金時相關的工作年限,是支付該長期服務金的重要基礎。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4025240e52f2b35715c2b7204670f856</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有關酬金或利益或權益所關乎的有關僱員服務期&quot;" target="&quot;有關長期服務金轉制後部分&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在計算轉制後的部分時仍然考慮到相關的工作年限,用於確定可扣除項目。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4025240e52f2b35715c2b7204670f856</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有關長期服務金轉制後部分&quot;" target="&quot;每項第(1)(B)(II)款提述的僱主供款職業退休計劃利益(屬僱主供款(指明)職業退休計劃權益者)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"這些項目在計算長期服務金時需要扣除,影響其總額。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4025240e52f2b35715c2b7204670f856</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有關長期服務金轉制後部分&quot;" target="&quot;每項第(1)(B)(III)款提述的僱主供款強積金計劃權益(屬僱主供款(自願性)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"這些項目在計算長期服務金時需要扣除,影響其總額。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4025240e52f2b35715c2b7204670f856</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有關長期服務金轉制後部分&quot;" target="&quot;每項第(1)(B)(II)款提述的僱主供款職業退休計劃利益(屬僱主供款(基本部分)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"這些項目在計算長期服務金時需要扣除,影響其總額。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4025240e52f2b35715c2b7204670f856</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有關長期服務金轉制後部分&quot;" target="&quot;每項第(1)(B)(III)款提述的僱主供款強積金計劃權益(屬僱主供款(強制性)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"這些項目在計算長期服務金時需要扣除,影響其總額。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4025240e52f2b35715c2b7204670f856</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(4)(A)&quot;" target="&quot;第(1)(B)(I)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(1)(b)(i) 提及的酬金是第(4)(a) 款資格項目的一部分。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f69b51e9b7108cc072600c8e1b97b079</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(1)(B)(II)&quot;" target="&quot;第(4)(D)">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(1)(b)(ii) 和 第(4)(d) 都涉及僱主供款職業退休計劃利益，但前者是基本部分豁免者。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f69b51e9b7108cc072600c8e1b97b079</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(1)(B)(II)&quot;" target="&quot;第(4)(E)">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(1)(b)(ii) 和 第(4)(e) 都涉及僱主供款職業退休計劃利益，但前者是強制性者。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f69b51e9b7108cc072600c8e1b97b079</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第(1)(B)(III)&quot;" target="&quot;第(4)(C)">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第(1)(b)(iii) 和 第(4)(c) 都涉及僱主供款強積金計劃權益，但前者是自願性者。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f69b51e9b7108cc072600c8e1b97b079</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;有關酬金或利益或權益&quot;" target="&quot;服務期相同&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據第(3) 款的規定, 有关服务期必须与相关薪酬、权益或利益可归因的服务期相同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f69b51e9b7108cc072600c8e1b97b079</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;基於的服務期&quot;" target="&quot;支付該長期服務金&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"长期服务金基于的服务期需与相关薪酬、权益或利益可归因的服务期相同。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f69b51e9b7108cc072600c8e1b97b079</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DETERMINING LAST-KNOWN ADDRESSES&quot;" target="&quot;REASONABLE INQUIRY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Making a reasonable inquiry helps in determining where a written communication should be sent if other specific addresses cannot be found for the addressee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35abbe99a6e0f69accfed39ff1b9fa2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDRESSEE'S LAST-KNOWN ADDRESS&quot;" target="&quot;COMMUNICATION SENT VIA RECORDED TRANSMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a communication is sent using means where information can be recorded and transmitted to the addressee, it can be deemed received on the day of sending if there is a record of receipt by the addressee."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35abbe99a6e0f69accfed39ff1b9fa2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONFIRMATION OF DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD OF RECEIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A record of receipt confirms that the communication has been delivered or attempted for delivery to the addressee, which affects when it can be deemed received."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35abbe99a6e0f69accfed39ff1b9fa2a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot; ARBITRATION AGREEMENT &quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT BODY, REGULATORY BODY, COURT OR TRIBUNAL &quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Government bodies and regulatory authorities can be involved in the enforcement of arbitration agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0cc9146e12fcb8f714add3a3f7c0771b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot; ARBITRATION AGREEMENT &quot;" target="&quot;DATA电文 &quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Data messages are recognized as valid forms of documentation for arbitration agreements under legal definitions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0cc9146e12fcb8f714add3a3f7c0771b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot; DATA电文 &quot;" target="&quot;ARBITRATION AGREEMENT &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Data messages can be considered as a form of written agreement for arbitration purposes, according to the definition provided in Article 7 of the示范法."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0cc9146e12fcb8f714add3a3f7c0771b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULT OF A PARTY&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINUED PROCEEDINGS WITH NO ADMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The respondent's failure to communicate statement of defence results in continued proceedings, not treating it as an admission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2dfe92de4b69d55e6e8223c18ca6b58c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTY NON-APPEARANCE OR EVIDENCE PRODUCTION FAILURE&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEEDINGS CONTINUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A party failing to appear at a hearing or produce documentary evidence allows the arbitral tribunal to continue the proceedings based on available evidence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2dfe92de4b69d55e6e8223c18ca6b58c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-COMPLIANCE WITH ORDER/DIRECTION&quot;" target="&quot;PEREMPTORY ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failure by any party to comply with an order or direction of the arbitral tribunal results in a peremptory order being made."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2dfe92de4b69d55e6e8223c18ca6b58c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AWARD RESTRICTIONS AND ADVERSE INFERENCES&quot;" target="&quot;PARTY NON-COMPLIANCE WITH PEREMPTORY ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A party's failure to comply with a peremptory order leads to restricted reliance on certain allegations, drawing of adverse inferences, or making an award based on provided materials."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2dfe92de4b69d55e6e8223c18ca6b58c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COSTS DETERMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;NON-COMPLIANCE WITH PEREMPTORY ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failure by any party to comply with the arbitral tribunal's peremptory order affects costs determination as well."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2dfe92de4b69d55e6e8223c18ca6b58c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;仲裁庭&quot;" target="&quot;可予追討的費用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The arbitral tribunal can limit recoverable costs as indicated by the text."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e0829311bda6ca8e30706b5b4b72bc86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COSTS ORDERED UNDER SUBSECTION (3)&quot;" target="&quot;DISPUTE CONCERNED IN SECTION 75&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DISPUTE CONCERNED IN SECTION 75 may lead to COSTS ORDERED UNDER SUBSECTION (3)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b29a301d74270bec02c5b77671a3c5a4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECOVERY OF COSTS IN AN ARBITRATION&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 50 OF THE LEGAL PRACTITIONERS ORDINANCE (CAP. 159)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 50 does not apply to recovery of costs in an arbitration, distinguishing it from other contexts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd0d66399468902de54d91fb89e5a84</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHARGING AND EXPENSES OF ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 76 AND SECTION 77 OF THE LEGAL PRACTITIONERS ORDINANCE (CAP. 159)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sections 76 and 77 provide rules on how arbitration fees and costs are handled when there is a dispute, including conditions for sending awards to parties and methods for recovering these costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd0d66399468902de54d91fb89e5a84</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPOINTING EXPERTS UNDER THE示范法第26条&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 54(1) OF THE LEGAL PRACTITIONERS ORDINANCE (CAP. 159)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 54(1) allows for the appointment of experts according to The示范法第26条, which is relevant in determining charges and expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efd0d66399468902de54d91fb89e5a84</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;仲裁协议的一方&quot;" target="&quot;内地法律&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据适用的内地法律规定,一方可能缺乏某些行为能力或仲裁协议无效的情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-76112f3bf347661ce2f42763f99c12c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;公共政策&quot;" target="&quot;内地裁决的强制执行亦可遭拒绝&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根据第(3)(b),如果强制执行该裁决违反了公共政策,则可以被拒绝。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-76112f3bf347661ce2f42763f99c12c0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;96(2) 条款提及的内容 (SECTION 96(2) CLAUSE MENTIONED IN TEXT)&quot;" target="&quot;由2021年第1号第5条废除 (REPEALED BY 2021 NO. 1, ARTICLE 5)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The repeal of Section 5 in the Arbitration Amendment Ordinance affects the applicability of Section 96(2), creating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7002524f6a8a76d0aa6007df37e1ac1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;96(2) 条款提及的内容 (SECTION 96(2) CLAUSE MENTIONED IN TEXT)&quot;" target="&quot;2013年第7号第18条增 (AMENDMENT 18 IN 2013 NO. 7)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 18 in 2013 No. 7 directly affects the applicability of Section 96(2), creating a strong relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7002524f6a8a76d0aa6007df37e1ac1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;由2021年第1号第5条废除 (REPEALED BY 2021 NO. 1, ARTICLE 5)&quot;" target="&quot;2013年第7号第18条增 (AMENDMENT 18 IN 2013 NO. 7)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 18 in 2013 No. 7 and the repeal of Section 5 in 2021 No. 1 are directly related as they both impact arbitration procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7002524f6a8a76d0aa6007df37e1ac1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第4分部 —— 澳门裁决的强制执行 (DIVISION FOR ENFORCEMENT OF MACAU AWARDS)&quot;" target="&quot;2013年第7号 (AMENDMENT 7 IN 2013)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendment 7 in 2013 directly affects the enforcement division for Macau awards, creating a clear relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7002524f6a8a76d0aa6007df37e1ac1f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;一方 (PARTY)&quot;" target="&quot;律師 (LAWYER)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A lawyer is defined as a party in an arbitration context under section 98I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf0dd7c47ebdb02fb1d905b0c712a8bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;一方 (PARTY TO AN ARBITRATION)&quot;" target="&quot;第98A條 (SECTION 98I)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parties in arbitration are specifically referred to as 'party' per Section 98I."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf0dd7c47ebdb02fb1d905b0c712a8bd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUCCESS FEE (成功收费)&quot;" target="&quot;DAMAGES-BASED AGREEMENT (DBA费用)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 'success fee' is based on the successful outcome in both conditional and damages-based agreements, though it specifically refers to a conditional fee agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-80dd0247f7607a0ca7c4bc8e5c16d806</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;第7分部 —— 其他措施及保障&quot;" target="&quot; COURT OR ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"第7分部中的程序适用于法院或仲裁庭的决定过程。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc6ead6e2679a8dfdba550b0494d664b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot; COURT OR ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL &quot;" target="&quot; LAWYER &quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院或仲裁庭在决定过程中可以考虑代码实践的遵守情况和不遵守情况。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc6ead6e2679a8dfdba550b0494d664b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot; LAWYER &quot;" target="&quot; CLIENT &quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The lawyer represents the client in matters related to arbitration, including disclosure of ORFS agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0dbf6f53e54d631a68b2a604874d6c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATION INSTITUTION &quot;" target="&quot;CLIENT &quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The client must notify the arbitration institution about their ORFS agreement for arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de0dbf6f53e54d631a68b2a604874d6c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;作出相應指示&quot;" target="&quot;支付該等仲裁程序的費用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"指示與費用相關，直接涉及如何處理費用問題。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-631cf173f722fbf772a243932dfa28ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;作出以下委任&quot;" target="&quot;委任仲裁員&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"委任是其中一部分的委任內容，涉及到仲裁程序中的角色分配。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-631cf173f722fbf772a243932dfa28ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;已就任何該等仲裁程序作出的任何其他仲裁員的委任&quot;" target="&quot;第(2)款所指的委任作出時停止有效&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"根據法院命令，先前的委任在新的任命生效後失效。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-631cf173f722fbf772a243932dfa28ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;就該等仲裁程序的費用而言,具有第74及75條所指的權力&quot;" target="&quot;聆訊該等仲裁程序的仲裁庭&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"仲裁庭對其聆訊的案件有特定財務權限，這與其職能相關。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-631cf173f722fbf772a243932dfa28ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2項或多於2項的仲裁程序同時聆訊,或以一項緊接另一項的方式聆訊&quot;" target="&quot;仲裁庭就同時聆訊或以一項緊接另一項的方式聆訊的該等仲裁程序而言,並無權力命令任何一方支付費用&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在多個案件同時進行時，仲裁庭對某些費用命令有特定限制。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-631cf173f722fbf772a243932dfa28ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;2項或多於2項的仲裁程序同時聆訊,或以一項緊接另一項的方式聆訊&quot;" target="&quot;根據第(1)(D)(II)款&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"該條款規定了多個案件同時進行的情況，這與其內容相關。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-631cf173f722fbf772a243932dfa28ec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 36 WHEN POWERS OF ADJUDICATOR NOT AFFECTED&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUDICATION SUBMISSION DEADLINE FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The submission deadline failure does not affect the ADJUDICATOR's power to determine a payment dispute under sections 31, 32, and 35 of the proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0c86684c7c7960eab0e6a0b609bc00e1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;法院的許可&quot;" target="&quot;裁定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在法院的許可下，可以强制执行程序中的裁定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ef1666f98af86da5285abdb503ef94d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;付款期限届满后的审裁程序一方&quot;" target="&quot;申请许可强制执行裁定&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"付款期限届满后，审裁程序的一方可以提出申请以寻求许可强制执行该裁定。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ef1666f98af86da5285abdb503ef94d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;强制定期执行申请&quot;" target="&quot;有关裁定的撤销申请待决情况&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"只有在没有关于有关裁定的撤销申请待决的情况下，才可以提出强制执行申请。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ef1666f98af86da5285abdb503ef94d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;文件作为证据&quot;" target="&quot;申请人誓章&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"申请人需以誓章支持强制执行申请，并附有相关文件作为证物。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ef1666f98af86da5285abdb503ef94d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;提出申请时的情况描述&quot;" target="&quot;有关经审裁款额的付款期限届满&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"在提出申请之时，有关经审裁款额的付款期限已届满且仍未获全数支付。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ef1666f98af86da5285abdb503ef94d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;上诉许可&quot;" target="&quot;法院决定批准或拒绝强制执行申请&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"除非该法院批予上诉许可，否则任何人不得针对法院关于是否批准或拒绝强制执行申请的决定提出上诉。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1ef1666f98af86da5285abdb503ef94d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;局長&quot;" target="&quot;裁員有管轄權&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"局長藉憲報公告指定日期失效，影響裁員有管轄權的行使。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;延遲 (DELAY)&quot;" target="&quot;意向通知 (NOTICE OF INTENTION)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"延遲與意向通知相關，意向通知是關於延遲進行建造工作或供應貨品及服務的通知。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;延遲 (DELAY)&quot;" target="&quot;擬開始日 (INTENDED STARTING DATE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"擬開始日在延遲的情況下被重新定義為可能開始的日期。"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd7d0b99f83087ec2853bdf1ea545dcf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTROL OF EXEMPTION CLAUSES&quot;" target="&quot;AVOIDANCE OF LIABILITY FOR NEGLIGENCE, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Control over exemption clauses includes managing their impact on the avoidance of liability for negligence and breach of contract as stated in section 5. Varieties of Exemption Clauses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTROL OF EXEMPTION CLAUSES&quot;" target="&quot;NEGLECT, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Control over exemption clauses includes managing their impact on the legal responsibilities for negligence and breach of contract as stated in section 5. Varieties of Exemption Clauses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTROL OF EXEMPTION CLAUSES&quot;" target="&quot;AVOIDANCE OF LIABILITY FOR NEGLECT, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Control over exemption clauses includes managing their impact on the avoidance of liability for negligence and breach of contract as stated in section 5. Varieties of Exemption Clauses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AVOIDANCE OF LIABILITY FOR NEGLECT, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;NEGLECT, BREACH OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Avoidance of liability for negligence and breach of contract is directly related to the legal responsibilities for these issues as stated in section 5. Varieties of Exemption Clauses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4f376b792b435eb29fed3bd6caa3e8f6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ARBITRATOR &quot;" target="&quot;COURT &quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"法院和仲裁人都是具合法裁判權的主管當局的一部分，尽管它们在具体职能上有所不同。</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-51d1d77716a000d59a4c18879a262e96</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCH. 2 U.K.&quot; &quot;" target="&quot;附表3&quot; &quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"附表3 corresponds to SCH. 2 U.K., indicating a parallel structure in different legal documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f256d7c77511a4ff29770b5e20137cfe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
</graph></graphml>